#: src/activity_actor.cpp:2614
msgid "The lock opens…"
msgstr "La cerradura se abre…"

#: src/activity_actor.cpp:2627 src/activity_actor.cpp:2639
msgid "You can't open this lock."
msgstr "No puedes abrir esta cerradura."

#: src/activity_actor.cpp:2707
msgid "Your clumsy attempt jams the lock!"
msgstr "¡Tu intento torpe traba la cerradura!"

#: src/activity_actor.cpp:2712
msgid "The lock stumps your efforts to pick it, and you destroy your tool."
msgstr ""
"La cerradura no cede a tus intentos de forzarla, y terminas rompiendo tu "
"herramienta."

#: src/activity_actor.cpp:2716
msgid "The lock stumps your efforts to pick it, and you damage your tool."
msgstr ""
"La cerradura no cede a tus intentos de forzarla, y terminas dañando tu "
"herramienta."

#: src/activity_actor.cpp:2719
msgid "The lock stumps your efforts to pick it."
msgstr "La cerradura no cede a tus intentos de forzarla."

#: src/activity_actor.cpp:2769
msgid "There is nothing to lockpick nearby."
msgstr "No hay nada que se pueda bloquear cerca."

#: src/activity_actor.cpp:2769
msgid "Use your lockpick where?"
msgstr "¿Dónde quieres usar tu ganzúa?"

#: src/activity_actor.cpp:2781
msgid "You pick your nose and your sinuses swing open."
msgstr "Te metes la ganzúa en la nariz y tus sinusales se abren completamente."

#: src/activity_actor.cpp:2784
msgid ""
"You can pick your friends, and you can\n"
"pick your nose, but you can't pick\n"
"your friend's nose."
msgstr ""
"Puedes tocar a tus amigos, y puedes\n"
"tocarte los pelos de la nariz, pero no puedes tocar\n"
"los pelos de la nariz de tu amigo."

#: src/activity_actor.cpp:2786
msgid "That door isn't locked."
msgstr "Esa puerta no está cerrada con llave."

#: src/activity_actor.cpp:2788
msgid "That cannot be picked."
msgstr "No puedes usar la ganzúa en eso."

