#: data/json/field_type.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "LIXA_decompressed"
msgid "In Decompressed Space"
msgstr "En Espacio Descomprimido"

#: data/json/field_type.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "In Decompressed Space"
msgid ""
"For an instant, every inch of this infinite space is itself infinite, slowing "
"you drastically."
msgstr ""
"Por un instante, cada centímetro de este espacio infinito es a su vez "
"infinito, lo que te ralentiza drásticamente."

#: data/json/field_type.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "In Decompressed Space"
msgid "Space unfolds and extends around you!"
msgstr "¡El espacio se despliega y se extiende a tu alrededor!"

#: data/json/field_type.json
#. ~ Miss message of effect type "In Decompressed Space"
msgid "You cannot make any progress in all this vastness."
msgstr "No puedes avanzar en medio de toda esta inmensidad."

#: data/json/field_type.json
#. ~ Field intensity level
msgid "decompressed space"
msgstr "espacio descomprimido"

#: data/json/field_type.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "LIXA_unfolded_eff"
msgid "Unfolded"
msgstr "Desplegado"

#: data/json/field_type.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Unfolded"
msgid ""
"There is no longer an inside or outside of you.  It is all one side; flat, "
"infinite, and everything you have ever been.  You wonder if you're having no "
"trouble understanding it because your brain works better spread out like this."
msgstr ""
"Ya no hay interior ni exterior en ti. Todo es un solo lado; plano, infinito y "
"todo lo que siempre has sido. Te preguntas si no te cuesta entenderlo porque "
"tu cerebro funciona mejor así extendido."

#: data/json/flags.json
#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "DEBUG_ONLY"
msgid ""
"This is not intended to be visible during normal gameplay.  <bad>Please file "
"a bug report</bad> unless you are seeing this in the debug menu."
msgstr ""
"No se pretende que esto sea visible durante el juego normal. <bad>Por favor, "
"envía un informe de error</bad> a menos que veas esto en el menú de "
"depuración."

