msgstr "Hab. de interacción"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Skill name
msgid "social"
msgstr "social"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Description of skill "social"
msgid ""
"Your skill in speaking to other people.  Covers ability in boasting, "
"flattery, threats, persuasion, lies, bartering, and other facets of "
"interpersonal communication.  Works best in conjunction with a high level of "
"intelligence."
msgstr ""
"Tu habilidad para hablar con otra gente. Abarca la habilidad para presumir, "
"halagar, amenazar, persuadir, mentir, comerciar y otras facetas de la "
"comunicación interpersonal. Funciona mejor junto a un nivel alto de "
"inteligencia."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "social"
msgid "You probably don't care about talking to other people much."
msgstr "Probablemente no te importe mucho hablar con otras personas."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "social"
msgid "You know how to communicate."
msgstr "Sabes cómo comunicarte."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "social"
msgid "You're a good communicator."
msgstr "Sabes comunicarte muy bien."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "social"
msgid "You know effective communication methods and sales tactics."
msgstr "Conoce métodos de comunicación y tácticas de venta eficaces."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "social"
msgid "You're possibly a psychologist."
msgstr "Posiblemente seas licenciado en psicología."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "social"
msgid "You're not used to talking to people."
msgstr "No estás acostumbrado a hablar con la gente."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "social"
msgid "You rarely offend people by accident."
msgstr "Rara vez ofendes a la gente por accidente."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "social"
msgid "You can communicate your ideas well."
msgstr "Puedes comunicar bien tus ideas."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "social"
msgid "You can make friends easily and drive a hard bargain."
msgstr "Puedes hacer amigos con facilidad y manejar un trato duro."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "social"
msgid "You could sell ocean water to a hermit crab."
msgstr "Podrías venderle agua del mar a un cangrejo ermitaño."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Skill name
msgid "computers"
msgstr "informática"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Description of skill "computers"
msgid ""
"Your skill in accessing and manipulating computers.  Higher levels can allow "
"a user to navigate complex software systems and even bypass their security."
msgstr ""
"Tu habilidad para acceder a equipos informáticos y manipularlos. Los niveles "
"altos te permiten navegar por sistemas complejos de software e incluso "
"puentear su seguridad."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "computers"
msgid "You barely know the minimum of how to use a computer."
msgstr "Apenas sabes lo cómo usar un ordenador."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "computers"
msgid "You knew how to surf the web back when that was possible."
msgstr "Sabías navegar por Internet cuando eso era posible."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "computers"
msgid "You're aware what a \"command prompt\" is."
msgstr "Sabes lo que es una \"línea de comandos\"."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "computers"
msgid "You know how to write code in a few scripting languages."
msgstr "Sabes escribir código en algunos lenguajes de programación."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "computers"
msgid "You have an in–depth knowledge of code and how computers function."
msgstr "Conoces a fondo el código y el funcionamiento de los ordenadores."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "computers"
msgid "You have probably read the entire SICP."
msgstr "Probablemente hayas leído todo el SICP."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "computers"
msgid ""
"You can navigate to the \"phone\" app on your smartphone and likely \"hunt "
"and peck\" to type."
msgstr ""
"Puedes navegar hasta la aplicación 'teléfono' de tu smartphone y "
"probablemente teclear."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "computers"
msgid "You can probably touch-type."
msgstr "Probablemente puedes mecanografiar sin mirar."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "computers"
msgid "You can debug a mod conflict for a video game."
msgstr "Puedes depurar un conflicto de mods para un videojuego."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "computers"
msgid "You can make your own mods for a video game."
msgstr "Puedes crear tus propios mods para un videojuego."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "computers"
msgid "You can code your own video game."
msgstr "Puedes programar tu propio videojuego."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "computers"
msgid ""
"You could get paid to bounty-hunt vulnerabilities in government databases, if "
"any government was still around."
msgstr ""
"Te pagarían por cazar vulnerabilidades en las bases de datos gubernamentales, "
"si es que aún existiera algún gobierno."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Description of skill "health care"
msgid ""
"Your skill in effecting medical treatment.  Higher levels allow better use of "
"medicines and items like bandages and first aid kits, and reduce the failure "
"and complication rates of medical procedures."
msgstr ""
"Tu habilidad para realizar un tratamiento médico efectivo. Los niveles altos "
"permiten un mejor uso de las medicinas y objetos como vendas y botiquines, y "
"reducen la posibilidad de fallo y complicaciones en los procedimientos "
"médicos."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "health care"
msgid "You barely have any idea how your own body works."
msgstr "Casi no tienes ni idea de cómo funciona tu propio cuerpo."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "health care"
msgid "You're at least aware the blood should stay inside you."
msgstr "Al menos eres consciente de que la sangre debe permanecer dentro de ti."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "health care"
msgid "You have a decent idea of first aid."
msgstr "Tienes una idea decente de primeros auxilios."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "health care"
msgid "You're well-trained in first aid."
msgstr "Estás bien entrenado en primeros auxilios."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "health care"
msgid "You know a lot about how the body works and how to deal with many injuries."
msgstr "Sabes mucho sobre cómo funciona el cuerpo y cómo tratar muchas lesiones."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "health care"
msgid "You may know how to do simple surgeries."
msgstr "Puede que sepas hacer cirugías sencillas."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "health care"
msgid "You might be able to put a bandaid on a minor cut without passing out."
msgstr "Puede que seas capaz de ponerte una tirita en un pequeño corte sin desmayarte."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "health care"
msgid "You can do basic first-aid techniques without panicking too much."
msgstr ""
"Puedes realizar técnicas básicas de primeros auxilios sin que cunda demasiado "
"el pánico."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "health care"
msgid "You're used to using a first-aid kit."
msgstr "Estás acostumbrado a utilizar un botiquín de primeros auxilios."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "health care"
msgid "Dealing with injuries is becoming routine for you."
msgstr "Enfrentarte a las lesiones se está convirtiendo en una rutina para ti."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "health care"
msgid "You could probably work in the ER."
msgstr "Probablemente podrías trabajar en Urgencias."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "health care"
msgid "You almost certainly can perform a simple surgery."
msgstr "Seguramente puedas realizar una operación sencilla."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Skill name
msgid "mechanics"
msgstr "mecánica"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Description of skill "mechanics"
msgid ""
"Your skill in engineering, maintaining and repairing vehicles and other "
"mechanical systems.  This skill covers the craft of items with complex parts, "
"and plays a role in the installation of bionic equipment."
msgstr ""
"Tu habilidad en ingeniería, mantenimiento y reparación de vehículos y otros "
"sistemas mecánicos. Esta habilidad cubre fabricar objetos con partes "
"complejas, y cumple un papel en la instalación de biónicos."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "mechanics"
msgid "You know that cars are supposed to be able to go forward."
msgstr "Sabes que se supone que los coches pueden ir hacia delante."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "mechanics"
msgid "You know how to check your oil."
msgstr "Sabes cómo comprobar el aceite."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "mechanics"
msgid "You know the basic ideas of how a car works."
msgstr "Conoces las ideas básicas de cómo funciona un coche."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "mechanics"
msgid "You know how to fix most issues a car could have."
msgstr "Sabes cómo arreglar la mayoría de los problemas que puede tener un coche."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "mechanics"
msgid "You know how to build a car from scratch."
msgstr "Sabes cómo construir un coche desde cero."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "mechanics"
msgid "You can change a wheel.  Potentially."
msgstr "Puedes cambiar una rueda. En teoría."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "mechanics"
msgid "You can do the basics of car maintenance."
msgstr "Puedes hacer las tareas básicas de mantenimiento del coche."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "mechanics"
msgid "You can fix most common issues your car could have."
msgstr "Puedes arreglar los problemas más comunes que pueda tener tu coche."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "mechanics"
msgid "You can install an engine."
msgstr "Puedes instalar un motor."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "mechanics"
msgid "You're a skilled enough mechanic you can install a second engine."
msgstr "Eres un mecánico lo suficientemente hábil como para instalar un segundo motor."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Description of skill "devices"
msgid ""
"Your skill in manipulating fine devices like security systems, traps, locks "
"and other precision tasks.  This skill does not affect the evasion of traps "
"that are triggered."
msgstr ""
"Tu habilidad de manipular dispositivos delicados como sistemas de seguridad, "
"trampas, cerraduras y otras tareas de precisión. No afecta a tu capacidad "
"para esquivar trampas que actives."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "devices"
msgid "You know keys go in locks and traps go off if you step on them."
msgstr ""
"Ya sabes que las llaves entran en las cerraduras y las trampas saltan si las "
"pisas."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "devices"
msgid "You know how to set basic traps."
msgstr "Sabes poner trampas básicas."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "devices"
msgid "You know how to set most traps and how most locks function."
msgstr ""
"Sabe cómo colocar la mayoría de las trampas y cómo funcionan la mayoría de "
"las cerraduras."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "devices"
msgid "You're a knowledgeable trapper and locksmith."
msgstr "Eres un experto trampero y cerrajero."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "devices"
msgid "You have an intricate understanding of traps and locks."
msgstr "Tienes un conocimiento profundo de las trampas y las cerraduras."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "devices"
msgid "You shouldn't try disarming anything, you'll only hurt yourself."
msgstr "No deberías intentar desarmar nada, sólo te harás daño a ti mismo."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "devices"
msgid "You might be able to pick the simplest locks and can disarm basic traps."
msgstr ""
"Puede que seas capaz de forzar las cerraduras más sencillas y de desarmar "
"trampas básicas."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "devices"
msgid "You can easily disarm most traps and pick some locks."
msgstr ""
"Puedes desarmar fácilmente la mayoría de las trampas y forzar algunas "
"cerraduras."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "devices"
msgid "Lockpicking shouldn't be a problem for you."
msgstr "Forzar cerraduras no debería ser un problema para ti."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "devices"
msgid ""
"You can disarm a landmine.  It's still extremely unsafe.  But you can.  "
"Probably."
msgstr ""
"Puedes desarmar una mina terrestre. Sigue siendo extremadamente inseguro. "
"Pero se puede. Probablemente."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Skill name
msgid "vehicles"
msgstr "vehiculos"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Description of skill "vehicles"
msgid ""
"Your skill in operating and steering a vehicle in motion, from cars and boats "
"to helicopters and hot air balloons.  A higher level allows greater control "
"over vehicles at higher speeds, and reduces the penalty of shooting while "
"driving."
msgstr ""
"Tu habilidad para operar y controlar un vehículo en movimiento, desde "
"automóviles y botes hasta helicópteros y globos aerostáticos. Los niveles "
"altos permiten tener un mejor control del vehículo a altas velocidades, y "
"reducen la penalización de disparar mientras conduces."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "vehicles"
msgid "You know what a car looks like."
msgstr "Ya sabes cómo es un coche."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "vehicles"
msgid "You know the basics of driving a car."
msgstr "Ya sabes lo básico para conducir un coche."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "vehicles"
msgid "You know how to drive a car."
msgstr "Sabes conducir un coche."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "vehicles"
msgid "You probably know how to drive larger vehicles like a truck or bus."
msgstr ""
"Probablemente sepas conducir vehículos más grandes, como un camión o un "
"autobús."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "vehicles"
msgid "You know how to drive even in difficult conditions."
msgstr "Sabes conducir incluso en condiciones difíciles."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "vehicles"
msgid "You know tricks even racecar drivers use."
msgstr "Conoces trucos que usan hasta los pilotos de carreras."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "vehicles"
msgid "You don't even have a driver's license."
msgstr "Ni siquiera tienes carnet de conducir."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "vehicles"
msgid "You were good enough to get a driver's license."
msgstr "Eras lo suficientemente bueno como para sacarte el carné de conducir."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "vehicles"
msgid "You've driven a car enough for it to become routine."
msgstr "Has conducido un coche lo suficiente para que se convierta en rutina."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "vehicles"
msgid "You're better than most drivers on the road.  Well, not that any are left."
msgstr ""
"Eres mejor que la mayoría de los conductores de la carretera. Bueno, no es "
"que quede ninguno."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "vehicles"
msgid "You can keep control of most vehicles even in awkward conditions."
msgstr ""
"Puede mantener el control de la mayoría de los vehículos incluso en "
"condiciones difíciles."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "vehicles"
msgid "You could compete on a race track."
msgstr "Podrías competir en un circuito de carreras."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Skill name
msgid "athletics"
msgstr "atletismo"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Description of skill "athletics"
msgid ""
"Your athletic ability, including swimming endurance and ability to swim with "
"weight.  Athletic skill also improves your overall cardio fitness and stamina."
msgstr ""
"Tu habilidad atlética, incluida la resistencia en la natación y la capacidad "
"de nadar con peso. La habilidad atlética también mejora tu capacidad "
"cardiovascular y tu vigor en general."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "athletics"
msgid "You don't even let people tell you that you should be more active."
msgstr "Ni siquiera dejas que te digan que deberías hacer más ejercicio."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "athletics"
msgid "You're at least aware exercise is good and that you should do it more."
msgstr ""
"Al menos eres consciente de que el ejercicio es bueno y de que deberías "
"hacerlo más."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "athletics"
msgid "You know how to exercise."
msgstr "Sabes cómo hacer ejercicio."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "athletics"
msgid "You know proper form and stretches."
msgstr "Conoces la forma adecuada y los estiramientos."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "athletics"
msgid "You could be a personal trainer."
msgstr "Podrías ser entrenador personal."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "athletics"
msgid "You're a couch potato."
msgstr "Eres un adicto al sofá."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "athletics"
msgid "You might be able to doggy paddle."
msgstr "Podrías chapotear a lo perrito."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "athletics"
msgid "You're reasonably active and a decent swimmer."
msgstr "Eres razonablemente activo y un nadador decente."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "athletics"
msgid "You're active and a good swimmer."
msgstr "Eres una persona activa y sabes nadar muy bien."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "athletics"
msgid "You're very active and a great swimmer."
msgstr "Eres una persona muy activa y un pez en el agua."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "athletics"
msgid "You could swim across the English Channel."
msgstr "Podrías cruzar el Canal de la Mancha a nado."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Skill name
msgid "fabrication"
msgstr "fabricación"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Description of skill "fabrication"
msgid ""
"Your skill in working with raw materials and shaping them into useful "
"objects.  This skill plays an important role in the crafting of many objects."
msgstr ""
"Tu habilidad para trabajar con materiales crudos y usarlos para fabricar "
"objetos útiles. Esta habilidad juega un papel importante en la fabricación de "
"muchos objetos."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "fabrication"
msgid "You barely know which side of the hammer you should hold."
msgstr "Casi no sabes qué lado del martillo debes sujetar."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "fabrication"
msgid "You know how to hold a hammer."
msgstr "Sabes cómo sostener un martillo."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "fabrication"
msgid ""
"You're a decent DIYer and know how to craft a variety of wooden items or very "
"basic metalworking."
msgstr ""
"Manitas decente y sabes cómo fabricar una variedad de objetos de madera o "
"metal muy básicos."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "fabrication"
msgid "You're a fairly skilled DIYer and know how to craft a variety of metal items."
msgstr "Manitas habilidoso y sabes fabricar diversos objetos de metal."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "fabrication"
msgid ""
"You're an exceptionally skilled DIYer and know how to smith basic tools and "
"weapons."
msgstr "Manitas excepcional y sabes forjar herramientas y armas básicas."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "fabrication"
msgid "You know the ins and outs of making almost anything you can think of."
msgstr ""
"Conoces los entresijos de la fabricación de casi cualquier cosa que se te "
"ocurra."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "fabrication"
msgid "You can only craft the most basic things."
msgstr "Sólo puedes fabricar las cosas más básicas."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "fabrication"
msgid "You can craft a few basic things."
msgstr "Puedes fabricar algunas cosas básicas."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "fabrication"
msgid "You can craft a variety of useful stuff without much issue."
msgstr "Puedes fabricar una gran variedad de cosas útiles sin mucho problema."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "fabrication"
msgid ""
"You can easily craft useful, if junky weapons and armor, but nothing too "
"complex."
msgstr ""
"Puedes fabricar fácilmente armas y armaduras útiles, pero nada demasiado "
"complejo."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "fabrication"
msgid "You can craft even complex objects without fail."
msgstr "Puede fabricar incluso objetos complejos sin fallos."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "fabrication"
msgid ""
"You have created many things with your hands and you should have little issue "
"crafting anything."
msgstr ""
"Has creado muchas cosas con tus manos y no deberías tener problemas para "
"elaborar cualquier cosa."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Description of skill "food handling"
msgid ""
"Your skill in combining food ingredients to make other, tastier food items.  "
"Also includes food preservation and safety, brewing, butchery, and more."
msgstr ""
"Tu habilidad para combinar ingredientes y hacer comidas más sabrosas. También "
"incluye la preservación y seguridad de los alimentos, así como la "
"fermentación, descuartizado y más."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "food handling"
msgid "You probably lived on takeout."
msgstr "Probablemente vivías comiendo fuera siempre."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "food handling"
msgid "You know the basics of how not to burn your house down."
msgstr "Ya sabes lo básico para no quemar tu casa."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "food handling"
msgid "You know how to cook reasonably."
msgstr "Sabes cocinar razonablemente."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "food handling"
msgid "You know how to cook a wide variety of food."
msgstr "Sabes cocinar una gran variedad de alimentos."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "food handling"
msgid "You know how to cook the most advanced and complex dishes."
msgstr "Sabe cocinar los platos más avanzados y complejos."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "food handling"
msgid "You'd burn a PB&J, somehow."
msgstr "Quemarías un PB&J, de alguna manera."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "food handling"
msgid "You can boil an egg."
msgstr "Sabes hervir un huevo."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "food handling"
msgid "You can cook a variety of recipes."
msgstr "Puedes cocinar una gran variedad de recetas."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "food handling"
msgid "You can cook most recipes with ease."
msgstr "Puedes cocinar la mayoría de las recetas con facilidad."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "food handling"
msgid "You'd win a neighborhood bake-off."
msgstr "Ganarías un concurso de pastelería de barrio."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "food handling"
msgid "You'd be an excellent chef, too bad all the zombies want to eat is you."
msgstr "Serías un chef excelente, lástima que los zombis sólo quieran comerte a ti."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Description of skill "tailoring"
msgid ""
"Your skill in the craft and repair of clothing, bags, blankets and other "
"textiles.  Affects knitting, sewing, stitching, weaving, and nearly anything "
"else involving a needle and thread."
msgstr ""
"Tu habilidad al fabricar y repararropa, bolsos, mantas y otros tejidos. "
"Afecta a tejer, coser, puntear, hilar y casi todo lo que implique una aguja e "
"hilo."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "tailoring"
msgid "You know nothing about tailoring."
msgstr "No sabes nada de sastrería."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "tailoring"
msgid "You know the very basics of how to sew a patch over a small hole."
msgstr "Sabes lo básico para coser un parche sobre un pequeño agujero."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "tailoring"
msgid "You know how to sew."
msgstr "Sabes coser."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "tailoring"
msgid "You know how to sew well."
msgstr "Sabes coser muy bien."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "tailoring"
msgid "You know how to sew with non-standard materials."
msgstr "Sabes coser con materiales no convencionales."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "tailoring"
msgid "You're a very knowledgeable tailor."
msgstr "Eres un sastre muy bien preparado."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "tailoring"
msgid "You can put a shirt on without ripping it, at least."
msgstr "Puedes ponerte una camisa sin rasgarla, al menos."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "tailoring"
msgid "You've held a sewing needle once or twice."
msgstr "Has sujetado una aguja de coser una o dos veces."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "tailoring"
msgid "You can repair or sew simple clothing."
msgstr "Puedes reparar o coser ropa sencilla."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "tailoring"
msgid "You can repair or sew more complex clothing."
msgstr "Puedes reparar o coser prendas más complejas."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "tailoring"
msgid "You're skilled at working with non-standard materials like Kevlar."
msgstr "Eres hábil trabajando con materiales no estándar como el Kevlar."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "tailoring"
msgid "You can sew anything you could dream of."
msgstr "Puedes coser cualquier cosa que se te ocurra."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Skill name
msgid "survival"
msgstr "supervivencia"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Description of skill "survival"
msgid ""
"Your skill in surviving the wilderness, and in crafting various basic "
"survival items.  This also covers your ability to skin and butcher animals "
"for meat and hides."
msgstr ""
"Tu habilidad para sobrevivir en la naturaleza, y para fabricar varios objetos "
"de supervivencia básicos. También abarca tu habilidad para despellejar y "
"descuartizar animales para conseguir pellejos y carne."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "survival"
msgid "You're aware the outdoors is gross."
msgstr "Eres consciente de que la naturaleza es asquerosa."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "survival"
msgid "You know the very basics of camping."
msgstr "Conoces lo más básico para acampar."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "survival"
msgid "You know how to craft a fire drill to start fires without lighters."
msgstr "Sabes cómo hacer un fuego sin mechero."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "survival"
msgid "You probably memorized most of the Scouting handbook."
msgstr "Probablemente hayas memorizado la mayor parte del manual de los exploradores."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "survival"
msgid "You're exceptionally knowledgeable in all things outdoorsy."
msgstr "Eres un experto excepcional en todo lo relacionado con el aire libre."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "survival"
msgid "You need to touch grass."
msgstr "Necesitas tocar la hierba."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "survival"
msgid "You've touched grass."
msgstr "Has tocado hierba."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "survival"
msgid "You might've been a cub scout as a kid."
msgstr "Puede que hayas sido un explorador de pequeño."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "survival"
msgid "You're a skilled scout and can pitch a tent with ease."
msgstr "Eres un hábil explorador y puedes montar una tienda de campaña con facilidad."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "survival"
msgid "You could likely be dropped into a forest with nothing and thrive."
msgstr "Podrías encontrarte en un bosque sin nada y prosperar."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Skill name
msgid "electronics"
msgstr "electrónica"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Description of skill "electronics"
msgid ""
"Your skill in dealing with electrical systems, used in the craft and repair "
"of objects with electrical components.  This skill is an important part of "
"installing and managing bionic implants."
msgstr ""
"Tu habilidad en el manejo de sistemas eléctricos, útil al fabricar y reparar "
"objetos con componentes eléctricos. Esta habilidad es una parte importante de "
"la instalación y gestión de implantes biónicos."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "electronics"
msgid ""
"You don't know the first thing about how electricity works.  It might as well "
"be magic to you."
msgstr ""
"No tienes ni idea de cómo funciona la electricidad. Para ti es como si fuera "
"magia."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "electronics"
msgid "You have a very rudimentary knowledge on how electricity works."
msgstr "Tienes conocimientos muy rudimentarios sobre como funciona la electricidad."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "electronics"
msgid "You have some idea of how electricity works."
msgstr "Tienes alguna idea de cómo funciona la electricidad."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "electronics"
msgid ""
"You have a good understanding of how electricity works and were possibly an "
"electrician."
msgstr ""
"Conoces bien el funcionamiento de la electricidad y posiblemente seas "
"electricista."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "electronics"
msgid "You have an intricate understanding of electronics and how they function."
msgstr "Conoces a fondo la electrónica y su funcionamiento."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "electronics"
msgid "You can turn a light switch on or off."
msgstr "Puedes encender o apagar un interruptor de la luz."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "electronics"
msgid "You can craft extremely basic electronics like flashlights."
msgstr "Puedes fabricar aparatos electrónicos muy básicos, como linternas."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "electronics"
msgid ""
"You can craft some electrical gadgets and set up an at-home power grid "
"without major fire hazards."
msgstr ""
"Puedes fabricar algunos aparatos eléctricos y montar una red eléctrica en "
"casa sin grandes riesgos de incendio."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "electronics"
msgid "You can craft a variety of useful electronics."
msgstr "Puedes fabricar una gran variedad de útiles aparatos electrónicos."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "electronics"
msgid "You can craft any electrical device you can think of."
msgstr "Puedes fabricar cualquier aparato eléctrico que se te ocurra."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Description of skill "archery"
msgid ""
"Your skill in using bow weapons, from hand-carved self bows to complex "
"compound bows.  Quiet and effective, they require strength of body and sight "
"to wield, and are not terribly accurate over a long distance."
msgstr ""
"Tu habilidad en el uso de arco, desde arcos propios tallados a mano hasta "
"complejos arcos compuestos. Silenciosos y eficaces, requieren fuerza física y "
"visual para empuñarlos y no son muy precisos a larga distancia."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "archery"
msgid "You know what a bow looks like."
msgstr "Ya sabes cómo es un arco."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "archery"
msgid "You know how to nock an arrow."
msgstr "Sabes cómo tensar una flecha."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "archery"
msgid "You know the basics of archery."
msgstr "Conoces lo básico del tiro con arco."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "archery"
msgid "You're knowledgeable about archery."
msgstr "Tienes conocimientos de tiro con arco."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "archery"
msgid "You have a wealth of knowledge about archery."
msgstr "Tienes muchos conocimientos sobre tiro con arco."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "archery"
msgid "You're lucky if the arrow doesn't spin sideways."
msgstr "Tienes suerte si la flecha no gira de lado."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "archery"
msgid "You can usually get the arrow to fly straight-ish."
msgstr "Normalmente puedes conseguir que la flecha vuele más o menos recta."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "archery"
msgid "You can usually hit an archery target."
msgstr "Normalmente puedes acertar en una diana de tiro con arco."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "archery"
msgid "You're a fairly skilled archer."
msgstr "Eres bastante hábil con el arco."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "archery"
msgid "You're a skilled archer and might've done well in some competitions."
msgstr ""
"Tienes habilidad con el arco y puede que lo hayas hecho bien en alguna "
"competición."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "archery"
msgid "You'd've been a terror at the Battle of Agincourt."
msgstr "Habrías sido el terror de la batalla de Agincourt."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Description of skill "marksmanship"
msgid ""
"Your overall skill in using bows and firearms.  With higher levels, this "
"general experience increases accuracy with any bows or firearms, but is "
"secondary to practice with the type of ranged weapon in question."
msgstr ""
"Tu habilidad general para el uso de arcos y armas de fuego. A niveles altos, "
"incrementa la precisión de arcos y armas de fuego, pero es menos importante "
"que la práctica con el tipo de arma utilizada en el momento."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "marksmanship"
msgid "You don't even know how to aim a gun."
msgstr "Ni siquiera sabes apuntar con un arma."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "marksmanship"
msgid "You know where the iron sights on a gun are."
msgstr "Sabes dónde están las miras de un arma."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "marksmanship"
msgid "You know the basics of aiming."
msgstr "Conoces los fundamentos de apuntar."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "marksmanship"
msgid "You know how to aim most ranged weapons fairly well."
msgstr "Sabes apuntar bastante bien con la mayoría de las armas a distancia."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "marksmanship"
msgid ""
"You know how to aim even at long distances taking into account bullet drop "
"and wind speed."
msgstr ""
"Sabes apuntar incluso a largas distancias teniendo en cuenta la caída de la "
"bala y la velocidad del viento."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "marksmanship"
msgid ""
"Your hands shake, your aim is shit, and you close your eyes before each shot. "
" You could aim at the ground and somehow miss."
msgstr ""
"Te tiemblan las manos, tu puntería es una mierda y cierras los ojos antes de "
"cada disparo. Podrías apuntar al suelo y fallar."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "marksmanship"
msgid "Holding a gun steady is difficult for you."
msgstr "Sostener un arma con firmeza es difícil para ti."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "marksmanship"
msgid "You've been to the range a few times and can usually hit the target."
msgstr "Has ido varias veces al campo de tiro y sueles dar en el blanco."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "marksmanship"
msgid "Your aim is pretty good even at medium ranges."
msgstr "Tu puntería es bastante buena incluso a media distancia."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "marksmanship"
msgid "You have good aim even at fairly long ranges."
msgstr "Tienes buena puntería incluso a distancias bastante largas."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "marksmanship"
msgid "You're a veritable sniper."
msgstr "Eres un auténtico francotirador."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Description of skill "launchers"
msgid ""
"Your skill in using heavy weapons like rocket, grenade or missile launchers.  "
"These weapons have a variety of applications and may carry immense "
"destructive power, but they are cumbersome and hard to manage."
msgstr ""
"Tu habilidad para usar armamento pesado como cohetes, lanzagranadas o "
"lanzamisiles. Estas armas tienen aplicaciones diversas y pueden tener "
"muchísimo poder destructivo, pero son incómodas y difíciles de manejar."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "launchers"
msgid "You know nothing about launchers, cannons, or anything similar."
msgstr "No sabes nada de lanzaderas, cañones ni nada parecido."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "launchers"
msgid "You've at least read about cannons or flamethrowers."
msgstr "Al menos has leído sobre cañones o lanzallamas."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "launchers"
msgid "You probably built a spud launcher at some point."
msgstr "Probablemente construiste un lanzador de patatas en algún momento."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "launchers"
msgid "You're skilled with various types of launchers."
msgstr "Eres hábil con varios tipos de lanzadores."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "launchers"
msgid "You're a rare expert in knowledge about various types of launchers."
msgstr "Eres un experto poco común en el conocimiento de varios tipos de lanzadores."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "launchers"
msgid "Rather understandably, you have never fired any kind of launcher before."
msgstr ""
"Es bastante comprensible que nunca antes hayas disparado ningún tipo de "
"lanzador."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "launchers"
msgid "You may have fired a spud cannon at some point."
msgstr "Puede que hayas disparado un cañón de patatas en algún momento."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "launchers"
msgid "You have experience firing launchers or flamethrowers, somehow."
msgstr "Tienes experiencia disparando lanzadores o lanzallamas, de alguna manera."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "launchers"
msgid ""
"Your growing level of experience with rocket launchers, flamethrowers, or "
"cannons is worrying."
msgstr ""
"Tu creciente nivel de experiencia con lanzacohetes, lanzallamas o cañones es "
"preocupante."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "launchers"
msgid ""
"You just want to watch the world burn, and you're really damn good at making "
"sure it will."
msgstr ""
"Tu creciente nivel de experiencia con lanzacohetes, lanzallamas o cañones es "
"preocupante."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Skill name
msgid "handguns"
msgstr "pistolas"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Description of skill "handguns"
msgid ""
"Handguns have poor accuracy compared to rifles, but are usually quick to fire "
"and reload faster than other guns.  They are very effective at close "
"quarters, though unsuited for long range engagement."
msgstr ""
"Las pistolas tiene poca precisión comparadas con los rifles, pero "
"generalmente son más rápidas para disparar y recargar. Son muy efectivas en "
"combate en espacios cerrados, pero no sirven para grandes distancias."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "handguns"
msgid "You can't tell a revolver from a semiautomatic."
msgstr "No puedes distinguir un revólver de una semiautomática."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "handguns"
msgid "You can tell a revolver from a semiautomatic."
msgstr "Puedes distinguir un revólver de una semiautomática."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "handguns"
msgid "You know the basics of handguns and their usage."
msgstr "Conoces los fundamentos de las armas de mano y su uso."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "handguns"
msgid "You're knowledgeable about handguns and their uses."
msgstr "Conoces bien las armas de mano y sus usos."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "handguns"
msgid ""
"You know every trick and technique for firing handguns accurately and "
"effectively."
msgstr ""
"Conoces todos los trucos y técnicas para disparar armas cortas con precisión "
"y eficacia."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "handguns"
msgid "Hopefully it won't fly out of your hands when you fire one."
msgstr "Con suerte no saldrá volando de tus manos cuando dispares una."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "handguns"
msgid "Handguns feel awkward to use for you."
msgstr "Las pistolas te resultan incómodas de usar."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "handguns"
msgid "You're comfortable with the usage of handguns."
msgstr "Te sientes cómodo con el uso de armas cortas."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "handguns"
msgid "You're quite skilled and accurate with handguns."
msgstr "Eres bastante hábil y preciso con las pistolas."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "handguns"
msgid "You could win a duel at high noon."
msgstr "Podrías ganar un duelo a mediodía."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "handguns"
msgid ""
"You're a deadeye with pistols and can likely hit someone at 20 yards from the "
"hip with ease."
msgstr ""
"Eres muy bueno con las pistolas y probablemente puedas acertar a alguien a 18 "
"metros desde la cadera con facilidad."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Description of skill "rifles"
msgid ""
"Classic rifles have terrific range and accuracy compared to other firearms, "
"but may be slow to fire and reload, and can prove difficult to use in close "
"combat.  Short-barreled rifles and carbines are more like SMGs and perform "
"well in close combat."
msgstr ""
"Los rifles clásicos tienen un gran alcance y precisión en comparación con "
"otras armas de fuego, pero pueden ser lentos para disparar y recargar, y "
"pueden resultar difíciles de usar en combate en espacios cerrados. Los rifles "
"de cañón corto y las carabinas son más parecidos a los subfusiles y se "
"comportan mejor en el combate en espacios cerrados.."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "rifles"
msgid "Rifles are complicated weaponry and you don't know anything about them."
msgstr "Los rifles son armamento complicado y tú no sabes nada de ellos."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "rifles"
msgid "You at least have rudimentary knowledge of rifles."
msgstr "Al menos tienes conocimientos rudimentarios de rifles."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "rifles"
msgid "You can maintain your average standard-issue rifle."
msgstr "Puedes conservar un rifle normal."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "rifles"
msgid "You have an intricate knowledge of all the parts of a rifle and their use."
msgstr "Conoces a fondo todas las piezas de un rifle y su uso."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "rifles"
msgid ""
"You can probably disassemble and reassemble your rifle in the dark with your "
"hands tied together."
msgstr ""
"Probablemente puedas desmontar y volver a montar tu rifle en la oscuridad con "
"las manos atadas."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "rifles"
msgid "You've never fired a rifle before."
msgstr "Nunca has disparado un rifle antes."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "rifles"
msgid "You can at least shoulder a rifle."
msgstr "Al menos puedes llevar un rifle al hombro."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "rifles"
msgid "You're at least as competent as the average soldier straight out of boot camp."
msgstr ""
"Eres al menos tan competente como el soldado medio recién salido del campo de "
"entrenamiento."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "rifles"
msgid "Rifles feel familiar in your hands."
msgstr "Los rifles te resultan familiares en las manos."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "rifles"
msgid "You're a genuinely good shot."
msgstr "Eres realmente un buen tirador."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "rifles"
msgid "You could be a career sniper."
msgstr "Podrías ser un francotirador profesional."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Description of skill "shotguns"
msgid ""
"Shotguns are easy to shoot and can inflict massive damage, but their "
"effectiveness and accuracy decline rapidly with range.  Slugs can be loaded "
"into shotguns to provide greater range, though they are somewhat inaccurate."
msgstr ""
"Las escopetas son fáciles de usar y pueden causar mucho daño, pero su "
"eficacia y precisión disminuyen mucho con la distancia. Se pueden cargar "
"cartuchos para proveer mayor alcance, aunque son un poco menos precisos."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "shotguns"
msgid "\"Shot-guns?\"  But all guns are shot?"
msgstr "¿Escopetas? ¿Pero eso es un arma?"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "shotguns"
msgid "You know what a shotgun is."
msgstr "Sabes lo que es una escopeta."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "shotguns"
msgid ""
"You know enough about shotguns to get mad about unrealistic pellet spread in "
"video games."
msgstr ""
"Sabes lo suficiente de escopetas como para enfadarte por la dispersión poco "
"realista de los perdigones en los videojuegos."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "shotguns"
msgid "You're knowledgeable about the handling and maintenance of shotguns."
msgstr "Conoces el manejo y el mantenimiento de las escopetas."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "shotguns"
msgid "You couldn't hit the broad side of a barn."
msgstr "No podrías darle ni a la pared de un granero."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "shotguns"
msgid "You can usually hit a clay pigeon if it's just sitting there."
msgstr "Normalmente puedes acertar a una paloma de arcilla si está ahí sentada."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "shotguns"
msgid "You probably have experience skeet shooting."
msgstr "Probablemente tengas experiencia en tiro al plato."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "shotguns"
msgid "You're a very skilled skeet shooter."
msgstr "Eres muy hábil tirando al plato."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "shotguns"
msgid "You could snipe with most shotguns if you weren't limited by the spread."
msgstr ""
"Podrías francotirar con la mayoría de las escopetas si no estuvieras limitado "
"por la dispersión."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Skill name
msgid "submachine guns"
msgstr "subfusiles"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Description of skill "submachine guns"
msgid ""
"Comprised of an automatic rifle carbine designed to fire a pistol cartridge, "
"submachine guns can reload and fire quickly, sometimes in bursts, but they "
"are relatively inaccurate and may be prone to mechanical failures."
msgstr ""
"Compuestas principalmente por carabinas automáticas diseñadas para disparar "
"cartuchos de pistola, los subfusiles pueden recargarse y disparar "
"rápidamente, a veces en ráfagas, pero son relativamente imprecisos y pueden "
"ser propensos a fallos mecánicos."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "submachine guns"
msgid "You don't know the first thing about submachine guns."
msgstr "No sabes nada sobre subfusiles."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "submachine guns"
msgid "You know very little about SMGs."
msgstr "Sabes muy poco sobre los Subfusiles."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "submachine guns"
msgid "You know a decent bit about firing SMGs accurately."
msgstr "Sabes un poco sobre disparar subfusiles con precisión."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "submachine guns"
msgid "You're knowledgeable about the tactics used with SMGs."
msgstr "Conoces bien las tácticas utilizadas con los subfusiles."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "submachine guns"
msgid "You've never held an SMG before."
msgstr "Nunca has sostenido un subfusil antes."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "submachine guns"
msgid "You have minimal experience with SMGs."
msgstr "Tienes una experiencia mínima con los subfusiles."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "submachine guns"
msgid "You have some experience with SMGs."
msgstr "Tienes algo de experiencia con subfusiles."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "submachine guns"
msgid "You're fairly experienced with SMGs."
msgstr "Tienes bastante experiencia con subfusiles."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "submachine guns"
msgid "You're very experienced with SMGs."
msgstr "Tienes mucha experiencia con subfusiles."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "submachine guns"
msgid "You're a CQB expert with SMGs."
msgstr "Eres un experto en el combate cuerpo a cuerpo con los subfusiles."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Description of skill "throwing"
msgid ""
"Your skill in throwing objects over a distance.  Skill increases accuracy, "
"and at higher levels, the range of a throw."
msgstr ""
"Tu habilidad para arrojar objetos a distancia. La habilidad aumenta la "
"precisión y, en los niveles más altos, el alcance de un lanzamiento."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "throwing"
msgid ""
"You've managed to avoid gym class your whole life and barely know how to "
"throw a rock.  Impressive."
msgstr ""
"Has conseguido evitar las clases de gimnasia toda tu vida y apenas sabes "
"lanzar una piedra. Impresionante."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "throwing"
msgid ""
"You know how to throw things.  Which is good, since that's an inherent skill "
"of being human."
msgstr ""
"Sabes tirar cosas. Lo cual es bueno, ya que es una habilidad inherente al ser "
"humano."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "throwing"
msgid "You know how to throw stuff with reasonable accuracy."
msgstr "Sabes lanzar cosas con una precisión razonable."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "throwing"
msgid "You know proper form and methods for throwing accurately."
msgstr "Conoces la forma y los métodos adecuados para lanzar con precisión."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "throwing"
msgid "You could teach sports.  The ones that involve throwing stuff anyway."
msgstr " Podrías enseñar deportes. Los que implican lanzar cosas."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "throwing"
msgid ""
"You're lucky if you don't drop the thing you're throwing at your feet.  Be "
"extra careful with grenades."
msgstr ""
"Tendrás suerte si no se te cae lo que estás tirando a los pies. Ten mucho "
"cuidado con las granadas."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "throwing"
msgid ""
"You can usually throw a rock at a person if they're not too far away, or "
"moving."
msgstr ""
"Normalmente puedes lanzar una piedra a una persona si no está muy lejos, o en "
"movimiento."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "throwing"
msgid "You can accurately throw a dodgeball at someone."
msgstr "Puedes lanzar con precisión un balón prisionero a alguien."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "throwing"
msgid "You can pitch a baseball across home plate into the strike zone reliably."
msgstr "Puedes lanzar una pelota de béisbol a la zona de strike de forma fiablemente."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "throwing"
msgid "You've got a good fastball."
msgstr "Tienes una buena bola rápida."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "throwing"
msgid ""
"You could've become a professional pitcher.  At least beaning zombies doesn't "
"give them a free walk to first base."
msgstr ""
"Podrías haberte convertido en lanzador profesional. Por lo menos golpear "
"zombis no les da una carrera libre a primera base."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Description of skill "melee"
msgid ""
"Your skill and finesse in personal combat, both with and without a weapon.  "
"Higher levels can significantly increase the accuracy and effectiveness of "
"your physical attacks."
msgstr ""
"Tu habilidad y sutileza en el combate personal, tanto con arma como "
"desarmado. Los niveles altos pueden incrementar significativamente la "
"precisión y la eficacia de tus ataques físicos."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "melee"
msgid ""
"You have no idea how to do anything other than vaguely swing in their "
"direction."
msgstr ""
"No tienes ni idea de cómo hacer otra cosa que lanzar golpes al aire en su "
"dirección."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "melee"
msgid "You can theoretically fight."
msgstr "En teoría puedes luchar."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "melee"
msgid ""
"You've learned enough to avoid overswinging and falling off balance if you "
"miss."
msgstr ""
"Has aprendido lo suficiente como para evitar balancearte en exceso y "
"desequilibrarte si fallas."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "melee"
msgid "Whether self-taught or trained, you've learned quite a lot about fighting."
msgstr ""
"Ya sea de forma autodidacta o entrenada, has aprendido bastante sobre la "
"lucha."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "melee"
msgid "You could teach a platoon of medieval soldiers how to fight in a war."
msgstr "Podrías enseñar a un pelotón de soldados medievales a luchar en una guerra."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "melee"
msgid "Any fighting you do is mostly just panicked flailing."
msgstr "Cualquier lucha que hagas es en su mayoría sólo pánico azotando."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "melee"
msgid "Your panicked flailing has become somewhat more determined flailing."
msgstr "Tus sacudidas de pánico se han convertido en sacudidas algo más decididas."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "melee"
msgid "Your fighting now actually resembles proper form and is far less clumsy."
msgstr "Tu lucha ahora se asemeja a la forma correcta y es mucho menos torpe."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "melee"
msgid "You're a proper fighter and can use most techniques."
msgstr "Sabes luchar muy bien y puedes utilizar la mayoría de las técnicas.."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "melee"
msgid ""
"You're a skilled man-at-arms that wouldn't look out of place fighting on a "
"medieval battlefield."
msgstr ""
"Hábil mariscal de armas, no desentonarías luchando en un campo de batalla "
"medieval."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "melee"
msgid ""
"In a world with guns you've dedicated yourself to mastering melee combat, and "
"you're damn good at it too."
msgstr ""
"En un mundo con armas de fuego te has dedicado a dominar el combate cuerpo a "
"cuerpo, y además se te da condenadamente bien."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Skill name
msgid "bashing weapons"
msgstr "arm. contundentes"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Description of skill "bashing weapons"
msgid ""
"Your skill in fighting with blunt weaponry, from rocks and sticks to baseball "
"bats and the butts of rifles.  Skill increases damage, and higher levels will "
"improve the accuracy of an attack."
msgstr ""
"Tu habilidad para pelear con armas contundentes, desde piedras y palos hasta "
"bates de béisbol y culatas de rifles. Esta habilidad aumenta el daño y a "
"niveles altos mejora la precisión de un ataque."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "bashing weapons"
msgid "You don't even know how to swing a baseball bat properly."
msgstr "Ni siquiera sabes cómo blandir un bate de béisbol correctamente."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "bashing weapons"
msgid "You at least know how to swing a baseball bat."
msgstr "Al menos sabes cómo blandir un bate de béisbol."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "bashing weapons"
msgid ""
"You have a decent idea how to maneuver blunt weapons without falling off "
"balance."
msgstr ""
"Tienes una idea decente de cómo maniobrar armas contundentes sin perder el "
"equilibrio."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "bashing weapons"
msgid ""
"You've learned how to leverage blunt weapons best to get powerful, accurate "
"hits."
msgstr ""
"Has aprendido a aprovechar mejor las armas contundentes para conseguir golpes "
"potentes y precisos."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "bashing weapons"
msgid "You could teach a class on fighting with maces and hammers."
msgstr "Podrías dar una clase de lucha con mazas y martillos."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "bashing weapons"
msgid ""
"You've somehow gone through life without even swinging a stick for fun.  How "
"awful."
msgstr ""
"De alguna manera has pasado por la vida sin siquiera balancear un palo para "
"divertirte. Qué horror."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "bashing weapons"
msgid "You can swing a baseball bat."
msgstr "Puedes blandir un bate de béisbol."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "bashing weapons"
msgid "You can reliably hit a pitch while at bat."
msgstr "Puedes golpear de forma fiable un lanzamiento mientras estás bateando."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "bashing weapons"
msgid ""
"You're a decently skilled batter and good at using all sorts of bludgeons, "
"improvised or otherwise."
msgstr ""
"Sabes batear decentemente y eres hábil con todo tipo de cachiporras, "
"improvisadas o no."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "bashing weapons"
msgid ""
"You can hit zombies over the head even with random junk and still make it "
"look good."
msgstr ""
"Puedes golpear a los zombis en la cabeza incluso con chatarra aleatoria y que "
"siga quedando bien."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "bashing weapons"
msgid ""
"You can swing a heavy, poorly-weighted sledgehammer with pinpoint accuracy "
"even against a moving target."
msgstr ""
"Puedes blandir un mazo pesado y mal contrapesado con una precisión "
"milimétrica incluso contra un objetivo en movimiento."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Skill name
msgid "cutting weapons"
msgstr "arm. cortantes"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Description of skill "cutting weapons"
msgid ""
"Your skill in fighting with weaponry designed to cut, hack and slash an "
"opponent.  Lower levels of skill increase accuracy and damage, while higher "
"levels will help to bypass heavy armor and thick hides."
msgstr ""
"Tu habilidad para pelear con armas diseñadas para cortar, dar hachazos y "
"rajar al oponente. Los primeros niveles incrementan la precisión y el daño, y "
"los niveles altos te ayudarán a penetrar armaduras pesadas y pellejos gruesos."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "cutting weapons"
msgid "You don't even know how to play-swordfight."
msgstr "Ni siquiera sabes jugar a luchar con espadas."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "cutting weapons"
msgid "You at least know which part of the sword you're supposed to hold."
msgstr "Al menos sabes qué parte de la espada debes empuñar."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "cutting weapons"
msgid "You've learned how to cut properly with draw cuts and similar techniques."
msgstr "Has aprendido a cortar correctamente con armas de corte y técnicas similares."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "cutting weapons"
msgid "You've learned how to fight with swords effectively."
msgstr "Has aprendido a luchar con espadas de forma eficaz."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "cutting weapons"
msgid "You've studied the blade."
msgstr "Has estudiado la espada."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "cutting weapons"
msgid "You'd probably hit with the flat of the blade more than the edge."
msgstr "Probablemente golpearías con la parte plana de la hoja más que con el filo."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "cutting weapons"
msgid "You can usually get a decent cut when chopping."
msgstr "Normalmente puedes conseguir un corte decente al trocear."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "cutting weapons"
msgid "You can reliably keep good edge alignment when slicing."
msgstr "Puede garantizar una buena alineación de los golpes al cortar."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "cutting weapons"
msgid "You're a fairly skilled swordsman."
msgstr "Eres muy hábil con la espada."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "cutting weapons"
msgid "With your skill, in another life you could duel a samurai."
msgstr "Con tu habilidad, en otra vida podrías batirte en duelo con un samurái."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Description of skill "dodging"
msgid ""
"Your ability to dodge an oncoming threat, be it an enemy's attack, a "
"triggered trap, or a falling rock.  This skill is also used in attempts to "
"fall gracefully, and for other acrobatic feats.  The first number shown "
"includes modifiers, and the second does not."
msgstr ""
"Tu habilidad para esquivar una amenaza que se aproxima, ya sea un ataque "
"enemigo, una trampa disparada o una roca que cae. Esta habilidad también se "
"usa en intentos de caer con gracia, y para otras hazañas acrobáticas. El "
"primer número que se muestra incluye modificadores, y el segundo no."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "dodging"
msgid ""
"For most people, jumping out of the way of danger is instinct, and you barely "
"have that."
msgstr ""
"Para la mayoría de la gente, saltar para apartarse del peligro es instinto, y "
"tú apenas lo tienes."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "dodging"
msgid "You might know how to dodge."
msgstr "Puede que sepas cómo se esquiva."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "dodging"
msgid ""
"You've learned how to minimize your movement with dodging to avoid "
"overexerting yourself."
msgstr ""
"Has aprendido a reducir al mínimo tus movimientos al esquivar para evitar "
"sobreesfuerzos."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "dodging"
msgid ""
"You have a good grasp on various dodging techniques and ways to avoid being "
"grabbed."
msgstr "Dominas varias técnicas de esquiva y formas de evitar que te agarren."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "dodging"
msgid ""
"You know how to do a dodge, duck, dip, dive, and how to win every game of "
"dodgeball."
msgstr ""
"Sabes cómo esquivar, agacharte, zambullirte y ganar todos los partidos de "
"balón prisionero."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "dodging"
msgid "Your reflexes are dull and you have two left feet.  Hope you don't trip."
msgstr ""
"Tus reflejos están embotados y tienes dos pies izquierdos. Espero que no "
"tropieces."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "dodging"
msgid "You can at least dodge without tripping over your own feet."
msgstr "Al menos puedes esquivar sin tropezar con tus propios pies."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "dodging"
msgid "You have decent reflexes and can dodge a dodgeball."
msgstr "Tienes reflejos decentes y puedes esquivar una pelota de balón prisionero."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "dodging"
msgid "You're fairly squirrely, most enemies will have some difficulty hitting you."
msgstr ""
"Eres bastante escurridizo, la mayoría de los enemigos tendrán alguna "
"dificultad para alcanzarte."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "dodging"
msgid "You have exceptional reflexes and are very slippery and hard to pin down."
msgstr ""
"Tiene unos reflejos excepcionales y es muy escurridizo y difícil de "
"inmovilizar."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Skill name
msgid "piercing weapons"
msgstr "arm. penetrantes"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Description of skill "piercing weapons"
msgid ""
"Your skill in fighting with knives, spears and other such stabbing "
"implements.  Skill increases attack accuracy as well as the chance of "
"inflicting a deadly and critical blow."
msgstr ""
"Tu habilidad para pelear con cuchillos, lanzas y otros objetos punzantes. "
"Esta habilidad aumenta la precisión de los ataques y la posibilidad de causar "
"un golpe crítico y mortal."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "piercing weapons"
msgid "You might not even be aware you're supposed to stab with a spear."
msgstr "Puede que ni siquiera sepas que debes pinchar con una lanza."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "piercing weapons"
msgid "You understand the gist of thrusting weapons."
msgstr "Entiendes lo esencial de las armas penetrantes."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "piercing weapons"
msgid "You know some of the techniques involved with thrusting weapons."
msgstr "Conoces algunas de las técnicas relacionadas con las armas penetrantes."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "piercing weapons"
msgid "You're well-learned in fencing or spearmanship."
msgstr "Tienes buenos conocimientos de esgrima y lanza."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "piercing weapons"
msgid "You could open a fencing school or start your own spear lessons."
msgstr "Podrías abrir una escuela de esgrima o empezar tus propias clases de lanza."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "piercing weapons"
msgid "You have a hard time spearing steak with a fork."
msgstr "Te cuesta mucho atravesar un filete con un tenedor."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "piercing weapons"
msgid "Stabbing is an awkward motion for you."
msgstr "Apuñalar es un movimiento torpe para ti."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "piercing weapons"
msgid "You're a decent fencer or spearman."
msgstr "Sabes usar la lanzas y la armas de estoque decentemente."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "piercing weapons"
msgid "You're a skilled fencer or spearman."
msgstr "Tienes una gran habilidad con las lanzas y las armas de estoque."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "piercing weapons"
msgid ""
"You're a commando with a knife, a fencing expert, and an accomplished "
"spearman."
msgstr ""
"Te llaman comando por tu uso del cuchillo, las armas de estoque y tu "
"conocimiento de la lanza."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Skill name
msgid "unarmed combat"
msgstr "desarmado"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Description of skill "unarmed combat"
msgid ""
"Your skill in hand-to-hand fighting.  For the unskilled, it's a good way to "
"get hurt, but those with enough practice can perform special blows and "
"techniques to quickly dispatch enemies."
msgstr ""
"Tu habilidad en la lucha cuerpo a cuerpo. Para los inexpertos, es una buena "
"forma de resultar heridos, pero aquellos con suficiente práctica pueden "
"realizar golpes y técnicas especiales para despachar rápidamente a los "
"enemigos."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "unarmed combat"
msgid "You've never had any interest in learning to fight."
msgstr "Nunca has tenido interés en aprender a luchar."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "unarmed combat"
msgid "You can theoretically throw a punch."
msgstr "En teoría puedes dar un puñetazo."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "unarmed combat"
msgid "You know how to throw down."
msgstr "Sabes como dar un golpe."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "unarmed combat"
msgid "You really know how to throw down."
msgstr "Sabes bien como dar un golpe."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "unarmed combat"
msgid "You could probably teach your own martial art."
msgstr "Probablemente podrías enseñar tu propio arte marcial."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "unarmed combat"
msgid "Punching someone is more likely to hurt you than them."
msgstr ""
"Dar un puñetazo a alguien tiene más probabilidades de hacerte daño a ti que a "
"él."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "unarmed combat"
msgid "You can throw a punch.  Not well, but you can throw one."
msgstr "Puedes dar un puñetazo. No muy bien, pero puedes dar uno."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "unarmed combat"
msgid "You're enough of a scrapper to fight with your fists if you have to."
msgstr "Tienes suficiente carácter para luchar con los puños si es necesario."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "unarmed combat"
msgid "You could win most bar fights."
msgstr "Podrías ganar la mayoría de las peleas de bar."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "unarmed combat"
msgid "You'd have your black belt if any dojos were still open."
msgstr "Tendrías tu cinturón negro si algún dojo siguiera abierto."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "unarmed combat"
msgid "You could have multiple black belts or box in the major leagues."
msgstr "Podrías tener varios cinturones negros o boxear en las ligas mayores."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Skill name
msgid "applied science"
msgstr "ciencia aplicada"

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Description of skill "applied science"
msgid ""
"Your skill in general 'bench science', applying any of a wide range of "
"precision techniques based on your overall understanding of scientific "
"principles.  This is not a research skill, but about using the results of "
"others' research."
msgstr ""
"Tu habilidad en la \"ciencia de laboratorio\" general, aplicando una amplia "
"gama de técnicas de precisión basadas en tu comprensión general de los "
"principios científicos. No se trata de una habilidad de investigación, sino "
"de utilizar los resultados de la investigación de otros."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "applied science"
msgid "You're not even theoretically a physicist."
msgstr "Ni siquiera sabes en teoría de física."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "applied science"
msgid "You have the basic understanding of science on par with a high schooler."
msgstr ""
"Tienes unos conocimientos básicos de ciencia a la altura de los alumnos de "
"secundaria."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "applied science"
msgid "You have a decent understanding of science on par with a college graduate."
msgstr ""
"Tienes una comprensión de la ciencia equiparable a la de una persona con "
"titulación universitaria."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "applied science"
msgid ""
"You have a deep understanding of the scientific method and possibly have a "
"degree in a scientific field."
msgstr ""
"Tienes un profundo conocimiento del método científico y posiblemente un "
"título en un campo científico."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "applied science"
msgid "You likely have a PhD in a scientific field."
msgstr "Es probable que tengas un doctorado en un campo científico."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "applied science"
msgid "You skipped all your science classes."
msgstr "Te saltaste todas las clases de ciencias."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "applied science"
msgid "You've at least done high school chemistry classes."
msgstr "Al menos has dado clases de química en el instituto."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "applied science"
msgid "You've worked with a few chemicals and can follow simple procedures."
msgstr ""
"Has trabajado con algunos productos químicos y puedes seguir procedimientos "
"sencillos."

#: data/json/skills.json
#. ~ Level description of skill "applied science"
msgid ""
"You can follow some more complicated procedures and likely took advanced "
"chemistry courses."
msgstr ""
"Puede seguir algunos procedimientos más complicados y es probable que haya "
"seguido cursos avanzados de química."

