msgstr "PÁJARO"

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_effect_eocs.json
#: data/json/monster_special_attacks/spells.json
#: data/json/recipes/recipes.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/recipes/categories.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<radiation_category>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<random_category>"
