#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_effect_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_ink_grand_spray"
msgid "Your ink glands spray some ink into your attacker's eyes!"
msgstr "¡Tus glándulas de tinta rocían algo de tinta en los ojos de tu atacante!"

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_effect_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_insect_wings_shutoff"
msgid "You don't have the stamina to keep buzzing."
msgstr "No tienes suficiente vigor para seguir zumbando."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_effect_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_social2_penalty"
msgid "You could use some friendly company."
msgstr "Te vendría bien un poco de compañía amistosa."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_effect_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_asocial2_penalty"
msgid "You'd really rather be by yourself."
msgstr "Preferirías estar solo."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/LIXA_EOCs_spells_traps.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LIXA_UNFOLD_ENTRY"
msgid ""
"You step into a space that unfolds around you, becoming endless and "
"completely flat.  Every side of every surface is on display.  You look down "
"at your hands; you can see the front, the back, the insides and outsides of "
"every vein and bone, all in the same place on one surface.  You can't imagine "
"what has happened to your eyes to let you understand what you are seeing.  Or "
"your brain."
msgstr ""
"Entras en un espacio que se despliega a tu alrededor, infinito y "
"completamente plano. Todas las caras de todas las superficies están a la "
"vista. Te miras las manos y puedes ver el anverso, el reverso, el interior y "
"el exterior de cada vena y cada hueso, todo en el mismo lugar de una misma "
"superficie. No puedes imaginar lo que le ha pasado a tus ojos para que "
"entiendas lo que estás viendo. O a tu cerebro."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/LIXA_EOCs_spells_traps.json
#. ~ Success message in teleportation in nested effect in switch statement in
#. effect in EoC "EOC_LIXA_BACK"
#. ~ Success message in teleportation in nested effect in switch statement in
#. effect in EoC "EOC_LIXA_FORWARD"
msgid "You walk for a long while."
msgstr "Caminas durante un buen rato."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/LIXA_EOCs_spells_traps.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LIXA_unfold_return"
msgid ""
"There is a soft sound, like a champagne cork popping in an empty concert "
"hall.  The world is as it was again.  The LIXA device still hums quietly as "
"it finishes powering down."
msgstr ""
"Hay un sonido suave, como el descorche de un corcho de champán en una sala de "
"conciertos vacía. El mundo vuelve a ser como antes. El dispositivo LIXA sigue "
"zumbando en silencio mientras termina de apagarse."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/labyrinth_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Fail message in teleportation in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LS_Teleport_to_labyrinth"
msgid "Nope!"
msgstr "¡Nope!"

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/labyrinth_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LS_Teleport_to_labyrinth"
msgid "Zwoink."
msgstr "Zwoink."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/labyrinth_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LS_Exit_labyrinth"
msgid "Zworunk"
msgstr "Zworunk"

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/labyrinth_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LS_Exit_labyrinth_sparkling_chasm"
msgid ""
"As you fall into the chasm, you see a multitude of stars, spots, and other "
"shapes.  It's like your sinking ever further into a liquid solution, and "
"falling through the air at the same time.  Your head throbs with pain as the "
"pressure increases, and you black out.  When you come to, you're back in "
"reality disoriented but unharmed."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/nether_glass_effect_on_condition.json
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/abyssal_hunger_eocs.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/elemental_eruptions.json
#. ~ Fail message in teleportation in effect in EoC "EOC_nether_glass_lost_tp"
#. in nested EOCs in effect in EoC "EOC_nether_glass_event"
#. ~ Fail message in teleportation in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON"
#. ~ Fail message in teleportation in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON_NEXT_LEVEL"
#. ~ Fail message in teleportation in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON_EXIT"
#. ~ Fail message in teleportation in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_ENTER_ABYSSAL_HUNGER_DUNGEON"
#. ~ Fail message in teleportation in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_ENTER_ABYSSAL_HUNGER_NEXT_LEVEL"
#. ~ Fail message in teleportation in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_ENTER_ABYSSAL_HUNGER_NEXT_LEVEL"
#. ~ Fail message in teleportation in effect in EoC "EOC_ABYSSAL_HUNGER_EXIT"
#. ~ Fail message in teleportation in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_UNDINE_WARP_POOL_BOTTOM_FLOOR"
msgid "Something is very wrong!"
msgstr "¡Algo está muy mal!"

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/nether_glass_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player sees monster spawns in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_nether_glass_yrax_encounter" in nested EOCs in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_nether_glass_event"
msgid "The emptiness yields before an all-encompassing construct."
msgstr "El vacío cede ante una construcción que lo abarca todo."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/nether_glass_effect_on_condition.json
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player sees monsters spawn in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_nether_glass_yrax_encounter" in nested EOCs in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_nether_glass_event"
#. ~ Player sees monsters spawn in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_ARTIFACT_MEDIUM"
msgid "Reality twists and deforms as wriggling chunks of it fall on the ground."
msgstr ""
"La realidad se retuerce y se deforma a medida que se desgarran los trozos que "
"caen al suelo."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/nether_monster_death.json
#. ~ Message in nested effect in then statement in nested effect in switch
#. statement in effect in EoC "EOC_YUGG_DEATH"
msgid ""
"As it stops moving, the creature quickly begins to darken and turn "
"translucent, shattering like glass soon after."
msgstr ""
"Al dejar de moverse, la criatura empieza a oscurecerse rápidamente y a "
"volverse translúcida, rompiéndose como el cristal poco después."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/nether_monster_death.json
#. ~ Message in nested effect in then statement in nested effect in switch
#. statement in effect in EoC "EOC_YUGG_DEATH"
msgid ""
"As it stops moving, the creature's skin turns darker and it falls limp like a "
"pool noodle."
msgstr ""
"Cuando deja de moverse, la piel de la criatura se oscurece y cae flácida como "
"un fideo en agua."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/nether_monster_death.json
#. ~ Message in nested effect in then statement in nested effect in switch
#. statement in effect in EoC "EOC_YUGG_DEATH"
msgid ""
"As it stops moving, the creature seems to lose all detail and falls limply on "
"the ground with a wet thud."
msgstr ""
"Al dejar de moverse, la criatura parece perder todo detalle y cae desplomada "
"al suelo con un ruido sordo y húmedo."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/nether_monster_death.json
#. ~ Message in nested effect in then statement in nested effect in switch
#. statement in effect in EoC "EOC_YUGG_DEATH"
msgid ""
"As it stops moving, the creature seems to stiffen as it skins seems to harden "
"and take a form not dissimilar to stone."
msgstr ""
"Cuando deja de moverse, la criatura parece endurecerse y su piel toma una "
"forma similar a la de la piedra."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/nether_monster_death.json
#. ~ Message in nested effect in then statement in nested effect in switch
#. statement in effect in EoC "EOC_YUGG_DEATH"
msgid ""
"As it falls to the ground, strands of fog seem to tear away from the corpse.  "
"The giant worm dissolves in the air in front of your eyes."
msgstr ""
"Al caer al suelo, hilos de niebla parecen desprenderse del cadáver. El gusano "
"gigante se disuelve en el aire ante tus ojos."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MORALE_GOOD"
msgid "You feel a warm sense of being at home."
msgstr "Tienes la acogedora sensación de estar en casa."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_DEPENDENT_ACCEPTANCE_1"
msgid "You suddenly feel a weight you didn't know you had on you, being lifted away."
msgstr "De repente sientes que se te quita un peso que no sabías que tenías encima."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_DEPENDENT_ACCEPTANCE_2"
msgid ""
"You suddenly feel wakeful and energized, as if something that was slowing you "
"down is now gone."
msgstr ""
"De repente sientes menos cansació y con más energía, como si algo que "
"empujaba de ti hubiera desaparecido."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_DEPENDENT_ACCEPTANCE_3"
msgid "You suddenly feel as if invisible shackles are being lifted away…"
msgstr "De repente sientes como si te quitaran unos grilletes invisibles..."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_PORTAL_DEPENDENT_ACCEPTANCE_4"
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_PORTAL_DEPENDENT_DUNGEON_REWARD_5"
msgid ""
"You suddenly feel a profound sense of belonging take root inside you, "
"spreading throughout your body.  It fades quickly, but something warm remains…"
msgstr ""
"De repente, sientes que un profundo sentimiento de pertenencia arraiga en tu "
"interior y se extiende por todo tu cuerpo. Se desvanece rápidamente, pero "
"algo cálido permanece..."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in else statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_PORTAL_DEPENDENT_ACCEPTANCE_4"
msgid ""
"You suddenly feel a profound sense of belonging take root inside you, but "
"then abruptly grow cold.  You reach out for it, but it's gone now, taken away "
"by the indoors.  You long for the sky…"
msgstr ""
"De repente sientes que un profundo sentimiento de pertenencia arraiga en tu "
"interior, pero luego se vuelve abruptamente frío. Extiendes la mano para "
"alcanzarlo, pero ya no está, se lo ha llevado el interior. Anhelas el cielo..."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_DEPENDENT_FOCUS_GOOD"
msgid "Everything suddenly feels more clear."
msgstr "De repente, todo parece más claro."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MORALE_BAD"
msgid "You suddenly feel like you shouldn't be here."
msgstr "De repente sientes que no deberías estar aquí."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_DEPENDENT_FOCUS_BAD"
msgid "You try to recall what you were about to do, but you can't focus…"
msgstr "Intentas recordar lo que ibas a hacer, pero no puedes concentrarte..."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_DEPENDENT_STR_BAD"
msgid "You suddenly feel feeble.  Your muscles wobble."
msgstr "De repente, te sientes débil. Tus músculos tiemblan."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_DEPENDENT_DEX_BAD"
msgid ""
"You suddenly feel a sharp pain in your hand.  You reach out to grab it, and "
"miss."
msgstr ""
"De repente sientes un dolor agudo en la mano. Estiras la mano para agarrarla "
"y fallas."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_DEPENDENT_PER_BAD"
msgid "You blink one time, and everything seems bigger."
msgstr "Pestañeás una vez y todo parece más grande."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_DEPENDENT_INT_BAD"
msgid "You stop to think, but you can't seem to remember about what."
msgstr "Te paras a pensar, pero no consigues recordar sobre qué."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_DEPENDENT_SHAKES"
msgid "You feel anxious for no reason."
msgstr "Te sientes ansioso sin razón."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_DEPENDENT_NAUSEA"
msgid "You suddenly feel as if your stomach and its contents are fighting."
msgstr "De repente sientes como si tu estómago y su contenido estuvieran luchando."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_DEPENDENT_STUN"
msgid "For a brief moment, you feel rejected by the world."
msgstr "Durante un breve momento, te sientes rechazado por el mundo."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_DEPENDENT_DOWNED"
msgid "Gravity suddenly exerts immense pressure, forcing you to the ground!"
msgstr ""
"De repente, ¡la gravedad ejerce una presión inmensa, tirándote contra el "
"suelo!"

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_DEPENDENT_DAMAGE_CONSTANT"
msgid "Your vision suddenly fills with cold sparks.  You feel so alone…"
msgstr "De repente, tu visión se llena de chispas frías. Te sientes tan solo..."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_DEPENDENT_PAIN_CONSTANT"
msgid ""
"Faint sparks surround your body as you suffer with every action you take, as "
"if you weren't intended to do them."
msgstr ""
"Débiles chispas rodean tu cuerpo mientras sufres con cada acción que "
"realizas, como si no estuvieras destinado a hacerlas."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_DEPENDENT_PAIN"
msgid ""
"Faint sparks suddenly appear and disappear around you, as if rejecting your "
"very existence.  Pain flares across your body."
msgstr ""
"Unas débiles chispas aparecen y desaparecen de repente a tu alrededor, como "
"si rechazaran tu propia existencia. El dolor recorre tu cuerpo."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_DEPENDENT_DUNGEON_REWARD_0"
msgid ""
"You feel invigorated by what you just experienced, so…  What is this feeling "
"of regret for leaving that place?"
msgstr ""
"Te sientes vigorizado por lo que acabas de vivir, así que... ¿Qué es ese "
"sentimiento de arrepentimiento por haber abandonado ese lugar?"

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_DEPENDENT_DUNGEON_REWARD_1"
msgid ""
"You feel like the shackles of your body are loosening a little.  The world "
"seems to accept your distorted presence for now.  You wonder if what you "
"currently feel would have been greater if only you had gone deeper…"
msgstr ""
"Sientes que los grilletes de tu cuerpo se aflojan un poco. El mundo parece "
"aceptar por ahora tu presencia distorsionada. Te preguntas si lo que sientes "
"actualmente habría sido mayor si hubieras profundizado más..."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_DEPENDENT_DUNGEON_REWARD_2"
msgid ""
"You suddenly feel in calm, your body a little faster, and your surroundings "
"less hostile than what you remember.  Before this new sensation passes away "
"though, you hear a little voice in your head saying \"deeper…\""
msgstr ""
"De repente te sientes en calma, tu cuerpo un poco más rápido y tu entorno "
"menos hostil de lo que recuerdas. Sin embargo, antes de que esta nueva "
"sensación desaparezca, oyes una vocecita en tu cabeza que te dice \"más "
"profundo...\"."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_DEPENDENT_DUNGEON_REWARD_3"
msgid ""
"You return to your reality with a sense of ecstasy, your body feels great, "
"your shackles have come loose and you feel powerful because of it.  But you "
"can feel it, this exhilarating feeling is only the beginning, you need to go "
"deeper…"
msgstr ""
"Vuelves a tu realidad con una sensación de éxtasis, tu cuerpo se siente "
"genial, tus grilletes se han soltado y te sientes poderoso por ello. Pero "
"puedes sentirlo, esta estimulante sensación es sólo el principio, necesitas "
"profundizar más..."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_DEPENDENT_DUNGEON_REWARD_4"
msgid ""
"You feel in communion with the world around you, the world is no longer "
"rejecting you, at least for now, YOU are rejecting IT.  Your whole body "
"craves for what you could have gained if only you had gone a little deeper…"
msgstr ""
"Te sientes en comunión con el mundo que te rodea, el mundo ya no te rechaza, "
"al menos por ahora, TÚ lo rechazas a ÉL. Todo tu cuerpo anhela lo que podrías "
"haber ganado si hubieras profundizado un poco más..."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in else statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_PORTAL_DEPENDENT_DUNGEON_REWARD_5"
msgid ""
"You suddenly feel a profound sense of belonging take root inside you, "
"temporally amplifying your grasp of reality.  For some time you will be the "
"master of your surroundings."
msgstr ""
"De repente sientes que un profundo sentimiento de pertenencia echa raíces en "
"tu interior, ampliando temporalmente tu comprensión de la realidad. Durante "
"algún tiempo serás el dueño de tu entorno."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/effects_on_condition/altered_eocs.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_premonition_instances.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_CAUSE_EARLY_PORTAL_STORM"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_CAUSE_EARLY_PORTAL_STORM_ACTUAL"
msgid ""
"You suddenly register a buzzing in your senses.  It's getting louder, and "
"your head starts to throb.  Somewhere nearby, a tiny cataclysm has begun "
"(check mission log for details)."
msgstr ""
"De repente, notas un zumbido en tus sentidos. Es cada vez más fuerte y tu "
"cabeza empieza a palpitar. En algún lugar cercano, ha comenzado un pequeño "
"cataclismo (comprueba el registro de misiones para más detalles)."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_CAUSE_PORTAL_STORM"
msgid "Reality is breaking!"
msgstr "¡La realidad se está rompiendo!"

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_CANCEL_PORTAL_STORM"
msgid ""
"As suddenly as it began, the portal storm fades.  Reality returns to normal.  "
"Hopefully the scarring is minimal…"
msgstr ""
"Tan repentinamente como empezó, la tormenta del portal se desvanece. La "
"realidad vuelve a la normalidad. Esperemos que las cicatrices sean mínimas..."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player sees monster spawns in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_SHIFTING_MASS"
msgid ""
"Small gashes in reality open nearby, revealing an endless expanse of black "
"water.  An alien being spills through before the portals close."
msgstr ""
"En las inmediaciones se abren pequeñas brechas en la realidad que revelan una "
"extensión interminable de agua negra. Un ser alienígena se derrama a través "
"de ellas antes de que se cierren los portales."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player sees monsters spawn in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_SHIFTING_MASS"
msgid ""
"Small gashes in reality open nearby, revealing an endless expanse of black "
"water.  Several alien beings spill out before the portals close."
msgstr ""
"En las inmediaciones se abren pequeñas brechas en la realidad que revelan una "
"extensión interminable de agua negra. Varios seres alienígenas se derraman "
"antes de que los portales se cierren."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player sees monster spawns in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_ARTIFACT_WEAK"
msgid "A chunk of reality gets loose and falls on the ground."
msgstr "Un trozo de realidad se suelta y cae al suelo."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player sees monsters spawn in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_ARTIFACT_WEAK"
msgid "Chunks of reality get loose and fall on the ground."
msgstr "Trozos de realidad se sueltan y caen al suelo."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player sees monster spawns in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_ARTIFACT_MEDIUM"
msgid "Reality twists and deforms as a wriggling chunk of it falls on the ground."
msgstr "La realidad se retuerce y deforma al caer al suelo un trozo que se retuerce."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player sees monster spawns in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_ARTIFACT_STRONG"
msgid "A chunk of reality tears itself asunder and takes shape on the ground."
msgstr "Un trozo de realidad se desgarra y toma forma en el suelo."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player sees monsters spawn in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_ARTIFACT_STRONG"
msgid "Chunks of reality tear themselves asunder and take shape on the ground."
msgstr "Trozos de realidad se despedazan y toman forma en el suelo."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player sees monster spawns in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_IMPOSSIBLE_SHAPE"
msgid ""
"You cannot remember how the impossible shape came to be here.  The pain in "
"your head suggests that that's a good thing."
msgstr ""
"No recuerdas cómo ha llegado hasta aquí esa forma imposible. El dolor en tu "
"cabeza sugiere que eso es algo bueno."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player sees monsters spawn in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_IMPOSSIBLE_SHAPE"
msgid ""
"You cannot remember how the impossible shapes came to be here.  The pain in "
"your head suggests that that's a good thing."
msgstr ""
"No recuerdas cómo han llegado hasta aquí esas formas imposibles. El dolor en "
"tu cabeza sugiere que eso es algo bueno."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player sees monster spawns in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_FLATLANDER"
msgid ""
"something glides into your field of vision out of thin air, slipping between "
"the space between atoms."
msgstr ""
"algo se desliza en tu campo de visión de la nada, deslizándose entre el "
"espacio de los átomos."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player sees monsters spawn in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_FLATLANDER"
msgid ""
"several things glide into your field of vision out of thin air, slipping "
"between the spaces between atoms."
msgstr ""
"varias cosas se deslizan en tu campo de visión de la nada, deslizándose en "
"los espacios entre átomos."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player sees monster spawns in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_GIANT_APPENDAGE"
msgid "A gigantic limb tears its way into reality."
msgstr "Un miembro gigantesco se abre paso en la realidad."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player sees monsters spawn in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_GIANT_APPENDAGE"
msgid "Gigantic limbs tear their way into reality around you."
msgstr "Miembros gigantescos se abren paso en la realidad a tu alrededor."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#: data/json/mapgen/haunting.json
#. ~ Player sees monster spawns in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_MEMORIES"
#. ~ Player sees monster spawns in effect in EoC "EOC_conjure_memories"
msgid "A flickering silhouette appears nearby."
msgstr "Una silueta parpadeante aparece cerca."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#: data/json/mapgen/haunting.json
#. ~ Player sees monsters spawn in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_MEMORIES"
#. ~ Player sees monsters spawn in effect in EoC "EOC_conjure_memories"
msgid "Human silhouettes appear and surround you."
msgstr "Las siluetas humanas aparecen y te rodean."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player sees monster spawns in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_ABSENCE"
msgid ""
"The very notion of empty space is made a cruel joke.  Nearby nothing becomes "
"even less."
msgstr ""
"La noción misma de espacio vacío se convierte en una broma cruel. La nada "
"cercana se convierte en aún menos."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player sees monster spawns in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_SWARM_STRUCTURE"
msgid "The swarm structure was always here, right?"
msgstr "La estructura del enjambre siempre estuvo aquí, ¿verdad?"

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_PAIN"
msgid ""
"You awake with a start from what must have been a violent and horrifying "
"daydream.  Your body aches as if the wounds were real."
msgstr ""
"Te despiertas con un sobresalto de lo que debe haber sido una violenta y "
"horrible pesadilla. Te duele el cuerpo como si las heridas fueran reales."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_SMOKE"
msgid ""
"A million tiny pinpricks in space open for an instant, and smoke fills the "
"air."
msgstr ""
"Un millón de pequeños pinchazos se abren en el espacio por un instante, y el "
"humo llena el aire."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_YRAX_ATTENTION"
msgid "An alien construct emerges from the storm."
msgstr "Una construcción alienígena emerge de la tormenta."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player makes sound in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_TAUNT"
msgid "The voice was loud, it might have drawn attention to you!"
msgstr "La voz era alta, ¡podría haberte llamado la atención!"

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_TELEPORT_STUCK_START"
msgid "The moment feels thick, as if it's not quite over."
msgstr "El ambiente se siente tenso, como si no hubiera terminado del todo."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player makes sound in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_PORTAL_TELEPORT_STUCK_LOOP"
msgid "a loud tearing sound."
msgstr "un fuerte ruido de desgarro."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Success message in teleportation in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_PORTAL_TELEPORT_STUCK"
msgid "You feel an intense sense of deja vu."
msgstr "Sientes una intensa sensación de deja vu."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in nested effect in
#. then statement in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_LIGHT"
msgid "The sun is snuffed out like a candle."
msgstr "El sol se apaga como una vela."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in else statement in nested effect in
#. then statement in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_LIGHT"
msgid "Some of the stars grow so bright that they hurt to look at."
msgstr "Algunas estrellas brillan tanto que duele mirarlas."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_INCORPOREAL"
msgid ""
"You feel stretched, as if part of you was elsewhere.  You are not solid "
"enough to affect matter, and your equipment falls through you."
msgstr ""
"Te sientes estirado, como si una parte de ti estuviera en otra parte. No eres "
"lo suficientemente sólido como para afectar a la materia, por lo que tu "
"equipo te atraviesa."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player makes sound in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_GRASS_CHANGE"
msgid "a high-pitched squeal."
msgstr "un chirrido agudo."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Text variable value in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_STORM_CELL"
#. ~ Text variable value in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON"
msgid "Somewhere"
msgstr "Algún lugar"

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Text variable value in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_STORM_CELL"
#. ~ Text variable value in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON"
msgid "Nowhere"
msgstr "Ningún lugar"

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Text variable value in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_STORM_CELL"
#. ~ Text variable value in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON"
msgid "Everywhere"
msgstr "Todos los lugares"

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Text variable value in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_STORM_CELL"
#. ~ Text variable value in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON"
msgid "Yesterday"
msgstr "Ayer"

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Text variable value in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_STORM_CELL"
#. ~ Text variable value in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON"
msgid "Tomorrow"
msgstr "Mañana"

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Fail message in teleportation in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_STORM_CELL"
msgid "that sucks"
msgstr "Qué asco."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_STORM_CELL_TELEPORT" in
#. nested EOCs in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_STORM_CELL"
msgid "You came back.  This time."
msgstr "Volvistes. Esta vez."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_STORM_CELL"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON"
msgid "You are trapped in <global_val:place_name>!"
msgstr "¡Te has cruzado con una <global_val:place_name> !"

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_STORM_MAPGEN"
msgid ""
"You can feel the presence of something nearby, cracked in a way you can't put "
"into words (check mission log for details)."
msgstr ""
"Puedes sentir la presencia de algo cerca, agrietado de una manera que no "
"puedes expresar con palabras (comprueba el registro de la misión para más "
"detalles)."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON_NEXT_LEVEL"
msgid "Weren't you just here?  It feels thicker somehow though."
msgstr "¿No estuviste justo aquí? Te sientes más espeso de alguna manera."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player sees monster spawns in nested effect in switch statement in effect
#. in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON_REFLECTION_SPAWN"
msgid ""
"Something your mind can't fully parse appears, despite the distance and "
"obstacles you know where it is.  You can feel its presence as if it was a "
"part of you."
msgstr ""
"Aparece algo que tu mente no puede descifrar del todo y, a pesar de la "
"distancia y los obstáculos, sabes dónde está. Puedes sentir su presencia como "
"si formara parte de ti."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Success message in teleportation in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON_EXIT"
msgid "You are safely back in the apocalypse."
msgstr "Estás a salvo de vuelta en el apocalipsis."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player sees monster spawns in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_PORTAL_STORM_SHADOW_SPAWN"
msgid "Your shadow is no longer attached to you."
msgstr "Tu sombra ya no está unida a ti."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_DEATH_PORTAL_DUNGEON"
msgid ""
"Your ultimate fate is hard to sum up in words but suffice to say, the thing "
"that used to be you wishes it had hidden from the storm."
msgstr ""
"Tu final es difícil de resumir en palabras, pero basta con decir que lo que "
"solía ser tú desearía haberse escondido de la tormenta."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_DUNGEON_REWARD_ITEM"
msgid "A strange item comes back with you."
msgstr "Un objeto extraño regresa a ti."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player sees NPC spawns in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_NPC"
msgid "A person steps nearby from somewhere else."
msgstr "Una persona se acerca desde otro lugar."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player sees NPCs spawn in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_NPC"
msgid "Several identical people walk nearby from nowhere."
msgstr "Varias personas idénticas caminan cerca de la nada."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "MAKAYLA_MUTATOR_portal_storm"
msgid "Everything feels fuzzy."
msgstr "Todo parece borroso."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "cat_ears_portal_storm" in nested EOCs in
#. effect in EoC "MAKAYLA_MUTATOR_portal_storm"
msgid "It didn't take very long for the ears to be back."
msgstr "No tardaron mucho en volver las orejas."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "large_printout_portal_storm_data_ping"
#. in nested EOCs in effect in EoC "record_portal_storm_data"
msgid "The NRE recorder emits a three beep sequence!"
msgstr "¡La grabadora NRE emite una secuencia de tres pitidos!"

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "medium_printout_portal_storm_data_ping"
#. in nested EOCs in false effect in EoC
#. "large_printout_portal_storm_data_ping" in nested EOCs in effect in EoC
#. "record_portal_storm_data"
msgid "The NRE recorder emits a two beep sequence!"
msgstr "¡La grabadora NRE emite una secuencia de dos pitidos!"

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "small_printout_portal_storm_data_ping"
#. in nested EOCs in false effect in EoC
#. "medium_printout_portal_storm_data_ping" in nested EOCs in false effect in
#. EoC "large_printout_portal_storm_data_ping" in nested EOCs in effect in EoC
#. "record_portal_storm_data"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "capture_generic_nre_anomaly"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_on_kill_capture_generic_nre_anomaly"
msgid "The NRE recorder emits a sharp beep!"
msgstr "¡La grabadora NRE emite un fuerte pitido!"

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "large_printout_portal_storm_data" in
#. nested EOCs in effect in EoC "print_nre_data"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "medium_printout_portal_storm_data" in
#. nested EOCs in effect in EoC "print_nre_data"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "small_printout_portal_storm_data" in
#. nested EOCs in effect in EoC "print_nre_data"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "printout_nre_anomaly_data" in nested
#. EOCs in effect in EoC "print_nre_data"
msgid "The recorder whirs as it starts printing the recorded data."
msgstr "La grabadora pita mientras imprime los datos guardados."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "print_nre_data"
msgid "The recorder prints: \"NO DATA\" in a short piece of paper"
msgstr "La grabadora imprime: \"NO DATA\" en un trozo de papel corto"

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/vitrification_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_quietfarm_nearby"
msgid ""
"<color_red>There is a soft, sonorous tone filling the air, like wind over "
"brittle ice.  It sets your teeth on edge.</color>"
msgstr ""
"<color_red>Hay un tono suave y sonoro que llena el aire, como el viento sobre "
"hielo quebradizo. Te pone los dientes de punta.</color>"

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/vitrification_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Fail message in teleportation in effect in EoC "EOC_vitrified_farm_init"
#. ~ Fail message in teleportation in effect in EoC "EOC_unvitrified_return"
msgid "Oops!"
msgstr "¡Ups!"

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/vitrification_effect_on_condition.json
#: data/json/snippets/vitrified_snippets.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_vitrified_farm_init"
#. ~ Snippet in category "Vitrifaction_Threshold"
msgid ""
"You arrive at the farmhouse, after what feels like an eternity.  It's not "
"quite what you were expecting, but it's very peaceful."
msgstr ""
"Llegas a la granja, trás lo que te parece una eternidad. No es exactamente lo "
"que esperabas, pero hay mucha paz."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/vitrification_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_unvitrified_return"
msgid ""
"You suck in a deep, ragged draught of air that burns in your chest.  Have you "
"been holding your breath?  You must have been.  All you can hear for a moment "
"is your heart hammering in your ears.  It takes a while to settle down."
msgstr ""
"Aspiras una profunda y entrecortada bocanada de aire que te quema en el "
"pecho. ¿Has estado conteniendo la respiración? Seguro que sí. Por un momento "
"sólo oyes el martilleo de tu corazón en los oídos. Tarda un rato en calmarse."

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/vitrification_effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Morale text
msgid "Content amidst the glass"
msgstr "Contenido entre el cristal"

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/npc_eocs/appearance_eocs.json
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "use_hair_dye_kit"
msgid "Black Dye"
msgstr "Tinte Negro"

#: data/json/effects_on_condition/npc_eocs/appearance_eocs.json
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "use_hair_dye_kit"
