msgstr "El cargador de la pistola intentó poner dos balas en la recámara a la vez."

#: data/json/faults/faults_melee.json
#. ~ Name of a fault
msgid "Rolled edge"
msgstr "Filo doblado"

#: data/json/faults/faults_melee.json
#. ~ Description of fault "Rolled edge"
msgid "Edge of the blade got rolled, making it harder to cut."
msgstr "El filo de la hoja se dobló, dificultando el corte."

#: data/json/faults/faults_melee.json
#. ~ Name of a fault
msgid "Chipped edge"
msgstr "Filo desconchado"

#: data/json/faults/faults_melee.json
#. ~ Description of fault "Chipped edge"
msgid "The small piece of blade edge was broken off, making it much duller."
msgstr "El pequeño trozo de filo de la hoja se rompió, haciéndolo mucho más romo."

#: data/json/faults/faults_melee.json
#. ~ Name of a fault
msgid "Crack"
msgstr "Grieta"

#: data/json/faults/faults_melee.json
#. ~ Description of fault "Crack"
msgid ""
"There is a deep crack on the blade.  A sure sign that the entire sword will "
"break apart sooner or later."
msgstr ""
"Hay una grieta profunda en la hoja. Una señal segura de que toda la espada se "
"romperá tarde o temprano."

#: data/json/faults/faults_melee.json
#. ~ Name of a fault
msgid "Broken blade"
msgstr "Hoja rota"

#: data/json/faults/faults_melee.json
#. ~ Description of fault "Broken blade"
msgid ""
"The small part of this blade broke away.  You still can use it, but it's much "
"less effective."
msgstr ""
"Una pequeña parte de esta hoja se rompió. Todavía se puede utilizar, pero es "
"mucho menos eficaz."

#: data/json/faults/faults_melee.json
#. ~ Description of fault "Broken blade"
msgid ""
"The blade shattered completely, making it just a stub.  The only way to "
"repair such damage to make a new weapon."
msgstr ""
"La hoja se ha destrozado por completo, convirtiéndola en un simple muñón. La "
"única forma de reparar semejante daño es fabricar la arma de nuevo."

#: data/json/faults/faults_melee.json
#. ~ Name of a fault
msgid "Broken tip"
msgstr "Punta rota"

#: data/json/faults/faults_melee.json
#. ~ Description of fault "Broken tip"
msgid "The tip of the blade you could use to thrust is no more."
msgstr "La punta de la hoja que podrías usar para dar estocadas ya no existe."

#: data/json/faults/faults_melee.json
#. ~ Name of a fault
msgid "Bent tip"
msgstr "Punta doblada"

#: data/json/faults/faults_melee.json
#. ~ Description of fault "Bent tip"
msgid "The tip of the blade you could use to thrust rolled into a spiral."
msgstr "La punta de la hoja que usabas para dar estocadas se a doblado en una espiral."

#: data/json/faults/faults_melee.json
#. ~ Name of a fault
msgid "Tip fracture"
msgstr "Punta fracturada"

#: data/json/faults/faults_melee.json
#. ~ Description of fault "Tip fracture"
#, c-format
msgid "The tip of %s snapped off, making the thrusts weaker."
msgstr "La punta de %s se fracturó, haciendo tus estocadas más débiles."

#: data/json/faults/faults_melee.json
#. ~ Name of a fault
msgid "Tip warp"
msgstr "Punta deformada"

#: data/json/faults/faults_melee.json
#. ~ Description of fault "Tip warp"
#, c-format
msgid "The tip of %s started to warp, making the thrusts weaker."
msgstr "La punta de %s se empieza a deformar, haciendo tus estocadas más débiles."

#: data/json/faults/faults_melee.json
#. ~ Name of a fault
msgid "Tip chipping"
msgstr "Punto astillada"

#: data/json/faults/faults_melee.json
#. ~ Description of fault "Tip chipping"
#, c-format
msgid "Small pieces of %s started to chip off, making the thrusts less damaging."
msgstr ""
"Pequeñas piezas de %s se empiezan a desprender, haciendo que tus estocadas "
"hagan menos daño."

#: data/json/faults/faults_melee.json
#. ~ Name of a fault
msgid "Bent socket"
msgstr "Encaje doblado"

#: data/json/faults/faults_melee.json
#. ~ Description of fault "Bent socket"
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The %s's socket was bent off, making the tip not lined with a shaft, and "
"making the weapon very hard to thrust properly."
msgstr ""
"El encaje se ha doblado, haciendo que la punta no esté alineada con el asta, "
"y haciendo que sea difícil dar una estocada apropiadamente con el arma %s."

#: data/json/faults/faults_melee.json
#. ~ Name of a fault
msgid "Broken head"
msgstr "Cabeza rota"

#: data/json/faults/faults_melee.json
#. ~ Description of fault "Broken head"
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The head of %s is completely broken.  The only way to repair such damage is "
"to make a new one."
msgstr ""
"La cabeza del %s esta completamente rota. La única forma de reparar el daño "
"es crear una nueva."

#: data/json/faults/faults_melee.json
#. ~ Name of a fault
msgid "Chipping"
msgstr "Astillado"

#: data/json/faults/faults_melee.json
#. ~ Description of fault "Chipping"
#, c-format
msgid "Small pieces of %s are chipping off."
msgstr "Pequeñas partes del %s se han desprendido."

#: data/json/faults/faults_melee.json
#. ~ Name of a fault
msgid "Cracks"
msgstr "Grietas"

#: data/json/faults/faults_melee.json
#. ~ Description of fault "Cracks"
#, c-format
msgid ""
"There is a nasty crack on this %s.  Better to fix it before the entire thing "
"snaps in half!"
msgstr ""
"Hay una mala grieta en %s. Mejor arreglarlo antes de que se parta el arma por "
"la mitad."

#: data/json/faults/faults_melee.json
#. ~ Name of a fault
msgid "Broken"
msgstr "Rotura"

#: data/json/faults/faults_melee.json
#. ~ Description of fault "Broken"
#, c-format
msgid "The entire %s just snapped, leaving only long splinters."
msgstr "El arma %s se ha partido, dejando solo grandes astillas."

#: data/json/faults/faults_melee.json
#. ~ Description of fault "Cracks"
#, c-format
msgid ""
"There is a nasty crack on this %s.  Better to fix it before the entire shaft "
"snaps in half!"
msgstr ""
"Hay una mala grieta en %s. Mejor arreglarlo antes de que se parta el arma por "
"la mitad."

#: data/json/faults/faults_melee.json
#. ~ Description of fault "Broken"
#, c-format
msgid ""
"This %s is snapped in half.  You still can use it, albeit much less "
"effectively."
msgstr ""
"%s se ha partido en dos. Aún puedes utilizarlo, aunque con mucha menos "
"eficacia."

#: data/json/faults/faults_melee.json
#. ~ Description of fault "Broken"
#, c-format
msgid "This %s is completely broken."
msgstr "El arma %s esta completamente rota."

#: data/json/faults/faults_tools.json
#. ~ Name of a fault
msgid "Chipping handle"
msgstr "Mango astillado"

#: data/json/faults/faults_tools.json
#. ~ Description of fault "Chipping handle"
msgid "Small pieces of the handle are chipping off."
msgstr "Pequeñas piezas del mango se han desprendido."

#: data/json/faults/faults_tools.json
#. ~ Name of a fault
msgid "Cracked handle"
msgstr "Mango agrietado"

#: data/json/faults/faults_tools.json
#. ~ Description of fault "Cracked handle"
msgid ""
"There is a nasty crack on a handle.  Better to fix it before the entire shaft "
"snaps in half!"
msgstr ""
"Hay una mala grieta en el mango. Es mejor arreglarla antes de que se parta "
"por la mitad."

#: data/json/faults/faults_tools.json
#. ~ Name of a fault
msgid "Broken handle"
msgstr "Mango roto"

#: data/json/faults/faults_tools.json
#. ~ Description of fault "Broken handle"
msgid "Instead of a handle, there is just a small piece of wood that was left."
msgstr "En vez de un mango, ahora solo queda un pedazo de madera."

#: data/json/faults/faults_tools.json
#. ~ Name of a fault
msgid "No handle"
msgstr "Sin mango"

#: data/json/faults/faults_tools.json
#. ~ Description of fault "No handle"
msgid "The handle that was here before snapped away."
msgstr "El mango que estaba antes se rompió."

#: data/json/faults/faults_tools.json
#. ~ Description of fault "Broken handle"
msgid "The handle is snapped in half.  You still can use it, albeit less effectively."
msgstr ""
"El mango está partido por la mitad. Todavía se puede utilizar, aunque con "
"menos eficacia."

#: data/json/faults/faults_tools.json
#. ~ Description of fault "Broken handle"
msgid "The handle is completely broken."
msgstr "El mango está completamente roto."

#: data/json/faults/faults_tools.json
#. ~ Description of fault "No handle"
msgid "The head of the tool completely separated off the shaft."
msgstr "La cabeza de la herramienta se separó completamente del asta."

#: data/json/faults/faults_vehicles.json
#. ~ Name of a fault
msgid "Worn drive belt"
msgstr "Correa de transmisión desgastada"

#: data/json/faults/faults_vehicles.json
#. ~ Description of fault "Worn drive belt"
msgid "Required for operation of an attached alternator."
msgstr "Se necesita para operar un alternador unido."

