#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "industrial green carpet"
msgstr "alfombra industrial verde"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/LIXA_furniture_and_terrain.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "industrial green carpet"
msgid ""
"Firm, low-pile, high-durability carpet in a green color, for laying down on "
"bare concrete, with a still-functioning light attached to the ceiling above."
msgstr ""
"Moqueta firme, de pelo bajo y alta durabilidad, de color verde, para colocar "
"sobre hormigón desnudo, con una luz aún en funcionamiento sujeta al techo por "
"encima."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/LIXA_furniture_and_terrain.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-walls.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "reinforced concrete wall"
msgstr "muro/pared de hormigón armado"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/LIXA_furniture_and_terrain.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-walls.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "reinforced concrete wall"
msgid ""
"An extremely resilient wall, filled with concrete and rebar.  Best suited for "
"supporting multi-level buildings, only serious explosives and high-speed "
"impacts would be capable of damaging this wall."
msgstr ""
"Un muro/pared extremadamente resistente, lleno de hormigón y barras "
"corrugadas. Más adecuado para soportar edificios de varios niveles, sólo los "
"explosivos potentes y los impactos de alta velocidad serían capaces de dañar "
"este muro/pared."

