#. ~ Item name
msgid "glass door freezer"
msgid_plural "glass door freezers"
msgstr[0] "congelador con puerta de cristal"
msgstr[1] "congeladores con puerta de cristal"
msgstr[2] "congeladores con puerta de cristal"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances_refrigeration.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "glass door freezer"
msgid ""
"A glass door freezer.  When turned on, it will freeze the food inside, "
"preventing any further expiration."
msgstr ""
"Un congelador con puerta de cristal. Cuando se enciende, congela los "
"alimentos de su interior, evitando que sigan caducando."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances_refrigeration.json
#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_refrigeration.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
#. ~ Item name
msgid "display freezer"
msgid_plural "display freezers"
msgstr[0] "congelador expositor"
msgstr[1] "congeladores expositores"
msgstr[2] "congeladores expositores"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances_refrigeration.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "display freezer"
msgid ""
"A display freezer.  When turned on, it will freeze the food inside, "
"preventing any further expiration."
msgstr ""
"Un congelador expositor. Cuando se enciende, congela los alimentos de su "
"interior, evitando que sigan caducando."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "glowing tendril"
msgstr "zarcillo luminoso"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "glowing tendril"
msgid ""
"A willowy tendril growing from the floor, gently waving back and forth.  A "
"faint light spills from it."
msgstr ""
"Un zarcillo de sauce que crece desde el suelo y se agita suavemente de un "
"lado a otro. Una débil luz brota de él."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_nether_monster.json
#. ~ Bashing sound
#. ~ Bashing failed sound
msgid "splorch!"
msgstr "¡splorch!"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "wafting anemone"
msgstr "anémona flotante"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "wafting anemone"
msgid ""
"A fleshy white protuberance growing from the floor, with a cluster of "
"tendrils protruding from it.  It looks almost exactly like a sea anemone, "
"even waving gently as though underwater."
msgstr ""
"Una protuberancia blanca y carnosa que crece en el suelo, con un grupo de "
"tentáculos que salen de ella. Se parece casi exactamente a una anémona de "
"mar, incluso se agita suavemente como si estuviera bajo el agua."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "gasping tube"
msgstr "tubo jadeante"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "gasping tube"
msgid ""
"A meaty green stalactite with a thickened hide like that of a starfish, "
"extending from the floor to the ceiling.  In the center is a series of ports "
"somewhat like mouths, from which pour bursts of a vile-smelling gas."
msgstr ""
"Una carnosa estalactita verde con una piel engrosada como la de una estrella "
"de mar, que se extiende desde el suelo hasta el techo. En el centro hay una "
"serie de orificios que parecen bocas, de los que brotan ráfagas de un gas "
"apestoso."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "twitching frond"
msgstr "frondosa sacudida"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "twitching frond"
msgid ""
"A spine resembling moth antennae juts from the ground, swaying gently in the "
"air.  Every so often, a cascade of energy arcs along it and discharges into "
"the ceiling."
msgstr ""
"Una columna vertebral que se asemeja a las antenas de una polilla sobresale "
"del suelo y se balancea suavemente en el aire. De vez en cuando, una cascada "
"de energía se arquea a lo largo de ella y se descarga en el techo."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "scarred lump"
msgstr "bulto cicatrizado"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "scarred lump"
msgid ""
"A pile of nondescript alien flesh, twitching and belching strange gases out "
"of injured orifices."
msgstr ""
"Un montón de carne alienígena anodina, que se retuerce y eructa extraños "
"gases por los orificios heridos."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-eggs.json
#. ~ Bashing failed sound
#. ~ Bashing sound
msgid "splat!"
msgstr "¡splat!"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "slimy pod"
msgstr "vaina viscosa"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "slimy pod"
msgid ""
"A slick, translucent pod suspended on a thin stalk.  It is covered in a thick "
"mucus, obscuring whatever is floating in the gel-like substance inside."
msgstr ""
"Una vaina resbaladiza y translúcida suspendida en un tallo delgado. Está "
"cubierta por una espesa mucosidad, que oscurece lo que está flotando en la "
"sustancia gelatinosa del interior."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "organ pod"
msgstr "vaina de órgano"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "organ pod"
msgid ""
"A translucent pod suspended on a thin stalk.  Inside you can see the dimly "
"outlined shape of human organs, floating in some kind of preservative goo."
msgstr ""
"Una vaina translúcida suspendida en un tallo delgado. En el interior se puede "
"ver la forma poco marcada de los órganos humanos flotando en algún tipo de "
"sustancia conservante."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "resin pod"
msgstr "vaina de resina"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "resin pod"
msgid ""
"A translucent pod suspended on a thin stalk.  Inside is a clean, clear, "
"resinous-looking fluid.  You could fairly easily tear it from the stalk and "
"take it with you."
msgstr ""
"Una vaina translúcida suspendida en un tallo delgado. En el interior hay un "
"fluido limpio, claro y de aspecto resinoso. Podrías arrancarlo del tallo y "
"llevártelo contigo."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "fleshy altar"
msgstr " altar carnoso"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "fleshy altar"
msgid ""
"This pulsing protuberance juts from the floor, its sides covered in scaled, "
"oozing skin.  The surface is flat, but undulates softly.  A handful of "
"unidentifiable appendages reach from the sides, suggesting a sort of "
"nightmarish living Autodoc."
msgstr ""
"Esta protuberancia palpitante sobresale del suelo, con sus lados cubiertos de "
"piel escamosa y rezumante. La superficie es plana, pero se ondula suavemente. "
"Un puñado de apéndices inidentificables salen de los lados, sugiriendo una "
"especie de Autodoc viviente de pesadilla."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "scrap antenna"
msgstr "antena de chatarra"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "scrap antenna"
msgid ""
"This contraption looks like some sort of cobbled-together transmitter or "
"receiver antenna.  It consists of a number of mismatched blinking lights, "
"spinning servos, and dangling wires connected to a hefty metal box."
msgstr ""
"Este artilugio parece una especie de antena transmisora o receptora "
"improvisada. Consiste en una serie de luces parpadeantes que no coinciden, "
"servos que giran y cables que cuelgan conectados a una caja metálica pesada."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "pictographic signpost"
msgstr "cartel pictográfico"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "pictographic signpost"
msgid ""
"This simple scrap metal sign has a series of pictographs on it depicting what "
"seems to be a trade interaction.  There is a crude but understandable map "
"beneath it.  You should take a closer look."
msgstr ""
"Este sencillo cartel de restos de metal tiene una serie de pictogramas que "
"representan lo que parece ser una transacción comercial. Debajo hay un tosco "
"pero comprensible mapa de direcciones. Deberías mirarlo más de cerca."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_EXODII_SIGNPOST_FALSE" in furniture
#. "pictographic signpost"'s examine action
msgid ""
"You study the signpost.  It shows a similar set of directions to the ones you "
"already have.  You cross-reference them and don't learn anything new."
msgstr ""
"Examinas el cartel. Muestra un conjunto de direcciones similar a las que ya "
"tienes. Comparas las referencias y no aprendes nada nuevo."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_EXODII_SIGNPOST" in furniture
#. "pictographic signpost"'s examine action
msgid ""
"You study the signpost.  It shows simply-drawn pictograms of a pair of hands "
"holding out an object, and another pair taking the object and offering a "
"pouch in return.  Beneath the pictures there's a crude but understandable map "
"with arrows pointing to what looks like some kind of castle.  You do your "
"best to relate those to landmarks you know about, and mark the likely "
"location on your map."
msgstr ""
"Estudias el cartel. Muestra pictogramas sencillos de un par de manos que "
"sostienen un objeto, y otro par cogiendo el objeto y ofreciendo una bolsa a "
"cambio. Debajo de los dibujos hay un mapa tosco pero comprensible con flechas "
"que señala lo que parece ser una especie de castillo. Haces lo posible por "
"relacionarlos con los puntos de referencia que conoces, y marcas la probable "
"ubicación en tu mapa."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "rack of robots"
msgstr "estante de robots"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "rack of robots"
msgid ""
"A wire cage containing a number of robot parts, from chassis to limbs, firmly "
"clamped onto sturdy hanging rods.  It looks like it would be exceptionally "
"difficult to open it and get at them without damaging them, probably by "
"design."
msgstr ""
"Una jaula de alambre que contiene varias piezas de robot, desde el chasis "
"hasta las extremidades, firmemente sujetas a robustas barras colgantes. "
"Parece excepcionalmente difícil de abrir y acceder a ellas sin dañarlas, "
"probablemente por diseño."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "spinning dish"
msgstr "plato giratorio"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "spinning dish"
msgid ""
"A slowly-spinning parabolic dish engraved with an unrecognizable pattern of "
"symbols that might, at a guess, be some sort of circuitry pattern - or maybe "
"a religious incantation.  It is mounted on a completely mismatched electric "
"motor that looks fairly mundane."
msgstr ""
"Este es un plato parabólico que gira lentamente y que lleva grabado un patrón "
"irreconocible de símbolos que podría ser, supestamente, algún tipo de patrón "
"de circuitos, o tal vez un encantamiento religioso. Está montado en un motor "
"eléctrico completamente desajustado que parece bastante mundano."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "scavenged utility light"
msgstr "luz de utilidad de rebuscador"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "scavenged utility light"
msgid ""
"The bulbs emit an eerie greenish glow, and some parts of it have a curved "
"appearance as though the metal were grown in a lab, but by and large this "
"isn't a particularly unusual looking area light."
msgstr ""
"Las bombillas emiten un resplandor verdoso y algunas partes tienen un aspecto "
"curvado, como si el metal hubiera sido cultivado en un laboratorio, pero en "
"general no se trata de una luz de área de aspecto particularmente inusual."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "clanking fluid pump"
msgstr "bomba de fluido chirriante"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "clanking fluid pump"
msgid ""
"The huge, sweating pipes and large tank reveal this clanking and tortuous "
"piece of equipment to be some sort of fluid pump.  It is cobbled together "
"from several apparently ill-fitting parts that have been fitted with some "
"very strange-looking but surprisingly clever adapters."
msgstr ""
"Las enormes y humeantes tuberías y el gran depósito revelan que esta tortuosa "
"y ruidosa pieza es una especie de bomba de fluidos. Está fabricada a partir "
"de varias piezas aparentemente mal ajustadas a las que se han acoplado unos "
"adaptadores de aspecto muy extraño pero sorprendentemente ingeniosos."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "metalloid printer"
msgstr "impresora de metaloides"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "metalloid printer"
msgid ""
"This huge device fairly closely resembles a 3D printer, aside from its "
"industrial size.  Huge spools of various thin metallic wires atop it feed "
"into what seems to be some sort of nozzle, and massive electrical cables "
"disappear into the wall behind it."
msgstr ""
"Este enorme dispositivo se parece bastante a una impresora 3D, aparte de su "
"tamaño industrial. Enormes bobinas de varios cables metálicos finos lo "
"coronan y alimentan a lo que parece ser una especie de boquilla, y enormes "
"cables eléctricos desaparecen en la pared detrás de él."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "circuit printer"
msgstr "impresora de circuitos"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "circuit printer"
msgid ""
"A tall device with a lattice of pipes and nozzles.  Based on the pile of "
"products sitting in the output hopper, it looks like it's used as a printer "
"for complex electronic components."
msgstr ""
"Un aparato alto con un entramado de tubos y boquillas. Por la pila de "
"productos que hay en la tolva de salida, parece que se utiliza como impresora "
"de componentes electrónicos complejos."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "Mavrik 10-101 power core"
msgstr "núcleo de energía Mavrik 10-101"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "Mavrik 10-101 power core"
msgid ""
"There is a faded metallic plaque on the side of this cylindrical device.  The "
"lettering is a strange combination of English and Cyrillic script.  It reads:\n"
"Mavrik 10-101\n"
"Stabиlиtи\n"
"Saфetи\n"
"A нyuclиar фyutuр ви bilив iн"
msgstr ""
"En el lateral de este aparato cilíndrico hay una placa metálica descolorida. "
"La letra es una extraña combinación de escritura inglesa y cirílica. En ella "
"se puede leer:\n"
"Mavrik 10-101\n"
"Stabиlиtи\n"
"Saфetи\n"
"A нyuclиar фyutuр ви bilив iн"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "spherical generator"
msgstr "generador esférico"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "spherical generator"
msgid ""
"This huge steel-plated sphere gives off a soft hum as it, presumably, "
"generates power.  A heavy lead plate bolted to the front might describe what "
"it is, but it is written in something that looks vaguely like cuneiform."
msgstr ""
"Esta enorme esfera chapada en acero emite un suave zumbido mientras, "
"presumiblemente, genera energía. Una pesada placa de plomo atornillada a la "
"parte delantera podría describir lo que es, pero está escrita en algo que "
"parece vagamente cuneiforme."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "fluidic generator"
msgstr "generador de fluidos"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "fluidic generator"
msgid ""
"Twisting reams of copper and steel pipes wrap around a central core that "
"thrums softly.  Although there are no labels in any language you recognize, "
"the cables connected to the base suggest that this is some sort of power "
"generator."
msgstr ""
"Unas cuantas tuberías de cobre y acero se enroscan alrededor de un núcleo "
"central que retumba suavemente. Aunque no hay etiquetas en ningún idioma que "
"reconozcas, los cables conectados a la base sugieren que se trata de algún "
"tipo de generador de energía."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "rusty generator"
msgstr "generador oxidado"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "rusty generator"
msgid ""
"A tall, unremarkable cylinder capped by a wide, flat saucer.  There is heavy "
"rusting at the base.  A series of connected cables suggest that it's some "
"sort of power generator."
msgstr ""
"Un cilindro alto y poco llamativo coronado por un platillo ancho y plano. Hay "
"una fuerte oxidación en su base. Una serie de cables conectados sugieren que "
"es una especie de generador de energía."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "personal charging station"
msgstr "estación de carga personal"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "personal charging station"
msgid ""
"The cyborg equivalent of a bed, this is a custom-shaped near-vertical booth "
"designed to mount a heavy metal frame and connect it to a central power "
"supply and nutrient source."
msgstr ""
"El equivalente cibernético de una cama, es una cabina casi vertical de forma "
"personalizada diseñada para montar un armazón pesado metálico y conectarlo a "
"una fuente de alimentación y nutrientes central."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "simple charging station"
msgstr "estación de carga simple"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "simple charging station"
msgid ""
"A simple, unadorned, corroded metal charging and feeding station, with "
"hookups for two units somewhat larger than a human to stand side by side and "
"be recharged and refueled."
msgstr ""
"Una estación de carga y alimentación sencilla, sin adornos, de metal "
"corroído, con enganches para que dos unidades algo mayores que un humano "
"puedan estar una al lado de la otra y ser recargadas y repostadas."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "shimmering superstructure"
msgstr "superestructura reluciente"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "shimmering superstructure"
msgid ""
"A simple metal superstructure like you might see holding up a radio tower, "
"this one seems to give off just the faintest hint of shimmer, like heat "
"waves.  The metal has a burnt, iridescent pattern.  There is a boxy, "
"unimpressive-looking device at the top of the tower."
msgstr ""
"Una sencilla superestructura metálica, como las que sostienen las torres de "
"radio, parece desprender un tenue resplandor, como ondas de calor. El metal "
"tiene un patrón quemado e iridiscente. En la parte superior de la torre hay "
"un dispositivo cuadrado de aspecto poco impresionante."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "portal enclosure"
msgstr "recinto del portal"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "portal enclosure"
msgid ""
"A heavy metal ring attached to dozens of wires, charred by residue that gives "
"off an acrid, unfamiliar smell."
msgstr ""
"Un pesado anillo de metal unido a decenas de cables, carbonizado por residuos "
"que desprenden un olor acre y desconocido."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "locator antenna"
msgstr "antena de localización"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "locator antenna"
msgid ""
"A tall metal pole solidly fixed to the roof.  It does not look activated but "
"there's a small set of holes near its base, maybe something could be plugged "
"in one to reboot the locator."
msgstr ""
"Un alto poste metálico sólidamente fijado al tejado. No parece activado, pero "
"hay un pequeño conjunto de agujeros cerca de su base, tal vez se podría "
"enchufar algo en uno para reiniciar el localizador."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_EXOWARE_LOCATOR_ACTIVE" in furniture
#. "locator antenna"'s examine action
msgid "The locator is already active"
msgstr "El localizador ya está activado"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_EXOWARE_LOCATOR_FALSE" in furniture
#. "locator antenna"'s examine action
msgid "You don't have anything that could reactivate this device"
msgstr "No tienes nada que pueda reactivar este dispositivo"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_EXOWARE_LOCATOR" in furniture
#. "locator antenna"'s examine action
msgid ""
"You plug the rebooter in the locator.\n"
"<color_light_green>The locator reactivates.</color>"
msgstr ""
"Enchufas el reiniciador en el localizador.\n"
"<color_light_green>El localizador se reactiva.</color>"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "crystalline flower"
msgstr "flor cristalina"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "crystalline flower"
msgid "A crystalline structure that resembles a plant."
msgstr "Una estructura cristalina que se asemeja a una planta."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-decorative.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-domestic_plants.json
