#: data/json/items/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of "disconnected oven"
msgid ""
"A disconnected electric convection-based oven, commonly used for heating and "
"cooking food.  Plug it into a vehicle or power grid to get cooking."
msgstr ""
"Un horno eléctrico desconectado basado en la convección, utilizado "
"habitualmente para calentar y cocinar alimentos. Enchúfalo a un vehículo o a "
"la red eléctrica para empezar a cocinar."

#: data/json/items/appliances.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "disconnected large water purifier"
msgid_plural "disconnected large water purifiers"
msgstr[0] "potabilizador de agua grande desconectado"
msgstr[1] "potabilizadores de agua grandes desconectados"
msgstr[2] "potabilizadores de agua grandes desconectados"

#: data/json/items/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of "disconnected large water purifier"
msgid ""
"A device that effectively sterilizes water, but it doesn't take batteries.  "
"You'll need to connect it to a power source."
msgstr ""
"Un aparato que esteriliza eficazmente el agua, pero no lleva baterías. "
"Tendrás que conectarlo a una fuente de energía."

#: data/json/items/appliances.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "disconnected arcade machine"
msgid_plural "disconnected arcade machines"
msgstr[0] "máquina arcade desconectada"
msgstr[1] "máquinas arcade desconectadas"
msgstr[2] "máquinas arcade desconectadas"

#: data/json/items/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of "disconnected arcade machine"
msgid ""
"A bulky upright arcade cabinet, brightly painted and slightly worn with age.  "
"Ready to be plugged in and played."
msgstr ""
"Un voluminoso armario arcade vertical, pintado de forma brillante y "
"ligeramente desgastado por el paso del tiempo. Listo para ser enchufado y "
"jugar."

#: data/json/items/appliances.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "disconnected arc furnace"
msgid_plural "disconnected arc furnaces"
msgstr[0] "horno de arco desconectado"
msgstr[1] "hornos de arco desconectados"
msgstr[2] "hornos de arco desconectados"

#: data/json/items/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of "disconnected arc furnace"
msgid ""
"An arc furnace designed to burn a powdery mix of coke and limestone to create "
"calcium carbide.  Needs to be placed and plugged into a power source."
msgstr ""
"Un horno de arco diseñado para quemar una mezcla pulverulenta de coque y "
"piedra caliza para crear carburo de calcio. Necesita colocarse y enchufarse a "
"una fuente de energía."

#: data/json/items/appliances.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "disconnected drill press"
msgid_plural "disconnected drill presses"
msgstr[0] "prensa de taladro desconectada"
msgstr[1] "prensas de taladro desconectadas"
msgstr[2] "prensas de taladro desconectadas"

#: data/json/items/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of "disconnected drill press"
msgid ""
"A powerful drill mounted on a slide that lets it drop precisely down.  Useful "
"in all kinds of projects, from industrial fabrication to home woodworking.  "
"Needs to be placed and plugged into a power source."
msgstr ""
"Un potente taladro montado sobre una corredera que le permite descender con "
"precisión. Útil en todo tipo de proyectos, desde la fabricación industrial "
"hasta la carpintería doméstica. Necesita colocarse y enchufarse a una fuente "
"de energía."

#: data/json/items/appliances.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "disconnected table saw"
msgid_plural "disconnected table saws"
msgstr[0] "sierra de mesa desconectada"
msgstr[1] "sierras de mesa desconectadas"
msgstr[2] "sierras de mesa desconectadas"

#: data/json/items/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of "disconnected table saw"
msgid ""
"A rotating sawblade set into a large, flat table.  Used for making straight, "
"measured cuts, it's a key tool in any carpenter's arsenal.  Needs to be "
"placed and plugged into a power source."
msgstr ""
"Una hoja de sierra giratoria colocada en una gran mesa plana, para realizar "
"cortes rectos medidos, una herramienta clave en el arsenal de cualquier "
"carpintero. Necesita colocarse y enchufarse a una fuente de energía."

#: data/json/items/appliances.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "disconnected mitre saw"
msgid_plural "disconnected mitre saws"
msgstr[0] "sierra de inglete desconectada"
msgstr[1] "sierras de inglete desconectadas"
msgstr[2] "sierras de inglete desconectadas"

#: data/json/items/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of "disconnected mitre saw"
msgid ""
"A circular sawblade on an arm that can slide and rotate in several "
"directions, this is a staple tool for nearly any carpentry.  Needs to be "
"placed and plugged into a power source."
msgstr ""
"Una hoja de sierra circular en un brazo que puede deslizarse y girar en "
"varias direcciones, esta es una herramienta básica para casi cualquier "
"carpintería. Necesita colocarse y enchufarse a una fuente de energía."

#: data/json/items/appliances.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "disconnected band saw"
msgid_plural "disconnected band saws"
msgstr[0] "sierra de cinta desconectada"
msgstr[1] "sierras de cinta desconectadas"
msgstr[2] "sierras de cinta desconectadas"

#: data/json/items/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of "disconnected band saw"
msgid ""
"A ribbonlike sawblade runs in a single direction in this tool, allowing "
"precise cuts at almost any angle.  Needs to be placed and plugged into a "
"power source."
msgstr ""
"Una hoja de sierra en forma de cinta que corre en una sola dirección en esta "
"herramienta, permitiendo cortes precisos en casi cualquier ángulo. Necesita "
"colocarse y enchufarse a una fuente de energía."

#: data/json/items/appliances.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "disconnected router table"
msgid_plural "disconnected router tables"
msgstr[0] "mesa fresadora desconectada"
msgstr[1] "mesas fresadoras desconectadas"
msgstr[2] "mesas fresadoras desconectadas"

#: data/json/items/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of "disconnected router table"
msgid ""
"This table has an inset router, a rotating motor with an exchangeable blade "
"head for cutting specific profiles and grooves.  Needs to be placed and "
"plugged into a power source."
msgstr ""
"Esta mesa cuenta con una fresadora de inserción, un motor giratorio con un "
"cabezal de cuchilla intercambiable para cortar perfiles, ranuras específicas "
"y demás. Necesita colocarse y enchufarse a una fuente de energía."

#: data/json/items/appliances.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "disconnected planer"
msgid_plural "disconnected planers"
msgstr[0] "garlopa desconectada"
msgstr[1] "garlopas desconectadas"
msgstr[2] "garlopas desconectadas"

#: data/json/items/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of "disconnected planer"
msgid ""
"A hefty tool that will take in a board and cut it smooth and flat to a "
"specific width, particularly great if working with raw lumber stock, but also "
"good just for shaving wood down to size.  Needs to be placed and plugged into "
"a power source."
msgstr ""
"Una herramienta robusta que toma una tabla y la corta lisa y plana a una "
"anchura específica, especialmente útil si se trabaja con madera en bruto, "
"pero también es buena para cortar madera a medida. Necesita colocarse y "
"enchufarse a una fuente de energía."

#: data/json/items/appliances.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "disconnected jointer"
msgid_plural "disconnected jointers"
msgstr[0] "cepilladora desconectada"
msgstr[1] "cepilladora desconectadas"
msgstr[2] "cepilladoras desconectadas"

#: data/json/items/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of "disconnected jointer"
msgid ""
"A table-shaped tool with a rotating blade that will cut down, smooth out, and "
"square off a board to make it nice and smooth.  Needs to be placed and "
"plugged into a power source."
msgstr ""
"Una herramienta en forma de mesa con una cuchilla giratoria que cortará, "
"alisará y escuadrará una tabla para dejarla bonita y lisa. Necesita colocarse "
"y enchufarse a una fuente de energía."

#: data/json/items/appliances.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "disconnected hydraulic press"
msgid_plural "disconnected hydraulic presses"
msgstr[0] "prensa hidraúlica desconectada"
msgstr[1] "prensas hidraúlicas desconectadas"
msgstr[2] "prensas hidraúlicas desconectadas"

#: data/json/items/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of "disconnected hydraulic press"
msgid ""
"If you really want to squash something a lot, this is exactly the right "
"industrial tool for you.  Needs to be placed and plugged into a power source."
msgstr ""
"Si realmente quieres aplastar algo mucho, esta sería exactamente la "
"herramienta industrial adecuada para ti. Necesita colocarse y enchufarse a "
"una fuente de energía."

#: data/json/items/appliances.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "disconnected air compressor"
msgid_plural "disconnected air compressors"
msgstr[0] "compresor de aire desconectado"
msgstr[1] "compresores de aire desconectados"
msgstr[2] "compresores de aire desconectados"

#: data/json/items/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of "disconnected air compressor"
msgid ""
"This durable tank is topped with a motor that will cram as much air into the "
"tank as possible.  Needs to be placed and plugged into a power source."
msgstr ""
"Este depósito resistente está rematado con un motor que introducirá la mayor "
"cantidad de aire posible en el depósito. Necesita ser colocado y enchufado a "
"una fuente de energía."

#: data/json/items/appliances.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "disconnected autoclave"
msgid_plural "disconnected autoclaves"
msgstr[0] "autoclave desconectado"
msgstr[1] "autoclaves desconectados"
msgstr[2] "autoclaves desconectados"

#: data/json/items/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of "disconnected autoclave"
msgid ""
"An autoclave, used to sterilize equipment with pressurized steam.  It "
"requires a massive amount of power, so it will need to be plugged into a "
"power grid."
msgstr ""
"Un autoclave, utilizado para esterilizar equipos con vapor a presión. "
"Requiere una enorme cantidad de energía, por lo que tendrá que enchufarse a "
"una red eléctrica."

#: data/json/items/appliances.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "disconnected wall light"
msgid_plural "disconnected wall lights"
msgstr[0] "lampara de pared desconectada"
msgstr[1] "lamparas de pared desconectadas"
msgstr[2] "lamparas de pared desconectadas"

#: data/json/items/appliances.json
#. ~ Description of "disconnected wall light"
msgid "A wall light that provides illumination when plugged into a grid."
msgstr ""
"Una lampara de pared que provee iluminación cuando se conecta a una red "
"eléctrica."

#: data/json/items/appliances.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "disconnected standing lamp"
