msgstr[2] "polvo de quitina"

#: data/json/items/biosignatures.json
#. ~ Description of "chitin dust"
msgid ""
"The dust left over by winged insects such as butterflies or moths.  It's "
"mostly chitin but may also contain dirt and other gross materials."
msgstr ""
"El polvo que dejan los insectos alados, como las mariposas o las polillas. Es "
"mayoritariamente quitina, pero también puede contener suciedad y otros "
"materiales asquerosos."

#: data/json/items/biosignatures.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "shed snakeskin"
msgid_plural "shed snakeskins"
msgstr[0] "muda de serpiente"
msgstr[1] "mudas de serpiente"
msgstr[2] "mudas de serpiente"

#: data/json/items/biosignatures.json
#. ~ Description of "shed snakeskin"
msgid ""
"A small length of shed snakeskin.  It's thin and translucent but still bears "
"the distinct pattern of scales."
msgstr ""
"Un pequeño trozo de piel de serpiente desprendida. Es fina y translúcida, "
"pero conserva el patrón de las escamas."

#: data/json/items/biosignatures.json
#. ~ Description of "shed snakeskin"
msgid ""
"The molted dermis of an adult snake.  This one is in one piece.  You can even "
"see the individual eyes."
msgstr ""
"La dermis mudada de una serpiente adulta. Ésta está entera. Incluso se pueden "
"ver los ojos individuales."

#: data/json/items/biosignatures.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "big shed snakeskin"
msgid_plural "big shed snakeskins"
msgstr[0] "muda grande de serpiente"
msgstr[1] "mudas grandes de serpiente"
msgstr[2] "mudas grandes de serpiente"

#: data/json/items/biosignatures.json
#. ~ Description of "big shed snakeskin"
msgid ""
"A very large shed snakeskin.  This didn't come from anything native, or "
"natural, to New England."
msgstr ""
"Una piel de serpiente muy grande. Esto no vino de nada nativo, o natural, de "
"Nueva Inglaterra."

#: data/json/items/biosignatures.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "gigantic shed snakeskin"
msgid_plural "gigantic shed snakeskins"
msgstr[0] "muda gigante de serpiente"
msgstr[1] "mudas gigantes de serpiente"
msgstr[2] "mudas gigantes de serpiente"

#: data/json/items/biosignatures.json
#. ~ Description of "gigantic shed snakeskin"
msgid ""
"A complete shed snakeskin of tremendous size.  Whatever left it must be "
"getting even bigger.  You should not be, or return to, wherever you found "
"this."
msgstr ""
"Una piel de serpiente completa de tremendo tamaño. Lo que la dejó debe estar "
"haciéndose aún más grande. No deberías estar, o volver, donde sea que "
"encontraste esto."

#: data/json/items/biosignatures.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "gigantic snake scales"
msgid_plural "gigantic snake scales"
msgstr[0] "escamas de serpiente gigante"
msgstr[1] "escamas de serpiente gigante"
msgstr[2] "escamas de serpiente gigante"

#: data/json/items/biosignatures.json
#. ~ Description of "gigantic snake scales"
msgid ""
"A handful of greatly oversized scales from a snake.  This is a troubling find "
"for a few reasons.  There's the size, obviously, but also the unusual "
"hardness in spite of the obvious decay, and the fact that snakes don't shed "
"individual scales like this."
msgstr ""
"Un puñado de escamas de gran tamaño de una serpiente. Este es un hallazgo "
"preocupante por varias razones. Está el tamaño, obviamente, pero también la "
"inusual dureza a pesar de la obvia descomposición, y el hecho de que las "
"serpientes no se desprenden de escamas individuales como esta."

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "anesthetic"
msgid ""
"A variety of powerful hypnotic, analgesic, and stimulative drugs.  It's "
"intended for use in specialized medical equipment, and can't be administered "
"manually.  You can reload an anesthesia kit with it."
msgstr ""
"Una variedad de poderosas drogas hipnóticas, analgésicas y estimulantes. Está "
"destinado a ser utilizado por un equipo médico especializado y no puede ser "
"administrado manualmente. Puedes recargar un kit de anestesia con él."

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
