msgstr[1] "suplementos de fertilidad"
msgstr[2] "suplementos de fertilidad"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "fertility supplement"
msgid "A pill for those looking to have children.  It is of no use to you."
msgstr "Una píldora para los que quieren tener hijos. No le sirve de nada."

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sulfur"
msgid_plural "sulfur"
msgstr[0] "azúfre"
msgstr[1] "azúfre"
msgstr[2] "azúfre"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#. ~ Description of "sulfur"
msgid ""
"A handful of pure sulfur.  Primarily used to make battery acid, sulfur is "
"sometimes used as fuel for explosives.  Can be burned to produce acidic smoke "
"that is deadly to bacteria and humans alike, or oxidized to make "
"paper-bleaching agents.  It also serves as a basis for many kinds of "
"fungicide."
msgstr ""
"Un puñado de azufre puro. Utilizado principalmente para fabricar ácido para "
"baterías, el azufre se emplea a veces como combustible para explosivos. Puede "
"quemarse para producir un humo ácido que es mortal tanto para las bacterias "
"como para los humanos, u oxidarse para fabricar agentes blanqueadores del "
"papel. También sirve de base para muchos tipos de fungicidas."

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
