msgstr[0] "superpegamento"
msgstr[1] "superpegamentos"
msgstr[2] "superpegamentos"

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Description of "superglue"
msgid ""
"Cyanoacrylate, more commonly known as superglue, is a strong, quick curing "
"glue with many applications.  It was a favorite of many post-Cataclysm "
"hobbyists, but has become a sought-after trade good due to its wide "
"applications, and the fact it has become essentially impossible to "
"manufacture."
msgstr ""
"El cianoacrilato, más conocido como superpegamento, es un pegamento fuerte y "
"de secado rápido con muchas aplicaciones. Era uno de los favoritos de muchos "
"aficionados tras el Cataclismo, pero se ha convertido en un bien comercial "
"muy codiciado debido a sus amplias aplicaciones y al hecho de que su "
"fabricación se ha vuelto prácticamente imposible."

#: data/json/items/generic.json
#. ~ Item name
