msgid "A pink hairpin with cute flower textures."
msgstr "Es una horquilla rosa con flores relindas."

#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "towel"
msgid ""
"A large, fluffy towel.  It could be used to dry yourself.  Any person that "
"can travel the length and breadth of the apocalypse, rough it, slum it, "
"struggle against terrible odds, win through, and still know where their towel "
"is, is clearly a force to be reckoned with."
msgstr ""
"Una toalla grande y mullida. Podría usarse para secarse. Cualquier persona "
"que pueda viajar a lo largo y ancho del Apocalipsis, pasar apuros, vivir en "
"los barrios bajos, luchar contra terribles adversidades, salir airosa y, aun "
"así, saber dónde está su toalla, es claramente una fuerza a tener en cuenta."

#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "towel"
msgid ""
"A large, sopping wet towel.  If you wait a little bit, it should dry out.  "
"Don't panic."
msgstr ""
"Una toalla grande y empapada. Si esperas un poco, debería secarse. Que no "
"cunda el pánico."

#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "straw fedora"
msgid_plural "straw fedoras"
msgstr[0] "fedora de paja"
msgstr[1] "fedoras de paja"
msgstr[2] "fedoras de paja"

#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "straw fedora"
msgid ""
"A straw fedora hat, comfortable and stylish.  Its brim helps keep the sun out "
"of your eyes."
msgstr ""
"Un sombrero fedora de paja, cómodo y elegante. Su ala ayuda a mantener el sol "
"alejado de los ojos."

#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "thermal electric outfit"
msgid_plural "thermal electric outfits"
msgstr[0] "uniforme termoeléctrico"
msgstr[1] "trajes termoeléctricos"
msgstr[2] "trajes termoeléctricos"

#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "thermal electric outfit"
msgid ""
"A suit of thin thermal underwear that covers you from head to toe and is "
"equipped with internal battery-powered heating elements.  Use it to turn it "
"on."
msgstr ""
"Un traje de fina ropa interior térmica que te cubre de los pies a la cabeza, "
"y está equipada con resistencias térmicas internas alimentadas con baterías. "
"Usar para encender."

#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "thermal electric outfit (on)"
msgid_plural "thermal electric outfits (on)"
msgstr[0] "traje termoeléctrico (on)"
msgstr[1] "trajes termoeléctricos (on)"
msgstr[2] "trajes termoeléctricos (on)"

#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "thermal electric outfit (on)"
msgid ""
"A suit of thin thermal underwear that covers you from head to toe and is "
"equipped with internal battery-powered heating elements.  It is currently on, "
"and continually draining batteries.  Use it to turn it off."
msgstr ""
"Un traje de fina ropa interior térmica que te cubre de los pies a la cabeza, "
"y está equipado con resistencias térmicas internas alimentadas con baterías. "
"Está encendido, consumiendo gradualmente sus baterías. Usar para apagar."

