msgstr[1] "máscaras de ski (collar)"
msgstr[2] "máscaras de ski (collar)"

#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "ski mask (collar)"
msgid ""
"A warm wool mask that protects the head and face from the cold.  It is "
"wrapped around your throat, and can be adjusted to cover your mouth and more "
"of your head."
msgstr ""
"Una máscara de lana caliente que protege la cabeza y la cara del frío. Se "
"envuelve alrededor de la garganta y puede ajustarse para cubrir la boca y una "
"mayor parte de la cabeza."

#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "ski mask (collar)"
