msgstr[2] "mochilas solares (plegadas)"

#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "solar backpack (folded)"
msgid ""
"A personal portable charging system consisting of an array of solar panels "
"neatly folded into the form of a large backpack.  It can be worn like a "
"normal backpack, and has an integrated cable to plug it into a cable charger "
"system CBM."
msgstr ""
"Un sistema personal de carga portátil formado por un conjunto de paneles "
"solares perfectamente plegados en forma de gran mochila. Se puede llevar como "
"una mochila normal y tiene un cable integrado para enchufarlo a un sistema de "
"carga por cable MBC."

#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
