msgid_plural ".22 FMJ"
msgstr[0] ".22 FMJ"
msgstr[1] ".22 FMJ"
msgstr[2] ".22 FMJ"

#: data/json/items/ammo/22.json
#. ~ Description of ".22 FMJ"
msgid ""
".22 Long Rifle ammunition with a 30gr FMJ bullet.  The .22LR round is "
"extremely weak, with short range and negligible recoil.  This type is "
"marginally better at piercing through targets, but deals even less damage as "
"a result."
msgstr ""
"Munición .22 de Rifle Largo con una bala FMJ de 30gr. La munición ,22LR es "
"extremadamente débil, con corto alcance y un retroceso insignificante. Este "
"tipo de munición es ligeramente mejor a la hora de atravesar los objetivos, "
"pero causa aún menos daño."

#: data/json/items/ammo/22.json
#. ~ Description of ".22 LR"
msgid ""
".22 Long Rifle ammunition with a 40gr unjacketed bullet.  The .22LR round is "
"extremely weak, with short range and negligible recoil.  It is most useful "
"for target practice and hunting small animals."
msgstr ""
"Munición .22 de Rifle Largo con balas de 40gr sin chaqueta. La bala .22 LR es "
"extremadamente débil y tiene poca potencia de parada, corto alcance y "
"retroceso insignificante. Es más útil para entrenamiento de tiro y caza de "
"animales pequeños."

#: data/json/items/ammo/22.json
