msgid ""
"Jacketed .45 Colt ammunition with a 225gr hollow point bullet, loaded much "
"hotter than regular loads for this cartridge.  The resource scarcity of the "
"Cataclysm inspired someone to hand-reload this one with black powder, "
"bringing the round closer to its original incarnation.  It's kind of poetic, "
"when you think about it."
msgstr ""
"Munición .45 Colt con camisa y una bala de punta hueca de 225gr, con una "
"carga mucho más potente que las cargas normales para este cartucho. La "
"escasez de recursos del Cataclismo inspiró a alguien a recargarla a mano con "
"pólvora negra, acercando el proyectil a su encarnación original. Es algo "
"poético, si lo piensas."

