msgstr[2] "balas ligeras Diyua 27.3x110"

#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
#. ~ Description of "27.3x110 Diyua light slug"
msgid ""
"27.3x110 Diyua light slug loads were employed by colonists on some alternate "
"Earth to take dangerous game, and later, fend off commonwealth forces from "
"atop palisade walls."
msgstr ""
"Las balas ligeras Diyua 27,3x110 eran utilizadas por los colonos de alguna "
"Tierra alternativa para cazar animales peligrosos y, más tarde, para "
"defenderse de las fuerzas de la Commonwealth desde lo alto de las empalizadas."

#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "27.3x110 Diyua medium slug"
msgid_plural "27.3x110 Diyua medium slugs"
msgstr[0] "bala media Diyua 27.3x110"
msgstr[1] "balas medias Diyua 27.3x110"
msgstr[2] "balas medias Diyua 27.3x110"

#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
#. ~ Description of "27.3x110 Diyua medium slug"
msgid ""
"27.3x110 Diyua medium slug loads were employed by colonists on some alternate "
"Earth to take extremely dangerous game, and later, fend off commonwealth "
"forces from atop palisade walls.  Most users of the Brogyaga guns considered "
"these shells too punishing to withstand."
msgstr ""
"Las cargas de proyectil Diyua 27.3x110 mediano eran empleadas por los colonos "
"de una Tierra alternativa para cazar animales extremadamente peligrosos y, "
"más tarde, para defenderse de las fuerzas de la Commonwealth desde lo alto de "
"las empalizadas. La mayoría de los usuarios de las armas Brogyaga "
"consideraban que estos proyectiles eran demasiado molestos de soportar."

#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "27.3x110 Diyua heavy slug"
msgid_plural "27.3x110 Diyua heavy slugs"
msgstr[0] "bala pesada Diyua 27.3x110"
msgstr[1] "balas pesadas Diyua 27.3x110"
msgstr[2] "balas pesadas Diyua 27.3x110"

#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
#. ~ Description of "27.3x110 Diyua heavy slug"
msgid ""
"27.3x110 Diyua slug loads similar to these were employed by colonists on some "
"alternate Earth to take extremely dangerous game.  This heavy slug load, "
"however, was used almost entirely by recoil enthusiasts and braggarts, until "
"the Exodii came upon them."
msgstr ""
"Las balas Diyua 27.3x110, similares a éstas, eran utilizadas por los colonos "
"de alguna Tierra alternativa para cazar animales extremadamente peligrosos. "
"Sin embargo, esta pesada carga era utilizada casi exclusivamente por "
"fanáticos del retroceso y fanfarrones, hasta que los Exodii se toparon con "
"ellas."

#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "27.3x110 Diyua flockshot"
msgid_plural "27.3x110 Diyua flockshot"
msgstr[0] "bandada 27.3x110 Diyua"
msgstr[1] "bandadas 27.3x110 Diyua"
msgstr[2] "bandadas 27.3x110 Diyua"

#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
#. ~ Description of "27.3x110 Diyua flockshot"
msgid ""
"On some alien Earth, scores of flocks were decimated by loads such as this "
"27.3x110 Diyua shell, loaded with a ludicrous number of tiny pellets.  Though "
"it would still be devastating against more humanoid targets, flockshot like "
"this is more typically employed by the Exodii by the occasional hunting party."
msgstr ""
"En alguna Tierra alienígena, decenas de bandadas fueron diezmadas por "
"proyectiles como este proyectil Diyua 27.3x110, cargado con un número "
"ridículo de diminutos perdigones. Aunque seguiría siendo devastador contra "
"objetivos más humanoides, los Exodii suelen emplear este tipo de proyectiles "
"en sus partidas de caza ocasionales."

#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "27.3x110 Diyua canister"
msgid_plural "27.3x110 Diyua canisters"
msgstr[0] "bote 27.3x110 Diyua"
msgstr[1] "botes 27.3x110 Diyua"
msgstr[2] "botes 27.3x110 Diyua"

#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
#. ~ Description of "27.3x110 Diyua canister"
msgid ""
"On some alien Earth, these mini-canister loads mimicked much larger artillery "
"shot, and were employed for anti-personnel usage against advancing waves from "
"atop a palisade.  The Exodii would load these in their Brogyeki sidearms for "
"backup usage."
msgstr ""
"En algunas Tierras alienígenas, estos mini-botes imitaban proyectiles de "
"artillería mucho más grandes, y se empleaban para el uso antipersonal contra "
"oleadas que avanzaban desde lo alto de una empalizada. Los Exodii las "
"cargaban en sus armas Brogyeki como reserva."

#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "27.3x44 Diyua star"
msgid_plural "27.3x44 Diyua star"
msgstr[0] "estrella 27.3x44 Diyua"
msgstr[1] "estrellas 27.3x44 Diyua"
msgstr[2] "estrellas 27.3x44 Diyua"

#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
#. ~ Description of "27.3x44 Diyua star"
msgid ""
"These flare cartridges are for use in 27.3x44 Diyua guns, or perhaps in "
"27.3x110 Diyua guns.  They are employed by the Exodii for emergency signaling "
"when their usual communications systems are suffering interference, "
"breakdown, or are being jammed."
msgstr ""
"Estos cartuchos de bengalas son para uso en armas Diyua 27.3x44, o quizás en "
"armas Diyua 27.3x110. Los Exodii los emplean para realizar señales de "
"emergencia cuando sus sistemas de comunicación habituales sufren "
"interferencias, averías o están interferidos."

#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "27.3x44 Diyua practice"
msgid_plural "27.3x44 Diyua practice"
msgstr[0] "práctica 27.3x44 Diyua"
msgstr[1] "prácticas 27.3x44 Diyua"
msgstr[2] "prácticas 27.3x44 Diyua"

#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
#. ~ Description of "27.3x44 Diyua practice"
msgid ""
"A 27.3x44 Diyua cartridge loaded with a large hollow aluminum projectile, "
"painted blue at the tip, for practicing shooting.  If interdimensional total "
"replacement cyborgs have to practice, maybe you should too."
msgstr ""
"Un cartucho Diyua 27.3x44 cargado con un gran proyectil hueco de aluminio, "
"pintado de azul en la punta, para practicar el tiro. Si los cyborgs "
"interdimensionales totalmente reemplazables tienen que practicar, quizá tú "
"también deberías."

#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "27.3x44 Diyua thermobaric"
msgid_plural "27.3x44 Diyua thermobaric"
msgstr[0] "termobárica 27.3x44 Diyua"
msgstr[1] "termobáricas 27.3x44 Diyua"
msgstr[2] "termobáricas 27.3x44 Diyua"

#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
#. ~ Description of "27.3x44 Diyua thermobaric"
msgid ""
"A 27.3x44 Diyua cartridge with a minute amount of liquid fuel encasing a fuel "
"dispersing explosive charge, and a secondary ignition charge.  On impact the "
"fuel is dispersed, creating a fuel air mixture which is ignited a few "
"milliseconds later.  In a cartridge like 27.3x44 Diyua, the pressure wave "
"produced is rather diminutive, yet it makes the most of what little payload "
"is available."
msgstr ""
"Un cartucho Diyua 27.3x44 con una cantidad ínfima de combustible líquido que "
"contiene una carga explosiva de dispersión de combustible y una carga de "
"ignición secundaria. En un cartucho como el 27,3x44 Diyua, la onda de presión "
"producida es más bien diminuta, pero aprovecha al máximo la poca carga útil "
"disponible."

#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "27.3x44 Diyua high explosive"
msgid_plural "27.3x44 Diyua high explosive"
msgstr[0] "alto explosivo 27.3x44 Diyua"
msgstr[1] "altos explosivos 27.3x44 Diyua"
msgstr[2] "altos explosivos 27.3x44 Diyua"

#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
#. ~ Description of "27.3x44 Diyua high explosive"
msgid ""
"A 27.3x44 Diyua cartridge loaded with a high explosive charge and a "
"point-detonating fuze.  Primarily useful for assaulting soft targets, and, in "
"their universe of origin, dispersing crowds."
msgstr ""
"Un cartucho Diyua 27.3x44 cargado con una carga explosiva de gran potencia y "
"una espoleta de detonación puntual. Principalmente útil para atacar objetivos "
"blandos y, en su universo de origen, para dispersar multitudes."

#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "66/27.3x278 Diyua multipurpose"
msgid_plural "66/27.3x278 Diyua multipurpose"
msgstr[0] "multipropósito 66/27.3x278 Diyua"
msgstr[1] "multipropósitos 66/27.3x278 Diyua"
msgstr[2] "multipropósitos 66/27.3x278 Diyua"

#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
#. ~ Description of "66/27.3x278 Diyua multipurpose"
msgid ""
"A long 27.3 Diyua cartridge loaded with a propelling charge, attached to a "
"large high explosive shaped charge grenade several times larger in diameter.  "
"It was designed to be muzzle loaded into 27.3x44 Diyua guns.  Though the "
"grenade's penetration and fragmentation were ultimately deemed insufficient, "
"this was of no matter to the Exodii who saw value in the explosive potential "
"the grenade added to the Brogyeki '23."
msgstr ""
"Un cartucho largo de 27.3 Diyua cargado con una carga propulsora, unida a una "
"gran granada de carga en forma de alto explosivo varias veces mayor en "
"diámetro. Se diseñó para ser cargada por la boca del cañón en cañones Diyua "
"27.3x44. Aunque la penetración y la fragmentación de la granada se "
"consideraron finalmente insuficientes, esto no importó a los Exodii, que "
"vieron el valor del potencial explosivo que la granada añadía al Brogyeki '23."

#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
#. ~ Description of "Caotel cell"
msgid ""
"This is a small metallic cube of inscrutable construction.  A single groove "
"etched into one side of the object presumably allows it to be mounted into "
"other things, and a small red arrow has been helpfully painted besides it."
msgstr ""
"Este es un pequeño cubo metálico de construcción inescrutable. Una única "
"ranura grabada en un lado del objeto permite presumiblemente montarlo en "
"otras cosas, y junto a ella se ha pintado una pequeña flecha roja."

#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
#. ~ Description of "Khuunäöfaai firework payload"
msgid ""
"Pressurized chemical payload for the Khuunäöfaai.  Highly reactive to oxygen, "
"removing it from the tank would be a bad idea."
msgstr ""
"Carga química a presión para el Khuunäöfaai. Altamente reactivo al oxígeno, "
"sacarla del tanque sería una mala idea."

#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
#. ~ Description of "Khuunäöfaai incendiary payload"
msgid ""
"Pressurized chemical payload for the Khuunäöfaai.  Highly flammable and "
"reactive to oxygen, removing it from the tank would be a bad idea."
msgstr ""
"Carga química a presión para el Khuunäöfaai. Altamente inflamable y reactivo "
"al oxígeno, sacarla del tanque sería una mala idea."

#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
#. ~ Description of "Khuunäöfaai corrosive payload"
msgid ""
"Pressurized chemical payload for the Khuunäöfaai.  Essentially a juiced up "
"version of pirahna solution, removing it from the tank would be a bad idea."
msgstr ""
"Carga química a presión para el Khuunäöfaai. Esencialmente una versión "
"exprimida de la solución de piraña, sacarla del tanque sería una mala idea."

#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Khuunäöfaai foaming payload"
msgid_plural "Khuunäöfaai foaming payloads"
msgstr[0] "carga espumosa Khuunäöfaai"
msgstr[1] "cargas espumosas Khuunäöfaai"
msgstr[2] "cargas espumosas Khuunäöfaai"

#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
#. ~ Description of "Khuunäöfaai foaming payload"
msgid ""
"Pressurized chemical payload for the Khuunäöfaai.  An incredibly powerful "
"binding agent and sealant, removing it from the tank would be a bad idea."
msgstr ""
"Carga química a presión para el Khuunäöfaai. Un agente aglutinante y sellador "
"increíblemente potente, sacarlo del tanque sería una mala idea."

#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "3.3 naval, FMJ"
msgid_plural "3.3 naval, FMJ"
msgstr[0] "3.3 naval, FMJ"
msgstr[1] "3.3 naval, FMJ"
msgstr[2] "3.3 naval, FMJ"

#: data/json/items/ammo/exodii.json
#. ~ Description of "3.3 naval, FMJ"
msgid ""
"Initially made for marine combat, this hefty projectile is a go-to round for "
"late-stage Exodii fights."
msgstr ""
"Este potente proyectil, creado inicialmente para el combate marítimo, se "
"utiliza en los combates Exodii de última fase."

#: data/json/items/ammo/flintlock.json
#. ~ Description of "paper cartridge"
msgid ""
"A paper cartridge containing black powder and a metallic projectile.  "
"Historically used to reload muzzleloaders in a more reasonable time."
msgstr ""
"Un cartucho de papel que contiene pólvora negra y un proyectil metálico. "
"Históricamente utilizado para recargar los mosquetes en un tiempo más "
"razonable."

#: data/json/items/ammo/flintlock.json
#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/ammo/black_powder.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "paper shot cartridge"
msgid_plural "paper shot cartridges"
msgstr[0] "cartucho de papel de escopeta"
msgstr[1] "cartuchos de papel de escopeta"
msgstr[2] "cartuchos de papel de escopeta"

#: data/json/items/ammo/flintlock.json
#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/ammo/black_powder.json
#. ~ Description of "paper shot cartridge"
msgid ""
"A paper cartridge containing black powder and metallic shot.  Historically "
"used to reload muzzleloaders in a more reasonable time."
msgstr ""
"Un cartucho de papel que contiene pólvora negra y un proyectil metálico. "
"Históricamente utilizado para recargar los mosquetes en un tiempo más "
"razonable."

#: data/json/items/ammo/nail.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "flechette"
msgid_plural "flechettes"
msgstr[0] "flechette"
msgstr[1] "flechettes"
msgstr[2] "flechettes"

#: data/json/items/ammo/nail.json
#. ~ Description of "flechette"
msgid ""
"A tiny steel dart.  Can be fired from a nail gun or similar weapon, or used "
"for crafting ammunition."
msgstr ""
"Un pequeño dardo de acero. Puede dispararse con una pistola de clavos o un "
"arma similar, o utilizarse para fabricar munición."

#: data/json/items/ammo/nail.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "bronze nail"
msgid_plural "bronze nails"
msgstr[0] "clavo de bronce"
msgstr[1] "clavos de bronce"
msgstr[2] "clavos de bronce"

#: data/json/items/ammo/nail.json
#. ~ Description of "bronze nail"
msgid ""
"A pin-shaped piece of bronze.  It can be used to construct various things "
"with a hammer."
msgstr ""
"Un trozo de bronce en forma de alfiler. Puede usarse para construir varias "
"cosas con un martillo."

#: data/json/items/ammo/nail.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamer.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "nail"
msgid_plural "nails"
msgstr[0] "clavo"
msgstr[1] "clavos"
msgstr[2] "clavos"

#: data/json/items/ammo/nail.json
#. ~ Description of "nail"
msgid ""
"A pin-shaped piece of steel.  It can be used to construct various things with "
"a hammer."
msgstr ""
"Pieza de acero en forma de alfiler. Se puede utilizar para construir varias "
"cosas con un martillo."

#: data/json/items/ammo/nail.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "nut and bolt"
msgid_plural "nuts and bolts"
msgstr[0] "tuerca y tornillo"
msgstr[1] "tuercas y tornillos"
msgstr[2] "tuercas y tornillos"

#: data/json/items/ammo/nail.json
#. ~ Description of "nut and bolt"
msgid "A matching nut and bolt.  Useful for securing objects together."
msgstr "Una tuerca y un tornillo a juego. Útil para asegurar objetos juntos."

#: data/json/items/ammo/paintball.json
#. ~ Description of "paintball"
msgid ""
"A small paintball for recreational shooting.  Getting shot with one stings a "
"little, but you'd be hard-pressed to kill anything with it."
msgstr ""
"Una pequeña bola de pintura para jugar a paintball. Si te disparan con una, "
"te duele un poco, pero es difícil matar algo con ella."

#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "12 gauge birdshot, reloaded"
msgid_plural "12 gauge birdshot, reloaded"
msgstr[0] "calibre 12 con perdigones, recargado"
msgstr[1] "calibres 12 con perdigones, recargados"
msgstr[2] "calibres 12 con perdigones, recargados"

#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "12 gauge dragon's breath, reloaded"
msgid_plural "12 gauge dragon's breath, reloaded"
msgstr[0] "calibre 12 aliento de dragón, recargado"
msgstr[1] "calibres 12 aliento de dragón, recargados"
msgstr[2] "calibres 12  aliento de dragón, recargados"

#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
#. ~ Description of "12 gauge dragon's breath, reloaded"
#. ~ Description of "12 gauge dragon's breath, black powder"
msgid ""
"A shotgun shell filled with magnesium pellets or shards, used mostly as a "
"distress flare or pyrotechnics tool.  When the round is fired, "
"high-temperature sparks and flames shoot out of the barrel.  While looking "
"very impressive, they present more of a fire hazard than an effective tool "
"for lighting up hostiles.  This one was made in somebody's garage.  Are you "
"sure you want to shoot this?"
msgstr ""
"Un cartucho de escopeta relleno de perdigones o fragmentos de magnesio, "
"utilizado principalmente como bengala de socorro o herramienta pirotécnica. "
"Cuando se dispara, del cañón salen chispas y llamas a alta temperatura. "
"Aunque su aspecto es impresionante, representan más un peligro de incendio "
"que una herramienta eficaz para iluminar a los hostiles. Ésta se fabricó en "
"el garaje de alguien. ¿Seguro que quieres dispararla?"

#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
