msgstr[0] "granada casera preparada para eslinga"
msgstr[1] "granadas caseras preparadas para eslinga"
msgstr[2] "granadas caseras preparadas para eslinga"

#: data/json/items/ammo/sling-ready_grenade.json
#. ~ Description of "sling-ready homemade grenade"
msgid ""
"An improvised explosive device cobbled together from spare parts and modified "
"with a retaining fuse for use in a staff sling with a modified cradle.  To "
"throw this item without a sling, use it to snap the fuse and activate the "
"grenade.  You will then have 5 seconds before it explodes; throwing it would "
"be a good idea."
msgstr ""
"Un artefacto explosivo improvisado fabricado con piezas de repuesto, "
"modificado con una espoleta de retención para su uso en un fustíbalo con una "
"cesta modificada. Para arrojar este objeto sin honda, úsalo para hacer saltar "
"la espoleta y activar la granada. Tendrás entonces 5 segundos antes de que "
"explote; arrojarlo sería una buena idea."

#: data/json/items/ammo/sling-ready_grenade.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sling-ready military explosive small homemade grenade"
msgid_plural "sling-ready military explosive small homemade grenades"
msgstr[0] "granada casera pequeña de explosivo militar preparada para eslinga"
msgstr[1] "granadas caseras pequeñas de explosivo militar preparadas para eslinga"
msgstr[2] "granadas caseras pequeñas de explosivo militar preparadas para eslinga"

#: data/json/items/ammo/sling-ready_grenade.json
#. ~ Description of "sling-ready military explosive small homemade grenade"
msgid ""
"An improvised explosive device cobbled together from parts and modified with "
"a retaining fuse for use in a staff sling.  To throw this item without a "
"sling, use it to snap the fuse and activate the grenade.  You will then have "
"some amount of time before it explodes; throwing it would be a good idea."
msgstr ""
"Un artefacto explosivo improvisado, fabricado a partir de piezas, modificado "
"con una espoleta de retención para su uso en un fustíbalo. Para arrojar este "
"objeto sin honda, utilízalo para encajar la mecha y activar la granada. A "
"continuación, tendrás cierto tiempo antes de que explote; arrojarlo sería una "
"buena idea."

#: data/json/items/ammo/sling-ready_grenade.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sling-ready military explosive homemade grenade"
msgid_plural "sling-ready military explosive homemade grenades"
msgstr[0] "granada casera de explosivo militar preparada para eslinga"
msgstr[1] "granadas caseras de explosivo militar preparadas para eslinga"
msgstr[2] "granadas caseras de explosivo militar preparadas para eslinga"

#: data/json/items/ammo/sling-ready_grenade.json
#. ~ Description of "sling-ready military explosive homemade grenade"
msgid ""
"An improvised explosive device cobbled together from parts and modified with "
"a retaining fuse for use in a staff sling with a modified cradle.  To throw "
"this item without a sling, use it to snap the fuse and activate the grenade.  "
"You will then have some amount of time before it explodes; throwing it would "
"be a good idea."
msgstr ""
"Un artefacto explosivo improvisado fabricado a partir de piezas y modificado "
"con una espoleta de retención para su uso con un fustíbalo con cuna "
"modificada. Para lanzar este objeto sin una eslinga, úsalo para romper la "
"espoleta y activar la granada. Tendrás cierto tiempo antes de que explote; "
"lanzarla sería una buena idea."

#: data/json/items/ammo/weldgas.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "oxyacetylene"
msgid_plural "oxyacetylene"
msgstr[0] "oxiacetileno"
msgstr[1] "oxiacetileno"
msgstr[2] "oxiacetileno"

#: data/json/items/ammo/weldgas.json
#. ~ Description of "oxyacetylene"
msgid ""
"Pressurized, dangerous acetylene gas.  Can be used for welding or cutting "
"with a torch."
msgstr ""
"Gas de acetileno presurizado y peligroso. Se puede usar para soldar o cortar "
"con un soplete."

#: data/json/items/ammo/weldgas.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "welding rod"
msgid_plural "welding rods"
msgstr[0] "varilla de soldadura fuerte"
msgstr[1] "varillas de soldadura fuerte"
msgstr[2] "varillas de soldadura fuerte"

#: data/json/items/ammo/weldgas.json
#. ~ Description of "welding rod"
msgid ""
"A length of coated welding electrode - a 3 mm thick steel rod coated in a "
"special flux.  During the welding process, the hot metal of the electrode "
"fills the seam, jointing parts together while the flux protects the surface "
"of the seam from atmospheric gases and rapid cooling.  Required for arc "
"welding."
msgstr ""
"Una longitud de electrodo de soldadura revestido: una varilla de acero de 3 "
"mm de grosor recubierta de un fundente especial. Durante el proceso de "
"soldadura, el metal caliente del electrodo rellena la unión, juntando las "
"piezas, mientras que el fundente protege la superficie de la unión de los "
"gases atmosféricos y del enfriamiento rápido. Necesario para la soldadura por "
"arco."

#: data/json/items/ammo/weldgas.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "aluminum welding rod"
msgid_plural "aluminum welding rods"
msgstr[0] "barra de aluminio para soldadura"
msgstr[1] "barras de aluminio para soldadura"
msgstr[2] "barras de aluminio para soldadura"

#: data/json/items/ammo/weldgas.json
#. ~ Description of "aluminum welding rod"
msgid ""
"A length of coated welding electrode - a 3.2 mm thick aluminum rod coated in "
"a special protective flux.  Required for arc welding aluminum alloys."
msgstr ""
"Una longitud de electrodo de soldadura revestido: una varilla de aluminio de "
"3,2 mm de grosor revestida de un fundente protector especial. Necesario para "
"la soldadura por arco de aleaciones de aluminio."

#: data/json/items/ammo/weldgas.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "welding wire"
msgid_plural "welding wires"
msgstr[0] "hilo de soldadura"
msgstr[1] "hilos de soldadura"
msgstr[2] "hilos de soldadura"

#: data/json/items/ammo/weldgas.json
#. ~ Description of "welding wire"
msgid "A length of 0.8 mm steel wire for MAG welding."
msgstr "Un pedazo de alambre de acero de 0,8 mm para la soldadura MAG."

#: data/json/items/ammo/weldgas.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "aluminum welding wire"
msgid_plural "aluminum welding wires"
msgstr[0] "hilo para soldadura en aluminio"
msgstr[1] "hilos para soldadura en aluminio"
msgstr[2] "hilos para soldadura en aluminio"

#: data/json/items/ammo/weldgas.json
#. ~ Description of "aluminum welding wire"
msgid "A length of 0.9 mm aluminum wire for MIG welding."
msgstr "Un pedazo de alambre de aluminio de 0,9 mm para soldadura MIG."

#: data/json/items/ammo/weldgas.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "brazing rod"
msgid_plural "brazing rods"
msgstr[0] "varilla de soldadura blanda"
msgstr[1] "varillas de soldadura blanda"
msgstr[2] "varillas de soldadura blanda"

#: data/json/items/ammo/weldgas.json
#. ~ Description of "brazing rod"
msgid "A length of 3.2 mm flux-coated bronze rod, for brazing steel."
msgstr ""
"Varilla de bronce recubierta de fundente de 3,2 mm de longitud, para "
"soldadura blanda de acero."

#: data/json/items/ammo/weldgas.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "aluminum brazing rod"
msgid_plural "aluminum brazing rods"
msgstr[0] "varilla de soldadura blanda de aluminio"
msgstr[1] "varillas de soldadura blanda de aluminio"
msgstr[2] "varillas de soldadura blanda de aluminio"

#: data/json/items/ammo/weldgas.json
#. ~ Description of "aluminum brazing rod"
msgid ""
"A length of 3.2 mm aluminum rod, for brazing aluminum alloys.  Also suitable "
"for TIG welding."
msgstr ""
"Varilla de aluminio de 3,2 mm de longitud, para soldadura blanda de "
"aleaciones de aluminio. También apta para soldadura TIG."

#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_generators.json
#. ~ Description of "portable gasoline generator"
msgid ""
"Small, portable generator, one that people buy for a camp.  It just needs to "
"be plugged in, fueled up, and then turned on."
msgstr ""
"Pequeño generador portátil, de los que se compran para acampar. Solo hay que "
"enchufarlo, llenarlo de combustible y encenderlo."

#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_generators.json
#. ~ Description of "diesel generator"
msgid ""
"Big and powerful generator, used for street works.  It just needs to be "
"plugged in, fueled up, and then turned on.  Has little wheels to make it "
"easier to move."
msgstr ""
"Un generador grande y potente, utilizado para obras en la calle. Sólo hay que "
"enchufarlo, llenarlo de combustible y encenderlo. Tiene ruedecitas para "
"facilitar su desplazamiento."

#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_refrigeration.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "household fridge"
msgid_plural "household fridges"
msgstr[0] "nevera doméstica"
msgstr[1] "neveras domésticas"
msgstr[2] "neveras domésticas"

#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_refrigeration.json
#. ~ Description of "household fridge"
msgid ""
"A disconnected household refrigerator.  General choice to store some "
"perishables for an average family.  Activate to deploy and connect to your "
"electric grid."
msgstr ""
"Un frigorífico doméstico desconectado. Opción general para almacenar algunos "
"productos perecederos para una familia media. Activar para desplegar y "
"conectar a tu red eléctrica."

#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_refrigeration.json
#. ~ Description of "minifridge"
msgid ""
"A disconnected minifridge, similar to ones in some luxury limousines.  "
"Activate to deploy and connect to your electric grid."
msgstr ""
"Una mininevera desconectada, similar a las de algunas limusinas de lujo. "
"Activar para desplegar y conectar a tu red eléctrica."

#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_refrigeration.json
#. ~ Description of "food truck fridge"
msgid ""
"A heavy and bulky fridge with little wheels for easier transportation.  Has a "
"bunch of sections and separators, which allow it to be installed in a vehicle "
"with relative assurance that any items inside will stay put.  Activate to "
"deploy and connect to your electric grid."
msgstr ""
"Un frigorífico pesado y voluminoso con ruedecitas para facilitar su "
"transporte. Tiene un montón de secciones y separadores, que permiten "
"instalarla en un vehículo con relativa seguridad de que los objetos de su "
"interior permanecerán en su sitio. Activar para desplegar y conectar a tu red "
"eléctrica."

#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_refrigeration.json
#. ~ Description of "single glass door fridge"
msgid ""
"A disconnected commercial refrigerator with a transparent glass door, "
"designed to show off any cold drinks and similar goods in a grocery store "
"while still keeping them cool.  Activate to deploy and connect to your "
"electric grid."
msgstr ""
"Un frigorífico comercial desconectado con puerta de cristal transparente, "
"diseñado para mostrar las bebidas frías y productos similares de una tienda "
"de comestibles sin dejar de mantenerlos fríos. Activarlo para desplegar y "
"conectarlo a tu red eléctrica."

#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_refrigeration.json
#. ~ Description of "double glass door fridge"
msgid ""
"A disconnected commercial refrigerator with two transparent glass doors, "
"designed to show off any cold drinks and similar goods in a grocery store "
"while still keeping them cool.  Activate to deploy and connect to your "
"electric grid."
msgstr ""
"Un frigorífico comercial desconectado con dos puertas de cristal "
"transparente, diseñado para mostrar cualquier bebida fría y productos "
"similares en una tienda de comestibles sin dejar de mantenerlos fríos. "
"Activarlo para desplegar y conectarlo a tu red eléctrica."

#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_refrigeration.json
#. ~ Description of "heavy-duty fridge"
msgid ""
"A disconnected commercial refrigerator, used in many professional kitchens.  "
"Activate to deploy and connect to your electric grid."
msgstr ""
"Un frigorífico comercial desconectado, utilizado en muchas cocinas "
"profesionales. Activarlo para desplegar y conectarlo a tu red eléctrica."

#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_refrigeration.json
#. ~ Description of "display fridge"
msgid ""
"A big glass chamber, designed to display different food in a multiple rows, "
"while cooling it at the same time.  While you might not need to actually "
"display any of your food, it cools the food as good as any another fridge.  "
"Activate to deploy and connect to your electric grid."
msgstr ""
"Una gran cámara de cristal, diseñada para exponer diferentes alimentos en "
"varias filas, a la vez que los enfría. Aunque puede que no necesites exponer "
"ninguno de tus alimentos, enfría la comida tan bien como cualquier otra "
"nevera. Activar para desplegar y conectar a tu red eléctrica."

#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_refrigeration.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "household freezer"
msgid_plural "household freezers"
msgstr[0] "congelador doméstico"
msgstr[1] "congeladores domésticos"
msgstr[2] "congeladores domésticos"

#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_refrigeration.json
#. ~ Description of "household freezer"
msgid ""
"A disconnected household freezer.  Great choice if you need to freeze some "
"discount meat.  Activate to deploy and connect to your electric grid."
msgstr ""
"Un congelador doméstico desconectado. Una gran elección si necesitas congelar "
"carne con descuento. Activarlo para desplegar y conectarlo a tu red eléctrica."

#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_refrigeration.json
#. ~ Description of "minifreezer"
msgid ""
"A compact version of an upright freezer, designed as a mobile solution for "
"freezing food.  Activate to deploy and connect to your electric grid."
msgstr ""
"Una versión compacta de un congelador vertical, diseñada como solución móvil "
"para congelar alimentos. Activar para desplegar y conectar a tu red eléctrica."

#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_refrigeration.json
#. ~ Description of "chest minifreezer"
msgid ""
"A compact version of a chest freezer, designed as a mobile solution for "
"freezing food, but it's pretty tricky to pull anything out from the bottom.  "
"Perfect choice to put in your closet and forget for a year.  Activate to "
"deploy and connect to your electric grid."
msgstr ""
"Una versión compacta de un arcón congelador, diseñado como solución móvil "
"para congelar alimentos, pero es bastante complicado sacar algo del fondo. La "
"opción perfecta para guardarlo en el armario y olvidarlo durante un año. "
"Activar para desplegar y conectar a tu red eléctrica."

#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_refrigeration.json
#. ~ Description of "food truck freezer"
msgid ""
"A heavy and bulky freezer with little wheels for easier transportation.  Has "
"a bunch of sections and separators, which allow it to be installed in a "
"vehicle with relative assurance that any items inside will stay put.  "
"Activate to deploy and connect to your electric grid."
msgstr ""
"Un congelador pesado y voluminoso con ruedecitas para facilitar su "
"transporte. Tiene un montón de secciones y separadores, que permiten "
"instalarla en un vehículo con relativa seguridad de que los objetos de su "
"interior permanecerán en su sitio. Activar para desplegar y conectar a tu red "
"eléctrica."

#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_refrigeration.json
#. ~ Description of "chest freezer"
msgid ""
"A hefty chest freezer, designed to store plenty of perishables for a "
"minuscule amount of power.  Activate to deploy and connect to your electric "
"grid."
msgstr ""
"Un arcón congelador de gran tamaño, diseñado para almacenar gran cantidad de "
"productos perecederos por una minúscula cantidad de energía. Actívalo para "
"desplegarlo y conectarlo a tu red eléctrica."

#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_refrigeration.json
#. ~ Description of "heavy-duty freezer"
msgid ""
"A heavy-duty upright freezer.  Big as a closet, heavy as a tank, can probably "
"fit enough meat to feed a little colony for a week, but consumes power like "
"no other.  Activate to deploy and connect to your electric grid."
msgstr ""
"Congelador vertical de gran capacidad. Grande como un armario, pesado como un "
"tanque, probablemente puede caber suficiente carne para alimentar a una "
"pequeña colonia durante una semana, pero consume energía sin igual. Activar "
"para desplegar y conectar a tu red eléctrica."

#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_refrigeration.json
#. ~ Description of "glass door freezer"
msgid ""
"A disconnected commercial freezer with a glass door, used to present "
"different frozen goods.  Activate to deploy and connect to your electric grid."
msgstr ""
"Un congelador comercial desconectado con puerta de cristal, utilizado para "
"presentar diferentes productos congelados. Activar para desplegar y conectar "
"a tu red eléctrica."

#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_refrigeration.json
#. ~ Description of "display freezer"
msgid ""
"A disconnected commercial chest freezer with a glass lid.  Activate to deploy "
"and connect to your electric grid."
msgstr ""
"Un arcón congelador comercial desconectado con una tapa de cristal. Activar "
"para desplegar y conectar a tu red eléctrica."

#: data/json/items/armor/altered_object_auras.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "artifact_teleportitis_aura"
msgid "Strange Pressure"
msgstr "Presión Extraña"

#: data/json/items/armor/altered_object_auras.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Strange Pressure"
msgid "You feel a strange force pressing you inwards and inside-out"
msgstr "Sientes una fuerza extraña que te presiona hacia dentro y hacia fuera"

#: data/json/items/armor/altered_object_auras.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "artifact_slow_aura"
msgid "Temporal Distortion"
msgstr "Distorsión Temporal"

#: data/json/items/armor/altered_object_auras.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Temporal Distortion"
msgid "A slight temporal distortion appears to be centered around you"
msgstr "Una ligera distorsión temporal parece estar centrada a tu alrededor"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/bandoliers/bandolier.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "ammo pouch"
msgid_plural "ammo pouches"
msgstr[0] "bolsillo de munición"
msgstr[1] "bolsillos de munición"
msgstr[2] "bolsillos de munición"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#. ~ Description of "ammo pouch"
msgid ""
"A small pouch that can be used to store most types of small ammunition; "
"rockets, however, will not fit.  Use insert to store ammunition."
msgstr ""
"Una pequeña bolsa que puede ser usada para almacenar la mayoría de los tipos "
"de municiones pequeñas, los misiles sin embargo no caben. Use insertar para "
"almacenar la munición."

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "ammo satchel"
msgid_plural "ammo satchels"
msgstr[0] "mochila de munición"
msgstr[1] "mochilas de munición"
msgstr[2] "mochilas de munición"

#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#. ~ Description of "ammo satchel"
msgid ""
"A fabric ammo bag worn at the waist.  It is capable of holding a single large "
"magazine close at hand."
msgstr ""
"Una bolsa de tejido para munición que se pone en la cintura y te permite "
"tener un cargador a mano."

