msgid ""
"This vest covered in MOLLE webbing is designed to attach pouches, holsters "
"and other PALS compatible accessories.  Preferred by some soldiers over "
"directly attaching accessories to a ballistic vest as they can then be easily "
"separated.  This one has a single point sling wrapped around the shoulders "
"using a system to keep your weapon extra secure."
