msgstr[1] "mangas acolchadas de cuero"
msgstr[2] "mangas acolchadas de cuero"

#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "leather-padded sleeves"
msgid ""
"Armor made of combined pre-Cataclysm clothing.  Sections from leather "
"clothing are tightened and affixed to the sleeves of a thick cotton shirt, "
"excluding the joints."
msgstr ""
"Armadura hecha juntando prendas, antes del cataclismo. Las secciones de la "
"ropa de cuero se ajustan y se fijan a las mangas de una gruesa camisa de "
"algodón, excluyendo las articulaciones."

