"chin, this soft body armor was once used by news crews reporting from combat "
"zones.  It provides good protection from shrapnel, and to a lesser degree, "
"low-caliber bullets.  \"PRESS\" is emblazoned prominently on the front lapel "
"and across the back, and it features a pocket for a notebook and pen."
msgstr ""
"De un característico color azul marino y con un cuello acampanado que se "
"extiende hasta la barbilla, este chaleco blando fue utilizado en su día por "
"los equipos de noticias que informaban desde las zonas de combate. "
"Proporciona una buena protección contra la metralla y, en menor medida, "
"contra las balas de bajo calibre. En la solapa delantera y en la espalda "
"aparece la inscripción \"PRESS\", y cuenta con un Compartimento para un "
"cuaderno y un bolígrafo."

#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "FBI ballistic vest"
msgid_plural "FBI ballistic vests"
msgstr[0] "chaleco antibalas del FBI"
msgstr[1] "chalecos antibalas del FBI"
msgstr[2] "chalecos antibalas del FBI"

#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "FBI ballistic vest"
msgid ""
"A ranger green soft ballistic vest with MOLLE rigging used by federal law "
"enforcement agencies.  Soft armor plates inside the vest provide solid "
"defense against shrapnel and small-caliber rounds.  \"FBI\" is emblazoned "
"across the front and back in large, yellow lettering, and it includes a "
"pocket for storing evidence.  Use it to attach or detach pouches."
msgstr ""
"Un chaleco antibalas blando de color verde ranger con montaje MOLLE utilizado "
"por las fuerzas de seguridad federales. Las placas de blindaje blando del "
"interior del chaleco proporcionan una sólida defensa contra la metralla y los "
"proyectiles de pequeño calibre. La inscripción \"FBI\" está impresa en letras "
"amarillas grandes en la parte delantera y trasera, e incluye un bolsillo para "
"guardar pruebas. Usar para enganchar o desenganchar bolsillos."

#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "hard armor vest"
msgid_plural "hard armor vests"
msgstr[0] "chaleco de blindaje duro"
msgstr[1] "chalecos de blindaje duro"
msgstr[2] "chalecos de blindaje duro"

#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "hard armor vest"
msgid ""
"Armored panels give this vest solid defense against small caliber firearms, "
"and front and back pockets for hard armor panels give protection from higher "
"calibers."
msgstr ""
"Los paneles blindados dan a este chaleco una sólida defensa contra las armas "
"de fuego de pequeño calibre, y los compartimentos delanteros y traseros para "
"los paneles de blindaje duro dan protección contra los calibres superiores."

#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "hard armor vest"
msgid "humanitarian ballistic vest"
msgid_plural "humanitarian ballistic vests"
msgstr[0] "chaleco antibalas humanitario"
msgstr[1] "chalecos antibalas humanitarios"
msgstr[2] "chalecos antibalas humanitarios"

#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
#. ~ Description of variant "humanitarian ballistic vest" of item "hard armor
#. vest"
msgid ""
"Bright blue in color, this slim armor vest was used by volunteers and "
"officials from humanitarian groups during the first days of the Cataclysm "
"before order broke down completely.  \"FEMA\" is written on the front lapel "
"and across the back."
msgstr ""
"De color azul brillante, este chaleco blindado delgado fue utilizado por "
"voluntarios y funcionarios de grupos humanitarios durante los primeros días "
"del Cataclismo, antes de que el orden se rompiera por completo. \"FEMA\" está "
"escrito en la solapa delantera y en la espalda."

#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "hard armor vest"
msgid "police ballistic vest"
msgid_plural "police ballistic vests"
msgstr[0] "chaleco antibalas de la policía"
msgstr[1] "chalecos antibalas de la policía"
msgstr[2] "chalecos antibalas de la policía"

#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
#. ~ Description of variant "police ballistic vest" of item "hard armor vest"
msgid ""
"This charcoal-colored body armor was once a common sight on police officers, "
"and it provides adequate protection against small-caliber firearms in "
"addition to featuring pouches to hold armor inserts.  \"POLICE\" is written "
"on the front lapel and across the back."
msgstr ""
"Este chaleco antibalas color carbón era habitual en los agentes de policía, y "
"proporciona una protección adecuada contra las armas de fuego de pequeño "
"calibre, además de contar con fundas para guardar los insertos del blindaje. "
"En la solapa delantera y en la espalda está escrito \"POLICE\"."

#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "hard armor vest"
msgid "National Guard ballistic vest"
msgid_plural "National Guard ballistic vests"
msgstr[0] "chaleco antibalas de la Guardia Nacional"
msgstr[1] "chalecos antibalas de la Guardia Nacional"
msgstr[2] "chalecos antibalas de la Guardia Nacional"

#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
#. ~ Description of variant "National Guard ballistic vest" of item "hard
#. armor vest"
msgid ""
"Styled in urban camo, this ballistic vest was issued to soldiers, and as "
"things got worse, to volunteers as well.  It was designed to stand out after "
"the chaos of the riots; \"US ARMY\" is emblazoned on the front lapel next to "
"a patch of the United States flag, and \"NATIONAL GUARD\" is written across "
"the back."
msgstr ""
"Este chaleco antibalas de camuflaje urbano se entregó a los soldados y, "
"cuando las cosas empeoraron, también a los voluntarios. Fue diseñado para "
"destacar tras el caos de los disturbios; \"US ARMY\" está estampado en la "
"solapa delantera junto a un parche de la bandera de Estados Unidos, y "
"\"NATIONAL GUARD\" está escrito en la espalda."

#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "ballistic vest"
msgid_plural "ballistic vests"
msgstr[0] "chaleco antibalas"
msgstr[1] "chalecos antibalas"
msgstr[2] "chalecos antibalas"

#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "ballistic vest"
msgid ""
"An enormous handmade ballistic vest built with of lots of salvaged ballistic "
"Kevlar panels.  It's bulkier than a factory made US Army vest, but it is "
"customized for the benefit of an abnormally large mutant who couldn't wear "
"such armors otherwise.  Coated in MOLLE webbing to support modular loadouts "
"for the tacticool mutant.  It could be outfitted with steel plates for "
"further protection."
msgstr ""
"Un enorme chaleco antibalas hecho a mano con montones de paneles antibalas de "
"Kevlar recuperados. Es más voluminoso que un chaleco del Ejército de los EE. "
"UU. hecho en fábrica, pero está hecho a medida para el beneficio de un "
"mutante anormalmente grande que, de otro modo, no podría llevar este tipo de "
"armadura. Recubierto de correas MOLLE para soportar cargas modulares para el "
"mutante táctico. Podría ser equipado con placas de acero para una mayor "
"protección."

#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "ballistic vest (mild steel plates)"
msgid_plural "ballistic vests (mild steel plates)"
msgstr[0] "chaleco antibalas (placas de acero dulce)"
msgstr[1] "chalecos antibalas (placas de acero dulce)"
msgstr[2] "chalecos antibalas (placas de acero dulce)"

#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "ballistic vest (mild steel plates)"
msgid ""
"An enormous handmade ballistic vest built with lots of salvaged ballistic "
"Kevlar panels and homemade \"ballistic inserts\" made of mild steel.  The "
"thin metal isn't the most protective, but it's probably better than just "
"plain Kevlar."
msgstr ""
"Un enorme chaleco antibalas hecho a mano con muchos paneles de Kevlar "
"balístico recuperados e \"inserciones balísticas\" caseras de acero dulce. El "
"metal fino no es lo más protector, pero probablemente sea mejor que el kevlar "
"normal."

#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "ballistic vest (tempered steel plates)"
msgid_plural "ballistic vests (tempered steel plates)"
msgstr[0] "chaleco antibalas (placas de acero templado)"
msgstr[1] "chalecos antibalas (placas de acero templado)"
msgstr[2] "chalecos antibalas (placas de acero templado)"

#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "ballistic vest (tempered steel plates)"
msgid ""
"An enormous handmade ballistic vest made of lots of salvaged ballistic Kevlar "
"panels and ten NIJ IIIA plates inserted into custom-made pockets - four each "
"for your front and back and one each for your sides.  Monstrously heavy but "
"extremely protective."
msgstr ""
"Un enorme chaleco antibalas hecho a mano con montones de paneles antibalas de "
"Kevlar recuperados y diez placas NIJ IIIA insertadas en bolsillos hechos a "
"medida: cuatro para la parte delantera y otra para la trasera, y una para los "
"costados. Monstruosamente pesado, pero extremadamente protector."

#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of ballistic shoulder protectors"
msgid_plural "pairs of ballistic shoulder protectors"
msgstr[0] "protectores de hombro antibalas"
msgstr[1] "pares de protectores de hombro antibalas"
msgstr[2] "pares de protectores de hombro antibalas"

#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of ballistic shoulder protectors"
msgid ""
"Nylon armor with soft armor inserts protecting the deltoid and upper arm.  "
"Designed to be attached to heavy military body armor."
msgstr ""
"Armadura de nylon con inserciones de armadura suave que protege el deltoide y "
"la parte superior del brazo. Diseñado para ser acoplado a chalecos antibalas "
"militares pesados."

#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "ballistic groin protector"
msgid_plural "ballistic groin protectors"
msgstr[0] "protector balístico de ingle"
msgstr[1] "protectores balísticos de ingle"
msgstr[2] "protectores antibalas de ingle"

#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "ballistic groin protector"
msgid ""
"Front and back nylon armor with soft armor inserts for groin and butt "
"protection.  Designed to be attached to heavy military body armor."
msgstr ""
"Armadura de nylon delantera y trasera con inserciones de armadura suave para "
"la protección de la ingle y el trasero. Diseñado para ser acoplado a chalecos "
"antibalas militares pesados."

#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/military_armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/military_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
