msgstr[0] "tacones de aguja"
msgstr[1] "pares de tacones de aguja"
msgstr[2] "pares de tacones de aguja"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Description of variant "pair of stiletto heels" of item "pair of heels"
msgid ""
"A traditional pair of tall, high-heeled shoes with a tapered, slender heel, "
"which makes strutting fashionable, walking a challenge, and running an "
"impossibility.  These days, they'd probably be more useful to stab a zombie's "
"eyes out than as footwear."
msgstr ""
"Un par tradicional de zapatos altos, de tacón alto, con un tacón cónico y "
"delgado, que hace que pavonearse esté de moda, caminar sea un reto y correr, "
"una imposibilidad. Hoy en día, probablemente serían más útiles para sacarle "
"los ojos a un zombi que como calzado."

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "pair of heels"
msgid "pair of block heels"
msgid_plural "pairs of block heels"
msgstr[0] "par de tacones altos"
msgstr[1] "pares de tacones altos"
msgstr[2] "pares de tacones altos"

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
#. ~ Description of variant "pair of block heels" of item "pair of heels"
msgid ""
"These are a pair of chunky, broad-based shoes with a sturdy block-like heel, "
"and while they don't do you any favors in the mobility department, they're at "
"least more comfortable to trudge about in than their peers and won't likely "
"cause irreversible damage to your feet."
msgstr ""
"Son unos zapatos gruesos y anchos con un tacón robusto en forma de bloque, y "
"aunque no te hacen ningún favor en cuanto a movilidad, al menos son más "
"cómodos de llevar que los demás y no te causarán daños irreversibles en los "
"pies."

#: data/json/items/armor/boots.json
