msgstr[1] "yelmos 'grandes' de cartón"
msgstr[2] "yelmos 'grandes' de cartón"

#: data/json/items/armor/cardboard.json
#. ~ Description of "cardboard 'great' helm"
msgid ""
"A cardboard helmet shaped to look like a medieval great helm.  Very "
"unencumbering in comparison to actual helmets, with rather obvious drawbacks "
"in exchange.  The interior is lined with aluminum, apparently to 'divert the "
"zombie beta rays'.  It sure doesn't help with comfort."
msgstr ""
"Un casco de cartón con la forma de un gran yelmo medieval. Muy poco engorroso "
"en comparación con los cascos reales, con desventajas bastante obvias a "
"cambio. El interior está forrado de aluminio, aparentemente para 'desviar los "
"rayos beta de los zombis'. Seguro que no ayuda con la comodidad."

#: data/json/items/armor/cardboard.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cardboard 'plate' armor"
msgid_plural "cardboard 'plate' armors"
msgstr[0] "armadura 'placa' de cartón"
msgstr[1] "armaduras 'placa' de cartón"
msgstr[2] "armaduras 'placa' de cartón"

#: data/json/items/armor/cardboard.json
#. ~ Description of "cardboard 'plate' armor"
msgid ""
"A set of cardboard armor that's been duct taped and superglued into place, "
"with paper padding the interior in an unsuccessful attempt to increase "
"comfort.  Despite the triple-layering, tensile and shear strength diagrams, "
"and careful design considerations, there's just no way this is going to hold "
"up to a single attack."
msgstr ""
"Un conjunto de armadura de cartón que ha sido pegado con cinta adhesiva y "
"superglue en su lugar, con papel acolchado en el interior en un intento "
"fallido de aumentar la comodidad. A pesar de la triple capa, los diagramas de "
"resistencia a la tracción y al corte, y las cuidadosas consideraciones de "
"diseño, no hay forma de que esto resista un solo ataque."

#: data/json/items/armor/cardboard.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cardboard cuirass"
msgid_plural "cardboard cuirasses"
msgstr[0] "coraza de cartón"
msgstr[1] "corazas de cartón"
msgstr[2] "corazas de cartón"

#: data/json/items/armor/cardboard.json
#. ~ Description of "cardboard cuirass"
msgid ""
"While this isn't quite the 'heavy ballistic vest' the blueprints pretend it "
"is, the layering makes it almost passable as a form of extremely rudimentary "
"armor.  It's still nowhere near as good as basically any other choice, while "
"still being hard to move around in."
msgstr ""
"Aunque no es exactamente el 'chaleco antibalas pesado' que los planos "
"pretenden que es, las capas lo hacen casi aceptable como una forma de "
"armadura extremadamente rudimentaria. Aun así, no es ni de lejos tan bueno "
"como cualquier otra opción, y sigue siendo difícil moverse con ella."

