msgstr[0] "bandera del orgullo arromántico"
msgstr[1] "banderas del orgullo arromántico"
msgstr[2] "banderas del orgullo arromántico"

#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
#. ~ Description of variant "aromantic flag" of item "pride flag"
msgid ""
"A large black, gray, white and green aromantic flag.  The green and light "
"green stripes cover everyone under the aromantic spectrum, while represents "
"nonromantic forms of love and attraction, and the gray and black represent "
"all sexualities under the aromantic spectrum."
msgstr ""
"Una gran bandera aromántica negra, gris, blanca y verde. Las franjas verde y "
"verde claro cubren todas las formas de amor y atracción del espectro "
"aromático, mientras que el gris y el negro representan todas las sexualidades "
"del espectro aromático."

#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "pride flag"
msgid "transgender flag"
msgid_plural "transgender flags"
msgstr[0] "bandera del orgullo transgénero"
msgstr[1] "banderas del orgullo transgénero"
msgstr[2] "banderas del orgullo transgénero"

#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
#. ~ Description of variant "transgender flag" of item "pride flag"
msgid ""
"A large white, pink, and blue transgender flag.  The stripes at the top and "
"bottom are light blue, the traditional color for baby boys.  The stripes next "
"to them are pink, the traditional color for baby girls.  The white stripe is "
"for people that are nonbinary, feel that they don't have a gender.  The "
"pattern is such that no matter which way you fly it, it is always correct, "
"signifying finding correctness in one's life."
msgstr ""
"Una bandera del orgullo transgénero blanca, rosa y azul. Las franjas de "
"arriba y de abajo son celeste, el color tradicional para los bebés varones. "
"Las franjas al lado de esas son rosas, el color tradicional para los bebés "
"mujeres. La franja blanca es por las personas que son no binarias, quienes "
"sienten no pertenecer a los géneros preestablecidos. El diseño es tal que no "
"importa como la enarboles, siempre es correcta, encontrando lo apropiado en "
"la vida de cada uno."

#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "pride flag"
msgid "genderqueer flag"
msgid_plural "genderqueer flags"
msgstr[0] "bandera de género queer"
msgstr[1] "banderas de género queer"
msgstr[2] "banderas de género queer"

#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
#. ~ Description of variant "genderqueer flag" of item "pride flag"
msgid ""
"A large green, white, and purple genderqueer flag.  Lavender, a mixture of "
"blue and pink to represent androgynes and androgyny, white to represent "
"agender identity, and green, the inverse of lavender, to represent all those "
"who fall outside of the gender binary."
msgstr ""
"Una gran bandera genderqueer verde, blanca y púrpura. Lavanda, una mezcla de "
"azul y rosa para representar a los andróginos y la androginia, blanco para "
"representar la identidad agénero, y verde, el inverso del lavanda, para "
"representar a todos aquellos que se salen del binario de género."

#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "pride flag"
msgid "intersex flag"
msgid_plural "intersex flags"
msgstr[0] "bandera del orgullo intersexual"
msgstr[1] "banderas del orgullo intersexual"
msgstr[2] "banderas del orgullo intersexual"

#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
#. ~ Description of variant "intersex flag" of item "pride flag"
msgid ""
"A large yellow, and purple intersex flag.  It displays a purple circle on a "
"yellow field.  Yellow and purple were chosen as colors as they were viewed as "
"free from gender associations and were historically used to represent "
"intersex people.  The circle is described as \"unbroken and unornamented, "
"symbolizing wholeness and completeness, and our potentialities\"."
msgstr ""
"Una gran bandera intersexual amarilla y púrpura. Muestra un círculo púrpura "
"sobre un campo amarillo. Se eligieron los colores amarillo y púrpura porque "
"se consideraban libres de asociaciones de género y se utilizaban "
"históricamente para representar a las personas intersexuales. El círculo se "
"describe como \"ininterrumpido y sin ornamentos, símbolo de totalidad y "
"plenitud, y de nuestras potencialidades\"."

#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "pride flag"
msgid "genderfluid flag"
msgid_plural "genderfluid flags"
msgstr[0] "bandera del orgullo género fluido"
msgstr[1] "banderas del orgullo género fluido"
msgstr[2] "banderas del orgullo género fluido"

#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
#. ~ Description of variant "genderfluid flag" of item "pride flag"
msgid ""
"A large blue, black, purple, white and pink genderfluid flag.  The "
"genderfluid flag has a pink stripe for femininity, a blue stripe for "
"masculinity, a purple stripe for both masculinity and femininity, a black "
"stripe for lack of gender, and a white stripe for all genders."
msgstr ""
"Una gran bandera genderfluid azul, negra, púrpura, blanca y rosa. La bandera "
"genderfluid tiene una franja rosa para la feminidad, una franja azul para la "
"masculinidad, una franja púrpura para la masculinidad y la feminidad, una "
"franja negra para la ausencia de género y una franja blanca para todos los "
"géneros."

#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
#. ~ Description of variant "agender flag" of item "pride flag"
msgid ""
"A large green, white, gray and black agender flag.  The black and white "
"stripes represent complete absence of gender, gray represents being "
"semi-genderless, and green represents non-binary gender.  The symmetry of the "
"pattern makes it so that it's correct no matter how it flies."
msgstr ""
"Una gran bandera agénero verde, blanca, gris y negra. Las rayas blancas y "
"negras representan la ausencia total de género, el gris representa estar "
"semidesprovisto de género y el verde representa el género no binario. La "
"simetría del patrón hace que sea correcta independientemente de cómo ondee."

#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "pride flag"
msgid "non-binary flag"
msgid_plural "non-binary flags"
msgstr[0] "bandera del orgullo no binario"
msgstr[1] "banderas del orgullo no binario"
msgstr[2] "banderas del orgullo no binario"

#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
#. ~ Description of variant "non-binary flag" of item "pride flag"
msgid ""
"A large black, purple, white, and yellow non-binary flag.  Yellow for those "
"whose gender exists outside of and without reference to the binary, white for "
"those who have many or all genders, purple for those who feel their gender is "
"between or a mix of female and male, and black for those who feel they are "
"without gender."
msgstr ""
"Una bandera del orgullo no binario negra, púrpura, blanca y amarilla. El "
"amarillo por aquellos cuyo género existe por fuera o sin referencia a los "
"binarios, el blanco por aquellos que tienen varios géneros, el púrpura por "
"aquellos que sienten está entre o es una mezcla del femenino y masculino, el "
"negro por aquellos que sienten no tener género."

#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
