msgstr[2] "abrigos de piel"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of "fur coat"
msgid "A fur coat with a couple small pockets.  Extremely warm."
msgstr "Un abrigo de piel con un par de bolsillos pequeños. Extremadamente abrigado."

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "fur coat"
msgid "mink coat"
msgid_plural "mink coats"
msgstr[0] "abrigo de visón"
msgstr[1] "abrigos de visón"
msgstr[2] "abrigos de visón"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of variant "mink coat" of item "fur coat"
msgid ""
"A classic status symbol for the rich and famous, this is a heavy and "
"expensive coat made from luxuriously thick, soft, and rather short fur, with "
"a color palette consisting of rich, deep brown.  One of the most popular "
"types of fur coats produced and traded, this jacket is incredibly warm and "
"comes with two modest pockets."
msgstr ""
"Un clásico símbolo de estatus para los ricos y famosos, este es un abrigo "
"pesado y caro hecho de piel lujosamente gruesa, suave y más bien corta, con "
"una paleta de colores que consiste en un marrón rico y profundo. Uno de los "
"tipos de abrigos de piel más populares que se producen y comercializan, esta "
"chaqueta es increíblemente cálida y viene con dos modestos bolsillos."

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "fur coat"
msgid "arctic fox jacket"
msgid_plural "arctic fox jackets"
msgstr[0] "chaqueta de zorro ártico"
msgstr[1] "chaquetas de zorro ártico"
msgstr[2] "chaquetas de zorro ártico"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of variant "arctic fox jacket" of item "fur coat"
msgid ""
"Fluffy and insulating, this expensive fur coat is composed of a small "
"battalion's worth of snowy-white arctic fox pelts with silver tips.  A "
"straight section forms the back and lower sweep, while triangularly cut furs "
"are sown in an inverse pattern to form the rest of the jacket."
msgstr ""
"Esponjoso y aislante, este caro abrigo de piel está compuesto por un pequeño "
"batallón de pieles de zorro ártico blanco como la nieve con puntas plateadas. "
"Una sección recta forma la espalda y el bajo, mientras que las pieles de "
"corte triangular se siembran en un patrón inverso para formar el resto de la "
"chaqueta."

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "fur coat"
msgid "frost fox overcoat"
msgid_plural "frost fox overcoats"
msgstr[0] "abrigo de zorros árticos"
msgstr[1] "abrigos de zorros árticos"
msgstr[2] "abrigos de zorros árticos"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of variant "frost fox overcoat" of item "fur coat"
msgid ""
"A straight-cut, classically stylish jacket crafted from soft and voluminous "
"gray fox fur with a blue undercoat, this article of winter apparel comes "
"kitted out with a tall collar and two modest pockets."
msgstr ""
"Una chaqueta de corte recto y estilo clásico confeccionada en suave y "
"voluminosa piel de zorro gris con una capa interior azul, esta prenda de "
"invierno viene equipada con un cuello alto y dos modestos bolsillos."

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "fur coat"
msgid "fox fur bomber jacket"
msgid_plural "fox fur bomber jackets"
msgstr[0] "chaqueta bomber de piel de zorro"
msgstr[1] "chaquetas bomber de piel de zorro"
msgstr[2] "chaquetas bomber de piel de zorro"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of variant "fox fur bomber jacket" of item "fur coat"
msgid ""
"What was once a rugged piece of military clothing has metamorphosed into a "
"fashion icon within this slim-cut and insulated jacket, with wide, cinchable "
"sleeves and a broad collar.  Composed of sewn-together fox pelts and fastened "
"with a zipper at the front, the inside of this jacket is lined with plush, "
"reddish orange fur."
msgstr ""
"Lo que en su día fue una robusta prenda de ropa militar se ha metamorfoseado "
"en un icono de la moda dentro de esta chaqueta de corte entallado y aislante, "
"con mangas anchas y ceñibles y cuello ancho. Compuesta de pieles de zorro "
"cosidas entre sí y abrochada con una cremallera en la parte delantera, el "
"interior de esta chaqueta está forrado de felpa de color naranja rojizo."

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "fur coat"
msgid "chinchilla jacket"
msgid_plural "chinchilla jackets"
msgstr[0] "chaqueta de chinchilla"
msgstr[1] "chaquetas de chinchilla"
msgstr[2] "chaquetas de chinchilla"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of variant "chinchilla jacket" of item "fur coat"
msgid ""
"Luxuriously velvety and ridiculously extra, this warm, gray-hued coat is "
"ribbed with patterns of black and white highlights.  Composed of a small "
"army's worth of dead chinchilla pelts and naturally hypoallergenic, the world "
"might be going to hell, but at least you'll look like a celebrity while "
"enveloped within this dreamily soft, timelessly stylish coat."
msgstr ""
"Lujosamente aterciopelado y ridículamente extra, este cálido abrigo de tonos "
"grises está acanalado con patrones de reflejos blancos y negros. Compuesto "
"por un pequeño ejército de pieles de chinchilla muertas y naturalmente "
"hipoalergénico, puede que el mundo se esté yendo al infierno, pero al menos "
"tú parecerás una celebridad envuelto en este abrigo de ensueño, suave y de "
"estilo atemporal."

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "fur coat"
msgid "rabbit overcoat"
msgid_plural "rabbit overcoats"
msgstr[0] "abrigo de conejo"
msgstr[1] "abrigos de conejo"
msgstr[2] "abrigos de conejo"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of variant "rabbit overcoat" of item "fur coat"
msgid ""
"Prey and predator are brought together within this luxurious fur coat, sewn "
"from panels of velvety, snowy-white rabbit pelts and accentuated by a beige "
"layer of fox fur trimming the collar and cuffs.  With a tapered waist and two "
"side pockets, the jacket is both comfortable to wear and stylish."
msgstr ""
"Presa y depredador se unen en este lujoso abrigo de piel, cosido a partir de "
"paneles de aterciopelada piel de conejo blanca como la nieve y acentuado por "
"una capa beige de piel de zorro que adorna el cuello y los puños. Con cintura "
"ceñida y dos bolsillos laterales, la chaqueta es cómoda y elegante a la vez."

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "fur coat"
msgid "beaver skin bomber jacket"
msgid_plural "beaver skin bomber jackets"
msgstr[0] "chaqueta bomber de piel de castor"
msgstr[1] "chaquetas bomber de piel de castor"
msgstr[2] "chaquetas bomber de piel de castor"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of variant "beaver skin bomber jacket" of item "fur coat"
msgid ""
"The skins of what used to be several beavers have taken to the skies within "
"the composition of this sleek-fitting flight jacket, or, rather, they would "
"if the coat were in any way designed to be a practical piece of kit.  With a "
"soft spread of brown fur lining the inside of this wide-necked overcoat and "
"its exterior finished in a bold, glossy black color, it's safe to say that "
"this garment belongs more within a ski chalet than the cockpit of a fighter "
"craft."
msgstr ""
"Las pieles de lo que solían ser varios castores han surcado los cielos en la "
"composición de esta elegante chaqueta de vuelo, o, más bien, lo harían si el "
"abrigo estuviera diseñado de algún modo para ser una prenda práctica. Con una "
"suave capa de piel marrón forrando el interior de este abrigo de cuello ancho "
"y su exterior acabado en un audaz y brillante color negro, es seguro decir "
"que esta prenda pertenece más a un chalet de esquí que a la cabina de un caza."

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "fur coat"
msgid "albino mink coat"
msgid_plural "albino mink coats"
msgstr[0] "abrigo de visón albino"
msgstr[1] "abrigos de visón albino"
msgstr[2] "abrigos de visón albino"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of variant "albino mink coat" of item "fur coat"
msgid ""
"Even more prized than regular mink jackets, this coat is exclusively composed "
"of plush white fur with no markings or color in its undercoat.  Extremely "
"warm and equipped with dual pockets, this expensive fashion statement would "
"certainly turn some heads if anyone left alive could still care about "
"aesthetics."
msgstr ""
"Aún más preciado que las chaquetas de visón normales, este abrigo está "
"compuesto exclusivamente de felpa de piel blanca sin marcas ni color en su "
"capa interna. Extremadamente cálido y equipado con dos bolsillos, esta "
"costosa prenda de moda no dejaría indiferente a nadie que aún pudiera "
"preocuparse por la estética."

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "fur coat"
msgid "lynx coat"
msgid_plural "lynx coats"
msgstr[0] "abrigo de lince"
msgstr[1] "abrigos de lince"
msgstr[2] "abrigos de lince"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of variant "lynx coat" of item "fur coat"
msgid ""
"Possessing bell-bottom sleeves, a tapered waist, and a snowy-white fox fur "
"trim around the collar, hem, and cuffs, this pure white fur coat dappled with "
"striking spots would make any self-respecting aristocrat's heart swell in "
"admiration.  Sown from sections of long and silky abdominal lynx fur and "
"featuring two side pockets, the coat is extremely warm, elegant, and, thanks "
"to the Cataclysm, completely free."
msgstr ""
"Con mangas acampanadas, cintura ceñida y un ribete de piel de zorro blanca "
"como la nieve alrededor del cuello, el dobladillo y los puños, este abrigo de "
"piel de color blanco puro salpicado de llamativas manchas haría que el "
"corazón de cualquier aristócrata que se precie se hinchara de admiración. "
"Cosido a partir de secciones de larga y sedosa piel de lince abdominal y con "
"dos bolsillos laterales, el abrigo es extremadamente cálido, elegante y, "
"gracias al Cataclismo, completamente gratuito."

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "fur coat"
msgid "sable coat"
msgid_plural "sable coats"
msgstr[0] "abrigo de marta"
msgstr[1] "abrigos de marta"
msgstr[2] "abrigos de marta"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of variant "sable coat" of item "fur coat"
msgid ""
"The favorite coat of old European royalty, this extravagant jacket of Russian "
"sable is composed of stitched panels of cinnamon brown fur with a pale yellow "
"undercoat and silver tips.  Possessing a tall collar and flaring hips that "
"just might require you to walk sideways through narrower door frames, the "
"coat is impractical, swelteringly warm, and incredibly stylish."
msgstr ""
"El abrigo favorito de la antigua realeza europea, esta extravagante chaqueta "
"de marta rusa se compone de paneles cosidos de piel marrón canela con un "
"subpelo amarillo pálido y puntas plateadas. Con un cuello alto y caderas "
"acampanadas que obligan a caminar de lado por los marcos de las puertas más "
"estrechas, el abrigo es poco práctico, sofocantemente cálido e increíblemente "
"elegante."

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "fur coat"
msgid "coyote jacket"
msgid_plural "coyote jackets"
msgstr[0] "chaqueta de coyote"
msgstr[1] "chaquetas de coyote"
msgstr[2] "chaquetas de coyote"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of variant "coyote jacket" of item "fur coat"
msgid ""
"Before the Cataclysm, this fur coat would have likely been termed \"ruggedly "
"handsome,\" a nice way of saying that, while it's not as nice or as luxurious "
"as other fur garments, its price was the same.  Regardless, the jacket's "
"cinnamon brown fur and rust-red undercoat give it a pleasing aesthetic, while "
"its long hairs are also both dense and durable."
msgstr ""
"Antes del Cataclismo, este abrigo de piel probablemente habría sido "
"calificado de “'robustamente apuesto”', una bonita forma de decir que, aunque "
"no es tan bonito ni tan lujoso como otras prendas de piel, su precio era el "
"mismo. En cualquier caso, el pelaje marrón canela y el subpelo rojo óxido de "
"la chaqueta le confieren una estética agradable, mientras que sus largos "
"pelos son densos y duraderos."

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "fur coat"
msgid "tiger-skin overcoat"
msgid_plural "tiger-skin overcoats"
msgstr[0] "abrigo de piel de tigre"
msgstr[1] "abrigos de piel de tigre"
msgstr[2] "abrigos de piel de tigre"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of variant "tiger-skin overcoat" of item "fur coat"
msgid ""
"This is a vintage tiger skin jacket smelling distinctly of mothballs, "
"possessing an alternating blend of orange, white, and black striations "
"ribbing its shaggy exterior, broadly flaring hips, and an interior lining of "
"velvety chinchilla fur.  Illegal, before the Cataclysm, to either produce or "
"sell, this coat is almost certainly one of the last of its kind and would "
"make for a killer fashion statement, if you don't mind wearing the skin of a "
"murdered, endangered animal, that is."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una chaqueta vintage de piel de tigre que huele claramente a "
"naftalina, con una mezcla alternada de rayas naranjas, blancas y negras en su "
"peludo exterior, caderas ampliamente acampanadas y un forro interior de "
"aterciopelada piel de chinchilla. Antes del Cataclismo era ilegal producir o "
"vender este abrigo, por lo que es casi seguro que sea uno de los últimos de "
"su especie, y sería una declaración de moda de muerte, si no te importa "
"llevar la piel de un animal asesinado y en peligro de extinción."

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "fur coat"
msgid "side pocket."
msgstr "bolsillo lateral."

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "faux fur coat"
msgid_plural "faux fur coats"
msgstr[0] "abrigo de piel sintética"
msgstr[1] "abrigos de piel sintética"
msgstr[2] "abrigos de piel sintética"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of "faux fur coat"
msgid ""
"A garishly-colored faux fur coat with a couple small pockets.  Although not "
"as warm as natural fur, it gives you some of that unique flair."
msgstr ""
"Un abrigo de piel sintética de color chillón con un par de pequeños "
"compartimentos. Aunque no es tan cálida como la piel natural, le da un toque "
"único."

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "lab coat"
msgid_plural "lab coats"
msgstr[0] "bata de laboratorio"
msgstr[1] "batas de laboratorio"
msgstr[2] "batas de laboratorio"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of "lab coat"
msgid ""
"A long white coat with several large pockets.  Comes with a very nice pocket "
"protector."
msgstr ""
"Una bata larga y blanca con varios bolsillos grandes. Viene con un agradable "
"protector para los bolsillos."

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "rain coat"
msgid_plural "rain coats"
msgstr[0] "impermeable"
msgstr[1] "impermeables"
msgstr[2] "impermeables"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of "rain coat"
msgid ""
"A vinyl coat with a hood and two very large pockets, meant to provide "
"protection from rain."
msgstr ""
"Un abrigo de vinilo con capucha y dos bolsillos muy grandes, destinado a "
"proteger de la lluvia."

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "gutskin parka"
msgid_plural "gutskin parkas"
msgstr[0] "anorak de piel intestinal"
msgstr[1] "anoraks de piel intestinal"
msgstr[2] "anoraks de piel intestinal"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of "gutskin parka"
msgid ""
"An intricately sewn coat of treated and split intestines, prized for its "
"light weight and waterproof qualities among the indigenous peoples of the "
"arctic."
msgstr ""
"Un abrigo intrincadamente cosido a partir de tripas tratadas y troceadas, "
"apreciado por su peso ligero y sus cualidades impermeables entre los pueblos "
"indígenas del ártico."

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "winter coat"
msgid_plural "winter coats"
msgstr[0] "abrigo de invierno"
msgstr[1] "abrigos de invierno"
msgstr[2] "abrigos de invierno"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of "winter coat"
msgid "A padded coat with deep pockets and a hood.  Very warm."
msgstr "Un abrigo acolchado con capucha y bolsillos grandes. Muy abrigado."

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "duster"
msgid_plural "dusters"
msgstr[0] "guardapolvos"
msgstr[1] "guardapolvos"
msgstr[2] "guardapolvos"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of "duster"
msgid "A rugged full-length duster coat.  Has many pockets for storage."
msgstr "Un abrigo robusto y largo, con muchos bolsillos."

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "fur duster"
msgid_plural "fur dusters"
msgstr[0] "guardapolvos de piel"
msgstr[1] "guardapolvos de piel"
msgstr[2] "guardapolvos de piel"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of "fur duster"
msgid "A thick fur full-length duster.  Has many pockets for storage."
msgstr "Un abrigo robusto y largo de piel, con muchos bolsillos."

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "faux fur duster"
msgid_plural "faux fur dusters"
msgstr[0] "guardapolvos de piel sintética"
msgstr[1] "guardapolvos de piel sintética"
msgstr[2] "guardapolvos de piel sintética"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of "faux fur duster"
msgid ""
"A thick faux fur duster, falling below your knees.  Has many pockets for "
"storing things."
msgstr ""
"Es una gabardina gruesa de piel sintética, que te llega hasta las rodillas. "
"Tiene muchos bolsillos."

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "leather duster"
msgid_plural "leather dusters"
msgstr[0] "guardapolvos de cuero"
msgstr[1] "guardapolvos de cuero"
msgstr[2] "guardapolvos de cuero"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of "leather duster"
msgid "A thick leather full-length duster.  Has many pockets for storage."
msgstr "Un abrigo robusto de cuero resistente, con muchos bolsillos."

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "greatcoat"
msgid_plural "greatcoats"
msgstr[0] "gabán"
msgstr[1] "gabanes"
msgstr[2] "gabanes"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of "greatcoat"
msgid "A heavy, full-length wool coat.  Cumbersome, but warm and with deep pockets."
msgstr ""
"Un abrigo pesado de lana de cuerpo entero. Incómodo pero abrigado y con "
"bolsillos grandes."

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "hakama"
msgid_plural "hakama"
msgstr[0] "hakama"
msgstr[1] "hakamas"
msgstr[2] "hakamas"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of "hakama"
msgid "Plain black hakama for use in kendo and other martial arts."
msgstr "Un hakama negro que se utiliza en el kendo y en otras artes marciales."

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of "hakama"
msgid "A flowing, pleated garment which can be worn over a kimono."
msgstr "Una prenda fluida y con pliegues que se puede llevar sobre un kimono."

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "bathrobe"
msgid_plural "bathrobes"
msgstr[0] "albornoz"
msgstr[1] "albornoces"
msgstr[2] "albornoces"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of "bathrobe"
msgid ""
"An outer garment of absorbent, towel-like material traditionally worn to "
"cover one's nakedness to and from the bath.  It makes you wish you had "
"running water to bathe with."
msgstr ""
"Una prenda exterior de material absorbente, similar a una toalla, que se usa "
"tradicionalmente para cubrir la desnudez hacia y desde el baño. Te hace "
"desear tener agua corriente para bañarte."

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "army jacket"
msgid_plural "army jackets"
msgstr[0] "chaqueta del ejército"
msgstr[1] "chaquetas del ejército"
msgstr[2] "chaquetas del ejército"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of "army jacket"
msgid ""
"A vintage article of military surplus with an adjustable waist drawstring, or "
"at least a civilian reproduction of one — it's resplendent with a cotton "
"liner, an integral hood tucked away in a zip-up pouch in the collar, and "
"epaulettes upon the shoulders."
msgstr ""
"Un artículo vintage de excedentes militares con un cordón ajustable en la "
"cintura, o al menos una reproducción civil de uno, resplandeciente con un "
"forro de algodón, una capucha integral escondida en una bolsa con cremallera "
"en el cuello y charreteras en los hombros."

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "army jacket"
msgid "woodland-camo combat jacket"
msgid_plural "woodland-camo combat jackets"
msgstr[0] "chaqueta de combate de camuflaje de bosque"
msgstr[1] "chaquetas de combate de camuflaje de bosque"
msgstr[2] "chaquetas de combate de camuflaje de bosque"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of variant "woodland-camo combat jacket" of item "army
#. jacket"
msgid ""
"Tried and true, the US military's antiquated 4-tone woodland camouflage "
"pattern covers this particular jacket: large, high-contrast patches of green, "
"black, brown, and sand hues, all rather faded from years and ware."
msgstr ""
"El anticuado patrón de camuflaje de bosque de 4 tonos del ejército "
"estadounidense cubre esta chaqueta en particular: grandes parches de alto "
"contraste de tonos verdes, negros, marrones y arena, todos bastante "
"descoloridos por los años y el uso."

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "army jacket"
msgid "desert-camo combat jacket"
msgid_plural "desert-camo combat jackets"
msgstr[0] "chaqueta de combate de camuflaje desértico"
msgstr[1] "chaquetas de combate de camuflaje desértico"
msgstr[2] "chaquetas de combate de camuflaje desértico"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of variant "desert-camo combat jacket" of item "army jacket"
msgid ""
"This jacket's brass zipper runs from collar to hem, a river of metallic brown "
"knitting together the coat's arid-hued lapels, printed with a 3-tone mix of "
"pale green, dark brown, and beige.  Looking at it, you wonder how many "
"zombies are wandering about the gulf right now."
msgstr ""
"La cremallera de latón de esta chaqueta va desde el cuello hasta el "
"dobladillo, un río de marrón metálico que teje las solapas de tonos áridos "
"del abrigo, estampado con una mezcla de tres tonos de verde pálido, marrón "
"oscuro y beige. Mirándolo, te preguntas cuántos zombis deambulan por el golfo "
"en estos momentos."

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "army jacket"
msgid "olive-drab combat jacket"
msgid_plural "olive-drab combat jackets"
msgstr[0] "chaqueta de combate de color gris oliva"
msgstr[1] "chaquetas de combate de color gris oliva"
msgstr[2] "chaquetas de combate de color gris oliva"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of variant "olive-drab combat jacket" of item "army jacket"
msgid ""
"Lacking much frills and fanfare, this simple, traditional jacket is dyed a "
"solid shade of olive green with a brass zipper and buttons."
msgstr ""
"Sin muchos adornos ni fanfarrias, esta chaqueta sencilla y tradicional está "
"teñida de un sólido tono verde oliva con cremallera y botones de latón."

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "army jacket"
msgid "mottled-camo combat jacket"
msgid_plural "mottled-camo combat jackets"
msgstr[0] "chaqueta de combate de camuflaje moteado"
msgstr[1] "chaquetas de combate de camuflaje moteado"
msgstr[2] "chaquetas de combate de camuflaje moteado"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of variant "mottled-camo combat jacket" of item "army jacket"
msgid ""
"This particular garment has a base hue of dark tan, coated by myriad spots, "
"blobs, and splotches of green, reddish brown, black, and grayish green to "
"form a mottled, disruptive camouflage pattern."
msgstr ""
"Esta prenda en concreto tiene una tonalidad base tostada oscura, recubierta "
"por una miríada de puntos, manchas y salpicaduras de verde, marrón rojizo, "
"negro y verde grisáceo para formar un patrón de camuflaje moteado y "
"perturbador."

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "army jacket"
msgid "ocean-camouflage combat jacket"
msgid_plural "ocean-camouflage combat jackets"
msgstr[0] "chaqueta de combate de camuflaje oceánico"
msgstr[1] "chaquetas de combate de camuflaje oceánico"
msgstr[2] "chaquetas de combate de camuflaje oceánico"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of variant "ocean-camouflage combat jacket" of item "army
#. jacket"
msgid ""
"This jacket's exterior shell is dyed a mix of blue and gray hues, with extra "
"patches and disruptive striations, flipping between black and dark gray, "
"covering the garment from collar to hem.  Chrome buttons, zips, and other "
"fixtures glint from their home upon the coat."
msgstr ""
"El exterior de esta chaqueta está teñido de una mezcla de tonos azules y "
"grises, con parches adicionales y estrías disruptivas, que alternan entre el "
"negro y el gris oscuro, cubriendo la prenda desde el cuello hasta el "
"dobladillo. Los botones cromados, las cremalleras y otros elementos brillan "
"en el abrigo."

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "army jacket"
msgid "digital-camo combat jacket"
msgid_plural "digital-camo combat jackets"
msgstr[0] "chaqueta de combate de camuflaje digital"
msgstr[1] "chaquetas de combate de camuflaje digital"
msgstr[2] "chaquetas de combate de camuflaje digital"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of variant "digital-camo combat jacket" of item "army jacket"
msgid ""
"The fabric of this particular jacket is coated in the pixelized camouflage "
"pattern of the United States Army's former combat uniform, combining a "
"sand-brown base with disruptive patterns of urban gray and sage green, as "
"well as plastic zips and buttons."
msgstr ""
"El tejido de esta chaqueta en particular está recubierto con el patrón de "
"camuflaje pixelado del antiguo uniforme de combate del Ejército de los "
"Estados Unidos, combinando una base marrón arena con patrones disruptivos de "
"gris urbano y verde salvia, así como cremalleras y botones de plástico."

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "army jacket"
msgid "urban black combat jacket"
msgid_plural "urban black combat jackets"
msgstr[0] "chaqueta urbana de combate negra"
msgstr[1] "chaquetas urbanas de combate negras"
msgstr[2] "chaquetas urbanas de combate negras"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of variant "urban black combat jacket" of item "army jacket"
msgid ""
"Fitted with a brass main zip and corresponding buttons, this entire jacket "
"forgoes frivolities and is, instead, dyed a solid shade of midnight black."
msgstr ""
"Equipada con una cremallera principal de latón y los botones "
"correspondientes, toda esta chaqueta renuncia a frivolidades y, en su lugar, "
"se tiñe de un sólido tono negro medianoche."

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "army jacket"
msgid "splinter-camo combat jacket"
msgid_plural "splinter-camo combat jackets"
msgstr[0] "chaqueta de combate de camuflaje de polígono"
msgstr[1] "chaquetas de combate de camuflaje de polígonos"
msgstr[2] "chaquetas de combate de camuflaje de polígonos"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of variant "splinter-camo combat jacket" of item "army
#. jacket"
msgid ""
"This particular jacket is sown from fabric dyed a base color of stoney gray "
"with notes of brown, sprinkled through with large, splinter-like geometric "
"shapes of green, gray, and hues of deep naval blue."
msgstr ""
"Esta chaqueta en concreto está hecha con un tejido teñido de un color base "
"gris pétreo con notas de marrón, salpicado de grandes formas geométricas en "
"forma de astillas de color verde, gris y tonos de azul marino intenso."

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "army jacket"
msgid "coyote combat jacket"
msgid_plural "coyote combat jackets"
msgstr[0] "chaqueta de combate de coyote"
msgstr[1] "chaquetas de combate de coyote"
msgstr[2] "chaquetas de combate de coyote"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of variant "coyote combat jacket" of item "army jacket"
msgid ""
"Dyed in a solid shade of rugged, earthen brown with a brass main zip and "
"press-studs, this is a relatively handsome coat, so far as reproduction "
"military equipment goes.  Obviously, the would-be soldier, prepper, and "
"general wearer would most appreciate its utility in going undercover among "
"the insurgent coyote population."
msgstr ""
"Teñido en un sólido tono marrón tierra con cremallera principal de latón y "
"botones a presión, se trata de un abrigo relativamente bonito, en lo que a "
"reproducción de equipo militar se refiere. Obviamente, el aspirante a "
"soldado, preparador y usuario en general apreciaría más su utilidad para ir "
"de incógnito entre la población de coyotes insurgentes."

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of variant "woodland-camo combat jacket" of item "army
#. jacket"
msgid ""
"Dyed in a 4-tone blend of worn green, black, sand, and brown hues, this "
"particular overcoat had been your own issued service jacket when you'd still "
"been in the forces, with your name stitched upon the right lapel and insignia "
"pinned to the appropriate shoulder board."
msgstr ""
"Teñido en una mezcla de cuatro tonos de verde desgastado, negro, arena y "
"marrón, este abrigo en particular había sido su propia chaqueta de servicio "
"cuando aún estaba en las fuerzas, con su nombre cosido en la solapa derecha y "
"la insignia prendida en la hombrera correspondiente."

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "army jacket"
msgid "Button-fastened hip pocket."
msgstr "Bolsillo con botón en la cadera."

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "army jacket"
msgid "Button-fastened chest pocket."
msgstr "Bolsillo con botón en el pecho."

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/cyberpunk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/cyberpunk.json
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "army jacket"
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "tactical jacket"
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "synleather jacket"
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "diode bomber"
