#. ~ Description of "tuxedo"
msgid "A full-body tuxedo.  Makes the apocalypse feel a little more classy."
msgstr ""
"Un esmoquin de cuerpo entero. Hace que el apocalipsis tenga un poco más de "
"clase."

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "waistcoat"
msgid_plural "waistcoats"
msgstr[0] "chaleco"
msgstr[1] "chalecos"
msgstr[2] "chalecos"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of "waistcoat"
msgid ""
"An elegant waistcoat.  Ideal for those occasions when wearing only a shirt "
"would be too casual and a suit would be overdoing it."
msgstr ""
"Un chaleco elegante. Ideal para aquellas ocasiones en las que llevar solo una "
"camisa sería demasiado informal y un traje sería exagerado."

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "army winter jacket"
msgid_plural "army winter jackets"
msgstr[0] "chaqueta militar de invierno"
msgstr[1] "chaquetas militares de invierno"
msgstr[2] "chaquetas militares de invierno"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of "army winter jacket"
msgid ""
"A hooded jacket with lots of pockets, thickly padded for warmth.  Favored by "
"the military."
msgstr ""
"Una chaqueta con capucha y muchos bolsillos, densamente acolchada para dar "
"abrigo. Muy utilizada por los militares."

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "steampunk trenchcoat"
msgid_plural "steampunk trenchcoats"
msgstr[0] "gabardina steampunk"
msgstr[1] "gabardinas steampunk"
msgstr[2] "gabardinas steampunk"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of "steampunk trenchcoat"
msgid ""
"A thick black leather steampunk themed trenchcoat.  Unlike a regular "
"trenchcoat, this one has no pockets."
msgstr ""
"Una gabardina de cuero negro grueso de temática steampunk. A diferencia de "
"una gabardina normal, esta no tiene bolsillos."

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "plague robe"
msgid_plural "plague robes"
msgstr[0] "túnica de la plaga"
msgstr[1] "túnicas de la plaga"
msgstr[2] "túnicas de la plaga"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of "plague robe"
msgid "A dark robbed cassock worn by plague doctors."
msgstr "Una sotana oscura robada que llevan los médicos de la peste."

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "nun habit"
msgid_plural "nun habits"
msgstr[0] "hábito de monja"
msgstr[1] "hábitos de monja"
msgstr[2] "hábitos de monja"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of "nun habit"
msgid "A dark piece of clerical clothing.  Typically worn by Christian nuns."
msgstr "Una prenda oscura de ropa clerical. La suelen llevar las monjas cristianas."

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "tactical jacket"
msgid_plural "tactical jackets"
msgstr[0] "chaqueta táctica"
msgstr[1] "chaquetas tácticas"
msgstr[2] "chaquetas tácticas"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of "tactical jacket"
msgid ""
"A hefty camouflage jacket rattling with a spade of zippers, press-studs, and "
"attachment points, featuring a high mandarin collar, Velcro cuffs, plates for "
"ID tags, and enough pockets to make your internal Militiaman weep for joy."
msgstr ""
"Una fornida chaqueta de camuflaje llena de cremalleras, botones automáticos y "
"puntos de fijación, con cuello alto tipo mandarina, puños de velcro, placas "
"para etiquetas de identificación y suficientes bolsillos para que tu "
"miliciano interior llore de alegría."

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "tactical jacket"
msgid "forest-camo tactical jacket"
msgid_plural "forest-camo tactical jackets"
msgstr[0] "chaqueta táctica camuflaje bosque"
msgstr[1] "chaquetas tácticas camuflaje bosque"
msgstr[2] "chaquetas tácticas camuflaje bosque"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of variant "forest-camo tactical jacket" of item "tactical
#. jacket"
msgid ""
"Paying homage to the field-proven camouflage pattern of old US military "
"uniforms, this huntsman's jacket is printed with a green, brown, and black "
"woodland camouflage pattern."
msgstr ""
"Rindiendo homenaje al patrón de camuflaje probado en el campo de los antiguos "
"uniformes militares estadounidenses, esta chaqueta de cazador está estampada "
"con un patrón de camuflaje de bosque verde, marrón y negro."

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "tactical jacket"
msgid "jungle-camo tactical jacket"
msgid_plural "jungle-camo tactical jackets"
msgstr[0] "chaqueta táctica camuflaje jungla"
msgstr[1] "chaquetas tácticas camuflaje jungla"
msgstr[2] "chaquetas tácticas camuflaje jungla"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of variant "jungle-camo tactical jacket" of item "tactical
#. jacket"
msgid ""
"Bright and dark green shades meet within the patterning of this tactical "
"jacket, embellished by tones of earthen brown and other natural hues.  The "
"trees of the Amazon will speak your native tongue as you stalk around, waging "
"guerrilla warfare against the undead, with this jacket on.  It's just a shame "
"that the rainforest is quite a walk away."
msgstr ""
"Tonos verdes brillantes y oscuros se unen en el estampado de esta chaqueta "
"táctica, adornada con tonos de marrón tierra y otros matices naturales. Los "
"árboles del Amazonas hablarán tu lengua materna mientras te paseas, librando "
"una guerra de guerrillas contra los muertos vivientes, con esta chaqueta "
"puesta. Lástima que la selva esté bastante lejos."

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "tactical jacket"
msgid "savanna tactical jacket"
msgid_plural "savanna tactical jackets"
msgstr[0] "chaqueta táctica sabana"
msgstr[1] "chaquetas tácticas sabana"
msgstr[2] "chaquetas tácticas sabana"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of variant "savanna tactical jacket" of item "tactical
#. jacket"
msgid ""
"This adventurous-looking jacket would be at home on a safari to the Horn of "
"Africa, dyed, as it is, in light greens, browns, and beige tones.  Then "
"again, you suppose that every day's a safari now.  You're just not sure who's "
"meant to be the hunter: you or the dead."
msgstr ""
"Esta chaqueta de aspecto aventurero estaría como en casa en un safari por el "
"Cuerno de África, teñida, como está, en tonos verdes claros, marrones y "
"beige. Por otra parte, supones que ahora todos los días son un safari. No "
"estás seguro de quién está destinado a ser el cazador: tú o los muertos."

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "tactical jacket"
msgid "marshland-camo tactical jacket"
msgid_plural "marshland-camo tactical jackets"
msgstr[0] "chaqueta táctica camuflaje-pantano"
msgstr[1] "chaquetas tácticas camuflaje-pantano"
msgstr[2] "chaquetas tácticas camuflaje-pantano"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of variant "marshland-camo tactical jacket" of item "tactical
#. jacket"
msgid ""
"A staple companion of gamesmen whose trade lies within the watery recesses of "
"wetlands, this water-resistant jacket is festooned with profile-disrupting "
"lines and patterns printed in tan, gray, green, and black hues."
msgstr ""
"Esta chaqueta resistente al agua, compañera indispensable de los jugadores "
"que se dedican a las profundidades de los humedales, está adornada con líneas "
"y dibujos que alteran el perfil, impresos en tonos tostados, grises, verdes y "
"negros."

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "tactical jacket"
msgid "arid tactical jacket"
msgid_plural "arid tactical jackets"
msgstr[0] "chaqueta táctica de desierto"
msgstr[1] "chaquetas tácticas de desierto"
msgstr[2] "chaquetas tácticas de desierto"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of variant "arid tactical jacket" of item "tactical jacket"
msgid ""
"If you were traipsing off to the Sonoran desert, this pocket-laden jacket, "
"with its sand-tan hues, streaks of beige and black, and ventilated interior, "
"would have been your friend.  Now, all it is, is a reminder of a part of the "
"world that may as well be the crust of Mars, for how remote and unreachable "
"it is."
msgstr ""
"Si hubieras viajado al desierto de Sonora, esta chaqueta de bolsillo, con sus "
"tonos tostados, sus vetas beige y negras y su interior ventilado, habría sido "
"tu amiga. Ahora, todo lo que es, es un recordatorio de una parte del mundo "
"que bien podría ser la corteza de Marte, por lo remota e inalcanzable que es."

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "tactical jacket"
msgid "alpine-camo tactical jacket"
msgid_plural "alpine-camo tactical jackets"
msgstr[0] "chaqueta táctica camuflaje alpino"
msgstr[1] "chaquetas tácticas camuflaje alpino"
msgstr[2] "chaquetas tácticas camuflaje alpino"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of variant "alpine-camo tactical jacket" of item "tactical
#. jacket"
msgid ""
"A comfortable overcoat for the summer-time mountaineer, hiker, or alpine "
"hunter, this predominantly gray jacket is coated in jagged lines and "
"geometric shapes of brown and white dye."
msgstr ""
"Un cómodo abrigo para el montañero, el excursionista o el cazador alpino de "
"verano, esta chaqueta predominantemente gris está recubierta de líneas "
"irregulares y formas geométricas de tinte marrón y blanco."

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "tactical jacket"
msgid "urban-camo tactical jacket"
msgid_plural "urban-camo tactical jackets"
msgstr[0] "chaqueta táctica camuflaje urbano"
msgstr[1] "chaquetas tácticas camuflaje urbano"
msgstr[2] "chaquetas tácticas camuflaje urbano"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of variant "urban-camo tactical jacket" of item "tactical
#. jacket"
msgid ""
"This particular pattern of jacket proved a relatively common sight among "
"preppers during the end of days, printed in industrial colors — blacks, "
"grays, and dirty whites — to offer better concealment within New England's "
"man-made battle grounds.  Needless to say, a simple camo pattern proved of "
"little help when push came to actual shove."
msgstr ""
"Este modelo concreto de chaqueta era relativamente común entre los preppers "
"durante el fin de los tiempos, y se imprimía en colores industriales -negros, "
"grises y blancos sucios- para ofrecer una mejor ocultación en los campos de "
"batalla artificiales de Nueva Inglaterra. Ni que decir tiene que un simple "
"estampado de camuflaje no resultaba de gran ayuda a la hora de la verdad."

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "tactical jacket"
msgid "maritime tactical jacket"
msgid_plural "maritime tactical jackets"
msgstr[0] "chaqueta táctica marítima"
msgstr[1] "chaquetas tácticas marítimas"
msgstr[2] "chaquetas tácticas marítimas"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of variant "maritime tactical jacket" of item "tactical
#. jacket"
msgid ""
"Resplendent in a wide assortment of blue and light gray tones, this versatile "
"outerwear is the garment of choice for ocean-side activities, namely ocean "
"activities with less fun sea-side paddling and more marine security and "
"over-the-beach gunfights."
msgstr ""
"Resplandeciente en un amplio surtido de tonos azules y grises claros, esta "
"versátil prenda exterior es la prenda elegida para actividades junto al "
"océano, es decir, actividades oceánicas con menos diversión remando junto al "
"mar y más seguridad marina y tiroteos en la playa."

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "tactical jacket"
msgid "river-camo tactical jacket"
msgid_plural "river-camo tactical jackets"
msgstr[0] "chaqueta táctica camuflaje de río"
msgstr[1] "chaquetas tácticas camuflaje de río"
msgstr[2] "chaquetas tácticas camuflaje de río"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of variant "river-camo tactical jacket" of item "tactical
#. jacket"
msgid ""
"The fabric of this particular jacket is festooned with a camouflage pattern — "
"a muddle of greens, light blues, browns, and gray — that would make it at "
"home with any river-based huntsman or angler.  Its water-repellent "
"construction ensures that one's possessions are protected from river spray."
msgstr ""
"El tejido de esta chaqueta en particular está adornado con un estampado de "
"camuflaje -una mezcla de verdes, azules claros, marrones y grises- que la "
"haría ideal para cualquier cazador o pescador de río. Su construcción "
"repelente al agua garantiza la protección de las pertenencias frente a las "
"salpicaduras del río."

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "tactical jacket"
msgid "poler-camo tactical jacket"
msgid_plural "poler-camo tactical jackets"
msgstr[0] "chaqueta táctica camuflaje polar"
msgstr[1] "chaquetas tácticas camuflaje polar"
msgstr[2] "chaquetas tácticas camuflaje polar"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of variant "poler-camo tactical jacket" of item "tactical
#. jacket"
msgid ""
"Fit for utility in light snowfall and in the colder months, this jacket, "
"while not as insulating as thicker winter overcoats, is resplendent with a "
"mixed camo palette of snowy white, gray, and a hint of light brown."
msgstr ""
"Aunque no es tan aislante como los abrigos de invierno más gruesos, esta "
"chaqueta resplandece con una paleta de camuflaje mixta de blanco nevado, gris "
"y un toque de marrón claro."

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "tactical jacket"
msgid "wolf tactical jacket"
msgid_plural "wolf tactical jackets"
msgstr[0] "chaqueta táctica lobo"
msgstr[1] "chaquetas tácticas lobo"
msgstr[2] "chaquetas tácticas lobo"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of variant "wolf tactical jacket" of item "tactical jacket"
msgid ""
"Subtle and unassuming, save for the purely ludicrous number of pockets it's "
"coated in, this hardy overgarment's outer shell is dyed a muted tone of gray "
"verging into beige."
msgstr ""
"Sutil y discreta, salvo por el ridículo número de bolsillos que la recubren, "
"la capa exterior de esta resistente prenda está teñida de un tono gris "
"apagado que roza el beige."

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "tactical jacket"
msgid "coyote-brown tactical jacket"
msgid_plural "coyote-brown tactical jackets"
msgstr[0] "chaqueta táctica coyote marrón"
msgstr[1] "chaquetas tácticas coyote marrón"
msgstr[2] "chaquetas tácticas coyote marrón"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of variant "coyote-brown tactical jacket" of item "tactical
#. jacket"
msgid ""
"Modest and relatively plain, as far as tactical equipment goes, this "
"particular jacket is dyed a solid shade of earthen brown."
msgstr ""
"Modesta y relativamente sencilla, en lo que a equipamiento táctico se "
"refiere, esta chaqueta en particular está teñida de un sólido tono marrón "
"tierra."

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "tactical jacket"
msgid "olive-drab tactical jacket"
msgid_plural "olive-drab tactical jackets"
msgstr[0] "chaqueta táctica verde oliva"
msgstr[1] "chaquetas tácticas verde oliva"
msgstr[2] "chaquetas tácticas verde oliva"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of variant "olive-drab tactical jacket" of item "tactical
#. jacket"
msgid ""
"The venerable shade of old military equipment, modern reproductions, and "
"prepper camo-closets, this particular jacket is completely dyed a traditional "
"shade of olive green."
msgstr ""
"El venerable tono de los antiguos equipos militares, las reproducciones "
"modernas y los armarios de camuflaje de los prepper, esta chaqueta en "
"particular está completamente teñida de un tono tradicional de verde oliva."

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "tactical jacket"
msgid "urban-black tactical jacket"
msgid_plural "urban-black tactical jackets"
msgstr[0] "chaqueta táctica urbana negra"
msgstr[1] "chaquetas tácticas urbanas negras"
msgstr[2] "chaquetas tácticas urbanas negras"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#. ~ Description of variant "urban-black tactical jacket" of item "tactical
#. jacket"
msgid ""
"Pitch-black, from its mandarin collar to its hems, this jacket is a coat for "
"the aspiring nocturnal operator, tacticool edge lord, and those in the "
"business to be afoot during the small hours of the night."
msgstr ""
"Negra como el carbón, desde el cuello mao hasta los dobladillos, esta "
"chaqueta es un abrigo para el aspirante a operador nocturno, el señor del "
"filo táctico y los que se dedican a estar a pie durante las primeras horas de "
"la noche."

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/cyberpunk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/cyberpunk.json
