msgid ""
"A chunk of otherworldly carapace that seems to have been forced into the "
"shape of a ballistic plate with a slightly concave profile.  Scarred into the "
"outer surface is the label \"STRIKE FACE\".  It looks like you could force it "
"into a ballistic vest."
msgstr ""
"Un trozo de caparazón de otro mundo que parece haber sido forzado en forma de "
"placa balística con un perfil ligeramente cóncavo. En la superficie exterior "
"está grabada la etiqueta \"STRIKE FACE\". Parece que se podría forzar para "
"darle forma de chaleco antibalas."

