"outer surface is the label \"STRIKE FACE\".  The armor coverage is spotty and "
"it appears to be oozing and pulsing like it is in pain."
msgstr ""
"Un trozo de caparazón de otro mundo que parece haber sido forzado en forma de "
"placa balística con un perfil ligeramente cóncavo. En la superficie exterior "
