msgstr[1] "yelmos grandes de chapa"
msgstr[2] "yelmos grandes de chapa"

#: data/json/items/armor/helmets.json
#. ~ Description of "sheet metal great helm"
msgid ""
"Massively heavy, extremely uncomfortable, very crude, and looks like a bucket "
"with a slit cut out the front, but it'll keep zombie claws off your face.  "
"Comes with a bevor to help spread the weight out onto your shoulders and "
"protect your neck, and some cloth padding to keep your bell from being rung."
msgstr ""
"Es enormemente pesado, extremadamente incómodo, muy rudimentario y parece un "
"balde con una ranura adelante, PERO evitará que las garras de los zombis te "
"toquen la cara. Incluye una babera que ayuda a esparcir su peso en los "
"hombros y proteger el cuello, y un poco de relleno de tela para evitar que te "
"resuene la cabeza."

#: data/json/items/armor/helmets.json
