#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
#. ~ Description of variant "cross necklace" of item "holy symbol"
msgid ""
"A necklace made of a fine gold chain with a plain cross symbol as a pendant.  "
"It is a symbol of Christian faith, no matter the denomination."
msgstr ""
"Un collar de cadena de oro fino con una cruz lisa como colgante. Es un "
"símbolo de la fe cristiana, sea cual sea su creencia."

#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "holy symbol"
msgid "Star of David necklace"
msgid_plural "Star of David necklaces"
msgstr[0] "collar con la Estrella de David"
msgstr[1] "collares con la Estrella de David"
msgstr[2] "collares con la Estrella de David"

#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Star of David necklace" of item "holy symbol"
msgid ""
"A necklace made of a fine gold chain with the Star of David symbol as a "
"pendant.  It is a symbol of the Jewish faith.  The Star of David became "
"officially associated with Judaism when it was chosen as the symbol to appear "
"on a flag at the First Zionist Congress in 1897.  At that time, it became the "
"symbol of the Jewish people, Zionism, and the Jewish communities throughout "
"the world."
msgstr ""
"Un collar formado por una fina cadena de oro con el símbolo de la Estrella de "
"David como colgante. Es un símbolo de la fe judía. La estrella de David se "
"asoció oficialmente al judaísmo cuando fue elegida como símbolo para figurar "
"en una bandera en el Primer Congreso Sionista de 1897. En ese momento, se "
"convirtió en el símbolo del pueblo judío, el sionismo y las comunidades "
"judías de todo el mundo."

#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "holy symbol"
msgid "Crescent Moon and Star necklace"
msgid_plural "Crescent Moon and Star necklaces"
msgstr[0] "collar de Luna Creciente y Estrella"
msgstr[1] "collares de Luna Creciente y Estrella"
msgstr[2] "collares de Luna Creciente y Estrella"

#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Crescent Moon and Star necklace" of item "holy
#. symbol"
msgid ""
"A necklace made of a fine gold chain with the Crescent Moon and Star symbol "
"as a pendant.  It is a symbol of both the Sunni and Shia Islam faith.  The "
"crescent of the new moon signifies the beginning and end of fasting during "
"Ramadan."
msgstr ""
"Un collar de cadena de oro fino con el símbolo de la Luna Creciente y la "
"Estrella como colgante. Es un símbolo tanto de la fe islámica Suní como de la "
"Chiíta. El creciente de la luna nueva significa el comienzo y el final del "
"ayuno durante el Ramadán."

#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "holy symbol"
msgid "Dharmachakra necklace"
msgid_plural "Dharmachakra necklaces"
msgstr[0] "collar Dharmachakra"
msgstr[1] "collares Dharmachakra"
msgstr[2] "collares Dharmachakra"

#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Dharmachakra necklace" of item "holy symbol"
msgid ""
"A necklace made of a fine gold chain with the Dharmachakra symbol as a "
"pendant.  It is a symbol of the Hindu, Jain and Buddhist faiths.  Also known "
"as Dharma Wheel, the circle, the round shape of the wheel, represents the "
"perfection of the Dharma, the Buddha's teaching.  The rim of the wheel "
"represents meditative concentration and mindfulness, which hold practice "
"together.  The hub represents moral discipline."
msgstr ""
"Un collar de cadena de oro fino con el símbolo Dharmachakra como colgante. Es "
"un símbolo de las religiones hindú, jainista y budista. También conocido como "
"Rueda del Dharma, el círculo, la forma redonda de la rueda, representa la "
"perfección del Dharma, la enseñanza de Buda. El borde de la rueda representa "
"la concentración meditativa y la atención plena, que mantienen unida la "
"práctica. El centro representa la disciplina moral."

#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "holy symbol"
msgid "Horn of Odin necklace"
msgid_plural "Horn of Odin necklaces"
msgstr[0] "collar del Cuerno de Odin"
msgstr[1] "collares del Cuerno de Odin"
msgstr[2] "collares del Cuerno de Odin"

#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Horn of Odin necklace" of item "holy symbol"
msgid ""
"A necklace made of a fine gold chain with the Horn of Odin symbol as a "
"pendant.  It is a symbol of the Asatru faith.  The Horn of Odin is one of the "
"most recognizable Norse symbols, consisting of three interlocking drinking "
"horns and symbolizing poetic inspiration and wisdom.  It is also a nod to "
"Viking drinking customs and the camaraderie derived from them."
msgstr ""
"Un collar de cadena de oro fino con el símbolo del Cuerno de Odín como "
"colgante. Es un símbolo de la fe Asatru. El Cuerno de Odín es uno de los "
"símbolos nórdicos más reconocibles, consiste en tres cuernos para beber "
"entrelazados y simboliza la inspiración poética y la sabiduría. También es un "
"guiño a las costumbres vikingas de beber y a la camaradería derivada de ellas."

#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "holy symbol"
msgid "Faravahar necklace"
msgid_plural "Faravahar necklaces"
msgstr[0] "collar Faravahar"
msgstr[1] "collares Faravahar"
msgstr[2] "collares Faravahar"

#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Faravahar necklace" of item "holy symbol"
msgid ""
"A necklace made of a fine gold chain with the Faravahar symbol as a pendant.  "
"It is a symbol of the Zoroastrianism faith.  While there is no total "
"understanding of the meanings of that ancient symbol, it depicts a bearded "
"man with one hand reaching forward.  He stands above a pair of wings that are "
"outstretched from a circle which are believed to represent eternity."
msgstr ""
"Un collar de cadena de oro fino con el símbolo Faravahar como colgante. Es un "
"símbolo de la fe zoroastrista. Aunque no se conoce totalmente el significado "
"de este antiguo símbolo, representa a un hombre barbudo con una mano "
"extendida hacia delante. Se alza sobre un par de alas extendidas en círculo "
"que, según se cree, representan la eternidad."

#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "holy symbol"
msgid "Khanda necklace"
msgid_plural "Khanda necklaces"
msgstr[0] "collar Khanda"
msgstr[1] "collares Khanda"
msgstr[2] "collares Khanda"

#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Khanda necklace" of item "holy symbol"
msgid ""
"A necklace made of a fine gold chain with the Khanda symbol as a pendant.  It "
"is a symbol of the Sikh faith.  The Khanda symbol depicts the Sikh doctrine "
"of Deg Tegh Fateh in emblematic form.  It is also part of the design of the "
"'Sikh national flag', the Nishan Sahib.  A double edged sword (also called "
"Khanda) is placed at the top of a Nishan Sahib flag as an ornament or finial."
msgstr ""
"Un collar formado por una fina cadena de oro con el símbolo Khanda como "
"colgante. Es un símbolo de la fe Sikh. El símbolo Khanda representa de forma "
"emblemática la doctrina Sikh de Deg Tegh Fateh. También forma parte del "
"diseño de la «bandera nacional Sikh», el Nishan Sahib. En la parte superior "
"de la bandera Nishan Sahib se coloca una espada de doble filo (también "
"llamada Khanda) como adorno o remate."

#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "holy symbol"
msgid "Baha'i Star necklace"
msgid_plural "Baha'i Star necklaces"
msgstr[0] "collar de estrella Baha'i"
msgstr[1] "collares de estrella Baha'i"
msgstr[2] "collares de estrella Baha'i"

#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Baha'i Star necklace" of item "holy symbol"
msgid ""
"A necklace made of a fine gold chain with the Baha'i Star symbol as a "
"pendant.  It is a symbol of the Baha'i faith.  The Baha'i nine-pointed star "
"reflects the importance of the number for the Faith.  The number nine is the "
"highest single digit number, which symbolizes wholeness and the fulfillment "
"of the expectations of all prior religions."
msgstr ""
"Un collar formado por una fina cadena de oro con el símbolo de la estrella "
"bahá'í como colgante. Es un símbolo de la fe Baha'i. La estrella Bahá'í de "
"nueve puntas refleja la importancia del número para la Fe. El número nueve es "
"el número de un solo dígito más alto, que simboliza la totalidad y el "
"cumplimiento de las expectativas de todas las religiones anteriores."

#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "holy symbol"
msgid "Torii necklace"
msgid_plural "Torii necklaces"
msgstr[0] "collar Torii"
msgstr[1] "collares Torii"
msgstr[2] "collares Torii"

#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Torii necklace" of item "holy symbol"
msgid ""
"A necklace made of a fine gold chain with the Torii symbol as a pendant.  It "
"is a symbol of Shinto faith, where the Torii denotes the entrance to Shinto "
"Shrines and the respect towards the Shinto beliefs and culture."
msgstr ""
"Un collar formado por una fina cadena de oro con el símbolo del Torii como "
"colgante. Es un símbolo de la fe sintoísta, donde el Torii denota la entrada "
"a los santuarios sintoístas y el respeto hacia las creencias y la cultura "
"sintoístas."

#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "holy symbol"
msgid "Ying Yang necklace"
msgid_plural "Ying Yang necklaces"
msgstr[0] "collar Ying Yang"
msgstr[1] "collares Ying Yang"
msgstr[2] "collares Ying Yang"

#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Ying Yang necklace" of item "holy symbol"
msgid ""
"A necklace made of a fine gold chain with the Ying Yang symbol as a pendant.  "
"It is a symbol of both Confucian and Taoist faiths and philosophical systems. "
" Yin is a symbol of earth, femininity, darkness, passivity, and absorption.  "
"It is present in even numbers, in valleys and streams, and is represented by "
"the tiger, the color orange, and a broken line.  Yang is conceived of as "
"heaven, maleness, light, activity, and penetration, and together, they "
"represent balance between opposites."
msgstr ""
"Un collar de una cadena fina de oro con el símbolo del Ying Yang como "
"colgante. Es un símbolo tanto de la fe confucionista como de la taoísta y de "
"los sistemas filosóficos. El yin es el símbolo de la tierra, la feminidad, la "
"oscuridad, la pasividad y la absorción. Está presente en los números pares, "
"en los valles y arroyos, y se representa con el tigre, el color naranja y una "
"línea quebrada. El Yang se concibe como el cielo, la masculinidad, la luz, la "
"actividad y la penetración, y juntos representan el equilibrio entre los "
"opuestos."

#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "holy symbol"
msgid "Cao Dai necklace"
msgid_plural "Cao Dai necklaces"
msgstr[0] "collar Cao Dai"
msgstr[1] "collares Cao Dai"
msgstr[2] "collares Cao Dai"

#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Cao Dai necklace" of item "holy symbol"
msgid ""
"A necklace made of a fine gold chain with the Cao Dai symbol as a pendant.  "
"It is a symbol of Caodaism faith.  In Vietnamese, 'Cao' literally means "
"'high', while 'Dai' means 'tower', 'palace' or 'abode'. The combined verbal "
"image is used to represent both a heavenly place and a Supreme Being "
"envisioned as creating all religions and beings on the earth.  The visual "
"symbol used by Caodaism followers for this Supreme Being is an all-seeing "
"eye, the Cao Dai."
msgstr ""
"Un collar de cadena de oro fino con el símbolo Cao Dai como colgante. Es un "
"símbolo de la fe caodaísta. En vietnamita, 'Cao' significa literalmente "
"'alto, mientras que 'Dai' significa 'torre', 'palacio' o 'morada'. La imagen "
"verbal combinada se utiliza para representar tanto un lugar celestial como un "
"Ser Supremo considerado creador de todas las religiones y seres de la Tierra. "
"El símbolo visual utilizado por los seguidores del caodaísmo para este Ser "
"Supremo es un ojo que todo lo ve, el Cao Dai."

#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "holy symbol"
msgid "Zia Sun necklace"
msgid_plural "Zia Sun necklaces"
msgstr[0] "collar Zia del Sol"
msgstr[1] "collares Zia del Sol"
msgstr[2] "collares Zia del Sol"

#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Zia Sun necklace" of item "holy symbol"
msgid ""
"A necklace made of a fine gold chain with the Zia Sun symbol as a pendant.  "
"It is a symbol of the strength and union of the Zia Native Americans.  The "
"Zia Sun symbol represent the four cardinal directions, the four seasons of "
"the year, the four period of each day (morning, noon, evening, and night), "
"and the four seasons of life (childhood, youth, middle age, and old age)."
msgstr ""
"Un collar hecho de una fina cadena de oro con el símbolo Zia del Sol como "
"colgante. Es un símbolo de la fuerza y la unión de los nativos americanos "
"Zia. El símbolo Zia del Sol representa los cuatro puntos cardinales, las "
"cuatro estaciones del año, los cuatro periodos de cada día (mañana, mediodía, "
"tarde y noche) y las cuatro estaciones de la vida (infancia, juventud, "
"madurez y vejez)."

#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "holy symbol"
msgid "Hand of Ahimsa necklace"
msgid_plural "Hand of Ahimsa necklaces"
msgstr[0] "collar de Mano de Ahimsa"
msgstr[1] "collares de Mano de Ahimsa"
msgstr[2] "collares de Mano de Ahimsa"

#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Hand of Ahimsa necklace" of item "holy symbol"
msgid ""
"A necklace made of a fine gold chain with the Hand of Ahimsa symbol as a "
"pendant.  It is a symbol of the Jainist faith and philosophical system.  The "
"hand with a wheel on the palm symbolizes Ahimsa in Jainism.  The word in the "
"middle is 'ahimsa' (non-injury).  The wheel represents the dharmachakra, "
"which stands for the resolve to halt the samsara through the relentless "
"pursuit of Ahimsa."
msgstr ""
"Un collar de cadena de oro fino con el símbolo de la Mano de Ahimsa como "
"colgante. Es un símbolo de la fe y el sistema filosófico jainistas. La mano "
"con una rueda en la palma simboliza Ahimsa en el jainismo. La palabra del "
"centro es 'ahimsa' (no dañar). La rueda representa el dharmachakra, que "
"representa la resolución de detener el samsara mediante la búsqueda incesante "
"de Ahimsa."

#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "holy symbol"
msgid "Om necklace"
msgid_plural "Om necklaces"
msgstr[0] "collar Om"
msgstr[1] "collares Om"
msgstr[2] "collares Om"

#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Om necklace" of item "holy symbol"
msgid ""
"A necklace made of a fine gold chain with the Om symbol as a pendant.  It is "
"a symbol of the Hindu faith, as Om is a sacred sound, syllable, mantra, or an "
"invocation in Hinduism.  Om is the prime symbol of Hinduism, variously said "
"to be the essence of the supreme Absolute, consciousness, Atman, Brahman, or "
"the Cosmic world.  In Indian traditions, Om serves as a sonic representation "
"of the divine, a standard of Vedic authority and a central aspect of "
"soteriological doctrines and practices."
msgstr ""
"Un collar formado por una fina cadena de oro con el símbolo Om como colgante. "
"Es un símbolo de la fe hindú, ya que Om es un sonido sagrado, una sílaba, un "
"mantra o una invocación en el hinduismo. Om es el símbolo principal del "
"hinduismo, del que se dice que es la esencia del Absoluto supremo, la "
"conciencia, Atman, Brahman o el mundo cósmico. En las tradiciones hindúes, Om "
"es una representación sonora de lo divino, un estandarte de la autoridad "
"védica y un aspecto central de las doctrinas y prácticas soteriológicas."

