#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "rifle-cartridge necklace"
msgid ""
"Rather crude and clearly put together on a budget, this is a piece of "
"post-Cataclysmic—so-called—jewelry—little more than an unpolished, solitary "
"rifle casing threaded on a length of cord, string, or twine to form a pendent "
"necklace.  The cartridge's neck has been carefully drilled through, leaving "
"behind a tiny hole on either side of the shell's throat through which the "
"cord has been fed and tied off, forming a pedestrian facsimile of a chain "
"from where the round hangs, primer-down."
msgstr ""
"Bastante tosca y claramente elaborada con un presupuesto reducido, se trata "
"de una pieza de joyería postapocalíptica —así llamada— que no es más que un "
"casquillo de rifle sin pulir ensartado en un cordón, cuerda o hilo para "
"formar un collar colgante. El cuello del cartucho ha sido perforado "
"cuidadosamente, dejando un pequeño orificio a cada lado de la garganta del "
"casquillo por el que se ha pasado y atado el cordón, formando una réplica "
"rudimentaria de una cadena de la que cuelga la bala, con el cebador hacia "
"abajo."

#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "rifle-cartridge necklace"
msgid ""
"Rather crude and clearly put together on a budget, this is a piece of "
"post-Cataclysmic—so-called—jewelry—little more than an unpolished, solitary "
"rifle casing threaded on a length of cord, string, or twine to form a pendent "
"necklace.  The primer's indented portion has been drilled away, with a second "
"hole situated in the casing's side just shy of the base and a length of "
"tied-off cordage looping through both entry points to form a makeshift chain "
"for the apparel."
msgstr ""
"Bastante tosca y claramente elaborada con un presupuesto reducido, se trata "
"de una pieza de joyería postapocalíptica —así llamada— que no es más que un "
"casquillo de rifle sin pulir ensartado en un cordón, cuerda o hilo para "
"formar un collar colgante. La parte dentada del cebador se ha perforado, con "
"un segundo orificio situado en el lateral de la carcasa, justo por debajo de "
"la base, y un trozo de cordaje atado que pasa por ambos puntos de entrada "
"para formar una cadena improvisada para la prenda."

#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "rifle-cartridge necklace"
msgid ""
"Rather crude and clearly put together on a budget, this is a piece of "
"post-Cataclysmic—so-called—jewelry—little more than an unpolished, solitary "
"rifle casing threaded on a length of cord, string, or twine to form a pendent "
"necklace.  The jaws of a set of pliers have twisted closed the cartridge's "
"throat with a spiral flourish, while a hole has been drilled through opposite "
"sides of the pendant's shoulder, through which a loop of cord has been "
"threaded.  The string's loose ends have been wrapped several times around the "
"casing in a vague X-pattern before being tied off, creating a form of "
"mini-bullet cocoon."
msgstr ""
"Bastante tosca y claramente elaborada con un presupuesto reducido, se trata "
"de una pieza de joyería postapocalíptica —así llamada— que no es más que un "
"casquillo de rifle sin pulir ensartado en un cordón, cuerda o hilo para "
"formar un collar colgante. Las mordazas de unos alicates han cerrado la "
"garganta del cartucho con un movimiento espiral, mientras que se ha perforado "
"un agujero a través de los lados opuestos del hombro del colgante, a través "
"del cual se ha pasado un lazo de cordón. Los extremos sueltos del cordón se "
"han enrollado varias veces alrededor de la carcasa en una vaga forma de X "
"antes de atarse, creando una especie de mini capullo de bala."

#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "ordnance-cartridge necklace"
