#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "refined rifle-cartridge necklace"
msgid ""
"A gentlemanly article of craft-produced jewelry for the most spiffy ladies "
"and gentlemen of the post-apocalypse, this plain chain of precious metal has "
"been retrofitted with a fired rifle cartridge that hangs from it as a "
"pendant.  With its brass polished to a mirror-like sheen, the shell's primer "
"and rim have been neatly extricated at the edge of a saw, with a little "
"gemstone peeking out the casing's throat.  The gem's wrapped within the "
"embrace of a length of fine-gauge wire, whose remaining length has been "
"tugged back through the cartridge's body, fed out the base, and entwined with "
"a link in the chain."
msgstr ""
"Una elegante pieza de joyería artesanal para las damas y caballeros más "
"elegantes del apocalipsis, esta sencilla cadena de metal precioso ha sido "
"modificada con un cartucho de rifle disparado que cuelga de ella como "
"colgante. Con su latón pulido hasta alcanzar un brillo especular, el cebador "
"y el borde del casquillo han sido cuidadosamente extraídos con una sierra, "
"dejando que una pequeña piedra preciosa asome por la garganta de la carcasa. "
"La gema está envuelta en un alambre de calibre fino, cuya longitud restante "
"ha sido tirada hacia atrás a través del cuerpo del cartucho, sacada por la "
"base y entrelazada con un eslabón de la cadena."

#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "refined rifle-cartridge necklace"
msgid ""
"A gentlemanly article of craft-produced jewelry for the most spiffy ladies "
"and gentlemen of the post-apocalypse, this plain chain of precious metal has "
"been retrofitted with a fired rifle cartridge that hangs from it as a "
"pendant.  With its brass polished to a mirror-like sheen, the shell has grown "
"shorter by virtue of its base having been sawed away, and a glittering jewel "
"has been seated comfortably within the throat.  A length of wire is tightly "
"wrapped around both cartridge and gemstone in a top-down pattern, forming an "
"X-grid as it wines, with the cord's loose ends trailing through a small drill "
"hole at the cartridge's base and tied to the chain's links."
msgstr ""
"Una elegante pieza de joyería artesanal para las damas y caballeros más "
"elegantes del apocalipsis, esta sencilla cadena de metal precioso ha sido "
"modificada con un cartucho de rifle disparado que cuelga de ella como "
"colgante. Con su latón pulido hasta alcanzar un brillo especular, el "
"casquillo se ha acortado al serrar su base, y una joya brillante se ha "
"colocado cómodamente en su interior. Un trozo de alambre envuelve firmemente "
"tanto el cartucho como la gema en un patrón de arriba abajo, formando una "
"rejilla en forma de X a medida que se enrolla, con los extremos sueltos del "
"cordón pasando por un pequeño orificio perforado en la base del cartucho y "
"atados a los eslabones de la cadena."

