msgstr "Correa para el cañón de un arma."

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Hub 01 modular defense anchor"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 modular defense anchors"
msgstr[0] "ancla de defensa modular Hub 01"
msgstr[1] "anclas de defensa modular Hub 01"
msgstr[2] "anclas de defensa modular Hub 01"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "Hub 01 modular defense anchor"
msgid ""
"A custom-designed poncho for the true frontier explorer, made with aramid "
"fibers and robust ripstop nylon.  This one features a hardened skeleton of "
"ceramic plates running up and over the shoulders, and a portion of the front "
"has been raised upwards from the rest.  Lifting the fabric reveals a large "
"disc-shaped device installed into the garment, featureless except for a "
"prominent switch and Hub 01's logo in LED.  In addition to the poncho's usual "
"complement of storage, a battery compartment has been added that wires into "
"this device, featuring very specialized connectors and, perhaps a little "
"disconcertingly, radiation shielding."
msgstr ""
"Un poncho diseñado para el verdadero explorador fronterizo, hecho con tela "
"aramida y robusto nylon antidesgarro. Este tiene un esqueleto duro de placas "
"cerámicas que llegan hasta los hombros, y una parte en el frente está "
"levantado en comparación al resto. Debajo de la tela hay un dispositivo "
"grande en forma de disco instalado en la prenda, totalmente uniforme excepto "
"por un interruptor y el logo del Hub 01 hecho con leds. Además del "
"complemento de almacenamiento, tiene un compartimiento para batería que se "
"conecta al dispositivo, con unos conectores muy especializados y, tal vez un "
"poco desconcertante, protección contra radiación."

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "Hub 01 modular defense anchor"
msgid "Turn on anchor"
msgstr "Activar ancla"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "Hub 01 modular defense anchor"
msgid ""
"You activate the anchor, and the Hub 01 logo on your front begins to glow "
"white."
msgstr ""
"Activas el ancla y el logotipo Hub 01 de tu frontal empieza a brillar en "
"blanco."

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Hub 01 modular defense anchor (on)"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 modular defense anchors (on)"
msgstr[0] "ancla de defensa modular Hub 01 (enc.)"
msgstr[1] "anclas de defensa modular Hub 01 (enc.)"
msgstr[2] "anclas de defensa modular Hub 01 (enc.)"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "Hub 01 modular defense anchor (on)"
msgid ""
"A custom-designed poncho for the true frontier explorer, made with aramid "
"fibers and robust ripstop nylon.  The logo of Hub 01 emblazoned on the chest "
"is glowing white."
msgstr ""
"Un poncho diseñado para el verdadero explorador fronterizo, hecho con tela "
"aramida y robusto nylon antidesgarro. Tiene el logo del Hub 01 estampado en "
"el frontal brillando de color blanco."

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "Hub 01 modular defense anchor (on)"
msgid "Turn off anchor"
msgstr "Desactivar ancla"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "Hub 01 modular defense anchor (on)"
msgid "The Hub logo on your front stops glowing."
msgstr "El logo de Hub en tu pecho deja de brillar."

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Hub 01 modular recon headgear"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 modular recon headgear"
msgstr[0] "capucha de reconocimiento modular Hub 01"
msgstr[1] "capuchas de reconocimiento modular Hub 01"
msgstr[2] "capuchas de reconocimiento modular Hub 01"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "Hub 01 modular recon headgear"
msgid ""
"Heavy duty hooded headwear for the true frontier explorer, made with robust "
"Nylon sheeting reinforced with Kevlar fibers.  The top consists of a series "
"of plastic plates with hooks and velcro strips, perhaps for attaching "
"additional parts.  On the forehead of the assembly is a bulky box visor on a "
"mechanism to quickly pull it down over your eyes, with a cover on the side to "
"insert standard batteries.  Activate to lower the visor and use the light "
"amplification functions."
msgstr ""
"Capucha de alta resistencia para el verdadero explorador de la frontera, "
"fabricada con una robusta lámina de nylon reforzada con fibras de kevlar. La "
"parte superior consiste en una serie de placas de plástico con ganchos y "
"tiras de velcro, quizá para fijar piezas adicionales. En la parte frontal del "
"conjunto hay una voluminosa visera de caja con un mecanismo para bajarla "
"rápidamente sobre tus ojos, con una tapa en el lateral para insertar baterías "
"estándar. Se activa para bajar la visera y utilizar las funciones de "
"amplificación de la luz."

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "Hub 01 modular recon headgear"
msgid "You lower the visor and flick the control dial to light amplification mode."
msgstr ""
"Se baja la visera y se acciona el dial de control para el modo de "
"amplificación de la luz."

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/headsets.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/headsets.json
#. ~ "need_charges_msg" action message of item "Hub 01 modular recon headgear"
#. ~ "need_charges_msg" action message of item "tactical infovisor"
msgid "The visor's batteries are dead."
msgstr "Las baterías del visor están agotadas."

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "Hub 01 modular recon headgear"
msgid "Hooks for an armored helm plate."
msgstr "Ganchos para una placa de timón blindada."

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Hub 01 modular recon headgear (NV+IR)"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 modular recon headgear (NV+IR)"
msgstr[0] "capucha de reconocimiento modular Hub 01 (VN+IR)"
msgstr[1] "capuchas de reconocimiento modular Hub 01 (VN+IR)"
msgstr[2] "capuchas de reconocimiento modular Hub 01 (VN+IR)"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "Hub 01 modular recon headgear (NV+IR)"
msgid ""
"Heavy duty hooded headwear for the true frontier explorer.  The visor has "
"been lowered over the eyes, and is drawing low power to provide light "
"amplification by way of an infrared illuminator and detector.  Lets you see "
"in the dark, and detects heat signatures emitted by (un)living organisms.  "
"Activate again to turn off and stow the visor."
msgstr ""
"Un casco resistente con capucha para los verdaderos exploradores de la "
"frontera. La visera se ha bajado sobre los ojos y consume poca energía para "
"proporcionar amplificación de luz infrarrojos y un detector. Te permite ver "
"en la oscuridad y detecta las señales de calor emitidas por organismos (no) "
"vivos. Actívalo de nuevo para apagar y subir la visera."

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/headsets.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/headsets.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "Hub 01 modular recon headgear (NV+IR)"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "tactical infovisor"
msgid "You flick the visor off, and push it off your face."
msgstr "Te quitas la visera de un tirón y te la quitas de la cara."

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "drone-tech harness"
msgid_plural "drone-tech harness"
msgstr[0] "arnés para tecnología de drones"
msgstr[1] "arneses para tecnología de drones"
msgstr[2] "arneses para tecnología de drones"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "drone-tech harness"
msgid ""
"A modified army harness, repurposed to carry several small and a single "
"medium sized drone alongside the tools to maintain them."
msgstr ""
"Un arnés militar modificado para transportar varios drones pequeños y uno "
"mediano, junto con las herramientas necesarias para su mantenimiento."

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "drone-tech harness"
msgid "A series of connectors meant to hold a medium sized drone on your back."
msgstr ""
"Una serie de conectores diseñados para sujetar un dron de tamaño mediano a la "
"espalda."

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Brief name of a pocket in item "drone-tech harness"
msgid "Medium drone strap"
msgstr "correa mediana para drones"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "drone-tech harness"
msgid "A series of connectors meant to store a small drone."
msgstr "Una serie de conectores destinados a almacenar un pequeño dron."

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Brief name of a pocket in item "drone-tech harness"
msgid "Small drone holder"
msgstr "Soporte para drones pequeños"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "drone-tech harness"
msgid "Gadget pouch"
msgstr "Bolsa para artilugios"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "drone-tech harness"
msgid "Tool clip"
msgstr "Clip para herramientas"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Hub 01 prototype mantle"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 prototype mantles"
msgstr[0] "manto prototipo Hub 01"
msgstr[1] "mantos prototipo Hub 01"
msgstr[2] "mantos prototipo Hub 01"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "Hub 01 prototype mantle"
msgid ""
"3D printed armor for the upper body, made of thick and pliable polymer with "
"metallic fibers for reinforcement.  Several buckles and straps allow it to be "
"adjusted to fit you comfortably.  Despite its rough finish, it's clear that a "
"lot of thought has gone into the ergonomics and weight.  Designed to clip to "
"the chest and shoulders, its interior reads \"ATTACH TO MODULAR DEFENSE "
"SYSTEM\"."
msgstr ""
"Armadura impresa en 3D para el torso, hecha de polímero grueso y maleable con "
"fibras metálicas para reforzarlo. Varias hebillas y correas permiten "
"ajustarla para acomodarla a tu cuerpo. A pesar de sus terminaciones "
"irregulares, está claro que se le ha puesto mucho esfuerzo a su ergonomía y "
"su peso. Diseñada para engancharse al pecho y los hombros, en su interior "
"dice \"ENGANCHAR EN UN SISTEMA DEFENSIVO MODULAR\"."

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Hub 01 kinetic mantle"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 kinetic mantles"
msgstr[0] "manto cinético Hub 01"
msgstr[1] "mantos cinéticos Hub 01"
msgstr[2] "mantos cinéticos Hub 01"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/unique_items.json
#. ~ Description of "Hub 01 kinetic mantle"
#. ~ Description of "remediator kinetic mantle"
msgid ""
"3D printed armor for the upper body, made of thick and pliable polymer with "
"metallic fibers for reinforcement.  This model incorporates a rubber coating "
"that diffuses impacts and provides excellent protection from blunt trauma, "
"even if it does feel a bit like a rain coat.  Designed to clip to the chest "
"and shoulders, its interior reads \"ATTACH TO MODULAR DEFENSE SYSTEM\"."
msgstr ""
"Armadura impresa en 3D para el torso, hecha de polímero grueso y maleable con "
"fibras metálicas para reforzarlo. Este modelo incorpora una cobertura de goma "
"que amortigua impactos y brinda una protección excelente contra los golpes, "
"aunque parezca un simple prototipo. Diseñada para engancharse al pecho y los "
"hombros, en su interior dice \"ENGANCHAR EN UN SISTEMA DEFENSIVO MODULAR\"."

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Hub 01 turnout mantle"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 turnout mantles"
msgstr[0] "manto ignifugo Hub 01"
msgstr[1] "mantos ignifugos Hub 01"
msgstr[2] "mantos ignifugos Hub 01"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "Hub 01 turnout mantle"
msgid ""
"3D printed armor for the upper body, made of thick and pliable polymer with "
"metallic fibers for reinforcement.  This model features heat-resistant "
"materials in the construction, providing protection from extreme heat without "
"sacrificing its overall performance.  Designed to clip to the chest and "
"shoulders, its interior reads \"ATTACH TO MODULAR DEFENSE SYSTEM\"."
msgstr ""
"Armadura impresa en 3D para el torso, hecha de polímero grueso y maleable con "
"fibras metálicas para reforzarlo. Este modelo está construido con materiales "
"resistentes al calor, lo que brinda protección contra calor extremo sin "
"sacrificar su desempeño general. Diseñada para engancharse al pecho y los "
"hombros, en su interior dice \"ENGANCHAR EN UN SISTEMA DEFENSIVO MODULAR\"."

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Hub 01 ballistic mantle"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 ballistic mantles"
msgstr[0] "manto antibalas Hub 01"
msgstr[1] "mantos antibalas Hub 01"
msgstr[2] "mantos antibalas Hub 01"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "Hub 01 ballistic mantle"
msgid ""
"3D printed armor for the upper body, made of thick and pliable polymer with "
"metallic fibers for reinforcement.  Thanks to a slim under-layer of synthetic "
"fibers, it provides fantastic defense from small-arms fire, and could take "
"the edge off of a rifle bullet, too.  Designed to clip to the chest and "
"shoulders, its interior reads \"ATTACH TO MODULAR DEFENSE SYSTEM\"."
msgstr ""
"Armadura impresa en 3D para el torso, hecha de polímero grueso y maleable con "
"fibras metálicas para reforzarlo. Gracias a una fina capa interior de fibras "
"sintéticas, brinda una defensa fantástica contra armas de bajo calibre y "
"también puede reducir el golpe de una bala de rifle. Diseñada para "
"engancharse al pecho y los hombros, en su interior dice \"ENGANCHAR EN UN "
"SISTEMA DEFENSIVO MODULAR\"."

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Hub 01 soldier mantle"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 soldier mantles"
msgstr[0] "manto de soldado Hub 01"
msgstr[1] "mantos de soldado Hub 01"
msgstr[2] "mantos de soldado Hub 01"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "Hub 01 soldier mantle"
msgid ""
"3D printed armor for the upper body, sporting a professional finish and "
"stellar ergonomics.  Made of extremely tough UHMW polyethylene combined with "
"treated aramid fabric, it provides military-grade defense against zombies, "
"bullets, zombies with bullets, and plenty of other things that the Cataclysm "
"can throw at you.  Designed to clip to the chest and shoulders, its interior "
"reads \"ATTACH TO MODULAR DEFENSE SYSTEM\"."
msgstr ""
"Armadura impresa en 3D para el torso, con una terminación profesional y "
"ergonomía excelente. Está hecha con polietileno UHMW de extremada resistencia "
"combinado con tela aramida. Brinda defensa de grado militar contra zombis, "
"balas, zombis con balas y muchas otras cosas que el Cataclismo te pueda "
"presentar. Diseñada para enganchase al pecho y los hombros, en su interior "
"dice \"ENGANCHAR EN UN SISTEMA DEFENSIVO MODULAR\"."

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Hub 01 prototype skirt"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 prototype skirts"
msgstr[0] "falda prototipo Hub 01"
msgstr[1] "faldas prototipo Hub 01"
msgstr[2] "faldas prototipo Hub 01"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "Hub 01 prototype skirt"
msgid ""
"3D printed armor for the thighs and knees, consisting of a skirt made of "
"segmented armor plates.  It features a simple integrated belt to let it fit "
"any waist size.  Despite its rough finish, it's clear that a lot of thought "
"has gone into the ergonomics and weight.  Designed to clip to the waist, its "
"interior reads \"ATTACH TO MODULAR DEFENSE SYSTEM\"."
msgstr ""
"Armadura impresa en 3D para los muslos y las rodillas que consiste en una "
"falda hecha de placas de armaduras segmentadas. Tiene un cinturón integrado "
"para poder ajustarse a cualquier tamaño de cintura. A pesar de sus "
"terminaciones irregulares, está claro que se le ha puesto mucho esfuerzo a su "
"ergonomía y su peso. Diseñada para engancharse a la cintura, en su interior "
"dice \"ENGANCHAR EN UN SISTEMA DEFENSIVO MODULAR\"."

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Hub 01 kinetic skirt"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 kinetic skirts"
msgstr[0] "falda cinética Hub 01"
msgstr[1] "faldas cinéticas Hub 01"
msgstr[2] "faldas cinéticas Hub 01"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "Hub 01 kinetic skirt"
msgid ""
"3D printed armor for the thighs and knees, consisting of a skirt made of "
"segmented armor plates.  This model resembles scale armor, and provides "
"excellent protection from blunt trauma.  Designed to clip to the waist, its "
"interior reads \"ATTACH TO MODULAR DEFENSE SYSTEM\"."
msgstr ""
"Armadura impresa en 3D para los muslos y las rodillas que consiste en una "
"falda hecha de placas de armaduras segmentadas. Este modelo se parece a una "
"armadura de escamas y brinda excelente protección contra los golpes. Diseñada "
"para engancharse a la cintura, en su interior se lee \"CONECTAR EN UN SISTEMA "
"DEFENSIVO MODULAR\"."

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Hub 01 turnout skirt"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 turnout skirts"
msgstr[0] "falda ignifuga Hub 01"
msgstr[1] "faldas ignifugas Hub 01"
msgstr[2] "faldas ignifugas Hub 01"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "Hub 01 turnout skirt"
msgid ""
"3D printed armor for the thighs and knees, consisting of a skirt made of "
"segmented armor plates.  This version incorporates tight-fitting leggings "
"that provide some protection from extreme heat.  Designed to clip to the "
"waist, its interior reads \"ATTACH TO MODULAR DEFENSE SYSTEM\"."
msgstr ""
"Armadura impresa en 3D para los muslos y las rodillas que consiste en una "
"falda hecha de placas de armaduras segmentadas. Esta versión incorpora unas "
"perneras ajustadas que brindan un poco de protección contra el calor extremo. "
"Diseñada para engancharse a la cintura, en su interior dice \"ENGANCHAR EN UN "
"SISTEMA DEFENSIVO MODULAR\"."

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Hub 01 ballistic skirt"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 ballistic skirts"
msgstr[0] "falda antibalas Hub 01"
msgstr[1] "faldas antibalas Hub 01"
msgstr[2] "faldas antibalas Hub 01"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "Hub 01 ballistic skirt"
msgid ""
"3D printed armor for the thighs and knees, consisting of a skirt made of "
"segmented armor plates.  It includes a reinforcing layer of aramid fabric in "
"addition to leg sleeves made of high-strength material, protecting your "
"sensitive bits from small-arms fire.  Designed to clip to the waist, its "
"interior reads \"ATTACH TO MODULAR DEFENSE SYSTEM\"."
msgstr ""
"Armadura impresa en 3D para los muslos y las rodillas que consiste en una "
"falda hecha de placas de armaduras segmentadas. Incluye una capa reforzada de "
"tela aramida además de unas mangas para las piernas hechas de un material muy "
"fuerte, que protege tus partes sensibles de armas de bajo calibre. Diseñada "
"para engancharse a la cintura, en su interior dice \"ENGANCHAR EN UN SISTEMA "
"DEFENSIVO MODULAR\"."

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Hub 01 soldier skirt"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 soldier skirts"
