msgstr[1] "avambrazos soldado Hub 01"
msgstr[2] "avambrazos soldado Hub 01"

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of Hub 01 soldier vambraces"
msgid ""
"3D printed arm guards, sporting a professional finish and stellar ergonomics. "
" With thick bullet-resistant arm sleeves, flexible but extremely tough "
"thermoplastic plates, and special attention given to areas reflexively used "
"to protect the face from attacks, it provides first-rate protection against "
"all the horrors that the apocalypse has brought to bear."
msgstr ""
"Mangas impresas en 3D con una terminación profesional y excelente ergonomía. "
"Posee mangas gruesas resistentes a las balas, placas termoplásticas flexibles "
"pero extremadamente resistentes, y con mayor protección en las áreas que "
"protegen la cara de los ataques. Brinda protección de primer grado contra "
"todos los horrores que el apocalipsis te puede ofrecer."

#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of Hub 01 prototype greaves"
