msgstr[1] "bolsos de asalto MOLLE"
msgstr[2] "bolsos de asalto MOLLE"

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Description of "MOLLE assault pack"
msgid ""
"The Modular Lightweight Load-carrying Equipment is an advanced military "
"backpack.  Covered with pockets and straps, it strikes a fine balance between "
"storage space and encumbrance.  Can attach accessory pockets to the outside "
"rigging."
msgstr ""
"El Equipo Ligero Modular de Transporte de Carga es un mochila militar "
"avanzado. Cubierto de bolsillos y correas, logra un fino equilibrio entre el "
"espacio de almacenamiento y la incomodidad. Puede acoplar bolsillos para "
"accesorios en el aparejo exterior."

#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "MOLLE medium rucksack"
msgid_plural "MOLLE medium rucksacks"
msgstr[0] "morral mediano MOLLE"
msgstr[1] "morrales medianos MOLLE"
msgstr[2] "morrales medianos MOLLE"

