msgstr[0] "armadura pesada de chapa"
msgstr[1] "armaduras pesadas de chapa"
msgstr[2] "armaduras pesadas de chapa"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
#. ~ Description of "heavy sheet metal armor"
msgid ""
"A full set of armor hammered out from sheet metal and tied in place with "
"leather straps and belts, with a doubly-thick chest guard to keep all your "
"important organs safe.  You might be as mobile as a refrigerator wearing all "
"this, but that's the price to pay to keep your flesh attached."
msgstr ""
"Una armadura completa fabricada con chapa y atada con correas y cinturones de "
"cuero, con un protector pectoral doblemente grueso para mantener a salvo "
"todos tus órganos importantes. Puede que te muevas como una nevera con todo "
"esto, pero ese es el precio que hay que pagar para mantener tu carne unida."

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
