msgid_plural "heavy junkyard plate armors"
msgstr[0] "armadura pesada de chatarra"
msgstr[1] "armaduras pesadas de chatarra"
msgstr[2] "armaduras pesadas de chatarra"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
#. ~ Description of "heavy junkyard plate armor"
msgid ""
"A full set of steel armor made from sheet metal hammered into shape and "
"attached with chainmail covering the gaps, with an extra-thick chestpiece.  "
"About as heavy as a car but nowhere near as mobile, this suit is nonetheless "
"quite protective."
msgstr ""
"Un traje completo de armadura de acero hecha con chapa unida a cota de malla "
"para cubrir los espacios vacíos, con el peto más grueso. Este traje es casi "
"tan pesado como un auto pero no tan móvil, aunque bastante protector."

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "hardened junkyard plate armor"
msgid_plural "hardened junkyard plate armors"
msgstr[0] "armadura de placas de chatarra endurecida"
msgstr[1] "armaduras de placas de chatarra endurecida"
msgstr[2] "armaduras de placas de chatarra endurecida"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
#. ~ Description of "hardened junkyard plate armor"
msgid ""
"A full set of steel armor made from sheet metal hammered into shape, attached "
"with chainmail, and case-hardened for extra strength.  It might be crude and "
"uncomfortably heavy, but it was clearly made by a skilled metalworker and "
"offers excellent protection."
msgstr ""
"Una armadura completa de acero hecha con chapa, unida con cota de malla y "
"endurecida para aumentar su resistencia. Puede que sea tosca e incómoda, pero "
"está claro que ha sido fabricada por un hábil metalista y ofrece una "
"excelente protección."

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "heavy hardened junkyard plate armor"
msgid_plural "heavy hardened junkyard plate armors"
msgstr[0] "armadura de placas de chatarra endurecida pesada"
msgstr[1] "armaduras de placas de chatarra endurecida pesada"
msgstr[2] "armaduras de placas de chatarra endurecida pesada"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
#. ~ Description of "heavy hardened junkyard plate armor"
msgid ""
"A full set of steel armor made from sheet metal hammered into shape, attached "
"with chainmail, with a double-thick chestpiece, and case-hardened for extra "
"strength.  Top-of-the-line in armor that looks like it was made from "
"banged-up lockers, for the skilled metalworker that values protection over "
"being able to move."
msgstr ""
"Un conjunto completo de armadura de acero fabricada con chapa martillada, "
"unida con cota de malla, con una pechera de doble grosor y endurecida para "
"una mayor resistencia. Una armadura de primera línea que parece hecha con "
"armarios desvencijados, para el metalista experto que valora la protección "
"por encima de la capacidad de movimiento."

