#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
#. ~ Description of "riot armor suit"
msgid ""
"A full suit of black plastic body armor plates used by riot police.  Cleverly "
"placed velcro straps secure each piece, resulting in slightly less "
"encumbrance than its constituent parts.  MOLLE webbing is attached to the "
"torso and the word POLICE is emblazoned across the front."
msgstr ""
"Un traje completo de placas de plástico negro para la policía antidisturbios. "
"Unas correas de velcro inteligentemente colocadas fijan cada pieza, lo que "
"resulta en una incomodidad ligeramente menor que sus partes constituyentes. "
"Las correas MOLLE se sujetan a los muslos y la palabra POLICIA está estampada "
"en la parte delantera."

