msgid_plural "flame-resistant suits"
msgstr[0] "traje ignífugos"
msgstr[1] "trajes ignífugos"
msgstr[2] "trajes ignífugos"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
#. ~ Description of "flame-resistant suit"
msgid ""
"A snug body suit made from thin and lightweight Nomex fire-resistant fabric.  "
"Tough yet breathable, it is light and comfortable to wear under clothing."
msgstr ""
"Un traje ajustado, hecho de un tejido ligero y fino resistente al fuego "
"llamado Nomex. Resistente pero transpirable, es ligero y cómodo de llevar "
"bajo otra ropa."

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Hub 01 environmental suit"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 environmental suits"
msgstr[0] "traje ambiental Hub 01"
msgstr[1] "trajes ambientales Hub 01"
msgstr[2] "trajes ambientales Hub 01"

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
#. ~ Description of "Hub 01 environmental suit"
msgid ""
"A lightweight environmental suit incorporating Kevlar-lined boots and gloves, "
"worn by Hub personnel in their rare forays aboveground.  Colored brown and "
"blue, the white seal of Hub 01 is embroidered on both of its upper arms.  It "
"requires a separate gas mask for full protection."
msgstr ""
"Un traje ambiental ligero que incorpora botas y guantes forrados de Kevlar, "
"usado por el personal del Hub en sus raras incursiones en la superficie. De "
"color marrón y azul, lleva el sello blanco del Hub 01 bordado en la parte "
"superior de los brazos. Requiere una máscara de gas separada para una "
"protección completa."

