msgstr[1] "corazas de cuero laminar"
msgstr[2] "corazas de cuero laminar"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "leather lamellar cuirass"
msgid ""
"A cuirass made of multiple pieces of tough leather, laced together for "
"durable yet flexible protection."
msgstr ""
"Una coraza hecha de múltiples piezas de cuero resistente, unidas para una "
"protección duradera y flexible."

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "mild steel lamellar cuirass"
msgid_plural "mild steel lamellar cuirasses"
msgstr[0] "coraza laminar de acero dulce"
msgstr[1] "corazas laminares de acero dulce"
msgstr[2] "corazas laminares de acero dulce"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "mild steel lamellar cuirass"
msgid ""
"A cuirass made of small strips of sheet metal laced together, something of an "
"intermediary between chain mail and plate armor.  It's less Mad Max and more "
"Garage Mongolian, but the classics are classic for a reason."
msgstr ""
"Una coraza hecha de pequeñas tiras de chapa entrelazada, algo así como un "
"intermedio entre la cota de malla y la armadura de placas. Es menos Mad Max y "
"más Garage Mongol, pero los clásicos son clásicos por una razón."

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "mild steel lamellar cuirass"
msgid ""
"A cuirass made of small strips of sheet metal laced together, something of an "
"intermediary between chain mail and plate armor.  The perfect size for an orc "
"or bipedal grizzly bear."
msgstr ""
"Una coraza hecha de pequeñas tiras de chapa unidas entre sí, algo así como un "
"intermedio entre la cota de malla y la armadura de placas. El tamaño perfecto "
"para un orco o un oso pardo bípedo."

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "mild steel lamellar cuirass"
msgid ""
"A cuirass made of small strips of sheet metal laced together, something of an "
"intermediary between chain mail and plate armor.  Perfectly sized for a "
"particularly angry rat-person, yes-yes."
msgstr ""
"Una coraza hecha de pequeñas tiras de chapa entrelazadas, algo así como un "
"intermedio entre la cota de malla y la armadura de placas. El tamaño perfecto "
"para una persona rata especialmente enfadada."

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "hardened steel lamellar cuirass"
msgid_plural "hardened steel lamellar cuirasses"
msgstr[0] "coraza laminar de acero endurecido"
msgstr[1] "corazas laminares de acero endurecido"
msgstr[2] "corazas laminares de acero endurecido"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "hardened steel lamellar cuirass"
msgid ""
"A cuirass made of small strips of sheet metal laced together, something of an "
"intermediary between chain mail and plate armor.  This one has been hardened "
"for extra protection."
msgstr ""
"Una coraza hecha de pequeñas chapas unidas entre sí, algo así como un "
"intermedio entre la cota de malla y la armadura de placas. Esta ha sido "
"endurecida para una mayor protección."

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "hardened steel lamellar cuirass"
msgid ""
"A hardened cuirass made of small strips of sheet metal laced together, "
"something of an intermediary between chain mail and plate armor.  Built "
"larger for a minotaur guarding their labyrinth."
msgstr ""
"Una coraza endurecida hecha de pequeñas tiras de chapa entrelazadas, algo así "
"como un intermedio entre la cota de malla y la armadura de placas. Construida "
"a mayor tamaño para un minotauro que vigila su laberinto."

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "hardened steel lamellar cuirass"
msgid ""
"A hardened cuirass made of small strips of sheet metal laced together, "
"something of an intermediary between chain mail and plate armor.  Just the "
"right size for a fantasy dwarf."
msgstr ""
"Una coraza endurecida hecha de pequeñas tiras de chapa entrelazadas, algo así "
"como un intermedio entre la cota de malla y la armadura de placas. El tamaño "
"justo para un enano de fantasía."

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "carpet cuirass"
msgid_plural "carpet cuirasses"
msgstr[0] "coraza de alfombra"
msgstr[1] "corazas de alfombra"
msgstr[2] "corazas de alfombra"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "carpet cuirass"
msgid ""
"A rectangular length of tough carpet with a hole cut out for your head and "
"tied around the waist.  It's decently protective for its weight and quite the "
"fashion statement."
msgstr ""
"Una pieza rectangular de moqueta resistente con un agujero para la cabeza y "
"atada a la cintura. Ofrece una protección decente para su peso y es toda una "
"declaración de moda."

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "ichcahuipilli"
msgid_plural "ichcahuipillis"
msgstr[0] "ichcahuipillis"
msgstr[1] "ichcahuipillis"
msgstr[2] "ichcahuipillis"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "ichcahuipilli"
msgid ""
"A Mesoamerican armor of Nahuatl origin, somewhat similar to a European "
"gambeson.  It is made of unspun cotton between two layers of quilted cotton "
"crystalized by brine, edged with leather around its holes.  It is extremely "
"thick and offers superb protection, but is also heavy.  This bad boy once "
"stopped Spanish bullets and Aztec missiles alike, now its time has come to "
"stop zombie bites."
msgstr ""
"Una armadura mesoamericana de origen náhuatl, algo similar a un gambesón "
"europeo. Está hecha de algodón sin hilar entre dos capas de algodón acolchado "
"cristalizado con salmuera, con bordes de cuero alrededor de los agujeros. Es "
"extremadamente gruesa y ofrece una protección excelente, pero también es "
"pesada. Esta armadura detuvo en su día tanto las balas españolas como los "
"proyectiles aztecas, y ahora ha llegado su momento de detener las mordeduras "
"de los zombis."

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "lorica segmentata"
msgid_plural "lorica segmentata"
msgstr[0] "lorica segmentata"
msgstr[1] "lorica segmentata"
msgstr[2] "lorica segmentata"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "lorica segmentata"
msgid ""
"An ancient Roman laminar armor, made of overlapping metal strips connected to "
"internal leather straps."
msgstr ""
"Es una antigua armadura romana de láminas, hecha superponiendo bandas de "
"metal, conectadas a correas de cuero internas."

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cataphract armor"
msgid_plural "suits of cataphract armor"
msgstr[0] "traje de armadura de catafractas"
msgstr[1] "trajes de armadura de catafractas"
msgstr[2] "trajes de armadura de catafractas"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "cataphract armor"
msgid ""
"This armor, made of interlocking plates of burnished bronze, appears to be "
"either a high-quality recreation or a genuine artifact.  Despite having an "
"ancient design, it is in mint condition aside from some battle damage.  It "
"covers from the shoulders to the hips and is of extremely high quality."
msgstr ""
"Esta armadura, hecha de placas entrelazadas de bronce bruñido, parece ser una "
"recreación de alta calidad o un artefacto genuino. A pesar de tener un diseño "
"antiguo, está en perfectas condiciones, aparte de algunos daños de batalla. "
"Cubre desde los hombros hasta las caderas y es de gran calidad."

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sheet metal chest guard"
msgid_plural "sheet metal chest guards"
msgstr[0] "peto de chapa"
msgstr[1] "petos de chapa"
msgstr[2] "petos de chapa"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "sheet metal chest guard"
msgid ""
"Two sheets of metal hammered to fit your torso and riveted to leather belts "
"to act as straps.  Heavy, uncomfortable, and difficult to move in, but it "
"should help keep your blood inside your body."
msgstr ""
"Dos chapas martilladas para ajustarse a tu torso y remachadas a cinturones de "
"cuero para que actúen como correas. Pesado, incómodo y difícil de mover, pero "
"debería ayudar a mantener la sangre dentro del cuerpo."

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "hardened sheet metal chest guard"
msgid_plural "hardened sheet metal chest guards"
msgstr[0] "peto de chapa endurecida"
msgstr[1] "petos de chapa endurecida"
msgstr[2] "petos de chapa endurecida"

#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "hardened sheet metal chest guard"
msgid ""
"A chest guard made of hammered sheet metal, hardened for added protection.  "
