msgid ""
"Rabbi Joseph Telushkin's encyclopedic tome of Jewish life, running to "
"hundreds of chapters and answering questions about the Hebrew bible, the "
"Talmud, the holidays and rituals, the Holocaust, Israel and the diaspora, and "
"everything in between."
msgstr ""
"La enciclopédica obra del rabino Joseph Telushkin sobre la vida judía, que "
"consta de cientos de capítulos y responde a preguntas sobre la Biblia hebrea, "
