#. ~ Description of variant "God in Search of Man : A Philosophy of Judaism"
#. of item "Judaica softcover"
msgid ""
"Rabbi Abraham Joshua Heschel's philosophical work on religious thought, on "
"revelation and the problem of evil, and on the nature of a God who seeks a "
"partner in humanity."
msgstr ""
"La obra filosófica del Rabino Abraham Joshua Heschel sobre el pensamiento "
"religioso, la revelación y el problema del mal, y sobre la naturaleza de un "
"Dios que busca un compañero en la humanidad."

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Judaica softcover"
msgid "Not in God's Name: Confronting Religious Violence"
msgid_plural "copies of Not in God's Name: Confronting Religious Violence "
msgstr[0] "No En Nombre de Dios: Frente a la Violencia Religiosa "
msgstr[1] "copias de No En Nombre de Dios: Frente a la Violencia Religiosa "
msgstr[2] "copias de No En Nombre de Dios: Frente a la Violencia Religiosa "

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Not in God's Name: Confronting Religious
#. Violence" of item "Judaica softcover"
msgid ""
"Rabbi Abraham Joshua Heschel's answer to the claim that religion is "
"fundamentally divisive and encourages conflict.  His main argument is that "
"religiously-motivated violence stems from misreadings of sacred texts."
msgstr ""
"La respuesta del Rabino Abraham Joshua Heschel a la afirmación de que la "
"religión es fundamentalmente divisiva y fomenta el conflicto. Su argumento "
"principal es que la violencia motivada por la religión proviene de "
"interpretaciones erróneas de los textos sagrados."

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Judaica softcover"
msgid "When Bad Things Happen to Good People"
msgid_plural "copies of When Bad Things Happen to Good People"
msgstr[0] "Cuando Cosa Malas Le Suceden A Gente Buena"
msgstr[1] "copias de Cuando Cosa Malas Le Suceden A Gente Buena"
msgstr[2] "copias de Cuando Cosa Malas Le Suceden A Gente Buena"

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
#. ~ Description of variant "When Bad Things Happen to Good People" of item
#. "Judaica softcover"
msgid ""
"A meditation on meaningless tragedy and why the disaster and sorrow in the "
"world is unevenly distributed.  Written decades before the Cataclysm, but the "
"author was obviously on to something."
msgstr ""
"Una reflexión sobre la tragedia sin sentido y por qué el desastre y el dolor "
"en el mundo se distribuyen de manera desigual. Escrita décadas antes del "
"Cataclismo, pero el autor obviamente estaba en lo cierto."

#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
