msgstr[1] "copias de Usando el Arte para Tratar Desórdenes Alimenticios"
msgstr[2] "copias de Usando el Arte para Tratar Desórdenes Alimenticios"

#: data/json/items/book/nonfiction.json
#. ~ Description of "Using Art to Treat Eating Disorders"
msgid ""
"An introductory guide for those wanting to explore the use of art to address "
"eating disorders.  Art therapy is a particularly effective therapeutic "
"intervention, as it allows people to express uncomfortable thoughts and "
"feelings nonverbally."
msgstr ""
"Una guía introductoria para aquellos que quieran explorar el uso del arte "
"para tratar los trastornos de la alimentación. La terapia artística es una "
"intervención terapéutica particularmente efectiva, ya que permite a las "
"personas expresar pensamientos y sentimientos incómodos de forma no verbal."

#: data/json/items/book/nonfiction.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "A Clinical Guide to Video Gamers"
msgid_plural "copies of A Clinical Guide to Video Gamers"
