msgid ""
"This is volume 31 of 51, containing the second part of Tractate Yevamot.  It "
"continues the discussion of the laws of Yibbum, often translated as "
"\"Levirate marriage,\" and the circumstances in which it does or does not "
"apply."
msgstr ""
"Este es el volumen 31 de 51, que contiene la segunda parte del Tratado "
"Yevamot. Continúa el análisis de las leyes de Yibbum, a menudo traducidas "
"como \"matrimonio levirato\", y las circunstancias en las que se aplica o no."

