"Una galleta de pan seca, prácticamente insípida, capaz de permanecer "
"comestible sin estropearse durante mucho tiempo. Tan dura que es incomestible "
"por sí misma. Suele partirse en trozos más pequeños para su consumo."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "hardtack"
msgid_plural "hardtack"
msgstr[0] "pan de pirata"
msgstr[1] "panes piratas"
msgstr[2] "panes piratas"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
#. ~ Description of "hardtack"
msgid ""
"A dry, virtually tasteless bread product capable of remaining edible without "
"spoilage for vast lengths of time.  So hard it is inedible by itself."
msgstr ""
"Un producto de pan seco, prácticamente insípido, capaz de permanecer "
"comestible sin estropearse durante largos periodos de tiempo. Tan duro que es "
"incomestible por sí mismo."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "soggy hardtack"
msgid_plural "soggy hardtack"
msgstr[0] "pan pirata empapado"
msgstr[1] "panes piratas empapados"
msgstr[2] "panes piratas empapados"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
#. ~ Description of "soggy hardtack"
msgid ""
"A soggy, virtually tasteless bread product that has soaked up enough water "
"that it won't hurt your teeth when you chew it."
msgstr ""
"Un producto de pan empapado y prácticamente insípido que ha absorbido "
"suficiente agua como para no dañar tus dientes al masticarlo."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "biscuit"
msgid_plural "biscuits"
msgstr[0] "galleta"
msgstr[1] "galletas"
msgstr[2] "galletas"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
#. ~ Description of "biscuit"
msgid ""
"Hardtack's much more palatable descendant, thanks in large part to the "
"addition of milk in the recipe.  Crumbly on the outside, soft on the inside, "
"and delicious all the way through."
msgstr ""
"El descendiente mucho más sabroso del Hardtack, gracias en gran parte a la "
"incorporación de leche en la receta. Desmenuzable por fuera, blando por "
"dentro y delicioso hasta el final."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "wastebread"
msgid_plural "wastebread"
msgstr[0] "pan de sobras"
msgstr[1] "panes de sobras"
msgstr[2] "panes de sobras"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
#. ~ Description of "wastebread"
msgid ""
"Flour is a commodity these days and to deal with that, most survivors resort "
"to mixing it with leftovers of other ingredients and baking it all into "
"bread.  It's filling, and that's what matters."
msgstr ""
"La harina es una mercancía hoy en día y para hacer frente a eso, la mayoría "
"de los supervivientes recurren a mezclarla con restos de otros ingredientes y "
"hornearlo todo en forma de pan. Es saciante, y eso es lo que importa."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "brown bread"
msgid_plural "brown bread"
msgstr[0] "pan marrón"
msgstr[1] "panes marrones"
msgstr[2] "panes marrones"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
#. ~ Description of "brown bread"
msgid "Sweet bread made with molasses, with a consistency closer to cake."
msgstr "Pan dulce hecho con melaza, con una consistencia similar a una torta."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "hallula"
msgid_plural "hallula"
msgstr[0] "hallula"
msgstr[1] "hallula"
msgstr[2] "hallula"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
#. ~ Description of "hallula"
msgid ""
"A type of bread popular in Chile and Bolivia.  Prepared using animal lard or "
"oil, it resembles a large, round scone.  In the pre-Cataclysm world, it would "
"usually be filled with savory ingredients."
msgstr ""
"Un tipo de pan popular en Chile y Bolivia. Preparado con manteca de cerdo o "
"aceite, se parece a un bollo grande y redondo. En el mundo antes del "
"cataclismo, se suele rellenar con ingredientes salados."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Mycus wine must"
msgid_plural "Mycus wine must"
msgstr[0] "mosto de vino Mycus"
msgstr[1] "mostos de vino Mycus"
msgstr[2] "mostos de vino Mycus"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
#. ~ Description of "Mycus wine must"
msgid ""
"Unfermented Mycus wine.  A goopy white mess, made from Mycus fruit.  It "
"smells sweetly of mushrooms.  You need to put it in a fermenting vat to brew "
"it."
msgstr ""
"Vino Mycus sin fermentar. Una masa blanca y pegajosa, elaborada con la fruta "
"Mycus. Desprende un aroma dulce a setas. Hay que ponerlo en una cuba de "
"fermentación para elaborarlo."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Marloss wine must"
msgid_plural "Marloss wine must"
msgstr[0] "mosto de vino de Marloss"
msgstr[1] "mostos de vino de Marloss"
msgstr[2] "mostos de vino de Marloss"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
#. ~ Description of "Marloss wine must"
msgid ""
"Unfermented Marloss wine.  A soft pinkish mess, made from Marloss berries.  "
"It has a strong aroma, but you're not quite sure if it's a good or bad one.  "
"You need to put it in a fermenting vat to brew it."
msgstr ""
"Vino Marloss sin fermentar. Una mezcla rosada y suave, elaborada con bayas "
"Marloss. Tiene un aroma fuerte, pero no estás muy seguro de si es bueno o "
"malo. Hay que ponerlo en una cuba de fermentación para elaborarlo."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "whiskey wort"
msgid_plural "whiskey wort"
