msgstr[2] "grandes rebanadas de tocino sin cortar"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Description of "large slab of uncut bacon"
msgid ""
"A huge slab of uncut smoked bacon.  You can eat it as is, but it would be "
"more efficient to cut it into smaller portions with a knife."
msgstr ""
"Un enorme trozo de tocino ahumado sin cortar. Se puede comer tal cual, pero "
"sería más eficiente cortarlo en porciones más pequeñas con un cuchillo."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "slab of raw curing porkbelly"
msgid_plural "slabs of raw curing porkbelly"
msgstr[0] "planca de panceta curada cruda"
msgstr[1] "planchas de panceta curada cruda"
msgstr[2] "planchas de panceta curada cruda"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Description of "slab of raw curing porkbelly"
msgid ""
"Porkbelly in the process of becoming fully cured with salt and sugar, capable "
"of becoming bacon.  The flavor is slowly developing at this stage, and is "
"significantly unpleasant due to the residual salt.  Activate it once "
"completed to make use of the final product."
msgstr ""
"Panceta en proceso de curado completo con sal y azúcar, capaz de convertirse "
"en tocino. El sabor se desarrolla lentamente en esta etapa, y es "
"significativamente desagradable debido a la sal residual. Activarlo una vez "
"completado para hacer uso del producto final."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "slab of raw curing porkbelly"
msgid ""
"You pat off a bit of extra brine from the slice; this piece of meat is now "
"fully cured."
msgstr ""
"Quitas un poco de salmuera extra de la rebanada; esta pieza de carne está "
"ahora completamente curada."

