"unsettlingly humanoid in appearance.  It has odd bits of fur and other tissue "
"lodged in it that clearly don't belong.  You'd have to be crazy or starving "
"to eat this."
msgstr ""
"Carne cruda extraída del cuerpo de una criatura fuertemente mutada y de "
"aspecto inquietantemente humanoide. Tiene extraños trozos de piel y otros "
"tejidos alojados en él que claramente no pertenecen. Tendrías que estar loco "
"o hambriento para comertelo."

