msgid_plural "chunks of tainted meat"
msgstr[0] "trozo de carne contaminada"
msgstr[1] "trozos de carne contaminada"
msgstr[2] "trozos de carne contaminada"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Description of "chunk of tainted meat"
msgid ""
"A piece of meat that's obviously unhealthy.  You could eat it, but it will "
"poison you."
msgstr ""
"Es un pedazo de carne que, obviamente, no es saludable. Te la puedes comer "
"pero te va a intoxicar."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "tainted limb"
msgid_plural "tainted limbs"
msgstr[0] "miembro contaminado"
msgstr[1] "miembros contaminados"
msgstr[2] "miembros contaminados"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Description of "tainted limb"
msgid ""
"A rotted and then shredded arm.  Not much use unless you want to scrape the "
"meat from the bones."
msgstr ""
"Un brazo podrido y luego destrozado. No sirve para mucho, a menos que quieras "
"raspar la carne de los huesos."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
#. ~ Description of "tainted limb"
#. ~ Snippet in category "leg_zed_desc"
msgid ""
"What's left of some zombie's limb.  Most likely a leg based on the "
"proportions.  Though it's rotted, there is quite a bit of meat still on it."
msgstr ""
"Lo que queda de una extremidad de un zombi. Probablemente sea una pierna, a "
"juzgar por las proporciones. Aunque está podrida, todavía tiene bastante "
"carne."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/ammo_types.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/fuel.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of an ammunition type
msgid "tainted blood"
msgid_plural "tainted blood"
msgstr[0] "sangre contaminada"
msgstr[1] "sangre contaminada"
msgstr[2] "sangre contaminada"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Description of "tainted blood"
msgid "Blood that's obviously unhealthy.  You could drink it, but it will poison you."
msgstr "Sangre que obviamente no es saludable. Podrías beberla, pero te envenenaría."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "portion of tainted bone marrow"
msgid_plural "portions of tainted bone marrow"
msgstr[0] "porción de médula ósea contaminada"
msgstr[1] "porciones de médula ósea contaminada"
msgstr[2] "porciones de médula ósea contaminada"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Description of "portion of tainted bone marrow"
msgid ""
"A wet, green chunk of spongy goop extracted from a rotten bone.  You could "
"eat it, but it will poison you."
msgstr ""
"Un trozo verde y húmedo de una sustancia esponjosa extraída de un hueso "
"podrido. Puedes comerlo, pero te intoxicará."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "chunk of tainted fat"
msgid_plural "chunks of tainted fat"
msgstr[0] "pedazo de grasa contaminada"
msgstr[1] "pedazos de grasa contaminada"
msgstr[2] "pedazos de grasa contaminada"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Description of "chunk of tainted fat"
msgid ""
"A watery yellow glob of fat from some unnatural creature or other.  You could "
"eat it, but it will poison you."
msgstr ""
"Un glóbulo de grasa acuosa, amarillenta, de alguna criatura no natural o de "
"otra cosa. Te la puedes comer, pero te va a envenenaría."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "tainted tallow"
msgid_plural "tainted tallow"
msgstr[0] "sebo contaminado"
msgstr[1] "sebos contaminados"
msgstr[2] "sebos contaminados"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Description of "tainted tallow"
msgid ""
"A smooth grayish block of cleaned and rendered monster fat.  It will remain "
"'fresh' for a very long time, and can be used as an ingredient in many "
"projects.  You could eat it, but it will poison you."
msgstr ""
"Un bloque liso y grisáceo de grasa de monstruo limpiada y procesada. Se "
"mantendrá \"fresco\" durante mucho tiempo, y puede utilizarse como "
"ingrediente en muchos proyectos. Puedes comerlo, pero te envenenaría."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "large boiled stomach"
msgid_plural "large boiled stomachs"
msgstr[0] "estómago hervido grande"
msgstr[1] "estómagos hervidos grandes"
msgstr[2] "estómagos hervidos grandes"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Description of "large boiled stomach"
msgid "A boiled stomach from an animal, nothing else.  It looks all but appetizing."
msgstr "Un estómago hervido de un animal. Parece muchas cosas excepto apetecible."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "boiled large human stomach"
msgid_plural "boiled large human stomachs"
msgstr[0] "estómago humano hervido grande"
msgstr[1] "estómagos humanos hervidos grandes"
msgstr[2] "estómagos humanos hervidos grandes"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Description of "boiled large human stomach"
msgid ""
"A boiled stomach from a large humanoid creature, nothing else.  It looks all "
"but appetizing."
msgstr ""
"Un estómago hervido de una criatura humanoide grande. Parece muchas cosas "
"excepto apetecible."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "boiled stomach"
msgid_plural "boiled stomachs"
msgstr[0] "estómago hervido"
msgstr[1] "estómagos hervidos"
msgstr[2] "estómagos hervidos"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Description of "boiled stomach"
msgid ""
"A small boiled stomach from an animal, nothing else.  It looks all but "
"appetizing."
msgstr ""
"Un estómago pequeño y hervido de un animal. Parece muchas cosas excepto "
"apetecible."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "boiled human stomach"
msgid_plural "boiled human stomachs"
msgstr[0] "estómago humano hervido"
msgstr[1] "estómagos humanos hervidos"
msgstr[2] "estómagos humanos hervidos"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Description of "boiled human stomach"
msgid ""
"A small boiled stomach from a human, nothing else.  It looks all but "
"appetizing."
msgstr ""
"Un estómago pequeño hervido de un humano. Parece muchas cosas excepto "
"apetecible."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "raw hide"
msgid_plural "raw hide"
msgstr[0] "pellejo crudo"
msgstr[1] "pellejos crudos"
msgstr[2] "pellejos crudos"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Description of "raw hide"
msgid ""
"A carefully folded raw skin harvested from an animal.  You can cure it for "
"storage and tanning, or eat it if you're desperate enough."
msgstr ""
"Un pellejo crudo de animal cuidadosamente doblado. Lo puedes curar para "
"almacenarlo y para curtirlo, o te lo puedes comer si estás muy desesperado."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "tainted hide"
msgid_plural "tainted hide"
msgstr[0] "pellejo contaminado"
msgstr[1] "pellejos contaminados"
msgstr[2] "pellejos contaminados"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Description of "tainted hide"
msgid ""
"A carefully folded raw skin harvested from an unnatural creature.  The smell "
"of rot is overwhelming, and it has an ghastly unnatural feeling with a wide "
"variety of cuts, divots, and malformed lumps covering the sickly green-gray "
"skin.  This can't be used for anything useful."
msgstr ""
"Una piel cruda cuidadosamente doblada, extraída de una criatura antinatural. "
"El olor a podredumbre es insoportable, y tiene un aspecto espantoso y "
"antinatural, con una gran variedad de cortes, hendiduras y bultos deformes "
"que cubren la piel de un color verde grisáceo enfermizo. No se puede utilizar "
"para nada útil."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "tainted skin scraps"
msgid_plural "tainted skin scraps"
msgstr[0] "resto de piel contaminada"
msgstr[1] "restos de piel contaminada"
msgstr[2] "restos de piel contaminada"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Description of "tainted skin scraps"
msgid ""
"Shredded scraps of raw skin from an unnatural creature.  It can't have much "
"use."
msgstr ""
"Trozos desmenuzados de piel cruda de una criatura antinatural. No puede tener "
"mucha utilidad."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "raw human skin"
msgid_plural "raw human skin"
msgstr[0] "piel humana cruda"
msgstr[1] "pieles humanas crudas"
msgstr[2] "pieles humanas crudas"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Description of "raw human skin"
msgid ""
"A carefully folded raw skin harvested from a human.  Despite some dubious "
"historical accounts, the usefulness of human skin is limited, and can't be "
"made into leather.  The skin is still edible, if you're that desperate."
msgstr ""
"Una piel cruda cuidadosamente doblada extraída de un ser humano. A pesar de "
"algunos relatos históricos dudosos, la utilidad de la piel humana es limitada "
"y no se puede convertir en cuero. La piel sigue siendo comestible, si estás "
"tan desesperado."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "raw demihuman skin"
msgid_plural "raw demihuman skin"
msgstr[0] "piel demihumana cruda"
msgstr[1] "pieles demihumanas crudas"
msgstr[2] "pieles demihumanas crudas"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Description of "raw demihuman skin"
msgid ""
"A carefully folded raw skin harvested from a demihuman.  Despite being from a "
"human-enough body, the leather has this distinct unnatural and alien feeling "
"to it, and would be a very poor substitute for leather.  The skin is still "
"edible, if you're that desperate."
msgstr ""
"Una piel cruda cuidadosamente doblada, obtenida de un demihumano. A pesar de "
"proceder de un cuerpo lo suficientemente humano, el cuero tiene un aspecto "
"claramente antinatural y extraño, y sería un sustituto muy pobre del cuero. "
"La piel sigue siendo comestible, si estás tan desesperado."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "raw pelt"
msgid_plural "raw pelt"
msgstr[0] "pelaje crudo"
msgstr[1] "pelajes crudos"
msgstr[2] "pelajes crudos"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Description of "raw pelt"
msgid ""
"A carefully folded raw skin harvested from a fur-bearing animal.  It still "
"has the fur attached.  You can cure it for storage and tanning, or eat it if "
"you're desperate enough."
msgstr ""
"Una piel cruda cuidadosamente doblada de un animal con pelaje. Todavía tiene "
"el pelaje pegado. La puedes curar para almacenarla y para curtirla, o te la "
"puedes comer si estás muy desesperado."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "tainted pelt"
msgid_plural "tainted pelt"
msgstr[0] "pelaje contaminado"
msgstr[1] "pelajes contaminados"
msgstr[2] "pelajes contaminados"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Description of "tainted pelt"
msgid ""
"A carefully folded raw pelt harvested from an unnatural creature.  The smell "
"of rot is overwhelming, with bits of flesh cling to the mangy, sickly patches "
"of fur still present on the pelt.  This can't be used for anything useful."
msgstr ""
"Una piel cruda cuidadosamente doblada, obtenida de una criatura antinatural. "
"El olor a podredumbre es insoportable, con trozos de carne adheridos a los "
"parches de pelaje sarnoso y enfermizo que aún quedan en la piel. Esto no se "
"puede utilizar para nada útil."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "raw human pelt"
msgid_plural "raw human pelt"
msgstr[0] "piel humana cruda"
msgstr[1] "pieles humanas crudas"
msgstr[2] "pieles humanas crudas"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Description of "raw human pelt"
msgid ""
"A carefully folded raw skin harvested from a fur-bearing mutant human.  It "
"still has the fur attached.  You can cure it for storage and tanning, or eat "
"it if you're desperate enough."
msgstr ""
"Una piel cruda cuidadosamente doblada de un humano mutante con pelaje. "
"Todavía tiene el pelaje pegado. La puedes curar para almacenarla y para "
"curtirla, o te la puedes comer si estás muy desesperado."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/flesh.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/flesh.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "seeping heart"
msgid_plural "seeping hearts"
msgstr[0] "corazón filtrante"
msgstr[1] "corazones filtrantes"
msgstr[2] "corazones filtrantes"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/flesh.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/flesh.json
#. ~ Description of "seeping heart"
msgid ""
"A thick mass of flesh superficially resembling a mammalian heart.  It's the "
"size of your fist and covered in dimpled grooves."
msgstr ""
"Una gruesa masa de carne que se parece superficialmente a un corazón de "
"mamífero. Tiene el tamaño de un puño y está cubierto de surcos."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "putrid heart"
msgid_plural "putrid hearts"
msgstr[0] "corazón putrefacto"
msgstr[1] "corazones putrefactos"
msgstr[2] "corazones putrefactos"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Description of "putrid heart"
msgid ""
"A thick, hulking mass of flesh that's easily the size of your head, "
"superficially resembling a mammalian heart and covered in ribbed grooves.  "
"It's still full of whatever passes for blood in jabberwocks, and is heavy in "
"your hands.  After everything you've seen lately, you can't help but remember "
"old sayings about eating the hearts of your enemies…"
msgstr ""
"Una masa de carne gruesa y grande, del tamaño de tu cabeza, que se asemeja a "
"un corazón de mamífero y está cubierta de estrías. Todavía está lleno de lo "
"que sea que pasa por sangre en los jabberwocks, y es pesado en tus manos. "
"Después de todo lo que has visto últimamente, no puedes evitar recordar "
"viejos dichos sobre comer los corazones de tus enemigos..."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "desiccated putrid heart"
msgid_plural "desiccated putrid hearts"
msgstr[0] "corazón putrefacto disecado"
msgstr[1] "corazones putrefactos disecados"
msgstr[2] "corazones putrefactos disecados"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Description of "desiccated putrid heart"
msgid ""
"A huge strip of muscle - all that remains of a putrid heart that has been "
"sliced open and drained of blood.  It could be eaten if you're hungry, but "
"looks *disgusting*."
msgstr ""
"Una enorme franja de músculo - todo lo que queda de un corazón putrefacto que "
"ha sido cortado y drenado de sangre. Podría ser comido si tienes hambre, pero "
"parece *repugnante*."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "reverberating organ"
msgid_plural "reverberating organs"
msgstr[0] "órgano reverberante"
msgstr[1] "órganos reverberantes"
msgstr[2] "órganos reverberantes"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Description of "reverberating organ"
msgid ""
"A tubular leathery organ of an alien creature, comprised of tough muscle "
"tissue.  Dozens of deep ridges make up the slimy surface, like a disgusting "
"rendition of an accordion."
msgstr ""
"Órgano tubular correoso de una criatura alienígena, compuesto por tejido "
"muscular resistente. Decenas de profundas estrías conforman su superficie "
"viscosa, como una repugnante interpretación de un acordeón."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "alien grub"
msgid_plural "alien grubs"
msgstr[0] "larva alienígena"
msgstr[1] "larvas alienígenas"
msgstr[2] "larvas alienígenas"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Description of "alien grub"
msgid ""
"A segmented chitinous shell with curious markings is sheltering a weird alien "
"larva, squirming and wiggling around.  Theorizing what it could eventually "
"turn into, you're unsure if it is safe to keep around."
msgstr ""
"Un caparazón quitinoso segmentado con curiosas marcas esconde una extraña "
"larva alienígena que se retuerce y se contonea. Mientras especulas sobre en "
"qué podría convertirse, no estás seguro de si es seguro tenerlo cerca."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "alien fronds"
msgid_plural "alien fronds"
msgstr[0] "fronda alienígena"
msgstr[1] "frondas alienígenas"
msgstr[2] "frondas alienígenas"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Description of "alien fronds"
msgid ""
"The fleshy fronds harvested from an alien plant.  Eating these membranous "
"leaves and gut-like stems is likely a terrible idea, and yet they have a "
"paradoxically pleasant and inviting sweet smell.  Might be non-vegan."
msgstr ""
"Las frondas carnosas cosechadas de una planta alienígena. Comer estas hojas "
"membranosas y tallos similares a las tripas es probablemente una idea "
"terrible, y sin embargo tienen un paradójicamente agradable y atractivo olor "
"dulce. Podría no ser vegetariano."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "leech flower"
msgid_plural "leech flowers"
msgstr[0] "flor sanguijuela"
msgstr[1] "flores sanguijuelas"
msgstr[2] "flores sanguijuelas"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Description of "leech flower"
msgid ""
"The alien beauty of this indigo flower is betrayed by its disgustingly fleshy "
"composition.  What from afar appear to be petals are but layered membranes of "
"transparent veiny flesh, given color by a covering of blue iridescent ichor.  "
"Even if it is certainly poisonous, it has a pleasant medicinal smell to it."
msgstr ""
"La belleza alienígena de esta flor índigo es traicionada por su asquerosa "
"composición carnosa. Lo que desde lejos parecen ser pétalos no son más que "
"membranas en capas de carne venosa transparente, a la que le da color una "
"cubierta de ícor azul iridiscente. Aunque es ciertamente venenosa, tiene un "
"agradable olor medicinal."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "leech flower"
msgid "Even a close smell of this alien flower feels deeply intoxicating."
msgstr "Con solo oler de cerca esta flor extraterrestre se nota que es muy tóxica."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "leech bark"
msgid_plural "scraps of leech bark"
msgstr[0] "trozo de corteza sanguijuela"
msgstr[1] "trozos de corteza sanguijuela"
msgstr[2] "trozos de corteza sanguijuela"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Description of "leech bark"
msgid ""
"Dry and tough bark matter harvested from an alien plant.  It is slightly "
"translucent, and if placed against the light you can distinguish glistening "
"blue veins running through it."
msgstr ""
"Materia de corteza seca y dura cosechada de una planta alienígena. Es "
"ligeramente translúcida, y si se coloca a contraluz se pueden distinguir las "
"brillantes venas azules que la atraviesan."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "demihuman stomach"
msgid_plural "demihuman stomachs"
msgstr[0] "estómago demihumano"
msgstr[1] "estómagos demihumanos"
msgstr[2] "estómagos demihumanos"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Description of "demihuman stomach"
msgid "The stomach of an intelligent demihuman.  It is surprisingly durable."
msgstr "El estómago de un demihumano inteligente. Es sorprendentemente resistente."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "large demihuman stomach"
msgid_plural "large demihuman stomachs"
msgstr[0] "estómago demihumano grande"
msgstr[1] "estómagos demihumanos grandes"
msgstr[2] "estómagos demihumanos grandes"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "chunk of demihuman fat"
msgid_plural "chunks of demihuman fat"
msgstr[0] "trozo de grasa demihumana"
msgstr[1] "trozos de grasa demihumana"
msgstr[2] "trozos de grasa demihumana"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Description of "chunk of demihuman fat"
msgid "Raw fat harvested from a demihuman body."
msgstr "Grasa cruda cosechada de un cuerpo demihumano."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "demihuman tallow"
msgid_plural "demihuman tallow"
