#: data/json/items/comestibles/drink.json
#. ~ Description of "sweetened coffee substitute with milk"
msgid ""
"The morning ritual of the post-apocalyptic world.  Brewed from the Kentucky "
"coffeetree, this drink has no actual caffeine, but serves as a replacement "
"for those who dearly miss the aroma of real coffee.  Can also be served cold "
"as iced coffee."
msgstr ""
"El ritual matutino del mundo postapocalíptico. Elaborada a partir del árbol "
"del café de Kentucky, esta bebida no contiene cafeína, pero sirve como "
"sustituto para aquellos que echan mucho de menos el aroma del café auténtico. "
"También se puede servir fría como café helado."

