msgstr "Estos huevos flotan en largos filamentos, a la deriva en el agua tranquila."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
#. ~ Description of "cluster of frog's eggs"
msgid "A spiral strand of frog eggs adorns a patch of underwater vegetation."
msgstr "Una espiral de huevos de rana adorna un trozo de vegetación bajo el agua.."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
#. ~ Description of "cluster of frog's eggs"
msgid ""
"A loose grouping of surprisingly few frog's eggs, anchored to submerged "
"vegetation."
msgstr ""
"Un grupo disperso de sorprendentemente pocos huevos de rana, anclados a la "
"vegetación sumergida."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
#. ~ Description of "cluster of frog's eggs"
msgid "A small patch of frog's eggs rests on the water's surface."
msgstr "Un pequeño grupo de huevos de rana descansa sobre la superficie del agua."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
#. ~ Description of "cluster of frog's eggs"
msgid ""
"A tight, spherical cluster of eggs, often found near submerged vegetation.  "
"This cluster is polar, with dark pigment collected near the tops of the eggs "
"and white left on the underside."
msgstr ""
"Un grupo compacto y esférico de huevos, que suele encontrarse cerca de la "
"vegetación sumergida. Este grupo es polar, con pigmento oscuro acumulado "
"cerca de la parte superior de los huevos y blanco en la parte inferior."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
#. ~ Description of "cluster of frog's eggs"
msgid ""
"A globular mass of frog's eggs.  The individual eggs are colored a dark brown "
"on top and a yellow-cream on the bottom."
msgstr ""
"Una masa globular de huevos de rana. Los huevos individuales son de color "
"marrón oscuro en la parte superior y amarillo cremoso en la parte inferior."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
#. ~ Description of "cluster of frog's eggs"
msgid "A thin sheet of clear, gelatinous eggs with dark embryos peppered throughout."
msgstr ""
"Una fina lámina de huevos transparentes y gelatinosos salpicados de embriones "
"oscuros."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
#. ~ Description of "cluster of frog's eggs"
msgid ""
"This softball-sized mass of gooey eggs clings together like a bunch of soft, "
"transparent grapes.  The \"seeds\" inside these appear to be growing legs."
msgstr ""
"Esta masa de huevos pegajosos del tamaño de una pelota de softball se "
"aglutina como un racimo de uvas blandas y transparentes. Las 'semillas' que "
"hay en su interior parecen estar desarrollando patas."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
#. ~ Description of "cluster of frog's eggs"
msgid ""
"Several short strands of tightly clustered black eggs connected together by "
"their viscous coverings."
msgstr ""
"Varias cadenas cortas de huevos negros muy agrupados, unidos entre sí por sus "
"cubiertas viscosas."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
#. ~ Item name
