msgstr[1] "grupos de huevos de rana gigante"
msgstr[2] "grupos de huevos de rana gigante"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
#. ~ Description of "cluster of giant frog's eggs"
msgid ""
"A large clump of very large frog eggs.  They're gelatinous, transparent and "
"larger than even chicken's eggs."
msgstr ""
"Un gran grupo de huevos de rana muy grandes. Son gelatinosos, transparentes y "
"más grandes incluso que los huevos de gallina."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
#. ~ Description of "cluster of giant frog's eggs"
msgid ""
"From a distance you could mistake it for a cluster of gigantic caviar.  It is "
"only on close inspection that you can make out the faint translucence of "
"these softball-sized frog eggs."
msgstr ""
"Desde lejos, se podría confundir con un racimo de caviar gigante. Solo al "
"observarlo de cerca se puede apreciar la tenue translucidez de estos huevos "
"de rana del tamaño de una pelota de béisbol."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
#. ~ Description of "cluster of giant frog's eggs"
msgid ""
"A thick flotilla of enormous frog eggs floats together atop the water in a "
"roughly circular mass."
msgstr ""
"Una espesa flotilla de enormes huevos de rana flota junta sobre el agua "
"formando una masa más o menos circular."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
#. ~ Description of "cluster of giant frog's eggs"
msgid ""
"Looking like a submerged buoy-line, this long strand of softball-sized, "
"gelatinous eggs floats gently in the still water."
msgstr ""
"Con el aspecto de una boya sumergida, esta larga cadena de huevos gelatinosos "
"del tamaño de una pelota de softball flota suavemente en el agua tranquila."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
#. ~ Description of "cluster of giant frog's eggs"
msgid ""
"This is a spiral strand of giant frog eggs.  Its increased weight and size "
"nearly smothers the submerged vegetation it clings to."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una cadena en espiral de huevos de rana gigantes. Su gran peso y "
"tamaño casi asfixia a la vegetación sumergida a la que se aferra."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
#. ~ Description of "cluster of giant frog's eggs"
msgid "A patch of giant frog's eggs resembling a very thick, clear sack of oranges."
msgstr ""
"Una mancha de huevos de rana gigantes que se asemeja a un saco de naranjas "
"muy grueso y transparente."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
#. ~ Description of "cluster of giant frog's eggs"
msgid "These golfball-sized frog eggs cling together by their sticky membranes."
msgstr ""
"Estos huevos de rana, del tamaño de una pelota de golf, se adhieren entre sí "
"gracias a sus membranas pegajosas."

