msgstr[0] "paella valenciana"
msgstr[1] "paellas valencianas"
msgstr[2] "paellas valencianas"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "Valencian paella"
msgid ""
"A traditional dish originating from Spain, more specifically from the region "
"of Valencia.  A very tasty and filling dish made traditionally of rabbit, "
"beans, rice, chicken, spices and sometimes snails."
msgstr ""
"Un plato tradicional de España, específicamente de la región de Valencia.  Es "
"muy sabroso, sustancioso y está hecho tradicionalmente con conejo, judías, "
"arroz, pollo, especias y a veces caracoles."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "escargot"
msgid_plural "escargot"
msgstr[0] "caracol"
msgstr[1] "caracoles"
msgstr[2] "caracoles"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "escargot"
msgid ""
"A traditional dish originating from France, more specifically from the region "
"of Bourgogne.  It consists of prepared snails that have then been cooked in "
"butter and parsley inside their own shells, very low on fat but high on "
"protein."
msgstr ""
"Un plato tradicional de Francia, específicamente de la región de Borgoña.  "
"Consiste en caracoles que han sido cocinados en manteca y perejil dentro de "
"sus propios caparazones.  Es muy bajo en grasa pero alto en proteínas."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "kiymali pide"
msgid_plural "kiymali pide"
msgstr[0] "kiymali pide"
msgstr[1] "kiymali pide"
msgstr[2] "kiymali pide"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "kiymali pide"
msgid ""
"Turkish flatbread topped with ground lamb or beef mixed with peppers, onions, "
"and tomatoes."
msgstr ""
"Pan plano turco cubierto con carne picada de cordero o ternera mezclada con "
"pimientos, cebollas y tomates."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "lahmacun"
msgid_plural "lahmacuns"
msgstr[0] "lahmacun"
msgstr[1] "lahmacuns"
msgstr[2] "lahmacuns"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "lahmacun"
msgid ""
"Turkish flatbread topped with minced meat, minced vegetables, and herbs "
"including onions, garlic, tomatoes, red peppers, and parsley, flavored with "
"spices such as chili pepper and paprika, then baked."
msgstr ""
"Pan plano turco cubierto de carne picada, verduras picadas y hierbas como "
"cebolla, ajo, tomate, pimiento rojo y perejil, aromatizado con especias como "
"guindilla y pimentón, y luego horneado."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "iskender kebab"
msgid_plural "iskender kebab"
msgstr[0] "iskender kebab"
msgstr[1] "iskender kebab"
msgstr[2] "iskender kebab"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "iskender kebab"
msgid ""
"A Turkish dish that consists of sliced döner kebab meat topped with hot "
"tomato sauce over pieces of pita bread and generously slathered with melted "
"special sheep's milk butter and yogurt."
msgstr ""
"Un plato turco que consiste en rodajas de carne de döner kebab cubiertas con "
"salsa de tomate picante sobre trozos de pan de pita y generosamente untadas "
"con mantequilla especial de leche de oveja derretida y yogur."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "manti"
msgid_plural "manti"
msgstr[0] "manti"
msgstr[1] "manti"
msgstr[2] "manti"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "manti"
msgid ""
"Dumplings that typically consist of a spiced meat mixture, usually lamb or "
"ground beef, wrapped in a thin dough sheet which is then boiled or steamed."
msgstr ""
"Dumplings que suelen consistir en una mezcla de carne condimentada, "
"normalmente cordero o ternera picada, envuelta en una fina lámina de masa que "
"luego se hierve o se cuece al vapor."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sarma"
msgid_plural "sarma"
msgstr[0] "sarma"
msgstr[1] "sarma"
msgstr[2] "sarma"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "sarma"
msgid ""
"A traditional Turkish dish prepared by rolling rice and minced meat in grape "
"leaves."
msgstr ""
"Un plato tradicional turco que se prepara enrollando arroz y carne picada en "
"hojas de parra."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "fried chicken"
msgid_plural "fried chicken"
msgstr[0] "pollo frito"
msgstr[1] "pollo frito"
msgstr[2] "pollo frito"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "fried chicken"
msgid "A delicious golden-brown serving of crispy fried chicken."
msgstr "Una deliciosa ración de pollo frito crujiente y dorado."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "buttermilk fried chicken"
msgid_plural "buttermilk fried chicken"
msgstr[0] "pollo frito con suero de leche"
msgstr[1] "pollo frito con suero de leche"
msgstr[2] "pollo frito con suero de leche"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "buttermilk fried chicken"
msgid ""
"Brined in buttermilk, seasoned and breaded to perfection, and fried until "
"crispy and golden.  This fried chicken is so good you can almost forget about "
"the end of the world.  Vinegar leg is on the right!"
msgstr ""
"Marinado en suero de leche, sazonado y empanado a la perfección, y frito "
"hasta quedar crujiente y dorado. Este pollo frito está tan bueno que casi te "
"hace olvidar el fin del mundo. ¡La pata con vinagre está a la derecha!"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "tandoori chicken"
msgid_plural "tandoori chickens"
msgstr[0] "pollo tandoori"
msgstr[1] "pollo tandoori"
msgstr[2] "pollo tandoori"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "tandoori chicken"
msgid ""
"Originating from Punjabi cuisine, this deep-red and spicy baked chicken is "
"marinated with a yogurt-based sauce and is traditionally baked directly on "
"the walls of a wood-fired clay oven."
msgstr ""
"Originario de la cocina punjabi, este pollo al horno de color rojo intenso y "
"picante se marina con una salsa a base de yogur y se hornea tradicionalmente "
"directamente sobre las paredes de una cocina de barro alimentado con leña."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Hinanese chicken rice"
msgid_plural "Hinanese chicken rice"
msgstr[0] "arroz con pollo de Hinanese"
msgstr[1] "arroz con pollo de Hinanese"
msgstr[2] "arroz con pollo de Hinanese"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "Hinanese chicken rice"
msgid ""
"This delicious serving of poached chicken with rice is one of the national "
"dishes of Singapore."
msgstr ""
"Este delicioso plato de pollo escalfado con arroz es uno de los platos "
"nacionales de Singapur."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "chicken parmesan"
msgid_plural "chicken parmesan"
msgstr[0] "pollo a la parmesana"
msgstr[1] "pollos a la parmesana"
msgstr[2] "pollos a la parmesana"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "chicken parmesan"
msgid ""
"A classic Italian-American dish of breaded and fried chicken atop a bed of "
"pasta, enrobed with tomato sauce and cheese."
msgstr ""
"Un plato clásico italo-americano de pollo empanado y frito sobre un lecho de "
"pasta, recubierto de salsa de tomate y queso."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "scrapple"
msgid_plural "scrapple"
msgstr[0] "scrapple"
msgstr[1] "scrapple"
msgstr[2] "scrapple"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
#. ~ Description of "scrapple"
msgid ""
"A dry mush of meat scraps and grain, sliced and pan-fried; better than it "
"sounds and looks.  A staple food of the Mid-Atlantic United States."
msgstr ""
"Una papilla seca de restos de carne y cereales, cortados en rodajas y fritos "
"en sartén; mejor de lo que parece y suena. Un alimento básico del Atlántico "
"Medio de Estados Unidos."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "melatonin tablet"
msgid_plural "melatonin tablets"
msgstr[0] "tableta de melatonina"
msgstr[1] "tabletas de melatonina"
msgstr[2] "tabletas de melatonina"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Description of "melatonin tablet"
msgid ""
"An over-the-counter melatonin supplement, commonly prescribed to treat sleep "
"deprivation and to mitigate its effects.  One tablet a day combined with a "
"good night's sleep will help you recover faster."
msgstr ""
"Un suplemento de melatonina de venta libre, comúnmente prescrito para tratar "
"la falta de sueño y mitigar sus efectos. Un comprimido al día combinado con "
"una buena noche de sueño te ayudará a recuperarte más rápido."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "melatonin tablet"
msgid "You pop a melatonin tablet."
msgstr "Partes una tableta de melatonina."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "prescription stimulant"
msgid_plural "prescription stimulant"
msgstr[0] "estimulante de prescripción"
msgstr[1] "estimulantes de prescripción"
msgstr[2] "estimulantes de prescripción"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Description of "prescription stimulant"
#. ~ Description of variant "Adderall" of item "prescription stimulant"
msgid ""
"Medical-grade amphetamine salts mixed with dextroamphetamine salts, commonly "
"prescribed to treat hyperactive attention deficits.  It suppresses the "
"appetite, and is quite addictive."
msgstr ""
"Sales de anfetamina de grado médico mezcladas con sales de dextroanfetamina, "
"comúnmente recetadas para tratar el déficit de atención hiperactivo. Suprime "
"el apetito y es bastante adictivo."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "prescription stimulant"
msgid "Adderall"
msgid_plural "Adderall"
msgstr[0] "Adderall"
msgstr[1] "Adderall"
msgstr[2] "Adderall"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "epinephrine autoinjector"
msgid_plural "epinephrine autoinjectors"
msgstr[0] "autoinyector de epinefrina"
msgstr[1] "autoinyectores de epinefrina"
msgstr[2] "autoinyectores de epinefrina"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Description of "epinephrine autoinjector"
msgid ""
"A syringe filled with a shot of epinephrine, also called adrenalin.  It "
"serves as a powerful stimulant when you inject yourself with it.  Asthmatics "
"can use it in an emergency to clear an asthma attack."
msgstr ""
"Una jeringa rellena con una dosis de epinefrina, también denominada "
"adrenalina.  Cuando te lo inyectas funciona como un poderoso estimulante.  "
"Los asmáticos pueden usarlo en una emergencia para mejorar un ataque de asma."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "epinephrine autoinjector"
msgid "You inject yourself with the injector."
msgstr "Te inyectas con el inyector."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "antibiotics"
msgid_plural "antibiotics"
msgstr[0] "antibióticos"
msgstr[1] "antibióticos"
msgstr[2] "antibioticos"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Description of "antibiotics"
msgid ""
"Antibacterial medication designed to prevent or stop the spread of infection. "
" It's the safest way to cure any infections you might have.  One dose lasts "
"twelve hours."
msgstr ""
"Un medicamento antibacterial vendido bajo receta, usado para prevenir o "
"detener una infección. Es la manera más segura de curar las infecciones que "
"puedas haber contraído. Una dosis dura doce horas."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "antifungal drug"
msgid_plural "antifungal drug"
msgstr[0] "medicina antihongos"
msgstr[1] "medicinas antihongos"
msgstr[2] "medicinas antihongos"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Description of "antifungal drug"
msgid ""
"A powerful chemical tablet designed to eliminate fungal infections in living "
"creatures.  One dose lasts four hours."
msgstr ""
"Potente comprimido químico diseñado para eliminar las infecciones fúngicas en "
"seres vivos. Una dosis dura 4 horas."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "antiparasitic drug"
msgid_plural "antiparasitic drug"
msgstr[0] "medicamento antiparasitario"
msgstr[1] "medicamento antiparasitario"
msgstr[2] "medicamento antiparasitario"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Description of "antiparasitic drug"
msgid ""
"A broad-spectrum chemical tablet designed to eliminate parasitic infestations "
"in living creatures.  Though designed for use on pets and livestock, it will "
"likely work on humans as well."
msgstr ""
"Un comprimido químico de amplio espectro, diseñada para eliminar las plagas "
"parasitarias en los seres vivos.  A pesar de estar diseñada para las mascotas "
"y el ganado, también puede funcionar en humanos."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "aspirin"
msgid_plural "aspirins"
msgstr[0] "aspirina"
msgstr[1] "aspirinas"
msgstr[2] "aspirinas"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Description of "aspirin"
msgid ""
"Acetylsalicylic acid, a mild anti-inflammatory and blood thinner.  Take to "
"relieve pain and swelling.  Careful - it can increase bleeding."
msgstr ""
"Ácido acetilsalicílico, antiinflamatorio suave y anticoagulante. Tómelo para "
"aliviar el dolor y la hinchazón. Cuidado: puede aumentar las hemorragias."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "ibuprofen"
msgid_plural "ibuprofen"
msgstr[0] "ibuprofeno"
msgstr[1] "ibuprofenos"
msgstr[2] "ibuprofenos"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Description of "ibuprofen"
msgid "Ibuprofen, a mild NSAID-based painkiller.  Take to relieve pain and swelling."
msgstr ""
"Ibuprofeno, un analgésico suave a base de AINE. Tomar para aliviar el dolor y "
"la inflamación."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "naproxen"
msgid_plural "naproxen"
msgstr[0] "naproxeno"
msgstr[1] "naproxenos"
msgstr[2] "naproxenos"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Description of "naproxen"
msgid ""
"Naproxen, a mild long-lasting NSAID-based painkiller.  Take to relieve pain "
"and swelling."
msgstr ""
"Naproxeno, un analgésico suave de media duración basado en AINE. Ingerir para "
"aliviar el dolor y la inflamación."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "acetaminophen"
msgid_plural "acetaminophen"
msgstr[0] "paracetamol"
msgstr[1] "paracetamoles"
msgstr[2] "paracetamoles"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Description of "acetaminophen"
msgid ""
"Acetaminophen, a mild painkiller that works well in conjunction with "
"NSAID-based painkillers like aspirin.  Take to relieve pain and swelling."
msgstr ""
"Paracetamol o acetaminofén, un analgésico suave que funciona bien en "
"combinación con analgésicos a base de AINE como la aspirina. Tomar para "
"aliviar el dolor y la inflamación."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "metaprolol"
msgid_plural "metaprolol"
msgstr[0] "metaprolol"
msgstr[1] "metaprolol"
msgstr[2] "metaprolol"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Description of "metaprolol"
msgid ""
"Metaprolol, a classic beta blocker.  It lowers blood pressure and decouples "
"heart rate from stressful events such as anxiety or pain."
msgstr ""
"Metaprolol, un betabloqueante clásico. Reduce la presión arterial y desacopla "
"la frecuencia cardíaca de eventos estresantes como la ansiedad o el dolor."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "antiseptic powder"
msgid_plural "antiseptic powder"
msgstr[0] "polvo antiséptico"
msgstr[1] "polvo antiséptico"
