msgstr[1] "sueños de amapola"
msgstr[2] "sueños de amapola"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#. ~ Description of "poppy sleep"
msgid ""
"A potent sleep aid extracted from mutated poppy seeds.  Effective, but as an "
"opiate it can be addictive."
msgstr ""
"Un potente somnífero extraído de semillas de amapolas mutadas. Eficaz, pero "
"como opiáceo puede ser adictivo."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
