msgstr[1] "puñados de moras"
msgstr[2] "puñados de moras"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Description of "handful of mulberries"
msgid ""
"This red variety of mulberries is unique to eastern North America, and is "
"said to have the strongest flavor of any variety in the world."
msgstr ""
"Esta variedad roja de las moras es única del este de Estados Unidos, y se "
"dice que tiene el sabor más fuerte de todas las variedades del mundo."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "handful of elderberries"
msgid_plural "handfuls of elderberries"
msgstr[0] "puñado de bayas del saúco"
msgstr[1] "puñados de bayas del saúco"
msgstr[2] "puñados de bayas del saúco"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Description of "handful of elderberries"
msgid "A handful of elderberries, toxic when eaten raw but great when cooked."
msgstr ""
"Un puñado de bayas del saúco, tóxicas cuando se comen crudas pero están "
"buenísimas cuando se cocinan."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "handful of nannyberries"
msgid_plural "handfuls of nannyberries"
msgstr[0] "puñado de bayas de viburno"
msgstr[1] "puñados de bayas de viburno"
msgstr[2] "puñados de bayas de viburno"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Description of "handful of nannyberries"
msgid "Some dark blue nannyberries, tasting like prunes mixed with banana."
msgstr ""
"Algunas bayas de viburno de color azul oscuro, saben como ciruelas pasas "
"mezcladas con plátano."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "handful of tupelo fruits"
msgid_plural "handfuls of tupelo fruits"
msgstr[0] "puñado de frutas tupelo"
msgstr[1] "puñados de frutas tupelo"
msgstr[2] "puñados de frutas tupelo"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Description of "handful of tupelo fruits"
msgid ""
"Some dark blue tupelo fruits.  They are tart and feature a hard seed but are "
"still enjoyable."
msgstr ""
"Algunos frutos de tupelo azul oscuro. Son ácidos y tienen una semilla dura, "
"pero siguen siendo agradables."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "handful of chokeberries"
msgid_plural "handfuls of chokeberries"
msgstr[0] "puñado de aronias"
msgstr[1] "puñados de aronias"
msgstr[2] "puñados de aronias"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Description of "handful of chokeberries"
msgid ""
"A handful of black chokeberries.  They look similar to blackcurrant.  Big and "
"juicy but actually exceedingly sour."
msgstr ""
"Un puñado de aronias negras. Son parecidos a las grosellas negras. Grandes y "
"jugosas, pero en realidad extremadamente ácidas."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "handful of rose hips"
msgid_plural "handfuls of rose hips"
msgstr[0] "puñado de escaramujos"
msgstr[1] "puñados de escaramujos"
msgstr[2] "puñados de escaramujos"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Description of "handful of rose hips"
msgid ""
"A handful of fruits grown from pollinated rose flowers.  Full of irritating "
"hairs and hard seeds, they'll need to be disassembled before eating."
msgstr ""
"Un puñado de frutos cultivados a partir de flores de rosa polinizadas. Llenos "
"de pelos irritantes y semillas duras, hay que deshacerlos antes de comerlos."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cut rose hips"
msgid_plural "cut rose hips"
msgstr[0] "escaramujos cortados"
msgstr[1] "escaramujos cortados"
msgstr[2] "escaramujos cortados"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Description of "cut rose hips"
msgid ""
"Tart little fruits grown from a rose bush, now separated from their inedible "
"seeds and spines."
msgstr ""
"Pequeñas frutas ácidas que crecen en un rosal, ahora separadas de sus "
"semillas no comestibles y espinas."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "juice pulp"
msgid_plural "juice pulp"
msgstr[0] "pulpa de zumo"
msgstr[1] "pulpa de zumo"
msgstr[2] "pulpa de zumo"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Description of "juice pulp"
msgid ""
"A handful of stringy pulp, left-over from juicing some kind of fruit.  It's "
"not very tasty, but contains a lot of healthy fiber."
msgstr ""
"Un puñado de pulpa fibrosa que quedó después de hacer jugo con alguna fruta. "
"No es muy sabrosa pero contiene mucha fibra saludable."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pear"
msgid_plural "pears"
msgstr[0] "pera"
msgstr[1] "peras"
msgstr[2] "peras"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Description of "pear"
msgid "A juicy, bell-shaped pear.  Yum!"
msgstr "Un pera, jugosa, con forma de campana. ¡Rica!"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "guava"
msgid_plural "guavas"
msgstr[0] "guayaba"
msgstr[1] "guayabas"
msgstr[2] "guayabas"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Description of "guava"
msgid ""
"A sweet, sandy-textured fruit with pink flesh native to the Caribbean, "
"Central America, and South America.  Great for making milkshakes."
msgstr ""
"Una fruta dulce y de textura arenosa con la pulpa rosa, nativa del Caribe, "
"América Central y América del Sur. Genial para hacer batidos."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "handful of passionfruit"
msgid_plural "handfuls of passionfruit"
msgstr[0] "puñado de frutas de la pasión"
msgstr[1] "puñados de frutas de la pasión"
msgstr[2] "puñados de frutas de la pasión"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Description of "handful of passionfruit"
msgid ""
"A sweet, acidic fruit originating from South America.  It grows on vines and "
"is filled with seeds like a pomegranate.  Also known as the maracuya."
msgstr ""
"Una fruta dulce y ácida originaria de Sudamérica. Crece en enredaderas y está "
"llena de semillas como la granada. También se conoce como maracuyá."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "lulo"
msgid_plural "lulos"
msgstr[0] "lulo"
msgstr[1] "lulos"
msgstr[2] "lulos"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Description of "lulo"
msgid ""
"An acidic fruit found in South America and the Caribbean, it looks like a "
"hairy orange and is used mainly for juice and desserts.  Also known as the "
"naranjilla."
msgstr ""
"Una fruta agria que se encuentra en América del Sur y el Caribe. Parece una "
"naranja peluda y es utilizada principalmente para hacer zumo y postres. "
"También se la conoce como naranjilla."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "grapefruit"
msgid_plural "grapefruits"
msgstr[0] "pomelo"
msgstr[1] "pomelos"
msgstr[2] "pomelos"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Description of "grapefruit"
msgid ""
"A hybrid citrus fruit descended from the orange, whose taste ranges from sour "
"to semi-sweet, and a little bitter."
msgstr ""
"Una fruta cítrica híbrida descendiente de la naranja, cuyo gusto va desde lo "
"agrio hasta lo semidulce, y un poco amarga."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "handful of cherries"
msgid_plural "handfuls of cherries"
msgstr[0] "puñado de cerezas"
msgstr[1] "puñados de cerezas"
msgstr[2] "puñados de cerezas"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Description of "handful of cherries"
msgid ""
"A sweet red fruit that grows on trees.  If you have some time on your hands, "
"maybe you could figure out how to do that trick where you tie a knot in the "
"stem with your tongue."
msgstr ""
"Una fruta roja y dulce que crece en los árboles. Si tienes algo de tiempo, "
"quizá puedas averiguar cómo hacer ese truco de hacer un nudo en el tallo con "
"la lengua."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "plum"
msgid_plural "plums"
msgstr[0] "ciruela"
msgstr[1] "ciruelas"
msgstr[2] "ciruelas"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Description of "plum"
msgid "A large purple plum.  Tasty and good for your digestion."
msgstr "Una gran ciruela púrpura. Sabrosa y buena para la digestión."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "handful of grapes"
msgid_plural "handfuls of grapes"
msgstr[0] "puñado de uvas"
msgstr[1] "puñados de uvas"
msgstr[2] "puñados de uvas"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Description of "handful of grapes"
msgid ""
"A handful of juicy grapes.  Quite calorie-dense compared to most fruit, and "
"you might be able to make them into wine if you're ambitious enough."
msgstr ""
"Un puñado de uvas jugosas. Bastante densas en calorías en comparación con la "
"mayoría de las frutas, y podrías convertirlas en vino si eres lo "
"suficientemente ambicioso."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pineapple"
msgid_plural "pineapples"
msgstr[0] "piña"
msgstr[1] "piñas"
msgstr[2] "piñas"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Description of "pineapple"
msgid ""
"A large, spiky tropical fruit.  A tough rind protects the tasty flesh inside, "
"and digging into it as-is would be pretty inefficient and messy.  You should "
"find a knife or something vaguely knife-like to cut it up with."
msgstr ""
"Una fruta tropical grande y puntiaguda. Una corteza dura protege la sabrosa "
"pulpa de su interior, y cortarla tal cual sería bastante ineficaz y sucio. "
"Debes encontrar un cuchillo o algo parecido para cortarla."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "handful of pineapple chunks"
msgid_plural "handfuls of pineapple chunks"
msgstr[0] "puñado de trozos de piña"
msgstr[1] "puñados de trozos de piña"
msgstr[2] "puñados de trozos de piña"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Description of "handful of pineapple chunks"
msgid ""
"A handful of pineapple chunks.  Delicious and a great source of Vitamin C, "
"though a bit sour."
msgstr ""
"Un puñado de trozos de piña. Deliciosa y una gran fuente de vitamina C, "
"aunque un poco amarga."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "coconut"
msgid_plural "coconuts"
msgstr[0] "coco"
msgstr[1] "cocos"
msgstr[2] "cocos"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Description of "coconut"
msgid ""
"A tropical fruit with a hard, hairy shell and a hollow inside full of liquid "
"and edible flesh.  If you want to eat it, you'll have to find something heavy "
"to crack open the shell and something sharp to remove the 'meat'."
msgstr ""
"Una fruta tropical con una cáscara dura y peluda y un interior hueco lleno de "
"líquido y carne comestible. Si quieres comerla, tendrás que encontrar algo "
"pesado para abrir la cáscara y algo afilado para extraer la 'carne'."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "handful of coconut flesh"
msgid_plural "handfuls of coconut flesh"
msgstr[0] "puñado de pulpa de coco"
msgstr[1] "puñados de pulpa de coco"
msgstr[2] "puñados de pulpa de coco"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Description of "handful of coconut flesh"
msgid "A handful of coconut flesh.  It's surprisingly calorie-dense."
msgstr "Un puñado de pulpa de coco. Sorprendentemente denso en calorías."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "peach"
msgid_plural "peaches"
msgstr[0] "melocotón"
msgstr[1] "melocotones"
msgstr[2] "melocotones"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Description of "peach"
msgid "This fruit's large pit is surrounded by its tasty flesh."
msgstr "La gran semilla de esta fruta está rodeada por una pulpa sabrosa."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "watermelon"
msgid_plural "watermelons"
msgstr[0] "sandía"
msgstr[1] "sandías"
msgstr[2] "sandías"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Description of "watermelon"
msgid ""
"A deep green melon, bigger than your head.  It is very juicy!  You should be "
"able to take it apart with a knife."
msgstr ""
"Un melón verde intenso, más grande que tu cabeza. ¡Es muy jugoso!. Se puede "
"trocear con un cuchillo."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "watermelon wedge"
msgid_plural "watermelon wedges"
msgstr[0] "cuña de sandía"
msgstr[1] "cuñas de sandías"
msgstr[2] "cuñas de sandías"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Description of "watermelon wedge"
msgid "A yummy wedge of watermelon.  A handheld snack that tastes like summer."
msgstr "Una deliciosa porción de sandía. Un tentempié que sabe a verano."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cantaloupe melon"
msgid_plural "cantaloupe melons"
msgstr[0] "cantalupo"
msgstr[1] "cantalupos"
msgstr[2] "cantalupos"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Description of "cantaloupe melon"
msgid ""
"A large and very sweet orange fruit.  Technically a berry, like all melons "
"are.  You should be able to take it apart with a knife."
msgstr ""
"Una fruta grande y muy dulce de color naranja. Técnicamente es una baya, como "
"todos los melones. Deberías poder desmenuzarla con un cuchillo."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "handful of cantaloupe melon chunks"
msgid_plural "handfuls of cantaloupe melon chunks"
msgstr[0] "puñado de trozos de melón cantalupo"
msgstr[1] "puñados de trozos de melón cantalupo"
msgstr[2] "puñados de trozos de melón cantalupo"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Description of "handful of cantaloupe melon chunks"
msgid ""
"A handful of cantaloupe melon chunks.  A great snack by itself or in a fruit "
"salad."
msgstr ""
"Un puñado de trozos de melón cantalupo. Un aperitivo genial por si mismo o en "
"una ensalada de fruta."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "handful of blackberries"
msgid_plural "handfuls of blackberries"
msgstr[0] "puñado de zarzamoras"
msgstr[1] "puñados de zarzamoras"
msgstr[2] "puñados de zarzamoras"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Description of "handful of blackberries"
msgid ""
"A darker cousin of the raspberry.  The color isn't actually what sets them "
"apart - the identifying characteristic is whether the stem stays connected to "
"the fruit when it's first picked."
msgstr ""
"Un primo más oscuro de la frambuesa. El color no es lo que las diferencia, "
"sino que la característica que las identifica es que el tallo permanece unido "
"a la fruta cuando se recoge por primera vez."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "mango"
msgid_plural "mangos"
msgstr[0] "mango"
msgstr[1] "mangos"
msgstr[2] "mangos"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Description of "mango"
msgid ""
"A fleshy tropical fruit with a large pit.  Better enjoy it soon, you're "
"pretty sure more of these aren't going to be imported for a long time."
msgstr ""
"Una fruta tropical carnosa con un gran hueso. Más vale que la disfrutes "
"pronto, seguro que no se van a importar más de estas en mucho tiempo."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pomegranate"
msgid_plural "pomegranates"
msgstr[0] "granada"
msgstr[1] "granadas"
msgstr[2] "granadas"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Description of "pomegranate"
msgid "Under this pomegranate's spongy skin lie hundreds of fleshy seeds."
msgstr ""
"Bajo la piel esponjosa de esta granada se esconden cientos de semillas "
"jugosas."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "papaya"
msgid_plural "papayas"
msgstr[0] "papaya"
msgstr[1] "papayas"
msgstr[2] "papayas"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Description of "papaya"
msgid "A very sweet and soft tropical fruit."
msgstr "Una fruta tropical muy dulce y suave."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "kiwi"
msgid_plural "kiwis"
msgstr[0] "kiwi"
msgstr[1] "kiwis"
msgstr[2] "kiwis"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Description of "kiwi"
msgid "A large, brown, and fuzzy-skinned berry.  Its delicious insides are green."
msgstr ""
"Es una baya grande, de color marrón y con exterior peludo. Su delicioso "
"interior es verde."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "handful of apricots"
