"<color_yellow>6 RDS 84MM HEDP</color>"
msgstr ""
"Una gran caja metálica. En un lado tiene la etiqueta \"EXPLOSIVO\" y en otro "
"está escrito:\n"
"\n"
"6 RDS 84 MM HEDP"

#: data/json/items/containers/military.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "wooden crate"
msgid_plural "wooden crates"
msgstr[0] "caja de madera"
msgstr[1] "cajas de madera"
msgstr[2] "cajas de madera"

#: data/json/items/containers/military.json
#. ~ Description of "wooden crate"
msgid "Huge wooden crate, closed with metal wire."
msgstr "Enorme caja de madera, cerrada con alambre metálico."

#: data/json/items/containers/military.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "wooden crate"
msgid "72 40mm ammo crate"
msgid_plural "72 40mm ammo crates"
msgstr[0] "caja de 72 municiones de 40 mm"
msgstr[1] "cajas de 72 municiones de 40 mm"
msgstr[2] "cajas de 72 municiones de 40 mm"

#: data/json/items/containers/military.json
#. ~ Description of variant "72 40mm ammo crate" of item "wooden crate"
msgid ""
"Huge wooden crate, closed with metal wire.  Front side has printed:\n"
"<color_yellow>1310-00-992-0451 B546\n"
"72 CARTRIDGE COMP A-5\n"
"40 MM HEDP M433</color>"
msgstr ""
"Caja de madera grande, cerrada con alambre de metal. En la parte delantera "
"está impreso:\n"
"<color_yellow>1310-00-992-0451 B546\n"
"72 CARTUCHO COMP A-5\n"
"40 MM HEDP M433</color>"

#: data/json/items/containers/military.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cardboard ammo box"
msgid_plural "cardboard ammo boxes"
msgstr[0] "cajas de munición de cartón"
msgstr[1] "cajas de municiones de cartón"
msgstr[2] "cajas de municiones de cartón"

#: data/json/items/containers/military.json
#. ~ Description of "cardboard ammo box"
msgid "A small brown box without a cover."
msgstr "Una pequeña caja marrón sin tapa."

#: data/json/items/containers/military.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "collapsible drum"
msgid_plural "collapsible drums"
msgstr[0] "bidón plegable"
msgstr[1] "bidones plegables"
msgstr[2] "bidones plegables"

#: data/json/items/containers/military.json
#. ~ Description of "collapsible drum"
msgid ""
"A beige collapsible drum with a water valve and D-Rings.  Text on its top "
"clearly says \"POTABLE WATER ONLY\"."
msgstr ""
"Un bidón plegable de color beige con una válvula de agua y anillas en D. En "
"la parte superior se lee claramente \"SOLO AGUA POTABLE\"."

#: data/json/items/containers/military.json
#. ~ Description of "big collapsible drum"
msgid ""
"A black collapsible drum with a valve and D-Rings.  Yellow text on its top "
"clearly says \"FLAMMABLE\".  Empty and collapsed, it could be moved elsewhere."
msgstr ""
"Un bidón plegable negro con una válvula y anillas en D. En la parte superior, "
"un texto amarillo indica claramente \"INFLAMABLE\". Vacío y plegado, se puede "
"trasladar a otro lugar."

#: data/json/items/corpses/corpses.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "corpse"
msgid_plural "corpses"
msgstr[0] "cadáver"
msgstr[1] "cadáveres"
msgstr[2] "cadáveres"

#: data/json/items/corpses/corpses.json
#. ~ Description of "corpse"
msgid "A dead body."
msgstr "Es un cadáver."

#: data/json/items/corpses/corpses.json
#. ~ Conditional name for "corpse" when FLAG matches FIELD_DRESS
#. ~ Conditional name for "corpse" when FLAG matches FIELD_DRESS_FAILED
msgid "carcass"
msgid_plural "carcasses"
msgstr[0] "carcasa"
msgstr[1] "carcasas"
msgstr[2] "carcasas"

#: data/json/items/corpses/corpses.json
#. ~ Conditional name for "corpse" when FLAG matches SKINNED
#, c-format
msgid "skinned %s"
msgid_plural "skinned %s"
msgstr[0] " %sdespellejado"
msgstr[1] "%s despellejado"
msgstr[2] "%s despellejado"

#: data/json/items/corpses/corpses.json
#. ~ Conditional name for "corpse" when FLAG matches QUARTERED
msgid "carcass quarter"
msgid_plural "carcass quarters"
msgstr[0] "cuarto de carcasa"
msgstr[1] "cuartos de carcasa"
msgstr[2] "cuartos de carcasa"

#: data/json/items/corpses/corpses.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "desiccated corpse"
msgid_plural "desiccated corpses"
msgstr[0] "cadáver disecado"
msgstr[1] "cadáveres disecados"
msgstr[2] "cadáveres disecados"

#: data/json/items/corpses/corpses.json
#. ~ Description of "desiccated corpse"
msgid ""
"A badly mangled human body.  A giant puncture wound is visible on its upper "
"chest, and something has drained most of the moisture from the carcass, "
"leaving it desiccated and making it impossible to determine the body's age."
msgstr ""
"Un cuerpo humano gravemente mutilado. En la parte superior del tórax se "
"aprecia una herida punzante gigante y algo ha drenado la mayor parte de la "
"humedad del cadáver, dejándolo desecado y haciendo imposible determinar su "
"edad."

#: data/json/items/corpses/corpses.json
#. ~ Description of "corpse"
msgid "A lifeless human body."
msgstr "Un cuerpo humano sin vida."

#: data/json/items/corpses/corpses.json
#. ~ Description of "corpse"
msgid "A dead body of a middle-aged man."
msgstr "Un cuerpo muerto de un hombre de mediana edad."

#: data/json/items/corpses/corpses.json
#. ~ Description of "corpse"
msgid "A dead body of a young woman."
msgstr "El cuerpo muerto de una joven."

#: data/json/items/corpses/corpses.json
#. ~ Description of "corpse"
msgid "A dead body of a little boy."
msgstr "El cuerpo muerto de un niño pequeño."

#: data/json/items/corpses/corpses.json
#. ~ Description of "corpse"
msgid "A dead body of a little girl."
msgstr "El cuerpo muerto de una niña pequeña."

#: data/json/items/corpses/corpses.json
#. ~ Description of "corpse"
msgid ""
"The dead body of a small child.  Their corpse bears a calm facial expression, "
"as if they died instantly."
msgstr ""
"El cadáver de un niño pequeño. Su cadáver tiene una expresión facial "
"tranquila, como si hubiera muerto al instante."

#: data/json/items/corpses/corpses.json
#. ~ Description of "corpse"
#. ~ Snippet of item "corpse"
msgid ""
"The dead body of a child, riddled by bullets to the extent that you can no "
"longer tell their gender."
msgstr ""
"El cadáver de un niño, acribillado por las balas hasta el punto de que ya no "
"se puede saber su sexo."

#: data/json/items/corpses/corpses.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "corpse"
msgid ""
"The corpse of an infant.  A single small-caliber bullet has been put through "
"its skull."
msgstr ""
"El cadáver de un bebé. Una sola bala de pequeño calibre le ha atravesado el "
"cráneo."

#: data/json/items/corpses/corpses.json
#. ~ Description of "corpse"
msgid ""
"A dead body of an old woman.  Both of her earlobes are torn, several of her "
"fingers have been chopped off, and several of her teeth have been knocked out."
msgstr ""
"Un cuerpo sin vida de una anciana. Tiene desgarrados los lóbulos de las "
"orejas, le han cortado varios dedos y le han arrancado varios dientes."

#: data/json/items/corpses/corpses.json
#. ~ Description of "corpse"
msgid "A dead body, coated in congealed blood."
msgstr "Es un cadáver cubierto de sangre coagulada."

#: data/json/items/corpses/corpses.json
#. ~ Description of "corpse"
msgid ""
"A dead body with a frightful grimace on its face.  He appears to have been "
"horribly mangled prior to his death."
msgstr ""
"Un cadáver con una mueca espantosa. Parece haber sido horriblemente "
"destrozado antes de su muerte."

#: data/json/items/corpses/corpses.json
#: data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/items/corpses/mythos.json
#. ~ Description of "corpse"
#. ~ Description of "deep one corpse"
msgid "An awful, almost unidentifiable mass of charred flesh."
msgstr "Una horrible, casi inidentificable masa de carne carbonizada."

#: data/json/items/corpses/corpses.json
#. ~ Description of "corpse"
#. ~ Snippet of item "corpse"
msgid "A dead body with a gaping stab wound in its back."
msgstr "Un cadáver con una puñalada abierta en la espalda."

#: data/json/items/corpses/corpses.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "corpse"
msgid ""
"The bloody corpse of a young man.  He has been stabbed repeatedly in the "
"jugular and throat with a small blade."
msgstr ""
"El cadáver ensangrentado de un hombre joven. Ha sido apuñalado repetidamente "
"en la yugular y la garganta con una pequeña cuchilla."

#: data/json/items/corpses/corpses.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "corpse"
msgid ""
"The dead body of a person.  They look to have been skewered with a large, "
"sharp implement."
msgstr ""
"El cadáver de una persona. Parece haber sido ensartado con un gran "
"instrumento afilado."

#: data/json/items/corpses/corpses.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "corpse"
msgid ""
"The corpse of a tall middle-aged woman.  She appears to have many stab wounds "
"up her legs and thighs."
msgstr ""
"El cadáver de una mujer alta de mediana edad. Parece tener muchas heridas de "
"arma blanca en las piernas y los muslos."

#: data/json/items/corpses/corpses.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "corpse"
msgid "The corpse of a small old lady, her face caked in blood and missing an eye."
msgstr ""
"El cadáver de una pequeña anciana, con el rostro cubierto de sangre y sin un "
"ojo."

#: data/json/items/corpses/corpses.json
#. ~ Description of "corpse"
#. ~ Snippet of item "corpse"
msgid ""
"The dead body of a person.  Their forehead bears a large bullet entrance "
"wound.  An even larger exit wound is present on the back of their head."
msgstr ""
"El cuerpo muerto de una persona. Su frente tiene una gran herida de entrada "
"de bala. Una herida de salida aún más grande está presente en la parte "
"posterior de su cabeza."

#: data/json/items/corpses/corpses.json
#. ~ Description of "corpse"
msgid ""
"The upper half of a dead body, as if it was torn apart with enormous force.  "
"Some organs are hanging out."
msgstr ""
"La mitad superior de un cadáver, como si hubiera sido desgarrado con una "
"fuerza enorme. Algunos órganos están colgando."

#: data/json/items/corpses/corpses.json
#: data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/items/corpses/mythos.json
#. ~ Description of "corpse"
#. ~ Description of "deep one corpse"
msgid ""
"A half-decapitated dead body.  It is unclear what could have caused such a "
"wound."
msgstr "Un cadáver medio decapitado. No está claro qué pudo haber causado tal herida."

#: data/json/items/corpses/corpses.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "corpse"
msgid ""
"The corpse of a young blonde woman shot several times in the back with a "
"low-caliber weapon."
msgstr ""
"El cadáver de una joven rubia con varios disparos en la espalda de un arma de "
"bajo calibre."

#: data/json/items/corpses/corpses.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "corpse"
msgid ""
"An androgynous-looking corpse gored by bullet wounds from chest to thighs, "
"leaving the face eerily pristine."
msgstr ""
"Un cadáver de aspecto andrógino atravesado por disparos desde el pecho hasta "
"los muslos, dejando el rostro inquietantemente impoluto."

#: data/json/items/corpses/corpses.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "corpse"
msgid ""
"The corpse of a seemingly older man.  He appears to have been shot in the "
"forehead at very close range, leaving you a good view of his brain matter."
msgstr ""
"El cadáver de un hombre aparentemente mayor. Parece haber recibido un disparo "
"en la frente a muy corta distancia, lo que te deja una buena visión de su "
"masa encefálica."

#: data/json/items/corpses/corpses.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "corpse"
msgid ""
"The corpse of a middle-aged woman, her legs and arms covered in blood.  She "
"appears to have been shot in the thigh."
msgstr ""
"El cadáver de una mujer de mediana edad, con las piernas y los brazos "
"cubiertos de sangre. Parece que le han disparado en el muslo."

#: data/json/items/corpses/corpses.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "corpse"
msgid ""
"The corpse of a young man who appears to have been shot to death.  His right "
"arm is only barely still attached to his shoulder."
msgstr ""
"El cadáver de un joven que parece haber muerto de un disparo. Su brazo "
"derecho está apenas unido a su hombro."

#: data/json/items/corpses/corpses.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "corpse"
msgid ""
"The corpse of a tall woman unblemished but for the bloody hole atop her head, "
"her thick black hair intermixed now with brain, viscera and shotgun pellets."
msgstr ""
"El cadáver de una mujer alta, inmaculada salvo por el sangriento agujero "
"sobre su cabeza, su espesa cabellera negra entremezclada ahora con sesos, "
"vísceras y perdigones de escopeta."

#: data/json/items/corpses/corpses.json
#. ~ Description of "corpse"
msgid ""
"The dead body of a person.  There is a bloody bite wound on their forearm.  "
"Dry filth surrounds it."
msgstr ""
"El cadáver de una persona. En su antebrazo hay una herida sangrante por "
"mordedura. Lo rodea suciedad seca."

#: data/json/items/corpses/corpses.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "corpse"
msgid ""
"The dead body of a person.  There is a bloody bite wound on their forearm.  "
"Dry filth surrounds it but the body seems otherwise unharmed."
msgstr ""
"El cadáver de una persona. Tiene una herida sangrante en el antebrazo. Está "
"rodeado de suciedad, pero por lo demás el cuerpo parece ileso."

#: data/json/items/corpses/corpses.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "corpse"
msgid ""
"One of this deceased persons shoulders is disfigured by a deep bite wound "
"with a distinct shape, obviously caused by a human."
msgstr ""
"Uno de los hombros de esta persona fallecida está desfigurado por una "
"profunda herida de mordedura con una forma distintiva, obviamente causada por "
"un humano."

#: data/json/items/corpses/corpses.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "corpse"
msgid ""
"This unlucky fellow has a deep, straight cut wound on their hand.  The "
"blackened veins suggest it got infected."
msgstr ""
"Este desafortunado hombre tiene una herida profunda y recta en la mano. Las "
"venas ennegrecidas sugieren que se infectó."

#: data/json/items/corpses/corpses.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "corpse"
msgid ""
"This lifeless body is covered in myriads of uneven scratches.  Some of them "
"look pretty swollen."
msgstr ""
"Este cuerpo sin vida está cubierto de innumerables arañazos irregulares. "
"Algunos de ellos parecen bastante hinchados."

#: data/json/items/corpses/corpses.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/corpses.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/corpses.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "mummified corpse"
msgid_plural "mummified corpses"
msgstr[0] "cadáver momificado"
msgstr[1] "cadáveres momificados"
msgstr[2] "cadáveres momificados"

#: data/json/items/corpses/corpses.json
#. ~ Description of "mummified corpse"
msgid "Waxen skin drapes the remnants of an unknowable death."
msgstr "La piel encerada cubre los restos de una muerte desconocida."

#: data/json/items/corpses/dead_exodii.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mod_interactions/defense_mode/monster_corpses.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "broken Exodii worker"
msgid_plural "broken Exodii workers"
msgstr[0] "trabajador Exodii roto"
msgstr[1] "trabajadores Exodii rotos"
msgstr[2] "trabajadores Exodii rotos"

#: data/json/items/corpses/dead_exodii.json
#. ~ Description of "broken Exodii worker"
msgid "A broken Exodii worker.  It's possible it could be gutted for parts."
msgstr "Un trabajador Exodii roto. Se podría desmontar para recuperar sus partes."

#: data/json/items/corpses/dead_exodii.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/corpses.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mod_interactions/defense_mode/monster_corpses.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "broken Exodii quadruped"
msgid_plural "broken Exodii quadrupeds"
msgstr[0] "cuadrúpedo Exodii roto"
msgstr[1] "cuadrúpedos Exodii rotos"
msgstr[2] "cuadrúpedos Exodii rotos"

#: data/json/items/corpses/dead_exodii.json
#. ~ Description of "broken Exodii quadruped"
msgid ""
"A broken Exodii walker.  Still looks intimidating despite being permanently "
"inoperative, possibly due to the sheer size and mass.  Could be gutted for "
"parts."
msgstr ""
"Un caminante Exodii roto. Sigue teniendo un aspecto intimidante a pesar de "
"estar permanentemente inoperativo, posiblemente debido a su gran tamaño y "
"masa. Se podría desmontar para recuperar sus partes."

#: data/json/items/corpses/dead_exodii.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "broken Exodii turret"
msgid_plural "broken Exodii turrets"
msgstr[0] "torreta Exodii rota"
msgstr[1] "torretas Exodii rotas"
msgstr[2] "torretas Exodii rotas"

#: data/json/items/corpses/dead_exodii.json
#. ~ Description of "broken Exodii turret"
msgid ""
"A broken Exodii turret.  Still looks intimidating despite being permanently "
"inoperative, possibly due to the sheer size and mass.  Could be gutted for "
"parts."
msgstr ""
"Una torreta Exodii rota. Sigue pareciendo intimidante a pesar de estar "
"permanentemente inoperativa, posiblemente debido a su gran tamaño y masa. Se "
"podría desmontar para recuperar sus partes."

#: data/json/items/corpses/dead_exodii.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "broken Exodii balloon-drone"
msgid_plural "broken Exodii balloon-drones"
msgstr[0] "globodrón Exodii roto"
msgstr[1] "globodrones Exodii rotos"
msgstr[2] "globodrones Exodii rotos"

#: data/json/items/corpses/dead_exodii.json
#. ~ Description of "broken Exodii balloon-drone"
msgid ""
"A broken balloon drone.  The balloon has been shredded, but most of the "
"chassis is still intact.  Could be gutted for parts."
msgstr ""
"Un globodrón roto. El globo ha sido destrozado, pero la mayor parte del "
"chasis sigue intacto. Se podría desmontar para recuperar sus partes."

#: data/json/items/corpses/dead_yrax.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "trifacet remains"
msgid_plural "trifacet remains"
msgstr[0] "restos tricara"
msgstr[1] "restos tricara"
msgstr[2] "restos tricara"

#: data/json/items/corpses/dead_yrax.json
#. ~ Description of "trifacet remains"
msgid ""
"A split-open facet reveals an interior full of closely-fit geometric "
"primitives among chipped strips of milk-white quartz.  The composition of "
"parts lends you no clues as to how this machine ever functioned."
msgstr ""
"Una faz abierta completamente revela su interior lleno de primitivas figuras "
"geométricas incrustadas entre pedazos astillados de cuarzo blanco como la "
"leche. La composición de sus partes no te da ninguna pista de cómo funcionaba "
"esta máquina."

#: data/json/items/corpses/dead_yrax.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "triakis remains"
msgid_plural "triakis remains"
msgstr[0] "restos de triakis"
msgstr[1] "restos de triakis"
msgstr[2] "restos de triakis"

#: data/json/items/corpses/dead_yrax.json
#. ~ Description of "triakis remains"
msgid ""
"Its broken shell reveals an interior made from a single piece of quartz, "
"intricately carved into a series of nested tetrahedra."
msgstr ""
"Su caparazón roto revela un interior hecho de una sola pieza de cuarzo, "
"intrincadamente tallada en una serie de tetraedros anidados."

#: data/json/items/corpses/dead_yrax.json data/json/monsters/yrax.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Monster name
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "golden monolith"
msgid_plural "golden monoliths"
msgstr[0] "monolito dorado"
msgstr[1] "monolito dorados"
msgstr[2] "monolito dorados"

#: data/json/items/corpses/dead_yrax.json
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json data/json/monsters/yrax.json
#. ~ Description of "golden monolith"
#. ~ Description of "inactive golden monolith"
#. ~ Description of monster "golden monolith"
msgid ""
"A large golden monolith.  Carefully carved asymmetric edges betray its "
"artificial origin."
msgstr ""
"Un gran monolito dorado. Los bordes asimétricos cuidadosamente tallados "
"delatan su origen artificial."

#: data/json/items/corpses/dead_yrax.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "inert delta"
msgid_plural "inert deltas"
msgstr[0] "delta inerte"
msgstr[1] "deltas inertes"
msgstr[2] "deltas inertes"

#: data/json/items/corpses/dead_yrax.json
#. ~ Description of "inert delta"
msgid ""
"A small piece of inscrutable alloy shaped like an arrow's broadhead.  It "
"doesn't look like much of a robot once dead."
msgstr ""
"Una pequeña pieza de una aleación indescifrable con forma de punta de flecha "
"ancha. No parece un verdadero robot una vez muerto."

#: data/json/items/corpses/dead_yrax.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "inert quadraphract leg"
msgid_plural "inert quadraphract legs"
msgstr[0] "pata cuadrafracte inerte"
msgstr[1] "patas cuadrafractes inertes"
msgstr[2] "patas cuadrafractes inertes"

#: data/json/items/corpses/dead_yrax.json
#. ~ Description of "inert quadraphract leg"
msgid ""
"A great sickle-shaped leg, slumped and lifeless.  The metal is cold to the "
"touch, and its near invisible joints are locked in place."
msgstr ""
"Una gran pata en forma de hoz, desplomada y sin vida. El metal está frío al "
"tacto y sus juntas, casi invisibles, están bloqueadas en su sitio."

#: data/json/items/corpses/dead_yrax.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "inert quadraphract"
msgid_plural "inert quadraphracts"
msgstr[0] "cuadrafracte inerte"
msgstr[1] "cuadrafractes inertes"
msgstr[2] "cuadrafractes inertes"

#: data/json/items/corpses/dead_yrax.json
#. ~ Description of "inert quadraphract"
msgid ""
"A great carved piece of gold and crystal, slumped in the form of an unearthly "
"arachnid."
msgstr ""
"Una magnífica pieza tallada en oro y cristal, con forma de arácnido "
"sobrenatural."

#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "inactive EMP hack"
msgid_plural "inactive EMP hacks"
msgstr[0] "PEM-hack inactivo"
msgstr[1] "PEM-hacks inactivos"
msgstr[2] "PEM-hacks inactivos"

#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
#. ~ Description of "inactive EMP hack"
msgid ""
"An inactive EMP hack.  Manhacks are fist-sized robots that fly through the "
"air.  This one contains an EMP grenade and attacks by flying at its target "
"and detonating.  Use this item to reprogram and release the EMP hack.  "
"Electronics and computer skill determines if the targeting matrix is "
"reprogrammed successfully."
msgstr ""
"Un hack PEM inactivo. Los manhacks son robots del tamaño de un puño que "
"vuelan por el aire. Este contiene una granada PEM y ataca volando hacia su "
"objetivo y detonándola. Usa este objeto para reprogramar y liberar el hack "
"PEM. La habilidad en electrónica e informática determina si la matriz de "
"objetivos se reprograma correctamente."

#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
#. ~ "friendly_msg" action message of item "inactive EMP hack"
msgid "The EMP hack flies from your hand and surveys the area!"
msgstr "¡El PEM-hack vuela desde tu mano e inspecciona el área!"

