msgstr[1] "desatascadores de inodoros"
msgstr[2] "desatascadores de inodoros"

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Description of "toilet plunger"
msgid "A rubber-tipped tool for unclogging pipes, or a club for an immature survivor."
msgstr ""
"Una herramienta con punta de goma para desatascar tuberías, o un garrote para "
"un superviviente inmaduro."

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "professional plunger"
msgid_plural "professional plungers"
msgstr[0] "desatascador profesional"
msgstr[1] "desatascadores profesionales"
msgstr[2] "desatascadores profesionales"

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Description of "professional plunger"
msgid ""
"This hollow plastic toilet plunger's bell compresses like an accordion.  It "
"is efficient at its intended purpose, and complete rubbish as a weapon."
msgstr ""
"La campana de este desatascador de inodoro de plástico hueco se comprime como "
"un acordeón. Es eficiente en su propósito, y una completa basura como arma."

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "toilet paper"
msgid_plural "rolls of toilet paper"
msgstr[0] "rollo de papel higiénico"
msgstr[1] "rollos de papel higiénico"
msgstr[2] "rollos de papel higiénico"

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Description of "toilet paper"
msgid "A luxurious remnant of civilization."
msgstr "Un lujoso remanente de la civilización."

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "toilet paper"
msgid ""
"Imagine the thinnest, most disposable paper you could possibly make.  Now "
"imagine something thinner than that."
msgstr ""
"Imagina el papel más delgado y desechable que podrías hacer. Ahora imagina "
"algo más delgado que eso."

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "toilet paper"
msgid ""
"This roll of toilet paper is two-ply and quilted, for vandalizing houses more "
"comfortably than ever."
msgstr ""
"Este rollo de papel higiénico tiene dos capas y está acolchado, para que el "
"vandalismo en las casas sea más cómodo que nunca."

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "toilet paper"
msgid "This brand of toilet paper is designed to dissolve completely in water!"
msgstr ""
"¡Esta marca de papel higiénico está diseñada para disolverse completamente en "
"agua!"

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "toilet paper"
msgid "Images of your least favorite politician are printed on each individual sheet."
msgstr ""
"Las imágenes de tu político menos favorito están impresas en cada hoja "
"individual."

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "toilet paper"
msgid ""
"A luxurious remnant of civilization.  The splinters of unprocessed wood "
"visible in this one make it seem less luxurious, though."
msgstr ""
"Un lujoso remanente de la civilización. Las astillas de madera no procesada "
"visibles en este hacen que parezca menos lujoso, sin embargo."

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "hair dryer"
msgid_plural "hair dryers"
msgstr[0] "secador de pelo"
msgstr[1] "secadores de pelo"
msgstr[2] "secadores de pelo"

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Description of "hair dryer"
msgid ""
"This tool dries your hair by pushing air through a coil of hot wires.  The "
"heat can be toggled on and off."
msgstr ""
"Esta herramienta seca el pelo impulsando aire a través de una bobina de "
"alambres calientes. El calor se puede activar y desactivar."

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "curling iron"
msgid_plural "curling irons"
msgstr[0] "rizador de pelo"
msgstr[1] "rizadoras de pelo"
msgstr[2] "rizadoras de pelo"

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Description of "curling iron"
msgid ""
"A wand made of heat-resistant ceramics.  When plugged into an outlet, it is "
"hot enough to shape your hair into curls.  Too bad the power's out."
msgstr ""
"Una varita hecha de cerámica resistente al calor. Cuando se enchufa en un "
"tomacorriente, está lo suficientemente caliente como para dar forma a tu "
"cabello en rizos. Lástima que no haya electricidad."

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "toilet brush"
msgid_plural "toilet brushes"
msgstr[0] "escobilla de baño"
msgstr[1] "escobillas de baño"
msgstr[2] "escobillas de baño"

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Description of "toilet brush"
msgid ""
"Zombies cannot be intimidated or humiliated, so this stiff brush is only "
"useful for scouring toilet bowls."
msgstr ""
"Los zombis no pueden ser intimidados o humillados, por lo que este cepillo "
"rígido sólo es útil para fregar las tazas de baño."

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "lice comb"
msgid_plural "lice combs"
msgstr[0] "peine para piojos"
msgstr[1] "peines para piojos"
msgstr[2] "peines para piojos"

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Description of "lice comb"
msgid ""
"A stainless-steel comb with spiral grooved teeth designed to remove pesky "
"parasites from hair.  Even just thinking about it makes you itch."
msgstr ""
"Un peine de acero inoxidable con los dientes estriados diseñados para quitar "
"parásitos molestos del pelo. De solo pensar en eso te pica la cabeza."

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "bath toy"
msgid_plural "bath toys"
msgstr[0] "juguete de baño"
msgstr[1] "juguetes de baño"
msgstr[2] "juguetes de baño"

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Description of "bath toy"
#. ~ Snippet of item "bath toy"
msgid "A plastic floating bath toy."
msgstr "Un juguete de baño flotante de plástico."

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "bath toy"
msgid "A yellow rubber duck.  Designed to dropped in the bath."
msgstr "Un pato de goma amarillo. Diseñado para ser usado en la bañera."

#: data/json/items/generic/bathroom_house.json
#. ~ Snippet of item "bath toy"
