msgid ""
"Designed by HS Produkt in Croatia, the HS2000 has become a commercial success "
"for Springfield Armory, who imports and markets it as the eXtreme Duty.  The "
"XD has since been offered in a variety of chamberings and sizes, including "
"this full-sized match grade variant in 10mm Auto."
msgstr ""
"Diseñada por HS Produkt en Croacia, la HS2000 se ha convertido en un éxito "
"comercial para Springfield Armory, que la importa y comercializa como eXtreme "
"Duty. Desde entonces, el XD se ha ofrecido en una variedad de recámaras y "
"tamaños, incluyendo esta variante de tamaño completo en 10mm Auto."

