#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
#. ~ Description of gun ".22 1911 pistol"
#. ~ Description of ".22 1911 pistol"
msgid "A 1911 in .22 LR, with a 4 1/4\" barrel, and feeding from 10 round magazines."
msgstr ""
"Un 1911 en .22 LR, con un cañón de 10.75cm (4 1/4 pulgadas) y alimentada por "
"cargadores de 10 balas."

#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun ".22 1911 pistol"
#. ~ Variant name of item ".22 1911 pistol"
msgid "1911-22"
msgid_plural "1911-22s"
msgstr[0] "1911-22"
msgstr[1] "1911-22s"
msgstr[2] "1911-22s"

#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
#. ~ Description of variant ".22 1911 pistol" of gun "1911-22"
#. ~ Description of variant "1911-22" of item ".22 1911 pistol"
msgid ""
"A 1911 handgun with \"1911-22\" stamped on the slide.  While .22 LR 1911s "
"were first devised as a training aid for US soldiers, it found large civilian "
"use from concealed carry to plinking thanks to the readily available "
"ammunition and familiar platform."
msgstr ""
"Una pistola 1911 con la inscripción '1911-22' estampada en la corredera. "
"Aunque los 1911 del calibre 22 LR se diseñaron en un principio como ayuda "
"para el entrenamiento de los soldados estadounidenses, se utilizaron mucho en "
"la población civil, tanto para el porte oculto como para el tiro al blanco, "
"gracias a su munición fácilmente disponible y a su conocida plataforma."

#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "small game lever-action rifle"
msgid_plural "small game lever-action rifles"
msgstr[0] "rifle de palanca de caza menor"
msgstr[1] "rifles de palanca de caza menor"
msgstr[2] "rifles de palanca de caza menor"

#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
#. ~ Description of gun "small game lever-action rifle"
#. ~ Description of "small game lever-action rifle"
msgid ""
"A .22 Long Rifle lever-action rifle, which holds 15 rounds of ammo.  While "
"quite useful against small game, its effectiveness isn't as great against the "
"undead."
msgstr ""
"Un rifle de palanca calibre .22 Long Rifle, con capacidad para 15 cartuchos. "
"Aunque resulta bastante útil contra animales pequeños, su eficacia no es tan "
"grande contra los muertos vivientes."

#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "small game lever-action rifle"
#. ~ Variant name of item "small game lever-action rifle"
