msgstr[2] "Ruger SR22s"

#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
#. ~ Description of variant ".22 plinking handgun" of gun "Ruger SR22"
#. ~ Description of variant "Ruger SR22" of item ".22 plinking handgun"
msgid ""
"A very popular handgun, the SR22 is a more conventional pistol than Ruger's "
"other famous .22 LR handguns, the Ruger Standards.  While .22 LR is still "
"capable of killing, the very short barrel brings that into question."
msgstr ""
"La SR22, una pistola muy popular, es más convencional que otras famosas "
"pistolas Ruger del calibre .22 LR, las Ruger Standards. Aunque el calibre .22 "
"LR sigue siendo letal, el cañón tan corto pone esto en duda."

