msgstr[2] "carabinas bullpup Desert Tech"

#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
#. ~ Description of gun "Desert Tech bullpup carbine"
#. ~ Description of "Desert Tech bullpup carbine"
msgid ""
"Produced by the Desert Tech gun company, this is a highly modular, "
"semi-automatic rifle of remarkably modest dimensions.  The weapon is notable "
"for the simplicity of converting it to fire a wide number of different "
"cartridges, with retool kits for .223 Remington, .308 Winchester, and .300 "
"AAC Blackout being available."
msgstr ""
"Producida por la compañía de armas Desert Tech, este rifle semi-automático, "
"altamente modular, tiene unas dimensiones modestas. El arma es notable por su "
"facilidad de conversión para el disparo de un gran número de balas "
"diferentes, con kits de reequipamiento para .223 Remington, .308 Winchester y "
".300 AAC Blackout disponibles."

#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "Desert Tech bullpup carbine"
