msgid "Desert Tech MDRX carbine"
msgid_plural "Desert Tech MDRX carbines"
msgstr[0] "carabina MDRX Desert Tech"
msgstr[1] "carabinas MDRX Desert Tech"
msgstr[2] "carabinas MDRX Desert Tech"

#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Desert Tech bullpup carbine" of gun "Desert Tech
#. MDRX carbine"
#. ~ Description of variant "Desert Tech MDRX carbine" of item "Desert Tech
#. bullpup carbine"
msgid ""
"Bringing a compact, highly modular, and soft-recoiling weapon system to the "
"table, the Desert Tech Micro Dynamic Rifle Extreme (MDRX) is a gas-operated "
"bullpup carbine originally unveiled in 2014, with this updated model of the "
"weapon having been released in 2019.  One of the rifle's most notable "
"features is the utter simplicity of swapping the carbine's chambering, with "
"an easy change of the barrel, bolt, and a handful of other components being "
"all the steps required to chamber the MDRX for either .223 Remington, .308 "
"Winchester, or .300 AAC Blackout."
msgstr ""
"El Desert Tech Micro Dynamic Rifle Extreme (MDRX), un sistema de armas "
"compacto, altamente modular y de retroceso suave, es una carabina bullpup "
"accionada por gas que se presentó originalmente en 2014, y cuyo modelo "
"actualizado se lanzó en 2019. Una de las características más notables del "
"rifle es la absoluta simplicidad de cambiar la recámara de la carabina, con "
"un fácil cambio del cañón, el cerrojo y un puñado de otros componentes siendo "
"todos los pasos necesarios para cambiar la recámara al MDRX para .223 "
"Remington, .308 Winchester o .300 AAC Blackout."

#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
