msgid "SMLE No. 1 Mk III rifle"
msgid_plural "SMLE No. 1 Mk III rifles"
msgstr[0] "rifle SMLE No. 1 Mk III"
msgstr[1] "rifles SMLE No. 1 Mk III"
msgstr[2] "rifles SMLE No. 1 Mk III"

#: data/json/items/gun/303.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Enfield battle rifle" of gun "SMLE No. 1 Mk III
#. rifle"
#. ~ Description of variant "SMLE No. 1 Mk III rifle" of item "Enfield battle
#. rifle"
msgid ""
"An English darling and icon of the First World War, the Short Magazine "
"Lee-Enfield Mk III was the standard issue battle rifle of the British "
"commonwealth from 1907.  Chambered for .303 ammunition, the rifle makes use "
"of ten-round detachable magazines.  With its full-length wooden handguard, "
"brass buttplate, and smooth action, the Lee-Enfield cuts a recognizable "
"profile in either the trenches of the Great War or the zombie-strewn "
"wastelands."
msgstr ""
"El Lee-Enfield Mk III de Cargador Corto, mimado por los ingleses e icono de "
"la Primera Guerra Mundial, fue el rifle de combate estándar de la "
"Commonwealth británica desde 1907. Con recámara para munición del .303, el "
"rifle utiliza cargadores extraibles de diez cartuchos. Con su guardamano "
"integral de madera, cantonera de latón y acción suave, el Lee-Enfield tiene "
"un perfil reconocible tanto en las trincheras de la Gran Guerra como en los "
"páramos sembrados de zombis."

#: data/json/items/gun/303.json
