msgid ""
"A semi-automatic, domestically produced clone of an early battle rifle "
"developed after the end of WWII.  Known as the PTR 91, it is a fantastically "
"reliable, cheap to produce rifle that continues to serve in conflict regions. "
" Though the action is legendary, its handling characteristics and harsher "
"recoil leave something to be desired."
msgstr ""
"Un clon semiautomático de producción nacional de uno de los primeros rifles "
"de combate desarrollados tras el final de la Segunda Guerra Mundial. Conocido "
"como el PTR 91, es un rifle fantásticamente fiable y barato de producir que "
"sigue prestando servicio en regiones en conflicto. Aunque la acción es "
"legendaria, sus características de manejo y su retroceso más duro dejan algo "
"que desear."

