msgid ""
"The M134D-H Minigun is a (relatively) lightweight heavy rotary machine gun.  "
"Its six barrels are rotated by an electric motor, powered by UPS or vehicle.  "
"If you could find enough ammo for it, it would become a devastating weapon.  "
"It must be mounted on a vehicle before use."
msgstr ""
"El Minigun M134D-H es una ametralladora rotativa (relativamente) ligera y "
"pesada. Sus seis cañones giran con un motor eléctrico, impulsado por un UPS o "
"un vehículo. Si pudieras encontrar suficiente munición para ella, se "
"convertiría en un arma devastadora. Debe ser montada en un vehículo antes de "
"su uso."

