#. caliber carbine"
msgid ""
"A pistol-caliber carbine chambered in .380 ACP, designed by Hi-Point "
"Firearms.  Its 16.5\" barrel provides extra stopping power over an equivalent "
"pistol, but .380 is still a relatively weak caliber.  Accepts 10-round "
"magazines, which are notably not interchangeable with those of CF380 pistols."
msgstr ""
"Una carabina de pistola con recámara .380 ACP, diseñada por Hi-Point "
"Firearms. Su cañón de 42cm (16.5 pulgadas) provee un poder de parada por "
"encima de una pistola equivalente, pero el .380 es un calibre relativamente "
"débil. Acepta cargadores de 10 balas, que son notablemente intercambiables "
"con las pistolas CF380."

