#: data/json/items/gun/45.json
#. ~ Description of gun ".45 WWII submachine gun"
#. ~ Description of ".45 WWII submachine gun"
msgid ""
"A WWII submachine gun, lacking semi-auto fire selector and chambered in .45 "
"ACP."
msgstr ""
"Un subfusil de la segunda guerra mundial, sin el selector de tiro "
"semiautomático y con recámara .45 ACP."

#: data/json/items/gun/45.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun ".45 WWII submachine gun"
#. ~ Variant name of item ".45 WWII submachine gun"
msgid "M3 submachine gun"
msgid_plural "M3 submachine guns"
msgstr[0] "subfusil M3"
msgstr[1] "subfusiles M3"
msgstr[2] "subfusiles M3"

#: data/json/items/gun/45.json
#. ~ Description of variant ".45 WWII submachine gun" of gun "M3 submachine
#. gun"
#. ~ Description of variant "M3 submachine gun" of item ".45 WWII submachine
#. gun"
msgid ""
"An American-made submachine gun developed during WWII as an alternative to "
"Thompson M1928A1 and used at least till early 1990s.  Simple, cheap, and "
"somewhat crude, the M3 was still quite an effective weapon, mostly made from "
"sheet metal to reduce costs and speed up production.  In times of active use, "
"it was considered as a disposable weapon, which is more expedient to replace "
"than to repair.  Unfortunately, you cannot afford such wastefulness, unlike "
"this submachine gun, which is devoid of even a fire selector for semi-auto "
"fire."
msgstr ""
"Un subfusil hecho en EEUU desarrollado durante la Segunda Guerra Mundial como "
"una alternativa a la Thompson M1928A1 y usado hasta principios de los años "
"90. Simple, barato y algo tosco, el M3 todavía es un arma efectiva, hecha "
"sobretodo con chapa para reducir el coste y acelerar la producción. Mientras "
"estuvo en servicio, se considero como una arma desechable, más fácil de "
"reemplazar que reparar. Por desgracia no te puedes permitir semejante "
"derroche, no como este subfusil, que ni siquiera tiene un selector de tiro "
"semiautomático."

#: data/json/items/gun/450bushmaster.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "Ruger American Ranch Rifle"
msgid_plural "Ruger American Ranch Rifles"
msgstr[0] "rifle Ruger American Ranch"
msgstr[1] "rifles Ruger American Ranch"
msgstr[2] "rifles Ruger American Ranch"

#: data/json/items/gun/450bushmaster.json
#. ~ Description of gun "Ruger American Ranch Rifle"
#. ~ Description of "Ruger American Ranch Rifle"
msgid ""
"A compact, magazine-fed, bolt-action hunting rifle designed and manufactured "
"with cost-effectiveness at the peak of concerns, the Ruger American Ranch "
"Rifle series caters to shooters on a budget.  Factory chambered for the "
"powerful, though short-range, .450 Bushmaster cartridge, the weapon was able "
"to stand toe-to-toe with all native North American game despite its "
"minimalist design."
msgstr ""
"Un rifle de cerrojo de caza compacto, alimentado con cargador, diseñado y "
"fabricado con la reducción de costes en mente, la serie de Rifle Ruger "
"American Ranch atrae a tiradores con bajo presupuesto. Con la recámara de "
"fábrica con el potente cartucho, aunque de corto alcance,  .450 Bushmaster, "
"este arma fue capaz de pelear de tu a tu con toda la caza nativa "
"norteamericana a pesar de su diseño minimalista."

#: data/json/items/gun/454.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
