#: data/json/items/gun/57.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "FN 5.7mm pistol"
msgid_plural "FN 5.7mm pistols"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/items/gun/57.json
#. ~ Description of gun "FN 5.7mm pistol"
#. ~ Description of "FN 5.7mm pistol"
msgid ""
"Firing the armor-piercing 5.7x28mm round, this lightweight handgun was "
"developed for NATO use as a sidearm capable of penetrating body armor.  Its "
"proprietary and nonprolific ammunition kept it comparatively rare among both "
"civilian and militant use, but the gun's ability to ignore most forms of "
"conventional ballistic armor can't be argued with.  Given that its tiny "
"bullets have next to no stopping power, its armor-penetrating capability "
"comes at a considerable trade-off."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/gun/57.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "FN 5.7mm pistol"
#. ~ Variant name of item "FN 5.7mm pistol"
msgid "FN Five-seveN pistol"
msgid_plural "FN Five-seveN pistols"
msgstr[0] "pistola FN Five-seveN"
msgstr[1] "pistolas FN Five-seveN"
msgstr[2] "pistolas FN Five-seveN"

#: data/json/items/gun/57.json
#. ~ Description of variant "FN 5.7mm pistol" of gun "FN Five-seveN pistol"
#. ~ Description of variant "FN Five-seveN pistol" of item "FN 5.7mm pistol"
msgid ""
"Designed to work with FN's proprietary 5.7x28mm round, the Five-seveN is a "
"lightweight pistol with a very high capacity, best used against armored "
"opponents."
msgstr ""
"Diseñada para trabajar con la bala 5.7x28mm de FN, la Five-seveN es una "
"pistola ligera con muy buena capacidad, y buen desempeño contra oponentes con "
"armadura."

#: data/json/items/gun/57.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "P90 automatic PDW"
msgid_plural "P90 automatic PDWs"
msgstr[0] "P90 automatic PDW"
msgstr[1] "P90 automatic PDWs"
msgstr[2] "P90 automatic PDWs"

#: data/json/items/gun/57.json
#. ~ Description of gun "P90 automatic PDW"
#. ~ Description of "P90 automatic PDW"
msgid ""
"A late 90s manufactured personal defense weapon (PDW), this automatic firearm "
"fires the high-velocity, proprietary 5.7x28mm cartridge.  Making use of "
"top-mounted 50-round custom magazines which lock into the receiver of the "
"weapon behind the grip, this little submachine gun packs quite the nasty "
"payload.  Its small, high-speed caliber makes it excellent at both defeating "
"armored opponents and firing short bursts manageably."
msgstr ""
"Esta arma de fuego automática, un arma de defensa personal (PDW) fabricada a "
"finales de los 90, dispara el cartucho patentado de 5,7x28 mm de alta "
"velocidad. Este pequeño subfusil, que utiliza cargadores personalizados de 50 "
"balas montados en la parte superior que se bloquean en el receptor del arma "
"detrás de la empuñadura, es un arma muy potente. Su pequeño calibre de alta "
"velocidad lo hace excelente tanto para derrotar a oponentes blindados como "
"para disparar ráfagas cortas de forma manejable."

#: data/json/items/gun/57.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "P90 automatic PDW"
#. ~ Variant name of item "P90 automatic PDW"
msgid "FN P90 submachine gun"
msgid_plural "FN P90 submachine guns"
msgstr[0] "subfusil FN P90"
msgstr[1] "subfusiles FN P90"
msgstr[2] "subfusiles FN P90"

#: data/json/items/gun/57.json
#. ~ Description of variant "P90 automatic PDW" of gun "FN P90 submachine gun"
#. ~ Description of variant "FN P90 submachine gun" of item "P90 automatic
#. PDW"
msgid ""
"The first in a new genre of guns, termed \"personal defense weapons.\"  FN "
"designed the P90 to use their proprietary high-velocity 5.7x28mm ammunition.  "
"Made to fulfill NATO requests for a weapon chambered in a more suitable "
"cartridge for defeating body armor than standard 9x19mm submachine guns, the "
"FN P90 is excellent at firing short and controllable bursts manageably.  The "
"PDW's small and high-speed 5.7mm ammunition, of which 50 rounds fit in the "
"P90's top mounted magazine, packs quite the lethal payload for any armored "
"opponent, whilst the firearm's bullpup design makes it commendably compact to "
"boot."
msgstr ""
"La primera de un nuevo género de armas, denominadas \"armas de defensa "
"personal\". FN diseñó la P90 para utilizar su munición propietaria de alta "
"velocidad de 5.7x28mm. Fabricada para satisfacer las peticiones de la OTAN de "
"un arma con un cartucho más adecuado para destruir el blindaje corporal en "
"lugar de sus subfusiles estándar de 9mm, la FN P90 es excelente para disparar "
"ráfagas cortas y controlables de forma manejable. La munición de alta "
"velocidad de 5.7mm de diámetro comparativamente pequeño del PDW, cabiendo "
"cómodamente 50 cartuchos en el cargador superior del P90, supone una carga "
"letal para cualquier adversario blindado, mientras que el diseño del arma en "
"forma de bullpup le confiere un tamaño compacto encomiable."

#: data/json/items/gun/57.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "high-capacity P90 handgun"
msgid_plural "high-capacity P90 handguns"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/items/gun/57.json
#. ~ Description of gun "high-capacity P90 handgun"
#. ~ Description of "high-capacity P90 handgun"
msgid ""
"A large and retro-looking semi-automatic pistol firing the high-velocity "
"5.7x28mm cartridge, mainly constructed out of polymer-based materials.  "
"Making use of standard P90 50-round magazines which are inserted horizontally "
"over the grip, the top of the gun swings forwards and away from the frame to "
"facilitate reloading.  If you were looking to add a touch of retro-futuristic "
"spice to your new life in the ruins of New England, this firearm just might "
"become your best friend."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/gun/57.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "high-capacity P90 handgun"
#. ~ Variant name of item "high-capacity P90 handgun"
msgid "Kel-Tec P50 pistol"
msgid_plural "Kel-Tec P50 pistols"
msgstr[0] "pistola Kel-Tec P50"
msgstr[1] "pistolas Kel-Tec P50"
msgstr[2] "pistolas Kel-Tec P50"

#: data/json/items/gun/57.json
#. ~ Description of variant "high-capacity P90 handgun" of gun "Kel-Tec P50
#. pistol"
#. ~ Description of variant "Kel-Tec P50 pistol" of item "high-capacity P90
#. handgun"
msgid ""
"Unique, adaptable, and extremely retro, the Kel-Tec P50 is a truly bizarre "
"semi-automatic pistol.  Having been regarded as possibly one of the most "
"innovative firearms from Kel-Tec's entire line-up of guns, the P50 makes use "
"of the high velocity 5.7x28mm cartridge, and feeds from standard FN P90 "
"magazines.  Boasting ambidextrous controls, an AR-15-like T-shaped charging "
"handle, and a reload which involves swinging the receiver and barrel "
"assemblies up and away from the frame to insert the magazine horizontally "
"over the grip, this weapon lends a decidedly retro-futuristic touch to almost "
"any situation."
msgstr ""
"Única, adaptable y extremadamente retro, la Kel-Tec P50 es una pistola "
"semiautomática realmente extraña. Considerada posiblemente una de las armas "
"más innovadoras de toda la gama de Kel-Tec, la P50 utiliza el cartucho de "
"alta velocidad 5.7x28mm y se alimenta de cargadores FN P90 estándar. Con "
"controles ambidiestros, una empuñadura de carga en forma de T similar a la de "
"un AR-15, y una recarga que consiste en girar los conjuntos de carcasa y "
"cañón hacia arriba y fuera del armazón para insertar el cargador "
"horizontalmente sobre la empuñadura, esta arma aporta un toque decididamente "
"retrofuturista a casi cualquier situación."

#: data/json/items/gun/57.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
#. ~ Variant name of gun "Ruger-57 handgun"
#. ~ Variant name of item "Ruger-57 handgun"
msgid "Ruger-57 handgun"
msgid_plural "Ruger-57 handguns"
msgstr[0] "pistola Ruger-57"
msgstr[1] "pistolas Ruger-57"
msgstr[2] "pistolas Ruger-57"

#: data/json/items/gun/57.json
#. ~ Description of gun "Ruger-57 handgun"
#. ~ Description of "Ruger-57 handgun"
msgid ""
"Produced by the Ruger gun company, this full-sized pistol makes use of the "
"5.7x28mm cartridge.  One of the first pistols to both make use of the unusual "
"round and achieve market success within the civilian world, it opened the "
"door for accessible 5.7mm shooting due to its low price and reliable design."
msgstr ""
"Producidas por la compañía de armas Ruger, esta pistola de tamaño completa "
"hace uso del cartucho 5.7x28mm. Una de las primeras pistolas en hacer uso de "
"esta inusual munición y alcanzar éxito en el mercado civil, que abrió las "
"puertas para tiradores a acceder al cartucho 5.7mm debido a su bajo precio y "
"fiable diseño."

#: data/json/items/gun/57.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Ruger-57 handgun" of gun "Ruger-57 handgun"
#. ~ Description of variant "Ruger-57 handgun" of item "Ruger-57 handgun"
msgid ""
"A full-sized polymer framed handgun chambered in the unusual 5.7x28mm "
"cartridge, the Ruger-57 was one of the first commercially available 5.7mm "
"pistols on the market, with its main competitor being FN's decades-old, and "
"far pricier, Five-seveN pistol.  Featuring a lightweight ergonomic design, "
"1911-style thumb-safety, a high visibility green front-sight with adjustable "
"black rear iron-sights, and a price point which hovered a good 500 dollars "
"below its competition, the Ruger-57 made the comparatively niche 5.7x28mm "
"round far more accessible to a wider margin of potential shooters."
msgstr ""
"La Ruger-57, una pistola de polímero de tamaño completo con recámara para el "
"inusual cartucho de 5.7x28 mm, fue una de las primeras pistolas de 5.7mm "
"disponibles en el mercado, siendo su principal competidora la pistola "
"Five-seveN de FN, que tenía décadas de antigüedad y era mucho más cara.  Con "
"un diseño ergonómico y ligero, un seguro para el pulgar tipo 1911, una mira "
"delantera verde de alta visibilidad con miras de hierro negras ajustables y "
"un precio que se situaba en unos 500 dólares por debajo de su competencia, la "
"Ruger-57 hizo que la munición de 5.7x28mm, comparativamente muy "
"especializada, fuera mucho más accesible para un mayor número de tiradores "
"potenciales."

#: data/json/items/gun/57.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "semi-automatic P90 carbine"
msgid_plural "semi-automatic P90 carbines"
msgstr[0] "carabina semiautomática P90"
msgstr[1] "carabinas semiautomáticas P90"
msgstr[2] "carabinas semiautomáticas P90"

#: data/json/items/gun/57.json
#. ~ Description of gun "semi-automatic P90 carbine"
#. ~ Description of "semi-automatic P90 carbine"
msgid ""
"The civilian version of the older 5.7mm PDW, this carbine features a 16 inch "
"long barrel, feeds from the same 50-round magazines as its predecessor, and "
"is only capable of semi-automatic fire in order to keep it in line with "
"American firearm restrictions."
msgstr ""
"La versión civil de la antigua PDW de 5.7mm, esta carabina cuenta con un "
"cañón de 40.6cm (16 pulgadas) de largo, se alimenta de los mismos cargadores "
"de 50 cartuchos que su predecesora, y sólo es capaz de disparar de forma "
"semiautomática con el fin de mantenerla en línea con las restricciones de "
"armas de fuego estadounidenses."

#: data/json/items/gun/57.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "semi-automatic P90 carbine"
#. ~ Variant name of item "semi-automatic P90 carbine"
msgid "FN PS90 carbine"
msgid_plural "FN PS90 carbines"
msgstr[0] "carabina FN PS90"
msgstr[1] "carabinas FN PS90"
msgstr[2] "carabinas FN PS90"

#: data/json/items/gun/57.json
#. ~ Description of variant "semi-automatic P90 carbine" of gun "FN PS90
#. carbine"
#. ~ Description of variant "FN PS90 carbine" of item "semi-automatic P90
#. carbine"
msgid ""
"Originally introduced in 2005, the PS90 is the civilian clone of the "
"venerable FN P90, sharing much of the same characteristics and features as "
"its fully-automatic older brother.  Chambering the same 5.7x28mm cartridge as "
"its predecessor, in order to make it a legally distributable carbine in the "
"eyes of the law the PS90 was manufactured to only be capable of "
"semi-automatic fire, with a fitted-on 16-inch long barrel to sidestep NFA "
"regulations on short-barreled rifles."
msgstr ""
"Presentada originalmente en 2005, la PS90 es el copia civil de la venerable "
"FN P90, y comparte muchas de las características y prestaciones de su hermano "
"mayor totalmente automático. Con el mismo cartucho de 5,7x28mm que su "
"predecesora, para que fuera una carabina legalmente distribuible a los ojos "
"de la ley, la PS90 se fabricó para que sólo fuera capaz de disparar en modo "
"semiautomático, con un cañón de 16 pulgadas de largo para eludir las "
"regulaciones de la NFA sobre rifles de cañón corto."

#: data/json/items/gun/60mm.json
