msgstr[1] "las Louvertures"
msgstr[2] "las Louvertures"

#: data/json/items/gun/artisan_guns.json
#. ~ Description of "the Louverture"
msgid ""
"An oddly-vented mace with an internal fuel reservoir built into the pommel.  "
"Can be engaged to ignite large puffs of gasoline and start fires."
msgstr ""
"Una extraña maza con un depósito interno de combustible integrado en el pomo. "
"Puede activarse para encender grandes cantidades de gasolina y provocar "
"fuegos."

#: data/json/items/gun/artisan_guns.json
