msgstr[2] "rifles PA md. 68"

#: data/json/items/gun/exodii.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "Exodii zombie hunting rifle"
msgid_plural "Exodii zombie hunting rifles"
msgstr[0] "rifle de caza zombi Exodii"
msgstr[1] "rifles de caza zombi Exodii"
msgstr[2] "rifles de caza zombi Exodii"

#: data/json/items/gun/exodii.json
#. ~ Description of gun "Exodii zombie hunting rifle"
#. ~ Description of variant "Exodii zombie hunting rifle" of gun "PS md. 71z
#. rifle"
#. ~ Description of "Exodii zombie hunting rifle"
#. ~ Description of variant "PS md. 71z rifle" of item "Exodii zombie hunting
#. rifle"
msgid ""
"This extremely popular Romanian rifle, made famous in the third Carpathian "
"War, has been redesigned slightly by the Exodii for precision shots against "
"high-priority targets.  In a pinch this modified design can fire a 2-shot "
"burst, with the goal of shredding the target and preventing revivification.  "
"However, the recoil is much greater for a human than it would be for a cyborg "
"or giant quadruped, causing the burst to more often miss than hit."
msgstr ""
"Este rifle rumano extremadamente popular, que se hizo famoso en la tercera "
"Guerra de los Cárpatos, ha sido rediseñado ligeramente por los Exodii para "
"realizar disparos de precisión contra objetivos de alta prioridad. En caso de "
"necesidad, este diseño modificado puede disparar una ráfaga de 2 tiros, con "
"el objetivo de destrozar al objetivo e impedir que reviva. Sin embargo, el "
"retroceso es mucho mayor para un humano que para un ciborg o un cuadrúpedo "
"gigante, por lo que la ráfaga suele fallar más que acertar."

