#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "flintlock pistol"
msgid_plural "flintlock pistols"
msgstr[0] "pistola de chispa"
msgstr[1] "pistolas de chispa"
msgstr[2] "pistolas de chispa"

#: data/json/items/gun/flintlock.json
#. ~ Description of gun "flintlock pistol"
#. ~ Description of "flintlock pistol"
msgid ""
"A beautifully decorated flintlock pistol.  If using this doesn't make you "
"feel a pirate, nothing will."
msgstr ""
"Una pistola de chispas bellamente decorada. Si usar esto no te hace sentir un "
"pirata, nada lo hará."

#: data/json/items/gun/flintlock.json
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/old_guns.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "flintlock musket"
msgid_plural "flintlock muskets"
msgstr[0] "mosquete de chispa"
msgstr[1] "mosquetes de chispa"
msgstr[2] "mosquetes de chispa"

#: data/json/items/gun/flintlock.json
#. ~ Description of gun "flintlock musket"
#. ~ Description of "flintlock musket"
msgid ""
"For once, something *good* came back from the dead.  This ancient design "
"lacks the fire-rate of modern weapons, but packs as much punch as the best of "
"'em and rewards the skilled shooter with easily-crafted ammunition."
msgstr ""
"Por una vez, algo *bueno* nos llegó de los muertos. Este diseño antiguo "
"carece del ritmo de disparo de las armas modernas, pero causa tanto daño como "
"la mejor, y premia al tirador habilidoso con una munición fácil de fabricar."

#: data/json/items/gun/flintlock.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "flintlock rifle"
msgid_plural "flintlock rifles"
msgstr[0] "rifle de chispa"
msgstr[1] "rifles de chispa"
msgstr[2] "rifles de chispa"

#: data/json/items/gun/flintlock.json
#. ~ Description of gun "flintlock rifle"
#. ~ Description of "flintlock rifle"
msgid ""
"Also called a Pennsylvania rifle, this long-barreled rifled flintlock gun has "
"significantly increased accuracy at the cost of taking even longer to reload."
msgstr ""
"También llamado rifle Pennsylvania, este arma de cañón largo y rayado de "
"pedernal tiene una precisión significativamente mayor a costa de tardar aún "
"más en recargar."

