"correas de tela hechas a mano. Incluso bien montada, parece una bestia "
"difícil de manejar, y los seis cañones separados dificulta el calibrado de la "
"mira. Gracias a su accionamiento externo, es mucho menos probable que se "
"atasque."

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "compact bullpup shotgun"
msgid_plural "compact bullpup shotguns"
msgstr[0] "escopeta bullpup compacta"
msgstr[1] "escopetas bullpup compactas"
msgstr[2] "escopetas bullpup compactas"

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Description of gun "compact bullpup shotgun"
#. ~ Description of "compact bullpup shotgun"
msgid ""
"This pump-action shotgun uses a system of twin magazines to carry 14 total "
"rounds of 12-gauge shotgun shells.  As the weapon's trigger is situated "
"forwards of the chamber in what is termed as a 'bullpup' design, the "
"firearm's notably more compact than its peers despite having a higher "
"capacity when compared against more classically designed shotguns."
msgstr ""
"Esta escopeta de bombeo utiliza un sistema de cargadores dobles para "
"transportar un total de 14 cartuchos de escopeta del calibre 12. Como el "
"gatillo del arma está situado delante de la recámara en lo que se denomina un "
"diseño \"bullpup\", el arma es notablemente más compacta que sus homólogas a "
"pesar de tener una mayor capacidad en comparación con escopetas de diseño más "
"clásico."

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "compact bullpup shotgun"
#. ~ Variant name of item "compact bullpup shotgun"
msgid "Kel-Tec KSG shotgun"
msgid_plural "Kel-Tec KSG shotguns"
msgstr[0] "escopeta Kel-Tec KSG"
msgstr[1] "escopetas Kel-Tec KSG"
msgstr[2] "escopetas Kel-Tec KSG"

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
