msgstr[2] "drop-in auto sears"

#: data/json/items/gunmod/mechanism.json
#. ~ Description of gun mod "drop-in auto sear"
#. ~ Description of "drop-in auto sear"
msgid ""
"A vaguely 'U'-shaped piece of metal with a vaguely 'T'-shaped flapper on a "
"pin.  Once tucked into an AR-15's lower receiver, the rifle will become "
"selective fire-capable.  The handcrafted-sear surface isn't as good as actual "
"full-auto parts, so precision and reliability suffer slightly."
msgstr ""
"Una pieza de metal con forma de \"U\" y una aleta con forma de \"T\" en un "
"alfiler. Una vez metido en el receptor inferior de un AR-15, el rifle será "
"capaz de disparar selectivamente. La superficie de la caja no es tan buena "
"como la de las piezas automáticas, por lo que la precisión y la fiabilidad se "
"ven ligeramente afectadas."

#: data/json/items/gunmod/mechanism.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Gun mod name
msgid "lightning link"
msgid_plural "lightning links"
msgstr[0] "lightning link"
msgstr[1] "lightning links"
msgstr[2] "lightning links"

#: data/json/items/gunmod/mechanism.json
#. ~ Description of gun mod "lightning link"
#. ~ Description of "lightning link"
msgid ""
"Originally designed for the Colt SP-1, this 'reproduction' is intended to "
"convert an AR-15 into a full-auto only rifle.  Once the necessary "
"modifications are made and the link is in place, semi-auto is disabled and "
"full-auto is enabled.  Reliability and precision suffer greatly due to "
"questionable craftsmanship and lack of unobtainium SP-1 parts."
msgstr ""
"Originalmente diseñado para el Colt SP-1, esta \"reproducción\" está "
"destinada a convertir un AR-15 en un rifle automático. Una vez que se hacen "
"las modificaciones necesarias y se establece el enlace, se desactiva el "
"semi-automático y se activa el automático completo. La fiabilidad y la "
"precisión sufren enormemente debido a la cuestionable artesanía y a la falta "
"de piezas de unobtainium SP-1."

#: data/json/items/gunmod/mechanism.json
