#: data/json/items/gunmod/mount.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Gun mod name
msgid "replaceable stock kit"
msgid_plural "replaceable stock kits"
msgstr[0] "kit de culata reemplazable"
msgstr[1] "kits de culata reemplazable"
msgstr[2] "kits de culata reemplazable"

#: data/json/items/gunmod/mount.json
#. ~ Description of gun mod "replaceable stock kit"
#. ~ Description of "replaceable stock kit"
msgid ""
"A kit consisting of various steel parts.  When installed, it will remove the "
"weapon's original fixed stock, install a new stock mount in its place, modify "
"the original stock to fit it and then reattach it to the gun, or simply "
"attach a stock mount if the gun had no stock to start with.  This allows easy "
"installation of any kind of more advanced stocks."
msgstr ""
"Un kit compuesto por varias piezas de acero. Una vez instalado, retirará la "
"culata fija original del arma, instalará una nueva montura de culata en su "
"lugar, modificará la culata original para ajustarla y luego la volverá a "
"acoplar al arma, o simplemente acoplará una montura de culata si el arma no "
"tenía culata al principio. De este modo, se puede instalar fácilmente "
"cualquier tipo de culata más avanzada."

#: data/json/items/gunmod/mount.json
