#. "ordnance cannon corrosive canister"
#. ~ Description of variant "Khuunäöfaai corrosive canister" of item "ordnance
#. cannon corrosive canister"
msgid ""
"A pressurized tank containing one of the special payloads the Exodii made for "
"the Khuunäöfaai, a mixture of several acids and peroxides capable of rapidly "
"breaking down the organic tissues of zombies and mutants alike.  Apparently "
"developed for cases where the incendiary payload would fail, like low to zero "
"oxygen environments and targets capable of self-extinguishing - It's somewhat "
"alarming the Exodii run into those scenarios frequently enough to justify "
"producing this."
msgstr ""

