msgstr[2] "mayales de guerra"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "war flail"
msgid ""
"A stout pole with a large flanged mace head attached to the end with a short "
"chain, a purpose-made combat version of the peasant flail.  It specializes in "
"threshing people in metal armor, rather than grain."
msgstr ""
"Un palo robusto con una gran maza embridada unida al extremo con una cadena "
"corta, una versión de combate del mayal campesino. Está especializado en "
"trillar a personas con armadura metálica, más que grano."

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/weapon_copy_extensions.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "peasant flail"
msgid_plural "peasant flails"
msgstr[0] "mayal de arma"
msgstr[1] "mayal de armas"
msgstr[2] "mayal de armas"

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Description of "peasant flail"
msgid ""
"A stout pole with a wooden club attached to the end with a leather cord.  "
"This farming tool was historically used to thresh wheat and occasionally "
"people when the peasants got angry at their feudal lords."
msgstr ""
"Un palo robusto con un garrote de madera atado al extremo con una cuerda de "
"cuero. Esta herramienta agrícola se utilizaba históricamente para trillar "
"trigo y, ocasionalmente, personas cuando los campesinos se enfadaban con sus "
"señores feudales."

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/weapon_copy_extensions.json
