"A sinister looking cane made of plastic.  It has a shiny red orb gripped by "
"claws at the handle."
msgstr ""
"Un bastón de plástico de aspecto siniestro. Tiene un orbe rojo brillante "
"agarrado por garras en el mango."

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
#. ~ Item name
