msgid ""
"An improvised version of the close combat weapon that was mainly used by "
"Aztecs.  It's not very sturdy, but it will break someone's skull open and "
"give them a good cut."
msgstr ""
"Una versión improvisada del arma de combate cuerpo a cuerpo que utilizaban "
"principalmente los aztecas. No es muy resistente, pero le abrirá el cráneo a "
"alguien y le hará un buen corte."

