msgid ""
"A poor imitation of the close combat weapon affiliated with Aztec warriors, "
"made with a large wooden club and carefully hammered razors.  Although not "
"very sturdy, it delivers some nasty cuts and bruises."
msgstr ""
"Una pobre imitación del arma de combate cercano afiliada a los guerreros "
"aztecas, hecha con un gran garrote de madera y cuchillas martilladas "
"cuidadosamente. Aunque no es muy resistente, causa algunos cortes y moratones "
"desagradables."

