msgstr ""
"Un arma medieval que consiste en un palo muy largo de madera con una punta de "
"metal."

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Description of "pike"
msgid ""
"A dull, cheaply made replica of a medieval weapon consisting of a very long "
"wooden shaft tipped with an iron spearhead."
msgstr ""
"Una réplica sin filo y barata de un arma medieval que consiste en un palo muy "
"largo de madera con una punta de hierro."

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Description of "pike"
msgid ""
"A medieval weapon consisting of a very long wooden shaft tipped with an iron "
"spearhead.  The head seems to be pretty dull, and the whole thing feels "
"poorly made."
msgstr ""
"Un arma medieval que consiste en un palo muy largo de madera con una punta de "
"hierro. La punta parece no tener filo y el arma en general parece estar hecha "
"pobremente."

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
#. ~ Item name
