"This stout combat knife features a steel guard to protect the user's "
"knuckles.  The guard can also be used for striking or blocking.  This one is "
"made of hardened steel, an officer's weapon if ever there was one."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "tempered steel trench knife"
msgid_plural "tempered steel trench knives"
msgstr[0] "cuchillo de trinchera de acero templado"
msgstr[1] "cuchillos de trinchera de acero templado"
msgstr[2] "cuchillos de trinchera de acero templado"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "tempered steel trench knife"
msgid ""
"This stout combat knife features a steel guard to protect the user's "
"knuckles.  The guard can also be used for striking or blocking.  This one is "
"made of tempered steel, and you feel you could hold a trench against an army "
"of zombies with it."
msgstr ""
"Este fuerte cuchillo de combate posee una guarda de acero para proteger los "
"nudillos del usuario. La guarda también puede ser usada para golpear o para "
"bloquear. Esta está hecha de acero templado, y sientes que podrías sostener "
"una trinchera contra un ejército de zombis con ella."

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "makeshift knife"
msgid_plural "makeshift knives"
msgstr[0] "cuchillo improvisado"
msgstr[1] "cuchillos improvisados"
msgstr[2] "cuchillos improvisados"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "makeshift knife"
msgid ""
"A knife consisting of a long, somewhat sharpened spike and a tightly-wrapped "
"rag as a handle.  Not as good as a real knife, but it'll do in a pinch."
msgstr ""
"Un cuchillo que consiste en una punta larga más o menos afilada, y un trapo "
"fuertemente enrollado que funciona como empuñadura. No es tan bueno como un "
"cuchillo de verdad, pero servirá en caso de necesidad."

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
