#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "hardened steel cavalry saber"
msgid ""
"A curved sword associated with cavalry from the Early Modern period onwards.  "
"Lightweight, but a deadly slashing weapon.\n"
"\n"
"Made of hardened steel and with a molded grip that fits your hand perfectly, "
"this weapon looks as good as any you might find in a museum.  The balance is "
"perfect and the edge is as sharp as a razor."
msgstr ""
"Una espada curva asociada a la caballería a partir de la Edad Moderna. "
"Ligera, pero un arma cortante mortal.\n"
"\n"
"Fabricada en acero endurecido y con una empuñadura moldeada que se adapta "
"perfectamente a la mano, esta arma no tiene nada que envidiar a las que se "
"pueden encontrar en los museos. El equilibrio es perfecto y el filo tan "
"afilado como una navaja."

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "tempered steel cavalry saber"
msgid_plural "tempered steel cavalry sabers"
msgstr[0] "sable de caballería de acero templado"
msgstr[1] "sables de caballería de acero templado"
msgstr[2] "sables de caballería de acero templado"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "tempered steel cavalry saber"
msgid ""
"A curved sword associated with cavalry from the Early Modern period onwards.  "
"Lightweight, but a deadly slashing weapon.\n"
"\n"
"Made of tempered steel, this is a masterpiece.  The grip, the balance, the "
"blade, all perfect.  This is the peak of the swordsmith's craft."
msgstr ""
"Una espada curva asociada a la caballería a partir de la Edad Moderna. "
"Ligera, pero un arma mortal.\n"
"\n"
"Hecha de acero templado, es una obra maestra. La empuñadura, el equilibrio, "
"la hoja, todo perfecto. Esta es la cima de la maestría del herrero."

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "cavalry saber"
msgid ""
"A dull, cheaply-made replica of a curved sword associated with cavalry from "
"the Early Modern period onwards."
msgstr ""
"Una réplica sosa sin filo de una espada curvada que se asocia con la "
"caballería de la Edad Moderna y siguientes períodos."

