msgstr[2] "floretes de esgrima"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "fencing foil"
msgid ""
"A weapon used for fencing, the most noble of all sports.  Unfortunately, a "
"fencing foil is rather useless as a weapon due to its flexible shaft and dull "
"tip."
msgstr ""
"Un arma utilizada en la esgrima, el más noble de todos los deportes. "
"Lamentablemente, un florete de esgrima es bastante inútil como arma debido a "
"su hoja flexible y punta sin filo."

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sharpened foil"
msgid_plural "sharpened foils"
msgstr[0] "hoja afilada"
msgstr[1] "hojas afiladas"
msgstr[2] "hojas afiladas"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "sharpened foil"
msgid ""
"What was once a mostly-harmless fencing foil has had its electrical plunger "
"assembly removed and has been crudely sharpened to a point.  Though it still "
"lacks a cutting edge, it is now somewhat more lethal, yet still familiar to "
"the practiced fencer."
msgstr ""
"Lo que una vez fue una hoja de esgrima mayormente inofensiva ha sido removida "
"de su ensamblaje de émbolo eléctrico y ha sido crudamente afilada hasta "
"cierto punto. Aunque todavía carece de un borde cortante, ahora es algo más "
"letal, pero aún familiar para el esgrimista practicante."

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "electrified foil"
msgid_plural "electrified foils"
msgstr[0] "florete electrificado"
msgstr[1] "floretes electrificadas"
msgstr[2] "floretes electrificadas"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
#. ~ Description of "electrified foil"
msgid ""
"The modifications made to this fencing foil may not be sporting, but they "
"might give you an edge in this final competition.  Extra effort has been made "
"to insulate the grip and a high voltage stun gun has been attached to the "
"guard, wired through the electronic scoring circuit to the tip.  Thrusting "
"the sharpened tip into a foe and activating the momentary switch will deliver "
"a painful electric shock."
msgstr ""
"Las modificaciones hechas a este florete de esgrima pueden no ser deportivas, "
"pero pueden darte una ventaja en esta competición final. Se ha hecho un "
"esfuerzo extra para aislar la empuñadura y se ha colocado un arma aturdidora "
"de alto voltaje en el guardia, conectada a través del circuito electrónico de "
"puntuación a la punta. Al empujar la punta afilada hacia un enemigo y activar "
"el interruptor momentáneo, se producirá una dolorosa descarga eléctrica."

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
