#: data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
#. ~ Description of "brazier"
msgid ""
"A large metal stand used to contain a fire.  Fires set in a brazier will not "
"spread to surrounding flammable objects."
msgstr ""
"Un gran soporte de metal usado para contener el fuego. Los incendios que se "
"producen en un brasero no se propagan a los objetos inflamables circundantes."

#: data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
#. ~ Description of "makeshift brazier"
msgid ""
"A portable brazier fashioned from a steel bucket by punching small holes on "
"the sides to improve the air supply.  It is too small to fit any fuel item "
"larger than some splintered wood.  Fires set in this bucket will not spread "
"to surrounding flammable objects."
msgstr ""
"Un brasero portátil fabricado a partir de un cubo de acero perforando "
"pequeños agujeros en los laterales para mejorar el suministro de aire. Es "
"demasiado pequeño para alojar un combustible mayor que madera astillada. Los "
"fuegos provocados en este cubo no se propagan a los objetos inflamables "
"circundantes."

#: data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
#. ~ Description of "hobo stove"
msgid ""
"A small, improvised wood stove, made from a metal can or similar container of "
"the right size.  It's too small to fit anything much larger than splintered "
"wood.  Activate it to deploy."
msgstr ""
"Una pequeña cocina de leña improvisada, hecha con una lata de metal o un "
"recipiente similar de tamaño adecuado. Es demasiado pequeño para que quepa "
"algo mucho más grande que madera astillada. Activar para Desplegar."

#: data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
#. ~ Description of "portable stove"
msgid ""
"A foldable wood stove to safely lit fires while camping in the wilderness.  "
"Activate it to deploy."
msgstr ""
"Una cocina de leña plegable para encender con seguridad fuegos mientras "
"acampas en la naturaleza. Activar para Desplegar."

#: data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
#. ~ Description of "fire barrel (200 L)"
#. ~ Description of "fire barrel (100 L)"
msgid ""
"A large metal barrel used to contain a fire.  It has multiple holes punched "
"in its walls for air supply.  Fires set in a fire barrel will not spread to "
"surrounding flammable objects."
msgstr ""
"Un gran barril de metal usado para contener el fuego. Tiene múltiples "
"agujeros perforados en sus lados para el suministro de aire. Los incendios "
"que se producen en un barril de fuego no se propagan a los objetos "
"inflamables circundantes."

#: data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
#. ~ Description of "camp chair"
msgid "A folded chair for camping.  Activate it to set it down for a place to sit."
msgstr ""
"Una silla plegable para acampar. Actívar para dejarla en el suelo y poder "
"sentarte."

#: data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
#. ~ Description of "deck chair"
msgid "Folded deck chair, deploy to sit down."
msgstr "Tumbona plegada, desplegar para sentarse."

#: data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
#. ~ Description of "folding chair"
msgid "Folded plastic chair on a metal frame, deploy to sit down."
msgstr "Silla plegable de plástico sobre estructura metálica, desplegar para sentarse."

#: data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "deployable antenna"
msgid_plural "deployable antennas"
msgstr[0] "antena desplegable"
msgstr[1] "antenas desplegables"
msgstr[2] "antenas desplegables"

#: data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
#. ~ Description of "deployable antenna"
msgid ""
"A directional antenna and accompanying tripod, folded into a shape vaguely "
"resembling an umbrella."
msgstr ""
"Una antena direccional y el trípode que la acompaña, plegados en una forma "
"que se asemeja vagamente a un paraguas."

#: data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
#. ~ Description of "cot"
msgid ""
"A military-style folding cot.  While it may not be quite as comfortable as a "
"bed, it's better than slumming it on the ground."
msgstr ""
"Un catre plegable de estilo militar. Aunque no sea tan cómodo como una cama, "
"es mejor que tumbarse en el suelo."

#: data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
#. ~ "done_message" action message of item "cot"
msgid "You unfold the cot and place it on the ground."
msgstr "Despliegas la cama plegable y la colocas en el suelo."

#: data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
#. ~ Description of "metal butchering rack"
msgid ""
"A metal butchering rack designed to hang a carcass in the air.  It is folded "
"for easy transportation."
msgstr ""
"Un estante metálico de descuartizado diseñado para colgar una pieza en el "
"aire. Se pliega para facilitar su transporte."

#: data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
#. ~ Description of "metal smoking rack"
msgid ""
"A metal rack designed to smoke food for better preservation and taste.  It is "
"folded for easy transportation."
msgstr ""
"Un estante de metal diseñado para ahumar la comida para una mejor "
"conservación y sabor. Está plegada para facilitar el transporte."

#: data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
#. ~ Description of "folding table"
msgid ""
"A metal folding table for off-road trips.  It is currently folded for easy "
"transportation."
msgstr ""
"Una mesa metálica plegable para viajes todoterreno. Actualmente está plegada "
"para facilitar su transporte."

#: data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
#. ~ Description of "leather tarp"
msgid ""
"A large sheet of leather.  You could use it as a picnic blanket, but it's "
"more valuable as a surface for butchering as it does not soak up blood.  It's "
"rolled and ready for carrying."
msgstr ""
"Una gran hoja de cuero. Podrías usarla como manta de picnic, pero es más "
"valiosa como superficie para descuartizar, ya que no absorbe la sangre. Está "
"enrollada y lista para llevar."

#: data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
#. ~ Description of "fiber mat"
msgid ""
"A large mat woven from fibrous material.  You could use it as a picnic "
"blanket, but it's more valuable as a surface for butchering.  Too thin to be "
"used as a comfortable sleeping mat.  It's rolled and ready for carrying."
msgstr ""
"Una gran alfombra tejida con material fibroso. Podría usarse como manta de "
"picnic, pero es más valiosa como superficie para descuartizar. Demasiado fina "
"para utilizarla como una cómoda esterilla para dormir. Está enrollada y lista "
"para llevar."

#: data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "folded butter churn"
msgid_plural "folded butter churns"
msgstr[0] "mantequera plegable"
msgstr[1] "mantequeras plegables"
msgstr[2] "mantequeras plegables"

#: data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
#. ~ Description of "folded butter churn"
msgid ""
"A large wooden container used to turn raw milk into butter and buttermilk.  "
"This model uses a foot crank and holds three gallons of raw milk."
msgstr ""
"Un gran recipiente de madera utilizado para convertir la leche cruda en "
"mantequilla y suero de leche. Este modelo utiliza una manivela de pie y tiene "
"capacidad para 11 litros de leche cruda."

#: data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
#. ~ Description of "water mill"
msgid ""
"A small water-powered mill that can convert starchy products into flour.  "
"Needs to be placed via the construction menu."
msgstr ""
"Un pequeño molino accionado por agua que puede convertir productos con "
"almidón en harina. Se debe colocar a través del menú de construcción."

#: data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
#. ~ Description of "wind mill"
msgid ""
"A small wind-powered mill that can convert starchy products into flour.  "
"Needs to be placed via the construction menu."
msgstr ""
"Un pequeño molino de viento que puede convertir productos con almidón en "
"harina. Debe colocarse a través del menú de construcción."

#: data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
#. ~ Description of "screw press"
msgid ""
"A large screw press for manually pressing oil out of fruit or seed paste.  "
"Needs to be placed via the construction menu."
msgstr ""
"Una gran prensa con el propósito de extraer aceite manualmente de pasta de "
"fruta o semillas. Debe colocarse a través del menú de construcción."

#: data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
#. ~ Description of "manual tire changer"
msgid ""
"A floor-mounted machine containing all the levers, clamps, and mounts "
"required to remove or fit a tire, plus an integrated foot pump to inflate it."
msgstr ""
"Una máquina montada en el suelo que contiene todas las palancas, abrazaderas "
"y soportes necesarios para desmontar o montar un neumático, además de una "
"bomba de pie integrada para inflarlo."

