#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
#. ~ Description of "directional antenna"
msgid ""
"An antenna designed to pick up signals better when pointed at the source.  "
"You could use this with a radio to receive faint signals."
msgstr ""
"Una antena diseñada para captar mejor las señales cuando apunta a la fuente. "
"Se puede utilizar con una radio para recibir señales débiles."

#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "electronic handcuffs"
msgid_plural "electronic handcuffs"
msgstr[0] "par de esposas electrónicas"
msgstr[1] "pares de esposas electrónicas"
msgstr[2] "pares de esposas electrónicas"

#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
#. ~ Description of "electronic handcuffs"
msgid ""
"A pair of electronic handcuffs, used by police and riot bots to detain "
"captives.  Their continuous siren clearly identifies the wearer as an "
"arrested criminal and alerts human police.  Wait for their arrival, don't try "
"to escape or to remove the cuffs - they will administer an electric shock.\n"
"However, since the only police likely to respond are undead, you may have a "
"long wait ahead, unless you get creative…"
msgstr ""
"Un par de esposas electrónicas, usadas por la policía y los antidisturbios "
"para detener a los cautivos. Su sirena continua identifica claramente al "
"portador como un criminal arrestado y alerta a la policía humana. Espere su "
"llegada, no intente escapar o quitar las esposas - le administrarán una "
"descarga eléctrica.\n"
"Sin embargo, como los únicos policías que pueden responder son los "
"no-muertos..."

#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
