msgid ""
"A tablet PC using an efficient color e-ink display.  Before the Cataclysm, "
"these were nifty gadgets; now, they are extremely useful tools.  Runs on "
"conventional batteries."
msgstr ""
"Una tableta PC con una eficaz pantalla de tinta electrónica a color. Antes "
"del Cataclismo, eran artilugios ingeniosos; ahora, son herramientas "
"extremadamente útiles. Funciona con baterías convencionales."

