msgstr[1] "contadores Geiger (apag.)"
msgstr[2] "contadores Geiger (apag.)"

#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
#. ~ Description of "Geiger counter (off)"
msgid ""
"A tool for measuring radiation.  Using it will prompt you to choose whether "
"to scan yourself or the terrain, or to turn on continuous scan, which will "
"provide continuous feedback on ambient radiation.  It is currently off."
msgstr ""
"Una herramienta para medir la radiación. Al utilizarla, se te pedirá que "
"elijas entre escanearte a ti mismo o al terreno, o activar el escaneo "
"continuo, que proporcionará información continua sobre la radiación "
"ambiental. Ahora está apagada."

#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Geiger counter (on)"
msgid_plural "Geiger counters (on)"
msgstr[0] "contador Geiger (enc.)"
msgstr[1] "contadores Geiger (enc.)"
msgstr[2] "contadores Geiger (enc.)"

#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
#. ~ Description of "Geiger counter (on)"
msgid ""
"A tool for measuring radiation.  It is in continuous scan mode, and will "
"produce quiet clicking sounds in the presence of ambient radiation.  Using it "
"allows you to turn it off, or scan yourself or the ground."
msgstr ""
"Una herramienta para medir la radiación. Funciona en modo de exploración "
"continua y emite chasquidos silenciosos en presencia de radiación ambiental. "
"Usar permite apagarlo, o escanearte a ti mismo o el terreno."

#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "Geiger counter (on)"
msgid "The Geiger counter's SCANNING LED turns off."
msgstr "El LED de ESCANEO del contador Geiger se apaga."

#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Otherworldly measuring device"
msgid_plural "Otherworldly measuring devices"
msgstr[0] "Aparato de medición de otro mundo"
msgstr[1] "Aparatos de medición de otro mundo"
msgstr[2] "Aparatos de medición de otro mundo"

#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
#. ~ Description of "Otherworldly measuring device"
msgid ""
"This strange contraption appears to be little more than a laminated box built "
"around a battery, a poorly backlit screen, and a wound spool of cloth "
"netting.  The letters \"X E D R A\" are emblazoned on the side.  To operate "
"the device, unfurl the netting and place it around the object to analyze.  "
"Despite not appearing to do anything, it consumes an enormous amount of "
"electricity and provides a brief numerical readout."
msgstr ""
"Este extraño artilugio parece ser poco más que una caja laminada construida "
"alrededor de una batería, una pantalla mal retroiluminada y un carrete "
"enrollado de red de tela. Las letras \"X E D R A\" están grabadas en el "
"lateral. Para hacer funcionar el aparato, hay que desplegar la red y "
"colocarla alrededor del objeto que se desea analizar. A pesar de que "
"aparentemente no hace nada, consume una enorme cantidad de electricidad y "
"proporciona una breve lectura numérica."

#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "NRE recorder"
msgid_plural "NRE recorders"
msgstr[0] "grabadora NRE"
msgstr[1] "grabadoras NRE"
msgstr[2] "grabadoras NRE"

#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
#. ~ Description of "NRE recorder"
msgid ""
"A strange apparatus, seemingly consisting of a glass-encased microphone "
"linked to a small thermal printer and digital screen.  The screen remains "
"perpetually blank, save for a battery indicator on its upper right, and on "
"its left side lies a single red button: \"PRINT DATA\"."
msgstr ""
"Un extraño aparato, aparentemente compuesto por un micrófono encerrado en un "
"cristal, conectado a una pequeña impresora térmica y a una pantalla digital. "
"La pantalla permanece perpetuamente en blanco, salvo por un indicador de "
"batería en su parte superior derecha, y en su lado izquierdo se encuentra un "
"único botón rojo: \"IMPRIMIR DATOS\"."

#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
#. ~ "description" action message of item "NRE recorder"
msgid "Activate the recorder's printer."
msgstr "Activar la impresora de la grabadora."

#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "hand-crank charger"
msgid_plural "hand-crank chargers"
msgstr[0] "cargador de manivela"
msgstr[1] "cargadores de manivela"
msgstr[2] "cargadores de manivela"

#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
#. ~ Description of "hand-crank charger"
msgid ""
"A hand-powered battery charger.  It has an adjustable receptacle designed to "
"accept a wide variety of rechargeable battery cells."
msgstr ""
"Un cargador de baterías manual. Dispone de un receptáculo ajustable diseñado "
"para aceptar una amplia variedad de baterías recargables."

#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "laptop computer"
msgid_plural "laptop computers"
msgstr[0] "ordenador portátil"
msgstr[1] "ordenadores portátiles"
msgstr[2] "ordenadores portátiles"

#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
#. ~ Description of "laptop computer"
msgid ""
"A portable computer, a ubiquitous tool both before and after the cataclysm.  "
"While you no longer have internet access, you still can load it with books "
"and other useful software."
msgstr ""
"Un ordenador portátil, una herramienta omnipresente antes y después del "
"cataclismo. Aunque ya no tengas acceso a Internet, puedes cargarlo con libros "
"y otros programas útiles."

