#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Description of "makeshift gas canister"
msgid ""
"A crude gas bomb made using household chemicals.  Use this item to arm it.  "
"In three seconds it will begin to expel a highly toxic gas for a short time.  "
"This gas poisons those exposed to it, in addition to obscuring vision and "
"scent."
msgstr ""
"Una bomba de gas rudimentaria fabricada con productos químicos domésticos. "
"Usar este objeto para armarla. En tres segundos comenzará a expulsar un gas "
"altamente tóxico durante un breve periodo de tiempo. Este gas envenena a "
"quienes se exponen a él, además de oscurecer la visión y el olfato."

