#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "packed disposable rocket launcher"
msgid_plural "packed disposable rocket launchers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Description of "packed disposable rocket launcher"
msgid ""
"A packed, disposable light anti-tank rocket launcher.  Once fired, it cannot "
"be reloaded and must be disposed of.  Activate it to pop it out and make it "
"ready to fire."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "packed disposable rocket launcher"
msgid "You pull the activating lever, readying the LAW to fire."
msgstr "Tiras de la palanca activadora, preparando el LAW para disparar."

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "packed disposable rocket launcher"
msgid "M72 LAW (packed)"
msgid_plural "M72 LAWs (packed)"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Description of variant "M72 LAW (packed)" of item "packed disposable
#. rocket launcher"
msgid ""
"The M72 LAW (Light Anti-armor Weapon) is a one-time use lightweight rocket "
"launcher, meant to take out tanks and other armored vehicles.  Designed to "
"replace the earlier Bazookas, it features a shaped-charge warhead to pierce "
"armor.  Though weaker than the more modern and heavier AT4, it's still in "
"service to this day.  Due to its design, you must unpack it to use it, and it "
"cannot be reloaded.  Activate to unpack."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "SADM mininuke"
msgid_plural "SADM mininukes"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Description of "SADM mininuke"
msgid ""
"The B54 Special Atomic Demolition Munition is an extremely powerful weapon, a "
"portable nuclear bomb, using the smallest nuclear warhead in US inventory.  "
"It is housed inside a extremely sturdy transit container.  Use it to activate "
"the timer.  You guess that the explosion would be large enough to take out a "
"small house."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "active SADM mininuke"
msgid_plural "active SADM mininukes"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Description of "active SADM mininuke"
msgid ""
"The nuclear bomb looks no different from the outside, yet you know that the "
"device is armed and counting down.  You should probably get far, far away "
"from it."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Molotov cocktail"
msgid_plural "Molotov cocktails"
msgstr[0] "cóctel molotov"
msgstr[1] "cócteles molotov"
msgstr[2] "cócteles molotov"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Description of "Molotov cocktail"
msgid ""
"A bottle of flammable liquid with a rag inserted.  Use this item to light the "
"rag.  You will, of course, need a lighter or matches in your inventory to do "
"this.  After lighting it, throw it to cause fires."
msgstr ""
"Es una botella con líquido inflamable y un trapo metido adentro. Úsalo para "
"mechero fuego el trapo. Vas a necesitar un encendedor o fósforos en tu "
"inventario para usarlo. Después de encenderlo, tíralo para prender fuego en "
"el impacto."

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Description of "Molotov cocktail"
msgid ""
"A bottle of flammable liquid with a flaming rag stoppered in its neck.  "
"Throwing it will shatter the bottle on impact and ignite a fireball.  "
"Dropping it will set you on fire, so don't do that unless you want to burn to "
"death."
msgstr ""
"Una botella con un líquido inflamable y un trapo llameante metido en el "
"cuello. Al arrojarla se rompe la botella y se prende como una bola de fuego. "
"Si se te cae, te vas a prender fuego a ti mismo, así que no hagas eso excepto "
"que te quieras morir quemado."

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/price_overrides/grenades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "scrambler grenade"
msgid_plural "scrambler grenades"
msgstr[0] "granada distorsionadora"
msgstr[1] "granadas distorsionadoras"
msgstr[2] "granadas distorsionadoras"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Description of "scrambler grenade"
msgid ""
"A specialized grenade designed to scramble robots' IFF control chips.  This "
"converts the robot to your side for a short time, before the backup systems "
"kick in.  Use this item to pull the pin and start the fuse, turning it into "
"an active scrambler grenade."
msgstr ""
"Una granada especializada diseñada para codificar los chips de control IFF de "
"los robots. Esto hace que el robot se ponga de tu lado durante un breve "
"periodo de tiempo, antes de que entren en acción los sistemas de respaldo. "
"Utiliza este objeto para tirar de la anilla y encender la mecha, "
"convirtiéndola en una granada codificadora activa."

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "active scrambler grenade"
msgid_plural "active scrambler grenades"
msgstr[0] "granada distorsionadora activada"
msgstr[1] "granadas distorsionadoras activadas"
msgstr[2] "granadas distorsionadoras activadas"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Description of "active scrambler grenade"
msgid ""
"This scrambler grenade is active and will soon detonate, releasing a control "
"wave that temporarily converts robots to your side."
msgstr ""
"Esta granada distorsionadora está activa y pronto detonará, liberando una "
"onda de control que convierte temporalmente a los robots a tu bando."

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/price_overrides/grenades.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "smoke bomb"
msgid_plural "smoke bombs"
msgstr[0] "bomba de humo"
msgstr[1] "bombas de humo"
msgstr[2] "bombas de humo"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Description of "smoke bomb"
msgid ""
"A canister grenade filled with a variety of pyrotechnic chemicals.  Use this "
"item to pull the pin and start the fuse, turning it into an active smoke "
"bomb.  Five seconds after you do that, it will begin to expel a thick black "
"smoke.  This smoke will slow those who enter it, as well as obscuring vision "
"and scent."
msgstr ""
"Una granada de lata llena de una variedad de productos químicos pirotécnicos. "
"Usa este objeto para tirar de la anilla y encender la mecha, convirtiéndola "
"en una bomba de humo activa. Cinco segundos después de hacerlo, empezará a "
"expulsar un espeso humo negro. Este humo ralentizará a los que entren en él, "
"además de oscurecer la visión y el olfato."

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "armed smoke bomb"
msgid_plural "armed smoke bombs"
msgstr[0] "bomba de humo activada"
msgstr[1] "bombas de humo activadas"
msgstr[2] "bombas de humo activadas"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Description of "armed smoke bomb"
msgid ""
"This smoke bomb has had its pin removed and is (or will shortly be) expelling "
"thick smoke."
msgstr ""
"Esta bomba de humo tiene el pasador quitado y expulsa (o expulsará en breve) "
"un humo espeso."

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "rocket candy"
msgid_plural "rocket candies"
msgstr[0] "combustible de caramelo"
msgstr[1] "combustible de caramelo"
msgstr[2] "combustible de caramelo"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Description of "rocket candy"
msgid ""
"A pear-shaped chunk of rocket candy obtained by heating saltpeter with sugar "
"and casting the obtained liquid.  Can serve as a rocket fuel, but also as a "
"smokescreen - if you light the narrow end, you should be able to throw it "
"before the flame reaches the broad end."
msgstr ""
"Un trozo de caramelo para cohetes en forma de pera que se obtiene calentando "
"salitre con azúcar y echando el líquido obtenido. Puede servir como "
"combustible para cohetes, pero también como cortina de humo: si enciendes el "
"extremo estrecho, deberías poder lanzarlo antes de que la llama alcance el "
"extremo ancho."

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "rocket candy"
msgid "Light candy"
msgstr "Encender caramelo"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "rocket candy"
msgid "You light the rocket candy on fire.  Throw it!"
msgstr "Enciendes el cohete de caramelo. ¡Suéltalo!"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "burning rocket candy"
msgid_plural "burning rocket candies"
msgstr[0] "combustible de caramelo ardiendo"
msgstr[1] "combustible de caramelo ardiendo"
msgstr[2] "combustible de caramelo ardiendo"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Description of "burning rocket candy"
msgid ""
"A chunk of rocket candy that has been lit on fire and burns with a loud hiss, "
"spewing forth large amounts of smoke."
msgstr ""
"Un trozo de caramelo cohete que se ha encendido y arde con un fuerte silbido, "
"expulsando grandes cantidades de humo."

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ "message" action message of item "burning rocket candy"
msgid "You've already lit the fuse - get rid of it immediately!"
msgstr "Ya has encendido la mecha, ¡deshazte de ella inmediatamente!"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "military explosive small homemade grenade"
msgid_plural "military explosive small homemade grenades"
msgstr[0] "pequeña granada casera de explosivo militar"
msgstr[1] "pequeñas granadas caseras de explosivo militar"
msgstr[2] "pequeñas granadas caseras de explosivo militar"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ Description of "military explosive small homemade grenade"
#. ~ Description of "military explosive homemade grenade"
msgid ""
"An improvised explosive device cobbled together from parts.  Use this item to "
"light the fuse.  You will then have five seconds before it explodes; throwing "
"it would be a good idea."
msgstr ""
"Un artefacto explosivo improvisado, hecho de piezas sueltas. Usa este objeto "
"para encender la mecha. Tendrás 5 segundos antes de que explote; arrojarlo "
"sería una buena idea."

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "military explosive small homemade grenade"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "military explosive homemade grenade"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "small homemade grenade"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "homemade grenade"
msgid ""
"You light the fuse on the improvised grenade.  Throw it before it blows up in "
"your face!"
msgstr ""
"Enciendes la mecha de la granada improvisada. ¡Arrójala antes de que te "
"explote en la cara!"

