msgstr[0] "cuchillo para pelar"
msgstr[1] "cuchillos para pelar"
msgstr[2] "cuchillos para pelar"

#: data/json/items/tool/knives.json
#. ~ Description of variant "paring knife" of item "small kitchen knife"
msgid ""
"A short-bladed knife with a sharp blade, made for fine controlled cuts to "
"vegetables without using a cutting board."
msgstr ""
"Un cuchillo de hoja corta y afilada para realizar cortes finos y controlados "
"en las verduras sin utilizar una tabla de cortar."

#: data/json/items/tool/knives.json
#. ~ Item name
