msgstr[0] "cuchillo de chef"
msgstr[1] "cuchillos de chef"
msgstr[2] "cuchillos de chef"

#: data/json/items/tool/knives.json
#. ~ Description of variant "chef knife" of item "large kitchen knife"
msgid ""
"A long-bladed kitchen knife.  The blade is wider than the handle, giving room "
"for the wielder's knuckles, and it has a characteristic curve for a fast "
"rocking action for chopping vegetables.  It makes an acceptable melee weapon, "
"but the wide blade is unwieldy for butchering."
msgstr ""
"Un cuchillo de cocina de hoja larga. La hoja es más ancha que el mango, lo "
"que deja espacio para los nudillos del que lo maneja, y tiene una curva "
"característica que permite un rápido movimiento de vaivén para cortar "
"verduras. Es un arma aceptable para el combate c. a c., pero su hoja ancha es "
"poco manejable para descuartizar."

#: data/json/items/tool/knives.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "large kitchen knife"
msgid "carving knife"
msgid_plural "carving knives"
msgstr[0] "cuchillo para trinchar"
msgstr[1] "cuchillos para trinchar"
msgstr[2] "cuchillos para trinchar"

#: data/json/items/tool/knives.json
#. ~ Description of variant "carving knife" of item "large kitchen knife"
msgid ""
"A long-bladed kitchen knife with a thin, slightly curved blade for deftly "
"slicing meat either in flat sheets or around the bone.  It makes a decent "
"melee weapon, and is excellent for butchery."
msgstr ""
"Un cuchillo de cocina de hoja larga con un filo fino y ligeramente curvado "
"para rebanar con destreza la carne, ya sea en láminas planas o alrededor del "
"hueso. Es un arma c. a c. decente y excelente para descuartizar."

#: data/json/items/tool/knives.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "large kitchen knife"
msgid "bread knife"
msgid_plural "bread knives"
msgstr[0] "cuchillo de pan"
msgstr[1] "cuchillos de pan"
msgstr[2] "cuchillos de pan"

#: data/json/items/tool/knives.json
#. ~ Description of variant "bread knife" of item "large kitchen knife"
msgid ""
"This knife has quite a long blade with a scalloped edge for cutting bread.  "
"It's not that sharp, but its length and heft mean it could do a bit of damage "
"and cause some nasty tearing."
msgstr ""
"Este cuchillo tiene una cuchilla bastante larga con un borde festoneado para "
"cortar el pan. No esta tan afilado, pero su longitud y peso significan que "
"podría hacer un poco de daño y causar algunos desgarros desagradables."

#: data/json/items/tool/knives.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "huge kitchen knife"
msgid_plural "huge kitchen knives"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/items/tool/knives.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "huge kitchen knife"
msgid "butcher knife"
msgid_plural "butcher knives"
msgstr[0] "cuchillo de carnicero"
msgstr[1] "cuchillos de carnicero"
msgstr[2] "cuchillos de carnicero"

#: data/json/items/tool/knives.json
#. ~ Description of variant "butcher knife" of item "huge kitchen knife"
msgid ""
"A sharp, heavy knife.  It makes a good melee weapon, and is an ideal item for "
"butchering corpses."
msgstr ""
"Un cuchillo grande y afilado. Sirve bien como arma de c. a c. y es ideal para "
"descuartizar cadáveres."

#: data/json/items/tool/knives.json
