#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
#. ~ Description of "torch"
msgid ""
"A large stick wrapped in rags that are soaked with flammable material.  When "
"lit, it produces a fair amount of light.  You'll need a lighter or matches to "
"light it."
msgstr ""
"Un palo grande envuelto en trapos empapados de material inflamable. Cuando se "
"enciende, produce bastante luz. Necesitarás un mechero o cerillas para "
"encenderlo."

#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_misc.json
