"A thin wax candle.  It doesn't provide very much light and will burn "
"relatively quickly.  This candle is lit."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "menorah"
msgid_plural "menorahs"
msgstr[0] "menorah"
msgstr[1] "menorahs"
msgstr[2] "menorahs"

#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
#. ~ Description of "menorah"
msgid ""
"An eight-branched candelabra more properly called a 'hanukkiah', the menorah "
"is used to celebrate the Jewish festival of Hanukkah."
msgstr ""
"La menorah, un candelabro de ocho brazos más propiamente llamado "
"\"hanukkiah\", se utiliza para celebrar la fiesta judía de Hanukkah."

#: data/json/items/tool/masonry.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "masonry saw (off)"
msgid_plural "masonry saws (off)"
msgstr[0] "sierra para hormigón (off)"
msgstr[1] "sierras para hormigón (off)"
msgstr[2] "sierras para hormigón (off)"

#: data/json/items/tool/masonry.json
#. ~ Description of "masonry saw (off)"
msgid ""
"A construction tool for cutting through concrete or other surfaces.  It runs "
"on gasoline.  Using this item will cause it to turn on, turning it into a "
"very powerful but unwieldy melee weapon or a terrible chainsaw."
msgstr ""
"Una herramienta de construcción para cortar hormigón u otras superficies. "
"Funciona con gasolina. El uso de este objeto hará que se encienda, "
"convirtiéndolo en un arma c. a c. muy potente pero poco manejable o en una "
"terrible motosierra."

#: data/json/items/tool/masonry.json
#. ~ value of variable 'success_message' in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_toolweapon_activate__masonrysaw" in use action of item "masonry saw
#. (off)"
msgid "With a roar, the <npc_name> screams to life!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/tool/masonry.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "masonry saw (on)"
msgid_plural "masonry saws (on)"
msgstr[0] "sierra para hormigón (on)"
msgstr[1] "sierras para hormigón (on)"
msgstr[2] "sierras para hormigón (on)"

#: data/json/items/tool/masonry.json
#. ~ Description of "masonry saw (on)"
msgid "This masonry saw is on and making a lot of noise.  Use it to turn it off."
msgstr "Esta sierra de hormigón está encendida y hace mucho ruido. Usar para apagar."

#: data/json/items/tool/masonry.json
#. ~ value of variable 'sound_message' in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_toolweapon_running__masonrysaw" in use action of item "masonry saw
#. (on)"
msgid "Your masonry saw buzzes."
msgstr "Tu sierra de mampostería zumba."

#: data/json/items/tool/masonry.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "electric masonry saw (off)"
msgid_plural "electric masonry saws (off)"
msgstr[0] "sierra eléctrica para mampostería (apag.)"
msgstr[1] "sierras eléctricas para mampostería (apag.)"
msgstr[2] "sierras eléctricas para mampostería (apag.)"

#: data/json/items/tool/masonry.json
#. ~ Description of "electric masonry saw (off)"
msgid ""
"A construction tool for cutting through concrete or other surfaces.  It uses "
"electric motor with integrated battery and is compatible with a UPS.  Using "
"this item will cause it to turn on, turning it into a very powerful but "
"unwieldy melee weapon or a terrible chainsaw."
msgstr ""
"Una herramienta de construcción para cortar hormigón u otras superficies. Usa "
"un motor eléctrico con baterías integradas y es compatible con un SEU. El uso "
"de este objeto hará que se encienda, convirtiéndolo en un arma c. a c. muy "
"potente pero poco manejable o en una terrible motosierra."

#: data/json/items/tool/masonry.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "electric masonry saw (off)"
msgid "You turn on the masonry saw."
msgstr "Enciende tu sierra de mampostería."

#: data/json/items/tool/masonry.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "electric masonry saw (on)"
msgid_plural "electric masonry saws (on)"
msgstr[0] "sierra eléctrica para mampostería (enc.)"
msgstr[1] "sierras eléctricas para mampostería (enc.)"
msgstr[2] "sierras eléctricas para mampostería (enc.)"

#: data/json/items/tool/masonry.json
#. ~ Description of "electric masonry saw (on)"
msgid ""
"This electric masonry saw is on and making a lot of noise.  Use it to turn it "
"off."
msgstr ""
"Esta sierra eléctrica para mampostería está encendida y hace mucho ruido. "
"Usar para apagar."

#: data/json/items/tool/masonry.json
#. ~ value of variable 'sound_message' in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_toolweapon_running__electric_masonrysaw" in use action of item
#. "electric masonry saw (on)"
msgid "Your electric masonry saw buzzes."
msgstr "Tu sierra eléctrica de mampostería zumba."

#: data/json/items/tool/masonry.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "grinder blade"
msgid_plural "grinder blades"
msgstr[0] "hoja de amoladora"
msgstr[1] "hojas de amoladora"
msgstr[2] "hojas de amoladora"

#: data/json/items/tool/masonry.json
#. ~ Description of "grinder blade"
msgid ""
"A 125 mm angle grinder blade.  You could make a power tool with it, or throw "
"it.  Wielding it without sturdy gloves is a bad idea."
msgstr ""
"Una hoja de amoladora angular de 125 mm. Puedes hacer una herramienta "
"eléctrica con ella, o arrojarla. Empuñarla sin guantes resistentes es una "
"mala idea."

#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "adhesive bandage"
msgid_plural "adhesive bandages"
msgstr[0] "venda adhesiva"
msgstr[1] "vendas adhesivas"
msgstr[2] "vendas adhesivas"

#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
#. ~ Description of "adhesive bandage"
msgid ""
"A small medical dressing made of a piece of sterile cloth and sticky tape, "
"used for small injuries not serious enough to require a full-size bandage."
msgstr ""
"Un vendaje médico hecho de un pedazo esterilizado de tela y cinta adhesiva.  "
"Se usa para pequeñas heridas que no requieren una venda grande."

#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "alcohol wipe"
msgid_plural "alcohol wipes"
msgstr[0] "toallita con alcohol"
msgstr[1] "toallitas con alcohol"
msgstr[2] "toallitas con alcohol"

#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
#. ~ Description of "alcohol wipe"
msgid ""
"A wet wipe saturated with alcohol and stored in a sterile package.  Used for "
"personal hygiene or disinfecting small wounds."
msgstr ""
"Una toallita humedecida con alcohol almacenada en un paquete esterilizado.  "
"Se puede utilizar para higiene personal o para desinfectar pequeñas heridas."

#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "anesthesia kit"
msgid_plural "anesthesia kits"
msgstr[0] "kit de anestesia"
msgstr[1] "kits de anestesia"
msgstr[2] "kits de anestesia"

#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
#. ~ Description of "anesthesia kit"
msgid ""
"A kit for inducing anesthesia for surgery, containing specialized canisters "
"with a variety of powerful hypnotic, analgesic, and stimulative drugs.  It's "
"intended for use in specialized medical equipment, and can't be administered "
"manually."
msgstr ""
"Un equipo para introducir anestesia para una cirugía, que contiene "
"recipientes especializados con una variedad de poderosos fármacos hipnóticos, "
"analgésicos y drogas estimulantes. Está destinado a ser utilizado en un "
"equipo médico especializado y no puede ser administrado manualmente."

#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "bandage"
msgid_plural "bandages"
msgstr[0] "vendaje"
msgstr[1] "vendajes"
msgstr[2] "vendajes"

#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
#. ~ Description of "bandage"
msgid ""
"A sterile cloth bandage.  Used for stopping blood loss and protecting wounds "
"from aggravation to help them heal faster."
msgstr ""
"Una venda común de tela esterilizada.  Se usa para detener hemorragias, "
"proteger las heridas para que no empeoren y se curen más rápidamente."

#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "makeshift bandage"
msgid_plural "makeshift bandages"
msgstr[0] "vendaje improvisado"
msgstr[1] "vendajes improvisados"
msgstr[2] "vendajes improvisados"

#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
#. ~ Description of "makeshift bandage"
msgid ""
"A reasonably clean piece of cloth wrapped for use as a simple bandage.  "
"Better than nothing."
msgstr ""
"Un pedazo de tela razonablemente limpio enrollado para usar como una venda "
"común.  Mejor que nada."

#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "bleached makeshift bandage"
msgid_plural "bleached makeshift bandages"
msgstr[0] "Vendaje improvisado blanqueado"
msgstr[1] "Vendajes improvisados blanqueados"
msgstr[2] "Vendajes improvisados blanqueados"

#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
#. ~ Description of "bleached makeshift bandage"
msgid ""
"A piece of cloth treated with a bleach solution to sterilize it for use as a "
"bandage."
msgstr ""
"Un pedazo de tela tratado con una solución de lejía para esterilizarlo y "
"poder usarlo como venda."

#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "boiled makeshift bandage"
msgid_plural "boiled makeshift bandages"
msgstr[0] "vendaje improvisado hervido"
msgstr[1] "vendajes improvisados hervidos"
msgstr[2] "vendajes improvisados hervidos"

#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
#. ~ Description of "boiled makeshift bandage"
msgid "A piece of cloth boiled in water to sterilize it for use as a bandage."
msgstr ""
"Un pedazo de tela hervido en agua para esterilizarlo y poder usarlo como "
"venda."

#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cotton balls"
msgid_plural "cotton balls"
msgstr[0] "bolitas de algodon"
msgstr[1] "bolitas de algodon"
msgstr[2] "bolitas de algodon"

#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
#. ~ Description of "cotton balls"
msgid ""
"Fluffy balls of clean, white cotton.  They can serve as makeshift bandages in "
"an emergency."
msgstr ""
"Bolitas peludas de algodón blanco. Pueden usarse como vendas improvisadas en "
"una emergencia."

#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "antiseptic soaked rag"
msgid_plural "antiseptic soaked rags"
msgstr[0] "trapo empapado en antiséptico"
msgstr[1] "trapos empapados en antiséptico"
msgstr[2] "trapos empapados en antiséptico"

#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
#. ~ Description of "antiseptic soaked rag"
msgid ""
"A rag soaked in antiseptic.  Useful for light wounds, probably won't help "
"with deep bites."
msgstr ""
"Un trapo empapado en antiséptico. Útil para heridas leves, probablemente no "
"ayude con mordeduras profundas."

#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "antiseptic soaked cotton balls"
msgid_plural "antiseptic soaked cotton balls"
msgstr[0] "bolas de algodon empapadas en antiséptico"
msgstr[1] "bolas de algodon empapadas en antiséptico"
msgstr[2] "bolas de algodon empapadas en antiséptico"

#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
#. ~ Description of "antiseptic soaked cotton balls"
msgid ""
"Fluffy balls of clean white cotton.  Now that they've been soaked with "
"antiseptic, they are somewhat useful to disinfect a wound."
msgstr ""
"Bolas esponjosas de algodón blanco y limpio. Ahora empapadas con antiséptico, "
"son algo útiles para desinfectar una herida."

#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "inhaler"
msgid_plural "inhalers"
msgstr[0] "inhalador"
msgstr[1] "inhaladores"
msgstr[2] "inhaladores"

#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
#. ~ Description of "inhaler"
msgid ""
"An albuterol inhaler.  Used in the treatment of bronchospasm, it is a "
"lifeline for people with asthma.  A mild stimulant, it may cause anxiety or "
"tremors."
msgstr ""
"Un inhalador de albuterol. Utilizado en el tratamiento del broncoespasmo, es "
"un salvavidas para las personas asmáticas. Es un estimulante suave que puede "
"provocar ansiedad o temblores."

#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "medical gauze"
msgid_plural "medical gauzes"
msgstr[0] "gasa medica"
msgstr[1] "gasas medicas"
msgstr[2] "gasas medicas"

#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
#. ~ Description of "medical gauze"
msgid ""
"A decent-sized piece of cotton, sterilized and sealed.  It's designed for "
"medical purposes."
msgstr ""
"Un buen pedazo de algodón, esterilizado y sellado.  Está diseñado para uso "
"médico."

#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "spray bottle of liquid bandage"
msgid_plural "spray bottles of liquid bandage"
msgstr[0] "aerosol de venda liquida"
msgstr[1] "aerosoles de venda liquida"
msgstr[2] "aerosoles de venda liquida"

#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
#. ~ Description of "spray bottle of liquid bandage"
msgid ""
"Liquid bandage for minor cuts and scrapes, packaged in a tiny bottle with an "
"atomizer spray for convenient application."
msgstr ""
"Vendaje líquido para pequeños cortes y rozaduras, envasado en un frasco "
"diminuto con un pulverizador para una cómoda aplicación."

#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "RX12 jet injector"
msgid_plural "RX12 jet injectors"
msgstr[0] "inyector RX12"
msgstr[1] "inyectores RX12"
msgstr[2] "inyectores RX12"

#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
#. ~ Description of "RX12 jet injector"
msgid ""
"A Rivtech RX12 jet injector, a small pistol-shaped device used to inject "
"advanced fast-healing chemicals through the skin without using a needle.  A "
"label on the side warns against using more than two doses per hour."
msgstr ""
"Un inyector de chorro Rivtech RX12, un pequeño dispositivo con forma de "
"pistola que se utiliza para inyectar productos químicos avanzados de curación "
"rápida a través de la piel sin utilizar aguja. Una etiqueta lateral advierte "
"contra el uso de más de dos dosis por hora."

#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "scalpel"
msgid_plural "scalpels"
msgstr[0] "escalpelo"
msgstr[1] "escalpelos"
msgstr[2] "escalpelos"

#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
#. ~ Description of "scalpel"
msgid ""
"A very sharp knife designed for surgical cutting.  Its small, sharp blade "
"allows for precision strikes in the hands of the skilled."
msgstr ""
"Un cuchillo muy afilado diseñado para el corte quirúrgico. Su hoja pequeña y "
"afilada permite golpes de precisión en manos de los más hábiles."

#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "small oxygen delivery kit"
msgid_plural "small oxygen delivery kits"
msgstr[0] "equipo pequeño de suministro de oxigeno"
msgstr[1] "equipos pequeños de suministro de oxigeno"
msgstr[2] "equipos pequeños de suministro de oxigeno"

#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
#. ~ Description of "small oxygen delivery kit"
msgid ""
"A small tank of compressed medical oxygen with a folding regulator and mask.  "
"Commonly used in emergency situations, it provides immediate relief for "
"asthma attacks or smoke inhalation, and can provide a brief burst of energy."
msgstr ""
"Una pequeña botella de oxígeno medicinal comprimido con un regulador plegable "
"y una mascarilla. Suele utilizarse en situaciones de emergencia para aliviar "
"de forma inmediata los ataques de asma o la inhalación de humo, y puede "
"proporcionar una breve inyección de energía."

#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "syringe"
msgid_plural "syringes"
msgstr[0] "jeringa"
msgstr[1] "jeringas"
msgstr[2] "jeringas"

#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
#. ~ Description of "syringe"
msgid "A medical syringe.  Used for administering intravenous drugs."
msgstr "Una jeringa médica. Se usa para administrar drogas intravenosas."

#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "thermometer"
msgid_plural "thermometers"
msgstr[0] "termómetro"
msgstr[1] "termómetros"
msgstr[2] "termómetros"

#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
#. ~ Description of "thermometer"
msgid "A plastic thermometer that can read the air temperature."
msgstr "Un termómetro de plástico que puede medir la temperatura del ambiente."

#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "oxygen delivery kit"
msgid_plural "oxygen delivery kits"
msgstr[0] "equipo de suministro de oxigeno"
msgstr[1] "equipos de suministro de oxigeno"
msgstr[2] "equipos de suministro de oxigeno"

#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
#. ~ Description of "oxygen delivery kit"
msgid ""
"A tank of compressed medical oxygen with a regulator and mask.  Commonly used "
"in emergency situations, it provides immediate relief for asthma attacks or "
"smoke inhalation, and can provide a brief burst of energy."
msgstr ""
"Una botella de oxígeno medicinal comprimido con un regulador y una "
"mascarilla. Suele utilizarse en situaciones de emergencia para aliviar de "
"forma inmediata los ataques de asma o la inhalación de humo, y puede "
"proporcionar una breve inyección de energía."

#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "blood draw kit"
msgid_plural "blood draw kits"
msgstr[0] "equipo de extracción de sangre"
msgstr[1] "equipos de extracción de sangre"
msgstr[2] "equipos de extracción de sangre"

#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
#. ~ Description of "blood draw kit"
msgid ""
"A kit for drawing blood, including a test tube for holding the sample.  Use "
"this tool to draw blood, either from yourself or from a corpse you are "
"standing on."
msgstr ""
"Un kit para extraer sangre, que incluye un tubo de ensayo para contener la "
"muestra. Usa esta herramienta para extraer sangre, ya sea de ti mismo o de un "
"cadáver sobre el que te encuentres."

#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "wrapped radiation badge"
msgid_plural "wrapped radiation badges"
msgstr[0] "placa dosimétrica envuelta"
msgstr[1] "placas dosimétricas envueltas"
msgstr[2] "placas dosimétricas envueltas"

#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
#. ~ Description of "wrapped radiation badge"
msgid ""
"A badge that detects radiation dosage, sealed in a radiation-blocking bag.  "
"Use it to remove it from the bag."
msgstr ""
"Una placa que detecta la dosis de radiación, sellada en una bolsa que bloquea "
"la radiación. Usar para sacarla de la bolsa."

#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "wrapped radiation badge"
msgid "Unwrap badge"
msgstr "Desenvolver placa"

#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "wrapped radiation badge"
msgid "You remove the badge from its wrapper, exposing it to ambient radiation."
msgstr ""
"Le sacas el envoltorio a la placa dosimétrica, exponiéndola a la radiación "
"del ambiente."

#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of medical scissors"
msgid_plural "pairs of medical scissors"
msgstr[0] "tijeras médicas"
msgstr[1] "pares de tijeras médicas"
msgstr[2] "pares de tijeras médicas"

#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of medical scissors"
msgid ""
"A pair of medical scissors, typically used by nurses or paramedics to cut "
"bandages or fabric."
msgstr ""
"Un par de tijeras médicas, normalmente utilizadas por enfermeras o "
"paramédicos para cortar vendas o telas."

#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "small saline infusion kit"
msgid_plural "small saline infusion kits"
msgstr[0] "equipo de infusión salina pequeña"
msgstr[1] "equipos de infusiones salinas pequeñas"
msgstr[2] "equipos de infusiones salinas pequeñas"

#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
#. ~ Description of "small saline infusion kit"
msgid ""
"A small, sealed plastic bag for liquids used in intravenous therapy, with "
"rubber tube and cannula - all you need to perform an infusion.  Holds 250 mL "
"of completely sterile saline, therefore it is safe to put it inside your "
"veins, if you know how."
msgstr ""
