"A King Size™ industrial-strength permanent marker, about halfway between a "
"typical marker and a can of spray paint in size.  Activate it to write "
"something down.  However, writing \"Elbereth\" probably won't help you."
msgstr ""
"Un rotulador permanente industrial King Size™, a medio camino entre un "
"rotulador normal y un bote de pintura en spray. Actívar para escribir algo. "
"Sin embargo, escribir 'Elbereth' probablemente no te ayudará."

