#. ~ Description of "black pen"
msgid ""
"A disposable ballpoint pen, offers a smooth writing experience on paper.  Has "
"the same logo as those disposable lighters.  This one is black."
msgstr ""
"Un bolígrafo desechable, ofrece una experiencia de escritura suave sobre el "
"papel. Comparte el mismo logotipo que los mecheros desechables. Este "
"bolígrafo es de color negro."

