msgstr[2] "yugos y arneses reforzados"

#: data/json/items/vehicle/animals.json
#. ~ Description of "reinforced yoke and harness"
msgid ""
"Heavy steel beams and harness to attach a sufficiently large creature to a "
"wheeled vehicle, allowing them to pull it along, reinforced to withstand the "
"rigors of the apocalypse and ill-advised off-roading.  You would still need "
"separate armor for said creature to wear."
msgstr ""
"Pesadas vigas de acero y arneses para sujetar a una criatura lo "
"suficientemente grande a un vehículo con ruedas, permitiéndoles tirar de "
"ella, reforzados para soportar los rigores del apocalipsis y un todoterreno "
"imprudente. Seguiría haciendo falta una armadura aparte para que la llevara "
"dicha criatura."

