#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fungal zombie"
msgid ""
"Once alive, then undead, now something else entirely.  Fungal tendrils sprout "
"from its mouth, eyes, and other orifices, holding together a shambling mass "
"of mold-covered flesh."
msgstr ""
"Antes vivo, luego no muerto, ahora algo totalmente distinto. De su boca, ojos "
"y otros orificios brotan tentáculos fúngicos que mantienen unida a una masa "
"de carne cubierta de moho."

