msgstr[0] "plaga de escabullidores"
msgstr[1] "plagas de escabullidores"
msgstr[2] "plagas de escabullidores"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "skittering plague"
msgid ""
"A giant, sickly-looking cockroach that appears to be using the undead as its "
"primary food source.  The diet of infected flesh doesn't seem to harm it, but "
"something about the roach's biology is clearly changing.  It doesn't seem "
"interested in you."
msgstr ""
"Una cucaracha gigante de aspecto enfermizo que parece utilizar a los muertos "
"vivientes como su principal fuente de alimento. La dieta de carne infectada "
"no parece dañarla, pero algo en la biología de la cucaracha está claramente "
"cambiando. No parece interesada en ti."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "plague nymph"
msgid_plural "plague nymphs"
msgstr[0] "plaga de ninfas"
msgstr[1] "plagas de ninfas"
msgstr[2] "plagas de ninfas"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "plague nymph"
msgid ""
"A sickly-looking mutant cockroach about the size of a rat, raised from birth "
"on a healthy diet of zombie flesh.  It still has enough natural instinct left "
"to avoid approaching you."
msgstr ""
"Una cucaracha mutante de aspecto enfermizo y del tamaño de una rata, criada "
"desde su nacimiento con una saludable dieta de carne de zombi. Todavía le "
"queda suficiente instinto natural para evitar acercarse a ti."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "plague vector"
msgid_plural "plague vectors"
msgstr[0] "vector de la plaga"
msgstr[1] "vectores de la plaga"
msgstr[2] "vectores de la plaga"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "plague vector"
msgid ""
"This giant cockroach has been feeding on the undead for some time and started "
"to mutate chaotically.  Extra limbs and growths sprout from its thorax, and "
"it is notably aggressive even to creatures much larger than itself."
msgstr ""
"Esta cucaracha gigante lleva un tiempo alimentándose de muertos vivientes y "
"ha empezado a mutar caóticamente. De su tórax brotan extremidades y "
"crecimientos adicionales, y es notablemente agresiva incluso con criaturas "
"mucho más grandes que ella."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant cockroach"
msgid_plural "giant cockroaches"
msgstr[0] "cucaracha gigante"
msgstr[1] "cucarachas gigantes"
msgstr[2] "cucarachas gigantes"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant cockroach"
msgid ""
"A mutant cockroach the size of a dog.  This size advantage is apparently all "
"it needs to start regarding humans as food!"
msgstr ""
"Una cucaracha mutante del tamaño de un perro. Al parecer, esta ventaja de "
"tamaño es todo lo que necesita para empezar a considerar a los humanos como "
"comida."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant cockroach nymph"
msgid_plural "giant cockroach nymphs"
msgstr[0] "cucaracha ninfa gigante"
msgstr[1] "cucarachas ninfas gigantes"
msgstr[2] "cucarachas ninfas gigantes"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant cockroach nymph"
msgid "A baby mutant cockroach about the size of a rat."
msgstr "Es una cucaracha mutante bebé, del tamaño de una rata."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "pregnant giant cockroach"
msgid_plural "pregnant giant cockroaches"
msgstr[0] "cucaracha gigante embarazada"
msgstr[1] "cucarachas gigantes embarazadas"
msgstr[2] "cucarachas gigantes embarazadas"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "pregnant giant cockroach"
msgid ""
"A mutant cockroach the size of a small dog.  Its abdomen is heavily swollen "
"with eggs."
msgstr ""
"Una cucaracha mutante del tamaño de un perro pequeño. Su abdomen está muy "
"hinchado con huevos."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized silverfish"
msgid_plural "oversized silverfish"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized silverfish"
msgid "An oversized mutated silverfish the size of a small dog."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant silverfish"
msgid_plural "giant silverfish"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant silverfish"
msgid ""
"A mutant silverfish roughly the size of a person.  Doesn't seem at all "
"interested in you."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant silverfish nymph"
msgid_plural "giant silverfish nymphs"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant silverfish nymph"
msgid "A baby mutant silverfish about the size of a rat."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized bee"
msgid_plural "oversized bees"
msgstr[0] "abeja de gran tamaño"
msgstr[1] "abejas de gran tamaño"
msgstr[2] "abejas de gran tamaño"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized bee"
msgid "A mutant bee the size of a small dog."
msgstr "Una abeja mutante del tamaño de un perro."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant bee"
msgid_plural "giant bees"
msgstr[0] "abeja gigante"
msgstr[1] "abejas gigantes"
msgstr[2] "abejas gigantes"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant bee"
msgid ""
"With a stinger the size of a kitchen knife, this dog-sized insect's black and "
"yellow markings warn you to leave it undisturbed."
msgstr ""
"Con un aguijón del tamaño de una cuchilla, este insecto del tamaño de un "
"perro es negro con rayas amarillas, que te advierten que te alejes y no "
"molestes."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "alpha bee"
msgid_plural "alpha bees"
msgstr[0] "abeja alfa"
msgstr[1] "abejas alfa"
msgstr[2] "abejas alfa"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "alpha bee"
msgid ""
"An enormous mutant bee with black and white markings and a long stinger "
"spelling doom."
msgstr ""
"Una enorme abeja mutante con marcas blancas y negras y un largo aguijón que "
"deletrea."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized centipede"
msgid_plural "oversized centipedes"
msgstr[0] "ciempiés de gran tamaño"
msgstr[1] "ciempiés de gran tamaño"
msgstr[2] "ciempiés de gran tamaño"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized centipede"
msgid ""
"A brightly-colored mutant centipede the size of a small dog, skittering "
"quickly in the underbrush.  Probably won't think you're suitable prey, but "
"beware its venom."
msgstr ""
"Un ciempiés mutante de color brillante del tamaño de un perro pequeño, que se "
"desliza rápidamente en la maleza. Probablemente no piense que eres una presa "
"adecuada, pero ten cuidado con su veneno."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant centipede"
msgid_plural "giant centipedes"
msgstr[0] "Ciempiés gigante"
msgstr[1] "Ciempiés gigantes"
msgstr[2] "Ciempiés gigantes"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant centipede"
msgid ""
"A two-meter-long centipede with a menacing set of venom-dripping mandibles "
"and a worrying number of grabbing appendages, moving swiftly on dozens of "
"spindly legs.  It has a pair of small compound eyes, but seems to mostly "
"orient itself with its antennae."
msgstr ""
"Un ciempiés de dos metros de largo con un amenazador conjunto de mandíbulas "
"que gotean veneno y un preocupante número de apéndices de agarre, que se "
"mueve rápidamente sobre docenas de patas flacas. Tiene un par de pequeños "
"ojos compuestos, pero parece orientarse mayormente con sus antenas."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "centipede larva"
msgid_plural "centipede larvae"
msgstr[0] "larva de ciempiés"
msgstr[1] "larvas de ciempiés"
msgstr[2] "larvas de ciempiés"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "centipede larva"
msgid ""
"A juvenile centipede.  Despite its young age it is still quite large and you "
"reckon these mandibles could pack quite a bite."
msgstr ""
"Un ciempiés juvenil. A pesar de su corta edad, es bastante grande y crees que "
"estas mandíbulas pueden morder."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "centipede matriarch"
msgid_plural "centipede matriarchs"
msgstr[0] "matriarca de ciempiés"
msgstr[1] "matriarcas de ciempiés"
msgstr[2] "matriarcas de ciempiés"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "centipede matriarch"
msgid ""
"A giant centipede grown even larger, hind segments curled up to protect a "
"huge clump of eggs and its children of different ages.  Sometimes one of its "
"young gets shaken off by its clutchmates and disappears into the underbrush."
msgstr ""
"Un ciempiés gigante que creció aún más, los segmentos traseros se curvan para "
"proteger a un enorme grupo de huevos y a sus hijos de diferentes edades. A "
"veces una de sus crías es sacudida por sus compañeros de nidada y desaparece "
"entre la maleza."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "centipede matriarch"
msgid "A small centipede is shaken off in the struggle!"
msgstr "¡Un pequeño ciempiés es sacudido en la lucha!"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "armored centipede"
msgid_plural "armored centipedes"
msgstr[0] "ciempiés blindado"
msgstr[1] "ciempiés blindados"
msgstr[2] "ciempiés blindados"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "armored centipede"
msgid ""
"A huge mutated centipede covered in interlocking chitinous plates of metallic "
"gray, reminding you more of a runaway train car than any living animal.  Its "
"mandibles end in jagged points, seemingly specialized to hunt prey at least "
"as well-armored as itself.  You really don't want to try if you'd fare better."
msgstr ""
"Un enorme ciempiés mutado cubierto de placas quitinosas entrelazadas de un "
"gris metálico, que te hace pensar más en un tren que en un animal vivo. Sus "
"mandíbulas terminan en puntas serradas, y parecen especiales para cazar "
"presas con tanta protección como él mismo ciempiés. La verdad es que no "
"quieres ni intentar ver como luchar contra esto."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized house centipede"
msgid_plural "oversized house centipedes"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized house centipede"
msgid ""
"A mass of spindly legs the size of a large dog.  It is watching you intently, "
"but doesn't go out of its way to hunt you."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant house centipede"
msgid_plural "giant house centipedes"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant house centipede"
msgid ""
"A house centipede grown to immense size, with a slender body the size of a "
"child held up by a constantly-twitching mess of legs.  Already a fearsome "
"hunter at its normal scale, both its hunger and range of acceptable prey grew "
"to match its new size."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant house centipede larva"
msgid_plural "giant house centipede larvae"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant house centipede larva"
msgid "A baby house centipede about the size of a rat."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant dragonfly naiad"
msgid_plural "giant dragonfly naiads"
msgstr[0] "libélula náyade gigante"
msgstr[1] "libélulas náyades gigantes"
msgstr[2] "libélulas náyades gigantes"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant dragonfly naiad"
msgid ""
"A predatory, aquatic dragonfly larva, normally barely a centimeter long and "
"feeding on small fishes, grown to the size of a catfish.  Underneath its "
"sharp mandibles you can see that its folded lower jaw has changed into "
"something resembling a barbed spear."
msgstr ""
"La larva acuática depredadora de una libélula, normalmente de apenas un cm de "
"largo y que se alimenta de pequeños peces, crece hasta el tamaño de un pez "
"gato. Debajo de sus afiladas mandíbulas se puede ver que su mandíbula "
"inferior doblada se convirtió en algo parecido a una lanza de púas."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant dragonfly"
msgid_plural "giant dragonflies"
msgstr[0] "libélula gigante"
msgstr[1] "libélulas gigantes"
msgstr[2] "libélulas gigantes"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant dragonfly"
msgid ""
"A ferocious, bright green dragonfly, still lightning-fast despite growing to "
"the size of a schoolchild.  Its head is little more than a basketball-sized "
"pair of rainbow compound eyes, and its legs - already specialized for "
"grasping prey - end in curved talons."
msgstr ""
"Una feroz libélula verde brillante, que sigue siendo veloz como un rayo a "
"pesar de haber crecido hasta el tamaño de un niño de escuela. Su cabeza es "
"poco más que un par de ojos compuestos del tamaño de un balón de baloncesto, "
"y sus patas - ya especializadas para agarrar presas - terminan en garras "
"curvas."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fused dragonflies"
msgid_plural "fused dragonflies"
msgstr[0] "libélula fusionada"
msgstr[1] "libélulas fusionadas"
msgstr[2] "libélulas fusionadas"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fused dragonflies"
msgid ""
"What appears to be a single, enormous insect with a swollen abdomen is "
"actually the unholy union of two dragonflies in the act of mating, bodies "
"still locked into the telltale heart shape.  The remains of their wings and "
"abdomens form an egg sac they sluggishly pull between them, periodically "
"dropping a handful of glistening eggs."
msgstr ""
"Lo que parece un único y enorme insecto con el abdomen hinchado es, en "
"realidad, la impía unión de dos libélulas en el acto de apareamiento, con los "
"cuerpos todavía encerrados en la reveladora forma de corazón. Los restos de "
"sus alas y abdómenes forman un saco de huevos que arrastran lentamente entre "
"ellos, dejando caer periódicamente un puñado de huevos relucientes."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized firefly"
msgid_plural "oversized fireflies"
msgstr[0] "luciérnaga de gran tamaño"
msgstr[1] "luciérnagas de gran tamaño"
msgstr[2] "luciérnagas de gran tamaño"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized firefly"
msgid ""
"A mutated firefly grown to the size of a large housecat, brightly glowing "
"abdomen bobbing up and down as it tries to impress its unseen mate.  It looks "
"strangely uninterested in you and everything else."
msgstr ""
"Una luciérnaga mutada que crece hasta el tamaño de un gato doméstico grande, "
"con un abdomen brillante que se balancea hacia arriba y hacia abajo mientras "
"trata de impresionar a su pareja invisible. Parece extrañamente desinteresada "
"en ti y en todo lo demás."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "firefly larva"
msgid_plural "firefly larvae"
msgstr[0] "larva de luciernaga"
msgstr[1] "larvas de luciernaga"
msgstr[2] "larvas de luciernaga"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "firefly larva"
msgid ""
"An oversized larva of a firefly.  Shockingly large when compared to the "
"adults of its kind."
msgstr ""
"Una larva sobredimensionada de luciérnaga. Sorprendentemente grande en "
"comparación con los adultos de su especie."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized fly"
msgid_plural "oversized flies"
msgstr[0] "mosca de gran tamaño"
msgstr[1] "moscas de gran tamaño"
msgstr[2] "moscas de gran tamaño"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized fly"
msgid ""
"A mutant housefly the size of a small dog.  Its buzzing is high-pitched and "
"somehow sad."
msgstr ""
"Una mosca doméstica mutante del tamaño de un perro pequeño. Su zumbido es "
"agudo y de alguna manera triste."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant fly"
msgid_plural "giant flies"
msgstr[0] "mosca gigante"
msgstr[1] "moscas gigantes"
msgstr[2] "moscas gigantes"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant fly"
msgid ""
"A tremendous housefly the size of a dog, predictably accompanied by a loud, "
"incessant buzzing sound."
msgstr ""
"Es una tremenda mosca común del tamaño de un perro y como era de esperar, la "
"acompaña un zumbido incesante y fuerte."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant grub"
msgid_plural "giant grubs"
msgstr[0] "gusano gigante"
msgstr[1] "gusanos gigantes"
msgstr[2] "gusanos gigantes"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant grub"
msgid "A grub the size of a small dog."
msgstr "Un gusano del tamaño de un pequeño perro."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "frigate fly"
msgid_plural "frigate flies"
msgstr[0] "mosca fragata"
msgstr[1] "moscas fragata"
msgstr[2] "moscas fragata"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "frigate fly"
msgid ""
"A mutant housefly the size of a cow, creating a loud buzzing sound as it "
"inexplicably stays airborne."
msgstr ""
"Una mosca doméstica mutante del tamaño de una vaca, que crea un fuerte "
"zumbido mientras se mantiene inexplicablemente en el aire."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized mosquito"
msgid_plural "oversized mosquitos"
msgstr[0] "mosquito de gran tamaño"
msgstr[1] "mosquitos de gran tamaño"
msgstr[2] "mosquitos de gran tamaño"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized mosquito"
msgid "A mutant mosquito the size of a small dog, buzzing and fluttering erratically."
msgstr ""
"Un mosquito mutante del tamaño de un perro pequeño, zumbando y revoloteando "
"erráticamente."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant mosquito"
msgid_plural "giant mosquitos"
msgstr[0] "mosquito gigante"
msgstr[1] "mosquitos gigantes"
msgstr[2] "mosquitos gigantes"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant mosquito"
msgid ""
"A giant mutant mosquito the size of a dog, fluttering erratically.  Its face "
"is dominated by a long, spear-tipped proboscis."
msgstr ""
"Un mosquito mutante gigante del tamaño de un perro, revoloteando "
"erráticamente. Su cara está dominada por una larga probóscide con punta de "
"lanza."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant mosquito larva"
msgid_plural "giant mosquito larvae"
msgstr[0] "larva de mosquito gigante"
msgstr[1] "larvas de mosquito gigante"
msgstr[2] "larvas de mosquito gigante"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant mosquito larva"
msgid "A large mosquito larva.  A bit more unsettling now that it isn't microscopic."
msgstr ""
"Una gran larva de mosquito. Un poco más inquietante ahora que no es "
"microscópica."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "bloodbank mosquito"
msgid_plural "bloodbank mosquitos"
msgstr[0] "mosquito banco de sangre"
msgstr[1] "mosquitos banco de sangre"
msgstr[2] "mosquitos banco de sangre"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "bloodbank mosquito"
msgid ""
"A mutant mosquito the size of a cow, with huge, thin wings and legs.  Its "
"face is dominated by a long, spear-tipped proboscis."
msgstr ""
"Un mosquito mutante del tamaño de una vaca, con alas y patas enormes y "
"delgadas. Su cara está dominada por una larga probóscide con punta de lanza."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized moth fly"
msgid_plural "oversized moth flies"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized moth fly"
msgid "A mutant moth fly the size of a rabbit."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant moth fly"
msgid_plural "giant moth flies"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant moth fly"
msgid "A moth fly the size of a small dog.  It appears to pay you no mind."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant moth fly larva"
msgid_plural "giant moth fly larvae"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant moth fly larva"
msgid "A large moth fly larva."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized cellar spider"
msgid_plural "oversized cellar spiders"
msgstr[0] "araña de sótano de gran tamaño"
msgstr[1] "arañas de sótano de gran tamaño"
msgstr[2] "arañas de sótano de gran tamaño"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized cellar spider"
msgid ""
"A cellar spider - also known as \"daddy long-legs\" - grown to distressing "
"size.  Its body is about the size of your head, with the long, spindly legs "
"raising it up to your knee.  It tries getting away from you with an "
"unnervingly fluid run."
msgstr ""
"Una araña del sótano, también conocida como 'papá patas largas', ha crecido "
"hasta alcanzar un tamaño inquietante. Su cuerpo es del tamaño de tu cabeza y "
"sus largas y enjutas patas te llegan a la rodilla. Intenta alejarse de ti con "
"una carrera enervantemente fluida."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json data/mods/Defense_Mode/monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant cellar spider"
msgid_plural "giant cellar spiders"
msgstr[0] "araña de patas largas gigante"
msgstr[1] "arañas de patas largas gigantes"
msgstr[2] "arañas de patas largas gigantes"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json data/mods/Defense_Mode/monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant cellar spider"
msgid ""
"A huge brown spider in constant movement, with a small body the size of a "
"child held up at chest level by a set of spindly legs that branch into "
"three-pronged graspers at the end.  Unlike the smaller variant it obviously "
"decided hunting you is worth a try, and follows you with mandibles chittering "
"in anticipation."
msgstr ""
"Una araña reclusa marrón enorme en constante movimiento con un pequeño cuerpo "
"del tamaño de un humano soportado por un grupo de patas larguiruchas que se "
"ramifican en tres pinzas puntiagudas. A diferencia de la variante más "
"pequeña, obviamente decidió que cazarte es una buena opción y te persigue "
"moviendo las mandíbulas con anticipación."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "cellar spiderling"
msgid_plural "cellar spiderlings"
msgstr[0] "arañita de sótano"
msgstr[1] "arañitas de sótano"
msgstr[2] "arañitas de sótano"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "cellar spiderling"
msgid "A juvenile cellar spider, about the size of a beer bottle."
msgstr "Una araña de sotano joven, del tamaño de una botella de cerveza."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "mommy long-legs"
msgid_plural "mommy long legs"
msgstr[0] "mama piernas largas"
msgstr[1] "mamas piernas largas"
msgstr[2] "mamas piernas largas"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "mommy long-legs"
msgid ""
"This surprisingly shy giant cellar spider holds a head-sized ball of crawling "
"spiderlings of different ages in its mandibles, carefully balancing on her "
"long legs not to drop the precious cargo.  She seems uninterested in you."
msgstr ""
"Esta araña gigante del sótano, sorprendentemente tímida, sostiene en sus "
"mandíbulas una bola del tamaño de una cabeza de arañitas reptantes de "
"diferentes edades, balanceándose cuidadosamente sobre sus largas patas para "
"no dejar caer la preciada carga. No parece interesada en ti."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Death message of monster "mommy long-legs"
msgid "The spiderlings fall to the ground!"
msgstr "¡Las arañitas caen al suelo!"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "warehouse spider"
msgid_plural "warehouse spiders"
msgstr[0] "araña de almacén"
msgstr[1] "arañas de almacén"
msgstr[2] "arañas de almacén"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "warehouse spider"
msgid ""
"A tangle of branching chitinous legs operating seemingly independently, "
"somehow still managing to carry a cow-sized central body.  A number of "
"malformed, twitching legs hang from the cephalothorax, but the head -and "
"especially the mandibles- still seem to be in working order."
msgstr ""
"Una maraña de patas quitinosas ramificadas que operan de forma aparentemente "
"independiente y que, de algún modo, aún consiguen transportar un cuerpo "
"central del tamaño de una vaca. Del cefalotórax cuelgan varias patas "
"malformadas y crispadas, pero la cabeza, y sobre todo las mandíbulas, parecen "
"seguir funcionando."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "warehouse spider"
msgid "The maimed legs start twitching erratically!"
msgstr "¡Las patas mutiladas comienzan a retorcerse erráticamente!"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "detached spider leg"
msgid_plural "detached spider legs"
msgstr[0] "pata de araña suelta"
msgstr[1] "patas de araña sueltas"
msgstr[2] "patas de araña sueltas"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "detached spider leg"
msgid ""
"The strangely branching leg of a mutated cellar spider that… fell?  crawled?  "
"off of the main body when hurt.  It now flails about blindly, irregular "
"clawed appendages grasping at anything that comes close."
msgstr ""
"La pata extrañamente ramificada de una araña de sótano mutada que... ¿se "
"cayó? ¿se arrastró? del cuerpo principal al herirse. Ahora se agita a ciegas, "
"con apéndices de garras irregulares que se agarran a todo lo que se acerca."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized jumping spider"
msgid_plural "oversized jumping spiders"
msgstr[0] "araña saltarina de gran tamaño"
msgstr[1] "arañas saltarinas de gran tamaño"
msgstr[2] "arañas saltarinas de gran tamaño"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized jumping spider"
msgid ""
"A mutant spider the size of a small dog with long forelegs, big eyes, and "
"oversized fangs."
msgstr ""
"Una araña mutante del tamaño de un perro pequeño con largas patas delanteras, "
"grandes ojos y colmillos de gran tamaño."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json data/mods/Defense_Mode/monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant jumping spider"
msgid_plural "giant jumping spiders"
msgstr[0] "araña saltarina gigante"
msgstr[1] "arañas saltarinas gigantes"
msgstr[2] "arañas saltarinas gigantes"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json data/mods/Defense_Mode/monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant jumping spider"
msgid ""
"A dog-sized mutant spider with big forelegs and two pairs of "
"inquisitive-looking eyes.  It can leap quite quickly, even into the treetops."
msgstr ""
"Una araña mutante del tamaño de un perro con grandes patas delanteras y dos "
"pares de ojos de aspecto inquisitivo. Puede saltar con bastante rapidez, "
"incluso a las copas de los árboles."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "jumping spiderling"
msgid_plural "jumping spiderlings"
msgstr[0] "arañita saltarina"
msgstr[1] "arañitas saltarinas"
msgstr[2] "arañitas saltarinas"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "jumping spiderling"
msgid "A juvenile jumping spider, about the size of a beer bottle."
msgstr "Una araña saltadora joven, del tamaño de una botella de cerveza."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "missile spider"
msgid_plural "missile spiders"
msgstr[0] "araña misil"
msgstr[1] "arañas misil"
msgstr[2] "arañas misil"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "missile spider"
msgid ""
"An enormous hairy mutated spider the size of a cow, with strong forelegs and "
"a raised, bloated thorax.  Its vast increase in size has caused it to lose "
"much of its mobility, and when near it you can smell rotten eggs for some "
"reason…"
msgstr ""
"Una enorme araña peluda mutada del tamaño de una vaca, con fuertes patas "
"delanteras y un tórax elevado e hinchado. Su enorme aumento de tamaño le ha "
"hecho perder gran parte de su movilidad, y cuando te acercas a ella puedes "
"oler a huevos podridos por alguna razón..."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized trapdoor spider"
msgid_plural "oversized trapdoor spiders"
msgstr[0] "araña trampilla de gran tamaño"
msgstr[1] "arañas trampillas de gran tamaño"
msgstr[2] "arañas trampillas de gran tamaño"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized trapdoor spider"
msgid ""
"A dark brown mutant spider the size of a dog with a bulbous thorax, big eyes, "
"and oversized fangs."
msgstr ""
"Una araña mutante marrón oscuro del tamaño de un perro con un tórax bulboso, "
"grandes ojos y colmillos de gran tamaño."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant trapdoor spider"
msgid_plural "giant trapdoor spiders"
msgstr[0] "araña trampilla gigante"
msgstr[1] "arañas trampillas gigantes"
msgstr[2] "arañas trampillas gigantes"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant trapdoor spider"
msgid ""
"A gigantic dark brown spider with a bulbous thorax.  It digs a deep "
"underground burrow that serves as a pit to trap unwary prey."
msgstr ""
"Una gigantesca araña marrón oscuro con un tórax bulboso. Cava una profunda "
"madriguera subterránea que sirve como foso para atrapar presas incautas."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "trapdoor spiderling"
msgid_plural "trapdoor spiderlings"
msgstr[0] "arañita tapadera"
msgstr[1] "arañitas tapaderas"
msgstr[2] "arañitas tapaderas"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "trapdoor spiderling"
msgid "A juvenile trapdoor spider, about the size of a beer bottle."
msgstr "Una araña tapadera joven, del tamaño de una botella de cerveza."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "deathtrap spider"
msgid_plural "deathtrap spiders"
msgstr[0] "araña trampa mortal"
msgstr[1] "arañas trampa mortal"
msgstr[2] "arañas trampa mortal"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "deathtrap spider"
msgid ""
"A cow-sized mutant spider with strong, thick legs and a bulbous thorax, dark "
"brown in color.  Anything it pulls into its underground lair is unlikely to "
"see the light of day again."
msgstr ""
"Una araña mutante del tamaño de una vaca, con patas fuertes y gruesas y un "
"tórax bulboso, de color marrón oscuro. Todo lo que arrastra a su guarida "
"subterránea es poco probable que vuelva a ver la luz del día."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized web spinning spider"
msgid_plural "oversized web spinning spiders"
msgstr[0] "araña tejedora de gran tamaño"
msgstr[1] "arañas tejedoras de gran tamaño"
msgstr[2] "arañas tejedoras de gran tamaño"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized web spinning spider"
msgid ""
"A light gray mutant spider the size of a dog with a long legs, big eyes, and "
"oversized fangs."
msgstr ""
"Una araña mutante gris claro del tamaño de un perro con patas largas, ojos "
"grandes y colmillos de gran tamaño."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json data/mods/Defense_Mode/monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant web spider"
msgid_plural "giant web spiders"
msgstr[0] "araña gigante"
msgstr[1] "arañas gigantes"
msgstr[2] "arañas gigantes"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json data/mods/Defense_Mode/monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant web spider"
msgid ""
"A giant, light gray mutant grass spider, it waits for prey to become ensnared "
"in the vast webs that it weaves between the trees."
msgstr ""
"Una gigantesca araña mutante de la hierba, de color gris claro, espera a que "
"la presa quede atrapada en las vastas redes que teje entre los árboles."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "wyrd spider"
msgid_plural "wyrd spiders"
msgstr[0] "araña destino"
msgstr[1] "arañas destino"
msgstr[2] "arañas destino"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "wyrd spider"
msgid ""
"A cow-sized mutated grass spider with long spindly legs, light gray in color. "
" It moves ponderously, depending on its webs to prevent prey from fleeing."
msgstr ""
"Una araña herbívora mutada del tamaño de una vaca, con largas y enjutas "
"patas, de color gris claro. Se mueve pesadamente, dependiendo de sus telas "
"para evitar que las presas huyan."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "web spiderling"
msgid_plural "web spiderlings"
msgstr[0] "arañita tejedora"
msgstr[1] "arañitas tejedoras"
msgstr[2] "arañitas tejedoras"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "web spiderling"
msgid ""
"A juvenile giant grass spider, about the size of a beer bottle.  Too young to "
"be venomous, or to walk proficiently for that matter."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized black widow spider"
msgid_plural "oversized black widow spiders"
msgstr[0] "viuda negra de gran tamaño"
msgstr[1] "viudas negras de gran tamaño"
msgstr[2] "viudas negras de gran tamaño"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized black widow spider"
msgid ""
"A black mutant spider the size of a small dog with a long legs, big eyes, and "
"oversized fangs.  There is a red hourglass shape on its thorax."
msgstr ""
"Una araña negra mutante del tamaño de un pequeño perro con patas largas, "
"grandes ojos y colmillos de gran tamaño. Tiene una forma de reloj de arena "
"rojo en su tórax."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json data/mods/Defense_Mode/monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant black widow"
msgid_plural "giant black widows"
msgstr[0] "viuda negra gigante"
msgstr[1] "viudas negras gigantes"
msgstr[2] "viudas negras gigantes"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json data/mods/Defense_Mode/monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant black widow"
msgid ""
"A dog-sized mutated black widow spider.  There is a red hourglass shape on "
"its thorax.  A highly venomous nightmare come to life."
msgstr ""
"Una araña viuda negra mutada del tamaño de un perro. Tiene una forma de reloj "
"de arena rojo en su tórax. Una pesadilla altamente venenosa cobra vida."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "black death widow"
msgid_plural "black death widows"
msgstr[0] "viuda negra"
msgstr[1] "viudas negras"
msgstr[2] "viudas negras"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "black death widow"
msgid ""
"A cow-sized mutated black widow spider with a distinctive red hourglass shape "
"on its thorax.  Still possesses its infamous venom, but it probably doesn't "
"even need that to crush you like a bug."
msgstr ""
"Una araña viuda negra mutada del tamaño de una vaca con una distintiva forma "
"de reloj de arena rojo en su tórax. Todavía posee su infame veneno, pero "
"probablemente ni siquiera lo necesita para aplastarte como a un insecto."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "black widow spiderling"
msgid_plural "black widow spiderlings"
msgstr[0] "arañita de viuda negra"
msgstr[1] "arañitas de viuda negra"
msgstr[2] "arañitas de viuda negra"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "black widow spiderling"
msgid ""
"The horrid spawn of a giant black widow spider.  Though, given the size that "
"it currently is, it appears relatively harmless."
msgstr ""
"El horrible engendro de una araña viuda negra gigante. Aunque, dado el tamaño "
"que tiene actualmente, parece relativamente inofensiva."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized wolf spider"
msgid_plural "oversized wolf spiders"
msgstr[0] "araña lobo de gran tamaño"
msgstr[1] "arañas lobo de gran tamaño"
msgstr[2] "arañas lobo de gran tamaño"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized wolf spider"
msgid ""
"A shaggy brown mutant spider the size of a dog with eight long legs, two "
"especially big eyes, and oversized fangs."
msgstr ""
"Una araña mutante marrón peluda del tamaño de un perro con patas largas, dos "
"ojos especialmente grandes y colmillos de gran tamaño."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant wolf spider"
msgid_plural "giant wolf spiders"
msgstr[0] "araña-lobo gigante"
msgstr[1] "arañas-lobo gigantes"
msgstr[2] "arañas-lobo gigantes"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant wolf spider"
msgid ""
"A wolf spider mutated to about thirty times its normal size, it moves quickly "
"and aggressively to catch and consume prey."
msgstr ""
"Una araña lobo mutada que creció una treinta veces su tamaño normal. Se mueve "
"rápidamente y de manera agresiva para cazar y consumir a su presa."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "wolf spiderling"
msgid_plural "wolf spiderlings"
msgstr[0] "arañita lobo"
msgstr[1] "arañitas lobo"
msgstr[2] "arañitas lobo"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "wolf spiderling"
msgid "A juvenile wolf spider, about the size of a beer bottle."
msgstr "Una araña lobo joven, del tamaño de una botella de cerveza."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "necrowolf spider"
msgid_plural "necrowolf spiders"
msgstr[0] "araña necrolobo"
msgstr[1] "arañas necrolobos"
msgstr[2] "arañas necrolobos"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "necrowolf spider"
msgid ""
"A cow-sized, hairy mutant wolf spider.  Its mouthparts have noticeably "
"changed, and it moves much more slowly now with the additional weight it "
"needs to carry."
msgstr ""
"Una araña lobo mutante peluda del tamaño de una vaca. Sus piezas bucales han "
"cambiado notablemente, y ahora se mueve mucho más despacio con el peso "
"adicional que necesita llevar."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "wasp larva"
msgid_plural "wasp larvae"
msgstr[0] "larva de avispa"
msgstr[1] "larvas de avispa"
msgstr[2] "larvas de avispa"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "wasp larva"
msgid ""
"A dog-sized white grub, featureless apart from a vestigal mouthpart.  It "
"hangs upside-down in its cell, and regurgitates sweet-smelling fluid in "
"return for the scraps of viscera fed to it by the workers below."
msgstr ""
"Una larva blanca del tamaño de un perro, sin más rasgos que un vestigio de "
"boca. Está colgado boca abajo en su celda y regurgita un líquido de olor "
"dulce a cambio de los restos de vísceras que le dan los trabajadores de abajo."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "wasp pupa"
msgid_plural "wasp pupae"
msgstr[0] "pupa de avispa"
msgstr[1] "pupas de avispa"
msgstr[2] "pupas de avispa"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "wasp pupa"
msgid ""
"A wasp larva undergoing metamorphosis into a full-grown giant wasp.  It looks "
"like a strangely immobile adult coated in a thin white membrane, its legs and "
"wings packed tightly into its cell."
msgstr ""
"Una larva de avispa en proceso de metamorfosis a una avispa gigante adulta. "
"Parece un adulto extrañamente inmóvil recubierto de una fina membrana blanca, "
"con las patas y las alas apretadas en su celda."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized wasp"
msgid_plural "oversized wasps"
msgstr[0] "avispa de gran tamaño"
msgstr[1] "avispas de gran tamaño"
msgstr[2] "avispas de gran tamaño"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized wasp"
msgid ""
"A huge wasp the size of a large cat with bright yellow markings on her "
"jet-black carapace and a threatening stinger.  She flies around erratically, "
"searching for smaller prey."
msgstr ""
"Una enorme avispa del tamaño de un gato grande con marcas amarillas "
"brillantes en su caparazón negro azabache y un amenazante aguijón. Vuela "
"erráticamente en busca de presas más pequeñas."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized wasp guard"
msgid_plural "oversized wasp guards"
msgstr[0] "avispa guardiana de gran tamaño"
msgstr[1] "avispas guardianas de gran tamaño"
msgstr[2] "avispas guardianas de gran tamaño"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized wasp guard"
msgid ""
"A mutated wasp worker, buzzing around the nest.  While her foraging sisters "
"are relatively content to leave you be, this one won't hesitate to attack "
"anything she considers a threat to the nest.  Don't linger."
msgstr ""
"Una avispa obrera mutada, zumbando alrededor de su nido. Mientras que sus "
"hermanas, buscadoras de alimento, se contentan con vivir y dejar vivir, ésta "
"no dudará en atacar cualquier cosa que considere una amenaza para el nido. No "
"te detengas."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized wasp queen"
msgid_plural "oversized wasp queens"
msgstr[0] "avispa reina de gran tamaño"
msgstr[1] "avispas reina de gran tamaño"
msgstr[2] "avispas reina de gran tamaño"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized wasp queen"
msgid ""
"A mutated wasp queen grown to the size of a person, laying a single white egg "
"in each empty cell she comes across while scurrying around on the paper walls "
"of her home.  She struggles to fit into some of them, but the newer cells "
"seem to be getting larger…"
msgstr ""
"Una reina avispa mutada que ha crecido hasta alcanzar el tamaño de una "
"persona, pone un solo huevo blanco en cada celda vacía que encuentra mientras "
"corretea por los muros de papel de su hogar. Le cuesta encajar en algunos de "
"ellos, pero las nuevas celdas parecen ser cada vez más grandes..."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant wasp"
msgid_plural "giant wasps"
msgstr[0] "avispa gigante"
msgstr[1] "avispas gigantes"
msgstr[2] "avispas gigantes"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant wasp"
msgid ""
"A gigantic wasp worker, scouring the landscape for an easy meal to feed the "
"next generation.  Her abdomen glowers with ominous yellow stripes and ends in "
"a half-hidden stinger the size of a kitchen knife."
msgstr ""
"Una gigantesca avispa obrera, recorriendo el paisaje en busca de una comida "
"fácil para alimentar a la próxima generación. Su abdomen brilla con ominosas "
"rayas amarillas y termina con un aguijón semioculto del tamaño de un cuchillo "
"de cocina."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant wasp guard"
msgid_plural "giant wasp guards"
msgstr[0] "avispa guardiana gigante"
msgstr[1] "avispas guardianas gigantes"
msgstr[2] "avispas guardianas gigantes"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant wasp guard"
msgid ""
"A wasp worker grown to the size of a person, buzzing around her home.  While "
"her foraging sisters are relatively content to live and let live, this one "
"won't hesitate to attack anything she considers a threat to the nest.  Don't "
"linger."
msgstr ""
"Una avispa obrera del tamaño de una persona, zumbando alrededor de su casa. "
"Mientras que sus hermanas, buscadoras de alimento, se contentan con vivir y "
"dejar vivir, ésta no dudará en atacar cualquier cosa que considere una "
"amenaza para el nido. No te detengas."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant wasp queen"
msgid_plural "giant wasp queens"
msgstr[0] "avispa reina gigante"
msgstr[1] "avispas reina gigante"
msgstr[2] "avispas reina gigante"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant wasp queen"
msgid ""
"A yellowjacket queen grown to the size of a horse, towering over her "
"daughters.  Even with her abdomen swollen with eggs and wings long unused she "
"still poses a threat to interlopers, should her children have failed at "
"subduing them."
msgstr ""
"Una reina de chaqueta amarilla crecida hasta el tamaño de un caballo, se "
"eleva sobre sus hijas. Incluso con su abdomen hinchado de huevos y las alas "
"sin usar sigue siendo una amenaza para los entrometidos, en caso de que sus "
"hijos hayan fracasado en someterlos."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "dermatik larva"
msgid_plural "dermatik larvae"
msgstr[0] "larva dermática"
msgstr[1] "larvas dermáticas"
msgstr[2] "larvas dermáticas"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "dermatik larva"
msgid ""
"A fat white grub as big as a squirrel, with a pair of large, spadelike "
"mandibles."
msgstr ""
"Una larva blanca y gorda, grande como una ardilla, con un par de mandíbulas "
"largas, con forma de palas."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "dermatik"
msgid_plural "dermatiks"
msgstr[0] "dermatik"
msgstr[1] "dermatiks"
msgstr[2] "dermatiks"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "dermatik"
msgid ""
"A colorful parasitoid wasp grown to the size of a dog, with a huge ovipositor "
"extruding from her abdomen.  She darts around in search of a suitable home "
"for her many, many children."
msgstr ""
"Una colorida avispa parasitoide del tamaño de un perro, con un enorme "
"ovipositor que sale de su abdomen. Se lanza en busca de un hogar adecuado "
"para sus muchos, muchos hijos."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "dermatik midwife"
msgid_plural "dermatik midwives"
msgstr[0] "matrona dermatik"
msgstr[1] "matronas dermatik"
msgstr[2] "matronas dermatik"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "dermatik midwife"
msgid ""
"A dermatik grown even larger, her wings and ovipositor chewed off by her "
"sisters.  She now stands watch in the nest, tending to the unfortunate hosts "
"dragged home and ensuring they don't perish before their purpose is fulfilled."
msgstr ""
"Una dermatik crecida aún más, con sus alas y su ovipositor masticados por sus "
"hermanas. Ahora vigila en el nido, atendiendo a los desafortunados huéspedes "
"arrastrados a casa y asegurándose de que no perezcan antes de cumplir su "
"propósito."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "motionless deer"
msgid_plural "motionless deers"
msgstr[0] "ciervo inmóvil"
msgstr[1] "ciervos inmóviles"
msgstr[2] "ciervos inmóviles"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "motionless deer"
msgid ""
"A paralyzed, emaciated deer.  It spasms as it notices your presence, "
"terrified eyes darting around the muddy chamber when it fails to stand and "
"flee."
msgstr ""
"Un ciervo paralizado y demacrado. Tiene espasmos al notar tu presencia, sus "
"ojos aterrorizados recorren la cámara de barro cuando no logra ponerse de pie "
"y huir."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "motionless deer"
msgid "The sudden motion of their host cause some dermatik larvae to flee!"
msgstr ""
"¡El movimiento repentino de su huésped hace que algunas larvas de dermatik "
"huyan!"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "helpless dog"
msgid_plural "helpless dogs"
msgstr[0] "perro desvalido"
msgstr[1] "perros desvalidos"
msgstr[2] "perros desvalidos"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "helpless dog"
msgid ""
"A barely living dog, panting in a pool of slime and blood.  As you draw near "
"it lets out a faint whimper, and you see the smallest hint of a twitch in its "
"tail."
msgstr ""
"Un perro apenas vivo, jadeando en un charco de baba y sangre. Cuando te "
"acercas, suelta un leve gemido y ves un mínimo movimiento de su cola."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "twitching spider"
msgid_plural "twitching spiders"
msgstr[0] "araña temblorosa"
msgstr[1] "arañas temblorosas"
msgstr[2] "arañas temblorosas"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "twitching spider"
msgid ""
"A giant, mutated spider lying on its back, legs twitching without pause.  A "
"translucent slime, mixed with its ichor seeps from its joints, and its chitin "
"is marked by numerous exit wounds."
msgstr ""
"Una araña gigante y mutada que yace sobre su espalda, con las patas "
"moviéndose sin pausa. Una baba translúcida, mezclada con su icor, se filtra "
"de sus articulaciones, y su quitina está marcada por numerosas heridas de "
"salida."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized ant"
msgid_plural "oversized ants"
msgstr[0] "hormiga de gran tamaño"
msgstr[1] "hormigas de gran tamaño"
msgstr[2] "hormigas de gran tamaño"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized ant"
msgid ""
"A mutant red ant the size of a dog, covered in chitinous plates.  She "
"possesses a pair of wriggling antennae and vicious-looking mandibles."
msgstr ""
"Una hormiga roja mutante del tamaño de un perro cubierto de placas "
"quitinosas. Posee un par de antenas que se retuercen y unas mandíbulas de "
"aspecto feroz."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster_overrides.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant ant"
msgid_plural "giant ants"
msgstr[0] "hormiga gigante"
msgstr[1] "hormigas gigantes"
msgstr[2] "hormigas gigantes"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster_overrides.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant ant"
msgid ""
"An enormous red ant covered in chitinous plates.  She possesses a pair of "
"wriggling antennae and vicious-looking mandibles."
msgstr ""
"Una enorme hormiga roja cubierta de placas de quitina. Posee un par de "
"antenas bamboleantes y mandíbulas de apariencia feroz."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized acidic ant"
msgid_plural "oversized acidic ants"
msgstr[0] "hormiga ácida de gran tamaño"
msgstr[1] "hormigas ácidas de gran tamaño"
msgstr[2] "hormigas ácidas de gran tamaño"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized acidic ant"
msgid ""
"A dog-sized mutant brown ant with a swollen abdomen that ends with a small "
"orifice at the tip.  Glistening liquid drips out periodically."
msgstr ""
"Una hormiga mutante marrón del tamaño de un perro con un abdomen hinchado, "
"que termina con un pequeño orificio en la punta del cual gotea un líquido "
"brillante periódicamente."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster_overrides.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant acidic ant"
msgid_plural "giant acidic ants"
msgstr[0] "hormiga ácida gigante"
msgstr[1] "hormigas ácidas gigantes"
msgstr[2] "hormigas ácidas gigantes"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster_overrides.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant acidic ant"
msgid ""
"A monstrous brown ant with a swollen abdomen that ends with a small orifice "
"at the tip.  Glistening liquid seems to drip out periodically."
msgstr ""
"Una hormiga marrón monstruosa con un abdomen hinchado, que termina con un "
"pequeño orificio en la punta del cual gotea un líquido brillante "
"periódicamente."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json data/json/monsters/zed_acid.json
#: data/json/monsters/zed_amphibian.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/zombies.json
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/zombies.json
#. ~ Death message of monster "giant acidic ant"
#. ~ Death message of monster "acidic ant larva"
#. ~ Death message of monster "giant acidic soldier ant"
#. ~ Death message of monster "acidic zombear"
#. ~ Death message of monster "acidic zombie horse"
#. ~ Death message of monster "acidic zombie"
#. ~ Death message of monster "corrosive zombie"
#. ~ Death message of monster "spitter zombie"
#. ~ Death message of monster "wretched puker"
#. ~ Death message of monster "acidic zombie dog"
#. ~ Death message of monster "gastro bufo"
#. ~ Death message of monster "MoxPhore Emetic"
#. ~ Death message of monster "acid dilophosaurus"
#. ~ Death message of monster "acid ceratosaurus"
#, c-format
msgid "The %s's body leaks acid."
msgstr "El cuerpo del %s chorrea ácido."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "acidic ant larva"
msgid_plural "acidic ant larvae"
msgstr[0] "larva de hormiga ácida"
msgstr[1] "larvas de hormiga ácida"
msgstr[2] "larvas de hormiga ácida"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "acidic ant larva"
msgid ""
"A squirming yellow grub that seems to be oozing liquid from both ends of its "
"body.  It appears its chitin hasn't developed enough to resist acid."
msgstr ""
"Es una larva brillante que parece estar chorreando un líquido viscoso de las "
"dos extremos de su cuerpo. Parece que su quitina todavía no se ha "
"desarrollado lo suficiente como para resistir el ácido."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant acidic queen ant"
msgid_plural "giant acidic queen ants"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant acidic queen ant"
msgid ""
"An enormous brown ant with an elongated, pulsating abdomen.  Her orifice "
"seems developed only for egg-laying rather than spraying acid like the rest "
"of the colony, but she doesn't seem affected by the acrid liquid either."
msgstr ""
"Una enorme hormiga marrón con el abdomen hinchado y palpitante. Parece tener "
"un orificio desarrollado solo para poner huevos en lugar de escupir ácido "
"como las otras hormigas, pero tampoco parece ser afectada por el agrio "
"líquido."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant acidic soldier ant"
msgid_plural "giant acidic soldier ants"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant acidic soldier ant"
msgid ""
"A massive woolly brown ant that towers over the worker ants with a giant head "
"crest.  Along with her huge mandibles, a corrosive liquid seeps from the end "
"of her bloated abdomen."
msgstr ""
"Una inmensa hormiga marrón y peluda que sobresale entre las hormigas obreras "
"con su gigante cabeza con cresta. Además de sus enormes mandíbulas, un "
"líquido corrosivo se filtra desde el fondo de su hinchado abdomen."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "super soldier acidic ant"
msgid_plural "super soldier acidic ants"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "super soldier acidic ant"
msgid ""
"A cow-sized, woolly brown ant.  Corrosive liquid seeping from her huge "
"mandibles.  Given the relative strength of ants to their body size, you don't "
"doubt that this one could shove cars around or rip through solid walls."
msgstr ""
"Una hormiga lanosa marrón del tamaño de una vaca. Líquido corrosivo goteando "
"de sus enormes mandíbulas. Dada la relativa fuerza de las hormigas en "
"relación con el tamaño de su cuerpo, no dudas de que ésta podría empujar "
"coches o rasgar paredes sólidas."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "ant larva"
msgid_plural "ant larvae"
msgstr[0] "larva de hormiga"
msgstr[1] "larvas de hormiga"
msgstr[2] "larvas de hormiga"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "ant larva"
msgid ""
"A pulsating sausage of glistening white flesh, the size of a large cat.  On "
"one end is a set of squirming mouth parts."
msgstr ""
"Como una salchicha de reluciente carne blanca que palpita, del tamaño de un "
"gato grande. En un extremo hay un conjunto de piezas bucales que se retuercen."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant queen ant"
msgid_plural "giant queen ants"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant queen ant"
msgid ""
"A colossal red ant with a bulging, bloated thorax.  She moves slowly and "
"deliberately, tending to nearby eggs and continually laying more."
msgstr ""
"Una colosal hormiga roja con un tórax hinchado y saltón. Se mueve lenta y "
"deliberadamente, cuidando los huevos cercanos y continuamente poniendo más."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant soldier ant"
msgid_plural "giant soldier ants"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant soldier ant"
msgid ""
"A huge and hairy red ant almost twice the size of other giant ants.  Bulging "
"pincers extend from her jaws."
msgstr ""
"Una hormiga roja enorme y peluda, casi del doble de tamaño que las otras "
"hormigas gigantes. Grandes pinzas se extienden de su mandíbula."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "super soldier ant"
msgid_plural "super soldier ants"
msgstr[0] "hormiga super soldado"
msgstr[1] "hormigas super soldado"
msgstr[2] "hormigas super soldado"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "super soldier ant"
msgid ""
"A cow-sized, hairy red ant.  Bulging pincers extend from her jaws.  Given the "
"relative strength of ants to their body size, you don't doubt that this one "
"could shove cars around or rip through solid walls."
msgstr ""
"Una hormiga roja peluda del tamaño de una vaca. Unas abultadas pinzas salen "
"de sus mandíbulas. Dada la fuerza relativa de las hormigas en relación con el "
"tamaño de su cuerpo, no dudas de que ésta podría empujar coches o atravesar "
"paredes sólidas."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized locust"
msgid_plural "oversized locusts"
msgstr[0] "langosta de gran tamaño"
msgstr[1] "langostas de gran tamaño"
msgstr[2] "langostas de gran tamaño"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized locust"
msgid ""
"A yellow and brown mutated locust the size of a small dog, with big eyes and "
"long, powerful legs."
msgstr ""
"Una langosta mutada amarilla y marrón del tamaño de un perro pequeño con "
"grandes ojos y largas y poderosas patas."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant locust"
msgid_plural "giant locusts"
msgstr[0] "langosta gigante"
msgstr[1] "langostas gigantes"
msgstr[2] "langostas gigantes"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant locust"
msgid ""
"A yellow and brown mutated locust the size of a dog with big eyes and long, "
"powerful legs.  You don't think it'll eat you, but it could cause massive "
"damage to nearby plants."
msgstr ""
"Una langosta mutada amarilla y marrón del tamaño de un perro con grandes ojos "
"y largas y poderosas patas. No crees que te comerá pero podría causar mucho "
"daño a las plantas cercanas."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "famine"
msgid_plural "famines"
msgstr[0] "hambruna"
msgstr[1] "hambrunas"
msgstr[2] "hambrunas"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "famine"
msgid ""
"A cow-sized yellow and brown mutated locust with huge, staring eyes and long, "
"powerful legs.  The bane of the post-apocalyptic farmer."
msgstr ""
"Una langosta mutada del tamaño de una vaca, de color amarillo y marrón, con "
"ojos enormes y fijos y patas largas y poderosas. La perdición del agricultor "
"postapocalíptico."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "locust nymph"
msgid_plural "locust nymphs"
msgstr[0] "ninfa de langosta (Insecto)"
msgstr[1] "ninfas de langosta (Insecto)"
msgstr[2] "ninfas de langosta (Insecto)"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "locust nymph"
msgid ""
"A locust the size of a rabbit.  You'd hate to think what a swarm of these "
"could do."
msgstr ""
"Una langosta(Insecto) del tamaño de un conejo. Odiarías pensar lo que un "
"enjambre de estos podría hacer."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized aphid"
msgid_plural "oversized aphids"
msgstr[0] "pulgón de gran tamaño"
msgstr[1] "pulgones de gran tamaño"
msgstr[2] "pulgones de gran tamaño"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized aphid"
msgid ""
"This huge aphid is as big as a hamster.  It's not as thirsty as bigger ones, "
"but a herd of these could eat your crops easily."
msgstr ""
"Este enorme pulgón es del tamaño de un hámster. No es tan sediento como los "
"más grandes pero una horda de estos te podrían comer tu cosecha fácilmente."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant aphid"
msgid_plural "giant aphids"
msgstr[0] "pulgón gigante"
msgstr[1] "pulgones gigantes"
msgstr[2] "pulgones gigantes"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant aphid"
msgid ""
"A green aphid about the size of a rabbit.  It is constantly searching for "
"plants to suck from."
msgstr ""
"Un pulgón verde del tamaño de un conejo. Está constantemente buscando plantas "
"para succionar su savia."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized praying mantis"
msgid_plural "oversized praying mantises"
msgstr[0] "mantis religiosa de gran tamaño"
msgstr[1] "mantis religiosas de gran tamaño"
msgstr[2] "mantis religiosas de gran tamaño"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized praying mantis"
msgid ""
"A green mutant insect with sharp grappling spikes on its front legs.  It's a "
"little smaller than an adult person."
msgstr ""
"Un insecto mutante verde con púas afiladas de agarre en sus patas delanteras. "
"Un poco más pequeño que un humano adulto."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant praying mantis"
msgid_plural "giant praying mantises"
msgstr[0] "mantis religiosa gigante"
msgstr[1] "mantis religiosas gigantes"
msgstr[2] "mantis religiosas gigantes"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant praying mantis"
msgid ""
"An enormous green insect grown to about the size of a bear.  It moves in a "
"weird, dance-like pattern and looks ready to chop your head off at any moment."
msgstr ""
"Un enorme insecto verde del tamaño de un oso. Se mueve con un extraño patrón "
"de baile y parece dispuesto a cortarte la cabeza en cualquier momento."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "praying mantis nymph"
msgid_plural "praying mantis nymphs"
msgstr[0] "ninfa de mantis religiosa"
msgstr[1] "ninfas de religiosas"
msgstr[2] "ninfas de mantis religiosas"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "praying mantis nymph"
msgid ""
"A mantis nymph about the size of a dog.  Even though its far smaller than the "
"adults, you have a feeling it wouldn't take kindly to you coming too close."
msgstr ""
"Una ninfa de mantis del tamaño de un perro. Aunque es mucho más pequeña que "
"los adultos, tienes la sensación de que no le gustaría que te acercaras "
"demasiado."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "great mantis"
msgid_plural "great mantises"
msgstr[0] "gran mantis"
msgstr[1] "grandes mantis"
msgstr[2] "grandes mantis"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "great mantis"
msgid ""
"This ferocious cow-sized mantis stalks the fields of New England.  It's "
"probably capable of killing a moose with its powerful arms."
msgstr ""
"Esta feroz mantis del tamaño de una vaca acecha los campos de Nueva "
"Inglaterra. Probablemente sea capaz de matar a un alce con sus poderosos "
"brazos."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant mole cricket"
msgid_plural "giant mole crickets"
msgstr[0] "grillo topo gigante"
msgstr[1] "grillos topo gigantes"
msgstr[2] "grillos topo gigantes"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant mole cricket"
msgid ""
"An enormous underground bug.  Beware its ear-splitting screech and strong "
"shovel-like front legs."
msgstr ""
"Un enorme insecto subterráneo. Ten cuidado del alarido estridente y de las "
"poderosas patas delanteras que parecen palas."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "mole cricket nymph"
msgid_plural "mole cricket nymphs"
msgstr[0] "ninfa de grillo topo"
msgstr[1] "ninfas de grillo topo"
msgstr[2] "ninfas de grillo topo"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "mole cricket nymph"
msgid "A whitish mole cricket nymph the size of a dog."
msgstr "Una ninfa blanquecina de grillo topo del tamaño de un perro."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized lady bug"
msgid_plural "oversized lady bugs"
msgstr[0] "mariquita de gran tamaño"
msgstr[1] "mariquitas de gran tamaño"
msgstr[2] "mariquitas de gran tamaño"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized lady bug"
msgid ""
"This is a mutated lady bug the size of a big dog.  While not as dangerous as "
"her giant sisters, she's still troublesome to deal with."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una mariquita de San Antonio mutante del tamaño de un perro grande. "
"Aunque no es tan peligrosa como sus hermanas gigantes, sigue siendo "
"problemática."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant lady bug"
msgid_plural "giant lady bugs"
msgstr[0] "mariquita gigante"
msgstr[1] "mariquitas gigantes"
msgstr[2] "mariquitas gigantes"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant lady bug"
msgid ""
"The normal-sized version of this red and black beetle is generally considered "
"cute, and is adored by children and associated with good luck.  This monster, "
"on the other hand is clearly a ferocious predator capable of killing swarms "
"of ants, aphids, and unprepared humans."
msgstr ""
"La versión de tamaño normal de este escarabajo rojo y negro se considera "
"generalmente simpática, y es adorada por los niños y asociada a la buena "
"suerte. Este monstruo, en cambio, es claramente un feroz depredador capaz de "
"matar enjambres de hormigas, pulgones y humanos desprevenidos."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "lady bug larva"
msgid_plural "lady bug larvae"
msgstr[0] "larva de mariquita"
msgstr[1] "larvas de mariquita"
msgstr[2] "larvas de mariquita"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "lady bug larva"
msgid ""
"A large armored larva looking not unlike a centipede.  Even though it's just "
"a juvenile the armor on its back already looks functional."
msgstr ""
"Una gran larva acorazada con aspecto de ciempiés. A pesar de que es joven su "
"armadura en la espalda ya parece funcional."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized grasshopper"
msgid_plural "oversized grasshoppers"
msgstr[0] "saltamontes de gran tamaño"
msgstr[1] "saltamontes de gran tamaño"
msgstr[2] "saltamontes de gran tamaño"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized grasshopper"
msgid "A large grasshopper a few times bigger than a regular one."
msgstr "Un saltamontes grande, unas pocas veces más grande que uno normal."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant grasshopper"
msgid_plural "giant grasshoppers"
msgstr[0] "saltamontes gigante"
msgstr[1] "saltamontes gigantes"
msgstr[2] "saltamontes gigantes"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant grasshopper"
msgid ""
"A huge green grasshopper about the size of a big dog, with long and strong "
"back legs.  It hops, it hops and never stops."
msgstr ""
"Un enorme saltamontes verde del tamaño de un perro grande, con largas y "
"fuertes patas traseras. Salta, salta y nunca para."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "grasshopper nymph"
msgid_plural "grasshopper nymphs"
msgstr[0] "ninfa de saltamontes"
msgstr[1] "ninfas de saltamontes"
msgstr[2] "ninfas de saltamontes"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "grasshopper nymph"
msgid "A grasshopper nymph the size of a rabbit."
msgstr "Una ninfa de saltamontes del tamaño de un conejo."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant stag beetle larva"
msgid_plural "giant stag beetle larvae"
msgstr[0] "larva gigantes de escarabajo ciervo"
msgstr[1] "larvas gigantes de escarabajo ciervo"
msgstr[2] "larvas gigantes de escarabajo ciervo"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant stag beetle larva"
msgid ""
"Something about this cow-sized larva is pitiable, despite its immense size "
"and sickening cream color."
msgstr ""
"Hay algo en esta larva del tamaño de una vaca que da pena, a pesar de su "
"inmenso tamaño y su enfermizo color crema."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant stag beetle"
msgid_plural "giant stag beetles"
msgstr[0] "escarabajo ciervo gigante"
msgstr[1] "escarabajos ciervos gigantes"
msgstr[2] "escarabajos ciervos gigantes"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant stag beetle"
msgid ""
"It was called a giant even before the Cataclysm, but now this mutant beetle "
"is the size of a small horse.  It looks ready to molt again, even though "
"parts of the shell are still soft."
msgstr ""
"Antes del Cataclismo ya se le llamaba gigante, pero ahora este escarabajo "
"mutante tiene el tamaño de un caballo pequeño. Parece listo para mudar de "
"nuevo, aunque partes del caparazón aún están blandas."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/summoned.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "massive stag beetle"
msgid_plural "massive stag beetles"
msgstr[0] "escarabajo ciervo masivo"
msgstr[1] "escarabajos ciervos masivos"
msgstr[2] "escarabajos ciervos gigantes"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "massive stag beetle"
msgid ""
"This enormous stag beetle has reached mutated maturity, but continues to "
"grow.  Thankfully, that growth is exposing vulnerable cracks of flesh in the "
"strained chitin."
msgstr ""
"Este enorme escarabajo ciervo ha alcanzado la madurez mutante, pero sigue "
"creciendo. Afortunadamente, ese crecimiento está exponiendo grietas "
"vulnerables de carne en la quitina tensa."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/summoned.json
#. ~ Sentence fragment describing a weakpoint for monster "massive stag
#. beetle"
msgid "a soft section of chitin"
msgstr "una parte suave de quitina"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/summoned.json
#. ~ Sentence fragment describing a weakpoint for monster "massive stag
#. beetle"
msgid "a crack in the chitin"
msgstr "una grieta en la quitina"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "titan stag beetle"
msgid_plural "titan stag beetles"
msgstr[0] "escarabajo ciervo titán"
msgstr[1] "escarabajos ciervo titán"
msgstr[2] "escarabajos ciervo titán"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "titan stag beetle"
msgid ""
"This stag beetle rivals an armored personnel carrier in size, bearing horns "
"that could fell a tree and chitin thick enough to ignore most bullets.  Its "
"bulky shell looks nigh-impenetrable, and the cracks have sealed with a foul "
"paste."
msgstr ""
"Este escarabajo ciervo rivaliza en tamaño con un vehículo blindado de "
"transporte de personal, con unos cuernos que podrían derribar un árbol y una "
"quitina lo suficientemente gruesa como para ignorar la mayoría de las balas. "
"Su voluminoso caparazón parece casi impenetrable, y las grietas se han "
"sellado con una pasta asquerosa."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Sentence fragment describing a weakpoint for monster "titan stag beetle"
msgid "a foul scar in the chitin"
msgstr "una cicatriz sucia en la quitina"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant antlion larva"
msgid_plural "giant antlion larvae"
msgstr[0] "larva de hormiga león gigante"
msgstr[1] "larvas de hormiga león gigante"
msgstr[2] "larvas de hormiga león gigante"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant antlion larva"
msgid ""
"This huge grub has powerful mandibles and a hungry look.  It hides in the "
"dirt and awaits its prey."
msgstr ""
"Esta enorme larva tiene mandíbulas poderosas y una apariencia hambrienta. Se "
"esconde en la tierra y espera a su presa."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant adult antlion"
msgid_plural "giant adult antlions"
msgstr[0] "hormiga león gigante adulta"
msgstr[1] "hormigas león gigantes adultas"
msgstr[2] "hormigas león gigantes adultas"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant adult antlion"
msgid ""
"A ferocious mutant flying antlion as big as a cat, darting through the air "
"with a cluster of fangs for a mouth.  Despite its dangerous looks, it doesn't "
"seem interested in you."
msgstr ""
"Una hormiga león voladora mutante y feroz, grande como un gato, desplazándose "
"por el aire a gran velocidad con un grupo de colmillos en lugar de boca. Pero "
"a pesar de su apariencia peligrosa, no parece estar interesada en ti."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized water strider"
msgid_plural "oversized water striders"
msgstr[0] "zapatero de agua de gran tamaño"
msgstr[1] "zapateros de agua de gran tamaño"
msgstr[2] "zapateros de agua de gran tamaño"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized water strider"
msgid ""
"This water bug is several times larger than a regular one.  Its movements are "
"fast and fluid."
msgstr ""
"Este insecto acuático es varias veces más grande que uno normal. Sus "
"movimientos son rápidos y fluidos."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant water strider"
msgid_plural "giant water striders"
msgstr[0] "zapatero de agua gigante"
msgstr[1] "zapateros de agua gigantes "
msgstr[2] "zapateros de agua gigantes "

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant water strider"
msgid ""
"This water glider is about as big as a domestic cat.  Its legs are more "
"fin-like and a swollen body is mostly submerged underwater."
msgstr ""
"Este zapatero es del tamaño de un gato. Sus patas son más parecidas a aletas "
"y tiene el cuerpo hinchado en su mayoría sumergido en el agua."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "water strider nymph"
msgid_plural "water strider nymphs"
msgstr[0] "ninfa de zapatero de agua"
msgstr[1] "ninfas de zapateros de agua"
msgstr[2] "ninfas de zapateros de agua"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "water strider nymph"
msgid "A water strider nymph the size of a rabbit."
msgstr "Una ninfa de zapatero del tamaño de un conejo."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized butterfly"
msgid_plural "oversized butterflies"
msgstr[0] "mariposa de gran tamaño"
msgstr[1] "mariposas de gran tamaño"
msgstr[2] "mariposas de gran tamaño"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized butterfly"
msgid ""
"An oversized butterfly with vibrant colored markings.  Unlike the other big "
"insects of the Cataclysm this is a very peaceful nectivore."
msgstr ""
"Una mariposa de gran tamaño con marcas de colores vibrantes. A diferencia de "
"los otros grandes insectos del Cataclismo, este es un nectivoro muy pacífico."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant butterfly"
msgid_plural "giant butterflies"
msgstr[0] "mariposa gigante"
msgstr[1] "mariposas gigantes"
msgstr[2] "mariposas gigantes"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant butterfly"
msgid ""
"A mutated butterfly larger than a human.  Despite its size it is very "
"lightweight and feeds mainly on the nectar produced by triffid flowers."
msgstr ""
"Una mariposa mutante más grande que un ser humano. A pesar de su tamaño es "
"muy ligera y se alimenta principalmente del néctar que producen las flores de "
"los trífidos."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "emperor butterfly"
msgid_plural "emperor butterflies"
msgstr[0] "mariposa emperador"
msgstr[1] "mariposas emperador"
msgstr[2] "mariposas emperador"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "emperor butterfly"
msgid ""
"An enormous butterfly with regal looking wings.  This giant of the sky flies "
"cheerfully under the sun, leaving dust as it passes."
msgstr ""
"Una enorme mariposa con alas de aspecto regio. Este gigante del cielo vuela "
"alegremente bajo el sol, dejando polvo a su paso."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "oversized moth"
msgid_plural "oversized moths"
msgstr[0] "polilla de gran tamaño"
msgstr[1] "polillas de gran tamaño"
msgstr[2] "polillas de gran tamaño"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "oversized moth"
msgid ""
"An oversized moth with its typical wood-like motifs.  It is as peaceful as "
"the mutated butterflies found during the day."
msgstr ""
"Una polilla de gran tamaño con sus típicos motivos de madera. Es tan pacífica "
"como las mariposas mutantes que se encuentran durante el día."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant moth"
msgid_plural "giant moths"
msgstr[0] "polilla gigante"
msgstr[1] "polillas gigantes"
msgstr[2] "polillas gigantes"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant moth"
msgid ""
"A mutated moth larger than a human.  It silently flies with its huge wings "
"after dusk looking for nocturnal flowers to feed upon."
msgstr ""
"Una polilla mutada más grande que un humano. Vuela silenciosamente con sus "
"enormes alas después del atardecer en busca de flores nocturnas para "
"alimentarse."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "lunar moth"
msgid_plural "lunar moths"
msgstr[0] "polilla lunar"
msgstr[1] "polillas lunares"
msgstr[2] "polillas lunares"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "lunar moth"
msgid ""
"A majestic moth painted in pale colors.  This giant of the night only comes "
"out after the moon is out, leaving glittering dust."
msgstr ""
"Una majestuosa polilla pintada de colores pálidos. Este gigante de la noche "
"sólo sale cuando hay luna, dejando un polvo brillante."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant caterpillar"
msgid_plural "giant caterpillars"
msgstr[0] "oruga gigante"
msgstr[1] "orugas gigantes"
msgstr[2] "orugas gigantes"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant caterpillar"
msgid ""
"The larval stage of a butterfly or a moth.  This one appears to be about your "
"size so you can only imagine the size of the insect that it will grow into."
msgstr ""
"La fase larvaria de una mariposa o una polilla. Esta parece ser más o menos "
"de tu tamaño, así que imagínate el tamaño del insecto en el que se convertirá."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant cocoon"
msgid_plural "giant cocoons"
msgstr[0] "capullo gigante"
msgstr[1] "capullos gigantes"
msgstr[2] "capullos gigantes"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant cocoon"
msgid ""
"A caterpillar undergoing a metamorphosis.  Considering the size of the cocoon "
"you have a feeling the emerging adult will be massive as well."
msgstr ""
"Una oruga en metamorfosis. Teniendo en cuenta el tamaño del capullo, "
"presiento que el adulto que emerja también será enorme."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "cicada nymph"
msgid_plural "cicada nymphs"
msgstr[0] "ninfa de cigarra"
msgstr[1] "ninfas de cigarra"
msgstr[2] "ninfas de cigarra"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "cicada nymph"
msgid ""
"The mutated larval form of a cicada.  It doesn't produce noise like the "
"adults but its digging claws seem suited for scratching."
msgstr ""
"La larva mutada de una cigarra. No produce ningún ruido a diferencia de las "
"adultas pero sus garras parecen adecuadas para rasguñar."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant cicada"
msgid_plural "giant cicadas"
msgstr[0] "cigarra gigante"
msgstr[1] "cigarras gigantes"
msgstr[2] "cigarras gigantes"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant cicada"
msgid ""
"A huge cicada the size of a person.  These insects are mostly harmless but "
"may bite if attacked and produce a loud buzzing sound."
msgstr ""
"Una enorme cigarra del tamaño de una persona. Estos insectos son mayormente "
"inofensivos pero pueden morder si son atacados y producir un fuerte zumbido."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant woodlouse"
msgid_plural "giant woodlice"
msgstr[0] "bicho bola gigante"
msgstr[1] "bichos bola gigantes"
msgstr[2] "bichos bola gigantes"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant woodlouse"
msgid ""
"A woodlouse grown to the size of a dog.  These humble crustaceans are "
"harmless and enjoy damp places."
msgstr ""
"Un bicho bola del tamaño de un perro. Estos humildes crustáceos son "
"inofensivos y disfrutan de los lugares húmedos."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "woodlouse manca"
msgid_plural "woodlouse mancae"
msgstr[0] "bicho bola manca"
msgstr[1] "bichos bola mancae"
msgstr[2] "bichos bola mancae"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "woodlouse manca"
msgid ""
"Woodlice reproduce by carrying their eggs in a pouch and releasing them as "
"juveniles.  Their mancae look like small adults except for their pale color."
msgstr ""
"Los bichos bola se reproducen cargando sus huevos en una bolsa y liberándolos "
"cuando son jóvenes. Los mancae parecen pequeños adultos excepto por su color "
"pálido."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant water tiger"
msgid_plural "giant water tigers"
msgstr[0] "tigre de agua gigante"
msgstr[1] "tigres de agua gigantes"
msgstr[2] "tigres de agua gigantes"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant water tiger"
msgid ""
"The predatory, aquatic larva of a diving beetle grown to large proportions.  "
"It is quite slow but still a good ambusher."
msgstr ""
"La larva acuática depredadora de un escarabajo buceador que ha crecido hasta "
"alcanzar grandes proporciones. Es bastante lenta pero sigue siendo una buena "
"emboscadora."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant diving beetle"
msgid_plural "giant diving beetles"
msgstr[0] "escarabajo buceador gigante"
msgstr[1] "escarabajos buceadores gigantes"
msgstr[2] "escarabajos buceadores gigantes"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant diving beetle"
msgid ""
"Water beetles can be found in all freshwater environments, with diving "
"beetles being their predatory variant.  These however seem to have grown far "
"larger with the Cataclysm."
msgstr ""
"Los escarabajos de agua se pueden encontrar en todos los entornos de agua "
"dulce, siendo los escarabajos buceadores su variante depredadora. Sin "
"embargo, parecen haber crecido mucho más con el Cataclismo."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant water scorpion"
msgid_plural "giant water scorpions"
msgstr[0] "escorpión gigante de agua"
msgstr[1] "escorpiones gigantes de agua"
msgstr[2] "escorpiones gigantes de agua"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant water scorpion"
msgid ""
"A slender relative of the water bug, grown close to human size.  It uses its "
"long tail as a snorkel while ambushing prey."
msgstr ""
"Un pariente delgado de los insectos de agua, crecido a casi el tamaño de un "
"humano. Utiliza su larga cola como un snorkel mientras embosca a su presa."

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "water scorpion nymph"
msgid_plural "water scorpion nymphs"
msgstr[0] "ninfa de escorpión de agua"
msgstr[1] "ninfas de escorpión de agua"
msgstr[2] "ninfas de escorpión de agua"

#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#. ~ Description of monster "water scorpion nymph"
msgid "The nymph of a water scorpion, looks like a smaller version of its parents."
msgstr ""
"La ninfa de un escorpión de agua, parece una versión más pequeña de sus "
"padres."

#: data/json/monsters/jabberwock.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fleshy shambler"
msgid_plural "fleshy shamblers"
msgstr[0] "desastre carnoso"
msgstr[1] "desastres carnosos"
msgstr[2] "desastres carnosos"

#: data/json/monsters/jabberwock.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fleshy shambler"
msgid ""
"An amalgamation of throbbing organs from various creatures have fused "
"together into this lurching, vaguely-humanoid shape.  Its myriad "
"roughly-formed mouths susurrate in a chorus of sibilant groans and whispers."
msgstr ""
"Una amalgama de órganos palpitantes de varias criaturas que se han fusionado "
"en esta forma tambaleante y vagamente humanoide. Sus innumerables bocas de "
"forma tosca susurran en un coro de gemidos y susurros sibilantes."

#: data/json/monsters/jabberwock.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "flesh golem"
msgid_plural "flesh golems"
msgstr[0] "golem de carne"
msgstr[1] "golems de carne"
msgstr[2] "golems de carne"

#: data/json/monsters/jabberwock.json
#. ~ Description of monster "flesh golem"
msgid ""
"A seeping conglomeration of spasming muscle and organs have fused together "
"into this towering caricature of the human form.  Various organs fall off of "
"its hulking body only to be reabsorbed moments later."
msgstr ""
"Un conglomerado de músculos y órganos espasmódicos se han fusionado en esta "
"imponente caricatura de la forma humana. Varios órganos se caen de su cuerpo "
"mole sólo para ser reabsorbidos momentos después."

#: data/json/monsters/jabberwock.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "jabberwock"
msgid_plural "jabberwocks"
msgstr[0] "jabberwock"
msgstr[1] "jabberwocks"
msgstr[2] "jabberwocks"

#: data/json/monsters/jabberwock.json
#. ~ Description of monster "jabberwock"
msgid ""
"A putrid amalgamation of body parts from humans and other creatures have "
"fused together in this aberration of flesh.  The eyes of all the heads dart "
"about rapidly and the mouths form a chorus of groaning screams."
msgstr ""
"Es una combinación pútrida de partes de cuerpos humanos y otras criaturas que "
"se han fusionado para formar esta aberración de carnes. Los ojos de todas las "
"cabezas se mueven rápidamente y las bocas arman un coro de gritos y quejidos."

#: data/json/monsters/kraken_spawn.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "stalker octopus"
msgid_plural "stalker octopuses"
msgstr[0] "pulpo mimético"
msgstr[1] "pulpos miméticos"
msgstr[2] "pulpos miméticos"

#: data/json/monsters/kraken_spawn.json
#. ~ Description of monster "stalker octopus"
msgid ""
"This octopus seems larger than you remember from visits to the aquarium and "
"doesn't seem as slowed by land as would be expected.  Its body seems to mimic "
"its surroundings."
msgstr ""
"Este pulpo parece más grande de lo que recuerdas de tus visitas al acuario y "
"no parece tan lento en tierra como cabría esperar. Su cuerpo parece "
"mimetizarse con su entorno."

#: data/json/monsters/kraken_spawn.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "octopus spawn"
msgid_plural "octopus spawns"
msgstr[0] "hueva de pulpo"
msgstr[1] "huevas de pulpo"
msgstr[2] "huevas de pulpo"

#: data/json/monsters/kraken_spawn.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/uplifted_monsters.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/uplifted_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "octopus spawn"
#. ~ Description of monster "Cecaelian Spawn"
msgid ""
"A young Cecaelia.  If one is out here, a very protective parent is likely "
"nearby."
msgstr ""
"Una joven Cecaliano. Si uno está aquí, es probable que un padre muy protector "
"esté cerca."

#: data/json/monsters/kraken_spawn.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "kraken"
msgid_plural "kraken"
msgstr[0] "kraken"
msgstr[1] "krakens"
msgstr[2] "krakens"

#: data/json/monsters/kraken_spawn.json
#. ~ Description of monster "kraken"
msgid "The kind of octopus that can take down small boats by itself."
msgstr "El tipo de pulpo que puede derribar pequeñas embarcaciones por sí solo."

#: data/json/monsters/kraken_spawn.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "scylla"
msgid_plural "scylla"
msgstr[0] "escila"
msgstr[1] "escilas"
msgstr[2] "escilas"

#: data/json/monsters/kraken_spawn.json
#. ~ Description of monster "scylla"
msgid ""
"The water froths as a great bulk of tentacles breach the surface.  A great "
"bulk swiftly rises until the beak rises above the water and a shriek erupts "
"from the beast."
msgstr ""
"El agua se llena de espuma cuando un gran bulto de tentáculos irrumpe en la "
"superficie. Un gran bulto se eleva rápidamente hasta que el pico se eleva por "
"encima del agua y un chillido brota de la bestia."

#: data/json/monsters/lab_security_drones.json
#. ~ Message of spell "green_maintenance_check ( Green Maintenance Badge Trait
#. )"
#. ~ Message of spell "yellow_maintenance_check ( Ocher Maintenance Badge
#. Trait )"
#. ~ Message of spell "blue_maintenance_check ( Blue Maintenance Badge Trait
#. )"
#. ~ Message of spell "blue_maintenance_check2 ( Blue Maintenance Badge Trait
#. )"
#. ~ Message of spell "green_researcher_check ( Light Green Researcher Badge
#. Trait )"
#. ~ Message of spell "black_security_check ( Black Security Badge Trait )"
msgid "the drone scans for your ID badge."
msgstr "el drone escanea tus credenciales de identificación (ID)"

#: data/json/monsters/lab_security_drones.json
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "GREEN_MAINTENANCE_ALARM"
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "YELLOW_MAINTENANCE_ALARM"
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "BLUE_MAINTENANCE_ALARM"
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "BLUE_MAINTENANCE_ALARM2"
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "GREEN_RESEARCHER_ALARM"
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "BLACK_SECURITY_ALARM"
msgid "Hello, valued employee."
msgstr "Hola,  valioso empleado."

#: data/json/monsters/lab_security_drones.json
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in else statement in effect in EoC
#. "GREEN_MAINTENANCE_ALARM"
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in else statement in effect in EoC
