msgstr[2] "murciélagos"

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/bloodsuckers.json
#. ~ Description of monster "bat"
msgid ""
"One of the vesper bats, a family of winged insect-eating mammals.  It roosts "
"in caves and other hollows, and uses a form of echolocation to aerially "
"navigate through tricky terrain at rapid speeds."
msgstr ""
"Un vespertiliónido, de la familia de los mamíferos alados que comen insectos. "
"Habita en cuevas y otros lugares huecos, y utiliza una forma de ecolocación "
"para orientarse por el aire a gran velocidad a través de terreno complicado."

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "black bear cub"
msgid_plural "black bear cubs"
msgstr[0] "cachorro de oso negro"
msgstr[1] "cachorros de oso negro"
msgstr[2] "cachorros de oso negro"

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "black bear cub"
msgid ""
"A juvenile American black bear.  This one isn't much of a threat, but be wary "
"of its parent; black bears are known for their protectiveness."
msgstr ""
"Un joven oso negro americano. Este no es una gran amenaza, pero ten cuidado "
"con su padre; los osos negros son conocidos por su protección."

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "black bear"
msgid_plural "black bears"
msgstr[0] "oso negro"
msgstr[1] "osos negros"
msgstr[2] "osos negros"

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "black bear"
msgid ""
"The American black bear.  A large omnivorous scavenger, it has powerful claws "
"and jaws, and is an effective ambush hunter.  Most individuals are shy around "
"humans, but they're fiercely protective of their cubs."
msgstr ""
"El oso negro americano. Un gran carroñero omnívoro, tiene poderosas garras y "
"mandíbulas, y es un efectivo cazador de emboscadas. La mayoría de los "
"individuos son tímidos con los humanos, pero son ferozmente protectores de "
"sus cachorros."

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "beaver"
msgid_plural "beavers"
msgstr[0] "castor"
msgstr[1] "castores"
msgstr[2] "castores"

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "beaver"
msgid ""
"The North American beaver, the continent's largest rodent.  Its paddle-shaped "
"tail helps ferry it through the water, and its prominent teeth can chew "
"through wood, which it uses to build dam-like nests in lakes and streams."
msgstr ""
"El castor de Norte América, el roedor más grande del continente. Su cola en "
"forma de paleta lo ayuda a transportarse por el agua, y sus dientes "
"prominentes pueden masticar la madera, que utiliza para crear nidos en forma "
"de diques en los lagos y arroyos."

