#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "wild boar piglet"
msgid_plural "wild boar piglets"
msgstr[0] "lechón de jabalí"
msgstr[1] "lechones de jabalí"
msgstr[2] "lechones de jabalí"

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "wild boar piglet"
msgid ""
"Originally not native in the U.S., this wild omnivore is a crossbreed between "
"the Eurasian wild boar escaped from hunting reserves and the domesticated pig "
"gone feral in the wilderness.  This one is just a baby, and is surprisingly "
"cute."
msgstr ""
"Este omnívoro salvaje, que no es originario de Estados Unidos, es un cruce "
"entre el jabalí euroasiático escapado de los cotos de caza y el cerdo "
"doméstico asilvestrado en la naturaleza. Este es sólo un bebé, y es "
"sorprendentemente bonito."

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "wild boar"
msgid_plural "wild boars"
msgstr[0] "jabalí"
msgstr[1] "jabalíes"
msgstr[2] "jabalíes"

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "wild boar"
msgid ""
"Originally not native in the U.S., this wild omnivore is a crossbreed between "
"the Eurasian wild boar escaped from hunting reserves and the domesticated pig "
"gone feral in the wilderness.  Its population has skyrocketed during the last "
"few decades."
msgstr ""
"Originalmente no nativo de los Estados Unidos, este omnívoro salvaje es un "
"cruce entre el jabalí eurasiático escapado de las reservas de caza y el cerdo "
"domesticado que se volvió salvaje en la naturaleza. Su población se ha "
"disparado en los EE.UU. durante las últimas décadas."

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "bobcat"
msgid_plural "bobcats"
msgstr[0] "gato montes"
msgstr[1] "gatos monteses"
msgstr[2] "gatos monteses"

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
#. ~ Description of monster "bobcat"
msgid ""
"A spotted wild cat living across much of North America.  It is not a serious "
"threat to humans, but it can be aggressive when threatened."
msgstr ""
"Un gato salvaje manchado que vive en gran parte de América del Norte. No es "
"una amenaza seria para los humanos, pero puede ser agresivo cuando se ve "
"amenazado."

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "shorthair kitten"
msgid_plural "shorthair kittens"
msgstr[0] "gatito de pelo corto"
msgstr[1] "gatitos de pelo corto"
msgstr[2] "gatitos de pelo corto"

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "shorthair kitten"
msgid "A cuddly kitten meowing and scampering amidst the death.  Currently feral."
msgstr ""
"Un adorable gatito maullando y correteando en medio de la muerte. Actualmente "
"salvaje."

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "shorthair cat"
msgid_plural "shorthair cats"
msgstr[0] "gato de pelo corto"
msgstr[1] "gatos de pelo corto"
msgstr[2] "gatos de pelo corto"

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "shorthair cat"
msgid ""
"In the absence of human stewardship, this small, domesticated predator has "
"grown wary of humans.  Harried by the elements and the rigors of survival, it "
"has become very skittish but is still motivated by food."
msgstr ""
"En ausencia de vigilancia humana, este pequeño depredador domesticado se ha "
"vuelto receloso de los humanos. Acosado por los elementos y los rigores de la "
"supervivencia, se ha vuelto muy asustadizo, pero sigue estando motivado por "
"la comida."

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json data/mods/Tamable_Wildlife/mammal.json
#. ~ Feed message of monster "shorthair cat"
#. ~ Feed message of monster "mon_bobcat"
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The %s seems to like you!  Or maybe it just tolerates your presence better.  "
"It's hard to tell with felines."
msgstr ""
"¡A %s parece que le gustas! O quizás solo tolera tu presencia mejor que la de "
"otros. Es difícil darse cuenta con los felinos."

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json data/mods/Tamable_Wildlife/mammal.json
#. ~ Pet message of monster "shorthair cat"
#. ~ Pet message of monster "mon_bobcat"
#. ~ Pet message of monster "mon_mink"
#. ~ Pet message of monster "mon_otter"
#. ~ Pet message of monster "mon_weasel"
#, c-format
msgid "The %s softly purrs as you pet it.  It demands more."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "mon_cat_isherwood"
msgid ""
"A small domesticated predator gone feral in the absence of human stewardship. "
" Located near the old Isherwood cabin."
msgstr ""
"Un pequeño depredador domesticado que se asilvestró en ausencia de la "
"vigilancia humana. Situado cerca de la antigua cabaña Isherwood."

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "longhair cat"
msgid_plural "longhair cats"
msgstr[0] "gato de pelo largo"
msgstr[1] "gatos de pelo largo"
msgstr[2] "gatos de pelo largo"

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "longhair cat"
msgid ""
"This fluffy feline has longer hair than average.  Looks both beautiful and "
"warm.  You want to bury your face in its soft fur and forget about the "
"Cataclysm."
msgstr ""
"Este esponjoso felino tiene el pelo más largo que la media. Tiene un aspecto "
"tan hermoso como cálido. Dan ganas de enterrar la cara en su suave pelaje y "
"olvidarse del Cataclismo."

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "longhair kitten"
msgid_plural "longhair kittens"
msgstr[0] "gatito de pelo largo"
msgstr[1] "gatitos de pelo largo"
msgstr[2] "gatitos de pelo largo"

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "longhair kitten"
msgid ""
"Barely more than a ball of fluff with eyes, this kitten looks like a longhair "
"breed."
msgstr ""
"Es poco más que una bola de pelusa con ojos, este gatito parece de una raza "
"de pelo largo."

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Maine Coon"
msgid_plural "Maine Coons"
msgstr[0] "Maine Coon"
msgstr[1] "Maine Coons"
msgstr[2] "Maine Coons"

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Maine Coon"
msgid ""
"Impressively large for a domestic cat, this thick-haired breed was once "
"native to the state of Maine."
msgstr ""
"Impresionantemente grande para un gato doméstico, esta raza de pelo grueso "
"fue una vez nativa del estado de Maine."

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Maine Coon kitten"
msgid_plural "Maine Coon kittens"
msgstr[0] "gatito Maine Coon"
msgstr[1] "gatitos Maine Coon"
msgstr[2] "gatitos Maine Coon"

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Maine Coon kitten"
msgid "This young Maine coon has tufted ears and a striking pattern on its face."
msgstr ""
"Este joven gato mapache de Maine tiene las orejas puntiagudas y un patrón "
"llamativo en su cara."

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Siamese cat"
msgid_plural "Siamese cats"
msgstr[0] "gato siamés"
msgstr[1] "gatos siameses"
msgstr[2] "gatos siameses"

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Siamese cat"
msgid ""
"This cat has the distinctive dark extremities of a Siamese, first native to "
"Asia but a common domestic breed in North America."
msgstr ""
"Este gato tiene las extremidades oscuras distintivas de un siamés, originario "
"de Asia pero una raza doméstica común en América del Norte."

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Siamese kitten"
msgid_plural "Siamese kittens"
msgstr[0] "gatos Siames"
msgstr[1] "gatos Siameses"
msgstr[2] "gatos Siameses"

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Siamese kitten"
msgid ""
"With cream-colored fur and dark points, you guess this kitten must be a young "
"Siamese."
msgstr ""
"Con pelaje de color crema y puntos oscuros, supongo que este gatito debe ser "
"un joven siamés."

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Persian cat"
msgid_plural "Persian cats"
msgstr[0] "gato persa"
msgstr[1] "gatos persas"
msgstr[2] "gatos persas"

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Persian cat"
msgid ""
"The short nose and rounded face of this cat suggest it comes from the popular "
"Persian breed.  Its fur is already matted without anyone being able to groom "
"it."
msgstr ""
"La nariz corta y la cara redondeada de este gato sugieren que procede de la "
"popular raza persa. Su pelaje ya está enmarañado sin que nadie pueda "
"acicalarlo."

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Persian kitten"
msgid_plural "Persian kittens"
msgstr[0] "gatito persa"
msgstr[1] "gatitos persas"
msgstr[2] "gatitos persas"

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Persian kitten"
msgid ""
"An adorably squashed nose and sad pleading eyes beg you to adopt this tiny "
"Persian."
msgstr ""
"Una nariz adorablemente aplastada y unos tristes ojos suplicantes te suplican "
"que adoptes a este pequeño persa."

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Bengal cat"
msgid_plural "Bengal cats"
msgstr[0] "gato de Bengala"
msgstr[1] "gatos de Bengala"
msgstr[2] "gatos de Bengala"

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Bengal cat"
msgid ""
"Looking like a spotted wild cat, the Bengal breed derives from the Asian "
"leopard cat and Egyptian Mau.  Domesticated but very energetic."
msgstr ""
"Con aspecto de gato salvaje moteado, la raza bengalí deriva del gato leopardo "
"asiático y del mau egipcio. Domesticado pero muy enérgico."

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Bengal kitten"
msgid_plural "Bengal kittens"
msgstr[0] "gatito de Bengala"
msgstr[1] "gatitos de Bengala"
msgstr[2] "gatitos de Bengala"

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Bengal kitten"
msgid "You have seen spots like this on Bengal cats, but this one is just a kitten."
msgstr ""
"Has visto manchas como esta en los gatos de Bengala, pero este es sólo un "
"gatito."

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Devon Rex cat"
msgid_plural "Devon Rex cats"
msgstr[0] "gato Devon Rex"
msgstr[1] "gatos Devon Rex"
msgstr[2] "gatos Devon Rex"

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Devon Rex cat"
msgid ""
"An unusual-looking cat with strikingly large eyes and ears, sporting a soft "
"curly coat of fur."
msgstr ""
"Un gato de aspecto inusual con ojos y orejas sorprendentemente grandes, con "
"un suave pelaje rizado."

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Devon Rex kitten"
msgid_plural "Devon Rex kittens"
msgstr[0] "gatito Devon Rex"
msgstr[1] "gatitos Devon Rex"
msgstr[2] "gatitos Devon Rex"

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Devon Rex kitten"
msgid ""
"This curly-coated kitten has enormous ears and inquisitive eyes, possibly a "
"Devon Rex."
msgstr ""
"Este gatito de capa rizada tiene enormes orejas y ojos curiosos, posiblemente "
"un Devon Rex."

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Sphynx cat"
msgid_plural "Sphynx cats"
msgstr[0] "gato esfinge"
msgstr[1] "gatos esfinge"
msgstr[2] "gatos esfinge"

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Sphynx cat"
msgid ""
"The Sphynx cat has practically no fur on its body, exposing its curiously "
"wrinkled skin."
msgstr ""
"El gato esfinge prácticamente no tiene pelo en su cuerpo, exponiendo su piel "
"curiosamente arrugada."

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Sphynx kitten"
msgid_plural "Sphynx kittens"
msgstr[0] "gatito esfinge"
msgstr[1] "gatitos esfinge"
msgstr[2] "gatitos esfinge"

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Sphynx kitten"
msgid ""
"An almost total lack of fur on this kitten suggests it is of the hairless "
"Sphynx breed."
msgstr ""
"La casi total falta de pelo en este gatito sugiere que es de la raza esfinge "
"sin pelo."

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "tabby cat"
msgid_plural "tabby cats"
msgstr[0] "gato atigrado"
msgstr[1] "gatos atigrados"
msgstr[2] "gatos atigrados"

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "tabby cat"
msgid ""
"Marked with the characteristic 'M' on its forehead and decorated with "
"swirling stripes, the tabby's markings provide excellent camouflage."
msgstr ""
"Con la característica 'M' en la frente y decorado con rayas arremolinadas, el "
"atigrado ofrece un excelente camuflaje."

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "tabby kitten"
msgid_plural "tabby kittens"
msgstr[0] "gatito atigrado"
msgstr[1] "gatitos atigrados"
msgstr[2] "gatitos atigrados"

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "tabby kitten"
msgid ""
"Sharp lines around the eyes and familiar wavy stripes mark this kitten as a "
"common tabby."
msgstr ""
"Líneas afiladas alrededor de los ojos y las conocidas rayas onduladas marcan "
"a este gatito como un gato atigrado común."

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "calico cat"
msgid_plural "calico cats"
msgstr[0] "gato calicó"
msgstr[1] "gatos calicó"
msgstr[2] "gatos calicó"

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "calico cat"
msgid ""
"Partly white with patches of orange and black, the calico coloring tells you "
"this cat is probably female.  The calico was the Maryland state cat, back "
"when there were still states."
msgstr ""
"Parcialmente blanco con manchas de naranja y negro, la coloración del calicó "
"te dice que este gato es probablemente una hembra. El calicó fue el gato del "
"estado de Maryland (cuando todavía había estados)."

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "calico kitten"
msgid_plural "calico kittens"
msgstr[0] "gatito calicó"
msgstr[1] "gatitos calicó"
msgstr[2] "gatitos calicó"

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "calico kitten"
msgid ""
"Splotches of tan and gray mark this young cat as a calico, and probably "
"female."
msgstr ""
"Las manchas de color canela y gris indican que este joven gato es un calicó y "
"probablemente una hembra."

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "golden chonker"
msgid_plural "golden chonkers"
msgstr[0] "rechoncho dorados"
msgstr[1] "rechonchos dorados"
msgstr[2] "rechonchos dorados"

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "golden chonker"
msgid ""
"Oh lawd, he comin'!  This impressive feline would once have been celebrated "
"on internet cat forums for its chonkiness and majestic golden mane.  Appears "
"surprisingly well-groomed despite its bulk."
msgstr ""
"Oh, ¡ya viene! Este impresionante felino habría sido una vez celebrado en los "
"foros de gatos de Internet por su rechonchez y su majestuosa melena dorada. "
"Parece sorprendentemente bien cuidado a pesar de su corpulencia."

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "yellow kitten"
msgid_plural "yellow kittens"
msgstr[0] "gatito amarillo"
msgstr[1] "gatitos amarillos"
msgstr[2] "gatitos amarillos"

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "yellow kitten"
msgid ""
"This poor little kitten is starving!  You wonder if you have some cat food "
"around…"
msgstr ""
"¡Este pobre gatito se muere de hambre! Te preguntas si tienes algo de comida "
"para gatos por aquí..."

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "black kitten"
msgid_plural "black kittens"
msgstr[0] "gatito negro"
msgstr[1] "gatitos negros"
msgstr[2] "gatitos negros"

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "black kitten"
msgid "An adorable, little furry ball of darkness with pronounced green eyes."
msgstr "Una adorable bolita peluda de oscuridad con pronunciados ojos verdes."

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "black cat"
msgid_plural "black cats"
msgstr[0] "gato negro"
msgstr[1] "gatos negros"
msgstr[2] "gatos negros"

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "black cat"
msgid "A black ball of fur with prominent green eyes staring right into your soul."
msgstr ""
"Una bola de pelaje negro con unos prominentes ojos verdes que te miran "
"directamente al alma."

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "chipmunk"
msgid_plural "chipmunks"
msgstr[0] "ardilla"
msgstr[1] "ardillas"
msgstr[2] "ardillas"

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "chipmunk"
msgid ""
"The eastern chipmunk, a tiny omnivorous rodent with a characteristic striped "
"coat.  It spends much of the day patrolling its elaborate burrow and the "
"precious stores of foraged food within."
msgstr ""
"La ardilla del este, un pequeño roedor omnívoro con su característica piel "
"rayada. Pasa muchas horas de su día patrullando su elaborada madriguera y  el "
"precioso almacenamiento de comida que tiene adentro."

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "cougar"
msgid_plural "cougars"
msgstr[0] "puma"
msgstr[1] "pumas"
msgstr[2] "pumas"

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "cougar"
msgid ""
"The Eastern cougar, a large feline predator.  Once thought extinct in this "
"region, conservation efforts were successful in restoring a thriving "
"population.  Fast and silent, this predator can cover long distances with "
"powerful leaps and pounces, catching its prey with its deadly claws before "
"delivering the finishing blow with its enormous fangs."
msgstr ""
"El puma del este, un gran felino depredador. Alguna vez se pensó que estaba "
"extinto en esta región, pero los esfuerzos de conservación fueron exitosos y "
"se restauró su población. Rápido y silencioso, este predador puede cubrir "
"largas distancias con fuertes saltos, cazando su presa con sus mortales "
"garras antes de dar el golpe final con sus enormes colmillos."

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "cougar kitten"
msgid_plural "cougar kittens"
msgstr[0] "gatito de puma"
msgstr[1] "gatitos de puma"
msgstr[2] "gatitos de puma"

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "cougar kitten"
msgid ""
"A cute and currently defenseless cougar kitten, meowing at its surroundings "
"in search of its mother.  Be careful, these kittens grow quite big and "
"ferocious in just a few months."
msgstr ""
"Un lindo y actualmente indefenso gatito de puma, maullando a su alrededor en "
"busca de su madre. Ten cuidado, estos gatitos crecen bastante y se vuelven "
"feroces en pocos meses."

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "tiger"
msgid_plural "tigers"
msgstr[0] "tigre"
msgstr[1] "tigres"
msgstr[2] "tigres"

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "tiger"
msgid ""
"The majestic tiger, a large feline predator.  Native to Asia, they are now "
"most populous in private reserves in the United States.  Fast and powerful, "
"this predator is one of the most recognizable and beloved animals in the "
"world.  Also one of the deadliest."
msgstr ""
"El majestuoso tigre, un gran depredador felino. Originario de Asia, ahora "
"están más poblados en las reservas privadas de los Estados Unidos. Rápido y "
"poderoso, este depredador es uno de los animales más reconocidos y queridos "
"del mundo. También es uno de los más mortíferos."

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "calf"
msgid_plural "calves"
msgstr[0] "ternero"
msgstr[1] "terneros"
msgstr[2] "terneros"

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "calf"
msgid ""
"The domestic cow, a baleful, ruminating farm animal.  This one is still a "
"juvenile; it'll take a while before you can get any milk or a meaningful "
"amount of meat from her."
msgstr ""
"La vaca doméstica, un animal de granja maléfico y rumiante. Esta es todavía "
"una cría; pasará un tiempo antes de que puedas obtener leche o una cantidad "
"significativa de carne de ella."

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "cow"
msgid_plural "cows"
msgstr[0] "vaca"
msgstr[1] "vacas"
msgstr[2] "vacas"

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "cow"
msgid ""
"The domestic cow, a baleful, ruminating farm animal.  She is quite muscular, "
"and would be a great source of milk if domesticated or of meat and leather if "
"slaughtered."
msgstr ""
"La vaca doméstica, un animal de granja rumiante y torpe. Es bastante "
"musculosa, y sería una gran fuente de leche si fuera domesticada o de carne y "
"cuero si fuera sacrificada."

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "coyote"
msgid_plural "coyotes"
msgstr[0] "coyote"
msgstr[1] "coyotes"
msgstr[2] "coyotes"

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "coyote"
msgid ""
"The Eastern coyote, also called the tweed wolf, is a territorial canine "
"hybrid of wolves and true coyotes.  It can be intimidated by humans and other "
"predators, but it will still fight when threatened, and the Cataclysm seems "
"to have made it more fearless than before."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "coyote pup"
msgid_plural "coyote pups"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "coyote pup"
msgid ""
"A cute coyote pup.  Despite the temptation, perhaps it is wise to refrain "
"from petting it."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fawn"
msgid_plural "fawns"
msgstr[0] "cervatillo"
msgstr[1] "cervatillos"
msgstr[2] "cervatillos"

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fawn"
msgid ""
"A juvenile northern woodland white-tailed deer, a quick and strong grazing "
"animal.  Favored prey of coyotes, wolves, and giant spider mutants."
msgstr ""
"Un joven ciervo de cola blanca de los bosques del norte, un rápido y fuerte "
"animal de pastoreo. Presa preferida de coyotes, lobos y arañas gigantes "
"mutantes."

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "deer"
msgid_plural "deer"
msgstr[0] "ciervo"
msgstr[1] "ciervos"
msgstr[2] "ciervos"

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "deer"
msgid ""
"The northern woodland white-tailed deer, a quick and strong grazing animal.  "
"Favored prey of coyotes, wolves, and giant spider mutants."
msgstr ""
"El ciervo de cola blanca de los bosques del norte, un animal de pastoreo "
"rápido y fuerte. Es la presa favorita de los coyotes, lobos y arañas mutantes "
"gigantes."

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Labrador mutt"
msgid_plural "Labrador mutts"
msgstr[0] "Perro labrador"
msgstr[1] "Perros labradores"
msgstr[2] "Perros labradores"

#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Labrador mutt"
msgid ""
"This once-average Labrador mixed-breed dog has clearly gone feral.  Though it "
"likely still instinctively trusts humans, it's probably far from domestic by "
"now."
msgstr ""
"Este perro mestizo de Labrador, que alguna vez fue un promedio, se ha vuelto "
"claramente salvaje. Aunque probablemente aún confía instintivamente en los "
"humanos, probablemente esté lejos de ser doméstico ahora."

