"Safe exodimensional flux threshold exceeded!  Current flux compression:  "
"ERROR STACK OVERFLOW m/s"
msgstr ""
"¡Superado umbral de flujo exodimensional seguro! Compresión de flujo actual: "
"ERROR STACK OVERFLOW m/s"

#: data/json/npcs/LIXA_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
