msgstr "Acceder al Disco Principal"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_STRIP_MALL.json
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_MSU14.json
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_PREPPER_1_COMPUTER.json
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_RET_COMM.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/computer_dialogue.json
