"\n"
"ADVERTENCIA ERROR B231; NO SE PUEDE CONECTAR AL SERVIDOR DE MENSAJERÍA.\n"
"ERROR AL REFRESCAR LOS MENSAJES. ES POSIBLE QUE NO SE MUESTREN TODOS LOS "
"MENSAJES. \n"
"¡PÓNGASE EN CONTACTO INMEDIATAMENTE CON EL DEPARTAMENTO INFORMÁTICO!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_STRIP_MALL.json
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_RET_COMM.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[!]RE: Important Status Update"
msgstr "[!]RE: Actualización de Estado Importante"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_STRIP_MALL.json
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_RET_COMM.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "RETURN TO MAIN PAGE"
msgstr "VOLVER A PÁGINA PRINCIPAL"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_STRIP_MALL.json
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_RET_COMM.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"FROM: Kristi Gordee, SVP Operations\n"
"  TO: [Branch Managers], [Community Managers]\n"
"  RE: Important Status Update\n"
"\n"
" Everyone,\n"
" You are to follow your appropriate lockdown protocols at your discretion.  "
"With the recent events as they are, we must do our utmost to ensure that our "
"goals remain priority.\n"
"\n"
" Branch Managers - your deliveries will have an altered schedule.  I will "
"send a separate email with details.  Ensure the hidden safe rooms are "
"properly secured.\n"
" Community Managers - Lockdown the community appropriately.  Tell the "
"residents that it is for their protection, but do not let them leave.  We "
"need them for the Big Pappy project to be successful.  I am going to send you "
"some contacts who can discreetly install a heavy security gate.\n"
"\n"
" You will continue to receive your bonus pay as agreed upon.  Do not lose "
"sight of our important endgame."
msgstr ""
"DE: Kristi Gordee, SVP de Operaciones\n"
"  PARA: [Gerentes de Sucursal], [Community Managers]\n"
"  RE: Actualización de Estado Importante\n"
"\n"
" A todos,\n"
" Deben seguir el protocolo de cierre de emergencia según crean conveniente. "
"Debido a los recientes sucesos, debemos centrar nuestro máximo esfuerzo en "
"asegurar la prioridad de nuestros objetivos.\n"
"\n"
" Gerentes de Sucursal - sus envíos serán reprogramados. Os enviaré un correo "
"con los detalles. Asegúrense que las habitaciones de seguridad ocultas esten "
"apropiadamente seguras.\n"
" Community Managers - Cierre la comunidad apropiadamente. Diga a los "
"residentes que es por su protección, pero no les deje salir. Los necesitamos "
"para que el proyecto Gran Papi tenga éxito. Voy a enviarle algunos contactos "
"que pueden instalar discretamente una puerta de seguridad pesada..\n"
"\n"
" Seguiréis recibiendo vuestra bonificación extra según lo acordado. No "
"pierdas de vista nuestro importante objetivo final."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_STRIP_MALL.json
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_RET_COMM.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "RETURN TO MESSAGES"
msgstr "VOLVER A MENSAJES"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_STRIP_MALL.json
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_RET_COMM.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "ERROR ACCESSING SERVER"
msgstr "ERROR CONECTANDO AL SERVIDOR"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_STRIP_MALL.json
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "RETURN TO PREVIOUS PAGE"
msgstr "VOLVER A LA PÁGINA ANTERIOR"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "How are you alive?"
msgstr "¿Cómo es que estás vivo?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Horrible.  Did you get any pictures yourself?"
msgstr "Qué horror. ¿Sacaste alguna foto?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "What'd you do?"
msgstr "¿Qué has hecho?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Crazy, so you have been here ever since?"
msgstr "Locura, ¿así que has estado aquí desde entonces?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Greetings friend, it's nice to see you."
msgstr "Buenas amigo, me alegro de verte."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "What sorcery is this?"
msgstr "¿Qué tipo de brujería es ésta?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Welcome home Foodkid!"
msgstr "¡Bienvenido a casa, Comidaniño!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Still here?  Take your time, it's rough out there."
msgstr "¿Aún aquí? Tómate tu tiempo, la cosa está fea ahí fuera."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Greeting citizen, what brings you to the FoodLair?"
msgstr "Saludos ciudadanos, ¿qué te trae a la GuaridaComida?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Greetings… Foodperson?"
msgstr "Saludos... ¿Comidapersona?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I am you but from an alternate reality."
msgstr "Yo soy tú, pero de una realidad alternativa."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I am Foodperson, who are YOU?"
msgstr "Soy Comidapersona, ¿quién eres TÚ?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "There is only one real Foodperson!"
msgstr "¡Sólo hay un verdadero Comidapersona!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I am the REAL Foodperson!"
msgstr "¡Soy el verdadero Comidapersona!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid ""
"So, you are a REAL FOODPERSON, right?  You know my <name_g> over there?  You "
"know that you ruined his legacy?"
msgstr ""
"Así que, eres un COMIDAPERSONA REAL, ¿verdad? ¿Sabes mi <name_g> allí? ¿Sabes "
"que arruinaste su legado?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Nevermind me, I'm just going to leave."
msgstr "No te preocupes, me voy a ir."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Wow!  Such an honor to meet you in person!"
msgstr "¡Vaya! ¡Es un honor conocerte en persona!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Are you joking?  Foodperson is not real, it's a restaurant mascot!"
msgstr "¿Estás bromeando? Comidapersona no es real, ¡es la mascota de un restaurante!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid ""
"The great Foodperson in the flesh!  Such an honor to finally meet you in "
"person!"
msgstr ""
"¡El gran Comidapersona en carne y hueso! ¡Es un gran honor conocerle por fin "
"en persona!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Ah… well, nice to meet you Foodperson."
msgstr "Ah... Bueno, un placer conocerte Comidapersona."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Do not mock me, for my strength is quite real!  Get out of here now!"
msgstr ""
"¡No te burles de mí, porque mi fuerza es muy real! ¡Vete de aquí ahora!¡No te "
"burles de mí, porque mi fuerza es muy real! ¡Vete de aquí ahora!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Sheesh, ok, calm down, I'm leaving!"
msgstr "Sheesh, ok, cálmate, me voy!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Forgive me, I didn't mean to disrespect you."
msgstr "Perdóname, no quise faltarte el respeto."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Oh yeah?  Show me what you can do!"
msgstr "¿Ah, sí? ¡Muéstrame lo que puedes hacer!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "A common mistake, but I can assure you that I'm very real!"
msgstr "Un error común, pero puedo asegurarte que soy muy real."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_human_sample.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Sure, whatever."
msgstr "Claro, lo que sea."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Ok… I believe you."
msgstr "Ok... Te creo."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Anyway, do you need something?"
msgstr "De todos modos, ¿Necesitas algo?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Are you interested in some trading?"
msgstr "¿Está interesado en algún tipo de comercio?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Let's trade?"
msgstr "¿Negociamos?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'm looking for a place to stay."
msgstr "Estoy buscando un lugar para quedarme."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I want to get stronger.  Please teach me."
msgstr "Quiero ser más fuerte. Por favor, enséñame."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Please share your knowledge."
msgstr "Por favor comparte tu conocimiento."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'm building up a team, people with special abilities."
msgstr "Estoy formando un equipo, gente con habilidades especiales."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Can you tell me again about this sidekick offer?"
msgstr "¿Puedes decirme otra vez sobre la oferta de compinche?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Alright, I thought about this, what do you say about we team up?"
msgstr "Muy bien, he pensado en esto, ¿qué dices de que formemos un equipo?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'm good, bye."
msgstr "Estoy bien, adiós."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "I already have everything I need here in the FoodLair!"
msgstr "¡Ya tengo todo lo que necesito aquí en la GuaridaComida!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Alright let's see what you've got."
msgstr "Muy bien, veamos lo que tienes."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "But I am worthy!"
msgstr "¡Pero soy digno!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "I can teach you a few tricks."
msgstr "Puedo enseñarte algunos trucos."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "This is no place for a civilian.  You should go to the refugee center."
msgstr "Este no es lugar para un civil. Deberías ir al centro de refugiados."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Damn!"
msgstr "¡Maldición!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Well… You seem like a decent sort, I might have an offer for you."
msgstr "Bueno... Pareces un tipo decente, podría tener una oferta para ti."

#: data/json/npcs/Kindred/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_dialogue.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "I'm listening."
msgstr "Estoy escuchando."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Sorry but I work alone."
msgstr "Perdón pero trabajo solo."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "We could really use your help!"
msgstr "¡Nos vendría muy bien tu ayuda!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "That sounds great!"
msgstr "¡Suena genial!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Ok…"
msgstr "Ok…"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I need to think about it."
msgstr "Tengo que pensarlo."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Huh… no thanks."
msgstr "Eh... No gracias."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "There's other things I'd like to discuss."
msgstr "Hay otras cosas que me gustaría discutir."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Alright bye."
msgstr "Muy bien, adiós."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "The way you talk, the way you move… You're… You're me?  But how?"
msgstr ""
"La forma en la que hablas, la forma como te mueves... Tú eres... ¿Tú eres yo? "
"¿Pero cómo?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid ""
"I… I don't know.  It probably has something to do with <the_cataclysm>!  What "
"do you say we team up to find out?"
msgstr ""
"No... no lo sé. ¡Probablemente tenga algo que ver con <the_cataclysm>! ¿Qué "
"dices si nos unimos para averiguarlo?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid ""
"It might have something to do with <the_cataclysm>, mind if I stay here while "
"we try to figure this out?"
msgstr ""
"Podría tener algo que ver con <the_cataclysm>, ¿te importa si me quedo aquí "
"mientras intentamos resolver esto?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "This can't be true, you're trying to trick me!"
msgstr "Esto no puede ser verdad, ¡estás tratando de engañarme!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I need time to think."
msgstr "Necesito tiempo para pensar."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Wha… but.  But… how?"
msgstr "¿Qué... Pe. Pero... Cómo?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "No time to explain, the world is at an end and we must join forces to save it!"
msgstr ""
"No hay tiempo para explicaciones, el mundo se ha acabado y debemos unir "
"fuerzas para salvarlo."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid ""
"The Cataclysm weakened the space-time continuum, I accidentally fell through "
"a tear in reality and ended up here.  I will need access to your resources to "
"keep fighting."
msgstr ""
"El cataclismo debilitó el continuo espacio-tiempo, caí accidentalmente a "
"través de un desgarro en la realidad y terminé aquí. Necesitaré acceso a tus "
"recursos para seguir luchando."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid ""
"I am the ultimate Foodperson, I travel the multiverse consuming powers from "
"all the Foodpersons.  And now I've come for you!"
msgstr ""
"Soy el último Comidapersona, viajo por los multiversos consumiendo a todos "
"los Comidapersonas. ¡Y ahora he venido por ti!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Can't tell you now.  In due time all will be revealed."
msgstr "No puedo decírtelo ahora. A su debido tiempo todo será revelado."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Of course, whatever you need… Foodperson."
msgstr "Por supuesto, lo que necesites... Comidapersona."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Thank you Foodperson!  It's good to know I have a friend here."
msgstr "Gracias Comidapersona! Es bueno saber que tengo un amigo aquí."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "It's crazy out there, it's going to be a tough journey but I'm with you!"
msgstr "¡Es una locura allá afuera, va a ser un viaje difícil pero estoy contigo!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Let's go, we have a world to save!"
msgstr "¡Vamos, tenemos un mundo que salvar!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "There can be only one!"
msgstr "¡Sólo puede haber uno!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I AM THE ONE!"
msgstr "¡SOY EL ÚNICO!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Wow, calm down, it's just a prank bro."
msgstr "Vaya, cálmate, es sólo una broma, bro."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "WAIT!  There might be another way!"
msgstr "¡ESPERA! ¡Puede haber otra manera!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I don't want to fight you.  I'm leaving."
msgstr "No quiero pelear contigo. Me voy a ir."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Umm, I'm not sure I'm following you…"
msgstr "mmm, no estoy seguro de seguirte..."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid ""
"You know what, <name_b>, I don't want to talk to you anymore.  <kill_npc> "
"<name_b>!"
msgstr "Sabes que, <name_b>,  Yo no quiero hablarte más. ¡<kill_npc><name_b>!"

#: data/json/npcs/classes.json data/json/npcs/portal_storm/Portal_NPC.json
#. ~ Name of an NPC class
msgid "No class"
msgstr "Sin clase"

#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
#: data/json/npcs/classes.json
#. ~ Job description of "No class" NPC class
#. ~ Job description of "Fisherman" NPC class
msgid "I'm just wandering."
msgstr "Solo estoy dando vueltas."

#: data/json/npcs/classes.json
#. ~ Job description of "No class" NPC class
msgid "I'm a dummy class for better NPC items later into the Cataclysm."
msgstr ""
"Soy una clase ficticia para obtener mejores objetos de PNJ más adelante en el "
