#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Recover Priest's Diary"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Rock"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Recover Holy Symbol"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Mad Hermit"
msgid "St. Michael the archangel defend me in battle…"
msgstr "San Miguel El Arcángel me defiende en la batalla..."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Relic"
msgid ""
"As the world seems to abandon the reality that we once knew, it becomes "
"plausible that the old superstitions that were cast aside may have had some "
"truth to them.  Please go and find me a religious relic… I doubt it will be "
"of much use but I've got to hope in something."
msgstr ""
"A medida que el mundo parece abandonar la realidad que una vez conocimos, se "
"hace plausible que las viejas supersticiones que fueron desechadas puedan "
"tener algo de verdad. Por favor, ve y encuéntrame una reliquia religiosa... "
"Dudo que sea de mucha utilidad pero tengo que creer en algo."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Relic"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Recover Priest's Diary"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Rock"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Recover Holy Symbol"
msgid "I wish you the best of luck, may whatever god you please guide your path."
msgstr ""
"Te deseo la mejor de las suertes, puede que cualquier dios te guíe en tu "
"camino."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Relic"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Investigate Cult"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Prison Visionary"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Recover Priest's Diary"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Rock"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Recover Holy Symbol"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Mad Hermit"
msgid "Ya, I guess the stress may just be getting to me…"
msgstr "Sí, supongo que el estrés puede estar afectándome..."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Relic"
msgid "I suppose a large church or cathedral may have something."
msgstr "Supongo que en alguna iglesia o catedral haya algo."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Relic"
msgid "Any luck?  Please find me a small relic.  Any relic will do."
msgstr ""
"¿Tuviste suerte? Por favor, conseguime una reliquia pequeña. Cualquier "
"reliquia me sirve."

#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Relic"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Rock"
msgid "Thank you, I need some time alone now…"
msgstr "Gracias, necesito un tiempo a solas ahora..."

