#. ~ Name suffix of a male NPC
#. ~ Appears in the refugee center as shopkeeper with missions.  Faction
#. critical.  Real name: Gavin Wheeler
#. ~ Smokes is a firefighter that volunteered to take stock of what was
#. available and keep inventory. He's gradually had more lumped onto him as
#. the Free Merchants struggle to put themselves together, but he feels
#. obligated to help, even though he doesn't really want to have all the
#. responsibility he does.
#. ~ Retained to prevent errors.
msgid "Merchant"
msgstr "Mercader"

#: data/json/npcs/bunker_shop/classes.json
#. ~ Job description of "Merchant" NPC class
msgid "I sell things to make a living."
msgstr "Vendo cosas para ganarme la vida."

#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Find A Basic Analysis Kit"
msgstr "Encontrar un Equipo Básico de Análisis"

#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Find A Basic Analysis Kit"
msgid "Obtain a basic laboratory analysis kit for the chemist."
msgstr "Obtener un equipo básico de análisis de laboratorio para el químico."

#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find A Basic Analysis Kit"
msgid "I need a basic laboratory analysis kit."
msgstr "Necesito un equipo básico de análisis."

#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find A Basic Analysis Kit"
msgid ""
"I've checked the stock here at this house, and it turns out there's a few "
"pieces of equipment I need.  Firstly, I need a reliable way to take "
"measurements and verify results.  If you could get me a basic laboratory "
"analysis kit just to get started, I'd be grateful.  That's the first step "
"towards making everything I brought with me useful."
msgstr ""
"Revisé los suministros en esta casa y resulta que hay algunos equipos que "
"necesito. Primero, necesito una manera confiable para medir y verificar "
"resultados. Si pudieras conseguirme un equipo básico de análisis para "
"empezar, estaría agradecido. Ese es el primer paso para que todo lo que traje "
"sea útil."

#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/lumbermill_missions.json
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find A Basic Analysis Kit"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Some Hydrochloric Acid"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Some Gasoline"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Establish A Trade Route"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Drive Belts"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Get 1,000 Nails"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Get 6,800 Nails"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 6 Blankets"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 25 Magnetrons"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain 300 Charcoal"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain 100 Solder"
msgid "I'll be here when you get back.  Good luck!"
msgstr "Estaré aquí cuando vuelvas. Buena suerte!"

#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/lumbermill_missions.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find A Basic Analysis Kit"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Some Hydrochloric Acid"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Some Gasoline"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 6 Blankets"
msgid "Well, someone's got to do it."
msgstr "Bueno, alguien lo tiene que hacer."

#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find A Basic Analysis Kit"
msgid "One of those old labs might have one."
msgstr "Uno de esos viejos laboratorios pueden tener uno."

#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find A Basic Analysis Kit"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Some Gasoline"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain a guitar string"
msgid "Do you have it?"
msgstr "¿Lo conseguiste?"

#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find A Basic Analysis Kit"
msgid "Thank you!  I can't wait to get started!"
msgstr "¡Gracias! ¡Tengo muchas ganas de empezar!"

#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find A Basic Analysis Kit"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Some Hydrochloric Acid"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Some Gasoline"
msgid "That's unfortunate.  I guess I'll have to find it myself."
msgstr "Qué lastima. Supongo que lo tendré que hacer yo mismo."

#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Find Some Hydrochloric Acid"
msgstr "Consigue un poco de Ácido Hidroclórico"

#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Find Some Hydrochloric Acid"
msgid "Obtain 15 liters of hydrochloric acid for the chemist."
msgstr "Obtener 15 litros de ácido hidroclórico para el químico."

#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Some Hydrochloric Acid"
msgid "I need 15 liters of hydrochloric acid."
msgstr "Necesito 15 litros de ácido clorhídrico."

#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Some Hydrochloric Acid"
msgid ""
"The last thing I really need to get going is hydrochloric acid.  It's one of "
"those chemicals that's just perfect for so many things.  An acidifying "
"reagent, and one of the best.  With a large supply of hydrochloric acid, you "
"and I are only a few steps removed from a stable source of antiseptic, "
"fungicide, and even some light explosives!  As the only apparent health "
"authority left, I do have to warn you not to get it on your skin, though.  "
"Find this for me and I'll sell you whatever I can make."
msgstr ""
"Lo último que necesito para empezar es ácido hidroclórico. Es uno de esos "
"químicos perfectos para muchas cosas. Es uno de los mejores reactivos "
"acidificantes. Con un gran suministro de ácido hidroclórico estaríamos "
"bastante cerca de conseguir una fuente estable de antiséptico, fungicida e "
"¡incluso algunos explosivos! Como parezco la única autoridad en salud que "
"queda, te tengo que advertir que no te toque la piel. Consígueme esto y te "
"venderé todo lo que pueda fabricar."

#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Some Hydrochloric Acid"
msgid ""
"You might find large quantities in a warehouse somewhere, but it often got "
"sold as a household cleaner, did you know that?"
msgstr ""
"Es posible que encuentres grandes cantidades en algún almacén, pero a menudo "
"se vendía como limpiador doméstico, ¿lo sabías?"

#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Some Hydrochloric Acid"
msgid "Do you have the hydrochloric acid?"
msgstr "¿Conseguiste el ácido hidroclórico?"

#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Some Hydrochloric Acid"
msgid "Wonderful!  I'm sure this will be quite helpful."
msgstr "¡Genial! Estoy seguro que esto sera muy útil."

#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Find Some Gasoline"
msgstr "Encuentra un Poco de Gasolina"

#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Find Some Gasoline"
msgid "Obtain 100 liters of gasoline for the chemist."
msgstr "Obtener 100 litros de gasolina para el químico."

#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Some Gasoline"
msgid "I need 100 liters of gas."
msgstr "Necesito 100 litros de gasolina."

#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Some Gasoline"
msgid ""
"I'm in a bit of a spot.  I keep a generator around here to power all my "
"scientific equipment.  It has a bit of gas in it, but I've burned through "
"that and I can't use most of my tools without power.  This may seem like a "
"lot, but if you could get me 100 liters of gas, I'll pay you back any way I "
"can."
msgstr ""
"Lo tengo medio complicado. Mantengo un generador para alimentar todo el "
"equipo científico. Tenía un poco de gasolina pero la gasté toda y no puedo "
"usar mis herramientas sin electricidad. Puede parecer mucho, pero si me "
"pudieras conseguir 100 litros de gasolina, te lo pagaría con creces."

#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Some Gasoline"
msgid ""
"I bet the best place to find that much gas is still a gas station.  Bringing "
"it all here is another problem.  You might want one of those big steel drums "
"we used to use to haul off hazardous waste before <the_cataclysm>."
msgstr ""
"Supongo que el mejor lugar para conseguir esa cantidad de gasolina sigue "
"siendo una estación de servicio. Traerla hasta aquí es otro problema. Te "
"convendría conseguir uno de esos tanques de acero grandes que se usaban para "
"transportar deshechos peligrosos antes de <the_cataclysm>."

#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Some Gasoline"
msgid ""
"Wonderful!  Thank you so much!  This will keep me running for a long, long "
"time."
msgstr "¡Genial! ¡Muchas gracias! Esto me va a venir bien por mucho tiempo."

#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Some Gasoline"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Renewable Energy"
msgid "Thanks for trying…  I guess."
msgstr "Gracias por intentarlo... supongo."

#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/lumbermill_missions.json
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Establish A Trade Route"
msgstr "Establecer una Ruta Comercial"

#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Establish A Trade Route"
msgid ""
"Establish trade relations between the chemist and a refugee center, and bring "
"back a writ of the agreement."
msgstr ""
"Establecer relaciones comerciales entre el químico y el centro de refugiados "
"y traer el acuerdo por escrito."

#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/lumbermill_missions.json
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Establish A Trade Route"
msgid "Go negotiate a trade agreement."
msgstr "Ve a negociar un acuerdo comercial."

#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Establish A Trade Route"
msgid ""
"I was out scavenging recently, and I found one of those old evac shelters.  "
"Turns out the computer was still on and it had an address for a refugee "
"center.  I think my skills might be useful to them, for helping maintain "
"medical supplies and whatnot, so I want you to head over there and see if "
"they're interested.  I'd do it myself, but I need to look after this place."
msgstr ""
"Estaba buscando cosas recientemente y encontré uno de esos refugios de "
"evacuados. Resulta que el ordenador todavía estaba encendido y tenía la "
"dirección de un centro de refugiados. Creo que mis habilidades pueden serles "
"útiles para mantener los suministros médicos y demás, así que quiero que "
"vayas allí y veas si están interesados. Lo haría yo mismo pero tengo que "
"cuidar este lugar."

#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Establish A Trade Route"
msgid "Please?  This is really important to me."
msgstr "¿Por favor? Esto es muy importante para mí."

#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/lumbermill_missions.json
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Establish A Trade Route"
msgid ""
"It should be pretty simple making the deal, but I'd recommend taking a car "
"over there myself."
msgstr ""
"Debería ser bastante sencillo hacer el trato, pero yo mismo recomendaría "
"llevar un coche allí."

#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Establish A Trade Route"
msgid "What did they say about it?"
msgstr "¿Qué dijeron al respecto?"

#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Establish A Trade Route"
msgid "How does this help me?"
msgstr "¿En qué me ayuda esto?"

#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Establish A Trade Route"
msgid "That's unfortunate.  I guess I'll have to find other customers."
msgstr "Qué lástima. Supongo que tendré que buscar otros clientes."

#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_npc.json
#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
msgid "chemist"
msgstr "químico"

#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_npc.json
#: data/json/overmap/overmap_special/specials.json
#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#. ~ Name of NPC faction camp
msgid "Chemist"
msgstr "Químico"

#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_npc.json
#. ~ Job description of "Chemist" NPC class
msgid "I make and sell chemicals"
msgstr "Fabrico y vendo productos químicos"

#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_npc.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Could you tell me about yourself again?"
msgstr "¿Podría volver a hablarme de ti una vez más?"

#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_npc.json
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/TALK_lumbermill_logger.json
#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/TALK_lumbermill_merchant.json
