#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Shady Hills Nursing Home.\n"
" You are logged in as: Joe Shert, Receptionist.\n"
"\n"
"WARNING!  ERROR A101; FAILURE DETECTED IN POWER SUPPLY.\n"
" RESERVE POWER ACTIVATED.  CONTACT INFORMATION TECHNOLOGY DEPARTMENT "
"IMMEDIATELY!"
msgstr ""
"Hogar de Ancianos Colinas Sombrias.\n"
" Estás conectado como: Joe Shert, Recepcionista.\n"
"\n"
"¡ADVERTENCIA! ERROR A101; FALLO DETECTADO EN LA ALIMENTACIÓN ELÉCTRICA.\n"
" RESERVA DE ENERGÍA ACTIVADA.  ¡PÓNGASE EN CONTACTO INMEDIATAMENTE CON EL "
"DEPARTAMENTO INFORMÁTICO!"

#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Access Assigned Tasks"
msgstr "Acceder a Tareas Asignadas"

#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "RE: Ghosts!?"
msgstr "RE: ¡¿Fantasmas!?"

#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "RE: Performance Evaluation"
msgstr "RE: Evaluación de Rendimiento"

#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "RE: Mrs.  Palmero"
msgstr "RE: Sra. Palmero"

#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "RE: Housekeeping"
msgstr "RE: Servicio de Limpieza"

#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"FROM: Connie Malackey, Receptionist\n"
" TO: Joe Shert, Receptionist\n"
" RE: Ghosts!?\n"
"\n"
" Joe!  After we heard those weird noises the other night, I talked to some of "
"the nurses.\n"
" We aren't the only ones!  Everyone has heard weird noises coming from the "
"walls.\n"
" Do you think this place is haunted!?"
msgstr ""
"DE: Connie Malackey, Recepcionista\n"
" PARA: Joe Shert, Recepcionista\n"
" RE: ¿!Fantasmas!?\n"
"\n"
" ¡Joe! Cuando escuchamos esos ruidos raros la otra noche hablé con algunas de "
"las enfermeras.\n"
" ¡No somos los únicos! Todos escucharon ruidos raros saliendo de las paredes.\n"
"¿¡Crees que este lugar está embrujado!?"

#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"FROM: Bryan Rooters, Reception Manager\n"
" TO: Joe Shert, Receptionist\n"
" RE: Performance Eval\n"
"\n"
" Hi Joe.\n"
" Your 90-day performance evaluation is due.  Please plan to meet with me in "
"my office on Tuesday.\n"
" Thanks."
msgstr ""
"DE: Bryan Rooters, Gerente de Recepción\n"
" PARA: Joe Shert, Recepcionista\n"
" RE: Evaluación de Rendimiento\n"
"\n"
" Hola Joe.\n"
" Tu evaluación de 90 días está programada. Reúnase conmigo en mi despacho el "
"martes.\n"
" Gracias."

#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"FROM: Bryan Rooters, Reception Manager\n"
" TO: Receptionists\n"
" RE: Housekeeping\n"
"\n"
" Hi team,\n"
" Please be aware that the decision has been made to let go some of the "
"housekeeping staff.\n"
" This decision was made by management to ensure that our operation can run as "
"smoothly and efficiently as possible by passing on these cost savings to the "
"residents.\n"
" To keep up with our high standards of elder care, I will be assigning some "
"additional small tasks to you in the near future.\n"
" As you know, here at Shady Hills we value each and every employee and see "
"this as an excellent opportunity to grow, learn, and provide for the Shady "
"Hills family.\n"
" Please let me know if you have any questions.\n"
" Thanks."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"FROM: Connie Malackey, Receptionist\n"
" TO: Joe Shert, Receptionist\n"
" RE: Mrs.  Palmero\n"
"\n"
" Hi Joe.\n"
" So - you know how Mrs.  Palmero has been acting weird and constantly talking "
"about baking cookies?\n"
" I was talking to one of the nurses and they said that Mrs.  Palmero was "
"prescribed this new medicine?\n"
" It's this weird powder stuff.  Apparently the nurses aren't even qualified "
"to give it to her - she needs a special doctor to come in every day!\n"
" Crazy, right?  I wish all I had to worry about was baking cookies…"
msgstr ""
"DE: Connie Malackey, Recepcionista\n"
" PARA: Joe Shert, Recepcionista\n"
" RE: Sra. Palmero\n"
"\n"
" Hola Joe.\n"
" ¿Sabes que la Sra. Palmero ha estado actuando de forma extraña y hablando "
"constantemente de hacer galletas?\n"
"Estuve hablando con una de las enfermeras y me dijo que a la Sra. Palmero le "
"habían recetado un nuevo medicamento.\n"
"Es una cosa rara en polvo. Al parecer, las enfermeras ni siquiera están "
"cualificadas para dárselo, ¡necesita que venga un médico especial todos los "
"días!\n"
"Una locura, ¿verdad? Ojalá sólo tuviera que preocuparme de hacer galletas..e"

#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"WARNING!  ERROR A101; FAILURE DETECTED IN POWER SUPPLY.\n"
" RESERVE POWER ACTIVATED.  CONTACT INFORMATION TECHNOLOGY DEPARTMENT "
"IMMEDIATELY!\n"
"\n"
" WARNING!  ERROR C310; UNABLE TO CONNECT TO SCHEDULING SERVER.\n"
" ERROR REFRESHING TASKS.  NOT ALL TASKS MAY BE DISPLAYED.\n"
" REPORT COMPLETED TASKS DIRECTLY TO SUPERVISOR VIA MESSAGING SYSTEM.\n"
" CONTACT INFORMATION TECHNOLOGY DEPARTMENT IMMEDIATELY!"
msgstr ""
"¡ADVERTENCIA! ERROR A101; FALLO DETECTADO EN LA ALIMENTACIÓN ELÉCTRICA.\n"
"RESERVA DE ENERGÍA ACTIVADA. ¡PÓNGASE EN CONTACTO INMEDIATAMENTE CON EL "
"DEPARTAMENTO INFORMÁTICO!\n"
"\n"
"ADVERTENCIA ERROR C310; NO SE PUEDE CONECTAR CON EL SERVIDOR DE "
"PLANIFICACIÓN.\n"
"ERROR REFRESCANDO TAREAS. ES POSIBLE QUE NO SE MUESTREN TODAS LAS TAREAS.\n"
"COMUNIQUE LAS TAREAS COMPLETADAS DIRECTAMENTE AL SUPERVISOR A TRAVÉS DEL "
"SISTEMA DE MENSAJERÍA.\n"
"¡PÓNGASE EN CONTACTO INMEDIATAMENTE CON EL DEPARTAMENTO INFORMÁTICO!"

