msgid "Completed Assignments"
msgstr "Tareas Realizadas"

#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "RETURN TO ASSIGNED TASKS"
msgstr "VOLVER A LAS TAREAS ASIGNADAS"

#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Welcome Joe to Shady Hills Assignment Database,\n"
"\n"
" You have [1] new task(s) assigned to you by your supervisor.\n"
" When you have completed each task, be sure to submit them for approval."
msgstr ""
"Bienvenido Joe a la Base de Datos de Tareas de Colinas Sombrias,\n"
"\n"
" Tienes [1] tarea(s) nueva(s) asignada(s) por tu supervisor.\n"
"  Cuando completes cada tarea, asegúrate de presentarlas para su aprobación."

#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Clean Bathrooms [NEW!]"
msgstr "Limpiar Baños [¡NOVEDAD!]"

#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"TASK: Clean Bathrooms\n"
" Assigned to: Joe Shert, Reception\n"
" Assigned by: Bryan Rooters, Reception Manager\n"
" Priority: High\n"
" Due in: 1 Day\n"
"\n"
" Notes: Clean each bathroom stall and refresh toilet paper."
msgstr ""
"TAREA: Limpiar Baños\n"
" Asignada a: Joe Shert, Recepción\n"
" Asignada por: Bryan Rooters, Gerente de Recepción\n"
" Prioridad: Alta\n"
"Plazo de finalización: 1 Día\n"
"\n"
" Notas: Limpiar cada baño y renovar el papel higiénico."

#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Set Task to Completed"
msgstr "Establecer Tarea como Completada"

#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Add Comment"
msgstr "Agregar Comentario"

#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Shady Hills Nursing Home.\n"
" You are logged in as: Bryan Rooters, Reception Manager.\n"
"\n"
" WARNING!  ERROR A101; FAILURE DETECTED IN POWER SUPPLY.\n"
" RESERVE POWER ACTIVATED.  CONTACT INFORMATION TECHNOLOGY DEPARTMENT "
"IMMEDIATELY!"
msgstr ""
"Hogar de Ancianos Colinas Sombrias.\n"
" Estás conectado como: Bryan Rooters, Gerente de Recepción.\n"
"\n"
"¡ADVERTENCIA! ERROR A101; FALLO DETECTADO EN LA ALIMENTACIÓN ELÉCTRICA.\n"
"RESERVA DE ENERGÍA ACTIVADA. ¡PÓNGASE EN CONTACTO INMEDIATAMENTE CON EL "
"DEPARTAMENTO INFORMÁTICO!"

#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Access Employee Files"
msgstr "Acceder a Archivos de Empleados"

#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "RE: Do Your Job"
msgstr "RE: Haz Tu Trabajo"

#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "RE: Connie Malackey"
msgstr "RE: Connie Malackey"

#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"FROM: Kristi Gordee, SVP Operations\n"
" TO: Bryan Rooters, Reception Manager\n"
" RE: Do Your Job\n"
"\n"
" Bryan,\n"
" Do you not conduct thorough background checks and reviews on new hires?  Joe "
"is related to the Mayor of Springfield.  His 90 day New Employee evaluation "
"is coming up.  Do your job."
msgstr ""
"DE: Kristi Gordee, SVP de Operaciones\n"
" PARA: Bryan Rooters, Gerente de Recepción\n"
" RE: Haz Tu Trabajo\n"
"\n"
" Bryan,\n"
"¿No investigan a fondo los antecedentes de los nuevos contratados? Joe es "
"pariente del Alcalde de Springfield. Su evaluación de 90 días como Nuevo "
"Empleado está próxima. Haz tu trabajo."

#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"FROM: Joe Shert, Receptionist\n"
" TO: Bryan Rooters, Reception Manager\n"
" RE: Performance Evaluation\n"
"\n"
" Hi Mr. Rooters, I look forward to seeing you Tuesday for my evaluation.  "
"I've been working really hard to show that I am Shady Hills material!"
msgstr ""
"DE: Joe Shert, Recepcionista\n"
" PARA: Bryan Rooters, Gerente de Recepción\n"
" RE: Evaluación de Rendimiento\n"
"\n"
" Hola, Sr. Rooters, espero con ganas verlo el martes para mi evaluación. ¡He "
"estado trabajando muy duro para demostrar que soy digno de Colinas Sombrías!"

#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"FROM: Kristi Gordee, SVP Operations\n"
" TO: Bryan Rooters, Reception Manager\n"
" RE: Connie Malackey\n"
"\n"
" Bryan,\n"
" Connie has been asking a lot of weird questions about 'Ghosts' and other "
"such nonsense.\n"
" This could look bad for us.  To make it worse, she is hanging out with Joe "
"Shert a lot.\n"
" Shut it down."
msgstr ""
"DE: Kristi Gordee, SVP de Operaciones\n"
" PARA: Bryan Rooters, Gerente de Recepción\n"
" RE: Connie Malackey\n"
"\n"
" Bryan,\n"
"Connie ha estado haciendo un montón de preguntas raras sobre 'Fantasmas' y "
"otras tonterías por el estilo.\n"
"Esto podría perjudicarnos. Para empeorarlo, está pasando mucho tiempo con Joe "
"Shert.\n"
"Deten ese comportamiento."

#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"FROM: Joe Shert, Receptionist\n"
" TO: Bryan Rooters, Reception Manager\n"
" RE: Housekeeping\n"
"\n"
" Hi Mr. Rooters, with all due respect I feel that I may have been assigned "
"more of these tasks than the other Receptionists.\n"
" Jim said he hasn't had to do any cleaning in two weeks, yet I have been on "
"cleaning duty 3 times.\n"
" To be clear, I certainly do not mind the extra work!  I just want to ensure "
"you're aware in case there is a computer glitch.\n"
" Thank you and have a great day!"
msgstr ""
"DE: Joe Shert, Recepcionista\n"
" PARA: Bryan Rooters, Gerente de Recepción\n"
" RE: Servicio de Limpieza\n"
"\n"
"Hola Sr. Rooters, con el debido respeto creo que se me han asignado más "
"tareas de este tipo que a los otros Recepcionistas.\n"
"Jim dice que no ha tenido que hacer ninguna tarea de limpieza en dos semanas, "
"y sin embargo yo ya he tenido que limpiar 3 veces.\n"
"Que quede claro que no me importa el trabajo extra. Sólo quiero asegurarme de "
"que usted está enterado en caso de que exista un error informático.\n"
"¡Gracias y que pase un buen día!"

#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"FROM: Amanda Hugentskis, Receptionist\n"
" TO: Bryan Rooters, Reception Manager\n"
" RE: Housekeeping\n"
"\n"
" Seriously?  This is ridiculous.  This place was a mess even with "
"housekeeping personnel.\n"
" I quit."
msgstr ""
"DE: Amanda Hugentskis, Recepcionista\n"
" PARA: Bryan Rooters, Gerente de Recepción\n"
" RE: Servicio de Limpieza\n"
"\n"
" ¿En serio? Esto es ridículo. Este lugar era un asco incluso con el personal "
"de limpieza.\n"
"No pienso volver, lo dejo."

#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
