#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"EMPLOYEE NAME: Joseph Shert\n"
" EMPLOYEE TITLE: Receptionist\n"
" REVIEW DATE: 06-xx-xxxx\n"
" REVIEW BY: Bryan Rooters, Reception Manager\n"
"\n"
" Joseph is always on time for work and gets along well with coworkers.  "
"However, he has trouble taking direction and often speaks out against his "
"superiors [See attached email: Housekeeping].\n"
" Joe speaks a big game but unfortunately does not perform to the Shady Hills "
"standard.\n"
" As our standard is extremely important for the health and wellbeing of our "
"residents, I have no choice but to recommend termination.\n"
"\n"
" Signed,\n"
" Bryan Rooters\n"
" Reception Manager"
msgstr ""
"NOMBRE: Joseph Shert\n"
" OCUPACIÓN: Recepcionista\n"
" FECHA DE EVALUACIÓN: 06-xx-xxxx\n"
" HECHA POR: Bryan Rooters, Gerente de Recepción\n"
"\n"
"Joseph siempre llega puntual al trabajo y se lleva bien con sus compañeros. "
"Sin embargo, le cuesta aceptar instrucciones y a menudo habla en contra de "
"sus superiores [ Ver correo electrónico adjunto: Limpieza].\n"
"Joe habla muy bien de su trabajo pero desafortunadamente no cumple con los "
"estándares de Colinas Sombrias.\n"
"Dado que nuestro estándar es extremadamente importante para la salud y el "
"bienestar de nuestros residentes, no tengo más remedio que recomendar su "
"despido.\n"
"\n"
" Firmado,\n"
" Bryan Rooters\n"
"Gerente de Recepción"

#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
