#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"FROM: Kristi Gordee, SVP Operations\n"
" TO: Peter St. Travers, SVP Research & Development\n"
" RE: Shepherds\n"
"\n"
" Peter,\n"
" Leah Shepherds keeps sending me emails, and we just received the papers for "
"yet another lawsuit.\n"
" I don't know what you're thinking but this one is going to be really "
"difficult and could cost us.\n"
" The Board is going to be furious."
msgstr ""
"DE: Kristi Gordee, SVP de Operaciones\n"
" Para: Peter St. Travers, SVP de Investigación y Desarrollo\n"
" RE: Shepherds\n"
"\n"
" Peter,\n"
"Leah Shepherds sigue enviándome correos, y acabamos de recibir los papeles "
"para otra demanda.\n"
"No sé qué estás pensando, pero éste va a ser muy difícil y podría costarnos "
"caro.\n"
"La Junta va a estar furiosa."

#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"FROM: Vincent Fuels, Researcher\n"
" TO: Peter St. Travers, SVP Research & Development\n"
" RE: This is bad!\n"
"\n"
" While you were gone last night, the old man started to wake up and become "
"cranky.\n"
" We had to give him another dose of that elephant tranquilizer!\n"
" I think he might actually be strong enough to break out of his cell now.\n"
" We really need to do something before he kills someone!\n"
" I know this experiment meant a lot to you, but it isn't worth the risk "
"anymore!"
msgstr ""
"DE: Vincent Fuels, Investigador\n"
"PARA: Peter St. Travers, SVP Investigación y Desarrollo\n"
"RE: ¡Esto es malo!\n"
"Mientras no estabas anoche, el viejo empezó a despertarse y a ponerse de mal "
"humor.\n"
"¡Le tuvimos que darle otra dosis de ese tranquilizante para elefantes!.\n"
"Creo que podría ser lo suficientemente fuerte como para salir de su celda "
"ahora.\n"
"¡Tenemos que hacer algo antes de que mate a alguien!.\n"
"Sé que este experimento significaba mucho para ti, ¡pero ya no vale la pena "
"arriesgarse!"

#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"FROM: Kristi Gordee, SVP Operations\n"
" TO: Peter St. Travers, SVP Research & Development\n"
" RE: Budget\n"
"\n"
" Peter,\n"
" You need to find a way to reverse what you did ASAP.\n"
" What exactly do you expect me to do to get us out of this?\n"
" The police are investigating us now for foul play."
msgstr ""
"DE: Kristi Gordee, SVP de Operaciones\n"
" PARA: Peter St. Travers, SVP de Investigación y Desarrollo\n"
" RE: Presupuesto\n"
"\n"
" Peter,\n"
" Tienes que encontrar una manera de revertir lo que hiciste lo antes posible.\n"
"¿Qué esperas exactamente que haga para sacarnos de este problema?\n"
"La policía nos está investigando ahora por un delito."

#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"FROM: Unknown Sender\n"
" TO: Peter St. Travers, SVP Research & Development\n"
" RE: Results\n"
"\n"
" Looking forward to your report at the next meeting.\n"
" I put a lot on the line for you, don't disappoint me, Peter.\n"
" Get me results."
msgstr ""
"DE: Desconocido\n"
" PARA: Peter St. Travers, SVP de Investigación y Desarrollo\n"
" RE: Resultados\n"
"\n"
" Espero con impaciencia tu informe en la próxima reunión.\n"
"Me estoy jugando mucho por ti, no me decepciones, Peter.\n"
"Consígueme resultados."

#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"FROM: Will Higgins, VP Information Technology\n"
" TO: Peter St. Travers, SVP Research & Development\n"
" RE: Security\n"
"\n"
" Hello sir,\n"
" I understand your concerns about security.  Rest assured, myself and my team "
"take this very seriously.  I assure you that high-level encryption protects "
"all of our systems.\n"
" Nobody will be able to access any of our PCs without use of the owner's "
"fingerprint authentication, even in the event that the main power supply is "
"cut.\n"
" Nobody unauthorized will ever be able to read our emails or documents."
msgstr ""
"DE: Will Higgins, VP Departamento de Informática\n"
" PARA: Peter St. Travers, SVP de Investigación y Desarrollo\n"
" RE: Seguridad\n"
"\n"
" Hola, señor,\n"
"Entiendo su preocupación por la seguridad. Puede estar seguro de que mi "
"equipo y yo nos la tomamos muy en serio. Te aseguro que un encriptado de alto "
"nivel protege todos nuestros sistemas.\n"
"Nadie puede acceder a ninguno de nuestros ordenadores sin la autenticación de "
"la huella dactilar del propietario, ni siquiera en caso de corte del "
"suministro eléctrico.\n"
"Nadie no autorizado jamás podrá leer nuestros correos electrónicos o "
"documentos."

