msgid "Come back when you get a chance.  We need skilled survivors."
msgstr "Vuelve cuando tengas la oportunidad. Necesitamos supervivientes cualificados."

#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Water Pump Construction"
msgid "Try disassembling another well."
msgstr "Prueba desmontando otro pozo."

#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Water Pump Construction"
msgid "Managed to find that pump?"
msgstr "¿Lograste encontrar esa bomba?"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Water Pump Construction"
msgid ""
"Much obliged, survivor.  Thanks to you, we don't need to worry about where "
"our water's gonna come from.  Here, take this as a token of our gratitude."
msgstr ""
"Muchas gracias, superviviente. Gracias a ti, no tenemos que preocuparnos de "
"dónde vendrá nuestra agua. Toma esto como muestra de nuestra gratitud."

#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Chicken Coop Construction"
msgstr "Construcción de Gallinero"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Chicken Coop Construction"
msgid "Get 150 nails for Darryl."
msgstr "Consigue 150 clavos para Darryl."

#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Chicken Coop Construction"
msgid "I need nails to build a chicken coop"
msgstr "Necesito clavos para construir un gallinero"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Chicken Coop Construction"
msgid ""
"Now that we've got a steady supply of water, I've been thinking about raising "
"some livestock.  I'm starting with some chickens I found on a farm the other "
"day, but I don't have a coop for them.  If you can get me 150 nails, I can "
"start building one."
msgstr ""
"Ahora que tenemos un suministro constante de agua, he estado pensando en "
"criar algo de ganado. Voy a empezar con unas gallinas que encontré el otro "
"día en una granja, pero no tengo un gallinero para ellas. Si me consigues 150 "
"clavos, podré empezar a construir uno."

#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Chicken Coop Construction"
msgid "Its a simple job."
msgstr "Es un trabajo sencillo."

#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Chicken Coop Construction"
msgid "You could take apart some furniture in town, or make them yourself."
msgstr "Podrías desmontar algunos muebles de un pueblo, o fabricarlos tú mismo."

#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Chicken Coop Construction"
msgid "Got the nails?"
msgstr "¿Tienes los clavos?"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Chicken Coop Construction"
msgid ""
"Thank you.  I should have some eggs in a week, once I finish the coop.  Come "
"back and buy some!"
msgstr ""
"Gracias. Debería tener algunos huevos en una semana, una vez que termine el "
"gallinero. ¡Vuelve y compra algunos!"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Trophy Hunt I"
msgstr "Trofeo de Caza I"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Trophy Hunt I"
msgid ""
"Help Russell Connelly expand his trophy collection by gathering three hunks "
"of slime glob."
msgstr ""
"Ayuda a Russell Connelly a ampliar su colección de trofeos reuniendo tres "
"trozos de légamo."

#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt I"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt II"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt III"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Relic Recovery"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bible Belt"
msgid "I need your help…"
msgstr "Necesito tu ayuda..."

#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt I"
msgid ""
"I have the location for an alien crash site.  I want you to investigate and "
"bring me anything you'd find interesting."
msgstr ""
"Tengo la localización de un lugar de impacto alienígena. Quiero que lo "
"investigues y me traigas todo lo que te parezca interesante."

#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt I"
msgid "Good luck out there!"
msgstr "¡Buena suerte ahí fuera!"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt I"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt II"
msgid "That's all right.  Not everyone is cut out for this."
msgstr "Está bien, no todo el mundo está preparado para esto."

#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt I"
msgid ""
"Worst case scenario you'll be covered in slime.  There's nothing to fear, I "
"hope."
msgstr ""
"En el peor de los casos acabarás cubierto de légamo. No hay nada que temer, "
"creo."

#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt I"
msgid "Any luck, survivor?"
msgstr "¿Tuviste suerte, superviviente?"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt I"
msgid ""
"Good one!  Survivor, you have just passed my test.  I knew you could do it.  "
"Your work shall be rewarded!"
msgstr ""
"¡Bien hecho! Superviviente, acabas de pasar mi prueba. Sabía que podías "
"hacerlo. ¡Tu trabajo será recompensado!"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt I"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt II"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt III"
msgid "You liar!"
msgstr "¡Mentiroso!"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Trophy Hunt II"
msgstr "Trofeo de Caza II"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Trophy Hunt II"
msgid "Continue the quest for trophies by finding an unhatched spider egg."
msgstr "Continúa la búsqueda de trofeos encontrando un huevo de araña sin eclosionar."

#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt II"
msgid ""
"<the_cataclysm> didn't spare us humans.  Our former selves would look at us "
"in disgust at the things we do for survival.  At least, that's what I was "
"told.  I heard reports of arachnids deep in the woods.  I can't exactly "
"pinpoint where their webs are, but I'm sure you'll figure it out once you're "
"stuck in them.  I'd like me a spider egg!"
msgstr ""
"<the_cataclysm> no nos perdonó a los humanos. Nuestros antiguos yo nos "
"mirarían con repugnancia por las cosas que hacemos para sobrevivir. Al menos, "
"eso es lo que me dijeron. He oído informes sobre arácnidos en lo profundo del "
"bosque. No puedo precisar exactamente dónde están sus telarañas, pero estoy "
"seguro de que lo descubrirás una vez que estés atrapado en ellas. ¡Me "
"gustaría tener un huevo de araña!"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt II"
msgid "Thanks, make sure you're ready for whatever beast is waiting for you."
msgstr ""
"Gracias, asegúrate de estar preparado para cualquier bestia que te esté "
"esperando."

#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt II"
msgid "Don't worry <name_g>, I wouldn't send you on a suicide mission, would I?"
msgstr "No te preocupes <name_g>, no te enviaría a una misión suicida, ¿verdad?"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt II"
msgid "Managed to succeed, survivor?"
msgstr "¿Conseguiste tener éxito, superviviente?"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt II"
msgid ""
"Nice catch!  Friend, you've proven yourself to be an extraordinary survivor.  "
"Maybe there's still hope for humanity.  I'll take that egg, thank you very "
"much.  Here's your reward and some bullets for your effort."
msgstr ""
"¡Buena! Amigo, has demostrado ser un superviviente extraordinario. Tal vez "
"todavía hay esperanza para la humanidad. Me llevaré ese huevo, muchas "
"gracias. Aquí tienes tu recompensa y algunas balas por tu esfuerzo."

#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Trophy Hunt III"
msgstr "Trofeo de Caza III"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Trophy Hunt III"
msgid "Bring one last trophy to Russell Connelly.  Harvest a sting from a bee."
msgstr "Lleva un último trofeo a Russell Connelly. Extrae un aguijón de una abeja."

#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt III"
msgid ""
"It feels like I'm doing this for revenge.  I have one last mission for you.  "
"Ever seen those ginormous bee hives?  Well, I can tell you where the closest "
"one is.  Just kill off one stray bee, harvest its stinger and bring it to me."
msgstr ""
"Siento que estoy haciendo esto por venganza. Tengo una última misión para ti. "
"¿Alguna vez has visto esas colmenas gigantes? Bueno, puedo decirte dónde está "
"la más cercana. Solo mata a una abeja perdida, recoge su aguijón y tráemelo."

#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt III"
msgid "I wish you the best of luck, may God guide your path."
msgstr "Te deseo la mejor de las suertes, que Dios guíe tu camino."

#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt III"
msgid "This passion of mine may just be getting to me…"
msgstr "Puede que esta pasión mía me esté afectando..."

#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt III"
msgid ""
"If I were you, I'd bring a gun and a butcher knife.  I don't think bug spray "
"work anymore."
msgstr ""
"Si yo fuera tú, llevaría un arma y un cuchillo de carnicero. Creo que los "
"insecticidas ya no funcionan."

#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt III"
msgid "How is the hunt going, survivor?  Any luck?"
msgstr "¿Cómo va la caza, superviviente? ¿Ha habido suerte?"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt III"
msgid ""
"Well, partner, this might just be the end of the road.  I hope you enjoyed it "
"as much as I have.  In the meantime… here's your reward, a handful of icons, "
"that's all I have left.  Spend them all, I think you've deserved it."
msgstr ""
"Bien compañero, puede que este sea el final del camino. Espero que lo hayas "
"disfrutado tanto como yo. Mientras tanto... aquí tienes tu recompensa, un "
"puñado de iconos, es todo lo que me queda. Gástalos todos, creo que te lo "
"mereces."

#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt III"
msgid ""
"You give up now?  This country fell apart because no one could find a good "
"man to rely on… might as well give up, I guess."
msgstr ""
"¿Te rindes ahora? Este país se desmoronó porque nadie podía encontrar un "
"hombre de confianza... más vale que me rinda, supongo."

#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "End The Nightmare"
msgstr "Finalizar La Pesadilla"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
#. ~ Description of mission "End The Nightmare"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "End The Nightmare"
msgid "Kill whatever's keeping Zachary up at night."
msgstr "Matar lo que sea que este despertando a Zachary por la noche."

#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "End The Nightmare"
msgid "Any luck with that horror?"
msgstr "¿Ha habido suerte con ese horror?"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "End The Nightmare"
msgid ""
"Oh thank you!  Now I can finally get a nights sleep.  Here, I've got some "
"icons saved up, I want you to have them."
msgstr ""
"¡Oh, gracias! Ahora por fin podré dormir. Toma, tengo algunos iconos "
"ahorrados, quiero que los tengas."

#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "End The Nightmare"
msgid "I can still hear it, crying out in the night."
msgstr "Todavía puedo oírlo, gritando por la noche."

#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "End The Nightmare"
msgid "I'm not gonna go and fix this <freaking> mess."
msgstr "No voy a ir y reparar este <freaking> desastre."

#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Fungus Among Us"
msgstr "Hongos Entre Nosotros"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Fungus Among Us"
msgid "Purge the cultists in exchange for <reward_count:icon> icons."
msgstr "Elimina a los miembros de la secta a cambio de <reward_count:icon> iconos."

