#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_convert.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "The conversion is complete, here is your ammunition."
msgstr "La conversión ha finalizado, aquí tienes tu munición."

#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_convert.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Sorry, it isn't ready yet."
msgstr "Lo siento, aún no está listo."

#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_convert.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[Take your new ammo.] Thanks."
msgstr "[Llevar tu nueva munición.] Gracias."

#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Welcome to the first American bank of munitions.  We convert your goods and "
"services to the new gold standard."
msgstr ""
"Bienvenido al primer banco americano de municiones. Convertimos sus bienes y "
"servicios al nuevo patrón de oro."

#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_dialogue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "What's your deal?"
msgstr "¿Cuál es tu negocio?"

#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_dialogue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Munitions?"
msgstr "¿Municiones?"

#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_dialogue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid ""
"Hey.  Cody wanted to say that she's sorry.  She thought that you would want "
"to see this."
msgstr "Eh. Cody quería decirte que lo siente. Pensó que querrías ver esto."

#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_dialogue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'm interested in helping with that thing for Cody."
msgstr "Estoy interesado en ayudar con eso a Cody."

#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_dialogue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'd like to exchange some rounds."
msgstr "Me gustaría intercambiar algunas balas."

#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_dialogue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "How are my rounds coming?"
msgstr "¿Cómo van mis balas?"

#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_dialogue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'd like to convert some rounds."
msgstr "Me gustaría convertir algunos cartuchos."

#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_dialogue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Are you and Cody close?"
msgstr "¿Son tú y Cody cercanos?"

#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_dialogue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "How's the 'printing' thing going?"
msgstr "¿Cómo va lo de 'imprimir'?"

#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Next series of currency gotta be ready in around <interval>, fresh off the "
"print!"
msgstr ""
"La próxima serie de moneda debería estar lista en aproximadamente <interval>, "
"¡recién salidas de la impresora!"

#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_dialogue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'll make sure to take a look.  <end_talking_bye>"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Fuck yeah.  New currency is death and I'm dealing it."
msgstr "Sí, joder. La nueva moneda es muerte y la estoy repartiendo."

#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_dialogue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I understand, but how does this work exactly?"
msgstr "Lo entiendo, pero ¿cómo funciona exactamente?"

#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Pretty simple stuff, bud.  I barter in pre-shitshow ammo, and to stimulate "
"the growing economy, I print and issue more.  I take your goods - Cody would "
"call it labor - and exchange it for the new universal currency.  If you want "
"to convert currency I'm happy to facilitate, but it'll take a few days and "
"there is a service charge."
msgstr ""
"Es bastante simple, amigo. Hago trueques con munición de antes del desastre y "
"para estimular la creciente economía, fabrico y distribuyo más. Tomo tus "
"bienes - Cody los llamaría trabajo - y los cambio por la nueva moneda "
"universal. Si quieres convertir moneda, te lo facilito, pero tardaré unos "
"días y te cobraré por el servicio."

#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_dialogue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "So you're really going all in on this bank thing?"
msgstr "¿Así que realmente vas a ir a por todas en esto de los bancos?"

#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_dialogue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "So you'll exchange bullets for other bullets directly?"
msgstr "¿Así que cambiarás las balas por otras directamente?"

#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "I did a boring IT job and prepped for this shit.  Look at me now."
msgstr ""
"Trabajaba en un aburrido trabajo de informática y me preparaba para esta "
"mierda. Mírame ahora."

#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_dialogue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Look at you now."
msgstr "Mirate ahora."

#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"It's my house.  Cody's in the other building, if you've met her.  We dug a "
"trench and set up some milspec turrets.  I programmed them, Cody armored "
"them.  Now we're just trying to get by.  This ain't the wizard of Oz, you can "
"look behind the curtain over there."
msgstr ""
"Es mi casa. Cody está en el otro edificio, si la conoces. Cavamos una "
"trinchera e instalamos algunas torretas milspec. Yo las programé, Cody las "
"blindó. Ahora sólo tratamos de sobrevivir. Esto no es el mago de Oz, puedes "
"mirar detrás de la cortina de ahí."

#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_dialogue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Where'd you get half a dozen milspec turrets?"
msgstr "¿ De dónde has sacado media docena de torretas milspec?"

#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"*stares off into the distance.  \"The owners didn't need them anymore.  Not "
"anymore…\""
msgstr "*mira hacia el horizonte. \"Los dueños no las necesitaban más. Ya no…\""

#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Stuff is fucked all over, bud.  How about we stick to talking business?"
msgstr "Las cosas están jodidas, amigo. ¿Qué tal si nos ceñimos a hablar de negocios?"

#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Where did you… I- I don't know what to say.\"  Jay takes the rifle "
"reverently.  \"What did they do to this thing?  The receiver's all chopped "
"up!\"  He turns it over so carefully that you could mistake him for holding a "
"child instead of a gun.  \"This thing was beautiful.  Modern rails, ergonomic "
"furniture, recoil balancing system… At least it's all still here.  I know "
"Cody thinks that she did something wrong, but all I remember is being so "
"angry… just blindingly furious.  Then I was running.  When I woke up, "
"everything was fine.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Thank you for letting me see this, and for getting Cody and I talking.  If "
"you could help me out with something for Cody, I'll make this rifle right, "
"and hook you up with a casket mag and a box of the good ammo for it.  Stuff "
"from my reserves."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_dialogue.json
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_missions.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find the debug software"
msgid ""
"Alright, so Cody has talked about some cutting-edge tech she's seen "
"displayed.  This thing is called a nano-fabricator.  It's like a complicated, "
"robotic 3D printer.  Cody used to run with some hackers that steal IP, "
"schematics, that sort of thing.  I guess a problem they were running into was "
"the newest tech stuff is all encrypted as templates for these printers.  "
"Well, I know of a colleague who went home with debug software for the system. "
" You get that for her, and we're in business."
msgstr ""
"Muy bien, por lo que Cody ha hablado de alguna tecnología de vanguardia que "
"ha visto expuesta. Esta cosa se llama nano-fabricador. Es como una complicada "
"impresora 3D robótica. Cody solía trabajar con algunos hackers que roban IP, "
"esquemas, ese tipo de cosas. Supongo que un problema con el que se "
"encontraban era que el material tecnológico más nuevo está todo encriptado "
"como plantillas para estas impresoras. Bueno, sé de una colega que se fue a "
"casa con software de depuración para el sistema. Consíguele eso, y estamos en "
"el negocio."

#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_dialogue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'll see if I can find it."
msgstr "Veré si puedo encontrarlo."

#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_missions.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Find the gun"
msgstr "Encuentra el arma"

#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_missions.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Find the gun"
msgid ""
"Cody wants you to go to a gun show and find a rare gun that Jay wanted to "
"see.  It was an AK of some kind with a weird name… something like CARD or "
"CORE."
msgstr ""
"Cody quiere que vayas a una feria de armas y encuentres un arma rara que Jay "
"quería ver. Era un AK de algún tipo con un nombre raro... algo así como CARD "
"o CORE."

#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_missions.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find the gun"
msgid ""
"Before everything went to hell Jay was talking about going to some gun show.  "
"There was a guy there who had managed to sneak some Russian gun into the US.  "
"It was a massive deal for Jay, it was all he could talk about.  I know it's a "
"long shot but maybe that guy was already at the gun show?  If you find the "
"gun you can keep it, but it would mean a lot to Jay if he could take a look "
"all he wanted was to pull it apart and put it back together."
msgstr ""
"Antes de que todo se fuera al infierno Jay hablaba de ir a una feria de "
"armas. Había un tipo que había conseguido colar un arma rusa en los Estados "
"Unidos. Era un asunto enorme para Jay, era todo de lo que podía hablar. Sé "
"que es una posibilidad remota, pero tal vez ese tipo ya estaba en la feria de "
"armas. Si encuentras el arma puedes quedarte con ella, pero significaría "
"mucho para Jay si pudiera echar un vistazo, todo lo que quería era "
"desmontarla y volver a montarla."

#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_missions.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find the gun"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find the debug software"
msgid "Thanks.  I'll start working on an apology."
msgstr "Gracias. Empezaré a trabajar en una disculpa."

#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_missions.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/npc_vampiresacrifice_chat.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find the gun"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find the debug software"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Help me find my favorite book.  Apocalypse Now"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Help me find my favorite book.  Brave New
#. World."
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Help me find my favorite book.  Cat's Cradle."
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Help me find my favorite game.  Pathogen"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Help me find my favorite game.  Steam Gears"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Help me find my favorite game.  Terraforming
#. Mercury"
msgid "Let me know if you change your mind."
msgstr "Avísame si cambias de opinión."

#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_missions.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find the gun"
msgid ""
"I'd be careful there; Jay was saying they were bringing some new autonomous "
"hardware to the show.  You're looking for a Russian rifle that should be "
"modded to the moon.  CARD, CORE rifle, something like that."
msgstr ""
"Yo tendría cuidado ahí; Jay estaba diciendo que iban a traer algún nuevo "
"hardware autónomo a la feria. Estás buscando un rifle ruso que debe estar "
"modificado hasta la saciedad. CARD, CORE rifle, algo así."

#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_missions.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find the gun"
msgid ""
"Any luck finding that gun show?  I think it was a Russian gun, maybe a CARD "
"or CORE rifle?  Something like that."
msgstr ""
"¿Hubo suerte encontrando ese rifle? Creo que era un arma rusa, ¿tal vez un "
"rifle CARD o CORE? Algo parecido."

#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_missions.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find the gun"
msgid ""
"Thanks, darlin'.  If you could show it to Jay, that would mean a lot to me.  "
"If there's anything I could ever make for you as payment after that, just let "
"me know."
msgstr ""
"Gracias, cariño. Si pudieras enseñárselo a Jay, significaría mucho para mí. "
"Si hay algo que pueda hacer para ti como pago después de eso, sólo dímelo."

#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_missions.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find the gun"
msgid "That's great!  Make sure to show it to Jay."
msgstr "¡Eso es genial! Asegúrate de enseñárselo a Jay."

#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_missions.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find the gun"
msgid "Well you tried at least…"
msgstr "Bueno, al menos lo intentaste..."

#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_missions.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Find the debug software"
msgstr "Encuentra el software de depuración"

#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_missions.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Find the debug software"
msgid ""
"Jay wants you to go to someone's house and get some software that they had "
"taken home."
msgstr "Jay quiere que vayas a casa de alguien y te traigas un software."

#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_missions.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find the debug software"
msgid ""
"I'd be careful.  Guy was a bit of a nut, I don't know what he was planning to "
"do with that software."
msgstr ""
"Yo tendría cuidado. El tipo estaba un poco loco, no sé qué pensaba hacer con "
"ese programa."

#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_missions.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find the debug software"
msgid "Any luck finding that USB?"
msgstr "¿Hubo suerte encontrando ese USB?"

#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_missions.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find the debug software"
msgid "Thanks bud, I'll take it from here.  Take care of that rifle, now."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_missions.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find the debug software"
msgid "Shame.  Shame, shame."
msgstr "Qué lástima, una lástima."

#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_missions.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find the debug software"
msgid "Well fuck me then."
msgstr "Pues que me jodan entonces."

