#. general chitchat message
msgid ""
"While we chat, what say you we open a beer and just… pretend the world isn't "
"ending."
msgstr ""
"Mientras charlamos, ¿qué te parece si abrimos una cerveza y simplemente... "
"fingimos que el mundo no se esta acabando."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_booze>"
#. ~ Used when chit-chatting while the avatar has a beer; goes before a
#. general chitchat message
msgid "Yeah sure, want to crack open one of them beers?"
msgstr "Sí, claro, ¿quieres abrir una de esas cervezas?"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_booze>"
#. ~ Used when chit-chatting while the avatar has a beer; goes before a
#. general chitchat message
msgid ""
"Yeah you share those beers I see you hoarding and then we chat all you like!  "
"Only joking, heh."
msgstr ""
"Sí, comparte esas cervezas que veo que acumulas y luego charlamos todo lo que "
"quieras. Solo bromeaba, jeje."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_summer>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
msgid "Ah, summer… remember when it meant vacations?"
msgstr "Ah, el verano... ¿recuerdas cuando significaba vacaciones?"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_summer>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
msgid "Another sweltering summer day, ugh."
msgstr "Otro sofocante día de verano, ugh."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_summer>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
msgid "Can't wait for this summer to be over."
msgstr "No puedo esperar a que termine este verano."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_summer>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
msgid "Enjoying the summer."
msgstr "Disfrutando el verano."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_summer>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
msgid "Feels like the summer heat never lets up."
msgstr "Parece que el calor del verano no cesa."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_summer>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
msgid "Heatwave after heatwave, this summer is brutal."
msgstr "Ola de calor tras ola de calor, este verano es brutal."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_summer>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
msgid "Hotter than ever this summer, huh?"
msgstr "Más caliente que nunca este verano, ¿eh?"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_summer>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
msgid "Just trying to survive this summer heat."
msgstr "Sólo intento sobrevivir a este calor de verano."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_summer>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
msgid "Kinda wishing it would cool off a bit, to be honest."
msgstr "Deseando enfriarme un poquito, para ser honesto."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_summer>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
msgid "Nothing beats a cold drink in this summer heat."
msgstr "No hay nada mejor que una bebida fría con este calor de verano."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_summer>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
msgid "Not quite like the summers from before, huh?"
msgstr "No es como los veranos de antes, ¿eh?"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_summer>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
msgid "Summer days like these make me miss the old world."
msgstr "Días de verano como estos me hacen echar de menos el viejo mundo."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_summer>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
msgid "Summer evenings are the best, don't you think?"
msgstr "Las tardes de verano son las mejores, ¿no crees?"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_summer>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
msgid "Summer nights are getting shorter."
msgstr "Las noches de verano son cada vez más cortas."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_summer>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
msgid "Summer's here, time for some shade."
msgstr "El verano ya está aquí, es hora de un poco de sombra."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_summer>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
msgid "Summer's here, time for some sunburns."
msgstr "El verano ya está aquí, es hora de quemarse al sol."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_summer>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
msgid "These summer bugs are driving me nuts."
msgstr "Estos bichos de verano me están volviendo loco."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_summer>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
msgid "This summer air is thick enough to cut."
msgstr "El aire de este verano es tan espeso como para poder cortarlo."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_summer>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
msgid "This summer sun is relentless, isn't it?"
msgstr "Este sol de verano es implacable, ¿verdad?"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_summer>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
msgid "Yeah, this summer heat is hitting me hard, you know?"
msgstr "Sí, este calor de verano me está afectando mucho, ¿entiendes?"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_winter>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
msgid "Another day, another frostbite risk."
msgstr "Otro día, otro posible riesgo de congelación."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_winter>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
msgid "Can't wait for this winter to be over."
msgstr "No puedo esperar a que termine este invierno."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_winter>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
msgid "Cold enough to see your breath out here."
msgstr "Lo suficientemente frío como para ver tu aliento aquí fuera."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_winter>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
msgid "Everything's covered in ice."
msgstr "Todo está cubierto de hielo."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_winter>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
msgid "Frozen ground makes everything harder."
msgstr "El suelo helado lo hace todo más difícil."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_winter>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
msgid "Gotta say, I'm not minding the snow."
msgstr "Tengo de decirlo, no me preocupa la nieve."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_winter>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
msgid "I miss the cozy warmth of a fireplace in winter."
msgstr "Echo de menos el calor acogedor de una chimenea en invierno."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_winter>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
msgid "It's so cold, even the air hurts to breathe."
msgstr "Hace tanto frío que hasta duele respirar el aire."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_winter>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
msgid "It's weird the zombies don't freeze."
msgstr "Es raro que los zombis no se congelen."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_winter>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
msgid "Not quite like the winters from before, huh?"
msgstr "No es como los inviernos de antes, ¿eh?"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_winter>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
msgid "OK, maybe it'll stop me from freezing in this weather."
msgstr "Bien, tal vez evite que me congele con este tiempo."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_winter>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
msgid "Shivering is my new constant state."
msgstr "Los escalofríos son mi nuevo estado natural."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_winter>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
msgid "Snow everywhere, makes it hard to get around."
msgstr "La nieve por todas partes, hace que sea difícil moverse."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_winter>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
msgid "The cold is relentless this year."
msgstr "El frío no da tregua este año."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_winter>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
msgid "These short days and long nights are something else."
msgstr "Estos días cortos y las noches largas son otra cosa."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_winter>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
msgid "This winter chill cuts right through you."
msgstr "Este frío invernal te penetra por dentro."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_winter>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
msgid "Winter nights are the longest, aren't they?"
msgstr "Las noches de invierno son las más largas, ¿verdad?"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_winter>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
msgid "Winter's grip is tight this year."
msgstr "El invierno está apretando fuerte este año."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_winter>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
msgid "Winter's here, better bundle up."
msgstr "El invierno está aquí, mejor abrígate."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_winter>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
msgid "Winter winds are no joke."
msgstr "Los vientos invernales no son ninguna broma."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_infected>"
#. ~ A sentence about being sick to go before a more general chitchat message.
msgid "Alright, but I'm feeling a bit under the weather."
msgstr "Está bien, pero me siento un poco mal."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_infected>"
#. ~ A sentence about being sick to go before a more general chitchat message.
msgid "A nice chat might improve my health somewhat."
msgstr "Una buena charla podría mejorar mi salud de alguna forma."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_infected>"
#. ~ A sentence about being sick to go before a more general chitchat message.
msgid "Even sick, I could use some company."
msgstr "Incluso con enfermedad, me vendría bien algo de compañía."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_infected>"
#. ~ A sentence about being sick to go before a more general chitchat message.
msgid "Even with this bug, I'm still up for a conversation."
msgstr "Incluso con este bicho, sigo dispuesto a conversar."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_infected>"
#. ~ A sentence about being sick to go before a more general chitchat message.
msgid "Feeling kinda rough, but a conversation sounds good."
msgstr "Me siento un poco mal, pero una conversación suena bien."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_infected>"
#. ~ A sentence about being sick to go before a more general chitchat message.
msgid "Feeling like a zombie myself, but let's have a chat."
msgstr "Me siento como un zombi, pero charlemos."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_infected>"
#. ~ A sentence about being sick to go before a more general chitchat message.
msgid "I feel like death warmed over, but a chat might help."
msgstr "Me siento como un muerto calentito, pero una charla podría ayudar."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_infected>"
#. ~ A sentence about being sick to go before a more general chitchat message.
msgid "I'm a bit nauseous, but let's chat anyway."
msgstr "Tengo un poco de náuseas, pero charlemos de todos modos."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_infected>"
#. ~ A sentence about being sick to go before a more general chitchat message.
msgid "I might need to lie down soon, but let's chat first."
msgstr "Puede que necesite tumbarme pronto, pero charlemos primero."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_infected>"
#. ~ A sentence about being sick to go before a more general chitchat message.
msgid "I'm not feeling too well, but I can still talk for a bit."
msgstr "No me siento muy bien, pero todavía puedo hablar un poco."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_infected>"
#. ~ A sentence about being sick to go before a more general chitchat message.
msgid "I'm under the weather, but I'm up for a talk."
msgstr "No me siento bien, pero me apetece hablar."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_infected>"
#. ~ A sentence about being sick to go before a more general chitchat message.
msgid "I've been better, but I'm here to talk."
msgstr "He estado mejor, pero vine a hablar."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_infected>"
#. ~ A sentence about being sick to go before a more general chitchat message.
msgid "Let's talk, though I feel like I might keel over."
msgstr "Hablemos, aunque siento que me voy a desplomar."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_infected>"
#. ~ A sentence about being sick to go before a more general chitchat message.
msgid "Sick as a dog, but let's talk."
msgstr "Con enfermedad, pero hablemos."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_infected>"
#. ~ A sentence about being sick to go before a more general chitchat message.
msgid "Sure, but I'm battling a fever right now."
msgstr "Claro, pero ahora estoy con fiebre."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_infected>"
#. ~ A sentence about being sick to go before a more general chitchat message.
msgid "Sure, just know I might need to take a break if I start coughing."
msgstr "Claro, que sepas que podría necesitar un descanso si empiezo a toser."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_infected>"
#. ~ A sentence about being sick to go before a more general chitchat message.
msgid "Sure thing, but don't get too close—I might be contagious."
msgstr "Claro, pero no te acerques demasiado, podría ser contagioso."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_infected>"
#. ~ A sentence about being sick to go before a more general chitchat message.
msgid "Talking might help distract me from feeling like crap."
msgstr "Hablar podría ayudarme a distraerme de sentirme como una mierda."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_infected>"
#. ~ A sentence about being sick to go before a more general chitchat message.
msgid "We can talk, even though I'm not feeling too well."
msgstr "Podemos hablar, aunque no me siento muy bien."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_infected>"
#. ~ A sentence about being sick to go before a more general chitchat message.
msgid "Well, I'm feeling pretty sick… but sure."
msgstr "Bueno, me siento bastante mal... pero claro."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
msgid "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
msgstr "<thoughtfulchitchat>"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
msgid "Alright, you got something to get off your chest?"
msgstr "De acuerdo, ¿tienes algo que quieras sacarte del pecho?"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
msgid "Always ready for a good chat!  But why, you OK?"
msgstr "¡Siempre listo para una buena charla! Pero por qué, ¿estás bien?"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
msgid "Any new discoveries?"
msgstr "¿Algún nuevo descubrimiento?"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
msgid "Anything exciting happen to you lately?"
msgstr "¿Te ha pasado algo emocionante últimamente?"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
msgid "Anything you're looking forward to?"
msgstr "¿Algo que te haga ilusión?"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
msgid "Ever feel like there's still some good out there?"
msgstr "¿Alguna vez has sentido que aún queda algo lugar es buen estado por ahí?"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
msgid "Ever feel like we're living in a bad dream?"
msgstr "¿Alguna vez ha tenido la sensación de vivir en un mal sueño?"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
msgid "Ever wonder how we ended up here?"
msgstr "¿Te has preguntado alguna vez cómo hemos acabado aquí?"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
msgid "Fancy a chat?  I'm all ears."
msgstr "¿Te apetece charlar? Soy todo oídos."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
msgid "Feeling chatty?  I'm here for it."
msgstr "¿Te apetece charlar? Aquí estoy."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
msgid "Got any good news to share?"
msgstr "¿Tienes buenas noticias que compartir?"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
msgid "Got any good stories from the road?"
msgstr "¿Tienes alguna anécdota del camino?"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
msgid "Heard any good rumors?"
msgstr "¿Has oído algún rumor bueno?"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
msgid "Hey, <name_g>, what's been on your mind?"
msgstr "Eh, <name_g>, ¿en qué piensas?"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
msgid "How do you stay positive?"
msgstr "¿Cómo te mantienes positivo?"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
msgid "How's your day been so far?"
msgstr "¿Cómo te ha ido el día?"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
msgid "I feel great today.  Not sure what it is, just one of those days."
msgstr "Hoy me siento muy bien. No estoy seguro de lo que es, sólo uno de esos días."

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
msgid "I guess I can spare a few minutes, how's things?"
msgstr "  Supongo que puedo perder unos minutos, ¿cómo van las cosas?"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
msgid "I need a break anyway, how are you?"
msgstr "Necesito un descanso, ¿Cómo estas?"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
msgid "I'm OK with that, what's up?"
msgstr "Me parece perfecto, ¿qué pasa?"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
msgid "I'm game.  How you holding up?"
msgstr "Me apunto, ¿Cómo lo llevas?"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
msgid "I've been thinking a lot lately.  How about you?"
msgstr "He estado pensando mucho últimamente. ¿Y tú?"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
msgid "I've got a few minutes.  What's new with you?"
msgstr "Tengo unos minutos. ¿Qué novedades traes?"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
msgid "Let's catch up.  What's been happening?"
msgstr "Pongámonos al día. ¿Qué te ha pasado?"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
msgid "Let's chat about something light.  What's up?"
msgstr "Charlemos sobre cualquier cosa ligera. ¿Qué pasa?"

#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
