#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
#. ~ Name of an overmap land use code
msgid "Cropland"
msgstr "Tierras de cultivo"

#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
#. ~ Detailed definition of overmap land use code "Cropland"
msgid ""
"Generally tilled land used to grow row crops.  Boundaries follow the shape of "
"the fields and include associated buildings (e.g., barns).  This category "
"also includes turf farms that grow sod."
msgstr ""
"Generalmente, las tierras cultivadas se utilizan para producir cultivos en "
"hileras. Las fronteras siguen la forma de los campos e incluyen edificios "
"asociados (por ejemplo, graneros). En esta categoría se incluyen también las "
"granjas de césped que cultivan césped."

#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
#. ~ Name of an overmap land use code
msgid "Pasture"
msgstr "Pasto"

#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
#. ~ Detailed definition of overmap land use code "Pasture"
msgid ""
"Fields and associated facilities (barns and other outbuildings) used for "
"animal grazing and for the growing of grasses for hay."
msgstr ""
"Campos e instalaciones asociadas (graneros y otras dependencias) utilizados "
"para el pastoreo de animales y para el cultivo de hierbas para el heno."

#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
#. ~ Name of an overmap land use code
msgid "Forest"
msgstr "Bosque"

#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
#. ~ Detailed definition of overmap land use code "Forest"
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Areas where tree canopy covers at least 50% of the land.  Both coniferous and "
"deciduous forests belong to this class."
msgstr ""
"Áreas donde las copas de los árboles cubren al menos el 50% de la tierra. "
"Tanto los bosques de coníferas como los caducifolios pertenecen a esta clase."

#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
#. ~ Name of an overmap land use code
msgid "Non-Forested Wetland"
msgstr "Humedal no forestal"

#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
#. ~ Detailed definition of overmap land use code "Non-Forested Wetland"
msgid "DEP Wetlands (1:12,000) WETCODEs 4, 7, 8, 12, 23, 18, 20, and 21."
msgstr "DEP Wetlands (1:12,000) WETCODEs 4, 7, 8, 12, 23, 18, 20, and 21."

#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
#. ~ Name of an overmap land use code
msgid "Mining"
msgstr "Minando"

#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
#. ~ Detailed definition of overmap land use code "Mining"
msgid ""
"Includes sand and gravel pits, mines and quarries.  The boundaries extend to "
"the edges of the site's activities, including on-site machinery, parking "
"lots, roads and buildings."
msgstr ""
"Incluye arenas y gravas, minas y canteras. Los límites se extienden hasta los "
"bordes de las actividades del sitio, incluyendo la maquinaria del sitio, los "
"aparcamientos, los caminos y los edificios."

#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
#. ~ Name of an overmap land use code
msgid "Open Land"
msgstr "Tierra Abierta"

#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
#. ~ Detailed definition of overmap land use code "Open Land"
msgid ""
"Vacant land, idle agriculture, rock outcrops, and barren areas.  Vacant land "
"is not maintained for any evident purpose and it does not support large plant "
"growth."
msgstr ""
"Tierras baldías, agricultura ociosa, afloramientos rocosos y zonas áridas. "
"Las tierras baldías no se mantienen para ningún propósito evidente y no "
"soportan el crecimiento de grandes plantas."

#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
#. ~ Name of an overmap land use code
msgid "Participation Recreation"
msgstr "Participación Recreativa"

#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
#. ~ Detailed definition of overmap land use code "Participation Recreation"
msgid ""
"Facilities used by the public for active recreation.  Includes ball fields, "
"tennis courts, basketball courts, athletic tracks, ski areas, playgrounds, "
"and bike paths plus associated parking lots.  Primary and secondary school "
"recreational facilities are in this category, but university stadiums and "
"arenas are considered Spectator Recreation.  Recreation facilities not open "
"to the public such as those belonging to private residences are mostly "
"labeled with the associated residential land use class not participation "
"recreation.  However, some private facilities may also be mapped."
msgstr ""
"Instalaciones utilizadas por el público para la recreación activa. Incluye "
"campos de pelota, canchas de tenis, canchas de baloncesto, pistas de "
"atletismo, áreas de esquí, patios de juego y senderos para bicicletas, además "
"de los aparcamientos asociados. Las instalaciones recreativas de las escuelas "
"primarias y secundarias están en esta categoría, pero los estadios y arenas "
"de las universidades se consideran como Recreación de Espectadores. Las "
"instalaciones recreativas no abiertas al público, como las que pertenecen a "
"residencias privadas, se etiquetan en su mayoría con la clase de uso de la "
"tierra residencial asociada, no de recreación con participación. Sin embargo, "
"algunas instalaciones privadas también pueden ser objeto de un mapa."

#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
#. ~ Name of an overmap land use code
msgid "Spectator Recreation"
msgstr "Recreación del Espectador"

#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
#. ~ Detailed definition of overmap land use code "Spectator Recreation"
msgid ""
"University and professional stadiums designed for spectators as well as zoos, "
"amusement parks, drive-in theaters, fairgrounds, race tracks and associated "
"facilities and parking lots."
msgstr ""
"Estadios universitarios y profesionales diseñados para los espectadores, así "
"como zoológicos, parques de atracciones, autocines, recintos feriales, pistas "
"de carreras, instalaciones asociadas y aparcamientos."

#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
#. ~ Name of an overmap land use code
msgid "Water-Based Recreation"
msgstr "Recreación basada en el agua"

#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
#. ~ Detailed definition of overmap land use code "Water-Based Recreation"
msgid ""
"Swimming pools, water parks, developed freshwater and saltwater sandy beach "
"areas and associated parking lots.  Also included are scenic areas "
"overlooking lakes or other water bodies, which may or may not include access "
"to the water (such as a boat launch).  Water-based recreation facilities "
"related to universities are in this class.  Private pools owned by individual "
"residences are usually included in the Residential category.  Marinas are "
"separated into code 29."
msgstr ""
"Piscinas, parques acuáticos, áreas de playa de agua dulce y salada "
"desarrolladas y aparcamientos asociados. También se incluyen las zonas "
"escénicas con vistas a lagos u otras masas de agua, que pueden o no incluir "
"el acceso al agua (como una lancha). En esta clase se incluyen las "
"instalaciones recreativas acuáticas relacionadas con las universidades. Las "
"piscinas privadas propiedad de residencias individuales suelen incluirse en "
"la categoría Residencial. Las marinas se separan en el código 29."

#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
#. ~ Name of an overmap land use code
msgid "Multi-Family Residential"
msgstr "Residencia multifamiliar"

#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
#. ~ Detailed definition of overmap land use code "Multi-Family Residential"
msgid ""
"Duplexes (usually with two front doors, two entrance pathways, and sometimes "
"two driveways), apartment buildings, condominium complexes, including "
"buildings and maintained lawns.  Note: This category was difficult to assess "
"via photo interpretation, particularly in highly urban areas."
msgstr ""
"Dúplex (normalmente con dos puertas de entrada, dos vías de acceso y a veces "
"dos entradas), edificios de apartamentos, complejos de condominios, "
"incluyendo edificios y céspedes mantenidos. Nota: Esta categoría fue difícil "
"de evaluar a través de la fotointerpretación, particularmente en áreas "
"altamente urbanas."

#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
#. ~ Name of an overmap land use code
msgid "High Density Residential"
msgstr "Residencias de Alta Densidad"

#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
#. ~ Detailed definition of overmap land use code "High Density Residential"
msgid ""
"Housing on smaller than 1/4 acre lots.  See notes below for details on "
"Residential interpretation."
msgstr ""
"Viviendas en lotes de menos de un cuarto de acre. Vea las notas a "
"continuación para detalles sobre la interpretación residencial."

#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
#. ~ Name of an overmap land use code
msgid "Medium Density Residential"
msgstr "Residencia de Densidad Media"

#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
#. ~ Detailed definition of overmap land use code "Medium Density Residential"
msgid ""
"Housing on 1/4 - 1/2 acre lots.  See notes below for details on Residential "
"interpretation."
msgstr ""
"Viviendas en lotes de 1/4 - 1/2 acre. Vea las notas abajo para detalles sobre "
"la interpretación residencial."

#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
#. ~ Name of an overmap land use code
msgid "Low Density Residential"
msgstr "Residencias de baja densidad"

#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
#. ~ Detailed definition of overmap land use code "Low Density Residential"
msgid ""
"Housing on 1/2 - 1 acre lots.  See notes below for details on Residential "
"interpretation."
msgstr ""
"Viviendas en lotes de 1/2 - 1 acre. Vea las notas abajo para detalles sobre "
"la interpretación residencial."

#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
#. ~ Name of an overmap land use code
msgid "Saltwater Wetland"
msgstr "Humedal de agua salada"

#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
#. ~ Detailed definition of overmap land use code "Saltwater Wetland"
msgid "DEP Wetlands (1:12,000) WETCODEs 11 and 27."
msgstr "DEP Wetlands (1:12,000) WETCODEs 11 and 27."

#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
#. ~ Name of an overmap land use code
msgid "Commercial"
msgstr "Comercial"

#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
#. ~ Detailed definition of overmap land use code "Commercial"
msgid ""
"Malls, shopping centers and larger strip commercial areas, plus neighborhood "
"stores and medical offices (not hospitals).  Lawn and garden centers that do "
"not produce or grow the product are also considered commercial."
msgstr ""
"Centros comerciales y grandes áreas comerciales, además de tiendas de barrio "
"y consultorios médicos (no hospitales). Los centros de jardinería que no "
"producen o cultivan el producto también se consideran comerciales."

#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
#. ~ Name of an overmap land use code
msgid "Industrial"
msgstr "Industrial"

#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
#. ~ Detailed definition of overmap land use code "Industrial"
msgid "Light and heavy industry, including buildings, equipment and parking areas."
msgstr ""
"La industria ligera y pesada, incluyendo edificios, equipos y áreas de "
"estacionamiento. "

#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
#. ~ Name of an overmap land use code
msgid "Transitional"
msgstr "Transicional"

#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
#. ~ Detailed definition of overmap land use code "Transitional"
msgid ""
"Open areas in the process of being developed from one land use to another (if "
"the future land use is at all uncertain).  Formerly identified as Urban Open."
msgstr ""
"Áreas abiertas en proceso de desarrollo de un uso de la tierra a otro (si el "
"futuro uso de la tierra es del todo incierto). Anteriormente identificada "
"como Abierto Urbano."

#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
#. ~ Name of an overmap land use code
msgid "Transportation"
msgstr "Transportes"

#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
#. ~ Detailed definition of overmap land use code "Transportation"
msgid ""
"Airports (including landing strips, hangars, parking areas and related "
"facilities), railroads and rail stations, and divided highways (related "
"facilities would include rest areas, highway maintenance areas, storage "
"areas, and on/off ramps).  Also includes docks, warehouses, and related "
"land-based storage facilities, and terminal freight and storage facilities.  "
"Roads and bridges less than 200 feet in width that are the center of two "
"differing land use classes will have the land use classes meet at the center "
"line of the road (i.e., these roads/bridges themselves will not be separated "
"into this class)."
msgstr ""
"Aeropuertos (incluyendo pistas de aterrizaje, hangares, áreas de "
"estacionamiento e instalaciones relacionadas), ferrocarriles y estaciones de "
"ferrocarril, y carreteras divididas (las instalaciones relacionadas "
"incluirían áreas de descanso, áreas de mantenimiento de carreteras, áreas de "
"almacenamiento y rampas de entrada y salida). También incluye muelles, "
"almacenes e instalaciones de almacenamiento en tierra relacionadas, e "
"instalaciones de carga y almacenamiento en terminales. Las carreteras y "
"puentes de menos de 200 pies de ancho que son el centro de dos clases "
"diferentes de uso de la tierra tendrán las clases de uso de la tierra "
"reunidas en la línea central de la carretera (es decir, estas "
"carreteras/puentes en sí no se separarán en esta clase)."

#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
#. ~ Name of an overmap land use code
msgid "Waste Disposal"
msgstr "Eliminación de Residuos"

#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
#. ~ Detailed definition of overmap land use code "Waste Disposal"
msgid ""
"Landfills, dumps, and water and sewage treatment facilities such as pump "
"houses, and associated parking lots.  Capped landfills that have been "
"converted to other uses are coded with their present land use."
msgstr ""
"Basureros, vertederos e instalaciones de tratamiento de agua y de aguas "
"residuales como casas de bombas, y los aparcamientos asociados. Los "
"vertederos tapados que han sido convertidos para otros usos están codificados "
"con su uso actual de la tierra."

#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
#. ~ Detailed definition of overmap land use code "Water"
msgid "DEP Wetlands (1:12,000) WETCODEs 9 and 22."
msgstr "Humedales DEP (1:12.000) WETCODEs 9 y 22."

#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
#. ~ Name of an overmap land use code
msgid "Cranberry bog"
msgstr "Pantano de arándanos"

#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
#. ~ Detailed definition of overmap land use code "Cranberry bog"
msgid ""
"Both active and recently inactive cranberry bogs and the sandy areas adjacent "
"to the bogs that are used in the growing process.  Impervious features "
"associated with cranberry bogs such as parking lots and machinery are "
"included.  Modified from DEP Wetlands (1:12,000) WETCODE 5."
msgstr ""
"Los pantanos de arándanos activos y recientemente inactivos y las zonas "
"arenosas adyacentes a los pantanos que se utilizan en el proceso de cultivo. "
"Se incluyen las características impenetrables asociadas a los pantanos de "
"arándanos, como los aparcamientos y la maquinaria. Modificado de Humedales "
"DEP (1:12.000) WETCODE 5."

#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
#. ~ Name of an overmap land use code
msgid "Powerline/Utility"
msgstr "Línea eléctrica/utilidad"

#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
#. ~ Detailed definition of overmap land use code "Powerline/Utility"
msgid ""
"Powerline and other maintained public utility corridors and associated "
"facilities, including power plants and their parking areas."
msgstr ""
"Corredores de líneas de alta tensión y otros sistemas de servicios públicos "
"mantenidos e instalaciones asociadas, incluidas las instalaciones eléctricas "
"y sus zonas de aparcamiento."

#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
#. ~ Name of an overmap land use code
msgid "Saltwater Sandy Beach"
msgstr "Playa de Arena Salada"

#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
#. ~ Detailed definition of overmap land use code "Saltwater Sandy Beach"
msgid "DEP Wetlands (1:12,000) WETCODEs 1, 2, 3, 6, 10, 13, 17, and 19"
msgstr "DEP Wetlands (1:12,000) WETCODEs 1, 2, 3, 6, 10, 13, 17, and 19"

#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
#. ~ Name of an overmap land use code
msgid "Golf Course"
msgstr "Campo de Golf"

#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
#. ~ Detailed definition of overmap land use code "Golf Course"
msgid ""
"Includes the greenways, sand traps, water bodies within the course, "
"associated buildings and parking lots.  Large forest patches within the "
"course greater than 1 acre are classified as Forest (class 3).  Does not "
"include driving ranges or miniature golf courses."
msgstr ""
"Incluye las vías verdes, las trampas de arena, los cuerpos de agua dentro del "
"campo, los edificios asociados y los aparcamientos. Los grandes parches de "
"bosque dentro del curso de más de 1 acre se clasifican como Bosque (clase 3). "
"No incluye los campos de prácticas o los campos de minigolf."

#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
#. ~ Name of an overmap land use code
msgid "Marina"
msgstr "Marina"

#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
#. ~ Detailed definition of overmap land use code "Marina"
msgid "Include parking lots and associated facilities but not docks (in class 18)"
msgstr ""
"Incluir los aparcamientos y las instalaciones asociadas, pero no los muelles "
"(en la clase 18)"

#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
#. ~ Name of an overmap land use code
msgid "Urban Public/Institutional"
msgstr "Urbano Público/Institucional"

#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
#. ~ Detailed definition of overmap land use code "Urban Public/Institutional"
msgid ""
"Lands comprising schools, churches, colleges, hospitals, museums, prisons, "
"town halls or court houses, police and fire stations, including parking lots, "
"dormitories, and university housing.  Also may include public open green "
"spaces like town commons."
msgstr ""
"Tierras que comprenden escuelas, iglesias, colegios, hospitales, museos, "
"prisiones, ayuntamientos o juzgados, comisarías de policía y bomberos, "
"incluyendo aparcamientos, dormitorios y viviendas universitarias. También "
"puede incluir espacios verdes abiertos públicos como los parques de la ciudad."

#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
#. ~ Detailed definition of overmap land use code "Cemetery"
msgid ""
"Includes the gravestones, monuments, parking lots, road networks and "
"associated buildings."
msgstr ""
"Incluye las lápidas, monumentos, aparcamientos, redes de carreteras y "
"edificios asociados."

#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
#. ~ Name of an overmap land use code
msgid "Orchard"
msgstr "Huerto de árboles frutales"

#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
#. ~ Detailed definition of overmap land use code "Orchard"
msgid "Fruit farms and associated facilities."
msgstr "Granjas frutales e instalaciones asociadas."

#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
#. ~ Name of an overmap land use code
msgid "Nursery"
msgstr "Guardería"

#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
#. ~ Detailed definition of overmap land use code "Nursery"
msgid ""
"Greenhouses and associated buildings as well as any surrounding maintained "
"lawn.  Christmas tree (small conifer) farms are also classified as Nurseries."
msgstr ""
"Invernaderos y edificios asociados, así como cualquier césped mantenido "
"alrededor. Las granjas de árboles de Navidad (pequeñas coníferas) también se "
"clasifican como Guarderias."

#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
#. ~ Name of an overmap land use code
msgid "Forested Wetland"
msgstr "Humedal Forestal"

#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
#. ~ Detailed definition of overmap land use code "Forested Wetland"
msgid "DEP Wetlands (1:12,000) WETCODEs 14, 15, 16, 24, 25, and 26."
msgstr "DEP Humedales (1:12,000) WETCODEs 14, 15, 16, 24, 25 y 26."

#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
#. ~ Name of an overmap land use code
msgid "Very Low Density Residential"
msgstr "Residencial de Muy Baja Densidad"

#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
#. ~ Detailed definition of overmap land use code "Very Low Density
#. Residential"
msgid ""
"Housing on > 1 acre lots and very remote, rural housing.  See notes below for "
"details on Residential interpretation."
msgstr ""
"Viviendas en lotes de más de un acre y viviendas rurales muy remotas. Ver "
"notas más abajo para detalles sobre la interpretación Residencial."

#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
#. ~ Name of an overmap land use code
msgid "Junkyard"
msgstr "Basurero"

#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
#. ~ Detailed definition of overmap land use code "Junkyard"
msgid ""
"Includes the storage of car, metal, machinery and other debris as well as "
"associated buildings as a business."
msgstr ""
"Incluye el almacenamiento de coches, metales, maquinaria y otros escombros, "
"así como los edificios asociados como un negocio.Incluye el almacenamiento de "
"coches, metales, maquinaria y otros escombros, así como los edificios "
"asociados como un negocio."

#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
#. ~ Name of an overmap land use code
msgid "Brushland/Successional"
msgstr "Maleza/Sucesión"

#: data/json/overmap/overmap_land_use_codes.json
#. ~ Detailed definition of overmap land use code "Brushland/Successional"
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Predominantly (> 25%) shrub cover, and some immature trees not large or dense "
"enough to be classified as forest.  It also includes areas that are more "
"permanently shrubby, such as heath areas, wild blueberries or mountain laurel."
msgstr ""
"Predominantemente (> 25%) cubierta de arbustos, y algunos árboles inmaduros "
"no lo suficientemente grandes o densos para ser clasificados como bosque. "
"También incluye zonas que son más permanentemente arbustivas, como las zonas "
"de brezales, los arándanos silvestres o el laurel de montaña."

