#: data/json/proficiencies/athletics.json
#. ~ Proficiency name
msgid "Parkour Expert"
msgstr "Experto en Parkour"

#: data/json/proficiencies/athletics.json
#. ~ Description of proficiency "Parkour Expert"
msgid ""
"You're skilled at clearing obstacles; terrain like railings or counters are "
"as easy for you to move on as solid ground."
msgstr ""
"Tienes habilidad para esquivar obstáculos. El terreno, como las barandillas o "
"los mostradores, son tan faciles de moverte como el suelo firme."

#: data/json/proficiencies/athletics.json
#. ~ Proficiency name
msgid "Athlete's Form"
msgstr "Forma del Atleta"

#: data/json/proficiencies/athletics.json
#. ~ Description of proficiency "Athlete's Form"
msgid ""
"You've spent some time developing your general fitness.  When operating "
"muscle-powered vehicles, you know how to get more power out of each stroke."
msgstr ""
"Has dedicado algún tiempo a desarrollar tu forma física general. Cuando "
"manejas vehículos de propulsión muscular, sabes cómo sacar más potencia de "
"cada movimiento."

#: data/json/proficiencies/athletics.json
#. ~ Proficiency name
msgid "Athlete's Form (Expert)"
msgstr "Forma del Atleta (Experto)"

#: data/json/proficiencies/athletics.json
#. ~ Description of proficiency "Athlete's Form (Expert)"
msgid ""
"With considerable practice, you've honed your athletic fitness and form.  You "
"know how to get the most out of your effort, when manually powering a "
"muscle-driven vehicle."
msgstr ""
"Con una práctica considerable, has perfeccionado tu forma física y atlética. "
"Ya sabes cómo sacar el máximo partido a tu esfuerzo al propulsar manualmente "
"un vehículo de tracción muscular."

#: data/json/proficiencies/athletics.json
#. ~ Proficiency name
msgid "Athlete's Form (Master)"
msgstr "Forma del Atleta (Maestro)"

#: data/json/proficiencies/athletics.json
#. ~ Description of proficiency "Athlete's Form (Master)"
msgid ""
"You've honed your athletics to at least a professional level.  When it comes "
"to making vehicles move under your own power, your body is a well-oiled "
"machine."
msgstr ""
"Has perfeccionado tu atletismo al menos hasta un nivel profesional. Tu cuerpo "
"es una máquina bien engrasada cuando se trata de mover vehículos por tus "
"propios medios."

#: data/json/proficiencies/butchering.json
#. ~ Proficiency name
msgid "Principles of Butchering"
msgstr "Principios de Carnicería"

#: data/json/proficiencies/butchering.json
#. ~ Description of proficiency "Principles of Butchering"
msgid "You know how to pick up most of the meat from the animal body."
msgstr "Sabes cómo recoger la mayor parte de la carne del cuerpo del animal."

#: data/json/proficiencies/butchering.json
#. ~ Proficiency name
msgid "Butchering Expert"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/proficiencies/butchering.json
#. ~ Description of proficiency "Butchering Expert"
msgid "There is very little meat left after your skillful knife movements."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/proficiencies/butchering.json
#. ~ Proficiency name
msgid "Principles of Skinning"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/proficiencies/butchering.json
#. ~ Description of proficiency "Principles of Skinning"
msgid "You stopped making holes in the skin of animals you butcher."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/proficiencies/butchering.json
#. ~ Proficiency name
msgid "Skinning Expert"
msgstr "Experto en desollado"

#: data/json/proficiencies/butchering.json
#. ~ Description of proficiency "Skinning Expert"
msgid "You really know how to skin the animal."
msgstr "Realmente sabes cómo despellejar al animal."

#: data/json/proficiencies/chemistry.json
#. ~ Proficiency name
msgid "Principles of Chemistry"
msgstr "Principios de Química"

#: data/json/proficiencies/chemistry.json
#. ~ Description of proficiency "Principles of Chemistry"
msgid ""
"You are beginning to grasp a general idea of how elements and compounds react "
"with each other."
msgstr ""
"Empiezas a tener una idea general de cómo reaccionan los elementos y los "
"compuestos entre sí."

#: data/json/proficiencies/chemistry.json
#. ~ Proficiency name
msgid "Gross Anatomy"
msgstr "Anatomía General"

#: data/json/proficiencies/chemistry.json
#. ~ Description of proficiency "Gross Anatomy"
msgid ""
"You've identified the key organs within several creatures and their locations "
"with the goal of attacking them in combat."
msgstr ""
"Has identificado los órganos clave de varias criaturas y su ubicación con el "
"objetivo de atacarlos en combate."

#: data/json/proficiencies/chemistry.json
#. ~ Proficiency name
msgid "Principles of Biology"
msgstr "Principios de Biología"

#: data/json/proficiencies/chemistry.json
#. ~ Description of proficiency "Principles of Biology"
msgid ""
"You are beginning to gain a general idea of how various living beings "
"function."
msgstr ""
"Empiezas a hacerte una idea general de cómo funcionan los distintos seres "
"vivos."

#: data/json/proficiencies/chemistry.json
#. ~ Proficiency name
msgid "Organic Chemistry"
msgstr "Química Orgánica"

#: data/json/proficiencies/chemistry.json
#. ~ Description of proficiency "Organic Chemistry"
msgid ""
"Knowledge of the branch of chemistry that studies and uses carbon-containing "
"compounds."
msgstr ""
"Conocimiento de la rama de la química que estudia y utiliza los compuestos "
"que contienen carbono."

#: data/json/proficiencies/chemistry.json
#. ~ Proficiency name
msgid "Inorganic Chemistry"
msgstr "Química Inorgánica"

#: data/json/proficiencies/chemistry.json
#. ~ Description of proficiency "Inorganic Chemistry"
msgid ""
"Knowledge of the branch of chemistry that studies and uses compounds not "
"containing carbon."
msgstr ""
"Conocimiento de la rama de la química que estudia y utiliza los compuestos "
"que no contienen carbono."

#: data/json/proficiencies/chemistry.json
#. ~ Proficiency name
msgid "Mycology"
msgstr "Micología"

#: data/json/proficiencies/chemistry.json
#. ~ Description of proficiency "Mycology"
