#: data/json/recipes/practice/fabrication.json
#. ~ Description of practice "carving"
msgid "Practice carving different forms and shapes in a piece of wood."
msgstr "Practica la talla de diferentes formas y figuras en un trozo de madera."

#: data/json/recipes/practice/fabrication.json
#. ~ Practice name
msgid "basic carpentry"
msgstr "carpintería básica"

#: data/json/recipes/practice/fabrication.json
#. ~ Description of practice "basic carpentry"
msgid ""
"Practice basic carpentry by cutting, shaping and uniting some planks or "
"sticks with nails."
msgstr ""
"Practica la carpintería básica cortando, dando forma y uniendo algunos "
"tablones o palos con clavos."

#: data/json/recipes/practice/fabrication.json
#. ~ Practice name
msgid "welding (beginner)"
msgstr "soldadura (principiante)"

#: data/json/recipes/practice/fabrication.json
#. ~ Description of practice "welding (beginner)"
msgid ""
"Practice welding and separating some small metal sheets to one another in "
"some simple forms and designs."
msgstr ""
"Practicar la soldadura y la separación de algunas pequeñas chapas entre sí en "
"algunas formas y diseños sencillos."

#: data/json/recipes/practice/fabrication.json
#. ~ Practice name
msgid "welding (advanced)"
msgstr "soldadura (avanzado)"

#: data/json/recipes/practice/fabrication.json
#. ~ Description of practice "welding (advanced)"
msgid ""
"Practice welding, separating and giving form to some metal sheets in "
"intricate patterns and complicated designs."
msgstr ""
"Practicar la soldadura, separar y dar forma a algunas chapas metálicas en "
"patrones intrincados y diseños complicados."

#: data/json/recipes/practice/health.json
#. ~ Practice name
msgid "bandaging (beginner)"
msgstr "vendajes (principiante)"

#: data/json/recipes/practice/health.json
#. ~ Description of practice "bandaging (beginner)"
msgid ""
"Practice bandaging imaginary wounds while making sure your bandage won't fall "
"off during activities."
msgstr ""
"Practica vendando heridas imaginarias mientras te aseguras de que el vendaje "
"no se caerá durante las actividades."

#: data/json/recipes/practice/health.json
#. ~ Practice name
msgid "bandaging (advanced)"
msgstr "vendajes (avanzado)"

#: data/json/recipes/practice/health.json
#. ~ Description of practice "bandaging (advanced)"
msgid ""
"Practice bandaging different limbs and less accessible parts of your body "
"using both hands and each of your hands alone."
msgstr ""
"Practica el vendaje de diferentes extremidades y partes del cuerpo menos "
"accesibles utilizando ambas manos y cada una de ellas por separado."

#: data/json/recipes/practice/mechanics.json
#. ~ Practice name
msgid "basic mechanics - hydraulics"
msgstr "mecánica básica - hidráulica"

#: data/json/recipes/practice/mechanics.json
#. ~ Description of practice "basic mechanics - hydraulics"
msgid ""
"Practice basic mechanics by using a pre-Cataclysm edutainment set.  Learn "
"about hydraulics."
msgstr ""
"Practica mecánica básica con un juego de entretenimiento educativo antes del "
"Cataclismo. Aprende sobre hidráulica."

#: data/json/recipes/practice/mechanics.json
#. ~ Practice name
msgid "basic mechanics - robotics"
msgstr "mecánica básica - robótica"

#: data/json/recipes/practice/mechanics.json
#. ~ Description of practice "basic mechanics - robotics"
msgid ""
"Practice basic mechanics by using a pre-Cataclysm edutainment set.  Learn "
"about robots."
msgstr ""
"Practica mecánica básica con un juego de entretenimiento educativo de antes "
"del Cataclismo. Aprende sobre robots."

#: data/json/recipes/practice/mechanics.json
#. ~ Practice name
msgid "basic mechanics - engines"
msgstr "mecánica básica - motores"

#: data/json/recipes/practice/mechanics.json
#. ~ Description of practice "basic mechanics - engines"
msgid ""
"Practice basic mechanics by using a pre-Cataclysm edutainment set.  Learn "
"about engines."
msgstr ""
"Practica mecánica básica con un juego de entretenimiento educativo antes del "
"Cataclismo. Aprende sobre motores."

#: data/json/recipes/practice/melee.json
#. ~ Practice name
msgid "melee (beginner)"
msgstr "c. a c. (principiante)"

#: data/json/recipes/practice/melee.json
#. ~ Description of practice "melee (beginner)"
msgid ""
"Swing around a weapon-shaped object to try and get a feel for what fighting "
"might be like.  It's difficult without any instruction to guide you, but "
"hopefully this practice will help you to swing at your enemies without "
"falling on your face or panicking too much."
msgstr ""
"Mueves un objeto con forma de arma para intentar hacerte una idea de cómo es "
"el combate. Es difícil sin instrucciones que te guíen, pero con suerte esta "
"práctica te ayudará a golpear a tus enemigos sin caerte de bruces ni "
"asustarte demasiado."

#: data/json/recipes/practice/melee.json
#. ~ Practice name
msgid "melee (intermediate)"
msgstr "c. a c. (intermedio)"

#: data/json/recipes/practice/melee.json
#. ~ Description of practice "melee (intermediate)"
msgid ""
"Practice the basics of combat with the guidance of a manual or prior "
"knowledge.  Even without a sparring partner you can practice your footwork, "
"form, and flow drills to help avoid overswinging and stumbling."
msgstr ""
"Practica los fundamentos del combate con la ayuda de un manual o "
"conocimientos previos. Incluso sin un compañero de combate, puedes practicar "
"tu juego de pies, tu forma y ejercicios de fluidez que te ayudarán a evitar "
"golpes bruscos y tropiezos."

#: data/json/recipes/practice/melee.json
#: data/mods/innawood/recipes/practice/melee.json
#. ~ Practice name
msgid "cutting (beginner)"
msgstr "cortante (principiante)"

#: data/json/recipes/practice/melee.json
#. ~ Description of practice "cutting (beginner)"
msgid ""
"Practice some of the basics of combat with cutting weapons, such as how to "
"keep your edge lined up and how to not chop your own leg off."
msgstr ""
"Practica algunos de los aspectos básicos del combate con armas cortantes, "
"como mantener el filo orientado y cómo no cortarte tu propia pierna.rna."

#: data/json/recipes/practice/melee.json
#. ~ Practice name
msgid "cutting (intermediate)"
msgstr "cortante (intermedio)"

#: data/json/recipes/practice/melee.json
#. ~ Description of practice "cutting (intermediate)"
msgid ""
"Practice your edge alignment and cutting form by slashing soaked rolled-up "
"paper on a stand.  It's not quite tatami mats but you don't have the luxury "
"of historical accuracy."
msgstr ""
"Practica la orientación de tus cortes y la forma de cortar tajando papel "
"enrollado empapado en un soporte. No es exactamente un estera de tatami, pero "
"no puedes permitirte el lujo de la exactitud histórica."

#: data/json/recipes/practice/melee.json
#: data/mods/innawood/recipes/practice/melee.json
#. ~ Practice name
msgid "bashing (beginner)"
msgstr "contundente (principiante)"

#: data/json/recipes/practice/melee.json
#. ~ Description of practice "bashing (beginner)"
msgid ""
"Practice the basics of fighting with bludgeons, both purpose-made and "
"impromptu.  Learn how to apply your leverage, maximize kinetic energy, and to "
"swing for the fences without tearing your shoulder out of its socket."
msgstr ""
"Practica los fundamentos de la lucha con cachiporras, tanto improvisadas como "
"hechas a propósito. Aprende a hacer palanca, a maximizar la energía cinética "
"y a golpear sin romperte el hombro."

#: data/json/recipes/practice/melee.json
#. ~ Practice name
msgid "bashing (intermediate)"
msgstr "contundente (intermedio)"

#: data/json/recipes/practice/melee.json
#. ~ Description of practice "bashing (intermediate)"
msgid ""
"Practice the handling of very top-heavy and weighty bludgeons.  Learn how to "
"swing fast, accurately, with force, and without throwing yourself for a loop. "
" You'll need a reinforced training dummy to not break it into splinters with "
"such heavy weaponry, though."
msgstr ""
"Practica el manejo de porras muy pesadas. Aprende a blandir con rapidez, "
"precisión, fuerza y sin despeinarte. Aunque necesitarás un maniquí de "
"entrenamiento reforzado para no romperlo en astillas con un armamento tan "
"pesado."

#: data/json/recipes/practice/melee.json
#. ~ Practice name
msgid "dancing"
msgstr "bailar"

#: data/json/recipes/practice/melee.json
#. ~ Description of practice "dancing"
msgid "Practice some dancing moves with your imaginary partner."
msgstr "Practicas algunos movimientos de baile con tu pareja imaginaria."

#: data/json/recipes/practice/melee.json
#. ~ Practice name
msgid "dodge (beginner)"
msgstr "esquivar (principiante)"

#: data/json/recipes/practice/melee.json
#. ~ Description of practice "dodge (beginner)"
msgid ""
"Practice your dodging with some side hops, backsteps, and maybe a somersault "
"or two to learn why you shouldn't somersault in a fight.  Without someone "
"attacking you to actually dodge all you can practice is footwork, but "
"hopefully it'll help prevent you tripping over your shoelaces in a panic."
msgstr ""
"Practica tu esquiva con algunos saltos laterales, pasos atrás y tal vez un "
"salto mortal o dos para aprender por qué no debes dar saltos mortales en una "
"pelea. Sin alguien que te ataque, lo único que puedes practicar es el juego "
"de pies, pero espero que te ayude a no tropezar con los cordones de los "
"zapatos en un ataque de pánico."

#: data/json/recipes/practice/melee.json
#. ~ Practice name
msgid "unarmed (beginner)"
msgstr "desarmado (principiante)"

#: data/json/recipes/practice/melee.json
#. ~ Description of practice "unarmed (beginner)"
msgid ""
"Do a bit of shadowboxing as practice just in case you're left without a "
"weapon versus the undead.  There's not much you can learn without someone to "
"correct your mistakes, though."
msgstr ""
"Practica un poco de boxeo de sombra por si te quedas sin arma contra los "
"muertos vivientes. Aunque no hay mucho que puedas aprender sin alguien que "
"corrija tus errores."

#: data/json/recipes/practice/melee.json
#. ~ Practice name
msgid "unarmed (intermediate)"
msgstr "desarmado (intermedio)"

#: data/json/recipes/practice/melee.json
#. ~ Description of practice "unarmed (intermediate)"
msgid ""
"Learn how to throw a punch without breaking your wrist or kick without "
"falling over with the help of a punching bag or training dummy."
msgstr ""
"Aprende como lanzar un puñetazo sin romperte la muñeca o patear sin caerte "
"con la ayuda de una bolsa de boxeo o maniquí de entrenamiento."

#: data/json/recipes/practice/melee.json
#. ~ Practice name
msgid "long swords (beginner)"
msgstr "espadas largas (principiante)"

#: data/json/recipes/practice/melee.json
#. ~ Description of practice "long swords (beginner)"
msgid "Drill the fundamentals of using a longsword."
msgstr "Practica los fundamentos del uso de una espada larga."

#: data/json/recipes/practice/melee.json
#. ~ Practice name
msgid "long swords (intermediate)"
msgstr "espadas largas (intermedio)"

#: data/json/recipes/practice/melee.json
#. ~ Description of practice "long swords (intermediate)"
msgid "Hone your skills with a longsword against a dummy."
msgstr "Perfecciona tus habilidades con una espada larga contra un maniquí."

