"We went in.  We're going to try to fix it.  If someone finds this; we were "
"here.  We tried to make it right."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_alcohol_mild_awake"
msgid "You could use a drink."
msgstr "Te vendría bien una bebida."

#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_alcohol_mild_awake"
msgid "You're dying for a drink."
msgstr "Te estás muriendo por un trago."

#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_alcohol_mild_awake"
msgid "If only you had a beer…"
msgstr "Si tuvieras una cerveza..."

#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_alcohol_strong_awake"
msgid "Your hands start shaking… you need a drink bad!"
msgstr "Tus manos empiezan a temblar... ¡necesitas un trago!"

#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_alcohol_strong_awake"
msgid "You're really struggling with how long it's been since your last drink."
msgstr "Te cuesta saber cuánto tiempo ha pasado desde tu último trago."

#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_alcohol_strong_awake"
msgid "You're really dying for a drink now!"
msgstr "¡Ahora sí que te mueres por un trago!"

#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_alcohol_mild_asleep"
msgid "You dream of sitting at your favorite venue, enjoying a nice drink…"
msgstr "Sueñas con estar sentado en tu lugar favorito, disfrutando de un buen trago…"

#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_alcohol_mild_asleep"
msgid ""
"Talking to your friends for hours while having a couple drinks, just good "
"times, until you wake up alone and sober."
msgstr ""
"Hablar con tus amigos durante horas mientras te tomas un par de copas, sólo "
"buenos momentos, hasta que te despiertas solo y sobrio."

#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_alcohol_strong_asleep"
msgid ""
"You dream about searching an empty world for any kind of drink, for what "
"seems like ages.  At last, you find a strong beverage to appease your thirst, "
"only for it to be snatched away from you!"
msgstr ""
"Sueñas que buscas en un mundo vacío cualquier tipo de bebida, durante lo que "
"parecen siglos. Por fin, encuentras una bebida fuerte para calmar tu sed, "
"¡pero te la arrebatan!"

#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_alcohol_strong_asleep"
msgid ""
"Zombies crash through your bar setup at home, smashing the bottles and "
"spilling everything.  You fall to your knees in the wreckage and wait for the "
"end."
msgstr ""
"Los zombis destrozan el bar de tu casa, rompen las botellas y lo derraman "
"todo. Caes de rodillas entre los escombros y esperas el final."

#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_diazepam_mild_awake"
msgid "You could use some diazepam."
msgstr "Te vendría bien un poco de diazepam."

#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_diazepam_strong_awake"
msgid "You're shaking… you need some diazepam!"
msgstr "Estás temblando... ¡necesitas un poco de diazepam!"

#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_diazepam_mild_asleep"
msgid ""
"You dream that you reach into your pocket and pull out a bottle full of that "
"wonderful diazepam candy…"
msgstr ""
"Sueñas que metes la mano en el bolsillo y sacas una botella llena de "
"maravillosos caramelos de diazepam…"

#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_diazepam_mild_asleep"
msgid ""
"'A song plays in your dreams' ♪Lie still little bottle, and shake my shaky "
"hand.  Black coffee's not enough for me, I need a better friend♪."
msgstr ""
"'Una canción suena en tus sueños' ♪Quédate quieta botella pequeña, y dame tu "
"mano temblorosa.  El café negro no es suficiente para mi, Necesito un amigo "
"mejor♪."

#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_diazepam_strong_asleep"
msgid ""
"You dream about lying in an ocean of benzo boxes.  To your dismay, every "
"single box is empty…"
msgstr ""
"Sueñas que estás tumbado en un océano de cajas de benzo. Para tu "
"consternación, todas las cajas están vacías..."

#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_diazepam_strong_asleep"
msgid ""
"That calm that soaks into your bones from the outside in that benzos bring.  "
"You wake and there is none of that calm to find."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_coke_awake"
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_coke_asleep"
msgid "You feel like you need a bump."
msgstr "Sientes que necesitas un golpe."

#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_coke_awake"
msgid "What would you do for some coke, right now?"
msgstr "¿Qué harías por un poco de coca, ahora mismo?"

#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_crack_awake"
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_crack_asleep"
msgid "You're shivering, you need some crack."
msgstr "Sientes escalofríos, necesitas un poco de crack."

#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_coke_asleep"
msgid ""
"You should have a party with some cocaine, it's not like you have work "
"tomorrow."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_nicotine_mild_awake"
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_nicotine_mild_asleep"
msgid "You could use some nicotine."
msgstr "Te vendría bien un poco de nicotina."

#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_nicotine_strong_awake"
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_nicotine_strong_asleep"
msgid "You need some nicotine."
msgstr "Necesitas nicotina."

#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_nicotine_strong_awake"
msgid "You lick your lips as you think about lighting a cigarette."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_nicotine_mild_asleep"
msgid ""
"You dream of a long conversation with a dead relative, a cigarette in their "
"hand and smoke wafts through your brain."
msgstr ""
"Sueñas con una larga conversación con un familiar muerto, con un cigarrillo "
"en la mano y el humo recorriendo tu cerebro."

#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_nicotine_mild_asleep"
msgid ""
"In your dream you were standing around a campfire with a bunch of your now "
"dead friends, a cigarette between your lips.  The tobacco smell mixing in "
"with the wood smoke in the chill fall air."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_nicotine_strong_asleep"
msgid ""
"You dream of sex with an old flame, but the realest part of the dream is the "
"post coital cigarette."
msgstr ""
"Sueñas que haces el amor con un viejo fuego, aunque la parte mas realista del "
"sueño es el cigarrillo después del coito."

#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_nicotine_strong_asleep"
msgid ""
"You wake with the imagined taste of smoke in your mouth; how long has it been "
"since that was true?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_nicotine_strong_asleep"
msgid ""
"Standing on the edge of a building with a cigarette in your hand, a horde of "
"zombies milling below.  You take one last long drag and flick the butt out "
"over the zombies then step off the ledge.  Waking with a start you can almost "
"taste the smoke and tar in your mouth."
msgstr ""
"De pie en el borde saliente de un edificio, con un cigarrillo en la mano y "
"una horda de zombis pululando por debajo. Le das una última calada y tiras la "
"colilla por encima de los zombis. Al despertar, casi puedes saborear el humo "
"y el alquitrán en la boca."

#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_nicotine_strong_asleep"
msgid ""
"In your dream you brutally disanimate several zombies and then tear through "
"their clothing looking for any unsmoked cigarettes"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_opiate_mild_awake"
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_opiate_mild_asleep"
msgid "Your hands start shaking… you need some painkillers."
msgstr "Tus manos empiezan a temblar... necesitas algunos analgésicos."

#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_opiate_mild_awake"
msgid ""
"If you don't find some opiates soon you might start engaging in reckless "
"behavior, you think to yourself."
msgstr ""
"Si no encuentras pronto algún opiáceo podrías empezar a tener comportamientos "
"temerarios, te preguntas."

#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_opiate_mild_awake"
msgid ""
"You daydream of crushing pills and snorting them through a rolled up dollar "
"bill.  The drip in the back of your throat presaging a fun time."
msgstr ""
"Sueñas despierto con triturar pastillas y esnifarlas a través de un billete "
"de un dólar enrollado. El goteo en el fondo de tu garganta presagia un "
"momento divertido."

#: data/json/snippets/addiction.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "addict_opiate_mild_awake"
