msgid "SECURITY ADVISORY"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/dimensional_exploration.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "monitoring_equipment"
msgid ""
"\n"
"SECURITY ADVISORY\n"
"\n"
"When approaching or examining exotic material, ensure your 5-point-anchor "
"remains active at all times.  You might not feel any different, but it will "
"keep your insides from become physics during an unexpected resonance event."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"AVISO DE SEGURIDAD\n"
"\n"
"Cuando se acerque o examine material exótico, asegúrese de que su anclaje de "
"5 puntos permanece activo en todo momento. Puede que no sienta nada "
"diferente, pero evitará que sus interiores se vuelvan físicos durante un "
"evento de resonancia inesperado."

#: data/json/snippets/dimensional_exploration.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "monitoring_equipment"
msgid "scp complaint"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/dimensional_exploration.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "monitoring_equipment"
msgid ""
"Whoever decided to transcribe my lab reports into farcical entries of the "
"'SCP Foundation' and proceeded to distribute the edited reports across the "
"lab should be aware that: not only did I not find this 'joke' funny, but that "
"such actions are also considered to be in breach of your confidentiality "
"agreement.  A breach that I will see appropriately punished.\n"
"\n"
"------\n"
"Dr. Ethan Catherwood\n"
"Physics Department"
msgstr ""
"Quienquiera que haya decidido transcribir mis informes de laboratorio en "
"entradas absurdas de la \"Fundación SCP\" y haya procedido a distribuir los "
"informes editados por todo el laboratorio debe saber que: no sólo no me ha "
"hecho gracia esta \"broma\", sino que tales acciones se consideran una "
"violación de su acuerdo de confidencialidad. Un incumplimiento que veré "
"castigado adecuadamente.\n"
"\n"
"------\n"
"Dr. Ethan Catherwood\n"
"Departamento de Física"

#: data/json/snippets/dimensional_exploration.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "t-substrate"
msgid "ANALYSIS OF TRANSPLANAR MATERIALS: \"T-SUBSTRATE\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/dimensional_exploration.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "t-substrate"
msgid ""
"\n"
"ANALYSIS OF TRANSPLANAR MATERIALS\n"
"\n"
"T-SUBSTRATE\n"
"\n"
"SUMMARY:\n"
"The material henceforth named t-substrate is the naturally occurring 'floor' "
"material of phase-space.  Samples of t-substrate were first recovered during "
"IMMERSION-25A, when upon return to prime the samples violently █████████████, "
"exhibiting what are now known as 'plane-uneven' physical properties.  The "
"following report will examine such variances to the best extent of our "
"knowledge.\n"
"\n"
"Refer to file EXO-M-312 for full report."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"ANÁLISIS DE MATERIALES TRANSPLANARES\n"
"\n"
"SUBSTRATO-T\n"
"\n"
"RESUMEN:\n"
"El material que a partir de ahora se denominará sustrato t es el material "
"natural del \"suelo\" del espacio-fase. Las muestras de sustrato t se "
"recuperaron por primera vez durante la IMMERSION-25A, cuando al volver del "
"primario las muestras se volvieron violentamente █████████████, exhibiendo lo "
"que ahora se conoce como propiedades físicas \"desiguales de plano\". El "
"próximo informe examinará estas variaciones en la medida de nuestros "
"conocimientos.\n"
"\n"
"Consulte el archivo EXO-M-312 para ver el informe completo."

#: data/json/snippets/dimensional_exploration.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "HAADF_t-substrate"
msgid "ANALYSIS OF TRANSPLANAR MATERIALS: \"T-SUBSTRATE\", HAADF MICROGRAPH"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/dimensional_exploration.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "HAADF_t-substrate"
msgid ""
"\n"
"ANALYSIS OF TRANSPLANAR MATERIALS\n"
"\n"
"T-SUBSTRATE\n"
"\n"
"HAADF MICROGRAPH:\n"
"An atomic-scale photograph shows only a completely smooth red surface.  In "
"the lower left corner the phrase 'Not made of atoms?!' is scrawled with a "
"blue pen.\n"
"\n"
"Refer to file EXO-M-312 for full report."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"ANÁLISIS DE LOS MATERIALES EXTRAPLANABLES\n"
"\n"
"SUSTRATO-T\n"
"\n"
"MICROGRAFÍA HAADF:\n"
"Una fotografía a escala atómica muestra sólo una superficie roja "
"completamente lisa. En la esquina inferior izquierda la frase \"¿No está "
"hecho de átomos?\" está garabateada con un bolígrafo azul.\n"
"\n"
"Consulte el archivo EXO-M-312 para un informe completo."

