#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "mutant_meat_desc"
msgid ""
"Meat from a heavily mutated animal.  It has an unsettling loose and spongy "
"texture, but smells… mostly normal.  There are strange tangles and formations "
"in it that don't appear natural at all: bits of bone and hair crusted up "
"inside the muscle, as if trying to form another organism.  Still, it seems "
"digestible at least, if you cook it and remove the worst parts."
msgstr ""
"Carne de un animal fuertemente mutado. Tiene una inquietante textura suelta y "
"esponjosa, pero huele... mayormente normal. Hay extraños enredos y "
"formaciones en ella que no parecen naturales en absoluto: trozos de hueso y "
"pelo encostrados en el interior del músculo, como si se tratara de formar "
"otro organismo. Aún así, parece digerible al menos, si lo cocinas y quitas "
"las peores partes."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "mutant_meat_desc"
msgid ""
"Meat from a heavily mutated animal.  Although it came from muscle tissue, it "
"has a curious swirling grain pattern, and at the center of each grain is a "
"knot of hard, cartilaginous tissue.  It smells offputting."
msgstr ""
"Carne de un animal muy mutado. Aunque procede de tejido muscular, tiene un "
"curioso patrón de grano arremolinado, y en el centro de cada grano hay un "
"nudo de tejido duro y cartilaginoso. Tiene un olor desagradable."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "mutant_meat_desc"
msgid ""
"Meat from a heavily mutated animal.  This is from muscle, but in the fascial "
"tissue between the muscles, thick spiny hairs have grown.  Foul-smelling, "
"cream-colored fluid gushes out whenever a hair pulls loose."
msgstr ""
"Carne de un animal muy mutado. Esto es de un músculo, pero en el tejido "
"facial entre los músculos han crecido gruesos pelos espinosos. Un fluido "
"maloliente y de color crema sale a borbotones cada vez que se suelta un pelo."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "mutant_meat_desc"
msgid ""
"Meat from a heavily mutated animal.  Although this came from muscle, it has a "
"thick cordlike texture and smells like leather and bread mold."
msgstr ""
"Carne de un animal muy mutado. Aunque procede de un músculo, tiene una "
"textura espesa como un cordón y huele a cuero y a moho del pan."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_mutant_meat_desc"
msgid ""
"This is a cooked chunk of meat from a mutated animal.  It has an unsettling, "
"spongy texture, but otherwise tastes… mostly normal.  Hopefully you got all "
"the bits of hair and bone out…"
msgstr ""
"Este es un trozo de carne cocido de un animal mutado. Tiene una textura "
"esponjosa e inquietante, pero por lo demás tiene un sabor... casi normal. "
"Esperemos que hayas sacado todos los trozos de pelo y hueso..."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_mutant_meat_desc"
msgid ""
"This is a cooked chunk of meat from a mutated animal.  You thought you'd "
"cleared out all the gross parts, but while cooking, a fluid-filled sac inside "
"burst and covered it in some kind of thick grease."
msgstr ""
"Esto es un trozo de carne cocinada de un animal mutante. Pensabas que habías "
"limpiado todas las partes asquerosas, pero mientras se cocinaba, un saco "
"lleno de líquido en su interior se reventó y lo cubrió de una especie de "
"grasa espesa."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_mutant_meat_desc"
#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_tainted_mutant_meat_desc"
msgid ""
"This is a cooked chunk of meat from a mutated animal.  The surface is "
"peppered with divots from the pieces you had to dig out to make it seem "
"edible."
msgstr ""
"Esto es un trozo de carne cocida de un animal mutante. La superficie está "
"salpicada de muescas de los trozos que has tenido que extraer para que "
"parezca comestible."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_mutant_meat_desc"
#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_tainted_mutant_meat_desc"
msgid ""
"This is a cooked chunk of meat from a mutated animal.  Heat caused the "
"muscles to twist and move as if they were alive, and now it has writhed "
"itself into a dense knot."
msgstr ""
"Esto es un trozo de carne cocida de un animal mutado. El calor hizo que los "
"músculos se retorcieran y se movieran como si estuvieran vivos, y ahora se ha "
"retorcido hasta formar un denso nudo."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tainted_mutant_meat_desc"
msgid ""
"Poisonous meat from a heavily mutated animal.  It has an unsettling loose and "
"spongy texture and a putrid smell.  There are strange tangles and formations "
"in it that don't appear natural at all: bits of bone and hair crusted up "
"inside the muscle, as if trying to form another organism.  You'd have to be "
"truly desperate to try eating this."
msgstr ""
"Carne venenosa de un animal muy mutado. Tiene una inquietante textura suelta "
"y esponjosa y un olor pútrido. Tiene extraños enredos y formaciones que no "
"parecen naturales en absoluto: trozos de hueso y pelo encostrados dentro del "
"músculo, como si trataran de formar otro organismo. Hay que estar realmente "
"desesperado para intentar comer esto."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tainted_mutant_meat_desc"
msgid ""
"Poisonous meat from a heavily mutated animal.  Although it came from muscle "
"tissue, it has a curious swirling grain pattern, and at the center of each "
"grain is a knot of hard, cartilaginous tissue.  Its smell is nauseating."
msgstr ""
"Carne venenosa de un animal muy mutado. Aunque proviene de tejido muscular, "
"tiene un curioso patrón de granos arremolinados, y en el centro de cada grano "
"hay un nudo de tejido duro y cartilaginoso. Su olor es nauseabundo."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tainted_mutant_meat_desc"
msgid ""
"Poisonous meat from a heavily mutated animal.  This is from muscle, but in "
"the fascial tissue between the muscles, thick spiny hairs have grown.  "
"Foul-smelling, cream-colored fluid gushes out whenever a hair pulls loose."
msgstr ""
"Carne venenosa de un animal muy mutado. Es de músculo, pero en el tejido "
"fascial entre los músculos han crecido gruesos pelos espinosos. Un fluido "
"maloliente y de color crema sale a borbotones cada vez que se suelta un pelo."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "tainted_mutant_meat_desc"
msgid ""
"Poisonous meat from a heavily mutated animal.  Although this came from "
"muscle, it has a thick cordlike texture and smells like leather and bread "
"mold."
msgstr ""
"Carne venenosa de un animal muy mutado. Aunque procede de un músculo, tiene "
"una textura espesa como un cordón y huele a cuero y a moho del pan."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_tainted_mutant_meat_desc"
msgid ""
"This is a cooked chunk of meat from a mutated animal.  It has an unsettling, "
"spongy texture, but otherwise tastes… mostly normal.  Hopefully you won't "
"vomit while eating this…"
msgstr ""
"Este es un trozo de carne cocida de un animal mutado. Tiene una textura "
"esponjosa e inquietante, pero por lo demás tiene un sabor... casi normal. "
"Espero que no vomites mientras comes esto..."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_tainted_mutant_meat_desc"
msgid ""
"This is a cooked chunk of meat from a mutated animal.  You thought you'd "
"cleared out all the gross parts, but while cooking, a fluid-filled sac inside "
"burst and covered it in some kind of foul-smelling thick grease."
msgstr ""
"Esto es un trozo de carne cocida de un animal mutante. Pensabas que habías "
"limpiado todas las partes asquerosas, pero mientras se cocinaba, un saco "
"lleno de líquido en su interior se reventó y lo cubrió de una especie de "
"grasa espesa y maloliente."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "mutant_brain_desc"
msgid ""
"The brain of a heavily-mutated animal.  A thick net of interlocking veins "
"cocoons it, and the surface has a rainbow sheen like an oil slick.  When you "
"reach towards it, the whole thing starts shuddering and it comes loose from "
"the spinal cord, as if it's trying to escape."
msgstr ""
"Es el cerebro de un animal muy mutado. Lo cubre una red gruesa de venas "
"interconectadas y en la superficie tiene un brillo iridiscente como si fuera "
"aceitoso. Cuando te acercas, empieza a temblar y se suelta de la espina "
"dorsal como si estuviera intentando escapar."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "mutant_brain_desc"
msgid ""
"The brain of a heavily-mutated animal.  Shining white in color and brittle to "
"the touch like hard cheese, you can hardly believe it was a living organ "
"moments before.  On the base the pure whiteness is broken up by a huge, "
"spasming artery filled with yellow gunk."
msgstr ""
"Es el cerebro de un animal muy mutado. De un color blanco brillante y frágil "
"al tacto como un queso duro, apenas si podéis creer que hace poco era un "
"órgano vivo. En su base, el blanco puro está interrumpido por una arteria "
"enorme y con espasmos, llena de un residuo amarillo."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "mutant_brain_desc"
msgid ""
"The brain of a heavily-mutated animal.  Vestigial, still-twitching eyes are "
"strewn across its surface, each with a different-shaped pupil.  Hidden "
"between the hemispheres you find an embryonic copy of the creature's face, "
"eyes darting around in a mad spasm."
msgstr ""
"Es el cerebro de un animal muy mutado. Unos ojos residuales que todavía ser "
"retuercen están desparramados por su superficie, cada uno con una pupila de "
"diferente forma. Oculto entre los hemisferios encontráis una copia embriónica "
"de la cara de la criatura, con los ojos moviéndose a toda velocidad como en "
"un espasmo insano."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "mutant_brain_desc"
msgid ""
"Something, probably the brain, from a heavily-mutated animal.  The spinal "
"cord gives way to a chaotic tangle of loose neural fibers without any of "
"semblance of a solid anatomy, and the whole mess is visibly shrinking now "
"that you got it out of the creature's liquor."
msgstr ""
"Algo, probablemente el cerebro, de un animal muy mutado. La espina dorsal "
"muestra la maraña caótica de fibras neurales sueltas sin dar el aspecto de "
"haber sido una anatomía sólida, y todo eso se encoge ahora que lo sacaste del "
"jugo de la criatura."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_mutant_brain_desc"
msgid ""
"This is a piece of cooked brain from a mutated animal.  Whatever gave its "
"surface an oily sheen has coagulated into bluish clumps of goo settled into "
"the grooves.  You try to scrape them off, but they seem fused with the tissue "
"beneath."
msgstr ""
"Este es un pedazo cocinado de cerebro de un animal mutado. Sea lo que sea que "
"le da ese brillo aceitoso a su superficie, se coaguló formando viscosos "
"pedazos azules metidos en las ranuras. Tratas de sacarlos pero parecen "
"fusionados con el tejido."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_mutant_brain_desc"
msgid ""
"A piece of cooked brain from a heavily-mutated animal.  A circulatory vessel "
"at the base of it burst while cooking, slathering the whole thing in faintly "
"citrus-smelling yellow liquid.  While the smell is almost appetizing, the "
"faint taste of ammonia is anything but."
msgstr ""
"Es un pedazo cocinado de cerebro de un animal muy mutado. Un vaso sanguíneo "
"en su base se reventó cuando lo estabas cocinando, llenando todo de un "
"líquido amarillo de leve olor cítrico. Aunque el olor es casi apetecible, el "
"suave gusto a amoníaco es todo lo contrario."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_mutant_brain_desc"
msgid ""
"A piece of cooked brain from a heavily-mutated animal.  The eyes jutting out "
"of the surface have grown milky, and a good few of them fell off, each "
"revealing a small depression dominated by a short root of veins and nerve.  "
"Judging by the spongy texture, some remain buried in the deeper tissues."
msgstr ""
"Es un pedazo cocinado de cerebro de un animal muy mutado. Los ojos que "
"sobresalen de la superficie se han vuelto blanquecinos y varios de ellos se "
"cayeron, cada uno revelando un pequeño agujero dominado por una raíz corta de "
"venas y nervios. A juzgar por la textura esponjosa, algunos quedaron hundidos "
"en los tejidos más profundos."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_mutant_brain_desc"
msgid ""
"A cooked piece of what passes for a brain in some mutant animals.  The whole "
"thing came apart into a coarse jelly interspersed with hair-thin, branching "
"nerves that seem to move slightly.  The texture is horrible, but it tastes "
"better than starvation."
msgstr ""
"Es un pedazo cocinado por lo que vendría a ser el cerebro de algún animal "
"mutado. Todo se desarmó en una gelatina gruesa entremezclada con nervios "
"finos como pelo que parecen moverse levemente. La textura es horrible pero "
"tiene mejor sabor que la hambruna."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "mutant_lung_desc"
msgid ""
"A piece of lung you removed from a mutated animal.  Strange, transparent, "
"swaying tubes filled with a clear liquid emerge from the mostly-normal lung "
"tissue.  Some broke off during the butchery, and the escaped liquid coats "
"your tools, hardening on contact with the air like superglue."
msgstr ""
"Es un pedazo de pulmón que sacaste de un animal mutado. Unos tubos extraños, "
"transparentes y que todavía se mueven llenos de un líquido claro emergen del "
"tejido casi normal del pulmón. Algunos se rompieron durante el "
"descuartizamiento y el líquido que salió manchó tus herramientas, "
"endureciéndose al contacto con el aire como superpegamento."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "mutant_lung_desc"
msgid ""
"A piece of lung from a heavily-mutated animal.  Even after removing the "
"diaphragm, the tissue itself keeps rhythmically expanding and contracting, "
"sending a gurgling whine through the truncated windpipe with each breath.  It "
"takes far too long for it to grow still."
msgstr ""
"Es un pedazo de pulmón de una animal muy mutado. Incluso después de sacar el "
"diafragma, el tejido parece seguir expandiéndose y contrayéndose "
"rítmicamente, dejando escapar un quejido gorgoteante por la tráquea cortada. "
"Tarda mucho tiempo en quedarse completamente quieto."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "mutant_lung_desc"
msgid ""
"A piece of lung from a heavily-mutated animal.  The airways are broken up in "
"regular intervals by what resemble vocal cords, and whenever you push some "
"air through the tissue a cacophony of screams erupts from them."
msgstr ""
"Es un pedazo de pulmón de un animal muy mutado. Las vías respiratorias están "
"interrumpidas en intervalos regulares por lo que parecen cuerdas vocales, y "
"cuando empujas un poco de aire a través del tejido, una cacofonía de gritos "
"salen de ellas."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "mutant_lung_desc"
msgid ""
"A piece of lung from a heavily-mutated animal.  The whole thing is filled "
"with a foul-smelling, greenish foam bubbling from strange glands lining the "
"trachea, making you wonder how the creature could breathe at all.  It does "
"explain the attitude, at least."
msgstr ""
"Es un pedazo de pulmón de un animal muy mutado. Está todo lleno de una espuma "
"verdosa de olor nauseabundo que burbujea de una extrañas glándulas dentro de "
"la tráquea, lo que te hace preguntar cómo hacía la criatura para respirar. "
"Explica su actitud, eso sí."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "mutant_lung_desc"
msgid ""
"A piece of lung from a heavily-mutated animal.  The airways are lined with "
"rows of tiny, stone-hard barbs, each pointing towards the outside, as if they "
"were made to keep something out."
msgstr ""
"Es un pedazo de pulmón de un animal muy mutado. Las vías respiratorias están "
"llenas de filas de puntas pequeñas duras como piedras, cada una apuntando "
"hacia afuera como si estuvieran diseñadas para mantener algo afuera."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_mutant_lung_desc"
msgid ""
"A cooked piece of a mutant animal's lung.  With a lot of work you can cut "
"around the hardened shell of translucent gunk, but your only reward is "
"getting to the spongy, gray, mostly-flavorless mass of tissue beneath."
msgstr ""
"Un pedazo cocinado del pulmón de un animal mutado. Con mucho trabajo puedes "
"cortar alrededor del caparazón endurecido de mugre translúcida, pero tu "
"recompensa será conseguir una masa de tejido esponjoso, gris y casi sin sabor."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_mutant_lung_desc"
msgid ""
"A cooked piece of a mutant animal's lung.  The heat somehow made the tissue "
"swell up, with some alveoli bursting and collapsing on themselves.  The whole "
"thing turned to the consistency of cotton candy, but with a faint taste of "
"yeast replacing the sugary goodness."
msgstr ""
"Es un pedazo cocinado del pulmón de un animal mutante. El calor hizo que el "
"tejido se hinche, algunos alveolos explotaron y colapsaron. Ahora quedó con "
"la misma consistencia que el algodón de azúcar pero con un leve sabor a "
"levadura en lugar del azúcar."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_mutant_lung_desc"
msgid ""
"A cooked piece of a mutant animal's lung.  Deep within, the extraneous vocal "
"cords you didn't manage to remove turned to chewy morsels.  The taste is "
"almost good enough to make you forget the way they sounded while you were "
"cooking it."
msgstr ""
"Es un pedazo cocinado del pulmón de un animal mutante. Muy adentro de él, las "
"extrañas cuerdas vocales que no pudiste sacar se volvieron gomosos. El sabor "
"es casi tan bueno como para hacerte olvidar la manera en que sonaban mientras "
"lo estabas cocinando."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_mutant_lung_desc"
msgid ""
"A cooked piece of a mutant animal's lung.  The glands exuding the green foam "
"have solidified, and the foam itself seems to have evaporated without a "
"trace.  The smell is detestable, but the glands have a taste and consistency "
"remarkably like hardboiled egg yolk."
msgstr ""
"Es un pedazo cocinado del pulmón de un animal mutante. Las glándulas que "
"rezumaban una espuma verde están solidificadas y la espuma parece haberse "
"evaporado sin dejar rastro. El olor es detestable pero las glándulas tienen "
"el sabor y la consistencias muy parecido al huevo hervido."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "mutant_liver_desc"
msgid ""
"A chunk of liver from a mutated animal.  The surface is pockmarked by "
"hexagonal scar tissue, and some surprisingly active flatworms still seem to "
"cling to it.  About half of them seem to be in the process of being digested "
"by their meal, instead of the other way around."
msgstr ""
"Es un pedazo de hígado de un animal mutado. La superficie está lleno de "
"cicatrices hexagonales y algunos gusanos planos sorprendentemente activos "
"todavía parecen aferrarse a ella. Casi la mitad de ellos parecen estar en "
"proceso de ser digeridos por su carne, en lugar de ser al revés."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "mutant_liver_desc"
msgid ""
"A chunk of liver from a mutated animal.  Most of its volume is taken up by a "
"gigantic cyst filled with tiny, crab-like creatures.  Upon opening it the "
"contents spray to the ground, with the suddenly homeless inhabitants "
"scurrying for cover.  The rest of it looks relatively normal, if only in "
"comparison."
msgstr ""
"Es un pedazo de hígado de un animal mutado. La mayor parte de su volumen está "
"tomado por quiste gigantesco lleno de criaturas pequeñas similares a "
"cangrejos. Al abrirlo, el contenido sale despedido al suelo, y sus habitantes "
"sorprendidos sin hogar se escurren buscando refugio. El resto se ve "
"relativamente normal, por lo menos en comparación."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "mutant_liver_desc"
msgid ""
"A chunk of liver from a mutated animal.  The gall bladder has transformed "
"into a bundle of hair and skin, and what appeared to be brownish veins "
"originating from it turn out to be solitary, curled hairs crisscrossing "
"beneath the surface of the organ.  At least you can remove them with a gentle "
"pull on the central mass, but the whole liver collapses in a gelatinous heap "
"afterwards."
msgstr ""
"Es un pedazo de hígado de un animal mutado. La bilis de la vejiga se ha "
"transformado en un manojo de pelo y piel, y lo que parecen ser venas marrones "
"que salían de ella resultaron ser pelos enrulados entrecruzándose debajo de "
"la superficie del órgano. Por lo menos puedes sacarlos de la masa central con "
"un leve tirón, pero todo el hígado colapsa en una pila gelatinosa después de "
"eso."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "mutant_liver_desc"
msgid ""
"A chunk of liver from a mutated animal.  The surface is blackened and hard "
"but cracked, exposing a few strips of fresh pink tissue underneath.  After "
"cracking the shell fully open, the inner tissue begins swelling at an "
"alarming rate before turning gray and lifeless."
msgstr ""
"Un pedazo de hígado de un animal mutado. La superficie está ennegrecida y "
"dura pero rota, exponiendo unas pocas tiras de tejido rosa debajo. Después de "
"romper y dejarlo totalmente abierto, el tejido interno empieza a hincharse a "
"una velocidad alarmante antes de volverse gris y muerto."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_mutant_liver_desc"
msgid ""
"A cooked chunk of liver from a mutated animal.  Getting all the parasites - "
"if that's what they were - off was more effort than this meal is probably "
"worth, and the consistency suffered considerably from having to dig them out "
"from the depth of the organ."
msgstr ""
"Es un pedazo cocinado de hígado de un animal mutado. Sacarle todos los "
"parásitos - si es que son eso - te llevó más esfuerzo de lo que esta comida "
"probablemente valga, y la consistencia sufrió considerablemente por haberlos "
"sacado desde lo profundo del órgano."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_mutant_liver_desc"
msgid ""
"A cooked chunk of liver from a mutated animal.  Instead of the matte "
"gray-brown of a normal liver, this one turned disconcertingly orange after "
"heating it up, and finger-sized flakes detach themselves from it at the "
"slightest touch.  The taste reminds you of slightly overripe avocado, but "
"that's still better than you expected."
msgstr ""
"Un pedazo cocinado de hígado de un animal mutado. En lugar del color marrón "
"gris mate de un hígado normal, este se volvió desconcertantemente naranja "
"luego de calentarlo, y unos copos del tamaño de un dedo se sueltan al mínimo "
"toque. El sabor te hace acordar a un aguacate un poquito pasado de maduro, "
"pero eso es mejor de lo que esperabas."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_mutant_liver_desc"
msgid ""
"A cooked chunk of liver from a mutated animal.  The channels left by the "
"hairs you removed have filled with an oily black liquid, lending a "
"surprisingly nice look to the cut surface.  On biting into it the fluid "
"hardens unexpectedly, leaving you to chew much longer than you'd like to."
msgstr ""
"Es un pedazo cocinado de hígado de un animal mutado. Los canales que quedaron "
"de los pelos que sacaste se llenaron con un líquido aceitoso negro, dejando "
"una sorprendente apariencia agradable en la superficie. Cuando lo mordéis, el "
"líquido se endurece de manera inesperada, haciéndote masticar mucho más "
"tiempo de lo que esperabas."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_mutant_liver_desc"
msgid ""
"A cooked chunk of liver from a mutated animal.  The tissue split apart "
"following the veins before hardening, reminding you of a warped gray flower "
"with a sinuous vein for a stem.  Perhaps surprisingly, it tastes not entirely "
"unlike liver."
msgstr ""
"Un pedazo cocinado de hígado de un animal mutado. El tejido se partió por las "
"venas antes de endurecerse, recordándote una flor gris retorcida con una vena "
"sinuosa como tallo. Tal vez sorprendentemente, su sabor no es tan diferente "
"al de un hígado normal."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "mutant_heart_desc"
msgid ""
"A chunk of heart from a mutated animal.  Patches of hair and bits of bones "
"are present all over and inside it, making it resemble a giant teratoma.  "
"Despite this, it appears to have functioned as a heart."
msgstr ""
"Un trozo de corazón de un animal mutado. Presenta parches de pelo y trozos de "
"hueso por todas partes y en su interior, lo que lo asemeja a un teratoma "
"gigante. A pesar de ello, parece haber funcionado como un corazón."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "mutant_heart_desc"
msgid ""
"A chunk of heart from a mutated animal.  The ventricles are filled with "
"acidic fluids and bits of half-digested food, with the nearby veins and "
"arteries being lined with mucus.  Looking at this macabre fusion of the "
"circulatory and digestive systems, you wonder how such a thing could ever get "
"food to reach the heart without clogging the arteries."
msgstr ""
"Un trozo de corazón de un animal mutado. Los ventrículos están llenos de "
"fluidos ácidos y trozos de comida a medio digerir, y las venas y arterias "
"cercanas están recubiertas de mucosidad. Al contemplar esta macabra fusión de "
"los sistemas circulatorio y digestivo, uno se pregunta cómo es posible que "
"algo así consiga que la comida llegue al corazón sin obstruir las arterias."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "mutant_heart_desc"
msgid ""
"A chunk of heart from a mutated animal.  This cancerous, gangrenous mass of "
"flesh still beats, leaking out more of the foul fluids it used to push "
"through a body.  Beating isn't the only thing it continues to do, as you "
"witness what kept this heart beating: the gangrene eating the cancer as the "
"cancer grows back all over the gangrene, in a sickening ouroboros."
msgstr ""
"Un trozo de corazón de un animal mutado. Esta masa de carne cancerosa y "
"gangrenada sigue latiendo, goteando más de los fluidos asquerosos que solía "
"empujar a través de un cuerpo. Latir no es lo único que sigue haciendo, ya "
"que eres testigo de lo que hace que este corazón siga latiendo: la gangrena "
"se come al cáncer mientras el cáncer vuelve a crecer por toda la gangrena, en "
"un ouroboros enfermizo."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "mutant_heart_desc"
msgid ""
"A chunk of heart from a mutated animal.  Despite its stone-like exterior, its "
"inner flesh is much closer to mucus in all aspects.  Upon closer examination, "
"this heart appears vestigial, as the inner flesh turns out to be blood, "
"slowly moving on its own volition."
msgstr ""
"Un trozo de corazón de un animal mutado. A pesar de su exterior pétreo, su "
"carne interior es mucho más parecida al moco en todos los aspectos. Al "
"examinarlo más de cerca, este corazón parece vestigial, ya que la carne "
"interior resulta ser sangre, que se mueve lentamente por voluntad propia."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_mutant_heart_desc"
msgid ""
"A cooked chunk of heart from a mutated animal.  The removal of most fluid "
"pockets has made what remains of this heart resemble to a mass of tough "
"leather-like scraps, with a far fouler taste."
msgstr ""
"Un trozo de corazón cocinado de un animal mutado. La extracción de la mayoría "
"de las bolsas de fluido ha hecho que lo que queda de este corazón se parezca "
"a una masa de restos de cuero duro, con un sabor mucho más fétido."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_mutant_heart_desc"
msgid ""
"A cooked chunk of heart from a mutated animal.  The heat has turned this "
"heart white and mushy, with a taste and texture reminiscent of eating wet "
"ashes."
msgstr ""
"Un trozo de corazón cocinado de un animal mutado. El calor ha vuelto este "
"corazón blanco y blando, con un sabor y una textura que recuerdan a comer "
"cenizas húmedas."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_mutant_heart_desc"
msgid ""
"A cooked chunk of heart from a mutated animal.  It has partially melted as it "
"cooked, making it gelatinous yet sinewy, as if the taste and odor weren't "
"enough of a deterrent."
msgstr ""
"Un trozo de corazón cocinado de un animal mutado. Se ha derretido "
"parcialmente al cocinarse, haciéndolo gelatinoso y tendinoso, como si el "
"sabor y el olor no fueran suficiente disuasión."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_mutant_heart_desc"
msgid ""
"A cooked chunk of heart from a mutated animal.  Most of it has softened under "
"the heat, giving it a rubbery texture and a taste of cold grease, but the "
"core became akin to a meaty jawbreaker with an unsettling but not revolting "
"taste."
msgstr ""
"Un trozo de corazón cocinado de un animal mutado. La mayor parte se ha "
"ablandado con el calor, dándole una textura gomosa y un sabor a grasa fría, "
"pero el núcleo se convirtió en algo parecido a una carnosa mandíbula con un "
"sabor inquietante pero no repugnante."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "mutant_kidney_desc"
msgid ""
"A piece of kidney from a mutated animal.  While cutting into it your knife "
"slips, opening a large gash on its side from which tiny, beautiful pearls "
"roll out.  Before your eyes they start glistening with humidity and melt, "
"leaving no trace beyond a stinging stench."
msgstr ""
"Un pedazo de riñón de un animal mutado. Al cortarlo, tu cuchillo resbala "
"abriendo un gran tajo en un costado desde el cual unas pequeñas perlas "
"hermosas salen rodando. Ante tus ojos, comienzan a brillan de humedad y se "
"derriten sin dejar rastro además de un hedor punzante."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "mutant_kidney_desc"
msgid ""
"A piece of kidney from a mutated animal.  The tissue is broken up by pointy, "
"brittle crystals you need to carefully cut around, lest they embed in your "
"hand.  When you're done about half the meat is gone."
msgstr ""
"Es un pedazo de riñón de un animal mutado. El tejido está roto por unos "
"cristales puntiagudos y brillantes que tienes que esquivar cuidadosamente al "
"cortar para que no se te claven en la mano. Cuando terminas, la mitad de la "
"carne desapareció."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "mutant_kidney_desc"
msgid ""
"A piece of kidney from a mutated animal.  Most of the volume is taken up by "
"clear cysts filled with liquid, leaving you to pop them one by one to try and "
"salvage some usable tissue.  The result looks about as appetizing as it "
"sounds, but you suppose it's technically edible."
msgstr ""
"Es un pedazo de riñón de un animal mutado. La mayor parte de su volumen está "
"ocupada por unos quistes claros llenos de líquido, haciéndote reventarlos uno "
"por uno para intentar rescatar algo del tejido. El resultado parece tan "
"apetecible como suena pero supones que técnicamente es comestible."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "mutant_kidney_desc"
msgid ""
"A piece of kidney from a mutated animal.  Accessory kidneys bud off the "
"ureter in clumps, like red, slightly quivering grapes.  The main organ "
"continues the same fractal structure, fraying  into myriad tiny berries still "
"connected to a stem."
msgstr ""
"Un pedazo de riñón de un animal mutado. Unos riñones supernumerarios brotan "
"de la uretra en grupo como uvas rojas y vibrantes. El órgano principal "
"continúa la misma estructura fractal, deshilachándose en infinitas pequeñas "
"frutas todavía conectadas al tallo."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_mutant_kidney_desc"
msgid ""
"A cooked piece of kidney from a mutated animal.  Cooking it exposed myriad "
"tiny, glistening stones embedded into the tissue, making your teeth screech "
"with every bite despite your care not to crack your teeth.  It tastes sickly "
"sweet, and a stinging aftertaste lingers in your mouth for a long time."
msgstr ""
"Es un pedazo cocinado de riñón de un animal mutado. Al cocinarlo, quedaron "
"expuestos innumerables piedras pequeñas y brillantes metidas en el tejido, "
"haciendo que tus dientes rechinen con cada mordida a pesar de tu cuidado por "
"no romperte un diente. Tiene un sabor empalagosamente dulce y un resabio "
"punzante te queda un la boca por largo tiempo."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_mutant_kidney_desc"
msgid ""
"A cooked piece of kidney from a mutated animal.  Cooking loosened the tissue "
"enough for it to come apart from the lightest pull, while exposing long, "
"off-white strands that connect the different parts together."
msgstr ""
"Es un pedazo cocinado de riñón de un animal mutado. Al cocinarlo el tejido se "
"aflojó lo suficiente como para romperse al mínimo tirón, exponiendo unas "
"hebras largas y blancuzcas que conectan las diferentes partes."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_mutant_kidney_desc"
msgid ""
"A cooked piece of kidney from a mutated animal.  You swear it grew new cysts "
"while you were cooking it, each of which sports a different color.  You're "
"not sure you want to know how the dark blue one tastes."
msgstr ""
"Es un pedazo cocinado de riñón de un animal mutado. Juras que le han crecido "
"nuevos quistes mientras lo estabas cocinando, cada uno de diferente color. No "
"estás seguro de querer saber qué sabor tienen los que son azul oscuro."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "bug_organs_desc"
msgid ""
"These organs came from a giant mutant bug, and you really aren't sure what to "
"make of them.  There are things you've never seen in any anatomy book, with "
"spines and hair and other unidentified parts protruding seemingly at random."
msgstr ""
"Estos órganos proceden de un bicho mutante gigante, y realmente no estás "
"seguro de qué hacer con ellos. Hay cosas que nunca has visto en ningún libro "
"de anatomía, con espinas y pelos y otras partes no identificadas que "
"sobresalen aparentemente al azar."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "bug_organs_desc"
msgid ""
"These organs came from a giant mutant bug.  They have a sickly green color, "
"and one of them ripped when you were removing it, revealing an inner surface "
"that looks like row upon row of human fingers, nails and all."
msgstr ""
"Estos órganos proceden de un bicho mutante gigante. Tienen un color verde "
"enfermizo, y uno de ellos se desgarró cuando lo estabas quitando, revelando "
"una superficie interior que parece una fila y otra de dedos humanos, con uñas "
"y todo."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "bug_organs_desc"
msgid ""
"This is a huge, thick, fleshy sac you removed from a giant mutant bug.  The "
"surface is covered in smooth, soft skin, and beneath it is a coiled, twisted "
"mess of cordlike tissue."
msgstr ""
"Este es un enorme y grueso saco carnoso que extrajiste de un bicho mutante "
"gigante. La superficie está cubierta de piel suave y lisa, y debajo hay un "
"lío enrollado y retorcido de tejido similar a un cordón."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "bug_organs_desc"
msgid ""
"This is a long, corded organ you removed from a giant mutant bug.  It ran "
"from the head to the abdomen and has long tendrils coming off it, not unlike "
"a spinal cord."
msgstr ""
"Este es un órgano largo y con cuerdas que extrajistes de un bicho mutante "
"gigante. Va desde la cabeza hasta el abdomen y tiene largos tentáculos que "
"salen de él, no muy diferentes de una médula espinal."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "bug_organs_desc"
msgid ""
"This is a meaty gray organ you removed from a mutant.  It has a chalky yellow "
"coating that burns your skin, and several unidentifiable fleshy tubes "
"sticking out of it.  The smell it gives off stings your nostrils.  You're "
"pretty confident no natural creature has one of these."
msgstr ""
"Este es un órgano gris carnoso que has extraído de un mutante. Tiene una capa "
"amarilla calcárea que te quema la piel, y varios tubos carnosos "
"inidentificables que salen de él. El olor que desprende te escuece en las "
"fosas nasales. Estás seguro de que ninguna criatura natural tiene uno de "
"estos."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "bug_organs_desc"
msgid ""
"This organ meat, retrieved from a mutated creature, looks like a series of "
"small mammalian hearts arranged in series on a long fleshy tube.  At the end "
"of the chain is a large fleshy sac resembling a stomach."
msgstr ""
"Esta carne de órgano, obtenida de una criatura mutante, parece una serie de "
"pequeños corazones de mamífero dispuestos en serie en un largo tubo carnoso. "
"Al final de la cadena hay un gran saco carnoso que se parece a un estómago."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_bug_organs_desc"
msgid ""
"Some disturbing hairs have been burned off during cooking, but you still have "
"difficulty convincing yourself to eat them."
msgstr ""
"Algunos pelos molestos se han quemado durante la cocción, pero aún así te "
"cuesta convencerte de comerlos."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_bug_organs_desc"
msgid ""
"You have cooked a pile of *things* that used to be green, and it still looks "
"green under the light.  You think your face will turn that color after eating "
"them."
msgstr ""
"Has cocinado un montón de *cosas* que antes eran verdes, y todavía se ven "
"verdes bajo la luz. Crees que tu cara se volverá de ese color después de "
"comerlas."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_bug_organs_desc"
msgid ""
"It's cooked.  You can force yourself to believe that the cordlike tissue "
"inside is noodles with ketchup and Italian spices."
msgstr ""
"Está cocinado. Puedes forzarte a creer que el tejido fibroso del interior son "
"fideos con ketchup y especias italianas."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_bug_organs_desc"
msgid ""
"After you cooked it, you tore this long thing into small pieces.  Maybe this "
"can prevent it from reviving in your intestines."
msgstr ""
"Después de cocinarlo, rompiste esta cosa larga en trozos pequeños. Tal vez "
"esto pueda evitar que reviva en tus intestinos."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_bug_organs_desc"
msgid ""
"You're glad it didn't break your kitchen utensils.  Now you hope it won't "
"damage your digestive system."
msgstr ""
"Te alegras de que no haya roto tus utensilios de cocina. Ahora esperas que no "
"dañe tu sistema digestivo."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_bug_organs_desc"
msgid ""
"Looking at this pile of biological tissues with strange smell, you don't know "
"what kind of organs they belong to in medicine.  Of course, you're pretty "
"sure they're not boiled tomatoes."
msgstr ""
"Mirando este montón de tejidos biológicos con olor extraño, no sabes a qué "
"tipo de órganos pertenecen en medicina. Por supuesto, estás seguro de que no "
"son tomates hervidos."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "mutant_bug_lung_desc"
msgid ""
"You're pretty sure this is lung tissue.  It looks like a lung from a larger "
"mammal, like a dog, but instead of a few distinct lobes, it has dozens of "
"lobes arranged in sheets.  Strange spindles and gnarled tumescences dot the "
"surface."
msgstr ""
"Estás bastante seguro de que esto es tejido pulmonar. Parece un pulmón de un "
"mamífero más grande, como un perro, pero en lugar de unos pocos lóbulos "
"distintos, tiene docenas de lóbulos dispuestos en láminas. Extraños husos y "
"tumorcillos nudosos salpican la superficie."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "mutant_bug_lung_desc"
msgid ""
"You're pretty sure this is lung tissue.  It has a vaguely wing-like shape, "
"with a series of nodules around what would be the trailing edge of the "
"'wing'.  A cluster of quills in each corner of the organ held it to the bug's "
"carapace like clasps."
msgstr ""
"Estás bastante seguro de que esto es tejido pulmonar. Tiene una forma "
"vagamente parecida a un ala, con una serie de nódulos alrededor de lo que "
"sería el borde de salida del \"ala\". Un grupo de púas en cada esquina del "
"órgano lo sujetaba al caparazón del bicho como si fueran broches."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "chitin_desc"
msgid ""
"A piece of a bug's exoskeleton, but mutated.  The inner side is lined with "
"veins and strange, hooked protuberances."
msgstr ""
"Un trozo del exoesqueleto de un bicho, pero mutado. La cara interna está "
"recubierta de venas y extrañas protuberancias ganchudas."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "chitin_desc"
msgid ""
"A piece of a bug's exoskeleton.  Stringy lines of nervous tissue and blood "
"vessels still cling to the inner surface."
msgstr ""
"Un trozo del exoesqueleto de un insecto. Líneas fibrosas de tejido nervioso y "
"vasos sanguíneos todavía se aferran a la superficie interior."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "endochitin_desc"
msgid ""
"A piece of rigid, tube-shaped chitin from the inside of a giant bug.  It "
"seemed to be performing some kind of support role.  You're quite sure normal "
"insects don't have these."
msgstr ""
"Un trozo de quitina rígida, con forma de tubo, del interior de un bicho "
"gigante. Parecía estar realizando algún tipo de función de apoyo. Estás "
"bastante seguro de que los insectos normales no tienen esto."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "endochitin_desc"
msgid ""
"A long, flexible rod of chitin from inside a giant mutant bug.  It is laced "
"with blood vessels and chitinous nodules."
msgstr ""
"Una varilla larga y flexible de quitina del interior de un bicho mutante "
"gigante. Está repleta de vasos sanguíneos y nódulos quitinosos."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_chitin>"
msgid "As you peel away the outer shell, you find veins lining the chitin plates"
msgstr ""
"Al pelar la cáscara exterior, te encuentras las venas que recubren las placas "
"de quitina"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_chitin>"
msgid "With the creature dead, its carapace comes away surprisingly easily"
msgstr "Con la criatura muerta, su caparazón se desprende con sorprendente facilidad"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_chitin>"
msgid ""
"There's a thin membrane, much like skin, spread over the chitin of this "
"creature"
msgstr ""
"Hay una fina membrana, muy parecida a la piel, extendida sobre la quitina de "
"esta criatura"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_chitin>"
msgid "Under the carapace of this mutant is a bristly, velcro-like material"
msgstr "Bajo el caparazón de este mutante hay un material erizado, parecido al velcro"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_chitin>"
msgid ""
"The anatomy concealed beneath seems almost like a small mammal given a shell "
"and twisted into the shape of an arthropod"
msgstr ""
"La anatomía que se esconde debajo parece casi un pequeño mamífero al que se "
"le ha dado un caparazón y se ha retorcido en forma de artrópodo"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_chitin>"
msgid "You crack the beast open like a horrific lobster"
msgstr "Abres a la bestia como una horrible langosta"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_chitin>"
msgid ""
"The chitin holds tight to the creature, and you need to snap and tear it "
"away, sawing at tough fibers beneath"
msgstr ""
"La quitina se adhiere fuertemente a la criatura, y hay que romperla y "
"desgarrarla, aserrando las duras fibras que hay debajo"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_chitin>"
msgid ""
"The moment you start cutting into the corpse, a few of what you thought were "
"extra legs detach and scurry off into the undergrowth"
msgstr ""
"En el momento en que empiezas a cortar el cadáver, algunas de las que creías "
"que eran patas extra se desprenden y se escabullen entre la maleza"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_chitin>"
msgid ""
"For your first cut you connect the dozen openings on the creature's sides, "
"only to reveal a finger-sized wriggling grub in each"
msgstr ""
"Para tu primer corte conectas la docena de aberturas en los lados de la "
"criatura, sólo para revelar una larva del tamaño de un dedo en cada una"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_chitin>"
msgid ""
"Your work disturbs the parasites still clinging to the joints of the "
"creature, and a few size you up as a potential new home before scurrying away"
msgstr ""
"Tu trabajo molesta a los parásitos que aún se aferran a las articulaciones de "
"la criatura, y algunos te consideran como un posible nuevo hogar antes de huir"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_deeper>"
msgid ""
"Spaced evenly across the entire body you find small sacs of eggs in various "
"stages of growth"
msgstr ""
"Espaciados uniformemente por todo el cuerpo se encuentran pequeños sacos de "
"huevos en diferentes etapas de crecimiento"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_deeper>"
msgid ""
"Its intestines grew into a labyrinthine tangle, like so many worms devouring "
"each other"
msgstr ""
"Sus intestinos crecieron en una maraña laberíntica, como tantos gusanos "
"devorándose unos a otros"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_deeper>"
msgid ""
"Inside, half-formed organs press against spongy meat that doesn't look "
"anything like raw arthropod meat from normal creatures"
msgstr ""
"En el interior, los órganos a medio formar presionan contra una carne "
"esponjosa que no se parece en nada a la carne cruda de los artrópodos de las "
"criaturas normales"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_deeper>"
msgid ""
"Beneath, you find a collection of hooked spines that seem to have been "
"clasping it on somehow"
msgstr ""
"Debajo, se encuentra una colección de espinas enganchadas que parecen haber "
"sido sujetadas de alguna manera"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_deeper>"
msgid ""
"Inside is a complex, still-squirming mess of strange appendages and organs "
"that bear only a passing resemblance to any natural creature"
msgstr ""
"En tu interior hay un complejo y todavía retorcido lío de extraños apéndices "
"y órganos que sólo se parecen de pasada a cualquier criatura natural"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_deeper>"
msgid ""
"Beneath the chitin, the meat is covered in thick, bristly hair hiding a "
"chaotic bramble of half-formed, mutated organs"
msgstr ""
"Debajo de la quitina, la carne está cubierta de pelos gruesos y erizados que "
"esconden una caótica zarza de órganos mutantes a medio formar"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_deeper>"
msgid ""
"Inside is a tangled mess of organs and tissues that do not appear entirely "
"natural"
msgstr ""
"En tu interior hay una maraña de órganos y tejidos que no parecen del todo "
"naturales"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_deeper>"
msgid ""
"Inside the creature you find lungs, hearts, and intestines more like a mammal "
"than a giant bug"
msgstr ""
"En el interior de la criatura se encuentran pulmones, corazones e intestinos "
"más propios de un mamífero que de un bicho gigante"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_deeper>"
msgid ""
"Despite the apparent death of the whole, some organs still pump, beat, and "
"churn on undisturbed"
msgstr ""
"A pesar de la aparente muerte del conjunto, algunos órganos siguen bombeando, "
"latiendo y moviéndose sin ser manipulados"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_descriptive>"
msgid ""
"The meat inside gives off a horrifying stench, and seems to be covered in "
"thin damp hair, like a newborn animal gone horribly wrong"
msgstr ""
"La carne de tu interior desprende un hedor espantoso, y parece estar cubierta "
"de un fino pelo húmedo, como un animal recién nacido que ha salido "
"terriblemente mal"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_descriptive>"
msgid ""
"Small bundles of fiber break loose as you work, splitting open to reveal "
"twisted, half-formed copies of the creature itself"
msgstr ""
"Pequeños manojos de fibra se desprenden mientras trabajas, abriéndote para "
"revelar copias retorcidas y medio formadas de la propia criatura"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_descriptive>"
msgid "It is difficult to work as the spongey tissue tears apart under your tools"
msgstr ""
"Es difícil de trabajar, ya que el tejido esponjoso se desgarra bajo las "
"herramientas."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_descriptive>"
msgid ""
"Despite its outward appearance, both the organs and the endolymph of this "
"creature are pristinely white"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_descriptive>"
msgid ""
"Some of your cuts meet nerves, and the already stiff corpse shudders with "
"movement each time"
msgstr ""
"Algunos de tus cortes se encuentran con los nervios, y el ya rígido cadáver "
"se estremece con el movimiento cada vez"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_descriptive>"
msgid ""
"You follow what you think are superfluous veins into the deep, finding a "
"gorged, tick-like creature at their convergence"
msgstr ""
"Sigues lo que crees que son venas superfluas en las profundidades, "
"encontrando una criatura atiborrada de garrapatas en tu convergencia"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_descriptive>"
msgid ""
"Every cut reveals an organ you can't quite recognize, and you start to wonder "
"what your insides look like by now"
msgstr ""
"Cada corte revela un órgano que no puedes reconocer del todo, y empiezas a "
"preguntarte cómo son tus entrañas a estas alturas"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_descriptive>"
msgid ""
"You are dizzied by the rainbow coloration of the creature's muscles, clashing "
"with the bloody mess in its guts"
msgstr ""
"Te marea la coloración del arco iris de los músculos de la criatura, que "
"choca con el desorden sangriento en sus tripas"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_descriptive>"
msgid ""
"As you cut into its flesh you are disturbed by its sickly-sweet smell, like "
"fermenting fruit"
msgstr ""
"Al cortar su carne te molesta su olor enfermizo y dulce, como de fruta en "
"fermentación"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_descriptive>"
msgid ""
"There are fist-sized globs of nervous tissue dotted about its insides, "
"sending the corpse into a spasm every time you touch one"
msgstr ""
"Hay globos de tejido nervioso del tamaño de un puño repartidos por su "
"interior, que hacen que el cadáver sufra un espasmo cada vez que se toca uno"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_descriptive>"
msgid ""
"The muscles grow stiff, and begin leaking a dark gray liquid that pools "
"around your feet"
msgstr ""
"Los músculos se ponen rígidos y comienzan a gotear un líquido gris oscuro que "
"forma un charco a tus pies"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_centipede_chitin>"
msgid "Its legs contain no muscles, just sinews hanging in yellow-green ichor"
msgstr ""
"Sus piernas no tienen músculos, sólo tendones que cuelgan de un ichor "
"amarillo-verdoso."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_centipede_chitin>"
msgid "The legs fall off easily, leaving the main body looking like an armored worm"
msgstr ""
"Las patas se desprenden fácilmente, dejando el cuerpo principal con el "
"aspecto de un gusano acorazado"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_centipede_chitin>"
msgid ""
"Each pair of legs is slightly different.  These end in hooks, the next in "
"talons like a bird's, there's a pair of chitinous tentacles"
msgstr ""
"Cada par de patas es ligeramente diferente. Estas terminan en ganchos, las "
"siguientes en garras como las de un pájaro, hay un par de tentáculos "
"quitinosos"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_centipede_chitin>"
msgid ""
"The mandibles keep snapping, and acrid-smelling venom wets the soil.  You "
"decide to begin your work at its tail"
msgstr ""
"Las mandíbulas siguen chasqueando, y el veneno de olor acre moja el suelo. "
"Decides comenzar tu trabajo en su cola"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_centipede_chitin>"
msgid "You're startled as its antenna whips out and briefly coils around your arm"
msgstr ""
"Te sorprendes cuando su antena se extiende y se enrosca brevemente alrededor "
"de tu brazo"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_centipede_chitin>"
msgid ""
"Underneath the surface, there are small plates of chitin dotted about, much "
"harder than the rest"
msgstr ""
"Bajo la superficie, hay pequeñas placas de quitina con puntos, mucho más "
"duras que el resto"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_centipede_chitin>"
msgid ""
"On its tail end the segments get smaller and smaller, until they terminate in "
"a small copy of the head, looking backwards"
msgstr ""
"En su extremo de cola los segmentos se hacen cada vez más pequeños, hasta que "
"terminan en una pequeña copia de la cabeza, mirando hacia atrás"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_centipede_chitin>"
msgid "The chitin of the head is caked in old blood and lymph of its previous victims"
msgstr ""
"La quitina de la cabeza está empapada de sangre vieja y linfa de sus víctimas "
"anteriores"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_centipede_descriptive>"
msgid ""
"You find vacuoles filled with its venom in the most unexpected nooks, forcing "
"you to work carefully"
msgstr ""
"Encuentras vacuolas llenas de su veneno en los rincones más inesperados, lo "
"que te obliga a trabajar con cuidado"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_centipede_descriptive>"
msgid ""
"The indescribable stench of the remains of its last meal make you question "
"your decision to butcher it"
msgstr ""
"El indescriptible hedor de los restos de su última comida te hace cuestionar "
"tu decisión de descuartizarlo"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_centipede_descriptive>"
msgid ""
"On some organs you see the same swollen ulcers as around your own wounds.  It "
"seems not all of it is venom-proof"
msgstr ""
"En algunos órganos se ven las mismas úlceras hinchadas que alrededor de tus "
"propias heridas. Parece que no todo es a prueba de veneno"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_centipede_descriptive>"
msgid ""
"This one's very blood stinks like its venom, and even the slightest drop "
"makes your skin itch"
msgstr ""
"La propia sangre de éste apesta como su veneno, e incluso la más mínima gota "
"hace que te pique la piel"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_centipede_descriptive>"
msgid ""
"There is order to the chaos in this one.  Each segment's insides is a perfect "
"copy of the last, down to each sinew"
msgstr ""
"Hay orden en el caos en este caso. El interior de cada segmento es una copia "
"perfecta del anterior, hasta cada tendón"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_centipede_descriptive>"
msgid ""
"This one smells disturbingly appetizing, like a memory of a childhood meal "
"whose details you forgot"
msgstr ""
"Este huele inquietantemente apetecible, como el recuerdo de una comida de la "
"infancia cuyos detalles has olvidado"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_centipede_mom>"
msgid ""
"By the time you reach the rear of the matriarch, most of its offspring have "
"disappeared into the grass.  Some stuck around feeding on their unhatched "
"siblings, unwilling to give up the easy meal until the last moment"
msgstr ""
"Cuando llegas a la parte trasera de la matriarca, la mayoría de sus crías han "
"desaparecido en la hierba. Algunas se han quedado alimentándose de sus "
"hermanos no nacidos, sin querer renunciar a la comida fácil hasta el último "
"momento"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_centipede_mom>"
msgid ""
"The moment the matriarch grows still, the last third of its body flops to the "
"ground, letting go of dozens of eggs and small centipedes"
msgstr ""
"En el momento en que la matriarca se queda quieta, el último tercio de su "
"cuerpo cae al suelo, dejando escapar decenas de huevos y pequeños ciempiés"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_centipede_mom>"
msgid ""
"After cleaning away the rotten meat and mess of eggs shrouding the "
"matriarch's hind segments, you find its carapace chewed open, and much of its "
"flesh already eaten by its ever-hungry young"
msgstr ""
"Después de limpiar la carne podrida y el amasijo de huevos que cubren los "
"segmentos traseros de la matriarca, encuentras su caparazón abierto a "
"mordiscos, y gran parte de su carne ya devorada por sus siempre hambrientas "
"crías"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_centipede_mom>"
msgid ""
"As if they noticed the death of their mother, the dozens of centipedes still "
"clinging to it attack each other with a sudden frenzy.  You decide to give "
"them time to disperse before continuing"
msgstr ""
"Como si se hubieran dado cuenta de la muerte de su madre, las decenas de "
"ciempiés que aún se aferran a ella se atacan entre sí con un repentino "
"frenesí. Decides darles tiempo para que se dispersen antes de continuar"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_centipede_mega>"
msgid ""
"Since your tools barely have purchase on its carapace you decide to dig the "
"meat and viscera out from your first cut.  At times, you disappear up to your "
"waist in its armored insides"
msgstr ""
"Dado que tus herramientas apenas tienen compra en su caparazón, decides "
"desenterrar la carne y las vísceras de tu primer corte. A veces, desapareces "
"hasta la cintura en sus entrañas acorazadas"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_centipede_mega>"
msgid ""
"As you cut more and more meat away, some of the resilient chitin plates fall "
"away with a loud squelch"
msgstr ""
"A medida que se corta más y más carne, algunas de las resistentes placas de "
"quitina se desprenden con un fuerte chirrido"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_centipede_mega>"
msgid ""
"To bypass the armor you had to start your work by its mandibles, inches away "
"from its venom-coated fangs and the remains of chitin, bones, and strands of "
"Kevlar stuck between their points"
msgstr ""
"Para sortear la armadura había que empezar el trabajo por sus mandíbulas, cm "
"a cm desde sus colmillos recubiertos de veneno y los restos de quitina, "
"huesos y hebras de Kevlar pegados entre sus puntas"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_centipede_mega>"
msgid ""
"This feels more like scrapping a car than butchering an animal.  Instead of "
"veins and legs you find yourself thinking about joints, panels, and cabling"
msgstr ""
"Esto se parece más a desguazar un coche que a descuartizar un animal. En "
"lugar de venas y piernas, te encuentras pensando en juntas, paneles y cableado"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_centipede_mega>"
msgid ""
"On closer inspection, the head's armor is pocked by finger-sized holes with "
"jagged edges, reminiscent of the creature's fangs"
msgstr ""
"En una inspección más cercana, la armadura de la cabeza está llena de "
"agujeros del tamaño de un dedo con bordes dentados, que recuerdan a los "
"colmillos de la criatura"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_centipede_mega>"
msgid ""
"In a hidden organ without an obvious connection to the outside world, you "
"find a seemingly forgotten handful of glistening eggs"
msgstr ""
"En un órgano oculto sin conexión evidente con el mundo exterior, encuentras "
"un puñado aparentemente olvidado de huevos brillantes"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_ground_beetle_exterior>"
msgid ""
"When you sever the vestigial wings, a spurt of mud-thick fluid gushes up and "
"every leg twitches"
msgstr ""
"Cuando cortas las alas vestigiales, un chorro de líquido espeso como el barro "
"brota y todas las piernas se agitan"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_ground_beetle_exterior>"
msgid ""
"Prying off the elytra is easier than you thought it would be, but a thicker "
"duplicate lies beneath, melted into the veiny wings"
msgstr ""
"Arrancar los élitros es más fácil de lo que pensabas, pero debajo hay un "
"duplicado más grueso, fundido en las alas venosas"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_ground_beetle_exterior>"
msgid ""
"You hack off the legs, finding them surprisingly light once the knotted veins "
"within are drained"
msgstr ""
"Cortas las piernas, encontrándolas sorprendentemente ligeras una vez que las "
"venas anudadas dentro son drenadas"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_ground_beetle_exterior>"
msgid ""
"The thick chitin is difficult to saw through, and rooted so deeply in fat "
"that each panel you pull off comes with dangling ropes of sinew and grease"
msgstr ""
"La gruesa quitina es difícil de aserrar y está tan arraigada en la grasa que "
"cada panel que arrancas viene con cuerdas colgantes de tendones y grasa"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_ground_beetle_exterior>"
msgid ""
"Each leg bears too many hooks and outcrops to count, and they look far too "
"much like teeth for your liking"
msgstr ""
"Cada pata lleva demasiados ganchos y afloramientos para contarlos, y se "
"parecen demasiado a los dientes para tu gusto"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_ground_beetle_exterior>"
msgid ""
"The eyes are easily pulled loose, though with them spills out numerous coiled "
"ropes of nerve, sinew, and something halfway between"
msgstr ""
"Los ojos se desprenden fácilmente, aunque con ellos se derraman numerosas "
"cuerdas enrolladas de nervios, tendones y algo a medio camino de los "
"anteriores"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_ground_beetle_interior>"
msgid ""
"A lattice of glossy tubes still holds the mound of foamy fat and organs in "
"place after the abdomen falls apart"
msgstr ""
"Un entramado de tubos brillantes sigue manteniendo el montículo de grasa "
"espumosa y los órganos en su sitio después de que el abdomen se caiga"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_ground_beetle_interior>"
msgid ""
"The head is occupied entirely by organic hydraulics wrapped in muscle, and "
"you don't find tangled strands of brain tissue until the thorax"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_ground_beetle_interior>"
msgid ""
"A fist-sized organ next to the chain of hearts still subtly throbs, and you "
"find broken shards of chitin inside it after a swift hacking"
msgstr ""
"Un órgano del tamaño de un puño junto a la cadena de corazones sigue "
"palpitando sutilmente, y encuentras fragmentos rotos de quitina en su "
"interior tras un rápido hachazo"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_ground_beetle_interior>"
msgid ""
"You find a clutch of stillborn grubs inside, curled up in their parent's "
"fatty innards with eggshells nearby"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_ground_beetle_interior>"
msgid ""
"The reproductive organs of this beetle, sealed inside a chitin casket, have "
"coiled into a mockery of nature and bristle with half-developed eggs"
msgstr ""
"Los órganos reproductores de este escarabajo, sellados dentro de un ataúd de "
"quitina, se han enrollado en una burla de la naturaleza y se erizan con "
"huevos a medio desarrollar"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_ground_beetle_interior>"
msgid ""
"Something that looks like it belongs in an engine lies between the splayed "
"out lungs, and it sprays grease five paces when you puncture it"
msgstr ""
"Algo que parece pertenecer a un motor se encuentra entre los pulmones "
"extendidos, y rocía grasa a cinco pasos cuando lo pinchas"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_ground_beetle_mega>"
msgid ""
"A small landslide of flesh and gristle buries you to the waist at one point, "
"and you could swear something was slithering near your ankles"
msgstr ""
"Un pequeño desprendimiento de carne y cartílago te entierra hasta la cintura "
"en un momento dado, y podrías jurar que algo se desliza cerca de tus tobillos"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_ground_beetle_mega>"
msgid ""
"When you grab one particularly bristled organ, it writhes and nearly escapes "
"your grasp before you can smash it.  You find developing wings in the paste"
msgstr ""
"Cuando agarras un órgano especialmente erizado, se retuerce y casi se te "
"escapa antes de que puedas aplastarlo. Encuentras alas en desarrollo en la "
"pasta"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_ground_beetle_mega>"
msgid ""
"A much smaller second shell lies buried deep inside the beetle, an "
"entomological matryoshka that contains within itself… oh, fecal matter"
msgstr ""
"Un segundo caparazón mucho más pequeño yace enterrado en el interior del "
"escarabajo, una matrioska entomológica que contiene en su interior... oh, "
"materia fecal"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_ground_beetle_mega>"
msgid ""
"Chunks of meat, bone, and fabric inside one of the digestive tracts are still "
"easy to identify, and you wonder what their name was"
msgstr ""
"Trozos de carne, hueso y tela en el interior de uno de los tractos digestivos "
"siguen siendo fáciles de identificar, y uno se pregunta cuál era su nombre"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_ground_beetle_mega>"
msgid ""
"A bundle of gigantic wasp eggs is buried in the beast, but all are pierced "
"with wirey tubes draining nutrients and fluid from their fetal husks"
msgstr ""
"Un paquete de huevos de avispa gigantescos están enterrados en la bestia, "
"pero todos están perforados con tubos alámbricos que drenan nutrientes y "
"fluidos de sus cáscaras fetales"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_ground_beetle_mega>"
msgid ""
"You finish up, coming to grips with the fact that toxins suffuse every inch "
"of the truckload of meat you just pulled from this mutant beetle"
msgstr ""
"Terminas, asimilando el hecho de que las toxinas impregnan cada centímetro "
"del camión de carne que acabas de sacar de este escarabajo mutante"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_flying_chitin>"
msgid ""
"The wings of this creature break apart upon the slightest touch into myriad "
"identical rainbow crystals"
msgstr ""
"Las alas de esta criatura se rompen al menor toque en una miríada de "
"cristales de arco iris idénticos"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_flying_chitin>"
msgid "Even as the body grows still, the wings keep on beating slowly"
msgstr "Aunque el cuerpo se quede quieto, las alas siguen batiendo lentamente"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_flying_chitin>"
msgid "The chitin of this one is light and brittle, like an empty eggshell"
msgstr "La quitina de éste es ligera y frágil, como una cáscara de huevo vacía"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_flying_chitin>"
msgid ""
"Where you came to expect smooth chitin you find exposed flesh, shot with a "
"web of hardened strands"
msgstr ""
"Donde esperabas una quitina lisa, encuentras carne expuesta, disparada con "
"una red de hebras endurecidas"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_flying_chitin>"
msgid "You cough as you inhale the fine, colorful dust shedded from the wings"
msgstr "Toses al inhalar el fino y colorido polvo desprendido de las alas"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_flying_chitin>"
msgid ""
"The carapace of this one still feels hot to the touch, especially around the "
"wings"
msgstr ""
"El caparazón de este todavía se siente caliente al tacto, especialmente "
"alrededor de las alas"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_flying_chitin>"
msgid ""
"What you thought was shuddering chitinous fuzz on the creature's back is, in "
"reality, thousands of miniature copies of its main wings, flapping in unison"
msgstr ""
"Lo que creías que era una temblorosa pelusa quitinosa en la espalda de la "
"criatura es, en realidad, miles de copias en miniatura de sus alas "
"principales, batiendo al unísono"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_flying_deeper>"
msgid "The wings are held in place by stiff muscles, reaching into the deep"
msgstr ""
"Las alas se mantienen en su lugar por medio de músculos rígidos, llegando a "
"lo más profundo"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_flying_deeper>"
msgid ""
"Underneath the chitin you find bundles of small, floating pearls, each held "
"in place by a single strand of sinew"
msgstr ""
"Debajo de la quitina se encuentran manojos de pequeñas perlas flotantes, cada "
"una de ellas sujeta por una sola hebra de tendón"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_flying_deeper>"
msgid ""
"Near its wings you find a black, bubbling organ still periodically emitting a "
"bundle of floating bubbles"
msgstr ""
"Cerca de sus alas se encuentra un órgano negro y burbujeante que sigue "
"emitiendo periódicamente un haz de burbujas flotantes"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_flying_deeper>"
msgid ""
"As you open its intestines by mistake, you can barely pull your finger away "
"from the dozen snapping mandibles on its inside"
msgstr ""
"Al abrir sus intestinos por error, apenas puedes apartar el dedo de la docena "
"de mandíbulas que chasquean en su interior"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_flying_deeper>"
msgid ""
"The space not taken up by the now-familiar floating sacs is almost entirely "
"filled by a sticky, homogenous yellow jelly that seems to actively try to "
"avoid your knife"
msgstr ""
"El espacio que no está ocupado por los ya conocidos sacos flotantes está casi "
"totalmente ocupado por una gelatina amarilla pegajosa y homogénea que parece "
"tratar de evitar activamente tu cuchillo"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_flying_deeper>"
msgid ""
"The wings are rooted in its flesh by an almost transparent, fractal root "
"structure, making you question if it always belonged to the creature"
msgstr ""
"Las alas están arraigadas en su carne por una estructura de raíces casi "
"transparente y fractal, lo que hace que te preguntes si siempre perteneció a "
"la criatura"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_firefly>"
msgid "The light of its abdomen flickers with each cut, growing ever dimmer"
msgstr "La luz de su abdomen parpadea con cada corte, cada vez más tenue"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_firefly>"
msgid "An errant cut coats your tools with foul-smelling, glowing goop"
msgstr ""
"Un corte errante cubre tus herramientas con un pringue brillante de olor "
"nauseabundo."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_firefly>"
msgid ""
"What you saw as a homogenous light from a distance was the result of myriad "
"strands of glowing chitin crisscrossing just beneath the carapace"
msgstr ""
"Lo que veías como una luz homogénea desde la distancia era el resultado de "
"una miríada de hilos de quitina brillante que se entrecruzaban justo debajo "
"del caparazón"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_firefly>"
msgid ""
"This one's very flesh is glowing with a blinding intensity, lighting up your "
"gruesome work"
msgstr ""
"La propia carne de éste brilla con una intensidad cegadora, iluminando tu "
"horripilante trabajo"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_wasp_chitin>"
msgid ""
"Its chitin is sturdier than usual for the flying insects, and marked by the "
"struggles of its previous victims"
msgstr ""
"Su quitina es más resistente de lo habitual en los insectos voladores, y está "
"marcada por las luchas de sus anteriores víctimas"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_wasp_chitin>"
msgid ""
"The stripes on the back of its abdomen are warped into a nauseating spiral "
"you can't tear your eyes away from"
msgstr ""
"Las rayas de la parte posterior de su abdomen se deforman en una espiral "
"nauseabunda de la que no puedes apartar los ojos"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_wasp_chitin>"
msgid ""
"Upon closer inspection, the uniform black stripes reveal themselves to be "
"rows upon rows of glistening eyes"
msgstr ""
"Si se observan más de cerca, las rayas negras uniformes se revelan como filas "
"y filas de ojos brillantes"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_wasp_chitin>"
msgid ""
"With each cut, the stinger springs from its sheath, tip bending ever so "
"slightly towards your leg"
msgstr ""
"Con cada corte, el aguijón sale de su vaina, la punta se dobla ligeramente "
"hacia tu pierna"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_wasp_chitin>"
msgid ""
"The stripes -so uniform at a distance- reveal themselves to be jagged, "
"strangely familiar patterns, like the cursive of an unknown language"
msgstr ""
"Las rayas -tan uniformes a distancia- se revelan como patrones dentados, "
"extrañamente familiares, como la cursiva de un idioma desconocido"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_wasp_deeper>"
msgid ""
"The chaotic bundle of organs in its torso look much like those of other "
"mutated insects, but as you near the abdomen there's order to the madness: "
"comparatively neat rows of venom-filled glands, each feeding into a reservoir "
"at the base of the stinger"
msgstr ""
"El caótico conjunto de órganos de su torso se parece mucho a los de otros "
"insectos mutados, pero a medida que te acercas al abdomen hay un orden en la "
"locura: filas comparativamente ordenadas de glándulas llenas de veneno, cada "
"una de las cuales se alimenta de un depósito en la base del aguijón"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_wasp_deeper>"
msgid "You open a stomach, releasing a gush of sweet-smelling gray fluid"
msgstr "Abres un estómago, liberando un chorro de un fluido gris de olor dulce"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_wasp_deeper>"
msgid "For its apparent hunger for meat, its intestines seem almost atrophied"
msgstr "Para su aparente hambre de carne, sus intestinos parecen casi atrofiados"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_wasp_deeper>"
msgid ""
"Your knife reaches the retracted stinger and slips on its smooth surface, "
"opening half a dozen venom glands in the process.  You dearly hope that you "
"have not cut yourself"
msgstr ""
"Tu cuchillo alcanza el aguijón retraído y se desliza sobre su superficie "
"lisa, abriendo media docena de glándulas de veneno en el proceso. Esperas "
"sinceramente no haberte cortado"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_wasp_deeper>"
msgid ""
"You find a handful of dead grubs underneath its chitin, near a chewed-open "
"venom gland"
msgstr ""
"Encuentras un puñado de gusanos muertos debajo de su quitina, cerca de una "
"glándula de veneno masticada"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_wasp_queen>"
msgid ""
"Deep, deep within the dead queen you find a smooth, brightly colored plaque "
"the size of your fingernail, reading <number><number>"
msgstr ""
"Profundamente, en lo más profundo de la reina muerta se encuentra una placa "
"lisa y de colores brillantes del tamaño de la uña, en la que se lee "
"<number><number>"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_wasp_queen>"
msgid ""
"Some of the now-familiar venom glands also contain dozens of shiny white "
"eggs, undisturbed by their deadly surroundings"
msgstr ""
"Algunas de las ya conocidas glándulas venenosas también contienen docenas de "
"brillantes huevos blancos, imperturbables a su mortal entorno"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_wasp_queen>"
msgid ""
"As you cut into its abdomen you disturb a handful of normal-sized, wingless "
"wasps clinging to a strange, tubular organ.  They crawl a few steps before "
"falling lifelessly to the ground"
msgstr ""
"Al cortarle el abdomen, se ve un puñado de avispas de tamaño normal y sin "
"alas que se aferran a un extraño órgano tubular. Reptan unos pasos antes de "
"caer sin vida al suelo"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_wasp_queen>"
msgid ""
"Some of the egg clusters are ransacked by fat, white worms tunneling blindly "
"through its flesh"
msgstr ""
"Algunos de los racimos de huevos son saqueados por gusanos gordos y blancos "
"que hacen túneles a través de su carne"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_spider_chitin>"
msgid "The fangs spray a sickly green liquid to the ground when you touch them"
msgstr "Los colmillos rocían un líquido verde enfermizo al suelo cuando los tocas."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_spider_chitin>"
msgid "One of its eyes falls to the ground and shatters into a dozen jagged splinters"
msgstr "Uno de sus ojos cae al suelo y se rompe en una docena de astillas dentadas."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_spider_chitin>"
msgid ""
"The stiff hairs of its chitin seem to shift slightly, points reaching for "
"your skin"
msgstr ""
"Los pelos erizados de la quitina parecen moverse levemente, con las puntas "
"intentando alcanzar tu piel."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_spider_chitin>"
msgid ""
"Your first few cuts only succeed in peeling back the upper, hairy layer of "
"chitin, leaving a glassy green carapace"
msgstr ""
"Tus primeros cortes sólo logran arrancar la capa superior peluda de quitina, "
"dejando un caparazón verde vidrioso"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_spider_chitin>"
msgid ""
"You hit a hard, scarred spot with your tool and reveal a cross-section of "
"chitin with hundreds of stripes, like the rings of a tree"
msgstr ""
"Golpeas un punto duro y cicatrizado con tu herramienta y revelas una sección "
"transversal de quitina con cientos de rayas, como los anillos de un árbol."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_spider_deeper>"
msgid "The fangs are connected to fist-sized venom glands, still churning with life"
msgstr ""
"Los colmillos están conectados a glándulas venenosas del tamaño de un puño, "
"todavía agitadas con vida."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_spider_deeper>"
msgid ""
"The imposing mandibles give way to a surprisingly thin tube and atrophied "
"digestive track.  It must have done most of its digesting outside"
msgstr ""
"Las impresionantes mandíbulas ceden el paso a un tubo sorprendentemente fino "
"y atrofiado de tracto digestivo. Debe haber hecho la mayor parte de su "
"digestión fuera."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_spider_deeper>"
msgid ""
"A huge reddish lump reveals itself to be a sort of lung with a deflating "
"noise.  You're blasted with hot air and droplets of hemolymph"
msgstr ""
"Una enorme masa rojiza demuestra ser una especie de pulmón al hacer un ruido "
"de desinflado. Te llega una ráfaga de aire caliente y gotas de hemolinfa."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_spider_deeper>"
msgid ""
"Something not unlike a heart still spasms in the depth of the corpse, and the "
"legs twitch to its rhythm"
msgstr ""
"Algo parecido a un corazón sigue teniendo espasmos en el fondo del cadáver, y "
"las piernas se sacuden a su ritmo."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_acid_chitin>"
msgid "Steaming puddles of acid spill from its outer shell as you pull it back"
msgstr ""
"Charcos humeantes de ácido se derraman de su cáscara exterior cuando se tira "
"hacia atrás"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_acid_chitin>"
msgid "Steaming acid burbles from the creature's chitin as you peel it back"
msgstr "El ácido humeante brota de la quitina de la criatura cuando la pelas"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_acid_chitin>"
msgid ""
"Several acid glands rupture as you peel back the carapace, sending streams of "
"steaming caustic fluids spraying around"
msgstr ""
"Varias glándulas ácidas se rompen al pelar el caparazón, enviando chorros de "
"fluidos cáusticos humeantes rociando alrededor"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_acid_deeper>"
msgid ""
"The organs themselves have an acrid odor, but don't seem as caustically "
"acidic as the outer shell"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_acid_deeper>"
msgid ""
"You carefully avoid breaking through pockets of what you think may be "
"acid-secreting glands"
msgstr ""
"Evita cuidadosamente romper las bolsas de lo que cree que pueden ser "
"glándulas secretoras de ácido"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_acid_deeper>"
msgid ""
"Thick, ropey cords of tissue beneath its chitin protect an inner layer of "
"strange organs, resembling those of a bird more than anything"
msgstr ""
"Unas gruesas cuerdas de tejido bajo su quitina protegen una capa interna de "
"extraños órganos, que se parecen más a los de un pájaro que a cualquier otra "
"cosa."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_acid_descriptive>"
msgid "The powerfully acidic vapors coming from the carcass make it hard to work"
msgstr "Los vapores fuertemente ácidos que salen de la carcasa dificultan el trabajo"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_acid_descriptive>"
msgid ""
"The tissues of the creature are full of half-formed organs, their purpose "
"unclear"
msgstr ""
"Los tejidos de la criatura están llenos de órganos a medio formar, su "
"propósito no está claro"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_acid_descriptive>"
msgid ""
"Several times, you nearly burn yourself piercing a concealed gland full of "
"acid"
msgstr "Varias veces, casi te quemas perforando una glándula oculta llena de ácido"

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<incubator_mammal>"
msgid ""
"The skin is so riddled with wounds that you barely need to cut to pull it "
"away."
msgstr "La piel está tan plagada de heridas que apenas hay que cortar para arrancarla."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<incubator_mammal>"
msgid ""
"The poor creature has stopped breathing, but there's still a lot of movement "
"in the corpse."
msgstr ""
"La pobre criatura ha dejado de respirar, pero todavía hay mucho movimiento en "
"el cadáver."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<incubator_mammal>"
msgid ""
"The larvae seem to have taken care to leave enough intact not to kill their "
"host, but the rest is practically hollow."
msgstr ""
"Las larvas parecen haber tenido cuidado de dejar lo suficiente intacto su "
"huésped para no matarlo, pero el resto está prácticamente vacío."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<incubator_mammal>"
msgid ""
"You have to pause often to stomp on the slower grubs, who only now realized "
"that their home is growing cold."
msgstr ""
"Hay que detenerse a menudo para pisar a los gusanos más lentos, que sólo "
"ahora se han dado cuenta de que su hogar se está enfriando."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<incubator_mammal>"
msgid ""
"Its stomach is full of grubs even more malformed than the rest.  The runt of "
"the litter got recycled, it seems."
msgstr ""
"Su estómago está lleno de larvas aún más malformadas que el resto. El más "
"pequeño de la camada fue reciclado, parece."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<incubator_mammal>"
msgid ""
"In the beginning you take care to separate parasite and host, but after a "
"while you give up and start cutting through."
msgstr ""
"Al principio te cuidaste de separar parásito y huésped, pero al cabo de un "
"tiempo se abandona y se empieza a cortar."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_amalgamation_outer>"
msgid ""
"The skin comes off with a sickening snap, and reveals a billion tiny black "
"tendrils grasping after it"
msgstr ""
"La piel se desprende con un asqueante chasquido, y revela mil millones de "
"diminutos zarcillos negros aferrándose a ella."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_amalgamation_outer>"
msgid ""
"What you thought were black veins under the skin are actually some sort of "
"elastic net, snapping apart with a loud \"TWANG\" when your tool cuts them"
msgstr ""
"Lo que creías que eran venas negras bajo la piel son en realidad una especie "
"de red elástica que se rompe con un sonoro «TANG» cuando tu herramienta las "
"corta."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_amalgamation_outer>"
msgid ""
"This one's skin consists of dozens of layers, each of slightly different "
"color, sandwiched between a gelatinous mass"
msgstr ""
"La piel de éste consiste en docenas de capas, cada una de un color "
"ligeramente diferente, intercaladas entre una masa gelatinosa..."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_amalgamation_outer>"
msgid ""
"With every cut the creature shifts slightly, splayed limbs inching closer to "
"how it looked when it was…alive?  Whatever the right word is you hope it "
"stopped, if only for now"
msgstr ""
"Con cada corte, la criatura se desplaza ligeramente, sus extremidades "
"extendidas se acercan cada vez más al aspecto que tenía cuando estaba... "
"¿viva? Cualquiera que sea la palabra correcta, esperas que se haya detenido, "
"aunque sólo sea por ahora."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_amalgamation_outer>"
msgid ""
"Whatever this is, it doesn't look dead so much as staying still.  You still "
"feel like it's looking at you, even as you cut it apart"
msgstr ""
"Sea lo que sea, no parece tan muerto como si se estuviera quieto. Todavía "
"sientes que te está mirando, incluso cuando lo cortas en pedazos..."

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_amalgamation_inner>"
msgid "The white flesh keeps quivering, grasping and pulling your tool occasionally"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_amalgamation_inner>"
msgid ""
"There are no strange smells, no random organs strewn about its insides.  "
"Somehow that is more disconcerting than the mutated animals you took apart "
"until now"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_amalgamation_inner>"
msgid ""
"Even though it's made of something like flesh, you can't help but feel like "
"you're disassembling an intricate machine"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_amalgamation_inner>"
msgid ""
"Its parts don't want to stay apart, slowly moving to close your cuts.  You "
"resign yourself to removing every chunk and placing it on the ground beside "
"the corpse, where they finally grow still"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_amalgamation_inner>"
msgid ""
"Every so often your tool hits something bone-hard in the deep, but when you "
"cut there the second time the flesh parts smoothly"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_amalgamation_acid_outer>"
msgid ""
"The caustic buboes connect to a web of sickly green veins running down the "
"creature's limbs.  You take care not to nick them"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_amalgamation_acid_outer>"
msgid ""
"You slip and tear into an acid gland and can't help but pause and watch as "
"the substance inside dissolves a good chunk of flesh before growing inert"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_amalgamation_acid_outer>"
msgid ""
"Its skin feels less flexible than usual, and coated in a greasy film on the "
"outside"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_amalgamation_acid_outer>"
msgid ""
"A new, fist-sized green bubo emerges from your cut before your eyes, as if it "
"was waiting just below the surface.  You'll have to be careful"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_amalgamation_acid_inner>"
msgid ""
"No organs beyond various sizes of the acid glands in neat rows, as if they "
"were replacement parts ready to deploy"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_amalgamation_acid_inner>"
msgid ""
"Your tool takes on a rainbow sheen from working in the creature's innards, "
"and seems to give off a thin smoke.  You might want to hurry"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_amalgamation_acid_inner>"
msgid ""
"The green veins stand out before the stark white background and there is a "
"hair-thin space surrounding each, as if the flesh was hesitant to touch "
"whatever is carried inside"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_amalgamation_electric_outer>"
msgid "Sparks still dance around its limbs, and you're hesitant to start cutting"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_amalgamation_electric_outer>"
msgid ""
"There is no movement from the body, but you can still hear a faint crackling "
"from inside"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_amalgamation_electric_outer>"
msgid "Sparks dance between your tool and its skin, but disappear without any harm"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_amalgamation_electric_outer>"
msgid ""
"The skin is filled with tiny black crystals embedded in a dizzying fractal "
"pattern emanating from the central glowing organ"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_amalgamation_electric_inner>"
msgid "Your smell ozone and burned hair as you hack the crackling corpse to pieces"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_amalgamation_electric_inner>"
msgid ""
"Most of its insides are taken up by the warped organ still humming with "
"electricity.  Cutting into it proves harder than expected, not the least "
"because of the sparks"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_amalgamation_electric_inner>"
msgid ""
"Finger-thick strands connect the glowing organ to the base of a limb, and the "
"normally white flesh is blackened along its path"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/names.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<male_full_name>"
msgid "<male_given_name> '<nick_name>' <family_name>"
msgstr "<male_given_name> '<nick_name>' <family_name>"

#: data/json/snippets/names.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<male_full_name>"
msgid "<male_given_name> <family_name>"
msgstr "<male_given_name> <family_name>"

#: data/json/snippets/names.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<female_full_name>"
msgid "<female_given_name> '<nick_name>' <family_name>"
msgstr "<female_given_name> '<nick_name>' <family_name>"

#: data/json/snippets/names.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "<female_full_name>"
msgid "<female_given_name> <family_name>"
msgstr "<female_given_name> <family_name>"

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "many_years_old_news"
msgid "ATOMIC DEREGULATION"
msgstr "DESREGULACIÓN ATÓMICA"

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "many_years_old_news"
#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_old_news"
#. ~ This category roughly lines up with Cataclysm's many_years_old_news
#. category and contains some of the same snippets.
msgid ""
"ATOMIC DEREGULATION!  President Toffer announced to a mixed crowd today that "
"he had signed an executive order to deregulate public use of radioactive "
"compounds, allowing more widespread use of low-grade radioactive compounds in "
"home appliances.  \"Plutonium is the greenest energy we have,\" he told an "
"assembled press.  \"It's time we got over our fear and moved into the light.\""
msgstr ""
"DESREGULACIÓN ATÓMICA! El Presidente Toffer anunció hoy a una multitud mixta "
"que había firmado una orden ejecutiva para desregular el uso público de "
"compuestos radioactivos, permitiendo un uso más extendido de compuestos "
"radioactivos de bajo grado en los electrodomésticos. \"El plutonio es la "
"energía más verde que tenemos\", dijo a la prensa reunida. \"Es hora de que "
"superemos nuestro miedo y salgamos a la luz.\""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "many_years_old_news"
msgid "CELEBRATED PHYSICIST GOES MISSING"
msgstr "FÍSICO FAMOSO DESAPARECE"

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "many_years_old_news"
#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_lost_people_news"
#. ~ This category is for 'lost person' classified ads and newspaper snippets
#. about people that have fallen into to the Backrooms, from any era.
msgid ""
"CELEBRATED PHYSICIST GOES MISSING.  Dr. Amy Takatoshi, a celebrated quantum "
"physicist at MIT dubbed by some as \"the next Hawking\" has gone missing "
"shortly before a press conference that was expected to be the announcement of "
"her newest research results, rumored to be in the field of teleportation."
msgstr ""
"EL CÉLEBRE FÍSICO DESAPARECE. La Dra. Amy Takatoshi, una célebre física "
"cuántica del MIT apodada por algunos como \"la próxima Hawking\" ha "
"desaparecido poco antes de una conferencia de prensa que se esperaba fuera el "
"anuncio de los resultados de su más reciente investigación, que se rumoreaba "
"que está en el campo de la teletransportación."

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "many_years_old_news"
msgid "EDITORIAL: THE UN SHOULD PUT ON ITS BIG-BOY PANTS"
msgstr "EDITORIAL: LA ONU DEBERÍA ACTUAR COMO UN ADULTO"

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "many_years_old_news"
#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_old_news"
#. ~ This category roughly lines up with Cataclysm's many_years_old_news
#. category and contains some of the same snippets.
msgid ""
"EDITORIAL: THE UN SHOULD PUT ON ITS BIG-BOY PANTS.  So, driven by decreasing "
"regulation of radioactive materials in the US and China, the UN is pushing "
"hard again for nuclear disarmament.  What a tired old litany this has become. "
" With deregulation, we've been able to slate three new green nuclear reactors "
"in the Eastern US alone, bringing greenhouse-gas free power to millions of "
"people.  Whatever happened to the UN's focus on global warming?  This is a "
"classic situation of the world painting the USA as villains no matter what we "
"do."
msgstr ""
"EDITORIAL: LA ONU DEBERÍA PONERSE SUS PANTALONES DE NIÑO GRANDE. Así que, "
"impulsada por la disminución de la regulación de los materiales radiactivos "
"en los EE.UU. y China, la ONU está presionando duro de nuevo para el desarme "
"nuclear. En qué vieja y cansada letanía se ha convertido esto. Con la "
"desregulación, hemos sido capaces de poner en la pizarra tres nuevos "
"reactores nucleares ecológicos sólo en el este de EE.UU., llevando energía "
"libre de gases de efecto invernadero a millones de personas. ¿Qué pasó con el "
"enfoque de la ONU sobre el calentamiento global? Esta es una situación "
"clásica del mundo que pinta a los EE.UU. como villanos sin importar lo que "
"hagamos."

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "many_years_old_news"
msgid "US IGNORES UN DEMANDS"
msgstr "EEUU IGNORA LAS DEMANDAS DE LA ONU"

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "many_years_old_news"
#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_old_news"
#. ~ This category roughly lines up with Cataclysm's many_years_old_news
#. category and contains some of the same snippets.
msgid ""
"US IGNORES UN DEMANDS: The US ambassador to the UN today turned down UN "
"requests to begin mutual nuclear disarmament of China, the US and North "
"Korea.  \"We have a right to defend ourselves,\" insisted the ambassador.  "
"\"We'll back down when they do\"."
msgstr ""
"El embajador de EE.UU. en la ONU rechazó hoy las peticiones de la ONU para "
"comenzar el desarme nuclear mutuo de China, EE.UU. y Corea del Norte. "
"\"Tenemos derecho a defendernos\", insistió el embajador. \"Nos echaremos "
"atrás cuando lo hagan\"."

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "many_years_old_news"
msgid "DISASTER IN THE SARITANIA MINES"
msgstr "DESASTRE EN LAS MINAS DE SARITANIA"

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "many_years_old_news"
msgid ""
"DISASTER IN THE SARITANIA MINES!  A copper mine west of Saritania, a small "
"town in Vermont, collapsed Wednesday, killing an estimated thirty miners in "
"the disaster.  Local officials could not be reached for comment, despite the "
"mine being Saritania's primary industry.  An anonymous but credible source "
"did contact our offices, claiming that the Saritania Mine was in fact an "
"underground military facility, and that the disaster was a cover-up for a "
"failed experiment.  These allegations were not addressed by officials."
msgstr ""
"DESASTRE EN LAS MINAS DE SARANIA! Una mina de cobre al oeste de Saritania, un "
"pequeño pueblo en Vermont, se derrumbó el miércoles, matando a unos treinta "
"mineros en el desastre. Los funcionarios locales no pudieron ser contactados "
"para hacer comentarios, a pesar de que la mina es la principal industria de "
"Saritania. Una fuente anónima pero creíble se puso en contacto con nuestras "
"oficinas, afirmando que la mina Saritania era de hecho una instalación "
"militar subterránea, y que el desastre era un encubrimiento para un "
"experimento fallido. Estas acusaciones no fueron abordadas por los "
"funcionarios."

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "many_years_old_news"
msgid "ALIENS AMONG US"
msgstr "EXTRATERRESTRES ENTRE NOSOTROS"

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "many_years_old_news"
msgid ""
"ALIENS AMONG US!  Janine Galfrizowich, of Martha's Vineyard, wrote in to our "
"Paranormal Investigation Staff with this cryptic gem.  \"They're always "
"watching, always watching from the shadows.  Stealing my avocados and "
"watching!  They took my neighbor and made him into one of them!\"  Our "
"journalists are trying to track Mrs Galfrizowich down, but it is clear enough "
"that this ties into the well known Avocado Conspiracy (see issue 24, volume "
"7)."
msgstr ""
"EXTRATERRESTRES ENTRE NOSOTROS! Janine Galfrizowich, de Martha's Vineyard, "
"escribió a nuestro personal de investigación paranormal con esta gema "
"críptica. \"Siempre están mirando, siempre mirando desde las sombras. "
"¡Robando mis aguacates y observando! ¡Se llevaron a mi vecino y lo "
"convirtieron en uno de ellos!\" Nuestros periodistas intentaron localizar a "
"la Sra. Galfrizowich, pero está claro que esto está relacionado con la "
"conocida Conspiración de los Aguacates (ver número 24, volumen 7)."

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "many_years_old_news"
msgid "EDITORIAL: MORE HOMES NEED GUNS"
msgstr "EDITORIAL: MÁS HOGARES NECESITAN ARMAS"

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "many_years_old_news"
#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_old_news"
#. ~ This category roughly lines up with Cataclysm's many_years_old_news
#. category and contains some of the same snippets.
msgid ""
"EDITORIAL: MORE HOMES NEED GUNS.  While visiting a friend recently, our "
"conversation turned to gun control, and I was shocked to learn that my close "
"friend didn't own a firearm.  In this day and age, not having a deadly weapon "
"in your home shows an appalling lack of personal safety, and I told him so.  "
"Weapons that can kill a man, or several men, in an instant - sometimes even "
"accidentally - are our only hope against other people armed similarly.  I see "
"a utopia of honest citizens keeping each other honest by being armed to the "
"teeth."
msgstr ""
"EDITORIAL: MÁS HOGARES NECESITAN ARMAS. Mientras visitaba a un amigo "
"recientemente, nuestra conversación se centró en el control de armas, y me "
"sorprendió saber que mi amigo íntimo no poseía un arma de fuego. Hoy en día, "
"no tener un arma mortal en tu casa muestra una terrible falta de seguridad "
"personal, y se lo dije. Las armas que pueden matar a un hombre, o a varios "
"hombres, en un instante - a veces incluso accidentalmente - son nuestra única "
"esperanza contra otras personas armadas de manera similar. Veo una utopía de "
"ciudadanos honestos manteniéndose honestos unos a otros armados hasta los "
"dientes."

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "many_years_old_news"
msgid "EDITORIAL: LET ME BUY MY DANG PLUTONIUM"
msgstr "EDITORIAL: DÉJAME COMPRAR MI MALDITO PLUTONIO"

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "many_years_old_news"
msgid ""
"EDITORIAL: LET ME BUY MY DANG PLUTONIUM.  President Toffer made a bold and "
"unpopular move last month with nuclear regulation changes.  I, for one, "
"couldn't be more excited.  By now, we know very well what the risks of "
"radioactive materials are, and can take the measures to protect ourselves.  "
"Our citizens deserve the right to make the informed choice to purchase atomic "
"powered tools should they wish, and in this era of fossil fuel and global "
"warming concerns, what could be more appropriate than powering a home with a "
"radioisotope thermal generator?"
msgstr ""
"EDITORIAL: DÉJAME COMPRAR MI MALDITO PLUTONIO. El Presidente Toffer hizo un "
"movimiento audaz e impopular el mes pasado con los cambios en la regulación "
"nuclear. Yo, por mi parte, no podría estar más emocionado. A estas alturas, "
"sabemos muy bien cuáles son los riesgos de los materiales radioactivos, y "
"podemos tomar las medidas para protegernos. Nuestros ciudadanos merecen el "
"derecho a tomar la decisión informada de comprar herramientas de energía "
"atómica si así lo desean, y en esta era de preocupaciones por el combustible "
"fósil y el calentamiento global, ¿qué podría ser más apropiado que alimentar "
"una casa con un generador térmico de radioisótopos?"

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "many_years_old_news"
msgid "EDITORIAL: ALIENS ARE BACK IN A BIG WAY"
msgstr "EDITORIAL: LOS EXTRATERRESTRES VUELVEN A LO GRANDE"

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "many_years_old_news"
msgid ""
"EDITORIAL: ALIENS ARE BACK IN A BIG WAY.  We've all seen that autopsy video "
"that's making the rounds.  I'm not going to say if I believe it's real or not "
"(I will say \"I want to believe\" though!) but regardless of the truth, one "
"thing is clear: the public mind is completely addicted to aliens in the "
"biggest way I've seen since ET was popular.  What's brought little green men "
"back into the public eye?  It's anyone's guess, but personally I think it's a "
"concerning sign that we're culturally digging in to a second Cold War."
msgstr ""
"EDITORIAL: LOS EXTRATERRESTRES HAN VUELTO A LO GRANDE. Todos hemos visto ese "
"video de la autopsia que está rondando. No voy a decir si creo que es real o "
"no (¡diré \"quiero creer\"!) pero a pesar de la verdad, una cosa está clara: "
"la mente del público es completamente adicta a los extraterrestres de la "
"manera más grande que he visto desde que ET fue popular. ¿Qué ha traído a los "
"hombrecitos verdes de vuelta al ojo público? Es una suposición, pero "
"personalmente creo que es una señal preocupante de que estamos cavando "
"culturalmente en una segunda Guerra Fría."

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "many_years_old_news"
msgid "POPULAR 'ALIEN AUTOPSY' DEBUNKED"
msgstr "DESMENTIDA LA POPULAR 'AUTOPSIA ALIÉNÍGENA'"

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "many_years_old_news"
#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_old_news"
#. ~ This category roughly lines up with Cataclysm's many_years_old_news
#. category and contains some of the same snippets.
msgid ""
"POPULAR 'ALIEN AUTOPSY' DEBUNKED.  A widely circulated video, making the "
"rounds everywhere from FriendFace to television news, has been debunked as a "
"fake.  This extremely realistic and graphic alien autopsy shows an "
"insect-like creature being dismantled by Japanese researchers, who comment on "
"its anatomy in Japanese throughout the video.  Early observations that the "
"creature was suspiciously similar to those described in the popular works of "
"horror author HP Lovecraft were not sufficient to dislodge the video's viral "
"status.  Yesterday, on the popular social media website Eddit, a 'making of' "
"video was posted, clearly exposing the work as the final film project of a "
"small group of students at UCLA."
msgstr ""
"LA POPULAR \"AUTOPSIA ALIENÍGENA\" DESACREDITADA. Un video ampliamente "
"difundido, que ha estado rondando por todos lados desde FriendFace hasta las "
"noticias de televisión, ha sido desacreditado como una falsificación. Esta "
"autopsia alienígena extremadamente realista y gráfica muestra una criatura "
"parecida a un insecto que está siendo desmantelada por investigadores "
"japoneses, que comentan su anatomía en japonés a lo largo del vídeo. Las "
"primeras observaciones de que la criatura era sospechosamente similar a las "
"descritas en las populares obras de horror del autor HP Lovecraft no fueron "
"suficientes para desalojar el estatus viral del video. Ayer, en el popular "
"sitio web de medios sociales Eddit, se publicó un video \"making of\", "
"exponiendo claramente el trabajo como el proyecto final de película de un "
"pequeño grupo de estudiantes de la UCLA."

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "many_years_old_news"
msgid "STUDENT MISSING"
msgstr "ESTUDIANTE DESAPARECIDO"

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "many_years_old_news"
#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_lost_people_news"
#. ~ This category is for 'lost person' classified ads and newspaper snippets
#. about people that have fallen into to the Backrooms, from any era.
msgid ""
"STUDENT MISSING: A high school student vanished yesterday evening in the "
"forest near Wayland.  The 17-year-old student Brett Dong was last seen with "
"his friends in the camp.  \"Brett said that he was gonna get some firewood "
"but he never came back,\" said his classmate, Jianxiang Wang.  The search is "
"underway."
msgstr ""
"ESTUDIANTE DESAPARECIDO: Un estudiante de secundaria desapareció ayer por la "
"tarde en el bosque cerca de Wayland. El estudiante de 17 años Brett Dong fue "
"visto por última vez con sus amigos en el campo. \"Brett dijo que iba a "
"buscar leña, pero nunca volvió\", dijo su compañero de clase, Jianxiang Wang. "
"La búsqueda está en marcha."

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "many_years_old_news"
msgid "STILL SEARCHING"
msgstr "TODAVÍA EN BUSCA"

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "many_years_old_news"
msgid ""
"STILL SEARCHING: The search for Brett Dong, the high school student who went "
"missing three days ago, is still ongoing.  \"He could have played in the "
"soccer game against Weston High School yesterday,\" Brett's sorrowful "
"teammate said, \"[…] we've never stopped praying.\"  Despite the best efforts "
"of the County Search & Rescue, Brett had still not been located at the time "
"of this report."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "many_years_old_news"
msgid "RUMORS DENIED"
msgstr "RUMORES DESMENTIDOS"

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "many_years_old_news"
#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_lost_people_news"
#. ~ This category is for 'lost person' classified ads and newspaper snippets
#. about people that have fallen into to the Backrooms, from any era.
msgid ""
"RUMORS DENIED: Allegations from search parties hunting for Brett Dong, that a "
"civilian research facility just outside Wayland is a front for a government "
"facility researching dangerous technologies, were addressed during a press "
"conference earlier today.  \"I have to clarify that not only have we never "
"done such research,\" said the officer on the press conference.  \"These "
"allegations are absurd.  Teleportation and aliens only exist in sci-fi films, "
"and the US certainly doesn't have the funds to build these extensive "
"underground networks people are talking about.  I can't believe I even have "
"to tell you this.  I don't know what those kids saw that put these ideas in "
"their heads, but they're going through an awful lot with the loss of their "
"friend.\""
msgstr ""
"RUMORES NEGADOS: Las alegaciones de los grupos de búsqueda que buscan a Brett "
"Dong, de que una instalación de investigación civil en las afueras de Wayland "
"es una fachada para una instalación del gobierno que investiga tecnologías "
"peligrosas, fueron tratadas durante la conferencia de prensa de hoy . \"Tengo "
"que aclarar que no sólo nunca hemos hecho tal investigación\", dijo el "
"oficial en la conferencia de prensa. \"Estas acusaciones son absurdas. El "
"teletransporte y los extraterrestres sólo existen en las películas de ciencia "
"ficción, y los EE.UU. ciertamente no tiene los fondos para construir estas "
"extensas redes subterráneas de las que la gente está hablando. No puedo creer "
"que tenga que decirles esto. No sé qué vieron esos chicos para meterse esas "
"ideas en la cabeza, pero ya lo están pasando muy mal con la pérdida de su "
"amigo\"."

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "many_years_old_news"
msgid "TANK SUIT"
msgstr "TRAJE TANQUE"

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "many_years_old_news"
msgid ""
"TANK SUIT!  In a press conference on Tuesday, General Ariel Dabrowski was "
"proud to unveil the new military \"tank suit\", a powered exoskeleton capable "
"of resisting small arms fire and most heavy weapons.  \"Tank suits have been "
"used in limited deployment in Afghanistan for several months now,\" General "
"Dabrowski informed the gathered press.  \"We're proud to be at a point where "
"we can formally introduce them to the public.  These suits are just the first "
"stage in a new generation of mechanized infantry.\""
msgstr ""
"¡TRAJE TANQUE! En una conferencia de prensa el martes, el General Ariel "
"Dabrowski se enorgulleció de presentar el nuevo \"traje tanque\" militar, un "
"exoesqueleto motorizado capaz de resistir el fuego de las armas pequeñas y la "
"mayoría de las armas pesadas. \"Los trajes tanque han sido usados en un "
"despliegue limitado en Afganistán desde hace varios meses\", informó el "
"General Dabrowski a la prensa reunida. \"Estamos orgullosos de estar en un "
"punto en el que podemos presentarlos formalmente al público. Estos trajes son "
"sólo la primera etapa de una nueva generación de infantería mecanizada.\""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "many_years_old_news"
msgid "EDISON AUTOMOTIVES UNVEILS NEW SOLAR CAR"
msgstr "LA AUTOMOVILÍSTICA EDISON PRESENTA SU NUEVO COCHE SOLAR"

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "many_years_old_news"
msgid ""
"EDISON AUTOMOTIVES UNVEILS NEW SOLAR CAR.  \"These miracles of technology "
"wouldn't be possible without the deregulations pioneered by President "
"Toffer,\" said billionaire tech mogul Elton Moosek about his company's newest "
"innovation.  \"Access to radioactive compounds and military-grade fuel cells "
"has made this possible.  At this rate, we'll be flying solar sail spacecraft "
"within my lifetime.\""
msgstr ""
"AUTOMÓVILES EDISON PRESENTA EL NUEVO COCHE SOLAR. \"Estos milagros de la "
"tecnología no serían posibles sin las desregulaciones iniciadas por el "
"Presidente Toffer\", dijo el magnate tecnológico multimillonario Elton Moosek "
"sobre la más reciente innovación de su compañía. \"El acceso a los compuestos "
"radioactivos y a las células de combustible de grado militar ha hecho esto "
"posible. A este ritmo, estaremos volando naves espaciales de vela solar a lo "
"largo de mi vida.\""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "many_years_old_news"
msgid "REAL AI IN THE PALM OF YOUR HAND"
msgstr "LA AI REAL EN LA PALMA DE SU MANO"

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "many_years_old_news"
msgid ""
"REAL AI IN THE PALM OF YOUR HAND.  [Photograph: Dania Tang holds a "
"new-generation heuristic processor, weighing a mere seventy grams.]  "
"Engineers at MIT, working in conjunction with a funding grant from "
"entrepreneur Elton Moosek, have unveiled a next-generation deep learning "
"heuristic processor.  \"I'm hesitant to call it an artificial intelligence,\" "
"spokesperson Dania Tang said of the new device, \"but it's the closest we've "
"yet achieved.  It's able to instantly analyze dozens of possible outcomes of "
"a future action and choose the best one, much like a human uses deductive "
"reasoning.\"  Under a new startup, MindStone, the processors are reputedly "
"already being contracted for military use."
msgstr ""
"UNA VERDADERA I.A. EN LA PALMA DE TU MANO. [Fotografía: Dania Tang sujeta un "
"procesador heurístico de nueva generación, con un peso de sólo setenta "
"gramos.] Ingenieros del MIT, trabajando en conjunto con una subvención del "
"empresario Elton Moosek, han revelado un procesador heurístico de aprendizaje "
"profundo de nueva generación. \"No me atrevo a llamarlo inteligencia "
"artificial\", dijo la portavoz Dania Tang sobre el nuevo dispositivo, \"pero "
"es lo más parecido que hemos conseguido hasta ahora\". Es capaz de analizar "
"instantáneamente docenas de posibles resultados de una acción futura y elegir "
"la mejor, de forma muy parecida a como un humano utiliza el razonamiento "
"deductivo\". Bajo un nuevo startup, MindStone, se dice que los procesadores "
"ya han sido contratados para uso militar."

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "many_years_old_news"
msgid "GENERAL PROMOTED ONBOARD OLD IRONSIDES"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "many_years_old_news"
msgid ""
"GENERAL PROMOTED ONBOARD OLD IRONSIDES.  The USS Constitution was the site of "
"a promotion ceremony held by the Massachusetts National Guard at the "
"Charlestown Navy Yard.  Col. Ariel Dabrowski was promoted to the rank of "
"brigadier general in the Massachusetts National Guard in front of a crowd "
"massed on the deck of the historic ship.  General Carlsberg officiated the "
"promotion ceremony, and Maj. Gen. Michael Baker administered the oath of "
"office."
msgstr ""
"GENERAL ASCENDIDO A BORDO DEL VIEJO IRONIDES El USS Constitution fue el "
"escenario de una ceremonia de ascenso celebrada por la Guardia Nacional de "
"Massachusetts en el astillero naval de Charlestown. El coronel Ariel "
"Dabrowski fue ascendido al rango de general de brigada de la Guardia Nacional "
"de Massachusetts ante una multitud congregada en la cubierta del histórico "
"buque. El general Carlsberg ofició la ceremonia de ascenso y el general de "
"división Michael Baker prestó el juramento del cargo."

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "many_years_old_news"
msgid "THE FACE BEHIND THE 'UNCANNY' MASK"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "many_years_old_news"
msgid ""
"THE FACE BEHIND THE 'UNCANNY' MASK.  Everyone knows about James Hawthorne, "
"projected to become America's newest and fastest rising billionaire by next "
"month as stock value in his tech startup, Uncanny, grows at unprecedented "
"speeds.  We decided to explore the names behind the rise you might not have "
"heard.  Dr. Marc Silverstein, an MIT-trained researcher formerly involved "
"with Leapfrog Industries, has been along for the ride the whole time, and has "
"come out nearly as wealthy as Hawthorne himself.  Though impressively "
"reclusive, we managed to snag some pretty interesting information about Dr. "
"S.  Could he be the real mind behind the rise?  How much does James depend on "
"his right-hand scientist?  Details on page 12."
msgstr ""
"LA CARA DETRÁS DE LA MÁSCARA 'ASOMBROSO'. Todo el mundo conoce a James "
"Hawthorne, que se convertirá en el multimillonario más reciente y de más "
"rápido crecimiento de Estados Unidos el mes que viene, ya que el valor de las "
"acciones de su empresa tecnológica, Asombroso, crece a una velocidad sin "
"precedentes. Hemos decidido explorar los nombres que hay detrás de este "
"ascenso y que quizá no hayas oído. El Dr. Marc Silverstein, un investigador "
"formado en el MIT y anteriormente involucrado en Industrias SaltoDeRana, ha "
"estado en el camino todo el tiempo, y ha salido casi tan rico como el propio "
"Hawthorne. Aunque es impresionantemente reservado, hemos conseguido obtener "
"información muy interesante sobre el Dr. S. ¿Podría ser la verdadera mente "
"detrás del ascenso? ¿Cuánto depende James de su mano derecha científica? "
"Detalles en la página 12."

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "many_years_old_news"
msgid "FORMER RCI DIVISION PURCHASED BY FOREIGN INVESTORS"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "many_years_old_news"
msgid ""
"FORMER RCI DIVISION PURCHASED BY FOREIGN INVESTORS.  A former division of "
"Rivet and Crimp Industries, a major subcontractor for national defense "
"manufacturers, has recently been purchased by Taiwanese American tech "
"billionaire Henry Gau.  CEO of Formosa OptoTech, Gau is known for his close "
"relationship with Chinese suppliers and manufacturers. Branding the company "
"Rivtech, the company will focus on competing in the US Next Generation Squad "
"Weapons trial.  Rivet and Crimp Industries's former weapons manufactory "
"division is previously known for manufacturing a pump-action grenade launcher "
"entrant in the M32 Multiple Grenade Launcher Trial, embroiling RCI and tech "
"partner Javelin Systems in a bitter, expensive legal battle."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "years_old_news"
msgid "GOVERNMENT SCIENCE BOOST"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "years_old_news"
#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_recent_news"
#. ~ This category roughly lines up with Cataclysm's news segments newer than
#. a few months and contains some of the same snippets.
msgid ""
"GOVERNMENT SCIENCE BOOST: The government has drastically increased research "
"and development budgets after UN disarmament demands.  \"This not only keeps "
"money in our country, but maintains our lead on China and keeps us "
"defended\", President Oswald said.  \"This is a fight we can't afford to "
"lose.  We're not deaf to the concerns of our population: this is a blanket "
"increase, not just to military R&D spending but civilian as well.  We've "
"authorized the construction of seventy nine new private civilian research "
"facilities along the Eastern Seaboard alone!\""
msgstr ""
"El gobierno ha aumentado drásticamente los presupuestos de investigación y "
"desarrollo después de las demandas de desarme de la ONU. \"Esto no sólo "
"mantiene el dinero en nuestro país, sino que mantiene nuestra ventaja sobre "
"China y nos mantiene defendidos\", dijo el Presidente Oswald. \"Esta es una "
"lucha que no podemos permitirnos perder. No estamos sordos a las "
"preocupaciones de nuestra población: este es un aumento general, no sólo del "
"gasto en I+D militar, sino también civil. Hemos autorizado la construcción de "
"setenta y nueve nuevas instalaciones de investigación civil privada sólo a lo "
"largo de la costa este!\""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "years_old_news"
msgid "HOME GROWN SCIENCE"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "years_old_news"
msgid ""
"HOME GROWN SCIENCE: Several governors & legislators from the New England "
"region discussed a new regional initiative today, which relaxed laws that "
"limit the distance a hazardous-material laboratory or factory can be from a "
"city.  \"This should keep our economy going strong for years to come, with "
"all the R&D facilities being established,\", one mayor remarked.  \"With all "
"the new money coming in, we've seen a huge uptick in highly educated people "
"moving into the area too.  It's been nice, our coffee shops in particular are "
"doing very well.\""
msgstr ""
"CIENCIA CASERA: Varios gobernadores y legisladores de la región de Nueva "
"Inglaterra debatieron hoy una nueva iniciativa regional, que flexibilizó las "
"leyes que limitan la distancia que un laboratorio o fábrica de materiales "
"peligrosos puede tener de una ciudad. \"Esto debería mantener nuestra "
"economía fuerte en los años venideros, con todas las instalaciones de "
"investigación y desarrollo que se han establecido\", comentó un alcalde. "
"\"Con todo el dinero nuevo que está entrando, hemos visto un gran aumento de "
"personas altamente educadas que se mudan a la zona también. Ha sido "
"agradable, nuestras cafeterías en particular lo están llevando muy bien.\""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "years_old_news"
msgid "TECHWORLD NEWS: 'UNCANNY' REBRANDING"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "years_old_news"
msgid ""
"TECHWORLD NEWS: 'UNCANNY' REBRANDING.  Toy company at the origin of the "
"successful talking doll rebrands and becomes Uncanny.  A spokesperson from "
"the newly formed Uncanny told the press, \"We think we can do more than just "
"entertain.  We have new plans, big plans, plans that will shape the very "
"fabric of reality!\"  Unconfirmed rumors suggest that Uncanny has already "
"received large orders from the government."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "years_old_news"
msgid "THE 'UNCANNY' SUCCESS STORY"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "years_old_news"
msgid ""
"THE 'UNCANNY' SUCCESS STORY.  Everyone's talking about the meteoric rise of "
"tech startup \"Uncanny\" over the last few months.  From zero to household "
"name, the company leapt to the public eye with its, well, uncanny line of "
"talking toys.  Before we even knew what to expect, they were Wall Street's "
"new darling, with the fastest rise in manufacturing capacity of any company "
"in the last thirty years.  We spoke to James Hawthorne, America's newest "
"billionaire and the man behind the name on everyone's lips.  Interview on "
"page 3."
msgstr ""
"LA HISTORIA DE ÉXITO DE 'ASOMBROSO' Todo el mundo habla del meteórico ascenso "
"de la empresa tecnológica \"Asombroso\" en los últimos meses. De cero a un "
"nombre familiar, la empresa saltó a la palestra pública con su línea de "
"juguetes parlantes. Antes de que supiéramos lo que nos esperaba, era la nueva "
"favorita de Wall Street, con el aumento más rápido de la capacidad de "
"fabricación de cualquier empresa en los últimos treinta años. Hablamos con "
"James Hawthorne, el nuevo multimillonario de Estados Unidos y el hombre que "
"está detrás del nombre que está en boca de todos. Entrevista en la página 3."

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "years_old_news"
msgid "SOYPELUSA SUITS FIND NEW AMMO"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "years_old_news"
msgid ""
"SOYPELUSA SUITS FIND NEW AMMO:  Following the infamous disaster of the "
"DaiZoom product launch and the numerous lawsuits that sprung from its "
"failure, research from Harvard's Cognitive Neuropsychology labs has brought "
"new evidence in the ongoing litigation against the company.  We spoke with "
"lead researcher Doctor Soren Eldridge who had this to say: \"The DaiZoom bar, "
"beyond its notoriously bad taste, appears to cause in its consumers symptoms "
"similar to those of a major depressive disorder.  There is an actual tangible "
"impact on mood that lasts well beyond the initial consumption of even just a "
"few bars in a short span of time - we suspect DaiZoom may actually be "
"chemically inhibiting dopamine receptors.  This is unprecedented, and quite "
"exciting, given that it consists entirely of otherwise biochemically bland "
"ingredients.\"  Doctor Eldridge stated that further research would be needed "
"to determine the full extent of the issue and whether consumption of DaiZoom "
"had long-term health effects similar to existing dopamine blocking drugs, and "
"if there is any role for it as a medical therapy in the future.  The full "
"interview can be found on page 7."
msgstr ""
"LAS DEMANDA DE SOYPELUSA ENCUENTRAN UNA NUEVA PRUEBA: Tras el infame desastre "
"del lanzamiento del producto DaiZoom y las numerosas demandas que se "
"derivaron de su fracaso, una investigación de los laboratorios de "
"Neuropsicología Cognitiva de Harvard ha aportado nuevas pruebas en el litigio "
"en curso contra la empresa. Hemos hablado con el investigador principal, el "
"doctor Soren Eldridge, que nos ha contado lo siguiente: \"La barrita DaiZoom, "
"más allá de su notorio mal sabor, parece causar en sus consumidores síntomas "
"similares a los de un trastorno depresivo mayor. Hay un impacto tangible real "
"en el estado de ánimo que dura mucho más allá del consumo inicial de incluso "
"unas pocas barritas en un corto espacio de tiempo - sospechamos que DaiZoom "
"puede estar inhibiendo químicamente los receptores de dopamina. Se trata de "
"algo sin precedentes y muy emocionante, dado que está compuesto en su "
"totalidad por ingredientes bioquímicamente insípidos\". El doctor Eldridge "
"declaró que se necesitan más estudios para determinar el alcance de la "
"cuestión y si el consumo de DaiZoom tiene efectos a largo plazo similares a "
"los de los fármacos bloqueadores de la dopamina, y si puede utilizarse como "
"terapia médica en el futuro. La entrevista completa figura en la página 7."

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "one_year_old_news"
msgid "READY FOR THE WORST"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "one_year_old_news"
msgid ""
"READY FOR THE WORST.  In response to growing public concern about a potential "
"attack from China, President Oswald announced a major funding initiative for "
"the construction of FEMA-supported evacuation shelters near major population "
"sites.  \"These shelters will provide a much-needed near safety points in an "
"emergency,\" said a spokesperson for FEMA.  \"They're to be equipped with a "
"secure basement that can resist heavy bombardment, able to fit hundreds of "
"people, and equipped to survive gas and biological attacks.  They have "
"self-contained water and power, protective gear, and communications "
"equipment.  In short, they are public survivalist bunkers.  We've very "
"excited about this initiative.\""
msgstr ""
"PREPARADO PARA LO PEOR. En respuesta a la creciente preocupación pública por "
"un posible ataque de China, el Presidente Oswald anunció una importante "
"iniciativa de financiación para la construcción de refugios de evacuación "
"apoyados por la FEMA cerca de los principales centros de población. \"Estos "
"refugios proporcionarán un muy necesario punto de seguridad cercano en caso "
"de emergencia\", dijo un portavoz de FEMA. \"Estarán equipados con un sótano "
"seguro que pueda resistir fuertes bombardeos, capaz de albergar a cientos de "
"personas y equipado para sobrevivir a ataques biológicos y con gas\". Tienen "
"agua y energía autónomas, equipo de protección y equipo de comunicaciones. En "
"resumen, son búnkeres públicos de supervivencialistas. Estamos muy "
"entusiasmados con esta iniciativa\"."

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "one_year_old_news"
msgid "GRAVE BUSINESS"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "one_year_old_news"
msgid ""
"GRAVE BUSINESS: Recent reports show a large spike in thefts from and assaults "
"on funeral homes in the last few weeks.  Described as highly strange but not "
"especially dangerous, Homeland Security is \"looking at the connections now.\""
msgstr ""
"EL NEGOCIO DE LAS TUMBAS: Informes recientes muestran un gran incremento en "
"asaltos a casas fúnebres en las últimas semanas. Descrito como muy extraño "
"pero no especialmente peligroso, Seguridad Nacional está \"buscando en este "
"momento los vínculos.\""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "one_year_old_news"
msgid "TELEPORTATION?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "one_year_old_news"
#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_lost_people_news"
#. ~ This category is for 'lost person' classified ads and newspaper snippets
#. about people that have fallen into to the Backrooms, from any era.
msgid ""
"TELEPORTATION?  An unidentified source working in a major university "
"contacted multiple media outlets this week with a farfetched story that is "
"nonetheless corroborated by third-party physicists as \"shockingly "
"possible\".  This source, nicknamed \"Deep Space\", describes secret "
"government experimentation into teleportation, dating back to before 2008.  "
"\"When I read the tagline, I just scoffed,\" said Dr. Alice Feyn, a physics "
"professor at MIT.  \"Then I read on.  This is strongly reminiscent of Dr. "
"Takatoshi's lost work.  It feels bizarre to say it, but I think there's a "
"grain of truth to all of this.\"  Dr. Amy Takatoshi was a quantum physicist "
"who went missing, along with all records of her work, in July 2007."
msgstr ""
"¿TELEPORTACIÓN? Una fuente no identificada que trabaja en una universidad "
"importante contactó con múltiples medios de comunicación esta semana con una "
"historia inverosímil que, sin embargo, es corroborada por terceros físicos "
"como \"sorprendentemente posible\". Esta fuente, apodada \"Espacio "
"Profundo\", describe la experimentación secreta del gobierno en la "
"teletransportación, que se remonta a antes de 2008. \"Cuando leí el eslogan, "
"me burlé\", dijo la Dra. Alice Feyn, una profesora de física del MIT. \"Luego "
"seguí leyendo. Esto recuerda mucho al trabajo perdido de Dra. Takatoshi. Se "
"siente extraño decirlo, pero creo que hay un grano de verdad en todo esto.\" "
"La Dra. Amy Takatoshi era una física cuántica que desapareció, junto con "
"todos los registros de su trabajo, en julio de 2007."

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "one_year_old_news"
msgid "LASERS - NEXT BIG THING?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "one_year_old_news"
msgid ""
"LASERS - NEXT BIG THING?: Top defense researchers remarked during "
"demonstration of a prototype today: \"We are still working on it, the laser "
"weapon lacks power, but has a technically almost unlimited range,\" Colonel "
"Sylver, a spokesperson for the military said.  Laser weapons have been used "
"for years in large-scale platforms, especially as anti-ordnance weapons; this "
"marks the first field use of human-sized energy weapons.\n"
"\n"
"\"There's no real advantage over conventional weaponry at this point,\" said "
"analyst Mark Coza in an interview.  \"I think they're rolling them out mainly "
"to intimidate China, and in the hopes that field testing leads to further "
"improvements.\""
msgstr ""
"LOS LÁSERES... ¿LA PRÓXIMA GRAN NOVEDAD? Los principales investigadores de "
"defensa comentaron durante la demostración de un prototipo hoy: \"Todavía "
"estamos trabajando en ello, el arma láser carece de potencia, pero tiene un "
"alcance técnicamente casi ilimitado\", dijo el Coronel Sylver, un portavoz "
"del ejército. Las armas láser se han utilizado durante años en plataformas a "
"gran escala, especialmente como armas antiarmas; esto marca el primer uso de "
"campo de las armas de energía de tamaño humano.\n"
"\n"
"\"No hay ninguna ventaja real sobre el armamento convencional en este "
"momento\", dijo el analista Mark Coza en una entrevista. \"Creo que las están "
"desplegando principalmente para intimidar a China, y con la esperanza de que "
"las pruebas de campo conduzcan a nuevas mejoras\"."

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "one_year_old_news"
msgid "DRUG USE ON THE RISE"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "one_year_old_news"
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"DRUG USE ON THE RISE: Recent statistic suggest drug use in New England has "
"climbed more than 20% in the last two years.  \"People are scared for their "
"jobs, their country, even their life… of course some will turn to drugs,\" "
"said an expert."
msgstr ""
"EL USO DE DROGAS EN AUMENTO: Estadísticas recientes sugieren que el uso de "
"drogas en Nueva Inglaterra ha aumentado más del 20% en los últimos dos años. "
"\"La gente teme por su trabajo, su país, incluso por su vida... por supuesto "
"que algunos recurrirán a las drogas\", dijo un experto."

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "one_year_old_news"
msgid "EDITORIAL: DRUG USE SPIKE DUE TO ECONOMY"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "one_year_old_news"
msgid ""
"EDITORIAL: DRUG USE SPIKE DUE TO ECONOMY.  It's no secret that President "
"Oswald's promises of a booming new tech economy have fallen flat on their "
"face.  Whether you're a Democrat or a Republican, we should all be ready to "
"march on Washington and let Oswald know how we feel about broken promises and "
"unemployment.  Instead, people are drowning their sorrows in drugs, as usual, "
"and nothing will change."
msgstr ""
"EDITORIAL: EL AUMENTO DEL CONSUMO DE DROGAS DEBIDO A LA ECONOMÍA. No es un "
"secreto que las promesas del Presidente Oswald de una economía de nueva "
"tecnología en auge han caído de bruces. Ya sea demócrata o republicano, todos "
"deberíamos estar listos para marchar a Washington y dejar que Oswald sepa lo "
"que sentimos sobre las promesas rotas y el desempleo. En cambio, la gente "
"está ahogando sus penas en las drogas, como siempre, y nada cambiará."

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "one_year_old_news"
msgid "EDITORIAL: SOCIAL MEDIA HAS GOTTEN OUT OF HAND, AND GONE OUT OF COUNTRY"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "one_year_old_news"
msgid ""
"EDITORIAL: SOCIAL MEDIA HAS GOTTEN OUT OF HAND, AND GONE OUT OF COUNTRY.  We "
"can no longer trust what we read, and it's all because of social media.  "
"Although our newspaper takes painstaking efforts to source our data, our "
"colleagues have forgotten what it means to be a journalist, and widespread "
"falsehoods are repeated even by reputable publications as fact.  What is the "
"ultimate source of all this misinformation?  It's anyone's guess, but I think "
"we need look no further than our largest international trade partner and "
"rival, China."
msgstr ""
"EDITORIAL: LOS MEDIOS DE COMUNICACIÓN SOCIAL SE HAN SALIDO DE CONTROL, Y SE "
"HAN IDO DEL PAÍS. Ya no podemos confiar en lo que leemos, y es todo debido a "
"las redes sociales. Aunque nuestro periódico se esfuerza por obtener nuestros "
"datos, nuestros colegas han olvidado lo que significa ser periodista, y las "
"falsedades generalizadas se repiten incluso en publicaciones de renombre como "
"un hecho. ¿Cuál es la fuente última de toda esta desinformación? Es una "
"conjetura de cualquiera, pero creo que no tenemos que buscar más allá de "
"nuestro mayor socio comercial internacional y rival, China."

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "one_year_old_news"
msgid "EDITORIAL: HOME CANNING NEEDS TO MAKE A COMEBACK"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "one_year_old_news"
msgid ""
"EDITORIAL: HOME CANNING NEEDS TO MAKE A COMEBACK.  With food security in "
"question after severe drought this year, I think it's clear we all need to "
"get out Grandma's old books, and learn how to can again.  Grocery stores "
"could be a bit empty this winter, and now is the time to make pickles and "
"preserves while the pickling's good.  In this issue, three of our editors "
"share their uplifting stories of rediscovering the joys of home canning."
msgstr ""
"EDITORIAL: EL ENLATADO CASERO NECESITA VOLVER. Con la seguridad alimentaria "
"en cuestión después de la grave sequía de este año, creo que está claro que "
"todos tenemos que sacar los libros viejos de la abuela, y aprender cómo se "
"enlatar de nuevo. Las tiendas de comestibles podrían estar un poco vacías "
"este invierno, y ahora es el momento de hacer encurtidos y conservas mientras "
"el encurtido esta bueno. En este número, tres de nuestros editores comparten "
"sus historias edificantes de redescubrir las alegrías del enlatado "
"casero.nuevo. "

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "one_year_old_news"
msgid "EDITORIAL: THIS IS WHERE 'ME TOO' ENDS UP"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "one_year_old_news"
msgid ""
"EDITORIAL: THIS IS WHERE 'ME TOO' ENDS UP.  It's been a while now since 'Me "
"Too' swept the message boards of our nation, but its repercussions are felt "
"every day.  Disconnected from our identities and our heritage by the "
"overwhelming urge to suppress the white male and hide his every achievement, "
"American citizens are turning to drugs and violence to find a place of "
"belonging.  The government swings its hefty blame-stick around, trying to "
"shine a light on the rise in crime and failing economy, but the answer is "
"obvious to anyone who simply looks: it is the loss of our racial and sexual "
"identity that's at the root.  Mark my words: within a year, there will be a "
"reckoning, and it won't be caused by the government or some outside power, it "
"will be from the broken heart of America."
msgstr ""
"EDITORIAL: AQUÍ ES DONDE \"ME TOO\" TERMINA. Hace tiempo que 'Me Too' no "
"barre los tablones de anuncios de nuestra nación, pero sus repercusiones se "
"sienten todos los días. Desconectados de nuestras identidades y de nuestra "
"herencia por el abrumador impulso de suprimir al hombre blanco y esconder "
"todos sus logros, los ciudadanos americanos están recurriendo a las drogas y "
"a la violencia para encontrar un lugar de pertenencia. El gobierno echa la "
"culpa a todos, tratando de arrojar luz sobre el aumento de la delincuencia y "
"el fracaso de la economía, pero la respuesta es obvia para cualquiera que se "
"limite a mirar: la pérdida de nuestra identidad racial y sexual es lo que "
"está en la raíz. Recuerden mis palabras: dentro de un año, habrá un ajuste de "
"cuentas, y no será causado por el gobierno o algún poder externo, será del "
"corazón roto de América."

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "one_year_old_news"
msgid "TECHWORLD NEWS: THE GROCERY BOT"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "one_year_old_news"
msgid ""
"TECHWORLD NEWS: THE GROCERY BOT.  Uncanny unveils its new product - the "
"Grocery Bot!  Thousands of else-if statements, pre-recorded voice from "
"professional actors, what more does this adorable android hides under its "
"smiling face?  Our expert got the answer for you!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "one_year_old_news"
msgid "EDITORIAL: THE RISE OF THE RIGHT HAS BROUGHT US HERE"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "one_year_old_news"
msgid ""
"EDITORIAL: THE RISE OF THE RIGHT HAS BROUGHT US HERE.  As the wounded white "
"male ego becomes more and more of a self-stereotype, we see the cost of "
"allowing right-wing sentiment echoed all around us.  Through closet "
"capitulation to the demands of the most extremist right-wing groups, "
"President Oswald has made policies that allow foreign drugs to run rampant "
"through our nation.  Hiding under the guise of generally increased crime "
"rates, conservative extremists have taken over our cities, stalking the "
"streets at night and enacting vicious vigilante-style beatings on anyone they "
"deem different."
msgstr ""
"EDITORIAL: EL ASCENSO DE LA DERECHA NOS HA TRAÍDO AQUÍ. A medida que el "
"herido ego masculino blanco se convierte más y más en un auto-estereotipo, "
"vemos el costo de permitir que el sentimiento de la derecha se haga eco a "
"nuestro alrededor. A través de la capitulación a las demandas de los grupos "
"de derecha más extremistas, el Presidente Oswald ha hecho políticas que "
"permiten que las drogas extranjeras se extiendan por toda nuestra nación. "
"Escondidos bajo el disfraz de un aumento general de los índices de "
"criminalidad, los extremistas conservadores se han apoderado de nuestras "
"ciudades, acechando en las calles por la noche y propinando despiadadas "
"palizas al estilo de los vigilantes a cualquiera que consideren diferente."

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "one_year_old_news"
msgid "NEW LAB OPENS"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "one_year_old_news"
msgid ""
"NEW LAB OPENS: The H.R. Bennett Research Facility has been officially opened "
"by the Department of Energy.  According to Deputy Secretary of Energy Randall "
"Balakrishnan, \"This facility is one of the most state-of-the-art in the "
"world.  With the opening of the H.R. Bennett research complex, New England's "
"future is looking brighter than ever.\""
msgstr ""
"NUEVO LABORATORIO ABIERTO: El Centro de Investigación H.R. Bennett ha sido "
"inaugurado oficialmente por el Departamento de Energía. Según el Secretario "
"Adjunto de Energía Randall Balakrishnan, \"Esta instalación es una de las más "
"avanzadas del mundo. Con la apertura del complejo de investigación H.R. "
"Bennett, el futuro de Nueva Inglaterra se ve más brillante que nunca.\""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "one_year_old_news"
msgid "THE FOREIGN DESIGNER DRUG THEY DON'T WANT YOU TO KNOW ABOUT"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "one_year_old_news"
msgid ""
"THE FOREIGN DESIGNER DRUG THEY DON'T WANT YOU TO KNOW ABOUT.  Concerning "
"reports from a source in the Boston Police Department have hinted that there "
"is a new drug on the streets.  Move over, fentanyl: this is a new substance, "
"nicknamed Forbidden City.  While it has a lower fatal overdose rate, "
"Forbidden City is many times more addictive than heroin or methamphetamines, "
"and is making its way quickly around the streets."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "one_year_old_news"
msgid "WHEN I DID MY TIME"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "one_year_old_news"
msgid ""
"WHEN I DID MY TIME.  We spoke to Dan Huang, the Chinese-American author of "
"the New York Times bestselling exposé \"When I Did my Time\", the story of "
"his three years living with his extended family in China, immersed in what he "
"describes as \"The ever-escalating anti-American propaganda of the East.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"It's a real threat,\" said Huang.  \"They are being taught to hate our "
"freedom, and our technology.  Mark my words: there is going to be a "
"reckoning, and we need to be ready.\""
msgstr ""
"CUANDO CUMPLÍ MI CONDENA. Hablamos con Dan Huang, el autor chino-americano "
"del bestseller del New York Times \"Cuando Cumplí mi Condena\", la historia "
"de sus tres años viviendo con su familia extensa en China, inmerso en lo que "
"él describe como \"La siempre creciente propaganda anti-americana de "
"Oriente\".\n"
"\n"
"\"Es una verdadera amenaza\", dijo Huang. \"Se les está enseñando a odiar "
"nuestra libertad, y nuestra tecnología. Recuerden mis palabras: habrá un "
"ajuste de cuentas, y tenemos que estar preparados.\""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "one_year_old_news"
msgid "MAN EATING FLOWERS?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "one_year_old_news"
msgid ""
"MAN EATING FLOWERS?  Italian biologist Dr. Flavio Bianchi responded to an "
"ethics board denial of his work with an unusual announcement last Tuesday.  "
"\"I do not need your permission to do my work,\" stated Dr. Bianchi in a "
"letter to the University of Milan.  \"I will do my research in private, and "
"when I am done, you will rue the day you defied me.\"  Dr. Bianchi's work?  "
"Engineering Venus fly traps large enough to keep the local stray cat "
"population at bay.  His tenure with the university is reported to have been "
"suspended."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "one_year_old_news"
msgid "IT CAME FROM BEYOND"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "one_year_old_news"
msgid ""
"IT CAME FROM BEYOND.  [Pictured: Margaret Antwerp holds the fragment of alien "
"satellite that landed in her rose garden.]  It was a normal day for Margaret. "
" Normal, that is, until a thundering crash in her front yard nearly knocked "
"her house over.  \"This damn thing fell right out of space, I tell you,\" she "
"told investigative journalists from our Paranormal Investigations department. "
" \"It was glowing red hot, and it had burnt my prize-winning roses to a "
"crisp.\"  The US government and air force have declined to comment, as usual."
msgstr ""
"VINO DEL MÁS ALLÁ. [En la foto: Margaret Antwerp sostiene el fragmento del "
"satélite alienígena que aterrizó en su jardín de rosas.] Era un día normal "
"para Margaret. Normal, es decir, hasta que un atronador impacto en su jardín "
"casi derriba su casa. \"Esta maldita cosa cayó del espacio, se lo aseguro\", "
"les dijo a los periodistas de nuestro departamento de Investigaciones "
"Paranormales. \"Estaba al rojo vivo, y había quemado mis galardonadas rosas "
"hasta dejarlas fritas.\" El gobierno y la fuerza aérea de EE.UU. se han "
"declinado hacer comentarios, como de costumbre."

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "one_year_old_news"
msgid "MENDING FENCES"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "one_year_old_news"
msgid ""
"MENDING FENCES.  Growing international tensions have prompted President "
"Oswald to call for unprecedented funding increases for security "
"revitalization.  The president is calling for new \"precision micro\" "
"military installations to be built across the nation, with thousands to be "
"constructed in New England alone.  These come alongside similarly ambitious "
"budget increases for FEMA and scientific research.  A coalition of civil "
"rights orgs, neighborhood associations, and environmental advocates have "
"denounced the initiative."
msgstr ""
"REPARAR LAS VALLAS. Las crecientes tensiones internacionales han llevado al "
"presidente Oswald a pedir un aumento de fondos sin precedentes para la "
"revitalización de la seguridad. El presidente pide que se construyan nuevas "
"instalaciones militares de \"microprecisión\" en todo el país, con miles de "
"ellas sólo en Nueva Inglaterra. Estas medidas se suman a los ambiciosos "
"aumentos presupuestarios para la FEMA y la investigación científica. Una "
"coalición de organizaciones de derechos civiles, asociaciones de vecinos y "
"defensores del medio ambiente han denunciado la iniciativa."

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "one_year_old_news"
msgid "BIGGER BEES"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "one_year_old_news"
msgid ""
"BIGGER BEES.  State biologists are unable to explain the emergence of bees "
"that are two and three times normal size.  Authorities say that bees larger "
"than golf balls are being reported across the state.  As of this time, there "
"have been no reports of increased aggression or other behavioral changes in "
"the oversized insects.  \"I'm glad to see the resurgence in the bee "
"population,\" said Dr. Melissus \"Mel\" Versed, an entomologist at Tufts "
"University.  He added, \"while Anthophila this large are unprecedented in New "
"England, there is nothing particularly harmful about the phenomena.  Think of "
"the honey yields!\""
msgstr ""
"ABEJAS MÁS GRANDES. Los biólogos del estado no pueden explicar la aparición "
"de abejas que tienen un tamaño dos y tres veces superior al normal. Las "
"autoridades afirman que se están registrando abejas más grandes que pelotas "
"de golf en todo el estado. Hasta el momento, no se ha informado de un aumento "
"de la agresividad u otros cambios de comportamiento en los insectos de gran "
"tamaño. \"Me alegra ver el resurgimiento de la población de abejas\", dijo el "
"Dr. Melissus \"Mel\" Versed, entomólogo de la Universidad de Tufts. Añadió "
"que \"aunque las Anthophila de este tamaño no tienen precedentes en Nueva "
"Inglaterra, no hay nada especialmente perjudicial en este fenómeno. ¡Piense "
"en el rendimiento de la miel\"!."

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "one_year_old_news"
msgid "JAMES HAWTHORNE TWITTER FEUD"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "one_year_old_news"
msgid ""
"JAMES HAWTHORNE TWITTER FEUD.  Everyone's talking about the latest trending "
"news on Twitter.  \"Uncanny\" tech magnate and upcoming challenger to the "
"title of \"richest man in America\", James Hawthorne, had a protracted "
"Twitter battle with Minnesota Democratic senatorial candidate Lester "
"Namboney, starting over taxation laws, and running all the way down to grade "
"school insults.  Go to page 5 for the choicest tweets."
msgstr ""
"DISPUTA DE JAMES HAWTHORNE EN TWITTER. Todo el mundo está hablando de la "
"última noticia de moda en Twitter. \"El magnate 'Asombroso' de la tecnología "
"y próximo aspirante al título de \"hombre más rico de Estados Unidos\", James "
"Hawthorne, mantuvo una prolongada batalla en Twitter con el candidato "
"demócrata al Senado por Minnesota, Lester Namboney, que comenzó con las leyes "
"fiscales y llegó hasta los insultos de primaria. Ve a la página 5 para ver "
"los tuits más selectos."

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "one_year_old_news"
msgid "UNCANNY: SHADOWS IN PARADISE"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "one_year_old_news"
msgid ""
"UNCANNY: SHADOWS IN PARADISE.  Uncanny, a tech development firm that has gone "
"from nothing to a household name throughout the United States in the last two "
"years, has been a hot topic since they entered the limelight.  We all know "
"about James Hawthorne and his charismatic combination of sarcastic quipping "
"and insightful observations.  Everyone has seen his tweets, and his TED Talk "
"went viral last year.  Behind the smokescreen, though, hides labor practices "
"that have left employees scarred and, in some cases, permanently unable to "
"work.  Did you know that Uncanny's Portland manufacturing site tried "
"unsuccessfully to unionize last month?  I bet you didn't.  Did you know that "
"four union organizers disappeared prior to the vote?  I bet you didn't.  Are "
"you wondering why none of this was reported?  So am I."
msgstr ""
"ASOMBROSO: SOMBRAS EN EL PARAÍSO. Asombroso, una empresa de desarrollo "
"tecnológico que ha pasado de la nada a ser un nombre conocido en todo Estados "
"Unidos en los últimos dos años, ha sido un tema recurrente desde que entró en "
"escena. Todos conocemos a James Hawthorne y su carismática combinación de "
"chistes sarcásticos y observaciones perspicaces. Todo el mundo ha visto sus "
"tuits, y su charla TED se hizo viral el año pasado. Sin embargo, detrás de la "
"cortina de humo se esconden prácticas laborales que han dejado a los "
"empleados marcados y, en algunos casos, incapacitados permanentemente para "
"trabajar. ¿Sabías que la fábrica de Asombroso en Portland intentó sin éxito "
"sindicarse el mes pasado? Apuesto a que no. ¿Sabías que cuatro organizadores "
"del sindicato desaparecieron antes de la votación? Apuesto a que no. ¿Te "
"preguntas por qué no se informó de nada de esto? Yo también."

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "months_old_news"
msgid "SUPPORT THE COUNTRIES THAT SUPPORT YOURS - PRESIDENT"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "months_old_news"
msgid ""
"SUPPORT THE COUNTRIES THAT SUPPORT YOURS - PRESIDENT: Earlier today, in an "
"unexpected and unpopular decision, the president suggested the possible "
"institution of a peacetime draft in response to increasing Chinese aggression "
"towards Taiwan and the Philippines.  \"We must pray for the best while "
"preparing for the worst.  We cannot abandon key allies in the face of Chinese "
"bullying.\""
msgstr ""
"SOPORTE A LOS PAÍSES QUE SOPORTAN AL SUYO - PRESIDENTE: Hoy temprano, en una "
"decisión inesperada e impopular, el presidente sugirió la posible institución "
"de un proyecto de paz en respuesta a la creciente agresión de china hacia "
"Taiwán y Filipinas. \"Debemos rezar para que ocurra lo mejor mientras nos "
"preparamos para lo peor. No podemos abandonar a los aliados clave ante la "
"intimidación china\"."

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "months_old_news"
msgid "EVACS UNSTOCKED: TRUTH OR FICTION?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "months_old_news"
msgid ""
"EVACS UNSTOCKED: TRUTH OR FICTION?  An unidentified government source has "
"suggested that the evacuation centers are unstocked, having \"already "
"accomplished the goal of calming the people\".  He later retracted the "
"comment and is unable to be contacted."
msgstr ""
"EVACUADOS DESABASTECIDOS: ¿REALIDAD O FICCIÓN? Una fuente del gobierno que no "
"se identificó ha sugerido que los centros de evacuación están desabastecidos, "
"luego de haber \"cumplido con el objetivo de calmar a la gente\". Luego "
"desmintió haberlo dicho y ahora no es posible contactarse con él."

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "months_old_news"
msgid "SPIKE IN MENTAL HEALTH CONCERNS HAS EPIDEMIOLOGISTS WORRIED"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "months_old_news"
msgid ""
"SPIKE IN MENTAL HEALTH CONCERNS HAS EPIDEMIOLOGISTS WORRIED.  \"There's no "
"doubt about it,\" said a spokesperson from Mount Sinai Hospital.  \"Hospitals "
"over the US are overwhelmed with an increase in psychiatrically-related "
"violent behavior such as explosivity and aggressive paranoia.  The most "
"likely cause is a new street drug; we have yet to identify any commonality "
"between the affected people.\"\n"
"\n"
"Dr. Andrew Morton, a Harvard epidemiologist, has a different opinion.  "
"\"These people aren't drug users.  They're coming from all walks of life.  "
"Sure, there's a predilection for people who already have some mental illness, "
"but we're seeing perfectly normal people suddenly presenting with violent "
"explosive behavior.  I think the most likely cause is infectious: no other "
"pattern would fit this widespread an outbreak.\""
msgstr ""
"EL AUMENTO DE LOS PROBLEMAS DE SALUD MENTAL HA INQUIETADO A LOS "
"EPIDEMIÓLOGOS. \"No hay duda al respecto\", dijo un portavoz del Hospital "
"Mount Sinai. \"Los hospitales de EE.UU. están abrumados por el aumento de "
"comportamientos violentos relacionados con la psiquiatría como la "
"explosividad y la paranoia agresiva. La causa más probable es una nueva droga "
"callejera; todavía no hemos identificado ningún elemento en común entre las "
"personas afectadas\".\n"
"\n"
"El Dr. Andrew Morton, un epidemiólogo de Harvard, tiene una opinión "
"diferente. \"Estas personas no son consumidores de drogas. Vienen de todos "
"los ámbitos de la vida. Por supuesto, hay una predilección por la gente que "
"ya tiene alguna enfermedad mental, pero estamos viendo gente perfectamente "
"normal que de repente presenta un comportamiento explosivo violento. Creo que "
"la causa más probable es infecciosa: ningún otro patrón encaja con esta "
"expansión salvo la de una epidemia\"."

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "months_old_news"
msgid "UFO CRASH: TRUTH OR FICTION?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "months_old_news"
msgid ""
"UFO CRASH: TRUTH OR FICTION?  One civilian account claims a shining disk "
"appeared in his field.  \"It kind of glowed, and I could see a strange gray "
"world through it.  Then a shambling hazy purple mushroom came through, man.\""
msgstr ""
"OVNI ESTRELLADO: ¿REALIDAD O FICCIÓN? Un civil asegura que un disco brillante "
"apareció en su campo. \"Más o menos brillaba, y pude ver un mundo raro y gris "
"a través de él. Después, un hongo púrpura borroso y desordenado salió de "
"adentro, loco.\""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "months_old_news"
msgid "TIME TRAVEL: TRUTH OR FICTION?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "months_old_news"
msgid ""
"TIME TRAVEL: TRUTH OR FICTION?  Leaked federal documents describe the "
"formation of a new federal agency called XEDRA, to oversee \"4th Axis "
"technology\" already in use.  Our expert's opinion suggests time-travel or "
"parallel worlds.  The meaning of the acronym is currently unknown."
msgstr ""
"VIAJE EN EL TIEMPO: ¿VERDAD O FICCIÓN? Documentos federales filtrados "
"describen la formación de una nueva agencia federal llamada XEDRA, para "
"supervisar la \"tecnología del 4º Eje\" ya en uso. La opinión de nuestro "
"experto sugiere viajes en el tiempo o mundos paralelos. El significado de las "
"siglas es actualmente desconocido."

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "months_old_news"
msgid "EDITORIAL: THE CHINESE CONTROL OUR MEDIA"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "months_old_news"
msgid ""
"EDITORIAL: THE CHINESE CONTROL OUR MEDIA.  No, I don't mean they're writing "
"the articles, but there's no doubt in my mind our social media, from "
"FriendFace to Twitfeed to Eddit, is now run by Chinese influencers.  The real "
"question is not IF they're doing it, but HOW they're using this influence to "
"affect American minds."
msgstr ""
"EDITORIAL: LOS CHINOS CONTROLAN NUESTROS MEDIOS DE COMUNICACIÓN. No, no "
"quiero decir que escriban los artículos, pero no hay duda de que nuestros "
"medios sociales, desde FriendFace a Twitfeed y Eddit, están ahora dirigidos "
"por influencers chinos. La verdadera pregunta no es SI lo están haciendo, "
"sino COMO están usando esta influencia para afectar las mentes americanas."

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "months_old_news"
msgid "THE SOLDIER OF THE FUTURE, AT LAST"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "months_old_news"
msgid ""
"THE SOLDIER OF THE FUTURE, AT LAST.  The military's latest powered infantry "
"exoskeleton has been released for widespread, non-testing use.  Although "
"numbers are still very limited, official sources say that within two years "
"every infantry unit will have access to two powered exoskeletons for heavy "
"operations.  Within five, light exoskeletons will be the standard issue armor "
"for US ground forces.  \"This is going to put our military so far ahead of "
"the rest of the world, it's like we have guns while they have spears,\" "
"General Alex Findlay said in a press release.  The new armor is powered by a "
"proprietary fuel cell developed by the military and hoped to be ready for "
"civilian distribution in the next few years."
msgstr ""
"EL SOLDADO DEL FUTURO, POR FIN. El último exoesqueleto de infantería "
"impulsado por el ejército ha sido lanzado para un uso generalizado, sin "
"pruebas. Aunque los números son todavía muy limitados, fuentes oficiales "
"dicen que dentro de dos años cada unidad de infantería tendrá acceso a dos "
"exoesqueletos con motor para operaciones pesadas. Dentro de cinco, los "
"exoesqueletos ligeros serán el blindaje estándar de las fuerzas terrestres de "
"EE.UU. \"Esto va a poner a nuestro ejército tan por delante del resto del "
"mundo, que es como si tuviéramos armas mientras ellos tienen lanzas\", dijo "
"el general Alex Findlay en un comunicado de prensa. La nueva armadura se "
"alimenta de una pila de combustible patentada desarrollada por el ejército y "
"se espera que esté lista para su distribución civil en los próximos años."

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "months_old_news"
msgid "INCREASE IN \"MONSTER\" SIGHTINGS HAS EXPERTS BAFFLED"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "months_old_news"
msgid ""
"INCREASE IN \"MONSTER\" SIGHTINGS HAS EXPERTS BAFFLED.  A tenfold spike in "
"sightings of unexplained phenomena, particularly fantastic beasts and "
"monsters, has experts confused.  \"This could be related to the recent rise "
"in hallucinations,\" said Dr. Barb Coulson in an interview on web-based "
"debate show ContraPoints on Friday.  \"It's probably drugs,\" replied debate "
"partner Leanne Jefferson, a spokesperson from MADD.  \"You're both idiots,\" "
"moderator Natalie Wynn interjected.  \"The obvious answer is that it's "
"monsters walking the Earth, preparing to kill us all.\""
msgstr ""
"EL AUMENTO DE AVISTAMIENTOS DE \"MONSTRUOS\" TIENE A LOS EXPERTOS "
"DESCONCERTADOS. Un aumento de diez veces en los avistamientos de fenómenos "
"inexplicables, particularmente bestias y monstruos fantásticos, ha confundido "
"a los expertos. \"Esto podría estar relacionado con el reciente aumento de "
"alucinaciones\", dijo la Dra. Barb Coulson en una entrevista en el programa "
"de debate en la web ContraPuntos el viernes. \"Probablemente sean drogas\", "
"respondió la compañera de debate Leanne Jefferson, portavoz de MADD. \"Ambos "
"son idiotas\", intervino la moderadora Natalie Wynn. \"La respuesta obvia es "
"que son monstruos que caminan por la Tierra, preparándose para matarnos a "
"todos.\""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "months_old_news"
msgid "FOODPLACE PANTS FEUD"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "months_old_news"
msgid ""
"FOODPLACE PANTS FEUD.  An ongoing legal battle between popular fast food "
"megalith Foodplace and the non-profit Concerned Consumers of Foodpeople has "
"ended with the determination that the Foodperson costume will remain a "
"gender-neutral, nonrevealing unitard.  \"Superheroes are meant to have "
"exaggerated anatomy and revealing costumes,\" a spokesperson from CCF said in "
"a press release.  \"This is a sad day not just for fans of Foodplace, but for "
"consumers of the fast-food superhero genre overall.\"  A spokesperson from "
"rival food company NourishMart sent out a press release just minutes after "
"the ruling: \"NOURISHMART INFORMS THE PUBLIC THAT NOURISHMARTIC DOES NOT WEAR "
"ANY CLOTHES.  NOURISHMARTIC IS SOFTWARE.  NOURISHMARTIC CAN PRESENT AN AVATAR "
"OF WHATEVER APPEALING MEAT-FORM IS DESIRED BY THE PUBLIC.  EAT AT "
"NOURISHMART.  OUR PRODUCTS CONTAIN A MIX OF FAT, SALT, AND PROTEIN THAT IS "
"HIGHLY DESIRABLE TO HUMAN PALATES.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "months_old_news"
msgid "ASIAN AGENTS RESPONSIBLE FOR \"MONSTER\" ATTACKS"
msgstr "AGENTES ASIÁTICOS RESPONSABLES DE LOS ATAQUES \"MONSTRUOSOS\""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "months_old_news"
msgid ""
"ASIAN AGENTS RESPONSIBLE FOR \"MONSTER\" ATTACKS.  Sources have confirmed "
"with photographic evidence that the rise in 'monster' sightings and attacks "
"recently is the work of hostile Eastern agents believed to originate in "
"either China or North Korea.  The government has refused to respond to "
"evidence provided by our investigative journalist team proving that "
"hallucinogenic gases and puppets were used to spawn the widely circulated "
"social media phenomenon."
msgstr ""
"AGENTES ASIÁTICOS RESPONSABLES DE LOS ATAQUES DE \"MONSTRUOS\". Las fuentes "
"han confirmado con pruebas fotográficas que el aumento de los avistamientos y "
"ataques de \"monstruos\" recientemente es obra de agentes orientales hostiles "
"que se cree que son originarios de China o Corea del Norte. El Gobierno se ha "
"negado a responder a las pruebas aportadas por nuestro equipo de periodistas "
"de investigación que demuestran que se utilizaron gases alucinógenos y "
"marionetas para engendrar el fenómeno de los medios de comunicación social de "
"amplia difusión."

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "months_old_news"
msgid "RIOTS CONTINUE IN SOUTH AMERICA, AFRICA"
msgstr "CONTINÚAN LOS DISTURBIOS EN SUDAMÉRICA Y ÁFRICA"

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "months_old_news"
msgid ""
"RIOTS CONTINUE IN SOUTH AMERICA, AFRICA.  Although reports are inconsistent, "
"it has been confirmed that widespread rioting in poverty-stricken regions of "
"Africa and South America, as well as some parts of Indonesia, Asia, the "
"Middle East, and Eastern Europe, have continued and only grown in severity.  "
"\"It's obvious this is a social media effect,\" said political science "
"professor Dr. Ely Savage.  \"Economists have been saying for some time that "
"the current situation of developed nations forcing underdeveloped nations "
"into semi-slavery couldn't last, and now we're seeing the repercussions.\""
msgstr ""
"CONTINÚAN LOS DISTURBIOS EN AMÉRICA DEL SUR, ÁFRICA. Aunque los informes no "
"son coherentes, se ha confirmado que los disturbios generalizados en las "
"regiones de África y América del Sur afectadas por la pobreza, así como en "
"algunas partes de Indonesia, Asia, el Oriente Medio y Europa oriental, han "
"continuado y aumentado en intensidad. \"Es obvio que se trata de un efecto de "
"las redes sociales\", dijo el profesor de ciencias políticas Dr. Ely Savage. "
"\"Los economistas han estado diciendo durante algún tiempo que la situación "
"actual de las naciones desarrolladas forzando a las naciones subdesarrolladas "
"a la semi-esclavitud no podía durar, y ahora estamos viendo las "
"repercusiones\"."

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "months_old_news"
msgid "RIOT IN CARLHAVEN"
msgstr "DISTURBIOS EN CARLHAVEN"

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "months_old_news"
msgid ""
"RIOT IN CARLHAVEN.  A riot broke out in a supermarket in Carlhaven, Nebraska, "
"today.  A bystander who left the scene as violence started told police that "
"it began with a dispute over the last box of frozen Foodplace hamburger "
"patties, but quickly escalated \"For no reason at all\".  Police arrived on "
"the scene and were quickly forced to deploy less-lethal weaponry in response "
"to what was described by Sheriff Paul Redekopp as \"A complete sh*t show\".  "
"Seven people are dead, and another six in critical condition in Carlhaven "
"General Hospital."
msgstr ""
"DISTURBIOS EN CARLHAVEN. Hoy ha estallado un motín en un supermercado de "
"Carlhaven, Nebraska. Un transeúnte que abandonó la escena cuando comenzó la "
"violencia dijo a la policía que comenzó con una disputa por la última caja de "
"hamburguesas congeladas de Comidalugar, pero que rápidamente se intensificó "
"\"sin ningún motivo\". La policía llegó al lugar y se vio obligada a "
"desplegar rápidamente armamento poco letal en respuesta a lo que el sheriff "
"Paul Redekopp describió como \"un completo caos\". Siete personas han muerto, "
"y otras seis están en estado crítico en el Hospital General de Carlhaven."

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "months_old_news"
msgid "RIOT IN BANKSLEY"
msgstr "DISTURBIOS EN BANKSLEY"

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "months_old_news"
msgid ""
"RIOT IN BANKSLEY.  Irony was hot and dangerous in Banksley, Vermont today, "
"where a fight broke out in a local coffee shop, reportedly starting over a "
"dispute about the details of a similar riot in Carlhaven, Nebraska.  Within "
"an hour, the fight had expanded to engulf the local downtown core.  Danielle "
"Louiston, a server who fled the scene, was available for phone interview.  "
"\"It was like nothin' I've ever seen,\" describes Danielle.  \"One minute "
"it's a normal Friday morning, the next it's a bar brawl.  By the time I got "
"outta there, most of the restaurant was involved.  I got in my car and just "
"bolted home, then called the cops.  Turns out they're all in the fight!  The "
"secretary and I, we got hold of the military and finally they came in and "
"cleared things up.\"  Stabilizing the riots required the dispatch of three "
"National Guard units.  Casualty reports are, as yet, unavailable."
msgstr ""
"DISTURBIOS EN BANKSLEY. Hoy, la situación en Banksley, Vermont, se ha "
"caldeado y se ha vuelto peligrosa, tras estallar una pelea en una cafetería "
"local, supuestamente a raíz de una disputa sobre los detalles de unos "
"disturbios similares ocurridos en Carlhaven, Nebraska. En menos de una hora, "
"la pelea se había extendido hasta abarcar todo el centro de la ciudad. "
"Danielle Louiston, una camarera que huyó del lugar, ha concedido una "
"entrevista telefónica. «Nunca había visto nada igual», describe Danielle. "
"\"En un minuto parecía una mañana de viernes normal y, al siguiente, se había "
"convertido en una pelea de bar. Cuando salí de allí, la mayor parte del "
"restaurante estaba enzarzada en la pelea. Me metí en el coche y me fui "
"corriendo a casa, y luego llamé a la policía. ¡Resulta que todos estaban en "
"la pelea! La secretaria y yo contactamos con el ejército y finalmente "
"vinieron y pusieron orden. Para controlar los disturbios fue necesario enviar "
"tres unidades de la Guardia Nacional. Aún no se dispone de informes sobre el "
"número de víctimas."

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "months_old_news"
msgid "ECONOMIC RIOTING SPREADS TO UNITED STATES"
msgstr "LOS DISTURBIOS ECONÓMICOS SE EXTIENDEN A ESTADOS UNIDOS"

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "months_old_news"
msgid ""
"ECONOMIC RIOTING SPREADS TO UNITED STATES.  Global economic riots, started in "
"Africa and South America, have spread to the continental United States.  More "
"than thirty riots were reported over the weekend, primarily in poorer regions "
"of the Midwest and South.  \"I don't think this is related to what happened "
"in Carlhaven or Banksley,\" a spokesperson from the National Guard said in "
"response to media inquiry.  \"Those were isolated incidents, while this is "
"very clearly a coordinated social media effort.\"  Police and the National "
"Guard are containing riots as they crop up.  President Oswald, in a speech on "
"Sunday evening, reminded Americans of our solidarity.  \"Enemies perch at our "
"every border, watching for signs of weakness.  Now is not the time to shoot "
"ourselves in the feet.\""
msgstr ""
"LOS DISTURBIOS ECONÓMICOS SE EXTIENDEN A LOS ESTADOS UNIDOS. Los disturbios "
"económicos mundiales, que comenzaron en África y América del Sur, se han "
"extendido a los Estados Unidos continentales. Más de treinta disturbios "
"fueron reportados durante el fin de semana, principalmente en las regiones "
"más pobres del medio oeste y el sur. \"No creo que esto esté relacionado con "
"lo que ocurrió en Carlhaven o Banksley\", dijo un portavoz de la Guardia "
"Nacional en respuesta a la pregunta de los medios de comunicación. \"Esos "
"fueron incidentes aislados, mientras que esto es claramente un esfuerzo "
"coordinado en las redes sociales.\" La policía y la Guardia Nacional están "
"conteniendo los disturbios mientras aparecen. El presidente Oswald, en un "
"discurso el domingo por la noche, recordó a los americanos nuestra "
"solidaridad. \"Los enemigos se posan en cada una de nuestras fronteras, "
"buscando signos de debilidad. Ahora no es el momento de pegarnos un tiro a "
"nosotros mismos\"."

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "months_old_news"
msgid "THE MAN BEHIND THE RIOTS"
msgstr "EL HOMBRE DETRÁS DE LOS DISTURBIOS"

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "months_old_news"
msgid ""
"THE MAN BEHIND THE RIOTS.  [Photograph: Interpol identification photograph of "
"Qiang Ye, taken in Maastricht airport in June, 2019.]  Our sources in the UN "
"have informed reporters that the investigative committee in charge of the "
"riots currently engulfing most of the world, nicknamed the \"FriendFace "
"Riots\" for the role of social media in spreading the violence, are the work "
"of a discredited Chinese hacker and alleged intelligence agent, Qiang Ye.  Ye "
"is wanted by Interpol for his involvement in a cyberterror attack on Dutch "
"banks in 2018 that led to billions of dollars of losses for European banks.  "
"The Chinese government has disavowed any connection to Ye since 2015.  \"One "
"man, with an army of well-programmed bots at his control, could certainly be "
"behind this,\" said Dr. Ely Savage, a professor of political science at "
"Berkeley and our expert correspondent on the riots.  \"Social media is very "
"susceptible to this sort of influence.\""
msgstr ""
"EL HOMBRE DETRÁS DE LOS DISTURBIOS. [Fotografía: Fotografía de identificación "
"de la Interpol de Qiang Ye, tomada en el aeropuerto de Maastricht en junio de "
"2019.] Nuestras fuentes en la ONU han informado a los periodistas que el "
"comité de investigación a cargo de los disturbios que se están produciendo en "
"la mayor parte del mundo, apodado \"Disturbios FriendFace\" por el papel de "
"las redes sociales en la difusión de la violencia, son el trabajo de un "
"desacreditado hacker chino y presunto agente de inteligencia, Qiang Ye. Ye es "
"buscado por la Interpol por su participación en un ataque cibernético contra "
"bancos holandeses en 2018 que provocó miles de millones de dólares en "
"pérdidas para los bancos europeos. El gobierno chino ha negado cualquier "
"conexión con Ye desde 2015. \"Un hombre, con un ejército de robots bien "
"programados bajo su control, podría ciertamente estar detrás de esto\", dijo "
"el Dr. Ely Savage, profesor de ciencias políticas en Berkeley y nuestro "
"experto corresponsal sobre los disturbios. \"Las redes sociales son muy "
"susceptibles a este tipo de influencia.\""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "months_old_news"
msgid "VIOLENT OUTBREAKS CAUSED BY DRUG CONTAMINATION"
msgstr "VIOLENTOS ESTALLIDOS CAUSADOS POR CONTAMINACIÓN DE DROGAS"

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "months_old_news"
msgid ""
"VIOLENT OUTBREAKS CAUSED BY DRUG CONTAMINATION: Reports of riots being a "
"social media effect were disputed today by NSA spokesperson Colonel Shawn "
"Singer.  \"These are isolated incidents.  There is no evidence of any social "
"media articles that are causing them, here or abroad.  The violence is random "
"and senseless.  We are currently investigating a promising theory that a "
"malicious contamination effect of the street drug methothexazole, known as "
"'Forbidden City', is responsible.  Whatever the cause, the National Guard has "
"these riots very well contained.\""
msgstr ""
"BROTES VIOLESTOS CAUSADOS POR LA CONTAMINACIÓN DE DROGAS: Los informes de los "
"disturbios como un efecto de las redes sociales fueron discutidos hoy por el "
"portavoz de la NSA, el coronel Shawn Singer. \"Estos son incidentes aislados. "
"No hay evidencia de ningún artículo en redes sociales que estén causandolos, "
"aquí o en el extranjero. La violencia es aleatoria y sin sentido. Actualmente "
"estamos investigando una teoría prometedora de que un efecto de contaminación "
"maligna de la droga callejera metoxazol, conocida como 'Ciudad Prohibida', es "
"responsable. Cualquiera que sea la causa, la Guardia Nacional tiene estos "
"disturbios muy bien contenidos\"."

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "months_old_news"
msgid "EDITORIAL: FORGET DRUGS OR FRIENDFACE, THESE ARE THE GAMER RIOTS"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "months_old_news"
msgid ""
"EDITORIAL: FORGET DRUGS OR FRIENDFACE, THESE ARE THE GAMER RIOTS.  I can't "
"believe how many idiots are wasting their time blaming social media or drugs "
"on the riots we're facing when the answer is obvious: this is the result of "
"letting our kids fall to the moral iniquity of video games.  Just last week I "
"saw my kid playing one of those stupid bleep-bloop games, all letters and "
"numbers and symbols.  When I asked him what he was doing it was absolutely "
"appalling.  Violence.  Cannibalism.  Humans as cattle.  Mermaid abuse.  "
"Yesterday, he was arrested for participating in the riots.  Coincidence?  "
"Pretty obviously not.  Our government is in the pocket of these video game "
"developers, and we're all paying the price."
msgstr ""
"EDITORIAL: OLVIDA LAS DROGAS O FRIENDFACE, ESTOS SON LAS REVUELTAS DE LOS "
"JUGADORES. No puedo creer cuántos idiotas pierden el tiempo culpando a las "
"redes sociales o a las drogas en los disturbios que enfrentamos cuando la "
"respuesta es obvia: este es el resultado de dejar que nuestros hijos caigan "
"en la maldad moral de los videojuegos. La semana pasada vi a mi hijo jugando "
"a uno de esos estúpidos juegos de \"bleep-bloop\", todos con letras, números "
"y símbolos. Cuando le pregunté qué estaba haciendo fue absolutamente "
"espantoso. Violencia. Canibalismo. Humanos como ganado. Abuso de sirenas. "
"Ayer fue arrestado por participar en los disturbios. ¿Coincidencia? "
"Obviamente no. Nuestro gobierno está en el bolsillo de estos desarrolladores "
"de videojuegos, y todos estamos pagando el precio."

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "months_old_news"
msgid "MORE ORDAINED MINISTERS NEEDED"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "months_old_news"
msgid ""
"MORE ORDAINED MINISTERS NEEDED.  Wedlock is down, but last minute nuptials, "
"elopements, vow-renewals and 'micromonies' have been on the rise, supposedly "
"in response to many of the recent events and uneasing developments as more "
"people are feeling less secure about dating in these troubled times, "
"therefore rushing to the altar in preparation for the worst, or to cross "
"items off the bucket list before it's too late.  As a result, the nation is "
"experiencing a shortage of marriage officiants.  Luckily, now more than ever, "
"since the beginning of the 21st century it's become increasingly easier to "
"become qualified to help couples of all kinds celebrate their commitment to "
"each other.  However, not enough people are rising to the occasion."
msgstr ""
"NECESITAMOS MÁS MINISTROS ORDENADOS El número de matrimonios ha disminuido, "
"pero han aumentado las bodas de última hora, las fugas, las renovaciones de "
"votos y las \"micromonías\", supuestamente como respuesta a muchos de los "
"acontecimientos recientes y a los inquietantes sucesos, ya que cada vez más "
"personas se sienten menos seguras a la hora de salir con alguien en estos "
"tiempos difíciles, por lo que se precipitan hacia el altar preparándose para "
"lo peor, o para tachar cosas de la lista de deseos antes de que sea demasiado "
"tarde. Como resultado, el país está experimentando una escasez de oficiales "
"matrimoniales. Por suerte, ahora más que nunca, desde principios del siglo "
"XXI es cada vez más fácil cualificarse para ayudar a parejas de todo tipo a "
"celebrar su compromiso mutuo. Sin embargo, no hay suficientes personas a la "
"altura de las circunstancias."

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "months_old_news"
msgid "BUNKERS OF THE RICH AND FAMOUS"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "months_old_news"
msgid ""
"BUNKERS OF THE RICH AND FAMOUS.  Forget the backwater \"Last Man on Earth\" "
"shelter you helped your buddy pour the foundations for.  We got a look inside "
"the private bunker of James Hawthorne himself!  Ever wonder what it would "
"feel like to weather a disaster in style?  Wonder no more."
msgstr ""
"BÚNKERES DE LOS RICOS Y FAMOSOS. Olvídate del refugio del \"último hombre en "
"la Tierra\" al que ayudaste a tu amigo a echar los cimientos. Hemos echado un "
"vistazo al búnker privado del mismísimo James Hawthorne. ¿Te has preguntado "
"alguna vez qué se siente al capear un desastre con estilo? No te lo preguntes "
"más."

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "months_old_news"
msgid "POLICE TO INVESTIGATE SHADY HILLS"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "months_old_news"
#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_recent_news"
#. ~ This category roughly lines up with Cataclysm's news segments newer than
#. a few months and contains some of the same snippets.
msgid ""
"POLICE TO INVESTIGATE SHADY HILLS.  There will be a \"thorough "
"investigation\" into the Shady Hills nursing home, owned by Shady Hills "
"Corporation, said police Monday.  The announcement came following several "
"lawsuits launching against the home by family members of residents for "
"alleged elder abuse and neglect."
msgstr ""
"LA POLICÍA INVESTIGARÁ COLINAS SOMBRIAS. Se llevará a cabo una "
"\"investigación minuciosa\" en el hogar de ancianos de Colinas Sombrias "
"propiedad de la Empresa Colinas Sombrias, según informó la policía el lunes "
"pasado. El anuncio vino luego de varias demandas judiciales en contra del "
"hogar por parte de familiares de los residentes que alegan abusos y "
"negligencias."

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "weeks_old_news"
#. ~ Around the start of April
msgid "SURGEON GENERAL: DEAD ARE STAYING DEAD"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "weeks_old_news"
#. ~ Around the start of April
msgid ""
"SURGEON GENERAL: DEAD ARE STAYING DEAD: \"Stories about the dead rising are "
"completely unfounded and medically impossible.\", the office of the surgeon "
"general said in a press conference today.  \"It's an obvious hoax by people "
"just looking for five minutes of fame, or to scare people in these uncertain "
"times.  After all, remember the clown thing a few years ago?\"  A critic "
"pointed to the increasingly widespread viral videos of rioters with clearly "
"fatal injuries rising to return to the rioting.  \"Within ten hours, someone "
"will have deep faked this video to make me look like a Star Wars character,\" "
"replied the spokesperson, \"and you're confused by a bit of home grown CGI "
"showing zombies?\""
msgstr ""
"CIRUJANO GENERAL: LOS MUERTOS ESTÁN PERMANECIENDO MUERTOS: \"Las historias "
"sobre los muertos que se levantan son completamente infundadas y médicamente "
"imposibles\", dijo la oficina del cirujano general en una conferencia de "
"prensa hoy. \"Es un engaño obvio de la gente que sólo busca cinco minutos de "
"fama, o para asustar a la gente en estos tiempos inciertos. Después de todo, "
"¿recuerdan el asunto del payaso de hace unos años?\" Un crítico señaló que "
"los videos virales cada vez más extendidos de los alborotadores con lesiones "
"claramente fatales se elevan para volver a los disturbios. \"Dentro de diez "
"horas, alguien habrá falsificado profundamente este video para hacerme "
"parecer un personaje de Star Wars\", respondió el portavoz, \"¿y estás "
"confundido por un poco de CGI casero que muestra zombis?\""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "weeks_old_news"
#. ~ Around the start of April
msgid "GENERAL SAYS AVOID BUNKERS"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "weeks_old_news"
#. ~ Around the start of April
msgid ""
"GENERAL SAYS AVOID BUNKERS: Even in riot affected areas, do not attempt to "
"flee to military bunkers or outposts!  Understaffed bunkers are defended by "
"automated turrets, which will shoot those without proper registration.  FEMA "
"has authorized use of emergency evacuation shelters for people seeking refuge "
"from riots."
msgstr ""
"EL GENERAL DICE QUE HAY QUE EVITAR LOS BÚNKERES: Incluso en las zonas "
"afectadas por los disturbios, no intenten huir a los búnkeres militares o "
"puestos de avanzada! Los búnkeres sin personal son defendidos por torretas "
"automatizadas, que disparan a los que no están registrados. FEMA ha "
"autorizado el uso de refugios de evacuación de emergencia para las personas "
"que buscan refugio de los disturbios."

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "weeks_old_news"
#. ~ Around the start of April
msgid "VIOLENCE OUTBREAKS ARE UNIVERSAL"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "weeks_old_news"
#. ~ Around the start of April
msgid ""
"VIOLENCE OUTBREAKS ARE UNIVERSAL.  Despite government efforts to claim the "
"situation is \"under control\", sources in the CDC have confirmed our own "
"investigative results: there are now major unchecked riots in every city in "
"the United States.  Similar reports are trickling in from countries across "
"the globe.  We recommend packing a bugout bag and heading to your cabin on "
"the lake, if you have one."
msgstr ""
"LOS BROTES DE VIOLENCIA SON UNIVERSALES. A pesar de los esfuerzos del "
"gobierno por afirmar que la situación está \"bajo control\", fuentes del CDC "
"han confirmado los resultados de nuestra propia investigación: ahora hay "
"importantes disturbios sin control en todas las ciudades de los Estados "
"Unidos. Informes similares están llegando de países de todo el mundo. "
"Recomendamos que preparen una mochilas de emergencia y se dirijan a su cabaña "
"en el lago, si es que tienen una."

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "weeks_old_news"
#. ~ Around the start of April
msgid "ZOMBIE DRUG?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "weeks_old_news"
#. ~ Around the start of April
msgid ""
"ZOMBIE DRUG?  A controversial blogger suggested the recent riots are a "
"chemical attack by China in her latest podcast.  \"They're jealous of our "
"military superiority, so they teamed up with Haiti to put hoodoo drugs in the "
"water making people zombies!  You've all heard of Forbidden City, who hasn't? "
" well, this is what they were testing, and now we're seeing it everywhere!\""
msgstr ""
"¿DROGA ZOMBIE? Una controvertida bloguera sugirió en su último podcast que "
"los recientes disturbios son un ataque químico de China. \"Están celosos de "
"nuestra superioridad militar, así que se aliaron con Haití para poner drogas "
"vudú en el agua, ¡convirtiendo a la gente en zombis! Todos habéis oído hablar "
"de la Ciudad Prohibida, ¿quién no? Pues esto es lo que estaban probando, ¡y "
"ahora lo estamos viendo por todas partes!\""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "weeks_old_news"
#. ~ Around the start of April
msgid "SUPERSOLDIER EXPERIMENTS GONE WRONG"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "weeks_old_news"
#. ~ Around the start of April
msgid ""
"SUPERSOLDIER EXPERIMENTS GONE WRONG.  Recently leaked documents from an "
"inside source in a hitherto unknown government agency abbreviated 'XEDRA' "
"confirm that violent riots across the country are the result of an "
"accidentally released self-replicating supersoldier serum.  The serum gives "
"people unprecedented strength and durability, even regenerative capacity, but "
"has the dangerous side effect of causing uncontrolled anger.  Although the "
"leak suggests that the effect should wear off, it may take weeks or even "
"months to reach a stable state."
msgstr ""
"EXPERIMENTOS CON SUPERSOLDADOS QUE SALIERON MAL. Documentos recientemente "
"filtrados de una fuente interna en una agencia gubernamental hasta ahora "
"desconocida, abreviada 'XEDRA', confirman que los violentos disturbios en "
"todo el país son el resultado de un suero de supersoldado auto-replicante "
"liberado accidentalmente. El suero da a las personas una fuerza y durabilidad "
"sin precedentes, incluso capacidad de regeneración, pero tiene el peligroso "
"efecto secundario de causar una ira incontrolada. Aunque la fuga sugiere que "
"el efecto debería desaparecer, puede tardar semanas o incluso meses en "
"alcanzar un estado estable."

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "weeks_old_news"
#. ~ Around the start of April
msgid "DISTURBING VIDEO SHOWS PSYCHOTIC RIOTERS"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "weeks_old_news"
#. ~ Around the start of April
msgid ""
"DISTURBING VIDEO SHOWS PSYCHOTIC RIOTERS.  We've all known something was "
"really wrong for a while.  A new, extremely disturbing video has been making "
"the social media rounds in a shocking way.  It depicts a young woman amidst "
"the riots violently and fatally attacking a girl that appears to be her own "
"small daughter.  To many, this is the last straw that confirms a dreadful "
"suspicion: these riots are not the result of some social unrest, but "
"represent a complete breakdown of rationality."
msgstr ""
"UN VIDEO PERTURBADOR MUESTRA ALBOROTADORES PSICÓTICOS. Todos hemos sabido que "
"algo estaba realmente mal desde hace tiempo. Un nuevo y extremadamente "
"perturbador video ha estado rondando por las redes sociales de una manera "
"impactante. Muestra a una joven en medio de los disturbios atacando violenta "
"y fatalmente a una niña que parece ser su propia hija pequeña. Para muchos, "
"esta es la gota que colma el vaso y confirma una terrible sospecha: estos "
"disturbios no son el resultado de un malestar social, sino que representan "
"una completa ruptura de la racionalidad."

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "weeks_old_news"
#. ~ Around the start of April
msgid "GOVERNMENT SPEAKS OUT ABOUT 'MIND CONTROL' RUMORS"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "weeks_old_news"
#. ~ Around the start of April
msgid ""
"GOVERNMENT SPEAKS OUT ABOUT 'MIND CONTROL' RUMORS.  Amidst rumors that "
"nation- and world-wide riots are the result of a chemical mind control agent, "
"the NSA held a press conference today.  \"This is not mind control.  These "
"rioters are human beings, normal people, controlled only by feverish violence "
"at a level we've never seen before,\" said a flustered looking "
"representative.  \"Although in some places excessive force has been required "
"to deter rioters, we are treating them as the humans they are, not as some "
"faceless mind-controlled horde.  This is not science fiction, these are our "
"friends and family.\""
msgstr ""
"EL GOBIERNO HABLA DE RUMORES DE \"CONTROL MENTAL\". En medio de los rumores "
"de que los disturbios a nivel nacional y mundial son el resultado de un "
"agente químico de control mental, la NSA celebró una conferencia de prensa "
"hoy. \"Esto no es control mental. Estos alborotadores son seres humanos, "
"gente normal, controlados sólo por una violencia febril a un nivel que nunca "
"hemos visto antes\", dijo un representante de aspecto nervioso. \"Aunque en "
"algunos lugares se ha requerido una fuerza excesiva para disuadir a los "
"alborotadores, los estamos tratando como los humanos que son, no como una "
"horda sin rostro controlada por la mente. Esto no es ciencia ficción, estos "
"son nuestros amigos y familiares.\""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "weeks_old_news"
#. ~ Around the start of April
msgid "THEY FLY THE SKIES"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "weeks_old_news"
#. ~ Around the start of April
msgid ""
"THEY FLY THE SKIES.  It spreads its wings and the sun blocks out.  It strikes "
"the helicopter from the sky with a simple wave of its claw.  It rains spittle "
"down on our faces and we dissolve.  They are coming.  They are coming.  They "
"are coming."
msgstr ""
"VUELAN LOS CIELOS. Extiende sus alas y el sol se bloquea. Golpea el "
"helicóptero desde el cielo con un simple movimiento de su garra. La lluvia "
"nos escupe en la cara y nos disolvemos. Ya vienen. Ya vienen. Ya vienen."

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "weeks_old_news"
#. ~ Around the start of April
msgid "YOUR BUG-OUT BAG"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "weeks_old_news"
#. ~ Around the start of April
msgid ""
"YOUR BUG-OUT BAG.  In this issue we focus on tips and tricks to packing your "
"bug-out bag.  Whether you're near an urban center or in a small town, if you "
"don't already have an emergency kit, you need one while supplies are still "
"available.  Don't be the one person caught without a lighter when you need a "
"fire!"
msgstr ""
"TU MOCHILA DE EMERGENCIA. En este número nos centramos en los consejos y "
"trucos para preparar su mochila de emergencia. Ya sea que esté cerca de un "
"centro urbano o en un pueblo pequeño, si no tienes un kit de emergencia, "
"necesitas uno mientras haya suministros disponibles. No seas la única persona "
"que se quede sin mechero cuando necesites un fuego!"

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "weeks_old_news"
#. ~ Around the start of April
msgid "EDITORIAL: MY MOM, THE RIOTER"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "weeks_old_news"
#. ~ Around the start of April
msgid ""
"EDITORIAL: MY MOM, THE RIOTER.  My mother was one of the first of the rioters "
"in Jacksonville.  I've been wondering for a long time how a retired "
"sixty-seven year old woman with a passion for day lilies and knitting wound "
"up allegedly beating a police officer to death and getting thrown in a "
"containment tank.  Last week, against all odds and at great personal risk, I "
"managed to get her released into my care.  I thought I could calm her down.  "
"When they gave her to me, she was straitjacketed and masked, like Hannibal "
"Lecter.  When I got her home I tried to remove the bindings, and she almost "
"immediately tried to strangle me.  It was all I could do to tie her back up "
"and put her in the guest room.  She still eats and drinks when I give her "
"food, but I haven't seen her sleep.  I don't know what that thing is in "
"there, but it's not my mom.  I hope she comes back soon."
msgstr ""
"EDITORIAL: MI MADRE, LA ALBOROTADORA. Mi madre fue una de las primeras en "
"causar disturbios en Jacksonville. Me he preguntado durante mucho tiempo cómo "
"una mujer jubilada de 67 años, apasionada por los lirios de día y el tejido "
"de punto, terminó presuntamente golpeando a un oficial de policía hasta la "
"muerte y siendo arrojada a un tanque de contención. La semana pasada, contra "
"todo pronóstico y con un gran riesgo personal, me las arreglé para que la "
"pusieran a mi cuidado. Pensé que podría calmarla. Cuando me la entregaron, "
"estaba en camisa de fuerza y enmascarada, como Hannibal Lecter. Cuando la "
"llevé a casa intenté quitarle las ataduras, y casi inmediatamente trató de "
"estrangularme. Fue todo lo que pude hacer para atarla de nuevo y ponerla en "
"la habitación de invitados. Todavía come y bebe cuando le doy de comer, pero "
"no la he visto dormir. No sé qué es esa cosa de ahí, pero no es mi madre. "
"Espero que vuelva pronto."

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "weeks_old_news"
#. ~ Around the start of April
msgid "PSYCHIC EMANATIONS?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "weeks_old_news"
#. ~ Around the start of April
msgid ""
"PSYCHIC EMANATIONS?  A seemingly far-fetched theory about ongoing riots "
"sweeping the nation has been gaining traction after a leaked document about "
"experiments in magnetic control of brain-waves.  \"Two weeks ago, I'd have "
"told you this is ridiculous,\" said Dr. Andrew Morton, an epidemiologist and "
"our leading expert on the medical basis for the riots.  \"Now?  I'll consider "
"anything.  With the caveat that I don't think any of this is possible, "
"magnetic weaponry altering our brain waves and making people into crazy "
"violent psychopaths is more plausible than a lot of the theories running "
"around.  I certainly prefer this one to that 'zombies' suggestion from a few "
"days ago.\""
msgstr ""
"¿EMANACIONES PSÍQUICAS? Una teoría aparentemente descabellada sobre los "
"disturbios que están arrasando el país ha ido ganando adeptos tras la "
"filtración de un documento sobre experimentos de control magnético de las "
"ondas cerebrales. \"Hace dos semanas, te habría dicho que esto es ridículo\", "
"dijo el Dr. Andrew Morton, un epidemiólogo y nuestro principal experto en la "
"base médica de los disturbios. \"¿Ahora? Consideraré cualquier cosa. Con la "
"advertencia de que no creo que nada de esto sea posible, el armamento "
"magnético que altera nuestras ondas cerebrales y convierte a la gente en "
"psicópatas violentos y locos es más plausible que muchas de las teorías que "
"corren por ahí. Desde luego, prefiero ésta a la sugerencia de los \"zombis\" "
"de hace unos días\"."

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "weeks_old_news"
#. ~ Around the start of April
msgid "CHINESE SOLDIERS SPOTTED AMIDST RIOTERS"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "weeks_old_news"
#. ~ Around the start of April
msgid ""
"CHINESE SOLDIERS SPOTTED AMIDST RIOTERS.  Concerns that Chinese influence is "
"behind the riots sweeping North America were corroborated today by reports of "
"the appearance of PRC soldiers among the rioters in San Diego and San "
"Francisco, apparently unaffected by the otherwise uncontrolled frenzy of "
"violence.  The government continues to deny the truth."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "weeks_old_news"
#. ~ Around the start of April
msgid "IF YOU CAN'T BEAT 'EM"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "weeks_old_news"
#. ~ Around the start of April
msgid ""
"IF YOU CAN'T BEAT 'EM.  Riots continue to rage unchecked across the country, "
"maybe the world.  Here in our newsroom we've taken a poll, and it's agreed: "
"if you can't beat 'em, join 'em.  This will be our last issue, we're going "
"out there to show the government exactly what we think of their limp-wristed "
"failures."
msgstr ""
"SI NO PUEDES VENCERLOS. Los disturbios siguen causando estragos sin control "
"en todo el país, tal vez en el mundo. Aquí en nuestra sala de redacción hemos "
"hecho una encuesta y estamos de acuerdo: si no puedes vencerlos, únete a "
"ellos. Este será nuestro último número, vamos a salir para mostrarle al "
"gobierno lo que pensamos de sus fracasos."

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "weeks_old_news"
#. ~ Around the start of April
msgid "WATCH POWER ARMOR IN ACTION"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "weeks_old_news"
#. ~ Around the start of April
msgid ""
"WATCH POWER ARMOR IN ACTION.  The National Guard deployed a "
"recently-commissioned unit of heavy riot control power armor exoskeletons to "
"the front lines of the riots in Waterville, Maine.  This state of the art "
"armor is able to repel almost any attack from a civilian rioter, and has been "
"sent forward alongside infantry armed with pepper bullets and sponge rounds "
"to contain rioters.  \"It's an uphill battle, but we've still got it "
"contained,\" said Lieutenant Shawn Bhatti from inside his full-enclosure "
"suit.  \"I can subdue a dozen rioters in this thing, and I've got a dozen men "
"and women with me.\"  Video of the power armor in action will be streamed on "
"our website."
msgstr ""
"VEA LA ARMADURA DE ENERGÍA EN ACCIÓN. La Guardia Nacional desplegó una unidad "
"de exoesqueletos de armadura de energía pesada de control de disturbios en el "
"frente de los disturbios en Waterville, Maine. Esta armadura de última "
"generación es capaz de repeler casi cualquier ataque de un alborotador civil, "
"y ha sido enviada junto a la infantería armada con balas de pimienta y balas "
"de esponja para contener a los alborotadores. \"Es una batalla cuesta arriba, "
"pero aún así la tenemos contenida\", dijo el teniente Shawn Bhatti desde el "
"interior de su traje de recinto completo. \"Puedo someter a una docena de "
"alborotadores en esta cosa, y tengo una docena de hombres y mujeres "
"conmigo.\" El video de la armadura de energía en acción será transmitido en "
"nuestro sitio web."

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "weeks_old_news"
#. ~ Around the start of April
msgid "LETHAL FORCE DEPLOYED?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "weeks_old_news"
#. ~ Around the start of April
msgid ""
"LETHAL FORCE DEPLOYED?  Police and military forces deny the use of lethal "
"force in riot control, but reports do not seem to corroborate their claims.  "
"From videos of gunshot-riddled corpses to aberrant reports from some military "
"officials, it seems clear that at least in some areas, live fire turrets with "
"fully AI-driven threat recognition are being deployed to bolster an "
"overwhelmed military.  We reached Major Linda Pryce in Montpelier, Vermont, "
"for comment.  \"I don't ******* care what the orders are, I have men and "
"civilians that need protecting,\" she told our reporters.  \"These rioters "
"are worse than any insurgent I ever fought in Afghanistan, and I will use "
"whatever I can to keep them under control.\""
msgstr ""
"¿FUERZA LETAL DESPLEGADA? La policía y las fuerzas militares niegan el uso de "
"fuerza letal en el control de disturbios, pero los informes no parecen "
"corroborar sus afirmaciones. Desde videos de cadáveres acribillados a tiros "
"hasta informes aberrantes de algunos oficiales militares, parece claro que al "
"menos en algunas áreas, torretas de fuego real con reconocimiento de amenazas "
"totalmente impulsado por la IA están siendo desplegadas para reforzar un "
"ejército abrumado. Nos comunicamos con la Mayor Linda Pryce en Montpelier, "
"Vermont, para hacer comentarios. \"No me importa lo que las órdenes sean, "
"tengo hombres y civiles que necesitan protección\", dijo a nuestros "
"reporteros. \"Estos alborotadores son peores que cualquier insurgente que "
"haya luchado en Afganistán, y usaré todo lo que pueda para mantenerlos bajo "
"control\"."

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "weeks_old_news"
#. ~ Around the start of April
msgid "LOCAL EVACUATION ORDERS"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "weeks_old_news"
#. ~ Around the start of April
msgid ""
"LOCAL EVACUATION ORDERS.  FEMA has announced small-scale evacuations of "
"select centers where rioting is most intense.  \"This is a preventive "
"measure,\" Spokesperson Linda Garrison told our correspondent.  \"We expect "
"to have people home in a few days, but it's best we play it safe until then.\""
msgstr ""
"ÓRDENES DE EVACUACIÓN LOCALES. El FEMA ha anunciado evacuaciones a pequeña "
"escala de centros selectos donde los disturbios son más intensos. \"Esta es "
"una medida preventiva\", dijo la portavoz Linda Garrison a nuestro "
"corresponsal. \"Esperamos tener gente en casa en unos pocos días, pero es "
"mejor jugar a lo seguro hasta entonces\"."

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "weeks_old_news"
#. ~ Around the start of April
msgid "UNCANNY VALLEY"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "weeks_old_news"
#. ~ Around the start of April
msgid ""
"UNCANNY VALLEY.  Faced with accusations of malfeasance in his AI designs, "
"James Hawthorne appears to have *disappeared*.  Hawthorne could not be "
"reached for comment by any major news centers, as questions and even lawsuits "
"about dangerous flaws in his widespread law enforcement AI packages rise."
msgstr ""
"ASOMBROSO EN EL VALLE Ante las acusaciones de mala praxis en sus diseños de "
"IA, James Hawthorne parece haber *desaparecido*. Los principales centros de "
"noticias no han podido contactar con Hawthorne para que haga comentarios, a "
"medida que aumentan las preguntas e incluso las demandas sobre los peligrosos "
"fallos de sus paquetes de IA para el cumplimiento de la ley."

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "weeks_old_news"
#. ~ Around the start of April
msgid "ISS MUTINIES, ABANDONS STATION"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "weeks_old_news"
#. ~ Around the start of April
msgid ""
"ISS MUTINIES, ABANDONS STATION.  Making their demands known through amateur "
"radio communications, all astronauts and cosmonauts aboard the International "
"Space Station have demanded that NASA and ROSCOSMOS allow them to rejoin "
"their families amidst the recent riots and instability.  Claims have been "
"made that the agencies have shut them out of most controls aboard the "
"station, endangering the lives of all aboard when they were unable to respond "
"to a near-miss with orbital debris.  NASA officials have continued to make no "
"public statements regarding the demands, or the unconfirmed reports that the "
"docked spacecraft have been launched, *without* aid from ground control."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "weeks_old_news"
#. ~ Around the start of April
msgid "RHODE ISLAND DECLARES SECESSION"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "weeks_old_news"
#. ~ Around the start of April
msgid ""
"RHODE ISLAND DECLARES SECESSION!  In the midst of a nation-wide disaster, the "
"governor of Rhode Island has declared unilateral secession and war with the "
"government of the US.  \"My loyal Rhodians are withdrawing to Aquidneck and "
"Conanicut Islands,\" said governor Alex Ackerwith in a public announcement "
"this morning.  \"The US government has failed us.  Any attempt by the US to "
"intervene in our affairs will result in military action from the Narragansett "
"Government.  Frankly, I don't think they can get their shit together enough "
"to challenge us.\""
msgstr ""
"¡RHODE ISLAND DECLARA LA SECESIÓN! En medio de un desastre nacional, el "
"gobernador de Rhode Island ha declarado la secesión unilateral y la guerra "
"con el gobierno de los EE.UU. \"Mis leales ciudadadanos se retiran a las "
"islas Aquidneck y Conanicut\", dijo el gobernador Alex Ackerwith en un "
"anuncio público esta mañana. \"El gobierno de los EE.UU. nos ha fallado. "
"Cualquier intento de EE.UU. de intervenir en nuestros asuntos resultará en "
"una acción militar del gobierno de Narragansett. Francamente, no creo que "
"puedan resolver sus problemas en primer lugar para desafiarnos\"."

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "newest_news"
#. ~ Around April 15/16
msgid "GOVERNMENT FACILITIES BOMBED"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "newest_news"
#. ~ Around April 15/16
msgid ""
"GOVERNMENT FACILITIES BOMBED: In an apparent foreign attack (contradicting "
"earlier Department of Defense denials of the disaster being caused by Chinese "
"aggression) a coordinated bombing strike hit a wide number of US governmental "
"facilities simultaneously yesterday, as well as numerous locations in isolate "
"parts of the coastal United States.  A statement from the Pentagon has been "
"issued, stating the strikes were the result of Chinese opportunism during the "
"national crisis, and assured that action would be taken in kind against the "
"aggressors.  Allegations that these sites contained top-secret government "
"research facilities related to the disaster have been vehemently denied."
msgstr ""
"INSTALACIONES GUBERNAMENTALES BOMBARDEADAS: En un aparente ataque extranjero "
"(contradiciendo las anteriores negaciones del Departamento de Defensa sobre "
"el desastre causado por la agresión china), un ataque de bombardeo coordinado "
"golpeó ayer simultáneamente un amplio número de instalaciones gubernamentales "
"estadounidenses, así como numerosos lugares en partes aisladas de la costa de "
"los Estados Unidos. Se ha emitido una declaración del Pentágono en la que se "
"afirma que los ataques fueron el resultado del oportunismo chino durante la "
"crisis nacional y se asegura que se tomarán medidas en especie contra los "
"agresores. Se han negado con vehemencia las acusaciones de que estos sitios "
"contenían instalaciones de investigación gubernamentales de alto secreto "
"relacionadas con el desastre."

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "newest_news"
#. ~ Around April 15/16
msgid "RIOTS GROWING?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "newest_news"
#. ~ Around April 15/16
msgid ""
"RIOTS GROWING?  Communications with government forces have been muddled by a "
"large influx of aggressive armed individuals to nation-wide riots.  \"We have "
"this under control,\" says a local police chief.  \"We are authorizing our "
"forces to use lethal force on combative humans.  In the meantime, people are "
"advised to stay in their homes and avoid any contact with peacekeeping forces "
"to avoid friendly fire.\"  Riots are believed to be affecting cities "
"worldwide since at least three weeks ago."
msgstr ""
"¿CRECEN LOS DISTURBIOS? Las comunicaciones con las fuerzas gubernamentales se "
"han visto enturbiadas por la gran afluencia de personas armadas agresivas a "
"los disturbios en todo el país. \"Tenemos esto bajo control“, declara un jefe "
"de policía local. \"Estamos autorizando a nuestras fuerzas a utilizar la "
"fuerza letal contra los combatientes. Mientras tanto, se aconseja a la gente "
"que permanezca en sus casas y evite cualquier contacto con las fuerzas de paz "
"para evitar el fuego amigo.\" Se cree que los disturbios afectan a ciudades "
"de todo el mundo desde hace al menos tres semanas."

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "newest_news"
#. ~ Around April 15/16
msgid "EVACUATION ALERT"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "newest_news"
#. ~ Around April 15/16
msgid ""
"EVACUATION ALERT.  The Federal government has announced a formal evacuation "
"of all major centers, to pre-designated FEMA emergency shelters.  "
"Spokesperson Linda Garrison stated, \"This is not expected to be a permanent "
"issue.  By evacuating to the shelters and camps FEMA set up for just such a "
"situation, we can clamp down on riots without hurting uninvolved people.\"  "
"Garrison declined to comment on widespread allegations that the rioters are "
"under the influence of psychosis-inducing biological agents."
msgstr ""
"ALERTA DE EVACUACIÓN. El gobierno federal ha anunciado una evacuación formal "
"de todos los centros principales, a los refugios de emergencia pre-designados "
"por la FEMA. La portavoz Linda Garrison declaró: \"No se espera que esto sea "
"un problema permanente. Evacuando a los refugios y campamentos que FEMA ha "
"establecido para tal situación, podemos reprimir los disturbios sin lastimar "
"a la gente no involucrada\". La guarnición se negó a comentar las acusaciones "
"generalizadas de que los alborotadores están bajo la influencia de agentes "
"biológicos que inducen a la psicosis."

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "newest_news"
#. ~ Around April 15/16
msgid "RIOTERS MUTATING?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "newest_news"
#. ~ Around April 15/16
msgid ""
"RIOTERS MUTATING?  Eyewitnesses from the New England Disaster Area have "
"claimed that the allegedly psychotic rioters are displaying inhuman "
"qualities.  \"I swear to God, one of them was the size of a tree!\", said one "
"panicked survivor.  There are also reports of afflicted individuals with "
"acidic or electric properties.  CDC officials could not be reached for "
"comment."
msgstr ""
"¿LOS ALBOROTADORES ESTAN MUTANDO? Testigos oculares de la zona del desastre "
"de Nueva Inglaterra han afirmado que los presuntos alborotadores psicóticos "
"están mostrando cualidades inhumanas. \"¡Juro por Dios que uno de ellos era "
"del tamaño de un árbol!\", dijo un sobreviviente presa del pánico. También "
"hay informes de individuos afligidos con propiedades ácidas o eléctricas. Los "
"funcionarios del CDC no pudieron ser contactados para hacer comentarios."

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "newest_news"
#. ~ Around April 15/16
msgid "HELL ON EARTH?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "newest_news"
#. ~ Around April 15/16
msgid ""
"HELL ON EARTH?  Boston has been quarantined.  Prior to its complete lockdown, "
"our journalists received a concerning email from a colleague within the city, "
"describing horrendous and inhuman monsters walking the streets amidst the "
"rioters.  \"I don't know who started it, but we call it Hastur.  After the "
"horror novel.  The rioters fall in line behind it like soldiers, living and "
"dead.  Yeah, some of them are dead.  They're lying to us, they've all been "
"lying to us.\"  Our editor-in-chief demanded we keep this article from you.  "
"He has been deposed.  Rise up against the lies."
msgstr ""
"¿EL INFIERNO EN LA TIERRA? Boston ha sido puesto en cuarentena. Antes de su "
"cierre completo, nuestros periodistas recibieron un correo electrónico de un "
"colega de la ciudad, describiendo monstruos horribles e inhumanos caminando "
"por las calles en medio de los disturbios. \"No sé quién lo empezó, pero lo "
"llamamos Hastur. Por la novela de terror. Los alborotadores se alinean detrás "
"de ella como soldados, vivos y muertos. Sí, algunos de ellos están muertos. "
"Nos están mintiendo, todos nos han estado mintiendo\". Nuestro editor en jefe "
"exigió que ocultáramos este artículo. Ha sido destituido. Alzaos contra las "
"mentiras."

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "newest_news"
#. ~ Around April 15/16
msgid "PUBLIC SERVICE ANNOUNCEMENT: \"Aid Delayed\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "newest_news"
#. ~ Around April 15/16
msgid ""
"PUBLIC SERVICE ANNOUNCEMENT: \"Aid Delayed\".  Fighting by the military at "
"the edge of the New England Disaster Area is expected to delay civilian "
"extraction.  Civilians will be forced to supply themselves over the next "
"weeks.  Sources indicate this problem is widespread in other major population "
"centers, but aggravated locally by the very high number of bombing targets "
"over the last two days."
msgstr ""
"ANUNCIO DE SERVICIO PÚBLICO: \"Ayuda retrasada\". Se espera que los combates "
"de los militares en el borde de la zona de desastre de Nueva Inglaterra "
"retrasen la extracción de los civiles. Los civiles se verán obligados a "
"abastecerse en las próximas semanas. Las fuentes indican que este problema es "
"generalizado en otros centros de población importantes, pero se agrava "
"localmente por el gran número de objetivos de bombardeo en los últimos dos "
"días."

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "newest_news"
#. ~ Around April 15/16
msgid "PUBLIC SERVICE ANNOUNCEMENT: \"New England Cut Off\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "newest_news"
#. ~ Around April 15/16
msgid ""
"PUBLIC SERVICE ANNOUNCEMENT: \"New England Cut Off\".  New England has been "
"quarantined for the safety of the rest of the USA.  No rescue attempts will "
"be funded; it is assumed there are no survivors in the area.  This follows on "
"the heels of the quarantining of large sections of the Midwest last night.  "
"Cellular and land-based communication grids have been blocked by large "
"numbers of people attempting to contact loved ones.  It is recommended that "
"civilians avoid use of these tools for all but the most urgent messages."
msgstr ""
"ANUNCIO DE SERVICIO PÚBLICO: \"Nueva Inglaterra cortada\". Nueva Inglaterra "
"ha sido puesta en cuarentena por la seguridad del resto de los Estados "
"Unidos. No se financiará ningún intento de rescate; se supone que no hay "
"supervivientes en la zona. Esto sigue a la cuarentena de grandes secciones "
"del Medio Oeste anoche. Las redes de comunicación celular y terrestre han "
"sido bloqueadas por un gran número de personas que intentan contactar con sus "
"seres queridos. Se recomienda que los civiles eviten el uso de estas "
"herramientas para todos, excepto para los mensajes más urgentes."

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "newest_news"
#. ~ Around April 15/16
msgid "LEAVE IT TO THE EXPERTS - GENERAL"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "newest_news"
#. ~ Around April 15/16
msgid ""
"LEAVE IT TO THE EXPERTS - GENERAL: \"Do not attempt to deal with people "
"acting violent or unusual yourself.  If you see someone dangerous, report to "
"the nearest military or police blockade for assistance!  Even guns are to be "
"avoided: loud gunfire may attract more rioters than you have ammo!\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "newest_news"
#. ~ Around April 15/16
msgid ""
"EVACUATION ALERT: FEMA officials said today \"Do not try to defend your "
"property in towns.  Please retreat to your nearest evacuation center outside "
"town and await extraction to a safe facility.  Military officials require "
"non-hostile civilians to be removed from potential hot sites for ongoing "
"violence.  When the evacuation order is over, you will be able to return to "
"your homes.\""
msgstr ""
"ALERTA DE EVACUACIÓN: Los funcionarios de la FEMA dijeron hoy \"No intenten "
"defender su propiedad en las ciudades. Por favor, retírese a su centro de "
"evacuación más cercano fuera de la ciudad y espere la extracción a una "
"instalación segura. Los oficiales militares requieren que los civiles no "
"hostiles sean removidos de los sitios potencialmente calientes por la "
"violencia en curso. Cuando la orden de evacuación termine, podrán regresar a "
"sus hogares\"."

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "newest_news"
#. ~ Around April 15/16
msgid "EDITOR SAYS \"DESTROY THE DEAD\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "newest_news"
#. ~ Around April 15/16
msgid ""
"EDITOR SAYS \"DESTROY THE DEAD\".  Recognizable dead left lying in the street "
"may be dangerous!  If you kill a hostile, smash or butcher with a knife until "
"unrecognizable!  These aren't rioters, they're *undead*.  The government has "
"been lying to us all along.  This will be our last issue."
msgstr ""
"EL EDITOR DICE \"DESTRUID A LOS MUERTOS\". ¡Los muertos reconocibles que se "
"dejan en la calle pueden ser peligrosos! ¡Si matas a un hostil, aplastalo o "
"destruyalo con un cuchillo hasta que quede irreconocible! No son "
"alborotadores, son muertos vivientes. El gobierno nos ha estado mintiendo "
"todo el tiempo. Este será nuestro último número."

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "newest_news"
#. ~ Around April 15/16
msgid "THEY'RE NOT RIOTS!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "newest_news"
#. ~ Around April 15/16
msgid ""
"THEY'RE NOT RIOTS!  According to head officials at the Centers for Disease "
"Control, functional MRI studies of rioters have fit autopsy data that "
"suggests these people are under the influence of some sort of mind-altering "
"agent causing erratic, violent behavior.  A source inside the CDC, who did "
"not wish to be named, informed our reporter \"It's not just the rioters.  "
"They're the heaviest affected, but we scanned our own brains when we found "
"out.  It's everyone.  It's in me, and you.  It's in the government.  The "
"military.  God help us all.\""
msgstr ""
"¡NO SON DISTURBIOS! De acuerdo con los funcionarios del Centro de Control de "
"Enfermedades, los estudios de resonancia magnética funcional de los "
"alborotadores tienen datos de autopsia que sugieren que estas personas están "
"bajo la influencia de algún tipo de agente alterador de la mente que causa un "
"comportamiento errático y violento. Una fuente dentro del CDC, que no quiso "
"ser nombrada, informó a nuestro reportero \"No son solo los alborotadores. "
"Son los más afectados, pero escaneamos nuestros propios cerebros cuando lo "
"descubrimos. Es todo el mundo. Está en mí, y en ti. Está en el gobierno. El "
"ejército. Que Dios nos ayude a todos\"."

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "newest_news"
#. ~ Around April 15/16
msgid "THE DEAD WALK"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "newest_news"
#. ~ Around April 15/16
msgid ""
"THE DEAD WALK.  Amidst the violence of the riots, we can no longer disregard "
"reports of fatally wounded rioters and police forces alike rising and joining "
"the ranks of rioters.  Government sources could not be reached to confirm or "
"deny these reports, but our own reporters confirm it with photographic "
"evidence shown below."
msgstr ""
"EL CAMINO DE LOS MUERTOS. En medio de la violencia de los disturbios, no "
"podemos seguir ignorando los informes de alborotadores y fuerzas policiales "
"fatalmente heridos que se alzan y se unen a las filas de los alborotadores. "
"No se pudo contactar con fuentes gubernamentales para confirmar o negar estos "
"informes, pero nuestros propios reporteros lo confirman con la evidencia "
"fotográfica que se muestra a continuación."

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "newest_news"
#. ~ Around April 15/16
msgid "A BRIDGE TOO FAR"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "newest_news"
#. ~ Around April 15/16
msgid ""
"A BRIDGE TOO FAR.  In a statement Monday, the Department of Defense detailed "
"its plans to deploy strategic minefields on key bridge crossings, in order to "
"quarantine high-hostility regions of rioting.  \"Military personnel will be "
"on-site to assist any refugees fleeing the blackout zones.  We urge citizens "
"to comply with all military directives and avoid quarantined areas whenever "
"possible until order can be restored.\""
msgstr ""
"UN PUENTE DEMASIADO LEJOS. En un comunicado del lunes, el Departamento de "
"Defensa detalló sus planes para desplegar campos de minas estratégicos en "
"cruces de puentes clave, con el fin de poner en cuarentena las regiones de "
"alta hostilidad de los disturbios. \"El personal militar estará en el lugar "
"para ayudar a los refugiados que huyan de las zonas de apagón. Instamos a los "
"ciudadanos a que cumplan con todas las directivas militares y eviten las "
"zonas en cuarentena siempre que sea posible hasta que se pueda restablecer el "
"orden\"."

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "newest_news"
#. ~ Around April 15/16
msgid "PORTALS?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "newest_news"
#. ~ Around April 15/16
msgid ""
"PORTALS?  Reports of shimmering gateways opening around the US have been "
"corroborated by our own reporting staff.  One reporter witnessed a creature "
"the size of an apartment building taking a direct hit from an Apache "
"helicopter's weaponry and continuing to fight.  Government officials could "
"not be reached for comment, but a local pastor spoke to our reporter in the "
"field.  \"There can no longer be any doubt,\" she was quoted as saying.  "
"\"These are the end times.\""
msgstr ""
"¿PORTALES? Los informes de portales brillantes que se han abierto en los "
"EE.UU. han sido corroborados por nuestro propio personal de información. Un "
"reportero fue testigo de una criatura del tamaño de un edificio de "
"apartamentos recibiendo un impacto directo del armamento de un helicóptero "
"Apache y continuando la lucha. No se pudo contactar a los oficiales del "
"gobierno para hacer comentarios, pero un pastor local habló con nuestro "
"reportero en el campo. \"Ya no puede haber ninguna duda\", se le citó "
"diciendo. \"Estos son los tiempos finales\"."

