#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
msgid ""
"We both need to cheer up, so here is a joke: What do you call a sleepy car?  "
"Tired!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
msgid ""
