#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "artisan_docs"
msgid ""
"A collection of sketches and CAD designs marked up with a pencil.  They "
"depict a classic rifle and several diagrams of curved wooden maces.  The word "
"'OBREZ?' is written clearly on the front sheet.  There are two distinct sets "
"of handwriting making notes."
msgstr ""
"Una colección de bocetos y diseños CAD marcados con un lápiz. Representan un "
"rifle clásico y varios diagramas de mazas de madera curvadas. La palabra "
"\"OBREZ?\" está escrita claramente en la primera hoja. Hay dos grupos "
"distintos de escritura en las notas."

#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "artisan_docs"
msgid ""
"A collection of sketches and CAD designs marked up with a pencil.  They "
"depict a large mace with an internal gas reservoir and venting holes between "
"the steel segments.  There are additional diagrams labeled 'IGNITION SYSTEM' "
"and 'TRIGGER?'.  There are two distinct sets of handwriting making notes."
msgstr ""
"Una colección de bocetos y diseños CAD marcados con un lápiz. Representan una "
"gran maza con un depósito de gas interno y orificios de ventilación entre los "
"segmentos de acero. Hay diagramas adicionales etiquetados como \"SISTEMA DE "
"IGNICIÓN\" y \"¿Disparador?\". Hay dos grupos distintos de escritura en las "
"notas."

#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "artisan_docs"
msgid ""
"A collection of sketches and CAD designs marked up with a pencil.  They "
"depict a bladed weapon with some audio equipment implanted.  Doodles of hair "
"metal rock stars line the page, as well as the words 'LETS, HEAR IT FOR "
"FRANKY'.  There are two distinct sets of handwriting making notes."
msgstr ""
"Una colección de bocetos y diseños CAD marcados con un lápiz. Representan un "
"arma blanca con un equipo de audio implantado. En la página aparecen "
"garabatos de estrellas de rock de hair metal, así como las palabras \"LETS, "
"HEAR IT FOR FRANKY\". Hay dos grupos distintos de escritura en las notas."

#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "artisan_docs"
msgid ""
"A collection of sketches and CAD designs marked up with a pencil.  They "
"depict a sledgehammer with a moving center.  There is a references doc for a "
"powder actuated nail gun stapled to the sheets.  There are two distinct sets "
"of handwriting making notes."
msgstr ""
"Una colección de bocetos y diseños CAD marcados con un lápiz. Representan un "
"mazo con un centro móvil. Hay un documento de referencias para una pistola de "
"clavos accionada por pólvora grapada a las hojas. Hay dos grupos distintos de "
"escritura en las notas."

#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "comest_stimulant"
msgid "The shadows are getting ever closer."
msgstr "Las sombras se acercan cada vez más."

#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "comest_stimulant"
msgid "You have a bad feeling about this."
msgstr "Tienes un mal presentimiento sobre esto."

#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "comest_stimulant"
msgid "A powerful sense of dread comes over you."
msgstr "Una poderosa sensación de temor se apodera de ti."

#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "comest_stimulant"
msgid "Your skin starts crawling."
msgstr "Tu piel comienza a erizarse."

#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "comest_stimulant"
msgid "They're coming to get you."
msgstr "Vienen a buscarte."

#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "comest_stimulant"
msgid "This might've been a bad idea…"
msgstr "Esto podría haber sido una mala idea..."

#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "comest_stimulant"
msgid "You've really done it this time, haven't you?"
msgstr "Esta vez sí que lo has hecho, ¿verdad?"

#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "comest_stimulant"
msgid "You have to stay vigilant.  They're always watching…"
msgstr "Tienes que estar alerta. Siempre están vigilando..."

#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "comest_stimulant"
msgid "mistake mistake mistake mistake mistake"
msgstr "error error error error error"

#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "comest_stimulant"
msgid "Just gotta stay calm, and you'll make it through this."
msgstr "Sólo tienes que mantener la calma y superarás esto."

#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "comest_stimulant"
msgid "You're starting to feel very jumpy."
msgstr "Empiezas a sentirte muy nervioso."

#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "comest_stimulant"
msgid "Something is twitching at the edge of your vision."
msgstr "Algo se está moviendo en el borde de tu visión."

#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "comest_stimulant"
msgid "They know what you've done…"
msgstr "Saben lo que has hecho..."

#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "comest_stimulant"
msgid "You're feeling even more paranoid than usual."
msgstr "Te sientes más paranoico de lo normal."

#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "toxic_waste_corpse_disposal"
msgid ""
"A crumpled and dirty note containing some printed text.  The text contains "
"detailed instructions on how to dispose of \"experiments\" in remote areas."
msgstr ""
"Una nota arrugada y sucia que contiene un texto impreso. El texto contiene "
"instrucciones detalladas sobre cómo deshacerse de los \"experimentos\" en "
"zonas remotas."

#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "toxic_waste_corpse_disposal"
msgid ""
"You see a faded map, stained with unknown fluids and riddled with holes.  A "
"route is scribbled onto it.  The point of departure looks to be some kind of "
"odd research facility."
msgstr ""
"Ves un mapa descolorido, manchado con fluidos desconocidos y plagado de "
"agujeros. Hay una ruta garabateada en él. El punto de partida parece ser "
"algún tipo de instalación de investigación extraña."

#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "toxic_waste_corpse_disposal"
msgid ""
"Some sheets of paper, folded, crinkled and wet due to exposure to the "
"environment.  It smells vile and there are faint smears of blood.  A map is "
"printed on it, depicting instructions on how to handle deceased "
"\"experiments\" and a route to some remote site.  You find it very odd that "
"the starting point of the route is a subway station."
msgstr ""
"Unas hojas de papel, dobladas, arrugadas y húmedas por la exposición al "
"ambiente. Huele mal y hay tenues manchas de sangre. En él hay impreso un mapa "
"con instrucciones sobre el manejo de los \"experimentos\" de los fallecidos y "
"una ruta hacia algún lugar remoto. Te parece muy extraño que el punto de "
"partida de la ruta sea una estación de metro."

#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "toxic_waste_corpse_disposal"
msgid ""
"This note has a chemical smell and a bloody thumbprint on it.  You see "
"directions to nearby isolated sites, mainly forests and fields.  The name of "
"the company(?) who printed this, XEDRA, sounds ominous."
msgstr ""
"Esta nota tiene un olor químico y una huella de pulgar ensangrentada. Se ven "
"indicaciones para llegar a sitios aislados cercanos, principalmente bosques y "
"campos. El nombre de la empresa que lo imprimió, XEDRA, suena siniestro."

