#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/alien_organics.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/alien_organics.json
#. ~ Description of "cluster of gas sacs"
msgid ""
"This is a cluster of multicolored membranous bubbles, each about the size of "
"a grape, retrieved from inside an alien animal.  They float like tiny helium "
"balloons - perhaps they are full of lighter-than-air gas."
msgstr ""
"Este es un cúmulo de burbujas membranosas multicolores, cada una del tamaño "
"de una uva, extraídas del interior de un animal extraterrestre. Flotan como "
"diminutos globos de helio, quizá llenos de un gas más ligero que el aire."

