#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "bag of holding"
msgid_plural "bags of holding"
msgstr[0] "bolsa de retención"
msgstr[1] "bolsas de retención"
msgstr[2] "bolsas de retención"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "bag of holding"
msgid ""
"A sleek, unfathomably-complicated machine covered in dozens of blinking "
"lights, worn on the back by sturdy faux-leather straps.  An electrode dangles "
"from the back, attaching to your forehead.  How it operates without "
"annihilating spacetime isn't quite clear, but a localized portal allows "
"things to be stored in an extradimensional space."
msgstr ""
"Una máquina elegante e insondablemente complicada cubierta por docenas de "
"luces parpadeantes, llevada en la espalda por robustas correas de cuero "
"falso. Un electrodo cuelga de la espalda, pegado a la frente. No está claro "
"cómo funciona sin aniquilar el espacio-tiempo, pero un portal localizado "
"permite que las cosas se almacenen en un espacio extradimensional."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "titanium vest"
msgid_plural "titanium vests"
msgstr[0] "chaleco de titanio"
msgstr[1] "chalecos de titanio"
msgstr[2] "chalecos de titanio"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "titanium vest"
msgid ""
"A lightweight armor vest made of pieces of titanium sewn together, with cloth "
"padding for comfort.  Brittle against blunt force, but highly resistant to "
"cuts and corrosion."
msgstr ""
"Un chaleco de armadura ligera hecho de piezas de titanio cosidas, con "
"acolchado de tela para mayor comodidad. Es frágil contra la fuerza bruta, "
"pero muy resistente a cortes y a la corrosión."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "hologram cloak Mk. II"
msgid_plural "hologram cloaks Mk. II"
msgstr[0] "capa holográfica Mk. II"
msgstr[1] "capas holográficas Mk. II"
msgstr[2] "capas holográficas Mk. II"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "hologram cloak Mk. II"
msgid ""
"When activated, creates a holographic decoy of its wearer.  Powered by an "
"experimental n-space energy generator, it slowly recharges itself for free, "
"probably by siphoning excess energy from some unknown hyperdimensional space."
msgstr ""
"Cuando se activa, crea un señuelo holográfico de su portador. Alimentado por "
"un generador experimental de energía n-espacial, se recarga lentamente de "
"forma gratuita, probablemente extrayendo el exceso de energía de algún "
"espacio hiperdimensional desconocido."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "sentinel-lx cloak"
msgid_plural "sentinel-lx cloaks"
msgstr[0] "capa de centinela-lx"
msgstr[1] "capas de centinela-lx"
msgstr[2] "capas de centinela-lx"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "sentinel-lx cloak"
msgid ""
"The vantablack cloak of sentinel-lx hangs around ones shoulders as a solid, "
"unnatural shadow.  Made from woven graphene, it's lightweight and resistant, "
"but cannot be repaired."
msgstr ""
"La capa vantablack de centinela LX cuelga de los hombros como una sombra "
"sólida y antinatural. Hecha de grafeno entretejido, es ligera y resistente, "
"pero no se puede reparar.La capa vantablack centinela LX cuelga alrededor de "
"los hombros como una sombra sólida y antinatural. Hecho de grafeno tejido, es "
"ligero y resistente, pero no puede ser reparado"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Variant name of item "IX-2110 computer"
msgid "IX-2110 computer"
msgid_plural "IX-2110 computers"
msgstr[0] "ordenador IX-2110"
msgstr[1] "ordenadores IX-2110"
msgstr[2] "ordenadores IX-2110"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "IX-2110 computer"
msgid ""
"The original Imagos IX-2110, a general use wrist computer originally designed "
"to support operations within hazardous environments.  Among the most "
"successful pieces of technology ever created, millions of these were produced "
"and sold to the explorers that first tamed the stars during the early "
"Hyperspace Era.  The slow attrition of technological prowess since the "
"discontinuity has left slightly slower than its modern counterparts."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor.json
#. ~ Description of variant "IX-2110 computer" of item "IX-2110 computer"
msgid ""
"The original Imagos IX-2110, a general use wrist computer originally designed "
"to support operations within hazardous environments.  Among the most "
"successful pieces of technology ever created, millions of these were produced "
"and sold to the explorers that first tamed the stars during the early "
"Hyperspace Era.  The slow attrition of technological prowess since the "
"discontinuity means its only slightly less capable than its modern "
"counterparts."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "IX-2110 computer"
msgid "IX-2330S computer"
msgid_plural "IX-2330S computers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor.json
#. ~ Description of variant "IX-2330S computer" of item "IX-2110 computer"
msgid ""
"A rugged and radiation shielded wirst computer specifically designed to "
"support salvage operations.  It can perform general computing tasks and might "
"be used to interface with most ancient computer systems."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "quantum solar backpack (folded)"
msgid_plural "quantum solar backpacks (folded)"
msgstr[0] "mochila solar de quántum (plegada)"
msgstr[1] "mochilas solares de quántum (plegadas)"
msgstr[2] "mochilas solares de quántum (plegadas)"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "quantum solar backpack (folded)"
msgid ""
"Personal portable charging system consisting of an array of quantum solar "
"panels neatly folded in the form of a large backpack.  It can be worn as one, "
"and has an integrated cable to plug it into a cable charger system.  Cutting "
"edge technology."
msgstr ""
"Sistema personal de carga portátil que consiste en un conjunto de paneles "
"solares cuánticos perfectamente plegados en forma de gran mochila. Se puede "
"llevar encima y lleva un cable integrado para conectarlo a un sistema de "
"carga por cable. Tecnología de vanguardia."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "quantum solar backpack (unfolded)"
msgid_plural "quantum solar backpacks (unfolded)"
msgstr[0] "mochila solar cuántica (desplegada)"
msgstr[1] "mochilas solares cuánticas (desplegadas)"
msgstr[2] "mochilas solares cuánticas (desplegadas)"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "quantum solar backpack (unfolded)"
msgid ""
"Unfolded array of portable quantum solar panels ready to push some power into "
"an active cable charger system."
msgstr ""
"Son varios paneles solares de quántum portátiles desplegados, listos para "
"generar energía para algún sistema de recarga."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of combat boots"
msgid "Modern oversized reinforced tactical combat boots.  Very durable."
msgstr "Botas de combate tácticas modernas reforzadas de gran tamaño. Muy duraderas."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of tactical gloves"
msgid ""
"A pair of oversized reinforced Kevlar tactical gloves.  Commonly used by "
"police and military units."
msgstr ""
"Un par de guantes tácticos de Kevlar reforzados de gran tamaño. Comúnmente "
"usados por la policía y las unidades militares."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "pair of Killophant gloves"
msgid_plural "pairs of Killophant gloves"
msgstr[0] "guantes de Kilofante"
msgstr[1] "pares de guantes de Kilofante"
msgstr[2] "pares de guantes de Kilofante"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "pair of Killophant gloves"
msgid ""
"A pair of reinforced Kevlar tactical gloves, specifically designed to "
"accommodate three-fingered Killophants.  Thinner than regular oversized "
"tactical gloves."
msgstr ""
"Un par de guantes tácticos de Kevlar reforzados, diseñados específicamente "
"para acomodar a los kilofantes de tres dedos. Más delgados que los guantes "
"tácticos de tamaño normal."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "leather belt"
msgid ""
"An XL leather belt.  Useful for making your pair of pants fit if you need "
"really big pants."
msgstr ""
"Cinturón de cuero XL. Útil para hacer que tus pantalones te queden bien si "
"necesitas pantalones muy grandes."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "police duty belt"
msgid ""
"An XL black leather belt used by extremely large uplifted police officers.  "
"It has several pouches and a holder for a baton."
msgstr ""
"Un cinturón de cuero negro XL utilizado por los extremadamente grandes "
"ascendidos policías. Tiene varias bolsillos y un soporte para una porra."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "tactical full helmet"
msgid ""
"An all-encompassing massive black helmet that covers your entire face and "
"neck, providing excellent protection from all sorts of damage."
msgstr ""
"Un enorme casco negro que cubre toda la cara y el cuello, proporcionando una "
"excelente protección contra todo tipo de daños."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "leg ammo pouch"
msgid ""
"An XL fabric ammo pouch that can be strapped to your leg; capable of holding "
"two magazines close at hand."
msgstr ""
"Una bolsa de munición de tejido XL que se puede atar a la pierna, capaz de "
"mantener dos cargadores a mano."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Cecaelia wetsuit"
msgid_plural "Cecaelia wetsuits"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "Cecaelia wetsuit"
msgid ""
"A wetsuit designed for the Octopus Uplifts known as Cecaelia.  This is the "
"explorer suit with no head or tentacle protection."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "combat wetsuit"
msgid_plural "combat wetsuits"
msgstr[0] "traje de buceo de combate"
msgstr[1] "trajes de buceo de combate"
msgstr[2] "trajes de buceo de combate"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "combat wetsuit"
msgid ""
"The combat version of the Cecaelia wetsuit; made of neoprene and Kevlar, it "
"will provide some level of protection for deep dwellers."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "nanomesh vest"
msgid_plural "nanomesh vests"
msgstr[0] "chaleco de nanomalla"
msgstr[1] "chalecos de nanomalla"
msgstr[2] "chalecos de nanomalla"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "nanomesh vest"
msgid ""
"A lightweight nanomesh vest designed to face down many of the perils of space "
"travel.  These vests are mass produced and often stacked in starship lockers."
msgstr ""
"Un chaleco ligero de nanomalla diseñado para hacer frente a muchos de los "
"peligros de los viajes espaciales. Estos chalecos se fabrican en serie y "
"suelen apilarse en las taquillas de las naves estelares."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "carbide cuirass"
msgid_plural "carbide cuirasses"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor.json
#. ~ Description of "carbide cuirass"
msgid ""
"This piece of armor hearkens back to renaissance designs.  It differs in that "
"it is cast as a single piece in deep space installations where conditions can "
"be controlled absolutely.  Not quite bulletproof, but it will stop most small "
"arms fire."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "vacuum cast cuirass"
msgid_plural "vacuum cast cuirasses"
msgstr[0] "coraza de fundición al vacío"
