#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/inactiverobot.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "inactive brain blaster"
msgid_plural "inactive brain blasters"
msgstr[0] "blaster cerebrale inactivo"
msgstr[1] "blasters cerebrales inactivos"
msgstr[2] "blasters cerebrales inactivos"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/inactiverobot.json
#. ~ Description of "inactive brain blaster"
msgid ""
"This is a horrifying monstrosity.  Using this item is cannibalism in all but "
"taste and involves turning it on and placing it on the ground, where it will "
"attach itself.  If reprogrammed and rewired successfully the turret will "
"identify you as a friendly, and attack all enemies with its revolving laser "
"cannons."
msgstr ""
"Esto es una monstruosidad horrible. Usar este objeto es canibalismo en todo "
"menos en el gusto e implica encenderlo y colocarlo en el suelo, donde se "
"adherirá. Si se reprograma y se recablea con éxito, la torreta te "
"identificará como un amigo, y atacará a todos los enemigos con sus cañones "
"láser giratorios."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/inactiverobot.json
#. ~ "friendly_msg" action message of item "inactive brain blaster"
msgid "The brain blaster swivels towards you.  Hi new friend!"
msgstr "El blaster del cerebro gira hacia ti. ¡Hola nuevo amigo!"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/inactiverobot.json
#. ~ "hostile_msg" action message of item "inactive brain blaster"
msgid "The brain blaster swivels towards you.  You feel a buzzing in the air."
msgstr "El blaster del cerebro gira hacia ti. Sientes un zumbido en el aire."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json data/mods/No_Hope/items.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/inactiverobot.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "inactive tank drone"
msgid_plural "inactive tank drones"
msgstr[0] "dron tanque inactivo"
msgstr[1] "drones tanques inactivos"
msgstr[2] "drones tanques inactivos"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json data/mods/No_Hope/items.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/inactiverobot.json
#. ~ Description of "inactive tank drone"
msgid ""
"This is an inactive Beagle Mini-Tank UGV.  Using this item involves placing "
"it on the ground, loading the unit with the factory-loaded 5.56 rounds and "
"40mm cartridge grenades in your inventory (if you wish to divide your "
"ammunition, set aside whatever ammunition you do NOT want to give the robot) "
"and turning it on.  If reprogrammed and rewired successfully the tank drone "
"will then identify you as a friendly, roam around or follow you, and attack "
"all enemies with a built-in firearm and grenade launcher."
msgstr ""
"Este es un minitanque UGV de Beagle inactivo. El uso de este objeto implica "
"colocarlo en el suelo, cargar la unidad con cartuchos de fábrica de 5.56 "
"balas y cartuchos de granadas de 40 mm de su inventario (si desea dividir su "
"munición, deje a un lado cualquier munición que NO quiera darle al robot) y "
"encenderlo. Si se reprograma y se recablea con éxito, el tanque dron te "
"identificará como un amigo, se desplazará o te seguirá y atacará a todos los "
"enemigos con un arma de fuego y un lanzagranadas incorporados."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json data/mods/No_Hope/items.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/inactiverobot.json
#. ~ "friendly_msg" action message of item "inactive tank drone"
msgid "The tank drone rolls out and begins acquiring targets."
msgstr "El tanque dron se despliega y comienza a adquirir objetivos."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json data/mods/No_Hope/items.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/inactiverobot.json
#. ~ "hostile_msg" action message of item "inactive tank drone"
msgid ""
"The tank drone swivels its turret and aims directly at you.  Don your brown "
"pants!"
msgstr ""
"El dron tanque rota su torreta y te apunta directamente. ¡No pintes tus "
"pantalones marrón!"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json data/mods/No_Hope/items.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/inactiverobot.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "inactive chicken walker"
msgid_plural "inactive chicken walkers"
msgstr[0] "mecha-gallina inactivo"
msgstr[1] "mecha-gallinas inactivos"
msgstr[2] "mecha-gallinas inactivos"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/inactiverobot.json
#. ~ Description of "inactive chicken walker"
msgid ""
"This is an inactive chicken walker.  Using this item involves placing it on "
"the ground, loading the unit with the factory-loaded 5.56 rounds and 40mm "
"cartridge grenades in your inventory (if you wish to divide your ammunition, "
"set aside whatever ammunition you do NOT want to give the robot) and turning "
"it on.  If reprogrammed and rewired successfully the tank drone will then "
"identify you as a friendly, roam around or follow you, and attack all enemies "
"with a built-in firearm and grenade launcher."
msgstr ""
"Este es una gallina caminante inactiva. El uso de este objeto implica "
"colocarlo en el suelo, cargar la unidad con las granadas de 40 mm de fábrica "
"de y balas de 5.56 mm de su inventario (si desea dividir su munición, deje a "
"un lado cualquier munición que NO quiera darle al robot) y encenderlo. Si se "
"reprograma y se recablea con éxito, el avión teledirigido te identificará "
"como un amigo, se desplazará o te seguirá y atacará a todos los enemigos con "
"un arma de fuego y un lanzagranadas incorporados."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json data/mods/No_Hope/items.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/inactiverobot.json
#. ~ "friendly_msg" action message of item "inactive chicken walker"
#. ~ "friendly_msg" action message of item "broken chickenbot"
msgid "The chicken bot rolls out and begins acquiring targets."
msgstr "El bot de gallina se despliega y comienza a adquirir objetivos."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json data/mods/No_Hope/items.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/inactiverobot.json
#. ~ "hostile_msg" action message of item "inactive chicken walker"
#. ~ "hostile_msg" action message of item "broken chickenbot"
msgid ""
"The chicken bot swivels its turret and aims directly at you.  Don your brown "
"pants!"
msgstr ""
"El bot de gallina gira su torreta y apunta directamente a ti. ¡Ponte tus "
"pantalones marrones!"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json data/mods/No_Hope/items.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/inactiverobot.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "inactive tripod"
msgid_plural "inactive tripods"
msgstr[0] "trípode inactivo"
msgstr[1] "trípodes inactivos"
msgstr[2] "trípodes inactivos"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json data/mods/No_Hope/items.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/inactiverobot.json
#. ~ Description of "inactive tripod"
msgid ""
"This is an inactive Honda Regnal.  Using this item involves placing it on the "
"ground, wondering how it fuels its flamethrower and turning it on.  If "
"reprogrammed and rewired successfully the tribot will then identify you as an "
"ally, roam around or follow you, and impale hostiles with its spiked cable "
"weapons."
msgstr ""
"Este es un Honda Regnal inactivo. Usar este objeto implica colocarlo en el "
"suelo, preguntarse cómo alimenta su lanzallamas y encenderlo. Si se "
"reprograma y se recablea con éxito, el tribot lo identificará como un aliado, "
"te seguirá y empalará a los hostiles con sus armas de cable con púas."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json data/mods/No_Hope/items.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/inactiverobot.json
#. ~ "friendly_msg" action message of item "inactive tripod"
msgid "The tribot rises to its feet and scans the area for contaminants."
msgstr "El tribot se levanta e inspecciona el área en busca de contaminantes."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json data/mods/No_Hope/items.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/inactiverobot.json
#. ~ "hostile_msg" action message of item "inactive tripod"
msgid ""
"The tribot glowers down at you and ignites its flamethrower.  Turns out you "
"hate the smell of napalm."
msgstr ""
"El tribot te ilumina y enciende su lanzallamas. Resulta que odias el olor del "
"napalm."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json data/mods/No_Hope/items.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/inactiverobot.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "broken tribot"
msgid_plural "broken tribots"
msgstr[0] "tribot roto"
msgstr[1] "tribots rotos"
msgstr[2] "tribots rotos"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json data/mods/No_Hope/items.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/inactiverobot.json
#. ~ Description of "broken tribot"
msgid ""
"A broken tribot.  Now that its legs lie broken and immobile, the world seems "
"a little less threatening.  Could be gutted for parts."
msgstr ""
"Un tribot roto. Ahora que sus patas estás rotas e inmóviles, el mundo parece "
"menos amenazador. Se podría desmontar para recuperar sus partes."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/inactiverobot.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "broken Scavbot Skorpion"
msgid_plural "broken Scavbot Skorpions"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/inactiverobot.json
#. ~ Description of "broken Scavbot Skorpion"
msgid ""
"A broken Scavbot Skorpion.  Now that its legs lie broken and immobile, the "
"world seems a little less threatening.  Could be gutted for parts."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json data/mods/No_Hope/items.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/inactiverobot.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "broken tank drone"
msgid_plural "broken tank drones"
msgstr[0] "drone tanque roto"
msgstr[1] "drones tanque rotos"
msgstr[2] "drones tanque rotos"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json data/mods/No_Hope/items.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/inactiverobot.json
#. ~ Description of "broken tank drone"
msgid ""
"A broken tank drone.  Still looks intimidating despite being permanently "
"inoperative, possibly due to the sheer size and mass.  Could be gutted for "
"parts."
msgstr ""
"Un drone tanque roto. A pesar de estar totalmente fuera de servicio sigue "
"siendo intimidatorio, posiblemente debido a su tamaño y masa. Se podría "
"desmontar para recuperar sus partes."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json data/mods/No_Hope/items.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/inactiverobot.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "broken chickenbot"
msgid_plural "broken chickenbots"
msgstr[0] "robot de gallina roto"
msgstr[1] "robots de gallina rotos"
msgstr[2] "robots de gallina rotos"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json data/mods/No_Hope/items.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/inactiverobot.json
#. ~ Description of "broken chickenbot"
msgid ""
"A broken chicken walker.  Still looks intimidating despite being permanently "
"inoperative, possibly due to the sheer size and mass.  Could be gutted for "
"parts."
msgstr ""
"Una gallina caminante rota. Sigue pareciendo intimidante a pesar de ser "
"permanentemente inoperante, posiblemente debido al tamaño y la masa. Se "
"podría desmontar para recuperar sus partes."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/inactiverobot.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "inactive sentinel-lx"
msgid_plural "inactive sentinels-lx"
msgstr[0] "centinela-lx inactivo"
msgstr[1] "centinelas-lx inactivos"
msgstr[2] "centinelas-lx inactivos"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/inactiverobot.json
#. ~ Description of "inactive sentinel-lx"
msgid ""
"Crouched and dead still, this armored luxurious robot resembles an ancient "
"knight immersed in deep prayer.  If reprogrammed and rewired successfully the "
"robot will identify you as a friendly, and will protect you from nearby foes."
msgstr ""
"Agazapado y muerto todavía, este lujoso robot blindado se parece a un antiguo "
"caballero inmerso en una profunda oración. Si se reprograma y se recablea con "
"éxito, el robot te identificará como un amigo y te protegerá de los enemigos "
"cercanos."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/inactiverobot.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "inactive Kabura-ya drone"
msgid_plural "inactive Kabura-ya drones"
msgstr[0] "dron Kabura-ya inactivo"
msgstr[1] "drones Kabura-ya inactivos"
msgstr[2] "drones Kabura-ya inactivos"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/inactiverobot.json
#. ~ Description of "inactive Kabura-ya drone"
msgid ""
"An inactive Kabura-ya hunter drone, folded for ease of storage.  If deployed, "
"it will seek and fly to the closest enemy before detonating.  Unlike most "
"robots, its activation depends on a successful throw, and not on your "
"computer skill."
msgstr ""
"Un dron cazador Karuba-ya inactivo, plegado para facilitar su almacenamiento. "
"Si se despliega, buscará y volará hasta el enemigo más cercano antes de "
"detonar. A diferencia de la mayoría de los robots, su activación depende de "
"un lanzamiento exitoso, y no de tu habilidad informática."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/inactiverobot.json
#. ~ "friendly_msg" action message of item "inactive Kabura-ya drone"
msgid "The Kabura-ya emits a short IFF chirp as you throw it."
msgstr "El Kabura-ya emite un corto pitido IFF mientras lo lanzas."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/inactiverobot.json
#. ~ "hostile_msg" action message of item "inactive Kabura-ya drone"
msgid "The Kabura-ya emits an warning whine after your botched throw!"
msgstr ""
"¡El Kabura-ya emite un quejido de advertencia después de su lanzamiento "
"fallido!"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/inactiverobot.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "inactive bloodhound drone"
msgid_plural "inactive bloodhound drones"
msgstr[0] "dron sabueso inactivo"
msgstr[1] "drones sabueso inactivos"
msgstr[2] "drones sabueso inactivos"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/inactiverobot.json
#. ~ Description of "inactive bloodhound drone"
msgid ""
"This is an inactive bloodhound drone.  If successfully deployed, it will fly "
"towards enemy targets and highlight them with a powerful spotlight."
msgstr ""
"Este es un dron sabueso inactivo. Si se despliega con éxito, volará hacia los "
"objetivos enemigos y los resaltará con un poderoso foco."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/inactiverobot.json
#. ~ "friendly_msg" action message of item "inactive bloodhound drone"
msgid "The bloodhound drone flies from your hand and surveys the area!"
msgstr "¡El dron sabueso vuela de tu mano y revisa el área!"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/inactiverobot.json
#. ~ "hostile_msg" action message of item "inactive bloodhound drone"
msgid "You misprogram the bloodhound drone; it's hostile!"
msgstr "Programaste mal el dron sabueso; ¡es hostil!"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json data/mods/No_Hope/items.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/inactiverobot.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "inactive laser turret"
msgid_plural "inactive laser turrets"
msgstr[0] "torreta láser inactiva"
msgstr[1] "torretas láser inactivas"
msgstr[2] "torretas láser inactivas"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/inactiverobot.json
#. ~ Description of "inactive laser turret"
msgid ""
"This is an inactive laser turret.  Using this item involves turning it on and "
"placing it on the ground, where it will attach itself.  If reprogrammed and "
"rewired successfully the turret will identify you as a friendly, and attack "
"all enemies with its replaceable laser cannons.  It requires ammunition tubes "
"to fire."
msgstr ""
"Se trata de una torreta láser inactiva. Para usarla hay que encenderla y "
"colocarla en el suelo, donde se acoplará. Si se reprograma y reconecta con "
"éxito, la torreta te identificará como amigo y atacará a todos los enemigos "
"con sus cañones láser reemplazables. Requiere tubos de munición para disparar."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/inactiverobot.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "inactive bee-bot"
msgid_plural "inactive bee-bots"
msgstr[0] "abejabot inactivo"
msgstr[1] "abejabots inactivos"
msgstr[2] "abejabots inactivos"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/inactiverobot.json
#. ~ Description of "inactive bee-bot"
msgid ""
"A salvaged utility robot converted into an ambulatory bee hive that "
"periodically removes and delivers segments of fresh honey comb.  It protects "
"the insect colony with a mechanical crossbow mounted to its chassis.  "
"Activate this item, with wooden bolts in your inventory, to load and deploy "
"the robot."
msgstr ""
"Un robot utilitario recuperado convertido en una colmena ambulante que "
"periódicamente retira y entrega panales de miel. Protege a la colonia de "
"insectos con una ballesta mecánica montada en su chasis. Activa este objeto,  "
"cuanto tengas saetas de madera en tu inventario, para cargar y desplegar el "
"robot."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/inactiverobot.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "inactive shock-mine"
msgid_plural "inactive shock-mines"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/inactiverobot.json
#. ~ Description of "inactive shock-mine"
msgid ""
"A less-than-lethal mine that emits a powerful electrical shock when "
"triggered.  Activate this item to deploy the mine, which will have a lifetime "
"of 10 hours after activation."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/inactiverobot.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "inactive hack"
msgid_plural "inactive hacks"
msgstr[0] "hack inactivo"
msgstr[1] "hacks inactivos"
msgstr[2] "hacks inactivos"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/inactiverobot.json
#. ~ Description of "inactive hack"
msgid ""
"This is an inactive manhack.  Manhacks are fist-sized robots that fly through "
"the air.  They are covered with whirring blades and attack by throwing "
"themselves against their target.  Use this item to reprogram and activate the "
"manhack.  Electronics and computer skill determines if the targeting matrix "
"is reprogrammed successfully."
msgstr ""
"Es un manhack inactivo. Los manhacks son robots del tamaño de un puño que "
"vuelan por el aire. Están cubiertos de cuchillas giratorias y atacan "
"arrojándose hacia el objetivo. Usalo para reprogramar y activar el manhack. "
"Tu habilidad en electrónica e informática determinará si la reprogramación es "
"exitosa."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/inactiverobot.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "inactive floating lantern"
msgid_plural "inactive floating lanterns"
msgstr[0] "linterna voladora inactiva"
msgstr[1] "linternas voladoras inactivas"
msgstr[2] "linternas voladoras inactivas"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/inactiverobot.json
#. ~ Description of "inactive floating lantern"
msgid ""
"An inactive floating lantern, a fist-sized robot that flies through the air "
"and illuminates its surroundings with bright LEDs.  The lantern is non "
"aggressive and has no means of attack.  Activate this item to deploy the "
"salvaged robot."
msgstr ""
"Un farolillo flotante inactivo, un robot del tamaño de un puño que vuela por "
"el aire e ilumina su entorno con brillantes LED. El farol no es agresivo y no "
"tiene medios de ataque. Activar este objeto para desplegar el robot "
"recuperado."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/inactiverobot.json
#. ~ "friendly_msg" action message of item "inactive floating lantern"
msgid "The floating lantern flies from your hand and lights up the area!"
msgstr "¡La linterna flotante vuela de tu mano e ilumina el área!"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/inactiverobot.json
#. ~ "hostile_msg" action message of item "inactive floating lantern"
msgid "You misprogram the lantern."
msgstr "Programaste mal la linterna."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/inactiverobot.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "inactive military robot"
msgid_plural "inactive military robots"
msgstr[0] "militaribot inactivo"
msgstr[1] "militaribots inactivos"
msgstr[2] "militaribots inactivos"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/inactiverobot.json
#. ~ Description of "inactive military robot"
msgid ""
"An unpowered military robot fitted with an integrated 7.62 firearm and "
"electric prod.  Activate this item, with ammo in your inventory, to load and "
"deploy the robot."
msgstr ""
"Un robot militar sin motor equipado con un arma de fuego 7.62 integrada y una "
"picana eléctrica. Activa este objeto, con munición en tu inventario, para "
"cargar y desplegar el robot."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/inactiverobot.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "inactive rat snatcher"
msgid_plural "inactive rat snatchers"
msgstr[0] "cazarata inactivo"
msgstr[1] "cazaratas inactivos"
msgstr[2] "cazaratas inactivos"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/inactiverobot.json
#. ~ Description of "inactive rat snatcher"
msgid ""
"A small hexapod drone designed to hold small pests, folded into a small cube "
"for easy storage.  It's capable of hunting all sorts of small mammals with "
"remarkable efficiency, but shouldn't be expected to handle anything much "
"bigger than a rat."
msgstr ""
"Un pequeño dron hexápodo diseñado para cazar pequeñas plagas, plegado en un "
"pequeño cubo para facilitar su almacenamiento. Es capaz de cazar todo tipo de "
"pequeños mamíferos con notable eficacia, pero no debe esperarse que se "
"encargue de nada mucho más grande que una rata."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/inactiverobot.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "inactive grab-bot"
msgid_plural "inactive grab-bots"
msgstr[0] "agarrabot inactivo"
msgstr[1] "agarrabots inactivos"
msgstr[2] "agarrabots inactivos"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/inactiverobot.json
#. ~ Description of "inactive grab-bot"
msgid ""
"A salvaged skitterbot repurposed to grab onto and immobilize enemies.  "
"Activate this item to deploy the robot."
msgstr ""
"Es un arañabot reconvertido para agarrar e inmovilizar a los enemigos. Activá "
"este objeto para desplegar el robot."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/inactiverobot.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "inactive pest hunter"
msgid_plural "inactive pest hunters"
msgstr[0] "cazador de plaga inactivo"
msgstr[1] "cazadores de plagas inactivos"
msgstr[2] "cazadores de plagas inactivos"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/inactiverobot.json
#. ~ Description of "inactive pest hunter"
msgid ""
"A salvaged skitterbot refitted with an 8mm integrated firearm.  Activate this "
"item, with ammo in your inventory, to load and deploy the robot."
msgstr ""
"Es un arañabot reconvertido con un arma 8mm integrada. Activá este objeto, "
"con munición en tu inventario, para cargar y desplegar el robot."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/inactiverobot.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "inactive floating heater"
msgid_plural "inactive floating heaters"
msgstr[0] "calentador flotante inactivo"
msgstr[1] "calentadores flotantes inactivos"
msgstr[2] "calentadores flotantes inactivos"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/inactiverobot.json
#. ~ Description of "inactive floating heater"
msgid ""
"A salvaged eyebot repurposed into a floating space heater.  It emits a "
"constant jet of warm air to heat an enclosed space.  It is non-aggressive and "
"has no weapons systems.  Activate this item to deploy the robot."
msgstr ""
"Un ojobot recuperado que ha sido reconvertido en un calefactor flotante. "
"Emite un chorro constante de aire caliente para calentar un espacio cerrado. "
"No es agresivo y no tiene ningún sistema de armas. Activa este elemento para "
"desplegar el robot."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json data/mods/No_Hope/items.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/inactiverobot.json
#. ~ Description of "inactive laser turret"
#. ~ Description of "inactive interior laser turret"
msgid ""
"This is an inactive laser turret.  Using this item involves turning it on and "
"placing it on the ground, where it will attach itself.  If reprogrammed and "
"rewired successfully the turret will identify you as a friendly, and attack "
"all enemies with its revolving laser cannons.  It requires sunlight in order "
"to fire."
msgstr ""
"Es una torreta láser inactiva. Usarla incluye prenderla y ubicarla en el "
"suelo, donde se desplegará sola. Si se la reprograma e instala correctamente, "
"la torreta te identificará como aliado y atacará a todos tus enemigos con sus "
"cañones láser giratorios. Necesita estar expuesta a la luz del sol para "
"disparar."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/inactiverobot.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "inactive interior laser turret"
msgid_plural "inactive interior laser turrets"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/inactiverobot.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "inactive eyebot"
msgid_plural "inactive eyebots"
msgstr[0] "ojobot desactivado"
msgstr[1] "ojobots desactivados"
msgstr[2] "ojobots desactivados"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/inactiverobot.json
#. ~ Description of "inactive eyebot"
msgid ""
"An inactive eyebot.  Using this item involves turning it on and launching the "
"UAV.  If reprogrammed and rewired successfully, the eyebot will then keep "
"watch for intruders."
msgstr ""
"Un ojobot inactivo. Usar este objeto incluye encenderlo y lanzar el dron. Si "
"fue reprogramado y cableado exitosamente, el ojobot estará atento a los "
"intrusos."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/inactiverobot.json
#. ~ "friendly_msg" action message of item "inactive eyebot"
msgid "The eyebot hums and takes to the sky."
msgstr "El ojobot zumba y se eleva hacia el cielo."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/inactiverobot.json
#. ~ "hostile_msg" action message of item "inactive eyebot"
msgid ""
"The eyebot beeps disapprovingly and focuses its camera on your face.  Say "
"cheese!"
msgstr ""
"El ojobot emite un pitido de desaprobación y enfoca su cámara en tu cara. "
"¡Diga \"queso\"!"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/inactiverobot.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "inactive police bot"
msgid_plural "inactive police bots"
msgstr[0] "polibot inactivo"
msgstr[1] "polibots inactivos"
msgstr[2] "polibots inactivos"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/inactiverobot.json
#. ~ Description of "inactive police bot"
msgid ""
"An inactive police robot.  Using this item involves placing it on the ground "
"and turning it on.  If reprogrammed and rewired successfully, the police bot "
"will then identify you as law enforcement, roam around or follow you, and "
"attempt to detain lawbreakers."
msgstr ""
"Un polibot inactivo. Usar este objeto incluye ponerlo en el suelo y "
"encenderlo. Si se programa y cablea exitosamente, el polibot te identificará "
"como parte de las fuerzas de la ley, deambulará o te seguirá, e intentará "
"detener a los criminales."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/inactiverobot.json
#. ~ "friendly_msg" action message of item "inactive police bot"
msgid "The police bot rolls into action, ready to pursue criminals."
msgstr "El polibot entra en acción, listo para perseguir criminales."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/inactiverobot.json
#. ~ "hostile_msg" action message of item "inactive police bot"
msgid "A siren howls and lights flash as the police bot prepares to arrest you!"
msgstr ""
"¡Una sirena aúlla y las luces parpadean mientras el polibot se prepara para "
"arrestarte!"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/inactiverobot.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "inactive riot control bot"
msgid_plural "inactive riot control bots"
msgstr[0] "antidisturbiot inactivo"
msgstr[1] "antidisturbiots inactivos"
msgstr[2] "antidisturbiots inactivos"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/inactiverobot.json
#. ~ Description of "inactive riot control bot"
msgid ""
"An inactive riot control bot.  Using this item involves placing it on the "
"ground and turning it on.  If reprogrammed and rewired successfully, the "
"robot will bring order and peace to the horde."
msgstr ""
"Un antidisturbiot inactivo. Usar este objeto implica colocarlo en el suelo y "
"encenderlo. Si se reprograma y recablea correctamente, el robot traerá el "
"orden y la paz a la horda."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/inactiverobot.json
#. ~ "friendly_msg" action message of item "inactive riot control bot"
msgid "The riot control bot rolls into action."
msgstr "El antidisturbiot entra en acción."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/inactiverobot.json
#. ~ "hostile_msg" action message of item "inactive riot control bot"
msgid "The riot control bot gasses you and approaches with a pair of handcuffs!"
msgstr "El antidisturbiot te gasea y se acerca con un par de esposas!"

