#. ~ Item name
msgid "Crypto coin"
msgid_plural "Crypto coins"
msgstr[0] "moneda criptográfica"
msgstr[1] "monedas criptográficas"
msgstr[2] "monedas criptográficas"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/items.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/items.json
#. ~ Description of "Crypto coin"
msgid ""
"PrepNet had been heavily involved in avoiding taxes by using untraceable "
"internet currencies.  These however are physical coins with random numbers "
"sequences embossed on them and RFID chips inside."
msgstr ""
"La PrepNet había estado muy involucrada en la evasión de impuestos mediante "
"el uso de monedas no rastreables en Internet. Sin embargo, estas son monedas "
"físicas con secuencias de números aleatorios grabados en ellas y chips RFID "
"en su interior."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/items.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "broken distress beacon"
msgid_plural "broken distress beacons"
msgstr[0] "baliza de auxilio rota"
msgstr[1] "balizas de auxilio rotas"
msgstr[2] "balizas de auxilio rotas"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/items.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/items.json
#. ~ Description of "broken distress beacon"
msgid ""
"Truly putting the 'distress' in 'distress beacon,' this one has a huge hole "
"in the front.  It will not be alerting anyone today.  Perhaps you could "
"disassemble it for scrap."
msgstr ""
"Habría que auxiliar a la 'baliza de auxilio'. Aunque esta tiene un agujero "
"enorme en la parte frontal. Ahora ya no va a poder alertar a nadie. Tal vez "
"puedas desmontarla para reutilizar sus partes."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/items.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/items.json
