msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/tools.json
#. ~ Description of "micro-cooker"
msgid ""
"A rugged kitchen in one tool, made for use within small spaceships or in the "
"wilderness.  It can automatically prepare a variety of dishes while its owner "
"focuses on other tasks."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/tools.json
#. ~ Item name
