msgid_plural "micro-cookers - cooking"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/tools.json
#. ~ Description of "micro-cooker - cooking"
msgid "This micro-cooker is currently cooking a dish."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/tools.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "military mess kit"
msgid_plural "military mess kits"
msgstr[0] "kit de campaña militar"
msgstr[1] "kits de campaña militares"
msgstr[2] "kits de campaña militares"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/tools.json
#. ~ Description of "military mess kit"
msgid ""
"A military mess kit designed for long-range reconnaissance patrols deployed "
"behind enemy lines.  All of its parts are made from thin sheets of "
"aluminum-superalloy composite and are insulated with ceramic coating.  Relies "
"on a battery-operated hotplate, rather than the smoke-producing "
"chemical-fueled hexamine stove.  Compact, durable and lightweight."
msgstr ""
"Un equipo militar de utensilios diseñado para patrullas de reconocimiento que "
"pasan mucho tiempo detrás de las líneas enemigas. Todos sus componentes están "
"hechos de una delgada capa compuesta de aluminio y superaleación, y están "
"aislados con una cobertura cerámica. Depende de una placa térmica eléctrica "
"que funciona con baterías, en lugar de la cocina de acampada mas común "
"alimentada con químicos como la hexamina. Compacto, duradero y liviano."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/tools.json
#. ~ Description of "portable battery charger"
msgid ""
"This small device easily deploys anywhere you need it and will slowly charge "
"all rechargeable batteries placed within it's storage space."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/tools.json
#. ~ Description of "portable survival heater"
msgid ""
"When deployed and powered this device can warm a small room enough to doff "
"your EVA gear."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/tools.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "portable survival lamp"
msgid_plural "portable survival lamps"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/tools.json
#. ~ Description of "portable survival lamp"
msgid ""
"A small folded metal tripod that can be deployed to illuminate an area around "
"itself."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/tools.json
#. ~ Description of magazine "portable survival battery"
#. ~ Description of "portable survival battery"
msgid "A storage battery fit for improvised shelters."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/vehicle_items.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/vehicle_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "robot carrier"
msgid_plural "robot carriers"
msgstr[0] "transportador de robots"
msgstr[1] "transportadores de robots"
msgstr[2] "transportadores de robots"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/vehicle_items.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/vehicle_items.json
#. ~ Description of "robot carrier"
msgid ""
"A heavy frame outfitted with tie-downs and attachment points for carrying "
"cargo, with additional railings to keep a large machine in place.  It is "
"meant to hold large drones and robots for transport.  Use it on a suitable "
"robot to capture, use it on an empty tile to release."
msgstr ""
"Un marco pesado equipado con amarres y puntos de sujeción para el transporte "
"de carga, con barandillas adicionales para mantener una máquina grande en su "
"lugar. Está destinado a albergar grandes zánganos y robots para su "
"transporte. Úsalo en un robot adecuado para capturar, úsalo en un espacio "
"para soltar."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/vehicle_items.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/vehicle_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "military ablative plating"
msgid_plural "military ablative platings"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/vehicle_items.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/vehicle_items.json
#. ~ Description of "military ablative plating"
msgid ""
"A segment of thick armor plating that would normally be found mounted on a "
"spaceship.  Incredibly heavy."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/vehicle_items.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/vehicles/vehicle_parts.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/vehicle_items.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/vehicles/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "exosuit maintenance gantry"
msgid_plural "exosuit maintenance gantries"
msgstr[0] "grúa de mantenimiento de exotraje"
msgstr[1] "grúas de mantenimiento de exotraje"
msgstr[2] "grúas de mantenimiento de exotraje"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/vehicle_items.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/vehicle_items.json
#. ~ Description of "exosuit maintenance gantry"
msgid ""
"A vehicle-mounted gantry for supporting an exosuit upright during maintenance "
"and repair.  Includes the specialized tools needed for complex repairs and "
"will also charge the suit's power when activated from the vehicle's controls."
msgstr ""
"Una grúa montada en un vehículo para soportar el exotraje durante tareas de "
"mantenimiento y reparación. Incluye herramientas especializadas para "
"reparaciones complejas y también recarga la energía del traje cuando se "
"activa desde el panel de control del vehículo."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/weapons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "CE-4 \"The Claw\" (Non-Lethal)"
msgid_plural "CE-4 \"The Claws\" (Non-Lethal)"
msgstr[0] "CE-4 \"La Garra\" (No-Letal)"
msgstr[1] "CE-4 \"Las Garras\" (No-Letal)"
msgstr[2] "CE-4 \"Las Garras\" (No-Letal)"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/weapons.json
#. ~ Description of "CE-4 "The Claw" (Non-Lethal)"
msgid ""
"The CE-4, commonly known as \"The Claw\", is a popular self-defense weapon "
"used by corporate enforcers everywhere, especially on dangerous frontier "
"worlds.  Made from a cylinder of heat activated memory-alloy, the flick of a "
"switch allows it to morph between a less-lethal bludgeon form and a "
"sharpened, super heated blade.  Currently, it is in its less-lethal "
"configuration, and looks like a sleek side-handle metal baton."
msgstr ""
"El CE-4, comúnmente conocido como \"La Garra\", es un arma de autodefensa muy "
"popular que utilizan los agentes corporativos de todo el mundo, especialmente "
"en los peligrosos mundos fronterizos. Fabricada con un cilindro de aleación "
"de memoria activada por el calor, con sólo pulsar un interruptor puede "
"cambiar entre una forma de porra menos letal y una hoja afilada y "
"supercaliente. Actualmente, se encuentra en su configuración menos letal, y "
"tiene el aspecto de un elegante bastón metálico de mango lateral."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/weapons.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "CE-4 "The Claw" (Non-Lethal)"
msgid ""
"You activate the claw, and its bludgeoning surface slowly flattens into an "
"edge as it begins to glow red-hot"
msgstr ""
"Activas la garra, y su superficie de golpeo se aplana lentamente en un borde "
"mientras comienza a brillar al rojo vivo"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/weapons.json
#. ~ "need_charges_msg" action message of item "CE-4 "The Claw" (Non-Lethal)"
msgid "The claw is out of charge."
msgstr "La garra no tiene carga."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/weapons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "CE-4 \"The Claw\" (Lethal)"
msgid_plural "CE-4 \"The Claws\" (Lethal)"
msgstr[0] "CE-4 \"La Garra\" (Letal)"
msgstr[1] "CE-4 \"Las Garras\" (Letal)"
msgstr[2] "CE-4 \"Las Garras\" (Letal)"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/weapons.json
#. ~ Description of "CE-4 "The Claw" (Lethal)"
msgid ""
"The CE-4, commonly known as \"The Claw\", is a popular self-defense weapon "
"used by corporate enforcers everywhere, especially on dangerous frontier "
"planets.  Made from a cylinder of heat activated memory-alloy, the flick of a "
"switch allows it to morph between a less-lethal bludgeon form and a "
"sharpened, super heated blade.  Currently, it is in its lethal configuration, "
"and looks like a sleek sword, humming softly as its blade glows from heat."
msgstr ""
"El CE-4, comúnmente conocido como \"La Garra\", es un arma de autodefensa muy "
"popular que utilizan los agentes corporativos de todo el mundo, especialmente "
"en los peligrosos planetas fronterizos. Fabricada con un cilindro de aleación "
"de memoria activada por el calor, con sólo pulsar un interruptor puede "
"cambiar entre una forma de porra menos letal y una hoja afilada y "
"supercaliente. Actualmente, está en su configuración letal, y parece una "
"elegante espada, zumbando suavemente mientras su hoja brilla por el calor."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/weapons.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "CE-4 "The Claw" (Lethal)"
msgid ""
"The blade stops humming, and its edge dissipates into a smooth curve as it "
"cools."
msgstr "La hoja deja de zumbar y su filo se disipa en una suave curva al enfriarse."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/weapons.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "Alien lune"
msgid_plural "Alien lunes"
msgstr[0] "luna Alien"
msgstr[1] "lunas Alien"
msgstr[2] "lunas Alien"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/weapons.json
#. ~ Description of gun "Alien lune"
#. ~ Description of "Alien lune"
msgid ""
"A delicate strand of light links the antipodes of this crescent-shaped "
"device.  If the strand is interrupted, the device clanks and shudders before "
"violently emitting a bolt of plasma from its apex."
msgstr ""
"Un delicado hilo de luz une las antípodas de este dispositivo en forma de "
"media luna. Si el hilo se interrumpe, el dispositivo choca y se estremece "
"antes de emitir violentamente un rayo de plasma desde su vértice."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/weapons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "hydraulic gauntlet"
msgid_plural "hydraulic gauntlets"
msgstr[0] "guantelete hidráulico"
msgstr[1] "guanteletes hidráulicos"
msgstr[2] "guanteletes hidráulicos"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/weapons.json
#. ~ Description of "hydraulic gauntlet"
msgid ""
"A huge, heavy metal gauntlet lined with tubing and gauges.  Slow and "
"unwieldy, it uses internal pressure to deliver devastating blows, but takes "
"tremendous strength to use effectively.  Thanks to an internal microreactor, "
"it doesn't require power of its own."
msgstr ""
"Un enorme y pesado guante de metal forrado con tubos y medidores. Lento y "
"poco manejable, utiliza la presión interna para dar golpes devastadores, pero "
"requiere una tremenda fuerza para ser usado efectivamente. Gracias a un "
"microreactor interno, no requiere energía propia."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/weapons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "psychrophile handling gloves"
msgid_plural "psychrophile handling gloves"
msgstr[0] "guante de manejo para psicrófilo"
msgstr[1] "guantes de manejo para psicrófilos"
msgstr[2] "guantes de manejo para psicrófilos"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/weapons.json
#. ~ Description of "psychrophile handling gloves"
msgid ""
"These gloves are designed for handling organisms that live in extremely cold "
"temperatures.  They can also be used to freeze your foes to death."
msgstr ""
"Estos guantes están diseñados para manejar organismos que viven en "
"temperaturas extremadamente frías. También pueden ser usados para congelar a "
"tus enemigos hasta la muerte."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/weapons.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "deployed grenade launcher"
msgid_plural "deployed grenade launchers"
msgstr[0] "lanzagranada desplegable"
msgstr[1] "lanzagranadas desplegable"
msgstr[2] "lanzagranadas desplegable"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/weapons.json
#. ~ Description of gun "deployed grenade launcher"
#. ~ Description of "deployed grenade launcher"
msgid ""
"A grenade launcher mounted onto your right-hand wrist.  Less powerful than a "
"proper grenade launcher, but infinitely more portable, and quick to reload."
msgstr ""
"Un lanzagranadas montado en su muñeca derecha. Menos potente que un verdadero "
"lanzagranadas, pero infinitamente más portátil y rápido de recargar."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/weapons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "titanium bat"
msgid_plural "titanium bats"
msgstr[0] "bate de titanio"
msgstr[1] "bates de titanio"
msgstr[2] "bates de titanio"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/weapons.json
#. ~ Description of "titanium bat"
msgid ""
"A luxury baseball bat made out of titanium that was banned from competitive "
"sport due to the increased performance that put defenders at risk."
msgstr ""
"Un lujoso bate de béisbol hecho de titanio que fue prohibido en el deporte de "
"competición debido al aumento del rendimiento que ponía en riesgo a los "
"defensores."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/weapons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "bodyguard knife"
msgid_plural "bodyguard knives"
msgstr[0] "cuchillo de guardaespalda"
msgstr[1] "cuchillos de guardaespaldas"
msgstr[2] "cuchillos de guardaespaldas"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/weapons.json
#. ~ Description of "bodyguard knife"
msgid ""
"Designed to evade security measures, this knife is a must have for any "
"Cataclysm dinner party."
msgstr ""
"Diseñado para evadir las medidas de seguridad, este cuchillo es "
"imprescindible para cualquier cena del Cataclismo."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/weapons.json
