#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/weapons.json
#. ~ Description of "neurotoxic knife"
msgid ""
"A broad white-ceramic knife that is constantly kept coated in neurotoxic oil "
"by a handle mounted reservoir.  Don't cut yourself."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/weapons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "trident"
msgid_plural "tridents"
msgstr[0] "tridente"
msgstr[1] "tridentes"
msgstr[2] "tridentes"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/weapons.json
#. ~ Description of "trident"
msgid ""
"A three pronged spear that is surface treated to be used confidently above "
"and below water."
msgstr ""
"Una lanza de tres puntas que es tratada en la superficie para ser usada con "
"confianza por encima y por debajo del agua."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/weapons.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "Aztlani bow"
msgid_plural "Aztlani bows"
msgstr[0] "arco Aztlani"
msgstr[1] "arcos Aztlani"
msgstr[2] "arcos Aztlani"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/weapons.json
#. ~ Description of gun "Aztlani bow"
#. ~ Description of "Aztlani bow"
msgid ""
"An ornate bow used by Aztlani nobility during hunting rituals.  Designed to "
"fell the plated creatures of Aztlan, its articulated and power assisted limbs "
"allow it to fire projectiles with a strength comparable to modern assault "
"rifles.\n"
"\n"
"With its drawing aid system currently disabled, firing it will require truly "
"superhuman strength.  It can be activated to toggle it drawing assist "
"functionality."
msgstr ""
"Un arco ornamentado utilizado por la nobleza Aztlaní durante los rituales de "
"caza. Diseñado para abatir a las criaturas acorazadas de Aztlán, sus "
"extremidades articuladas y asistidas le permiten disparar proyectiles con una "
"fuerza comparable a la de los modernos rifles de asalto. \n"
"\n"
"Con su sistema de ayuda a la tracción actualmente desactivado, dispararlo "
"requerirá una fuerza verdaderamente sobrehumana. Puede activarse para activar "
"la función de ayuda al tensado."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/weapons.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "Aztlani bow"
msgid "You connect the bow to your UPS."
msgstr "Conectas el arco al SEU."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/weapons.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "Aztlani bow (active)"
msgid_plural "Aztlani bows (active)"
msgstr[0] "arco Aztlani (activo)"
msgstr[1] "arcos Aztlani (activos)"
msgstr[2] "arcos Aztlani (activos)"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/weapons.json
#. ~ Description of gun "Aztlani bow (active)"
#. ~ Description of "Aztlani bow (active)"
msgid ""
"An ornate bow used by Aztlani nobility during hunting rituals.  Designed to "
"fell the plated creatures of Aztlan, its articulated and power assisted limbs "
"allow it to fire projectiles with a strength comparable to modern assault "
"rifles.\n"
"\n"
"With its drawing aid system enabled, it can be much more easily drawn, at the "
"cost of a modest amount of UPS power consumption per arrow.  It can be "
"activated to toggle it drawing assist functionality."
msgstr ""
"Un arco ornamentado usado por la nobleza Aztlani durante los rituales de "
"caza. Diseñado para atacar las criaturas con placas de Aztlan, sus "
"extremidades articuladas y asistidas por energía te permite disparar "
"proyectiles con una fuerza comparable a la de un rifle de asalto moderno.\n"
"\n"
"Con su sistema de ayuda de tensado habilitado, se puede tensar fácilmente, a "
"costa de un consumo moderado de energía del SEU por cada flecha. Puede ser "
"activado para encender su funcionalidad de tensado rápido."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/weapons.json
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "Aztlani bow (active)"
msgid "You disconnect the UPS."
msgstr "Desconectas el SEU."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/weapons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Aztlani hunting sword"
msgid_plural "Aztlani hunting swords"
msgstr[0] "espada de caza Aztlani"
msgstr[1] "espadas de caza Aztlani"
msgstr[2] "espadas de caza Aztlani"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/weapons.json
#. ~ Description of "Aztlani hunting sword"
msgid ""
"An ornate, single-handed sword used by Aztlani hunters to finish injured "
"game.  Made from gleaming composite alloy, its tip and frontal blade have "
"been sharpened to a monomolecular point, while its back features a serrated "
"saw edge."
msgstr ""
"Una espada ornamentada de una sola mano utilizada por los cazadores aztlani "
"para rematar las piezas de caza heridas. Fabricada con una aleación compuesta "
"brillante, su punta y su hoja frontal han sido afiladas hasta conseguir una "
"punta monomolecular, mientras que su parte posterior presenta un filo de "
"sierra dentado."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/weapons.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "salvage bow"
msgid_plural "salvage bows"
msgstr[0] "arco recuperado"
msgstr[1] "arcos recuperados"
msgstr[2] "arcos recuperados"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/weapons.json
#. ~ Description of gun "salvage bow"
#. ~ Description of "salvage bow"
msgid ""
"A bow made from readily-available materials, and quickly and cheaply put "
"together.  It is not made to be pretty, but to get a job done.  Its nocks and "
"string are made of shape-memory alloy that help increase string tension in "
"the string.  The memory alloy requires a UPS source to be activated."
msgstr ""
"Un arco creado con materiales facilmente disponibles, y facil y barato de "
"crear. No fue creado para ser bonito, pero hace su trabajo. Su culatin y "
"cuerdas estan hechos de una aleación con forma de memoria que ayuda a "
"incrementar su tensión de cuerda. La aleación requiere una fuente SEU para "
"activarse."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/weapons.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "salvage crossbow"
msgid_plural "salvage crossbows"
msgstr[0] "ballesta recuperada"
msgstr[1] "ballestas recuperadas"
msgstr[2] "ballestas recuperadas"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/weapons.json
#. ~ Description of gun "salvage crossbow"
#. ~ Description of "salvage crossbow"
msgid ""
"A crossbow constructed of readily available materials, and quickly and "
"cheaply put together.  While it isn't very pretty, it gets the job done, and "
"its drawing mechanism is motorized allowing quick reloading."
msgstr ""
"Una ballesta construida con materiales fáciles de conseguir y montada de "
"forma rápida y barata. Aunque no es muy bonita, cumple su función, y su "
"mecanismo de tiro está motorizado, lo que permite una recarga rápida."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/weapons.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "monofilament whip"
msgid_plural "monofilament whips"
msgstr[0] "látigo de monofilamento"
msgstr[1] "látigos de monofilamento"
msgstr[2] "látigos de monofilamento"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/weapons.json
#. ~ Description of "monofilament whip"
msgid ""
"A long filament of nested carbon nanotubes only a few microns in diameter.  "
"In essence a very thin, very strong and very sharp blade that you throw at a "
"moment's notice."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/ammo/10mm.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/ammo/10mm.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "10mm FMJ caseless"
msgid_plural "10mm FMJ caseless"
msgstr[0] "10mm FMJ sin casquillo"
msgstr[1] "10mm FMJ sin casquillo"
msgstr[2] "10mm FMJ sin casquillo"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/ammo/10mm.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/ammo/10mm.json
#. ~ Description of "10mm FMJ caseless"
msgid ""
"Standardized 10mm ammunition with a brass jacketed projectile.  For as long "
"as you can remember bullets like these have been used for military, law "
"enforcement, and civilian use."
msgstr ""
"Munición estándar de 10mm con proyectil con chaqueta de latón. Desde que se "
"tiene memoria, balas como estas se han utilizado para uso militar, policial y "
"civil."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/ammo/10mm.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/ammo/10mm.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "10mm JHP caseless"
msgid_plural "10mm JHP caseless"
msgstr[0] "10mm JHP sin casquillo"
msgstr[1] "10mm JHP sin casquillo"
msgstr[2] "10mm JHP sin casquillo"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/ammo/10mm.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/ammo/10mm.json
#. ~ Description of "10mm JHP caseless"
msgid ""
"Standardized 10mm ammunition with a hollow point projectile.  While they have "
"inferior penetration to FMJ rounds, their expansion slightly increases "
"stopping power against unarmed targets and reduces overpenetration."
msgstr ""
"Munición estándar de 10mm con un proyectil de punta hueca. Aunque su "
"penetración es inferior a los cartuchos FMJ, su expansión aumenta ligeramente "
"el poder de detención contra objetivos desarmados y reduce la "
"sobrepenetración."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/ammo/10mm.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/ammo/10mm.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "10mm SDART"
msgid_plural "10mm SDART"
msgstr[0] "SDART 10mm"
msgstr[1] "SDART 10mm"
msgstr[2] "SDART 10mm"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/ammo/10mm.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/ammo/10mm.json
#. ~ Description of "10mm SDART"
msgid ""
"High precision 10mm microjet darts.  These low velocity rounds can adjust "
"mid-flight to exploit weaknesses in the target's defenses."
msgstr ""
"Dardos de microchorro de 10 mm de alta precisión. Estos proyectiles de baja "
"velocidad pueden ajustarse en pleno vuelo para aprovechar los puntos débiles "
"de las defensas del objetivo."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/ammo/25mm.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/ammo/25mm.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "25mm canister shot"
msgid_plural "25mm canister shot"
msgstr[0] "bote de metralla 25mm"
msgstr[1] "bote de metralla 25mm"
msgstr[2] "bote de metralla 25mm"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/ammo/25mm.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/ammo/25mm.json
#. ~ Description of "25mm canister shot"
msgid ""
"A 25mm round with a canister shot load, deals devastating damage against "
"lightly armored foes within mid to close range.  Relatively low tech and "
"affordable when compared to other 25mm grenades, these are often fielded by "
"frontier outfits due to their adequate performance in anti-drone and close "
"quarters combat."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/ammo/25mm.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/ammo/25mm.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "25mm Ball"
msgid_plural "25mm Ball"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/ammo/25mm.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/ammo/25mm.json
#. ~ Description of "25mm Ball"
msgid ""
"Standard issue UICA 25mm rounds, loading a single lead-core steel-jacketed "
"projectile.  Suitable for general purpose and anti-personnel use, these are "
"the most common 25mm rounds in circulation."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/ammo/25mm.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/ammo/25mm.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "25mm FRAG"
msgid_plural "25mm FRAG"
msgstr[0] "25mm FRAG"
msgstr[1] "25mm FRAG"
msgstr[2] "25mm FRAG"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/ammo/25mm.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/ammo/25mm.json
#. ~ Description of "25mm FRAG"
msgid ""
"Standard issue UICA 25mm rounds, each loading a plastic explosive charge "
"within a frangible ceramic projectile."
msgstr ""
"Cartuchos de 25mm estándar UICA, cada una con una carga plástica explosiva "
"dentro de un frágil proyectil cerámico."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/ammo/25mm.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/ammo/25mm.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "25mm APFSDS"
msgid_plural "25mm APFSDS"
msgstr[0] "25mm APFSDS"
msgstr[1] "25mm APFSDS"
msgstr[2] "25mm APFSDS"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/ammo/25mm.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/ammo/25mm.json
#. ~ Description of "25mm APFSDS"
msgid ""
"Standard issue UICA 25mm rounds, each concealing a finned tungsten-alloy "
"kinetic penetrator within a biodegradable plastic sabot.  Designed to defeat "
"modern personal and light-vehicle armor, these are illegal to own, and thus "
"are seldomly seen outside of military armories."
msgstr ""
"Cartuchos UICA estándar de 25 mm, cada uno con un penetrador cinético de "
"aleación de tungsteno con aletas dentro de un casquillo de plástico "
"biodegradable. Diseñadas para derrotar a los modernos blindajes personales y "
"de vehículos ligeros, su posesión es ilegal, por lo que rara vez se ven fuera "
"de los arsenales militares."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/ammo/25mm.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/ammo/25mm.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "25mm SDART"
msgid_plural "25mm SDART"
msgstr[0] "SDART 25mm"
msgstr[1] "SDART 25mm"
msgstr[2] "SDART 25mm"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/ammo/25mm.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/ammo/25mm.json
#. ~ Description of "25mm SDART"
msgid ""
"High precision 25mm microjet darts.  These low velocity rounds can adjust "
"mid-flight to exploit weaknesses in the target's defenses."
msgstr ""
"Dardos de microchorro de 25 mm de alta precisión. Estos proyectiles de baja "
"velocidad pueden ajustarse en pleno vuelo para aprovechar los puntos débiles "
"de las defensas del objetivo."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/ammo/5x50.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/ammo/5x50.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "RA110 5x50mm flechette"
msgid_plural "RA110 5x50mm flechettes"
msgstr[0] "RA110 5x50mm flechette"
msgstr[1] "RA110 5x50mm flechette"
msgstr[2] "RA110 5x50mm flechette"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/ammo/5x50.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/ammo/5x50.json
#. ~ Description of "RA110 5x50mm flechette"
msgid ""
"Designed to defeat modern body armor, the Rivtech 5x50mm flechette round "
"features a biodegradable sabot and a single, fin-stabilized penetrator."
msgstr ""
"Diseñada para atravesar el blindaje corporal moderno, la bala Rivtech 5x50mm "
"flechette se caracteriza por un sabot biodegradable y un  penetrador "
"estabilizado por aletas."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/ammo/5x50.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/ammo/5x50.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "RA119 5x50mm penetrator"
msgid_plural "RA119 5x50mm penetrators"
msgstr[0] "RA119 5x50mm penetrante"
msgstr[1] "RA119 5x50mm penetrante"
msgstr[2] "RA119 5x50mm penetrante"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/ammo/5x50.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/ammo/5x50.json
#. ~ Description of "RA119 5x50mm penetrator"
msgid ""
"Designed to defeat modern body armor, the Rivtech 5x50mm RA119 penetrator "
"round features a biodegradable sabot and a single, fin-stabilized tungsten "
"alloy projectile."
msgstr ""
"Diseñado para atravesar el blindaje corporal moderno, la bala Rivtech 5x50mm "
"RA119 penetrante se caracteriza por el sabot biodegradable y  un proyectil de "
"aleación de tungsteno estabilizado por aletas."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/ammo/5x50.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/ammo/5x50.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "5x50mm flechette, reloaded"
msgid_plural "5x50mm flechettes, reloaded"
msgstr[0] "5x50mm flechette, recargada"
msgstr[1] "5x50mm flechette, recargada"
msgstr[2] "5x50mm flechette, recargada"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/ammo/5x50.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/ammo/5x50.json
#. ~ Description of "5x50mm flechette, reloaded"
msgid ""
"Designed to defeat modern body armor, the Rivtech 5x50mm flechette round "
"features a biodegradable sabot and a single, fin-stabilized penetrator.  This "
"one has been hand-reloaded by a lucky survivor or perhaps a pre-Cataclysm "
"corporate spy, leading to slightly inferior performance compared to "
"factory-produced ammo."
msgstr ""
"La munición Rivtech 5x50mm, diseñada para destruir blindajes modernos, cuenta "
"con un sabot biodegradable y un único penetrador estabilizado por aletas. "
"Esta ha sido recargada a mano por un afortunado superviviente o quizás por un "
"espía corporativo antes del cataclismo, lo que hace que su rendimiento sea "
"ligeramente inferior al de la munición producida en fábrica."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/ammo/7.50mm.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/ammo/7.50mm.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "7.50mm caseless"
msgid_plural "7.50mm caseless"
msgstr[0] "7.50mm sin casquillo"
msgstr[1] "7.50mm sin casquillo"
msgstr[2] "7.50mm sin casquillo"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/ammo/7.50mm.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/ammo/7.50mm.json
#. ~ Description of "7.50mm caseless"
msgid ""
"An intermediate bullet with an acceptable all-round performance.  Due to "
"their role as UICA's standard issue rifle cartridge, these are ubiquitous "
"wherever Earth makes its presence be known."
msgstr ""
"Una bala intermedia con un rendimiento general aceptable. Debido a su papel "
"como cartucho estándar para rifles de la UICA, son omnipresentes allí donde "
"la Tierra hace acto de presencia."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/ammo/7.50mm.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/ammo/7.50mm.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "7.50mm AP caseless"
msgid_plural "7.50mm AP caseless"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/ammo/7.50mm.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/ammo/7.50mm.json
#. ~ Description of "7.50mm AP caseless"
msgid ""
"Armor piercing 7.50mm ammunition with a tungsten carbide penetrator.  These "
"rounds are designed to defeat body armor and other hard targets, but have "
"reduced stopping power against unarmored targets."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/ammo/7.50mm.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/ammo/7.50mm.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "7.50mm RP"
msgid_plural "7.50mm RP"
msgstr[0] "7.50mm RP"
msgstr[1] "7.50mm RP"
msgstr[2] "7.50mm RP"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/ammo/7.50mm.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/ammo/7.50mm.json
#. ~ Description of "7.50mm RP"
msgid ""
"Civilian-legal 7.50mm ammunition featuring a reduced propellant case and "
"unjacketed projectiles.  The 7.50mm RP round is extremely weak with very low "
"stopping power, short range, and negligible recoil.  While cheaper than "
"military grade rounds, it's only really useful for rifle training, and for "
"hunting small animals."
msgstr ""
"Munición de 7.50mm de uso civil con carcasa de propelente reducido y "
"proyectiles sin chaqueta. La munición RP de 7.50mm es extremadamente débil, "
"con un poder de parada muy bajo, un corto alcance y un retroceso "
"insignificante. Aunque es más barata que la munición militar, sólo es útil "
"para el entrenamiento con rifles y para cazar animales pequeños."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/ammo/7.50mm.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/ammo/7.50mm.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "7.50mm SDART"
msgid_plural "7.50mm SDART"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/ammo/7.50mm.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/ammo/7.50mm.json
#. ~ Description of "7.50mm SDART"
msgid ""
"High precision 7.50mm microjet darts for use in smart weaponry.  These low "
"velocity rounds can adjust mid-flight to exploit weaknesses in the target's "
"defenses."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/ammo/battery.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/ammo/battery.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "electric charge"
msgid_plural "electric charge"
msgstr[0] "carga eléctrica"
msgstr[1] "cargas eléctricas"
msgstr[2] "cargas eléctricas"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/ammo/battery.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/ammo/battery.json
#. ~ Description of "electric charge"
msgid ""
"Electric charge collected and stored through methods now undecipherable.  "
"Somehow increases the performance of laser weaponry."
msgstr ""
"Carga eléctrica recogida y almacenada mediante métodos ahora indescifrables. "
"De alguna manera aumenta el rendimiento del armamento láser."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/ammo/flashbulb.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/ammo/flashbulb.json
#. ~ Description of "82x225mm flashbulb"
msgid ""
"Pyrotechnic flash lamps designed to emit and focus a millisecond pulse laser "
"through controlled detonation."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/ammo/foam.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/ammo/foam.json
#. ~ Description of "foamcrete"
msgid ""
"The chemical precursors of foamcrete, a quick-hardening, resilient substance "
"that readily expands on contact with air.  Originally designed for structural "
"repair in commercial spaceflight, it can be used to quickly erect walls and "
"platforms, or to encase foes."
msgstr ""
"Los precursores químicos del hormigón celular, una sustancia de "
"endurecimiento rápido y resistente que se expande fácilmente en contacto con "
"el aire. Originalmente diseñado para la reparación estructural en los vuelos "
"espaciales comerciales, puede ser usado para erigir rápidamente muros/paredes "
"y plataformas, o para encerrar a los enemigos."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/ammo/foam.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/ammo/foam.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "wide-range pesticide"
msgid_plural "wide-range pesticide"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/ammo/foam.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/ammo/foam.json
#. ~ Description of "wide-range pesticide"
msgid ""
"An old Thistle Industries neurotoxic pesticide that can be used to kill "
"insects, plants, mammals, nematodes, fungi and most organisms not genetically "
"engineered to withstand its assault.  Even short exposure is likely to prove "
"fatal.  Frontier rated only."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/ammo/metal_rail.json
