msgid ""
"A lightweight steel-reinforced tool carrier.  Keeps your tools safe and about "
"in zero-g, Mars, the bottom of the Pacific, or other generally inhospitable "
"environments.  It has several deep pockets, and two mounting points for "
"pressurized canisters or other large magazines."
msgstr ""
"Un portaherramientas de acero reforzado ligero. Mantiene tus herramientas "
"seguras y a salvo en gravedad cero, Marte, el fondo del Pacífico, u otros "
"ambientes generalmente inhóspitos. Tiene varios bolsillos profundos, y dos "
"puntos de montaje para tanques presurizados o cargadores grandes."

