#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/headsets.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/headsets.json
#. ~ Description of "tactical infovisor"
msgid ""
"An armored black headset that coalesces the feeds of several sensors into a "
"single screen display.  It provides generalized assistance in combat, "
"including targeting assistance for thrown and ranged weaponry, threat "
"identification, conditional NV and thermal vision and protection against high "
"intensity light sources."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/jetpacks.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/jetpacks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "rocket pack"
msgid_plural "rocket packs"
msgstr[0] "mochila propulsora"
msgstr[1] "mochilas propulsoras"
msgstr[2] "mochilas propulsoras"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/jetpacks.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/jetpacks.json
#. ~ Description of "rocket pack"
msgid ""
"A back mounted rocket pack, its well worn superalloy nozzles seem to suggest "
"great age.  Units like this one are rarely used by elite military forces and "
"by scavenger-explorers hoping to find high value salvage.  Not powerful "
"enough to enable true flight within a gravity well, but it may still be used "
"to perform short jumps and air-dashes."
msgstr ""
"Una mochila cohete montada en la espalda, sus toberas de superaleación muy "
"desgastadas parecen sugerir una gran antigüedad. Las unidades como ésta rara "
"vez son utilizadas por las fuerzas militares de élite y por los "
"carroñeros-exploradores con la esperanza de encontrar salvamento de gran "
"valor. No es lo bastante potente como para permitir un verdadero vuelo dentro "
"de un pozo gravitatorio, pero puede utilizarse para realizar saltos cortos y "
"carreras aéreas."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/jetpacks.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/jetpacks.json
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "rocket pack"
msgid "The rocket pack fuel tank.  Holds up to 10 liters of pressurized fuel."
msgstr ""
"Una mochila tanque de combustible para cohete.  Soporta hasta 10 litros de "
"combustible presurizado."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/military_armor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/military_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "ballistic collar"
msgid ""
"Front and back nylon collar assemblies with armor inserts for neck "
"protection.  Designed to be attached to heavy military body armor."
msgstr ""

