#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/winter_masks.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/winter_masks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Magellan helmet CA."
msgid_plural "Magellan helmets CA."
msgstr[0] "Casco Magallanes CA."
msgstr[1] "Cascos Magallanes CA."
msgstr[2] "Cascos Magallanes CA."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/winter_masks.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/winter_masks.json
#. ~ Description of "Magellan helmet CA."
msgid ""
"The high quality helmet of a Magellan exosuit, adapted to handle the freezing "
"but breathable air of Salus IV.  In addition to its life support "
"functionality, it features a minor augmented reality UI overlay and a "
"retractable gold-plated visor to protect against glare and UV light.  "
"Although not armored as such, it's strong enough to handle minor blunt "
"impacts."
msgstr ""
"El casco de alta calidad de un exotraje Magallanes, adaptado para soportar el "
"aire gélido pero transpirable de Salus IV. Además de su funcionalidad de "
"soporte vital, cuenta con una pequeña superposición de interfaz de usuario de "
"realidad aumentada y un visor retráctil chapado en oro para proteger del "
"deslumbramiento y la luz ultravioleta. Aunque no está blindado como tal, es "
"lo suficientemente fuerte como para soportar pequeños impactos contundentes."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/winter_masks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Magellan helmet CA. (on)"
msgid_plural "Magellan helmets CA. (on)"
msgstr[0] "Cascos Magallanes CA. (on)"
msgstr[1] "Cascos Magallanes CA. (on)"
msgstr[2] "Cascos Magallanes CA. (on)"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/winter_masks.json
#. ~ Description of "Magellan helmet CA. (on)"
msgid ""
"The temperature control units and augmented reality overlays of this "
"high-tech garment are currently active, and continuously draining battery "
"power.  Use it to turn them off."
msgstr ""
"Las unidades de control de la temperatura y las superposiciones de realidad "
"aumentada de esta prenda de alta tecnología están actualmente activas y "
"consumen continuamente la energía de la batería. Usar para apagar."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/winter_masks.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/winter_masks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "frontier cryomask"
msgid_plural "frontier cryomasks"
msgstr[0] "criomáscara de frontera"
msgstr[1] "criomáscaras de frontera"
msgstr[2] "criomáscaras de frontera"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/winter_masks.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/winter_masks.json
#. ~ Description of "frontier cryomask"
msgid ""
"A common, industrially printed respirator cleverly retrofitted into a "
"wearable air heater.  While it adequately protects against the cold, most of "
"its original functions have been discarded and it offers no noticeable "
"protection against noxious fumes or other environmental hazards."
msgstr ""
"Un respirador común, impreso industrialmente, ingeniosamente reconvertido en "
"un calentador de aire portátil. Aunque protege adecuadamente contra el frío, "
"la mayoría de sus funciones originales se han descartado y no ofrece ninguna "
"protección apreciable contra los humos nocivos u otros riesgos ambientales."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/winter_masks.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "frontier cryomask (on)"
msgid_plural "frontier cryomasks (on)"
msgstr[0] "criomáscara de frontera (on)"
msgstr[1] "criomáscaras de frontera (on)"
msgstr[2] "criomáscaras de frontera (on)"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/winter_masks.json
#. ~ Description of "frontier cryomask (on)"
msgid ""
"The heater of this high-tech garment is currently active, and continuously "
"draining battery power.  Use it to turn the heat off."
msgstr ""
"El calentador de esta prenda de alta tecnología está activo y consume "
"continuamente la energía de la batería. Usar para apagar el calentador."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/winter_suits.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/winter_suits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Magellan exosuit"
msgid_plural "Magellan exosuits"
msgstr[0] "exotraje Magallanes"
msgstr[1] "exotrajes Magallanes"
msgstr[2] "exotrajes Magallanes"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/winter_suits.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/winter_suits.json
#. ~ Description of "Magellan exosuit"
msgid ""
"A high-quality, civilian grade EVA suit often employed by well-established "
"frontier research and exploration associations.  Designed to support the "
"exploration of challenging terrain, it offers respectable protection against "
"common environmental hazards like extreme temperatures, inhospitable "
"atmospheres, and light radiation.  It leaves arms and hands relatively "
"unencumbered to aid the manipulation of scientific instruments.\n"
"\n"
"An integral battery allows the suit to operate for up to 34 hours, but "
"complicates field recharging."
msgstr ""
"Un traje EVA civil de alta calidad que suelen emplear asociaciones de "
"investigación y exploración fronterizas bien establecidas. Diseñado para "
"apoyar la exploración de terrenos difíciles, ofrece una protección respetable "
"contra los riesgos ambientales habituales, como las temperaturas extremas, "
"las atmósferas inhóspitas y la radiación luminosa. Deja los brazos y las "
"manos relativamente libres para facilitar la manipulación de los instrumentos "
"científicos.\n"
"\n"
"Una batería integrada permite que el traje funcione hasta 34 horas, pero "
"complica la recarga sobre el terreno."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/winter_suits.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/winter_suits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Magellan exosuit (on)"
msgid_plural "Magellan exosuits (on)"
msgstr[0] "exotraje Magallanes (on)"
msgstr[1] "exotrajes Magallanes (on)"
msgstr[2] "exotrajes Magallanes (on)"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/winter_suits.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/winter_suits.json
#. ~ Description of "Magellan exosuit (on)"
#. ~ Description of "frontier cryo suit (on)"
#. ~ Description of "combat cryo suit (on)"
msgid ""
"The temperature control units of this high-tech garment are currently active, "
"and continuously draining battery power.  Use it to turn them off."
msgstr ""
"Las unidades de control de temperatura de esta prenda de alta tecnología "
"estan activas, y drenando energía continuamente. Usar para apagar."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/winter_suits.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/winter_suits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "frontier cryo suit"
msgid_plural "frontier cryo suits"
msgstr[0] "criotraje de frontera"
msgstr[1] "criotrajes de frontera"
msgstr[2] "criotrajes de frontera"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/winter_suits.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/winter_suits.json
#. ~ Description of "frontier cryo suit"
msgid ""
"A sturdy suit meant to protect against the freezing cold, made from a pair of "
"jumpsuits that have been woven around a heavy insulation layer and "
"crisscrossed with the thermal tubing of a heat regulation unit.  The thick "
"insulation allows the suit to function with unrivaled efficiency, but also "
"makes all types of movement difficult."
msgstr ""
"Un traje robusto destinado a proteger del frío glacial, hecho con un par de "
"monos que se han tejido alrededor de una pesada capa aislante y se han "
"entrecruzado con tubos térmicos de una unidad de regulación del calor. El "
"grueso aislamiento permite que el traje funcione con una eficacia "
"inigualable, pero también dificulta todo tipo de movimientos."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/winter_suits.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/winter_suits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "frontier cryo suit (on)"
msgid_plural "frontier cryo suits (on)"
msgstr[0] "criotraje de frontera (on)"
msgstr[1] "criotrajes de frontera (on)"
msgstr[2] "criotrajes de frontera (on)"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/winter_suits.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/winter_suits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "combat cryo suit"
msgid_plural "combat cryo suits"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/winter_suits.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/winter_suits.json
#. ~ Description of "combat cryo suit"
msgid ""
"A sleek black undersuit criss-crossed with the tubing of a heat regulation "
"unit.  Insulation is kept at a minimum to allow for combat mobility, and the "
"suit is quite power hungry as a result.  Despite the name, it's minimally "
"protective and designed to be worn under a set of armor."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/winter_suits.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/winter_suits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "combat cryo suit (on)"
msgid_plural "combat cryo suits (on)"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/winter_suits.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/winter_suits.json
#. ~ Description of "combat cryo suit"
msgid ""
"A sleek black undersuit criss-crossed with the tubing of a heat regulation "
"unit.  Insulation is kept at a minimum to allow for combat mobility, and the "
"suit is quite power hungry as a result.  Despite the name, it's minimally "
"protective and designed to be worn under a set of armor.  Made to fit the "
"uplifted, the heavily augmented, or similarly sized individuals."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/winter_suits.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/winter_suits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cryopod bodyglove"
msgid_plural "cryopod bodygloves"
msgstr[0] "guante criópodo"
msgstr[1] "guantes criópodos"
msgstr[2] "guantes criópodos"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/winter_suits.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/winter_suits.json
#. ~ Description of "cryopod bodyglove"
msgid ""
"A dark orange bodyglove, hundreds of tubes curl over its surface, tracing the "
"contours of human musculature.  Meant to control body temperature during "
"prolonged cryopreservation, it could easily keep you comfortable in any "
"earthly climate.  Use it to activate its climate control functionality."
msgstr ""
"Un traje de neopreno naranja oscuro, cientos de tubos se enrollan sobre su "
"superficie, trazando los contornos de la musculatura humana. Destinado a "
"controlar la temperatura corporal durante la criopreservación prolongada, "
"podría mantenerle a gusto en cualquier clima terrestre. Usar para activar su "
"función de control de temperatura."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/winter_suits.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/winter_suits.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cryopod bodyglove (on)"
msgid_plural "cryopod bodygloves (on)"
msgstr[0] "guante criópodo (on)"
msgstr[1] "guantes criópodos (on)"
msgstr[2] "guantes criópodos (on)"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/winter_suits.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/winter_suits.json
#. ~ Description of "cryopod bodyglove (on)"
msgid ""
"A dark orange bodyglove, hundreds of tubes curl over its surface, tracing the "
"contours of human musculature.  Meant to control body temperature during "
"prolonged cryopreservation, it could easily keep you comfortable in any "
"earthly climate.  The temperature control units of this high-tech garment are "
"currently active, and continuously draining battery power.  Use it to turn "
"them off."
msgstr ""
"Un traje de neopreno corporal naranja oscuro, cientos de tubos se enroscan en "
"su superficie, trazando los contornos de la musculatura humana. Destinado a "
"controlar la temperatura corporal durante la criopreservación prolongada, "
"podría mantenerte cómodo fácilmente en cualquier clima terrestre. Las "
"unidades de control de temperatura de esta prenda de alta tecnología están "
"activadas y consumen batería continuamente. Usar para apagar."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_ammo.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_components.json
