msgstr[0] "soplete de plasma 392-UASTA"
msgstr[1] "sopletes de plasma 392-UASTA"
msgstr[2] "sopletes de plasma 392-UASTA"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_melee.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_melee.json
#. ~ Description of "392-UASTA plasma torch"
msgid ""
"One of the many versions of UASTA certified plasma torches, essentially a "
"civilian plasma railgun used to deliver focused waves of plasma for precision "
"welding or metal cutting.  This is a larger, more powerful model meant to be "
"used by an exosuit for heavy engineering tasks.  Heavy cables run from the "
"module to a handheld trigger mechanism."
msgstr ""
"Una de las muchas versiones de sopletes de plasma certificados por la UASTA, "
"esencialmente un cañón de riel de plasma civil utilizado para lanzar ondas "
"focalizadas de plasma para soldadura de precisión o corte de metal. Se trata "
"de un modelo más grande y potente destinado a ser utilizado por un exotraje "
"para tareas de ingeniería pesadas. Unos cables pesados van desde el módulo "
"hasta un mecanismo de disparo manual."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_melee.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_melee.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "exosuit power cutter (off)"
msgid_plural "exosuit power cutters (off)"
msgstr[0] "cortadora eléctrica de exotraje (apag.)"
msgstr[1] "cortadoras eléctricas de exotraje (apag.)"
msgstr[2] "cortadoras eléctricas de exotraje (apag.)"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_melee.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_melee.json
#. ~ Description of "exosuit power cutter (off)"
msgid ""
"A huge, multi-fuel powered saw with a diamond blade, mounted on an exosuit.  "
"If it has fuel, it can be turned on to turn it into a powerful metal cutting "
"tool.  Heavy cables run from the module to a handheld trigger mechanism."
msgstr ""
"Una enorme sierra con una hoja de diamante que funciona con varios "
"combustibles, montada en un exotraje. Si tiene combustible, puede encenderse "
"para convertirse en una potente herramienta de corte de metal. Unos cables "
"pesados van desde el módulo hasta un mecanismo de disparo manual."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_melee.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_melee.json
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "exosuit power cutter (off)"
msgid "This is a tank for fuel.  Holds up to 1 liter."
msgstr "Este es un depósito para combustible. Tiene capacidad para 1 litro."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_melee.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_melee.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "exosuit power cutter (on)"
msgid_plural "exosuit power cutters (on)"
msgstr[0] "cortadora eléctrica de exotraje (enc.)"
msgstr[1] "cortadoras eléctricas de exotraje (enc.)"
msgstr[2] "cortadoras eléctricas de exotraje (enc.)"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_melee.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_melee.json
#. ~ Description of "exosuit power cutter (on)"
msgid ""
"A huge, multi-fuel powered saw with a diamond blade, currently a whirling "
"blur.  It's consuming fuel and can be used as a fantastic tool for cutting "
"metal.  You can also use it as a terrifying weapon, if you're into that sort "
"of thing."
msgstr ""
"Una enorme sierra propulsada por varios combustibles con una hoja de "
"diamante, actualmente un borrón giratorio. Consume combustible y puede usarse "
"como una fantástica herramienta para cortar metal. También puedes usarla como "
"arma aterradora, si te van ese tipo de cosas."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_modules.json
