#. ~ Description of "exosuit multi-lens zoom module"
msgid ""
"A series of strangely shaped hexagonal lenses that flutter about inside your "
"helmet.  As the lenses shift things around you stay perfectly in focus no "
"matter your eyesight or distance.  It can be mounted to an exosuit helmet."
msgstr ""
"Una serie de lentes hexagonales de formas extrañas que revolotean dentro del "
"casco. Como las lentes desplazan las cosas, se mantiene perfectamente "
"enfocado sin importar la vista o la distancia. Puede montarse en el casco de "
"un exotraje."

