#. ~ Item name
msgid "exosuit heavy flamethrower"
msgid_plural "exosuit heavy flamethrowers"
msgstr[0] "lanzallamas pesado para exotraje"
msgstr[1] "lanzallamas pesados para exotrajes"
msgstr[2] "lanzallamas pesados para exotrajes"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_ranged.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_ranged.json
#. ~ Description of "exosuit heavy flamethrower"
msgid ""
"A bulky flamethrower unit mounted on the shoulder of an exosuit.  An internal "
"compressor adds extra range and spread to the flame compared to most handheld "
"flame units."
msgstr ""
"Una voluminosa unidad lanzallamas montada en el hombro de un exotraje. Un "
"compresor interno aumenta el alcance y la propagación de la llama en "
"comparación con la mayoría de los lanzallamas portátiles."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_ranged.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_ranged.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "exosuit sonic cannon"
msgid_plural "exosuit sonic cannons"
msgstr[0] "cañón sónico de exotraje"
msgstr[1] "cañones sónicos de exotraje"
msgstr[2] "cañones sónicos de exotraje"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_ranged.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_ranged.json
#. ~ Description of "exosuit sonic cannon"
msgid ""
"A 'less-lethal' weapon mounted on the shoulder of an exosuit, it emits an "
"extremely loud high-frequency pulse in a wide arc.  Useful for discouraging "
"crowds, less useful for stealthy operations."
msgstr ""
"Un arma 'menos letal' montada en el hombro de un exotraje, emite un pulso de "
"alta frecuencia extremadamente potente en un amplio arco. Resulta útil para "
"disuadir a las multitudes, pero no tanto en operaciones sigilosas."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_ranged.json
