"Most ramen served in the frontier is already vegan through the use of "
"synthetic meat and other meat substitutes.  This variant simply doesn't "
"pretend to include any meat at all.  Slightly spicy."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/veggies.json
