#. ~ Description of "artificial neural tissue"
msgid ""
"Photonic axons process thought at speeds far surpassing primitive, "
"chemical-driven communication."
msgstr ""
"Axones fotónicos procesan el pensamiento a velocidades que superan con creces "
"la comunicación primitiva, impulsada por productos químicos."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/neural_io_scrap.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/crafting_scrap/neural_io_scrap.json
