#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/25mm.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/25mm.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "Gibson S86"
msgid_plural "Gibson S86s"
msgstr[0] "Gibson S86"
msgstr[1] "Gibsons S86"
msgstr[2] "Gibsons S86"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/25mm.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/25mm.json
#. ~ Description of gun "Gibson S86"
#. ~ Description of "Gibson S86"
msgid ""
"Manufactured by Gibson Armory, the S86 is a light-weight grenade launcher "
"designed to take care of moderately armored opponents.  While the S86 "
"firepower is nothing to truly gawk at, it still packs quite a punch both for "
"the target and user and is usually mounted as it is impossible to fire with "
"average strength."
msgstr ""
"Fabricado por Gibson Armory, el S86 es un lanzagranadas ligero diseñado para "
"encargarse de oponentes moderadamente blindados. Aunque la potencia de fuego "
"del S86 no es nada del otro mundo, sigue siendo muy potente, tanto para el "
"objetivo como para el usuario, y suele montarse, ya que es imposible de "
"disparar con una fuerza media."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/25mm.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/25mm.json
#. ~ Firing mode of gun
msgid "DOUBLE"
msgstr "DOBLE"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/25mm.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/25mm.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "1025 Goa"
msgid_plural "1025 Goa"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/25mm.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/25mm.json
#. ~ Description of gun "1025 Goa"
#. ~ Description of "1025 Goa"
msgid ""
"A powerful, single shot 25mm rifle, heavy under the weight of several recoil "
"dampening mechanisms.  Designed by the now defunct Goa Firearms, it was "
"originally conceived as a luxury rifle for sport hunting alien megafauna."
msgstr ""
"Un potente rifle monotiro de 25mm, pesado bajo el peso de varios mecanismos "
"de amortiguación del retroceso. Diseñado por la desaparecida Goa Firearms, "
"fue concebido originalmente como un rifle de lujo para la caza deportiva de "
"megafauna alienígena."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/25mm.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/25mm.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "Wraitheon Armory 2519"
msgid_plural "Wraitheon Armory 2519s"
msgstr[0] "Wraitheon Armory 2519"
msgstr[1] "Wraitheon Armory 2519"
msgstr[2] "Wraitheon Armory 2519"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/25mm.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/25mm.json
#. ~ Description of gun "Wraitheon Armory 2519"
#. ~ Description of "Wraitheon Armory 2519"
msgid ""
"The much feared 2519 smart sniper platform leverages advanced ballistic "
"targeting and guidance computers to deliver heavy munitions with unerring "
"precision.  Its undisputed lethality makes it a rare sight outside of the "
"company's max security divisions."
msgstr ""
"La muy temida plataforma de francotirador inteligente 2519 aprovecha los "
"avanzados ordenadores de puntería y guiado balístico para lanzar munición "
"pesada con una precisión infalible. Su indiscutible letalidad la convierte en "
"una rareza fuera de las divisiones de máxima seguridad de la empresa."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/40mm_grenade.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/40mm_grenade.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
