msgid_plural "mounted x-ray cannons"
msgstr[0] "cañón de rayos x montado"
msgstr[1] "cañones de rayos x montados"
msgstr[2] "cañones de rayos x montados"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/laser.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/laser.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "shoddy laser rifle"
msgid_plural "shoddy laser rifles"
msgstr[0] "rifle láser de mala calidad"
msgstr[1] "rifles láser de mala calidad"
msgstr[2] "rifles láser de mala calidad"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/laser.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/laser.json
#. ~ Description of gun "shoddy laser rifle"
#. ~ Description of "shoddy laser rifle"
msgid ""
"This is a cheap laser rifle made from common components.  Weak, but can be "
"powered with rechargeable batteries."
msgstr ""
"Es un rifle láser barato hecho de componentes comunes. Es frágil, pero puede "
"ser alimentado por baterías recargables."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/laser.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/laser.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "av-22"
msgid_plural "av-22s"
msgstr[0] "av-22"
msgstr[1] "av-22"
msgstr[2] "av-22"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/laser.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/laser.json
#. ~ Description of gun "av-22"
#. ~ Description of "av-22"
msgid ""
"A common pulse-laser pistol cleared for civilian use.  Recoilless, "
"energy-efficient, and easy to use, the av-22 is often carried as a defense "
"weapon by those who lack the practice required to effectively use ballistic "
"weaponry.  Due to its low power, it must be fired in sequence mode to stand a "
"chance against hardened foes."
msgstr ""
"Una pistola láser de pulso común autorizada para uso civil. Sin retroceso, de "
"bajo consumo y fácil de usar, la av-22 suele ser llevada como arma de defensa "
"por aquellos que carecen de la práctica necesaria para utilizar eficazmente "
"el armamento antibalas. Debido a su baja potencia, debe ser disparada en modo "
"secuencial para tener una oportunidad contra enemigos duros."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/laser.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/laser.json
#. ~ Firing mode of gun
msgid "pulse"
msgstr "pulso"

