"The single round 00 bore barrel built at the center of the T72 revolver.  Can "
"function as a backup in case the power pack of the main weapon is depleted."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/voltaic.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/voltaic.json
#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "R-PROTON ENR"
msgid_plural "R-PROTON ENRs"
msgstr[0] "R-PROTON ENR"
msgstr[1] "R-PROTON ENR"
msgstr[2] "R-PROTON ENR"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/voltaic.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/voltaic.json
#. ~ Description of gun "R-PROTON ENR"
#. ~ Description of "R-PROTON ENR"
msgid ""
"Within the solid barrel of the Raaz PROTON, an electrical anomaly is "
"carefully duplicated through magnetic stimulation and projected outwards.  "
"Freed from containment, the anomaly will temporarily settle in the physical "
"world and quickly emit its stored electrical charge before dissipating."
msgstr ""
"Dentro del sólido cañón del Raaz PROTON, se duplica con delicadeza una "
"anomalía eléctrica mediante estimulación magnética y se proyecta hacia el "
"exterior. Liberada de su contención, la anomalía se asentará temporalmente en "
"el mundo físico y emitirá rápidamente su carga eléctrica almacenada antes de "
"disiparse."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/voltaic.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/voltaic.json
