#. ~ Description of furniture "Deactivated Mercurial Resequencer"
msgid ""
"A large bio-sarcophagus and accompanying control machinery.  Used in gene "
"editing and for general medical purposes, can impart or remove traits using a "
"variety of gene templates.  This one stands lifelessly, its screens black and "
"the hum of machinery replaced by an eerie silence."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_habitat.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_habitat.json
