msgid ""
"A reclined metal chair adorned with soft fabric padding.  A number of cables "
"dangle from the headrest, waiting to be connected to a bionic interface.  In "
"the past, this state-of-the-art equipment would have served as a hypercloud "
"access point for cyber security specialists."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_habitat.json
