#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_habitat_wall.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_habitat_wall.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "habitat wall"
msgstr "muro/pared de hábitat"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_habitat_wall.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_habitat_wall.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "habitat wall"
msgid ""
"An industrially fabricated assembly of lightweight metallic framing and "
"insulated cover sheets, used to quickly assemble standardized colonial "
"infrastructure.  Capable of resisting the merciless cold and not much else."
msgstr ""
"Un conjunto industrial de armazón metálico ligero y láminas de recubrimiento "
"aislantes, utilizado para montar rápidamente una infraestructura colonial "
"estandarizada. Capaz de resistir el frío implacable y poco más."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_habitat_wall.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_habitat_wall.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "habitat window"
msgstr "ventana de hábitat"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_habitat_wall.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_habitat_wall.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "habitat window"
msgid ""
"A prefabricated porthole style window, equipped with metallic shutters for "
"both protection and privacy purposes.  It cannot be opened, but with its "
"shutters are retracted, it could be smashed with no particular difficulty."
msgstr ""
"Una ventana prefabricada de estilo ojo de buey, equipada con persianas "
"metálicas con fines tanto de protección como de privacidad. No puede abrirse, "
"pero con los postigos recogidos puede romperse sin mayor dificultad."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_habitat_wall.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_habitat_wall.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "habitat window (shutters)"
msgstr "ventana de hábitat (persianas)"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_habitat_wall.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_habitat_wall.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "habitat window (shutters)"
msgid ""
"A porthole style window of standard design, completely covered by sturdy "
"metallic shutters."
msgstr ""
"Una ventana tipo ojo de buey de diseño estándar, completamente cubierta por "
"robustas persianas metálicas."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_habitat_wall.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_habitat_wall.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "broken habitat window (shutters)"
msgstr "ventana de hábitat rota (persianas)"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_habitat_wall.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_habitat_wall.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "broken habitat window (shutters)"
msgid ""
"The shutters of this porthole are deployed, but the lack of a window between "
"them allows the frozen air to leak into the room."
msgstr ""
"Las persianas de este ojo de buey están desplegadas, pero la falta de una "
"ventana entre ellas permite que el aire helado se filtre en la habitación."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_habitat_wall.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_habitat_wall.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "broken habitat window"
msgstr "ventana de hábitat roto"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_habitat_wall.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_habitat_wall.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "broken habitat window"
msgid ""
"The glass panel that would have covered this porthole has been broken, "
"allowing unfettered access to the rooms within."
msgstr ""
"El panel de cristal que habría cubierto este ojo de buey se ha roto, "
"permitiendo un acceso sin restricciones a las habitaciones del interior."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_habitat_wall.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_habitat_wall.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "broken habitat segment"
msgstr "segmento de hábitat roto"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_habitat_wall.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_habitat_wall.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "broken habitat segment"
msgid ""
"Exposed structural ribs and battered plate metal are all what remains of this "
"habitat segment."
msgstr ""
"Costillas estructurales expuestas y chapa metálica maltratada es todo lo que "
"queda de este segmento del hábitat."

