#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"&You find the clerk leaning before an almost impressive collection of "
"weaponry, most of it neatly displayed in racks or hanging from the curved "
"prefab ceiling.  <mypronoun> barely acknowledges your approach, it doesn't "
"seem like customer service is a priority here."
