#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Augustmoon_Salvors/augustmoon_tool_trader.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Augustmoon_Salvors/augustmoon_tool_trader.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"&The store is full of high tech gadgets, both new and salvaged.  The clerk "
"behind the counter looks up as you enter, and gives you a nod."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGBR_Sadie.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/BGBR_Sadie.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"This feels like a good place to relax.  Want to play doctor with real "
"scalpels?"
msgstr ""
"Este parece un buen lugar para relajarse. ¿Quieres que juguemos al médico con "
"escalpelos reales?"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGBR_Sadie.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/BGBR_Sadie.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "This might not be a very private place."
msgstr "Este puede que no sea un lugar muy privado."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGBR_Sadie.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/BGBR_Sadie.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "This place is so boring.  We should take people and kill some drugs."
msgstr "Este lugar es tan aburrido. Deberíamos recoger gente y consumir drogas."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGBR_Sadie.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/BGBR_Sadie.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Water water everywhere.  Let's go skinny dipping.  I bet you'll attract some "
"leeches.  I need them for something I want to do to you.  It'll be so weird."
msgstr ""
"Agua, agua por todas partes. Vamos a bañarnos desnudos. Apuesto a que atraes "
"algunas sanguijuelas. Las necesito para algo que quiero hacerte. Será tan "
"divertido."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGBR_Sadie.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/BGBR_Sadie.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I like it down here.  This reminds me of that time I was down in a place like "
"this and someone creeped up behind me and hit me in the back of the head with "
"a shovel.  *shiver*  It still gives me goosebumps."
msgstr ""
"Me gusta estar aquí abajo. Me recuerda a aquella vez que estaba en un lugar "
"así y alguien se acercó sigilosamente por detrás y me golpeó en la nuca con "
"una pala. *Tiembla* Todavía se me pone la piel de gallina."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGBR_Sadie.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/BGBR_Sadie.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I love nature.  It smells so good out here, like living things growing and "
"multiplying and dying and returning from the dead with horrifying new powers "
"and trying to slowly rip us apart and eat us.  It brings back really happy "
"memories for me."
msgstr ""
"Amo la naturaleza. Huele tan bien aquí fuera, a seres vivos que crecen y se "
"multiplican y mueren y vuelven de entre los muertos con horribles poderes "
"nuevos e intentan despedazarnos lentamente y comernos. Me trae muy buenos "
"recuerdos."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGBR_Sadie.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/BGBR_Sadie.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I love swampy places like this.  The smell of the pussy willows, the sound of "
"the crickets, the giant mutant mosquitoes hungry for our blood.  It's like "
"we're in a sexy vampire romance novel."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGBR_Sadie.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/BGBR_Sadie.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"What a beautiful facility.  I bet they have all kinds of lovely toys to play "
"with.  We should kill everyone here and do some creative self-experimentation."
msgstr ""
"Qué instalación tan bonita. Seguro que tienen todo tipo de juguetes preciosos "
"con los que jugar. Deberíamos matar a todo el mundo y hacer un poco de "
"autoexperimentación creativa."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGBR_Sadie.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/BGBR_Sadie.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Ooh, it's like a murder mystery here.  Are we the murderers, the murdered, or "
"the mystery?"
msgstr ""
"Oh, esto parece un asesinato misterioso. ¿Somos nosotros los asesinos, los "
"asesinados o el misterio?"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_afterlife.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_afterlife.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "What level of hell is this?  I spent weeks in a sulfurous hell being tortured."
msgstr ""
"¿Qué nivel de infierno es este? Pasé semanas en un infierno sulfuroso siendo "
"torturado."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_afterlife.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_afterlife.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "What was that like?"
msgstr "¿Cómo fue eso?"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_afterlife.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_afterlife.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Then they started cutting me open and taking out my organs but adding new "
"ones."
msgstr ""
"Entonces empezaron a abrirme y a sacarme los órganos, pero añadiendo otros "
"nuevos."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_afterlife.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_bonesinger.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/criminal_experiment.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/radiation_1.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/radiation_2.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/selftest.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/uplifted_animal_3.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/uplifted_animal_4.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/uplifted_animal_5.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/vatgrown_1.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/whately.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_afterlife.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_bonesinger.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/criminal_experiment.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/radiation_1.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/radiation_2.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/selftest.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/uplifted_animal_3.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/uplifted_animal_4.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/uplifted_animal_5.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/vatgrown_1.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/whately.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "How did it end?"
msgstr "¿Cómo terminó?"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_afterlife.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_afterlife.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Now that I finally am able to move and have some freedom, I plan on finding "
"some of these demons and punching through them until I find the devil himself."
msgstr ""
"Ahora que por fin puedo moverme y tener algo de libertad, planeo encontrar "
"algunos de estos demonios y perforarlos hasta encontrar al propio diablo."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_bonesinger.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_bonesinger.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I heard the song before the aliens captured me.  I did what I could to help "
"the other Bonesingers."
msgstr ""
"Escuché la canción antes de que los alienígenas me capturaran. Hice lo que "
"pude para ayudar a los otros Cantores del Hueso."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_bonesinger.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_migo_1.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_migo_2.json
