#: data/mods/Aftershock/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "AFS_NIGHT_MESSAGES_1"
msgid ""
"A mountainside in the distance is littered with erratic flashes of light that "
"suggest extended combat.  It's too far to tell any other details."
msgstr ""
"La ladera de una montaña en la distancia está llena de destellos erráticos de "
"luz que sugieren un combate prolongado. Está demasiado lejos para conocer "
"otros detalles."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "AFS_NIGHT_MESSAGES_1"
msgid ""
"You hear a sudden CRACK of ice breaking and then the low roar of what must be "
"an avalanche just outside your line of sight."
msgstr ""
"Escuchas un repentino CRACK de hielo rompiéndose y luego el bajo rugido de lo "
"que debe ser una avalancha justo fuera de tu línea de visión."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "AFS_NIGHT_MESSAGES_1"
msgid ""
"Winged shadows cross the ground, but when you look into the sky you can't "
"seem to see any movement or shapes at all."
msgstr ""
"Sombras aladas cruzan el terreno, pero cuando miras al cielo no puedes ver "
"ningún movimiento o forma en absoluto."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "AFS_NIGHT_MESSAGES_1"
msgid ""
"Catch a falling star and put it in your pocket, watch it blaze on through the "
"night sky.  It's a peaceful sign despite all the chaos here below."
msgstr ""
"Atrapa una estrella fugaz y guárdala en tu bolsillo, mira cómo brilla en el "
"cielo nocturno. Es una señal de paz a pesar de todo el caos que hay aquí "
"abajo."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "AFS_NIGHT_MESSAGES_1"
msgid ""
"Some craft swiftly hovers across the night sky, searchlights flaring out from "
"its belly in figure-eight patterns.  It circles in an ever larger pattern "
"until it pauses and weapons fire lashes from it to the ground like lightning. "
" A full five seconds of broadsides to the ground, then only the searchlights "
"pointed where the shots seemed to land, then those lights cut off and it "
"might as well be invisible to you."
msgstr ""
"Una nave sobrevuela velozmente el cielo nocturno, con focos reflectores "
"saliendo de su vientre en forma de ocho. Da vueltas en un patrón cada vez más "
"grande hasta que se detiene y el disparo de las armas se extiende hacia el "
"suelo como un relámpago. Cinco segundos de disparos contra el terreno, luego "
"sólo los focos apuntan hacia donde los disparos parecen impactar, luego esas "
"luces se cortan y es como si se volviera invisible."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/snippets/effect_on_condition.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "AFS_NIGHT_MESSAGES_1"
msgid ""
"From where you stand, you can see at the edge of the horizon something "
"rocketing from planetside into orbit."
msgstr ""
"Desde donde estás, puedes ver en el borde del horizonte algo que se lanza "
"desde el lado trás el horizonte del planeta hacia órbita."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/snippets/personal_cards.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/snippets/personal_cards.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "afs_personal_card"
msgid ""
"There is a picture of a shuttle taking off with happy people waving from the "
"viewports.  \"Salus is cold.\n"
"\n"
" Our love is true\n"
"\n"
" I hope to see you\n"
"\n"
" On Croatan 2\n"
"\n"
" My dearest, please join me.  I don't believe there are many shuttles left "
"before people will be stuck here forever.\""
msgstr ""
"Hay una imagen de un transbordador despegando con gente feliz que saluda "
"desde las mirillas. \"Salus es frío.\n"
"\n"
"Nuestro amor es verdadero\n"
"\n"
"Espero verte\n"
"\n"
"En Croatan 2\n"
"\n"
"Mi amor, por favor, acompáñame. No creo que queden muchas lanzaderas antes de "
"que la gente se quede aquí para siempre\"."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/snippets/personal_cards.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/snippets/personal_cards.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "afs_personal_card"
msgid ""
"A person wrapped up in bandages in a hospital bed is pictured on the front of "
"this card.  \"Get well soon!!!\n"
"\n"
" Torrance, I'm sorry you feel ill but many new colonists forget to process "
"any foodstuffs from Salus IV to remove the macronutrient.\""
msgstr ""
"En el anverso de esta tarjeta aparece una persona envuelta en vendas en una "
"cama de hospital. \"¡¡¡Recupérate pronto!!!\n"
"\n"
"Torrance, siento que te sientas mal, pero muchos colonos nuevos se olvidan de "
"procesar cualquier alimento de Salus IV para eliminar el macronutriente.\""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/snippets/personal_cards.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/snippets/personal_cards.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "afs_personal_card"
msgid ""
"A picture of a bloody steak.  This card appears particularly old.  \"Gauchos "
"Steaks.  Deliveries made monthly from Brazil to Salus IV.  Sign up today!\""
msgstr ""
"Una foto de un filete ensangrentado. Esta tarjeta parece especialmente "
"antigua. \"Bistecs Gauchos. Entregas mensuales desde Brasil a Salus IV. "
"Inscríbase hoy mismo\"."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/snippets/personal_cards.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/snippets/personal_cards.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "afs_personal_card"
msgid ""
"A glossy image of flowers and funeral statuary.  \"I'm sorry for your loss.  "
"Ebby was an excellent grandparent and we hate for you that he was infected "
"with the Moxphoria and wandered into the wastes.\""
msgstr ""
"Una imagen brillante de flores y estatuas funerarias. \"Lamento tu pérdida. "
"Ebby era un excelente abuelo y lamentamos por ti que se haya infectado con la "
"Moxforia y se haya adentrado en las tierras baldias\"."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/snippets/personal_cards.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/snippets/personal_cards.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "afs_personal_card"
msgid ""
"An orbital view of Salus IV.  \"Happy Colonization Day!\n"
"\n"
" Leonid,\n"
"\n"
" This place is cold as Hell but we've made a life out here in the last ten "
"years.\""
msgstr ""
"Una vista orbital de Salus IV. \"¡Feliz Día de la Colonización!\n"
"\n"
"Leonid,\n"
"\n"
"\"Este lugar es frío como el infierno, pero hemos hecho una vida aquí en los "
"últimos diez años\"."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/snippets/personal_cards.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/snippets/personal_cards.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "afs_personal_card"
msgid ""
"An old style movie theater.  \"Showing the vintage film Aelita!\n"
"\n"
" Tovarishch,\n"
"\n"
" Come with me to the movies.  My grandfather says that this movie is one of "
"the classics.\""
msgstr ""
"Una sala de cine de estilo antiguo. \"¡Proyectando la película de época "
"Aelita!\n"
"\n"
"Tovarishch,\n"
"\n"
"Ven conmigo al cine. Mi abuelo dice que esta película es uno de los "
"clásicos\"."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/snippets/snippets.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "alien_organ"
msgid "A strange lumpy pink organ, it pulsates in your hand."
msgstr "Un extraño órgano rosado y abultado, palpita en tu mano."

