msgstr "Propulsalto"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/jetpack_spells.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/spells/jetpack_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "spell_rocket_jump ( Rocket Jump )"
msgid ""
"Take to the skies with a rocket assisted jump or dash.  You might target a "
"hostile creature to perform a powerful rocket kick at the end of the dash.  "
"The rocket pack allows for a brief moment of air control or hovering after a "
"jump."
msgstr ""
"Surca los cielos con un salto o una carrera asistida por cohete. Puedes "
"apuntar a una criatura hostil para ejecutar una potente patada cohete al "
"final del salto. La mochila cohete permite controlar el aire o planear "
"brevemente tras un salto."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/teleport_spells.json
