#: data/mods/Backrooms/modinfo.json data/mods/Backrooms/scenarios.json
#. ~ MOD name
#. ~ Name of starting location "sloc_backrooms"
msgid "The Backrooms"
msgstr "Las Habitaciones traseras"

#: data/mods/Backrooms/modinfo.json
#. ~ Description of MOD "The Backrooms"
msgid ""
"A strange place between dimensions traps you.  Can you survive among endless "
"halls of yellowed carpet and harshly humming fluorescents?\n"
"\n"
"Replaces all normal worldgen: no wilderness, no rivers, no cities, no farms, "
"no sky.  Just endless, winding indoor halls of mildewy carpeting, faded "
"drywall, desolate breakrooms and abandoned boardrooms.\n"
"\n"
"Recommended city size is 0.  Play Now!  (Default Scenario) is not supported."
msgstr ""
"Un extraño lugar entre dimensiones te atrapa. ¿Podrás sobrevivir entre "
"interminables pasillos de moqueta amarillenta y fluorescentes que zumban?\n"
"\n"
"Sustituye a todos los mundos normales: no hay naturaleza, ni ríos, ni "
"ciudades, ni granjas, ni cielo. Sólo interminables y serpenteantes pasillos "
"interiores de mohosa moqueta, descoloridos paneles de yeso, desoladas salas "
"de descanso y abandonadas salas de juntas.\n"
"\n"
"El tamaño de ciudad recomendado es 0. ¡Jugar Ahora! (Escenario Por Defecto) "
"no es compatible."

#: data/mods/Backrooms/overmap_terrain.json
#. ~ Overmap terrain name
msgid "backroom chamber"
msgstr "cámara de habitaciónes traseras"

#: data/mods/Backrooms/overmap_terrain.json
#. ~ Overmap terrain name
msgid "backroom stairs"
msgstr "escaleras de habitaciones traseras"

#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_note"
msgid "\"I took all the supplies.  I'm sorry.\""
msgstr "\"Me llevé todas las provisiones. Lo siento.\""

#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_note"
msgid ""
"\"Someday I will wake up.  Someday I will wake up.  Someday I will wake up.  "
"Someday I will\""
msgstr ""
"\"Algún día despertaré. Algún día despertaré. Algún día despertaré. Algún día "
"lo haré\""

#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_note"
msgid "\"eat the walls\""
msgstr "\"come las paredes\""

#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_note"
msgid "\"STAY QUIET\""
msgstr "\"NO HAGAS RUIDO\""

#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_note"
msgid "\"pray that you find the same peace I have found\""
msgstr "\"reza para que encuentres la misma paz que yo he encontrado\""

#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_note"
msgid "\"IF YOU MOVE IT WILL HEAR YOU\""
msgstr "\"SI TE MUEVES TE OIRÁ\""

#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_note"
msgid ""
"\"My name is Susan Li.  If you're reading this, I'm dead.  I leave everything "
"I own to\""
msgstr ""
"\"Mi nombre es Susan Li. Si estás leyendo esto, estoy muerta. Dejo todas mis "
"posesiones a\""

#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_note"
msgid ""
"\"225 steps from the vending machines to the couch room…  Turn left…  141 "
"steps from the couch room to the portal…\""
msgstr ""
"\"225 pasos desde las máquinas expendedoras hasta la sala del sofá... Gira a "
"la izquierda... 141 pasos desde la sala del sofá hasta el portal...\""

#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_note"
msgid "\"Welcome to Hell :)\""
msgstr "\"Bienvenido al Infierno :)\""

#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_note"
msgid ""
"\"know because I was wearing my watch.  Today was another bad day.  They "
"nearly saw me as I hauled wood back to the big room, and I lost half of it "
"running away.  Tomorrow, I plan\""
msgstr ""
"\"Lo sé porque llevaba mi reloj. Hoy ha sido otro mal día. Casi me ven "
"mientras transportaba leña a la sala grande, y perdí la mitad huyendo. Mañana "
"tengo planeado \""

#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_note"
msgid ""
"\"I AM IN A TOP SECRET FACILITY BUILT BY THE GOVERNMENT!!  I HAVE BEEN "
"ILLEGALLY KIDNAPPED!!  PLEASE HELP ME!!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡¡ESTOY EN UNA INSTALACIÓN DE ALTO SECRETO CONSTRUIDA POR EL GOBIERNO!! "
"¡¡HE SIDO SECUESTRADO ILEGALMENTE!! ¡¡POR FAVOR, AYUDADME!!\""

#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_note"
msgid "\"What do you want?  Am I supposed to confess??  What am I waiting for???\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Qué es lo que quieres? ¿Se supone que debo confesar?? ¿A qué estoy "
"esperando?\""

#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_note"
msgid "\"…602,651  602,652  602,653  602,654  602,655  602,656  602,657…\""
msgstr "\"…602.651 602.652 602.653 602.654 602.655 602.656 602.657…\""

#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_note"
msgid "\"I AM IN A SMALL ROOM WITH MANY DESKS.  I CAN'T STAY HERE.  COME FIND ME.\""
msgstr ""
"\"ESTOY EN UNA HABITACION PEQUEÑA CON MUCHOS ESCRITORIOS. NO PUEDO QUEDARME "
"AQUI. VEN A BUSCARME\"."

#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_note"
msgid ""
"This note has a bunch of lines all over it.  It looks like it might be a map, "
"but nothing is labeled and you're already hopelessly lost."
msgstr ""
"Esta nota tiene un montón de líneas por todas partes. Parece que podría ser "
"un mapa, pero no hay nada etiquetado y ya estás irremediablemente perdido."

#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_note"
msgid "This paper is covered in dried blood…  Gross."
msgstr "Este papel está cubierto de sangre seca... Asqueroso."

#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_note"
msgid "This note is covered with tally marks, front to back."
msgstr "Esta nota está cubierta de marcas, del anverso al reverso."

#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_note"
msgid "\"NO NO NO NO NO NO NO NO NO NO NO NO NO NO NO NO NO NO NO NO\""
msgstr "\"NO NO NO NO NO NO NO NO NO NO NO NO NO NO NO NO NO NO NO NO\""

#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_note"
msgid "\"I KILLED THEM.  I HAD TO.\""
msgstr "\"LOS MATÉ. LO TUVE QUE HACER.\""

#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_note"
msgid ""
"\"Casey Blumenthal.  Age 34.  Bangor, Maine.  Hotel receptionist.  The last "
"thing I remember was tripping on a power cord.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Casey Blumenthal. 34 años. Bangor, Maine. Recepcionista de hotel. Lo último "
"que recuerdo es tropezarme con un cable de electricidad.\""

#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_note"
msgid "\"STOP FOLLOWING ME\""
msgstr "\"DEJÁ DE SEGUIRME\""

#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_note"
msgid "\"IT'S CHASING ME\""
msgstr "\"ME ESTÁ PERSIGUIENDO\""

#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_note"
msgid "\"Abandon hope, all ye who read this.\""
msgstr "\"Abandonad la esperanza, todos los que leéis esto\"."

#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_note"
msgid "This note just has scribbles on it."
msgstr "Esta nota solamente tiene garabatos."

#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_note"
msgid "\"Let me out.  Let me out.  Let me out.  Let me OUT.  LET ME OUT.\""
msgstr "\"Déjenme salir. Déjenme salir. Déjenme salir. Déjenme SALIR. DÉJENME SALIR.\""

#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_note"
msgid "\"STAY HERE\""
msgstr "\"QUÉDATE AQUÍ\""

#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_note"
msgid "\"I have been blessed.\""
msgstr "\"He sido bendecido.\""

#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_ancient_news"
#. ~ This category is for news before 1950 and should adopt the tone of voice
#. of its era.
msgid ""
"CIGARET SHORTAGE EASILY EXPLAINED!  The cigaret industry says Americans are "
"smoking at the fastest rate in history - that's why there's a shortage!  The "
"final production figure will be 257 million in 1943, compared with 243 "
"million in 1942.  Add to this tax-free shipments to armed forces - which were "
"32 million this year and increasing, up from 8 million in 1942 - and "
"civilians would be struggling this year were it not for excellent crops!"
msgstr ""
"¡LA ESCASEZ DE CIGARRILLOS SE EXPLICA FÁCILMENTE! La industria tabaquera dice "
"que los estadounidenses fuman al ritmo más rápido de la historia, ¡por eso "
"hay escasez! La cifra final de producción será de 257 millones en 1943, "
"frente a los 243 millones de 1942. Si a esto se añaden los envíos libres de "
"impuestos a las fuerzas armadas -que han sido 32 millones este año y van en "
"aumento, frente a los 8 millones de 1942-, ¡los civiles estarían pasando "
"apuros este año si no fuera por las excelentes cosechas!"

#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_ancient_news"
#. ~ This category is for news before 1950 and should adopt the tone of voice
#. of its era.
msgid ""
"STRIKE ORE NEAR KENDALL!  A special of the 15th to the Miner from Lewistown "
"states that there is much excitement around Kendall over the reported "
"striking of a hitherto unknown ore in the Fergus tract, extending out on the "
"flat from the Bullard property, and claims are being located in all "
"directions!  Potential experts on the unknown metal are to arrive in the week."
msgstr ""
"¡HALLAZGO DE MINERAL CERCA DE KENDALL! En un especial del día 15 enviado al "
"Miner desde Lewistown, se afirma que hay un gran entusiasmo en los "
"alrededores de Kendall por la noticia de que se ha encontrado un mineral "
"desconocido hasta ahora en la zona de Fergus, que se extiende por la llanura "
"desde la propiedad de Bullard, y se han localizado en propiedades de todas "
"las direcciones. Esta semana llegarán posibles expertos en este metal "
"desconocido."

#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_ancient_news"
#. ~ This category is for news before 1950 and should adopt the tone of voice
#. of its era.
msgid ""
"THE WEATHER: Fair tonight and Wednesday.  THIS IS REAL COMFORT!  That is what "
"they say when they try one of TROUTMANS' Vudor chair hammocks, $3.50; ask to "
"see them!  Buy one of these for the Fourth of July: Flag, size 5x8 feet, pole "
"and rope ready to hang; price, while they last, $1.75 -- TROUTMANS'!"
msgstr ""
"EL CLIMA: Buen tiempo esta noche y el miércoles. ¡ES UNA VERDADERA COMODIDAD! "
"Eso es lo que dijeron cuando probaron una de las hamacas paraguayas Vudor de "
"TROUMANS, $3,50. ¡Consultanos! Comprate una para el cuatro de julio: bandera, "
"2.50 x 1.50 mts, asta y soga lista para colgar; precio, mientras haya, $1,75 "
"-- ¡TROUTMANS'!"

#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_very_old_news"
#. ~ This category is for news after 1950 until the time of Cataclysm lore and
#. should adopt the tone of voice of its era.
msgid ""
"ABRAMS CONFIDENT S. VIET TAKEOVER IS SUCCESS:  Gen. Creighton W. Adams, "
"commander of US troops in South Vietnam, praised the South Vietnamese army "
"today and said its forces have \"tremendous confidence\" in their continued "
"success.  The disappearance of Gen. Bessemer last month has \"not "
"disheartened the troops\", although Adams has admitted his death at enemy "
"hands is \"likely\"."
msgstr ""
"ABRAMS CONFIADO SOBRE EL ÉXITO DE LA TOMA DE VIETNAM DEL SUR: El general "
"Creighton W. Adams, comandante de las tropas de EEUU en Vietnam del Sur, "
"elogió al ejército survietnamita hoy y dijo que sus fuerzas tienen \"tremenda "
"confianza\" en su éxito continuo. La desaparición del general Bessemer el mes "
"pasado no ha \"desalentado a las tropas\", aunque Adams admitió que es "
"\"probable\" su muerte a manos enemigas."

#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_very_old_news"
#. ~ This category is for news after 1950 until the time of Cataclysm lore and
#. should adopt the tone of voice of its era.
msgid ""
"LUNCH MENUS:  MONDAY, February 16 - NO SCHOOL.  TUESDAY, February 17 - Corn "
"dog with catsup and mustard, potatoes au gratin, bread and butter, buttered "
"spinach, apple half, milk.  WEDNESDAY February 18 - Wildcat goulash, buttered "
"green beans, hot rolls and butter, orange jello with pears, milk.  THURSDAY, "
"February 19 - Tacos with cheese and lettuce, applesauce, milk.  FRIDAY, "
"February 20 - Creamed turkey over mashed potatoes, peanutbutter sandwiches, "
"cherry shortcake, chocolate milk."
msgstr ""
"MENÚS DE ALMUERZO: LUNES, 16 de febrero - NO HAY CLASES. MARTES, 17 de "
"febrero - Salchicha con mantequilla, tomate frito y mostaza, papas "
"gratinadas, pan y manteca, espinaca en manteca, media manzana, leche. "
"MIÉRCOLES, 18 de febrero - Goulash, judías con mantequilla, rollitos "
"calientes y manteca, mermelada de naranja con pera, leche. JUEVES, 19 de "
"febrero - Tacos con queso y lechuga, puré de manzana, leche. VIERNES, 20 de "
"febrero - Pavo con crema sobre puré de patatas, sandwiches de crema de "
"cacahuete, pastelito de cereza, leche con chocolate."

#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_very_old_news"
#. ~ This category is for news after 1950 until the time of Cataclysm lore and
#. should adopt the tone of voice of its era.
msgid ""
"ADMINISTRATIVE ASSISTANT SOUGHT:  Eberhard Technologies, Inc. is looking for "
"a full-time (37.5 hours) Administrative Assistant.  This position requires a "
"person with excellent organizational and computer skills, capable of "
"professional discretion in their daily life.  Extensive benefits offered.  "
"Send resume to thaskins@eberhardphoenix.com."
msgstr ""
"SE BUSCA ASISTENTE ADMINISTRATIVO: Eberhard Technologies, Inc. está buscando "
"un asistente administrativo a tiempo completo (37,5 horas). Esta posición "
"requiere una persona con excelentes habilidades organizativas, informáticas y "
"discreccionalidad profesional en su vida diaria. Amplios beneficios en el "
"puesto de trabajo. Enviar currículum a thaskins@eberhardphoenix.com."

#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_very_old_news"
#. ~ This category is for news after 1950 until the time of Cataclysm lore and
#. should adopt the tone of voice of its era.
msgid ""
"SEARCH FOR PILOT WHO SAW UFO, DISAPPEARED:  Authorities Wednesday called of a "
"ground, air, and sea search for a pilot who vanished after radioing that his "
"lightplane was being pursued by an unidentified flying object.  An air force "
"reconnaissance plane searched 1,000 square miles of ocean for George "
"Valentina and his Cessna 182.  At one point, Valentina radioed, \"It's not an "
"aircraft…  It's…\" before the transmission broke off.  Residents of King "
"Island have reported sightings of bright and trailing lights over the past "
"six weeks."
msgstr ""
"BÚSQUEDA DE UN PILOTO QUE VIO UN OVNI Y DESAPARECIÓ: Las autoridades "
"iniciaron el miércoles la búsqueda por tierra, mar y aire de un piloto que "
"desapareció tras comunicar por radio que su avioneta era perseguida por un "
"objeto volador no identificado. Un avión de reconocimiento de las fuerzas "
"aéreas buscó a George Valentina y su Cessna 182 en 1.000 millas cuadradas de "
"océano. En un momento dado, Valentina dijo por radio: \"No es un avión... "
"Es...\" antes de que se interrumpiera la transmisión. Los residentes de King "
"Island han informado de avistamientos de luces brillantes y rastreras durante "
"las últimas seis semanas."

#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_recent_news"
#. ~ This category roughly lines up with Cataclysm's news segments newer than
#. a few months and contains some of the same snippets.
msgid ""
"DRIVING ON A WING AND A PRAYER: A New England man has proven it is possible "
"to create a new car from scrap parts using almost nothing but duct tape.  "
"When asked why he had done it, his answer was \"Well, I didn't have a welder.\""
msgstr ""
"CONDUCIENDO CON UN ALAMBRE Y AYUDA DIVINA: Un hombre de Nueva Inglaterra ha "
"probado que es posible crear un coche desde cero usando casi solamente cinta "
"americana. Cuando se le preguntó por qué lo había hecho, su respuesta fue "
"\"Bueno, no tenía soldador.\""

#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_recent_news"
#. ~ This category roughly lines up with Cataclysm's news segments newer than
#. a few months and contains some of the same snippets.
msgid ""
"HALLOWAY ANNOUNCES SWEEPING BUDGET BILL.  As rhetoric surrounding national "
"defense spending ramps up, Senate Majority Leader Halloway has announced a "
"controversial bill that would cut over $700 billion from multiple federal "
"organizations, including arts funding and welfare.  He introduced the bill by "
"saying, \"We stand on the edge of a new age of science and discovery, and a "
"new age of danger from enemies abroad.  Hardworking Americans can benefit "
"most by getting involved in our new civilian science programs and making a "
"difference there.  No more sitting at home playing video games!\""
msgstr ""
"HALLOWAY ANUNCIA UN AMBICIOSO PROYECTO DE PRESUPUESTO. Mientras arrecia la "
"retórica en torno al gasto en defensa nacional, el líder de la mayoría en el "
"Senado, Halloway, ha anunciado un controvertido proyecto de ley que "
"recortaría más de 700.000 millones de dólares de múltiples organizaciones "
"federales, entre ellas la financiación de las artes y la asistencia social. "
"Presentó el proyecto de ley diciendo: \"Estamos al borde de una nueva era de "
"la ciencia y el descubrimiento, y de una nueva era de peligro de enemigos en "
"el extranjero. Los estadounidenses trabajadores pueden beneficiarse al máximo "
"participando en nuestros nuevos programas científicos civiles y marcando la "
"diferencia en ellos. Nada de quedarse en casa jugando a videojuegos\"."

#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_recent_news"
#. ~ This category roughly lines up with Cataclysm's news segments newer than
#. a few months and contains some of the same snippets.
msgid ""
"COUNTRY MUSIC FESTIVAL STILL ON.  Predictions of inclement weather won't stop "
"Huey Brooks, owner of Brooks Entertainment, from putting on his famous "
"country music festival.  The event has moved to the Springfield Masonic "
"Center and begins two hours earlier, at 5PM.  As the whereabouts of "
"self-admitted \"party boy\" Jerry Kenny remain unknown, local legend Poppy "
"Summerfield has been brought in to fill his slot."
msgstr ""
"NO SE CANCELA EL FESTIVAL DE MÚSICA COUNTRY. Las predicciones de las "
"inclemencias del clima no evitarán que Huey Brooks, dueño de Brooks "
"Entertainment, organice su famoso festival de música country. El evento ha "
"sido trasladado al Centro Masónico de Springfield y comenzará dos horas "
"antes, a las 17:00. Como todavía no se conoce el paradero del \"fiestero\" "
"Jerry Kenny, la leyenda local Poppy Summerfield ha sido convocada para "
"reemplazarlo."

#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_lost_people_news"
#. ~ This category is for 'lost person' classified ads and newspaper snippets
#. about people that have fallen into to the Backrooms, from any era.
msgid ""
"KIDNAPPING IN WESTFIELD?  After a week of intense searching, chasing leads "
"across the state, the Oriole County Sheriff's Department have still uncovered "
"no leads in the disappearance of Kasey Akron, 31, postal worker and mother of "
"two.  Akron disappeared without a trace while on the job in Westfield, a "
"small village with a population of only 824, on September 24th.  Her vehicle "
"was found still running, undelivered mail left inside.  Her mother tearfully "
"testified to the Oriole Free Press, \"Kasey was a happy and loved woman.  "
"Wherever she is, we know she wants to come home!\"  Detectives previously "
"suggested that Akron may have departed with someone she knew, but have not "
"made any arrests so far."
msgstr ""
"¿SECUESTRO EN WESTFIELD? Tras una semana de intensa búsqueda, persiguiendo "
"pistas por todo el estado, el departamento del sheriff del condado de Oriole "
"aún no ha descubierto ninguna pista sobre la desaparición de Kasey Akron, de "
"31 años, trabajadora de correos y madre de dos hijos. Akron desapareció sin "
"dejar rastro mientras trabajaba en Westfield, un pequeño pueblo de sólo 824 "
"habitantes, el 24 de septiembre. Su vehículo apareció en marcha, con el "
"correo sin entregar en su interior. Su madre declaró entre lágrimas al Oriole "
"Free Press: \"Kasey era una mujer feliz y querida. Dondequiera que esté, "
"sabemos que quiere volver a casa\". Los detectives sugirieron previamente que "
"Akron podría haberse marchado con alguien que conocía, pero no han realizado "
"ninguna detención hasta el momento."

#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_lost_people_news"
#. ~ This category is for 'lost person' classified ads and newspaper snippets
#. about people that have fallen into to the Backrooms, from any era.
msgid ""
"MYSTERY IN DRESDEN: Nefarious happenings are nothing new for the "
"ever-tumultuous GDR, but the peculiar mystery of two missing actors has "
"captured international attention.  Nani Wolf and Angela Weiss were slated to "
"perform in mere moments, spotted entering their dressing room with fellow "
"company members testifying to every minute and every angle, but when the "
"curtain call came, they were nowhere to be found!  Region police are baffled, "
"but have concluded there was no sign of foul play.  The girls just "
"disappeared!"
msgstr ""
"MISTERIO EN DRESDEN: Los sucesos nefastos no son nada nuevo en la siempre "
"tumultuosa RDA, pero el peculiar misterio de dos actores desaparecidos ha "
"captado la atención internacional. Nani Wolf y Angela Weiss iban a actuar "
"dentro de unos instantes, fueron vistas entrando en su camerino con "
"compañeros de la compañía atestiguando cada minuto y cada ángulo, pero cuando "
"se levantó el telón, ¡no aparecían por ninguna parte! La policía regional "
"está desconcertada, pero ha llegado a la conclusión de que no hay indicios de "
"delito. Las chicas simplemente desaparecieron."

#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_lost_people_news"
#. ~ This category is for 'lost person' classified ads and newspaper snippets
#. about people that have fallen into to the Backrooms, from any era.
msgid ""
"MISSING MAN: Gerald Bienkowski, age 47.  Disappeared: April 14.  Last seen "
"leaving Tony's Watering Hole in Burlington.  Believed to be of sound mind, "
"but possibly in danger.  If seen, contact local police.  Do not approach."
msgstr ""
"HOMBRE DESAPARECIDO: Gerald Bienkowski, 47 años. Desaparecido: El 14 de "
"abril. Visto por última vez saliendo de Tony's Watering Hole en Burlington. "
"Se cree que está en su sano juicio, pero posiblemente en peligro. Si lo ven, "
"contacten con la policía local. No se acerquen."

#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_lost_people_news"
#. ~ This category is for 'lost person' classified ads and newspaper snippets
#. about people that have fallen into to the Backrooms, from any era.
msgid ""
"MISSING WOMAN: Anne Demir, age 33.  Disappeared: May 3.  Last seen driving "
"SOUTH of Dallas on I-45 at 8:45pm.  NEW DETAILS HAVE RE-OPENED THIS "
"INVESTIGATION.  New witness footage confirms Demir's car driving SOUTH rather "
"than north, as previously reported."
msgstr ""
"MUJER DESAPARECIDA: Anne Demir, 33 años. Desaparecida: 3 de Mayo. Vista por "
"última vez conduciendo al SUR de Dallas por la I-45 a las 20:45. NUEVOS "
"DETALLES HAN REABIERTO ESTA INVESTIGACIÓN. Nuevas imágenes de testigos "
"confirman que el coche de Demir conducía hacia el SUR y no hacia el norte, "
"como se había informado anteriormente."

#: data/mods/Backrooms/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "backrooms_lost_people_news"
#. ~ This category is for 'lost person' classified ads and newspaper snippets
#. about people that have fallen into to the Backrooms, from any era.
msgid ""
"NO TRACE FOUND in search for missing Lisa Hawthorne and her boyfriend Shaun "
"after 58 Civil Air Patrol members spent three days scouring the area near "
"Twelve Mile Trail.  The couple's car was found roadside near the northern "
"trailhead and they were reported missing shortly after.  The couple were \"on "
"a daily hike in a place completely known to them\", says detective Aretha "
"Wesson, who personally knew the two intrepid young athletes."
msgstr ""
"NO SE HA ENCONTRADO NINGÚN RASTRO en la búsqueda de Lisa Hawthorne y su novio "
"Shaun después de que 58 miembros de la Patrulla Aérea Civil pasaran tres días "
"rastreando la zona cerca de Twelve Mile Trail. El coche de la pareja fue "
"encontrado al borde de la carretera, cerca de la entrada norte del sendero, y "
"poco después se denunció su desaparición. La pareja estaba 'de excursión "
"diaria en un lugar completamente conocido por ellos', dice la detective "
"Aretha Wesson, que conocía personalmente a los dos intrépidos jóvenes "
"deportistas."

