#: data/mods/DinoMod/lab_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_notes"
msgid ""
"Research on our visitors is proceeding nicely.  The raptor DNA is of special "
"interest, with some novel protein chains that may lead to medical "
"breakthroughs."
msgstr ""
"La investigación sobre nuestros visitantes avanza a buen ritmo. El ADN de "
"rapaz es de especial interés, con algunas cadenas de proteínas novedosas que "
"pueden dar lugar a avances médicos."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/lab_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_notes"
msgid ""
"Research proceeds apace on our visitors.  While Operation Major Laser did not "
"receive enough funding as hoped, our more humble bio-operator protocols were "
"already prepared and are proceeding ahead of schedule.  The hosts are most "
"receptive to improvement."
msgstr ""
"La investigación avanza a buen ritmo en nuestros visitantes. Aunque la "
"Operación Láser Mayor no recibió la financiación que se esperaba, nuestros "
"protocolos más humildes de los biooperadores ya estaban preparados y avanzan "
"antes de lo previsto. Los anfitriones son muy receptivos a las mejoras."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/lab_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_notes"
msgid ""
"Dr. Yoshimi has been reprimanded for unauthorized contact with the "
"procompsignathids.  Disgusting behavior, and a terrible example to the junior "
"researchers."
msgstr ""
"El Dr. Yoshimi ha sido reprendido por el contacto no autorizado con los "
"procompsignátidos. Un comportamiento repugnante, y un terrible ejemplo para "
"los investigadores jóvenes."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/lab_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_notes"
msgid ""
"Dr. Yoshimi has escaped, along with an unknown number of dinosaurs.  "
"Unfortunately, we have bigger problems with XE037."
msgstr ""
"El Dr. Yoshimi ha escapado, junto con un número desconocido de dinosaurios. "
"Por desgracia, tenemos problemas mayores con XE037."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/lab_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_notes"
msgid ""
"Strange sounds have been reported from the swamp nearby.  An enhanced "
"security team was dispatched, but has not returned in 48 hours.  The facility "
"is on lockdown.  We can't let them get back in."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/lab_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_notes"
msgid ""
"Tingle lab situation normal.  Dr. Tingle believes the Acrocanthosaurus is the "
"best fit for hybridization and the lab is working on safe methods to provide "
"Dr. Tingle the needed material.  Velociraptor is another possibility given "
"prior research.  Testing with chickens and the velociraptor specimens "
"suggests some subject resistance."
msgstr ""
"La situación del laboratorio Tingle es normal. El Dr. Tingle cree que el "
"Acrocanthosaurus es el más adecuado para la hibridación y el laboratorio está "
"trabajando en métodos seguros para proporcionar al Dr. Tingle el material "
"necesario. El velociraptor es otra posibilidad dada la investigación previa. "
"Las pruebas realizadas con pollos y especímenes de velociraptor sugieren "
"cierta resistencia del sujeto."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/lab_notes.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_notes"
msgid ""
"Tingle lab situation critical.  Dr. Tingle violated safety protocols last "
"night and attempted to secure genetic material directly - possibly under the "
"influence of some drug or toxin, given the anatomical impossibility and "
"danger of the procedure.  The Acrocanthosaurus specimen has escaped into the "
"facility."
msgstr ""
"La situación del laboratorio Tingle es crítica. El Dr. Tingle violó anoche "
"los protocolos de seguridad e intentó conseguir material genético "
"directamente, posiblemente bajo la influencia de alguna droga o toxina, dada "
"la imposibilidad anatómica y el peligro del procedimiento. El espécimen de "
"Acrocanthosaurus ha escapado a las instalaciones."

