#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid ""
"Yes.  I ask because I noticed there are dinosaurs around.  Do you know "
"anything about that?"
msgstr ""
"Sí. Lo pregunto porque me he dado cuenta de que hay dinosaurios por ahí. "
"¿Sabes algo de eso?"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I know all kinds of weird useless stuff.  I've seen things at churches, I've "
"seen things on farms, I've seen whole exhibits way out, a whole zoo even.  "
"And there's someone pretending to be me, but it's not me, because I would "
"know.  Or you would know.  One of us would be us.  Those Swampers, they know "
"what's happening.  They're creatures of light come back to save us all.  Or "
"eat us, I forget.  Oh and that Old Guard Repo Man hates them and Red at the "
"train station."
msgstr ""
"Conozco todo tipo de cosas raras e inútiles. He visto cosas en iglesias, he "
"visto cosas en granjas, he visto exhibiciones enteras muy lejos, un zoológico "
"entero incluso. Y hay alguien haciéndose pasar por mí, pero no soy yo, porque "
"yo lo sabría. O tú lo sabrías. Uno de nosotros sería nosotros. Esos Marismas, "
"saben lo que está pasando. Son criaturas de luz que vuelven para salvarnos a "
"todos. O comernos, lo olvidé. Oh y ese Reclamador de la Vieja Guardia los "
"odia a ellos y a Rojo de la estación de tren."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Yes.  How do I find the someone pretending to be you?"
msgstr "Sí. ¿Cómo encuentro al que se hace pasar por ti?"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I think I have to get going…"
msgstr "Tengo que irme ..."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Wait, what if I'm the probe?  What if you're the probe?  Let me mark that on "
"your map nice and big."
msgstr ""
"Espera, ¿y si yo soy la sonda? ¿Y si tú eres la sonda? Déjame marcar eso en "
"tu mapa bien grande."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Thanks for the information.  I'd better go."
msgstr "Gracias por la información. Mejor me voy."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I was the probe the whole time."
msgstr "Yo fui la sonda todo el tiempo."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Find fake Dino Dave"
msgstr "Encontrar al falso Dino Dave"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find fake Dino Dave"
msgid "It must be an alien probe…"
msgstr "Debo ser una sonda extraterrestre…"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find fake Dino Dave"
msgid ""
"I think the shack was that way.  Might have cleared out but who knows.  Watch "
"out for space lasers."
msgstr ""
"Creo que la cabaña estaba por allí. Puede que se haya despejado, pero quién "
"sabe. Cuidado con los láseres espaciales."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find fake Dino Dave"
msgid "You'll see, it's just like I say."
msgstr "Ya verás, es como yo te digo."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find fake Dino Dave"
msgid ""
"There aren't a lot of things to have faith for in the world today, but if I "
"were you I would bring some cardboard."
msgstr ""
"No hay muchas cosas por las que tener fe en el mundo actual, pero si yo fuera "
"tú llevaría algo de cartón."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find fake Dino Dave"
msgid "Did you see the probe?"
msgstr "¿Has visto la sonda?"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find fake Dino Dave"
msgid "I knew it.  Good."
msgstr "Lo sabía. Bien."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find fake Dino Dave"
msgid "Could have been another shack.  I don't know, lots going on."
msgstr "Podría haber sido otra cabaña. No lo sé, están pasando muchas cosas."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/Mr_Lapin.json
#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/exodii_merchant_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "What can you tell me about the dinosaurs?"
msgstr "¿Qué puedes decirme sobre los dinosaurios?"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/Mr_Lapin.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I am afraid that is drifting far out of my area of expertise, but I would be "
"willing to bet some of the little ones might be worth something to you if you "
"tamed them and raised them.  No fur to speak of, but feathers might be of "
"some use, and meat and eggs could help.  I'm not sure what they eat, but I "
"hope it isn't rabbits or people on the more rabbit adjacent end of things."
msgstr ""
"Me temo que eso se aleja de mi área de conocimientos, pero estaría dispuesto "
"a apostar que algunos de los pequeños podrían tener algún valor para ti si "
"los domaras y los criaras. No tienen pelaje, pero las plumas podrían ser "
"útiles, y la carne y los huevos podrían ayudar. No estoy seguro de lo que "
"comen, pero espero que no sean conejos o personas."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/Mr_Lapin.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Maybe dinosaurs and rabbits aren't so different."
msgstr "Tal vez los dinosaurios y los conejos no son tan diferentes."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Name of an NPC class
msgid "Swamper"
msgstr "Habitante de las Marismas"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Job description of "Swamper" NPC class
msgid "The great eaters have returned and they must be fed."
msgstr "Los grandes devoradores han vuelto y hay que alimentarlos."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Unique name of a male NPC
#. ~ A charismatic religious leader and CEO.
msgid "Bo Baronyx"
msgstr "Bo Baronyx"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Name suffix of a male NPC
#. ~ A charismatic religious leader and CEO.
msgid "CEO"
msgstr "CEO"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "The eaters will be fed."
msgstr "Los devoradores serán alimentados."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Welcome.  Are you hungry friend?"
msgstr "Bienvenido. ¿Tienes hambre amigo?"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"You look hungry friend.  So much hunger in this world.  This is the time of "
"the eaters."
msgstr ""
"Pareces hambriento, amigo. Hay mucha hambre en este mundo. Este es el tiempo "
"de los devoradores."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Hello.  Who are the eaters?"
msgstr "Hola. ¿Quiénes son los devoradores?"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "So about the eaters…"
msgstr "Así que sobre los devoradores..."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "You mentioned some pretenders before.  What does that mean?"
msgstr "Antes ha mencionado a algunos pretendientes. ¿Qué significa eso?"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Is there a way I can help feed the eaters?"
msgstr "¿Hay alguna forma de ayudar a alimentar a los devoradores?"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I have to get going.  Take care, CEO Baronyx."
msgstr "Tengo que irme. Cuídese, CEO Baronyx."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"The great eaters have returned, along with the false ones.  We must feed the "
"eaters and destroy the pretenders, child."
msgstr ""
"Los grandes devoradores han vuelto, junto con los falsos. Debemos alimentar a "
"los devoradores y destruir a los farsantes, hijo."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Who are you talking about?"
msgstr "¿De quién estás hablando?"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "No thank you, I'd like to leave now."
msgstr "No gracias, me gustaría irme ahora."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"This Cataclysm has woken the great eaters, lost in time, returned them to the "
"world to do their great work, to multiply and fill the land with their song.  "
"The time of man is over, but we few who remain can do our part to protect "
"this new world from the pretenders, who would steal the meat."
msgstr ""
"Este Cataclismo ha despertado a los grandes devoradores, perdidos en el "
"tiempo, y los ha devuelto al mundo para que hagan su gran trabajo, para que "
"se multipliquen y llenen la tierra con su canto. El tiempo del hombre ha "
"terminado, pero los pocos que quedamos podemos hacer nuestra parte para "
"proteger este nuevo mundo de los farsantes, que robarían la carne."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "So what do you do with the meat?"
msgstr "¿Y qué haces con la carne?"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Who are the great eaters and the pretenders?"
msgstr "¿Quiénes son los grandes devoradores y los farsantes?"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Are there any others left?"
msgstr "¿Quedan otros?"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"The great eaters are the ones that were lost, what we call dinosaurs, whose "
"meat we took and who are taking it back.  The pretenders are those others "
"that have come to steal the meat of this world.  It does not belong to them "
"and we will take it from their mouths."
msgstr ""
"Los grandes devoradores son los que se perdieron, los que llamamos "
"dinosaurios cuya carne tomamos y que ahora estan tomando la nuestra. Los "
"farsantes son aquellos otros que han venido a robar la carne de este mundo. "
"No les pertenece y se la quitaremos de la boca."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Okay, so you worship dinosaurs.  Understood."
msgstr "Vale, entonces adoras a los dinosaurios. Entendido."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"The Swampers knew these times would return and we prepared for them.  When "
"others wasted their time and meat, we fed and grew strong, and we filled our "
"stores with meat for this day."
msgstr ""
"Los habitantes de las Marismas sabiamos que estos tiempos volverían y nos "
"preparamos para ello. Cuando otros desperdiciaban su tiempo y su carne, "
"nosotros nos alimentábamos y nos hacíamos fuertes, y llenábamos nuestras "
"reservas de carne para este día."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Yes, very good."
msgstr "Si, muy bien."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "You keep talking about meat.  Why is meat so important?"
msgstr "Sigues hablando de carne. ¿Por qué es tan importante la carne?"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"The meat makes the great eaters strong.  We gather the meat and feed them, "
"and in the end we too will serve the eaters in death as we do in life.  This "
"was always our purpose and we lucky few have lived to see it."
msgstr ""
"La carne hace fuertes a los grandes devoradores. Recogemos la carne y los "
"alimentamos, y al final nosotros también serviremos a los devoradores en la "
"muerte como lo hacemos en la vida. Este fue siempre nuestro propósito y "
"nosotros, los pocos afortunados, hemos vivido para verlo."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Our purpose?  How do you know?"
msgstr "¿Nuestro propósito? ¿Cómo lo sabes?"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"The return of the great eaters was foretold by a prophet.  We faithful have "
"been waiting and preparing since the revelation."
msgstr ""
"El regreso de los grandes devoradores fue anunciado por un profeta. Los "
"fieles hemos estado esperando y preparándonos desde la revelación."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I guess it must be nice to be proven right."
msgstr "Supongo que debe ser agradable que te den la razón."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "This is crazy."
msgstr "Esto es de locos."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"You understand our purpose.  I welcome you to this work, all are needed to "
"feed the eaters."
msgstr ""
"Entiendes nuestro propósito. Te doy la bienvenida a este trabajo, todos son "
"necesarios para alimentar a los devoradores."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "You deny what you see right in front of you.  This world is what was foretold."
msgstr "Niegas lo que ves delante de ti. Este mundo es lo que se ha predicho."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Yeah, alright."
msgstr "Sí, está bien."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Gather meat for Bo Baronyx.  About 8 should do it."
msgstr "Reune carne para Bo Baronyx. Alrededor de 8 deberían bastar."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather meat for Bo Baronyx.  About 8 should do
#. it."
msgid "The eaters are hungry.  They need meat."
msgstr "Los devoradores tienen hambre. Necesitan carne."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather meat for Bo Baronyx.  About 8 should do
#. it."
msgid ""
"If you wish to feed the eaters, your work will be rewarded.  Go out, butcher "
"a pure animal.  Not a false eater, the meat must be good to eat.  Then bring "
"me the meat and I will see to the eaters."
msgstr ""
"Si quieres alimentar a los devoradores, tu trabajo será recompensado. Sal "
"fuera, descuartiza un animal puro. No un falso devorador, la carne debe ser "
"apta para consumo. Luego tráeme la carne y yo me encargaré de los devoradores."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather meat for Bo Baronyx.  About 8 should do
#. it."
msgid "Excellent.  The eaters must feed."
msgstr "Excelente. Los devoradores deben alimentarse."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather meat for Bo Baronyx.  About 8 should do
#. it."
msgid "Understood.  The great eaters will feed either way."
msgstr "Entendido. Los grandes devoradores se alimentarán de cualquier forma."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather meat for Bo Baronyx.  About 8 should do
#. it."
msgid ""
"Some of the animals have become touched by the pretenders in recent days, "
"larger and more dangerous, producing tainted mutant meat.  This will not work "
"for the great eaters, it must be the true meat."
msgstr ""
"Algunos de los animales han sido tocados por los impostores en los últimos "
"días, más grandes y peligrosos, produciendo carne mutante contaminada. Esto "
"no funcionará para los grandes devoradores, debe ser carne verdadera."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather meat for Bo Baronyx.  About 8 should do
#. it."
msgid "Have you brought meat?"
msgstr "¿Has traído carne?"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather meat for Bo Baronyx.  About 8 should do
#. it."
msgid "The eaters will feed.  Oh, this one seems to like you."
msgstr "Los devoradores se alimentarán. Ooooh, a este parece gustarle."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather meat for Bo Baronyx.  About 8 should do
#. it."
msgid "The eaters will feed I am sure."
msgstr "Los devoradores se alimentarán, estoy seguro."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather meat for Bo Baronyx.  About 8 should do
#. it."
msgid ""
"I see no meat.  There is meat in the forests and swamps waiting for the "
"eaters."
msgstr "No veo carne. Hay carne en los bosques y pantanos esperando a los devoradores."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Nickname for creature 'mon_eoraptor' in an effect
msgid "Bamm-Bamm"
msgstr "Bamm Bamm"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "The eaters have fed.  They will be hungry again in time."
msgstr "Los devoradores se han alimentado. Volverán a tener hambre con el tiempo."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "You know what to do."
msgstr "Ya sabes lo que tienes que hacer."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "The great eaters must be fed.  Are you ready?"
msgstr "Los grandes devoradores deben ser alimentados. ¿Estás listos?"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "There is still more work to do.  Are you ready?"
msgstr "Todavía hay más trabajo por hacer. ¿Estás preparado?"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "There is meat ready for the feeding.  Are you ready to gather it?"
msgstr ""
"Hay carne lista para la alimentación. ¿Estás listo para recogerla?Hay carne "
"lista para la alimentación. ¿Estás listo para recogerla?"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "The eaters are hungry."
msgstr "Los devoradores tienen hambre."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "There is more meat needed."
msgstr "Se necesita más carne."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "I know of eaters ready for meat."
msgstr "Sé de devoradores dispuestos a comer carne."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Maybe another time CEO Baronyx."
msgstr "Tal vez en otro momento CEO Baronyx."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"If you are ready to be of service to the great eaters, go and find meat and "
"bring it back.  There is always need for more."
msgstr ""
"Si estás dispuesto a servir a los grandes devoradores, ve a buscar carne y "
"tráela. Siempre hay necesidad de más."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Happy to be of service to the great eaters.  I'm in."
msgstr "Feliz de estar al servicio de los grandes devoradores. Me apunto."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Excellent.  Make it happen."
msgstr "Excelente. Hazlo realidad."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"The great eaters are not picky, any pure meat will do, but mutant and tainted "
"meat are not good enough."
msgstr ""
"Los grandes devoradores no son exigentes, cualquier carne pura les sirve, "
"pero la carne mutante y contaminada no es buena."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "So, meat from a creature that isn't a zombie, or a giant monster.  Got it."
msgstr ""
"Así que, carne de una criatura que no es un zombi, o un monstruo gigante. Lo "
"tengo."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Of course, you should find everything you need here."
msgstr "Por supuesto, deberías encontrar todo lo que necesitas aquí."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "That explains the knives then."
msgstr "Eso explica los cuchillos entonces."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Oh, you know my friend Brigitte.  Well in that case, let's go!"
msgstr "Oh, conoces a mi amiga Brigitte. Bueno, en ese caso, ¡vamos!"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "No, I must remain here to oversee the company."
msgstr "No,  yo debo permanecer aquí para supervisar la empresa."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Of course CEO Baronyx."
msgstr "Por supuesto CEO Baronyx."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Sweet!"
msgstr "¡Genial!"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Not just now.  You should remain here to oversee the company."
msgstr "No sólo ahora. Deberías quedarte aquí para supervisar la empresa."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Of course, the company will be ready when you are and the great eaters will "
"feed either way."
msgstr ""
"Por supuesto, la compañía estará lista cuando tú lo estés y los grandes "
"devoradores se alimentarán de cualquier manera."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"It was foretold that as the great eaters returned, so too would the "
"pretenders, who would come to steal the meat.  Very little is asked of us, "
"except that we do all we can to ensure that the true great eaters received as "
"much meat as possible and the pretenders go hungry."
msgstr ""
"Fue presagiado que cuando los grandes devoradores volvieran, también lo "
"harían los farsantes, que vendrían a robar la carne. Se nos pide muy poco, "
"salvo que hagamos todo lo posible para que los verdaderos grandes devoradores "
"reciban la mayor cantidad de carne posible y los farsantes pasen hambre."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Yes CEO Baronyx, very good CEO Baronyx."
msgstr "Si CEO Baronyx, muy bien CEO Baronyx."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "This makes no sense and I'm done talking about it."
msgstr "Esto no tiene ningún sentido y ya no voy a hablar de ello."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ NPC faction name
msgid "Swampers Religious Community and Hotels and Casinos"
msgstr "Comunidad religiosa, hoteles y casinos de las Marismas"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
#. ~ Description of NPC faction "Swampers Religious Community and Hotels and
#. Casinos"
msgid ""
"A prosperous but secretive group of churchgoers and entertainment moguls with "
"an affection for dinosaurs.  They welcome all untainted humans."
msgstr ""
"Un grupo próspero pero reservado de feligreses y magnates del entretenimiento "
"con afición a los dinosaurios. Acogen a todos los humanos no contaminados."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
#: data/mods/DinoMod/achievements/achievements.json
#. ~ Unique name of an NPC
#. ~ Name of achievement
msgid "Red"
msgstr "Red"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "It's a good day to shoot some dinos."
msgstr "Es un buen día para disparar algunos dinos."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"You're back.  I knew you were a killer.  Are you ready to take this country "
"back?"
msgstr "Has vuelto. Sabía que eras un asesino. ¿Estás listo para recuperar este país?"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"You there, wanderer.  You have the look of someone who hates dinosaurs.  Are "
"you ready to take this country back?"
msgstr ""
"Tú, caminante. Tienes la mirada de alguien que odia a los dinosaurios. ¿Estás "
"listo para recuperar este país?"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Dinosaurs?  What are you talking about?"
msgstr "¿Dinosaurios? ¿De qué estás hablando?"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "How can I help?"
msgstr "¿Cómo puedo ayudar?"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Mission update for you, Red."
msgstr "Misión actualizada para ti, Rojo."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Anyway.  Take care, Red."
msgstr "De todos modos. Cuídate, Red."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"They just started showing up about the same time it all fell apart.  They "
"attack the caravans and the bandits both.  Hungry bastards.  All dinosaurs "
"are shoot on sight.  We don't eat them, they're probably poisoned with "
"whatever got the dead ones.  Just leave them for the crows.  Same with the "
"eggs."
msgstr ""
"Empezaron a aparecer casi al mismo tiempo que todo se vino abajo. Atacan "
"tanto a las caravanas como a los bandidos. Bastardos hambrientos. A todos los "
"dinosaurios se les dispara a la vista. No los comemos, probablemente estén "
"envenenados con lo que sea que tengan los muertos. Sólo los dejamos para los "
"cuervos. Lo mismo con los huevos."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Kill all dinosaurs, interesting…"
msgstr "Matar a todos los dinosaurios, interesante..."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Probably not important."
msgstr "Probablemente no sea importante."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Secure Area"
msgstr "Area Segura"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Secure Area"
msgid ""
"We lost another trade caravan.  Whatever did the damage is still out there.  "
"Investigate the trade route and eliminate the threat."
msgstr ""
"Hemos perdido otra caravana comercial. Lo que sea que haya hecho el daño "
"todavía está ahí fuera. Investiga la ruta comercial y elimina la amenaza."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Secure Area"
msgid ""
"It sounds like you get it.  There is something out there scaring the "
"merchants.  They got away safe but lost a grain shipment, you're welcome to "
"it if you can haul it back.  Check out the area and report anything you find."
msgstr ""
"Parece que lo entiendes. Hay algo ahí fuera que asusta a los comerciantes. "
"Salieron vivos pero perdieron un cargamento de grano, eres bienvenido si "
"puedes transportarlo de vuelta. Revisa la zona y reporta cualquier cosa que "
"encuentres."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Lost in the Woods"
msgstr "Perdido en el Bosque"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Lost in the Woods"
msgid ""
"We lost a scout searching the woods for a lost family.  Find the scout or "
"take out what got them."
msgstr ""
"Hemos perdido a un explorador buscando en el bosque a una familia perdida. "
"Encuentra al explorador o elimina lo que los atrapó."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Lost in the Woods"
msgid ""
"Seems like the only news we get here is bad.  A weirdo family was staying "
"outside the center, I don't know why.  They said something about germs.  "
"Anyway, they're gone, vanished in the night.  We sent a scout out to find "
"them but now they're gone too.  We have a pretty good idea of where in the "
"woods the scout was searching.  Bring back anyone you can alive and end "
"whatever is keeping them."
msgstr ""
"Parece que las únicas noticias que recibimos aquí son malas. Una familia rara "
"se estaba quedando fuera del centro, no sé por qué. Dijeron algo sobre "
"gérmenes. De todos modos, se han ido, desaparecieron en la noche. Enviamos un "
"explorador para encontrarlos pero ahora también se ha desaparecido. Tenemos "
"una buena idea de en qué parte del bosque estaba buscando el explorador. "
"Traigan a todos los que puedas con vida y acaba con lo que sea que los "
"retiene."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Lost in the Woods"
msgid ""
"Try not to make too much noise.  Visibility is bad in the woods so it's all "
"about sound."
msgstr ""
"Intenta no hacer demasiado ruido. La visibilidad es mala en el bosque, así "
"que lo importante es el sonido."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Protect the cattle"
msgstr "Protege al ganado"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Protect the cattle"
msgid "Someone or something in the swamps is stealing cattle.  Stop it."
msgstr "Alguien o algo en los pantanos está robando ganado. Páralo."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Protect the cattle"
msgid ""
"This is probably a waste of time, but a nearby farmer has been complaining "
"that someone or something has been stealing a lot of their cattle.  We don't "
"normally bother with little things like this, but our food supplies are "
"getting low and the farmers are threatening to cut us off if we won't help.  "
"I've marked on your map where the farmers think the cattle are going."
msgstr ""
"Probablemente sea una pérdida de tiempo, pero un granjero cercano se ha "
"quejado de que alguien o algo ha estado robando gran parte de su ganado. "
"Normalmente no nos molestamos por cosas pequeñas como ésta, pero nuestras "
"reservas de alimentos se están agotando y los granjeros amenazan con dejarnos "
"sin suministro si no les ayudamos. He marcado en tu mapa dónde creen los "
"granjeros que el ganado está yendo."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Protect the cattle"
msgid ""
"Maybe bring a rope to bring the cattle back or something for them to eat.  "
"They can be ornery cusses if you don't know how to treat them."
msgstr ""
"Tal vez lleva una soga para traer el ganado de vuelta o algo para que coman. "
"Pueden ser unos malditos cabrones si no sabes cómo tratarlos."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Protect the cattle"
msgid ""
"Oh.  Oh no.  We didn't think the dinosaurs could raise and we've killed so "
"many of them.  We might be in trouble here.  Here's one now, I'll rip it "
"apart!  Wait, I can see in its dead eyes that it loves us and wants to help "
"us.  I'll just end up killing it, I'm barely holding it together here.  You'd "
"better take it."
msgstr ""
"Oh. Oh no. No creíamos que los dinosaurios pudieran resucitar y hemos matado "
"a muchos de ellos. Podríamos estar en problemas. ¡Aquí hay uno, lo voy a "
"destrozar! Espera, puedo ver en sus ojos muertos que nos ama y quiere "
"ayudarnos. Terminaré matándolo, apenas lo estoy resistiendo aquí. Será mejor "
"que te lo lleves."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
#. ~ Nickname for creature 'mon_zachycephalosaurus_chain' in an effect
msgid "Betty"
msgstr "Betty"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
#. ~ Mission name
#. ~ Description of mission "Kill 50 dinos"
msgid "Kill 50 dinos"
msgstr "Mata 50 dinosaurios"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill 50 dinos"
msgid ""
"While we were out on a hunting party a couple of those big ugly ones came "
"back and ate a whole mob of the dead I wanted to take out.  We lost a lot of "
"soldiers too while we were out too, good ones, and they died bad.  Slow.  I "
"made sure of it, the traitors.  These dinosaurs have gone too far.  They're "
"making us crazy.  We need to rack up some serious numbers to catch up.  We "
"need some serious risk taking, I'm talking explosives and fire and drugs and "
"rock and roll here.  I don't care if it's living dinos or dead, they all need "
"to be taken down."
msgstr ""
"Mientras salíamos de caza, un par de esos grandes y feos regresaron y se "
"comieron a toda una horda de muertos que yo quería liquidar. También perdimos "
"un montón de soldados mientras estábamos fuera, buenos soldados muertos de "
"mala forma. Lentamente. Me aseguré de ello, los traidores. Estos dinosaurios "
"han ido demasiado lejos. Nos están volviendo locos. Necesitamos incrementar "
"los números en serio para ponernos al día. Necesitamos tomar algunos riesgos "
"importantes, estoy hablando de explosivos, fuego, drogas y rock and roll. No "
"me importa si son dinosaurios vivos o muertos, todos necesitan ser abatidos."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill 50 dinos"
msgid "Kill all dinos."
msgstr "Mata todos los dinosaurios."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill 50 dinos"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill me a T Rex"
msgid "I'm right on the edge soldier.  Whose side are you on here?"
msgstr "Estoy al limite soldado. ¿De qué lado estás aquí?"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill 50 dinos"
msgid ""
"You can kill a lot of dinos without taking a lot of pills, but I don't see "
"how."
msgstr ""
"Puedes matar a muchos dinosaurios sin tomar muchas pastillas, pero no veo "
"cómo."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill 50 dinos"
msgid "You hit your numbers yet?"
msgstr "¿Ya has cumplido tu cuota?"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill 50 dinos"
msgid ""
"That's what I like to hear.  We got our numbers too, and we chained down a "
"couple too.  I had to take out a few more soldiers who didn't make their "
"numbers, so this is good.  We're doing good."
msgstr ""
"Eso es lo que queria oír. Conseguimos nuestros números, y encadenamos un par "
"también. Tuve que retirar algunos soldados más que no hicieron sus números, "
"así que esto es bueno. Lo estamos haciendo bien."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
#. ~ Nickname for creature 'mon_zachycephalosaurus_chain' in an effect
msgid "Stromer"
msgstr "Stromer"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
#. ~ Mission name
#. ~ Description of mission "Kill me a T Rex"
msgid "Kill me a T Rex"
msgstr "Mata un Tiranosaurus Rex"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill me a T Rex"
msgid ""
"I have a special mission I need to complete before these dinos finish killing "
"me off, and I need you to bring me something special.  Go kill me a T Rex.  "
"We're going to be gods.  It's all going to be worth it."
msgstr ""
"Tengo una misión especial que necesito completar antes de que estos "
"dinosaurios terminen de matarme, y necesito que me traigas algo especial. Ve "
"a matar para mi un T Rex. Vamos a ser dioses. Todo va a valer la pena."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill me a T Rex"
msgid "MY LIFE FOR YOU."
msgstr "MI VIDA POR TI."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill me a T Rex"
msgid "You're a dino killing machine like me.  You know what to do."
msgstr "Eres una máquina de matar dinosaurios como yo. Ya sabes lo que hacer."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill me a T Rex"
msgid "You got my body yet?"
msgstr "¿Ya me conseguiste mi cuerpo?"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill me a T Rex"
msgid ""
"All right, we've got the body here.  Watch this, I'm going to climb into its "
"dead mouth and when you see me again I'll be a god.  *SWALLOW*"
msgstr ""
"Muy bien, tenemos el cuerpo aquí. Mira esto, voy a trepar a su boca muerta y "
"cuando me veas de nuevo seré un dios. *TRAGANDO*"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
#. ~ Nickname for creature 'mon_zyrannosaurus_chain' in an effect
msgid "Wilma"
msgstr "Wilma"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ Unique name of an NPC
msgid "Yoshimi"
msgstr "Yoshimi"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
#. ~ Name of an NPC class
msgid "DinoLab survivor"
msgstr "superviviente de Laboratorio de Dinosaurios"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ Job description of "DinoLab survivor" NPC class
msgid "Need to learn what happened…"
msgstr "Necesito saber qué pasó..."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "How can I help you, survivor?"
msgstr "¿En qué te puedo ayudar, superviviente?"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Seen any interesting specimens?  I mean dinosaurs."
msgstr "¿Has visto especimenes interesantes? Me refiero a dinosaurios."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I was just imagining you transforming into a tyrannosaurus rex.  Of course "
"that's impossible.  Unless…"
msgstr ""
"Me estaba imaginando que te transformabas en un tiranosaurio rex. Por "
"supuesto, eso es imposible. A menos que..."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Let's do some science."
msgstr "Hagamos algo de ciencia."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Please leave me be, I am but a humble muck farmer in this humble muck."
msgstr ""
"Por favor, déjame en paz, no soy más que un humilde agricultor en este "
"humilde lodazal."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid ""
"You are dressed like a scientist.  Are you a scientist?  You look like a "
"dinosaur.  Are you a dinosaur?  Are you a scientist dinosaur?"
msgstr ""
"Estás vestido como un científico. ¿Eres un científico? Pareces un dinosaurio. "
"¿Eres un dinosaurio? ¿Eres un dinosaurio científico"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Die demon mutant!"
msgstr "¡Muere demonio mutante!"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "You look like you need help.  Can I do something for you?"
msgstr "Parece que necesitas ayuda. ¿Puedo hacer algo por ti?"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"You have seen through my ruse.  In retrospect I should have prepared a "
"costume of some kind.  Unimportant!  You haven't attacked me or tried to "
"seduce me so you aren't like the others.  Had any bad headaches recently, "
"strange mood swings, strong urges, desire for human flesh?"
msgstr ""
"Has visto a través de mi artimaña. En retrospectiva, debería haber preparado "
"algún tipo de disfraz. ¡Importante! No me has atacado ni has intentado "
"seducirme, así que no eres como los demás. ¿Has tenido algún dolor de cabeza "
"recientemente, extraños cambios de ánimo, fuertes impulsos, deseo de carne "
"humana?"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Only the usual.  What are you really?"
msgstr "Sólo lo de siempre. ¿Qué eres realmente?"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "You are aware of the Cataclysm then?"
msgstr "¿Estás al tanto del Cataclismo entonces?"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'd rather not say at this point."
msgstr "Prefiero no decirlo en este momento."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I am a hard working professional in a challenging field adjusting to a recent "
"change in circumstances.  That is all you need to know."
msgstr ""
"Soy un profesional muy trabajador en un campo difícil que se está adaptando a "
"un cambio reciente de circunstancias. Eso es todo lo que necesitas saber."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"My manager Dr. Tingle made some important mistakes and I have had to make "
"some quick decisions I would rather not go into detail on.  In retrospect our "
"faculties may have been influenced by external factors.  Suffice to say Dr. "
"Tingle is no longer with us but died happy.  And I escaped alive."
msgstr ""
"Mi director, el Dr. Tingle, cometió algunos errores importantes y yo he "
"tenido que tomar algunas decisiones rápidas que prefiero no detallar. En "
"retrospectiva, nuestras facultades pueden haber sido influenciadas por "
"factores externos. Basta con decir que el Dr. Tingle ya no está con nosotros "
"pero murió feliz. Y yo escapé vivo."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Look at me.  Yes, I am aware.  The question is what happens next."
msgstr "Mírame. Sí, soy consciente. La cuestión es qué ocurre después."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I just got here, actually; I've recently found it wise to move a lot.  There "
"may be some interesting specimens nearby.  I mean dinosaurs."
msgstr ""
"Acabo de llegar aquí, en realidad; últimamente me ha parecido prudente "
"moverme mucho. Puede haber algunos especímenes interesantes cerca. Me refiero "
"a dinosaurios."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "First we need some supplies"
msgstr "Primero necesitamos algunos suministros"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "First we need some supplies"
msgid "I think I might know where a decent chemistry set is…"
msgstr "Creo que podría saber dónde hay un equipo de química decente..."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "First we need some supplies"
msgid "I need a full chemistry set to do my work properly.  I could use some help."
msgstr ""
"Necesito un equipo de química completo para hacer mi trabajo correctamente. "
"Me vendría bien algo de ayuda."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "First we need some supplies"
msgid "Fine.  I've marked one I know about on your map but any set will work."
msgstr ""
"Bien. He marcado una que conozco en tu mapa, pero cualquier conjunto de ellas "
"servirá."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "First we need some supplies"
msgid "Fine, you'll probably be dead soon anyway."
msgstr "Bien, probablemente estarás muerto pronto de todas formas."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "First we need some supplies"
msgid ""
"It might be too dangerous now, any working full chemistry set is fine.  There "
"is a good chance something got out."
msgstr ""
"Podría ser demasiado peligroso ahora, cualquier equipo de química completo "
"que funcione está bien. Hay una buena posibilidad de que algo haya quedado."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "First we need some supplies"
msgid "Do you have the set yet?"
msgstr "¿Ya tienes el equipo?"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "First we need some supplies"
msgid "Let's get started."
msgstr "Empecemos."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "First we need some supplies"
msgid "Very convincing.  I do need an actual chemistry set to work though."
msgstr "Muy convincente. Sin embargo, necesito un juego de química real para trabajar."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "First we need some supplies"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kiernan consult"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Nice relaxing break"
msgid "It's fine, I'll make something work."
msgstr "Está bien, haré que algo funcione."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Kiernan consult"
msgstr "Consulta a Kiernan"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kiernan consult"
msgid "I need some expert advice…"
msgstr "Necesito el consejo de un experto..."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kiernan consult"
msgid ""
"I don't have access to my old lab's procedural documents here.  Find Dr. "
"Kiernan and get some notes on the basics.  I can work from there."
msgstr ""
"No tengo acceso a los documentos de procedimiento de mi antiguo laboratorio "
"desde aquí. Encuentra al Dr. Kiernan y consigue algunas notas sobre lo "
"básico. Puedo trabajar a partir de eso."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kiernan consult"
msgid "Right.  I've marked his last location on your map."
msgstr "Bien. He marcado su última ubicación en tu mapa."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kiernan consult"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Nice relaxing break"
msgid "Ugh."
msgstr "Uf."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kiernan consult"
msgid ""
"Kiernan is probably still at the old field office.  It should be fine as long "
"as the emergency power is still working.  You may have to do some kind of "
"stupid task before Kiernan talks.  Try not to get violent.  If Kiernan is "
"dead try and find some notes or books."
msgstr ""
"Kiernan probablemente siga en la antigua oficina de campo. Debería estar bien "
"mientras la energía de emergencia siga funcionando. Puede que tengas que "
"hacer algún tipo de tarea estúpida antes de que Kiernan te hable. Intenta no "
"ponerte violento. Si Kiernan está muerto intenta encontrar algunas notas o "
"libros."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kiernan consult"
msgid "Do you have the information yet?"
msgstr "¿Ya tienes la información?"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kiernan consult"
msgid "Let's get started.  Oh, I'll make you a copy just in case."
msgstr "Empecemos. Oh, te haré una copia por si acaso."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kiernan consult"
msgid "Very convincing.  I do need the information to work though."
msgstr "Muy convincente. Sin embargo, necesito la información para trabajar."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ Name of the monster "mon_zombie_scientist" placed on map update on start
#. of mission "Kiernan consult"
msgid "Kiernan"
msgstr "Kiernan"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Nice relaxing break"
msgstr "Bonito y relajante descanso"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Nice relaxing break"
msgid "Time for a nice relaxing trip…"
msgstr "Es hora de un agradable viaje de relax..."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Nice relaxing break"
msgid ""
"We have been working so hard.  We deserve a break.  Here is what I want you "
"to do.  There is a special zoo with very special animals in it. I need you to "
"go there and kill anything dangerous and smash the corpses bloody so they "
"don't rise and try to kill me.  For science.  Then I'm going to go there and "
"study what is there to get ready for the next step."
msgstr ""
"Hemos trabajado mucho. Nos merecemos un descanso. Esto es lo que quiero que "
"hagas. Hay un zoo especial con animales muy especiales. Necesito que vayas "
"allí y mates cualquier cosa peligrosa y aplastes los cadáveres sangrientos "
"para que no se levanten e intenten matarme. Por la ciencia. Luego iré allí y "
"estudiaré lo que hay para prepararme para el siguiente paso."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Nice relaxing break"
msgid "Clean up if you can, I don't like mess."
msgstr "Limpia si puedes, no me gusta el desorden."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Nice relaxing break"
msgid ""
"You're good at this kind of brutality I assume.  Bring a weapon of some kind. "
" I don't know how dangerous it will be but I would assume the worst.  I "
"always do."
msgstr ""
"Eres bueno con este tipo de brutalidad, supongo. Trae un arma de algún tipo. "
"No sé lo peligroso que será pero yo asumiría lo peor. Siempre lo hago."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Nice relaxing break"
msgid "Are you back from your relaxing trip?"
msgstr "¿Ya has vuelto de tu viaje de relax?"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Nice relaxing break"
msgid ""
"Wonderful.  I trust you weren't hurt by those animals.  I have some spare "
"chemicals you might enjoy."
msgstr ""
"Maravilloso. Confío en que no te hayan lastimado esos animales. Tengo algunos "
"productos químicos de repuesto que podrías disfrutar."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Nice relaxing break"
msgid "Wonderful, now I'm off to inspect your work."
msgstr "Maravilloso, ahora me voy para inspeccionar tu trabajo."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"It could be a mighty challenge, but Alonso knows there are some that are into "
"this, no?  I think they call themselves escalier, which is Italian for the "
"scaly banana.  Or staircase.  It is not important, I mean to say that people "
"love who they love, and the dinosaur, she does the same, and there is no "
"shame in what two people or dinosaurs do in the escalier.  Alonso does not "
"judge you.  You do you.  And maybe Alonso as well when you are done with the "
"you doing."
msgstr ""
"Podría ser un reto importante, pero Alonso sabe que hay algunos que les gusta "
"esto, ¿no? Creo que se llaman escalier, que en italiano significa plátano "
"escamoso. O escalera. No es importante, lo que quiero decir, es que la gente "
"quiere a quien quiere, y el dinosaurio, hace lo mismo, y no hay vergüenza en "
"lo que hacen dos personas o dinosaurios en el escalier. Alonso no te juzga. "
"Lo haces tú. Y tal vez Alonso también cuando termines de hacerlo tú."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Their song is older than ours, but also different.  We have much to learn "
"from their old bones.  I knew a man once who sang not of bones but of meat.  "
"If you find him, you will know the face of Bo.  He has listened hardest to "
"them, but I do not know if he hears."
msgstr ""
"Su canción es más vieja que la nuestra pero también diferente. Tenemos mucho "
"que aprender de sus viejos huesos. Conocí un hombre un vez que cantó no sobre "
"los huesos si no sobre la carne. Si lo encuentras, conocerás la cara de Bo. "
"Él los ha escuchado con más ganas pero no sé si los oye."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "That explains everything, thank you."
msgstr "Eso lo explica todo, gracias."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NPC_Old_Guard_RED_Soldier_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Kill all dinosaurs."
msgstr "Mata a todos los dinosaurios."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NPC_Old_Guard_RED_Soldier_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Welcome to whatever this is."
msgstr "Bienvenido a lo que sea esto."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NPC_Old_Guard_RED_Soldier_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "I'm supposed to direct all questions to my leadership, that's Red over there."
msgstr "Se supone que debo dirigir todas las preguntas a mi jefe, que es Rojo."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NPC_Old_Guard_RED_Soldier_1.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Sure sure…"
msgstr "Seguro seguro..."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"They just started showing up about the same time it all fell apart.  They "
"attack the caravans and the bandits both.  Hungry bastards.  All dinosaurs "
"are shoot on sight.  We don't eat them, they're probably poisoned with "
"whatever got the dead ones.  Best to burn and bury them.  Same with the eggs. "
" We have a team out working on wiping them all out in the region.  Check the "
"mass graves.  Talk to Red there."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Probably for the best."
msgstr "Probablemente sea lo mejor."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/TALK_NC_FARMER.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Strange greeting, ignoring that.  What can you tell me about the dinosaurs?"
msgstr "Extraño saludo, ignorando eso. ¿Qué puedes decirme sobre los dinosaurios?"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/TALK_NC_FARMER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Cute things, aren't they!  Like big birds with big appetites.  The plant "
"eaters are okay unless they get spooked - then it's time to hide on the roof "
"for a while until they calm down.  I gave one some cattle feed and it seemed "
"to like it fine, let me pet it and followed me around some.  I bet you could "
"tame them if they're young, maybe even some of the grown ones.  A man came "
"out here a while ago saying they were coming, that it was their time and we "
"needed to get with them or get out of the way.  The man said I should follow "
"him to the Swamper church, but I'm too busy here.  A whole lot of people went "
"with him though."
msgstr ""
"Qué cosas más bonitas, ¿verdad? Como grandes pájaros con gran apetito. Los "
"devoradores de plantas están bien a menos que se asusten - entonces es el "
"momento de esconderse en el tejado por un tiempo hasta que se calmen. Le di a "
"uno un poco de pienso para ganado y pareció gustarle, me dejó acariciarlo y "
"me siguió un poco. Apuesto a que podrías domesticarlos si son jóvenes, "
"incluso a algunos de los adultos. Un hombre vino aquí hace un rato diciendo "
"que venían, que era su hora y que teníamos que ir con ellos o quitarnos de en "
"medio. El hombre dijo que debería seguirle a la iglesia de las Marismas, pero "
"estoy demasiado ocupado aquí. Sin embargo, un montón de gente se fue con él."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/TALK_NC_FARMER.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'm sure they're fine.  What was that question again?"
msgstr "Estoy seguro que están bien. ¿Qué me habías preguntado?"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"That's a lot of meat to break down.  You're going to want to get together a "
"real butcher setup, hooks and all, rig up a way to keep the meat cold or even "
"better frozen, and figure out some way to make it last longer.  Could do "
"jerky, maybe get a canning operation going.  The main thing is to work fast "
"before it goes bad.  Hey, I know a pretty good cook who could help with that. "
" No, she's dead.  I'm here though."
msgstr ""
"Eso es un montón de carne que hay que desmenuzar. Tendrás que montar una "
"verdadera carnicería, con ganchos y todo, y preparar una forma de mantener la "
"carne fría o, mejor aún, congelada, y pensar en alguna forma de hacerla durar "
"más tiempo. Podrías hacer cecina, tal vez conseguir una operación de enlatado "
"en marcha. Lo principal es trabajar rápido antes de que se estropee. Oye, "
"conozco a una buena cocinera que podría ayudar con eso. No, está muerta. Pero "
"yo estoy aquí."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'm getting hungry."
msgstr "Me está entrando hambre."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/exodii_merchant_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Yes, and what can I tell you about the grass being green and the sun
#. being yellow?  All of the large baby chickens do what they do and we get no
#. benefit from it regardless of what we say about them.  Why do you ask, you
#. person with a physical body?  Do you like the big turkeys?
msgid ""
"Aye, 'n what c'n I yark'n ye around the grassins what be a'green 'n that the "
"big brassy what be a'yeller?  All'n those great chickees do what they do 'n "
"we profit none 'n the immortalinity of the crabs consists just so. What of it "
"ye long and bobbly?  Ye takin' a shinin' to the jibble-necks?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/exodii_merchant_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "This was unhelpful."
msgstr "Esto no ha servido de nada."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/exodii_merchant_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Are you really this nonchalant about the dinosaurs?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/exodii_merchant_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Yes, and yes again.  If every world has zombies, 90% of the ones we reach
#. have dinos.
msgid ""
"Aye, n'aye again!  E'ry ball o mud has the Enemy.  Nine mudballs out o' ten  "
"are mudded up wit thunder chickees."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/exodii_merchant_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I wonder why most worlds have dinosaurs roaming?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/npc_classes_mutant.json
#. ~ Name of an NPC class
msgid "Stego Mutant"
msgstr "Mutante Stego"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/npc_classes_mutant.json
#. ~ Job description of "Stego Mutant" NPC class
msgid "I'm looking for stego mutagen… I'm going to become a thunder lizard."
msgstr "Estoy buscando mutágeno stego... Me voy a convertir en un lagarto de trueno."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/npc_classes_mutant.json
#. ~ Name of an NPC class
msgid "Tyrant Mutant"
msgstr "Mutante Tirano"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/npc_classes_mutant.json
