msgstr[2] "hadrosaurus"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
#. ~ Description of monster "hadrosaurus"
msgid "A bulky, beaked dinosaur with hooved front legs and strong clawed back legs."
msgstr ""
"Un dinosaurio voluminoso, con pico y patas delanteras con pezuñas y unas "
