"A huge scaly dinosaur with hooves and a broad beak filled with hundreds of "
"small teeth with a small nasal crest just above and in front of the eyes."
msgstr ""
"Un enorme dinosaurio escamoso con pezuñas y un pico ancho lleno de cientos de "
"pequeños dientes con una pequeña cresta nasal justo encima y delante de los "
