"A huge scaly dinosaur with a tall ridge down the back, a tail and hooves.  "
"Has a short beak and a wide, rounded head crest."
msgstr ""
"Un enorme dinosaurio escamoso con una alta cresta a lo largo del lomo, una "
"cola y pezuñas. Tiene un pico corto y una cresta ancha y redondeada en la "
"cabeza."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "stegoceras"
msgid_plural "stegoceras"
msgstr[0] "stegoceras"
msgstr[1] "stegoceras"
msgstr[2] "stegoceras"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
#. ~ Description of monster "stegoceras"
msgid ""
"A small feathered bipedal dinosaur about the size of a goat.  It looks like a "
"reptilian ostrich with a round hard-looking domed head."
msgstr ""
"Un pequeño dinosaurio bípedo emplumado del tamaño de una cabra. Parece un "
"avestruz reptiliano con una cabeza redonda y abovedada de aspecto duro."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "pachycephalosaurus"
msgid_plural "pachycephalosaurus"
msgstr[0] "pachycephalosaurus"
msgstr[1] "pachycephalosaurus"
msgstr[2] "pachycephalosaurus"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
#. ~ Description of monster "pachycephalosaurus"
msgid ""
"A feathered bipedal dinosaur, standing as tall as a human.  It looks like a "
"reptilian ostrich with a round hard-looking domed head."
msgstr ""
"Un dinosaurio bípedo emplumado, con la altura de un ser humano. Parece un "
"avestruz reptiliano con una cabeza redonda y abovedada de aspecto duro."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "aquilops"
msgid_plural "aquilops"
msgstr[0] "aquilops"
msgstr[1] "aquilops"
msgstr[2] "aquilops"

