#. ~ Description of monster "fungal thescelosaurus zombie"
msgid ""
"This was once a sturdy two-legged dinosaur herbivore, with a long beak and "
"feathers.  Fungal tendrils now sprout from its mouth, eyes, and other "
"orifices, holding together a shambling mass of mold-covered flesh."
