"A massive, four-legged dinosaur corpse with a tall bony crest with two long "
"curved spikes and three rough bosses above the eyes and nose as well as a "
"short tail and hooked beak.  Its entire body bulges with distended muscles "
"and swollen, festering wounds."
msgstr ""
"Es el cuerpo de un dinosaurio enorme de cuatro patas con una cresta ósea "
"alta, con dos púas largas curvadas y tres protuberancias irregulares arriba "
"de los ojos y la nariz, con cola corta y pico ganchudo. Su cuerpo entero "
"tiene músculos dilatados sobresaliendo, con heridas supurantes e hinchadas."

