#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
#. ~ Description of monster "ceratopsian hulk"
msgid ""
"A hideously swollen zombified ceratopsian body towering into the sky.  Its "
"massive body bulges with distended muscles and swollen, festering wound."
