#. ~ Description of monster "skeletal neotheropod brute"
msgid ""
"Distorted outgrowths of calcified bone plates cover this dinosaur's rotten "
"flesh, especially two large crests on the head.  Joints and cracks around its "
"body ooze with black goo."
msgstr ""
"Distorsionadas excrecencias de placas óseas calcificadas cubren la carne "
"podrida de este dinosaurio, especialmente dos grandes crestas en la cabeza. "
"Las articulaciones y grietas de su cuerpo rezuman una sustancia viscosa negra."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
