msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
#. ~ Description of monster "skeletal theropod juggernaut"
msgid ""
"This hideous colossus of plated bones and misshapen flesh drags its heavy, "
"pointed limbs behind it.  Already strong and dangerous, bones grew around its "
"form to protect it - only, they kept growing.  The shape and twisted pointed "
"teeth suggest some kind of predator dinosaur."
msgstr ""
"Este espantoso coloso de placas óseas y carnes malformadas, se arrastra "
"pesadamente, con sus brazos hacia atrás. Los huesos han crecido para proteger "
"lo que antes ya era fuerte y peligroso pero siguieron creciendo. La forma y "
"los dientes retorcidos sugieren alguna clase de dinosaurio depredador."

