msgid ""
"This hideous colossus of plated bones and misshapen flesh drags its heavy, "
"pointed limbs behind it.  Already strong and dangerous, bones grew around its "
"form to protect it - only, they kept growing.  The twisted back sail means it "
"must have been a spinosaurus once."
msgstr ""
"Este horrible coloso de huesos chapados y carne deforme arrastra tras de sí "
"sus pesados y puntiagudos miembros. Ya fuerte y peligroso, los huesos "
"crecieron alrededor de su forma para protegerlo... sólo que siguieron "
