"its own set of sights.  In more recent years, variants were sold commercially "
"to ostensibly launch flares.  With the right cartridges, this would be "
"devastating against hard or soft targets.  A crude homemade bracket has been "
"attached, allowing a wider variety of hosts."
msgstr ""
"Un lanzador de un solo tiro para lanzar granadas o bengalas. Este lanzador "
"puede acoplarse a un fusil o a otra plataforma adecuada, e incluye su propio "
