msgstr[2] "CROWS II ametralladoras pesadas"

#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/robots/active_bots.json
#. ~ Description of monster "CROWS II, heavy machinegun"
msgid ""
"A remote weapon system derived from the M153 CROWS II and enhanced with "
"autonomous operation software.  Thousands of these were deployed by the US "
"military before the Cataclysm and they were valued for their use in engaging "
"anything up to light vehicles at long range without exposing the operator.  "
"This one is fitted with a heavy machinegun."
msgstr ""
"Un sistema de armas a distancia derivado del M153 CROWS II y mejorado con un "
"software de funcionamiento autónomo. Miles de ellas fueron desplegadas por el "
"ejército de EE.UU. antes del Cataclismo y fueron valoradas por su uso para "
"atacar cualquier cosa hasta vehículos ligeros a larga distancia sin exponer "
"al operador. Este está equipado con una ametralladora pesada."

#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/robots/active_bots.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "CROWS II, light machinegun"
msgid_plural "CROWS II, light machinegun"
msgstr[0] "CROWS II ametralladora ligera"
msgstr[1] "CROWS II ametralladoras ligeras"
msgstr[2] "CROWS II ametralladoras ligeras"

#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/robots/active_bots.json
#. ~ Description of monster "CROWS II, light machinegun"
msgid ""
"A remote weapon system derived from the M153 CROWS II and enhanced with "
"autonomous operation software.  Thousands of these were deployed by the US "
"military before the Cataclysm and they were valued for their use in engaging "
"infantry without exposing the operator.  This one is fitted with a light "
"machine gun."
msgstr ""
"Un sistema de armas a distancia derivado del M153 CROWS II y mejorado con un "
"software de funcionamiento autónomo. Miles de ellas fueron desplegadas por el "
"ejército de EE.UU. antes del Cataclismo y fueron valoradas por su uso en la "
"participación de la infantería sin exponer al operador. Este está equipado "
"con una ametralladora ligera."

#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/robots/active_bots.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "autonomous rifle TALON UGV"
msgid_plural "autonomous rifle TALON UGVs"
