msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "summon_undead_swarm ( Summon Undead Swarm )"
msgid ""
"A group of undead animals rises from the depths of the earth to fight for "
"you.  The type of undead you summon get deadlier with increasing spell level."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "necrotic_gaze"
msgid "Necrotic Gaze"
msgstr "Mirada Necrótica"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "necrotic_gaze ( Necrotic Gaze )"
msgid ""
"Using the power of blood contained within a rune, you imbue necrotic energy "
"into your gaze, damaging the target you look at."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "create_rune_animist"
msgid "Animist Rune"
msgstr "Runa Animista"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "create_rune_animist ( Animist Rune )"
msgid ""
"Performing a ritual, you turn some of your blood into an animist rune.  You "
"can use the rune to summon creatures, or as a catalyst for recipes."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "dominate"
msgid "Domination"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "dominate ( Domination )"
msgid ""
"Force the undead creature you pick to obey your command, making it your ally "
"for a short time."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "life_detonation"
msgid "Life Detonation"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "life_detonation ( Life Detonation )"
msgid ""
"Force life energy into an allied undead, making them explode with tremendous "
"force."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "convert"
msgid "Convert"
msgstr "Convertir"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "convert ( Convert )"
msgid ""
"Kill an allied creature, converting its life energy into a compact rune that "
"you can use afterwards."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "soulrend"
msgid "Soulrend"
msgstr "Finalizador de Alma"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "soulrend ( Soulrend )"
msgid ""
"Violently tears the spirit from the body and binds the resulting shade to "
"your will."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "disruption_bolt"
msgid "Disruption Bolt"
msgstr "Rayo Disruptivo"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "disruption_bolt ( Disruption Bolt )"
msgid ""
"Release a resonant bolt of spiritual energy at a nearby target.  It will "
"disrupt the natural link between matter and animus, causing heavy, non-lethal "
"damage."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "wrathful_spirits"
msgid "Wrathful Spirits"
msgstr "Espíritus Furiosos"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/feral_wizards.json
#. ~ Description of spell "wrathful_spirits ( Wrathful Spirits )"
#. ~ Description of spell "feral_high_animist_wrathful_spirits_self ( Wrathful
#. Spirits Summon )"
msgid ""
"Grant brief corporality to orphaned spirits and allow them to fight under "
"your command."
msgstr ""
"Concede una breve corporalidad a espíritus huérfanos y les permite luchar "
"bajo tu comando."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "spirit_walk"
msgid "Spirit Walk"
msgstr "Caminata Espiritual"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "spirit_walk ( Spirit Walk )"
msgid ""
"Momentarily plunge into the underworld and swap positions with any spirit you "
"command."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "banishment_lesser"
msgid "Lesser Banishment"
msgstr "Destierro Menor"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "banishment_lesser ( Lesser Banishment )"
msgid ""
"Banish a monster to a lesser-known nether dimension.  If a monster is more "
"powerful than you can handle, the spell drains your life force to make up the "
"difference."
msgstr ""
"Destierras a un monstruo a una dimensión inferior menos conocida. Si un "
"monstruo es más poderoso de lo que puedes manejar, el hechizo drena tu fuerza "
"vital para compensar la diferencia."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "summon_wisps"
msgid "Ignus Fatuus"
msgstr "Ignifugo Fatuo"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "summon_wisps ( Ignus Fatuus )"
msgid ""
"Summons ghostly foxfire worked from living marsh vapor to lead your enemies "
"astray.  With more experience, this spell can conjure multiple ghost lights."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "bleed"
msgid "Bleed"
msgstr "Sangrado"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "bleed ( Bleed )"
msgid "Agitate old wounds on a creature, causing blood to ooze out of them."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "animist_summon_decaying_boneclub"
msgid "Decaying Boneclub"
msgstr "Garrote de Hueso Pútrido"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "animist_summon_decaying_boneclub ( Decaying
#. Boneclub )"
msgid ""
"You link your living blood to dead bones, creating a club hungry for the "
"flesh of the living."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "animist_summon_decaying_boneclub_plus"
msgid "Improved Decaying Boneclub"
msgstr "Garrote Mejorado de Hueso Putrefacto"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "animist_summon_decaying_boneclub_plus ( Improved
#. Decaying Boneclub )"
msgid ""
"You link your living blood to dead bones, creating a club hungry for the "
"flesh of the living.  Now you know this spell like the back of your hand, and "
"have started to design your own version."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "rupture"
msgid "Rupture"
msgstr "Ruptura"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "rupture ( Rupture )"
msgid ""
"You pour mana into an unwilling and unprepared vessel, causing cellular "
"break-down, internal hemorrhaging, muddling ley lines, and overcharging "
"electronics.  The more powerful the spell, the faster the damage happens.  "
"Immensely gruesome and crude, it was once illegal world-wide, not that it "
"matters now."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "devour"
msgid "Devour"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "devour ( Devour )"
msgid "Kill an allied creature, consuming its life energy to regain some health."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "animist_sense_outsiders"
msgid "Sense Outsiders"
msgstr "Sentido Exterior"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "animist_sense_outsiders ( Sense Outsiders )"
msgid "You can sense the presence of nearby beings from the Nether."
msgstr "Puedes sentir la presencia de seres cercanos desde el Inframundo."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "animist_summon_watcher"
msgid "Summon Watcher Spirit"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "animist_summon_watcher ( Summon Watcher Spirit )"
msgid ""
"Summon a watcher spirit, whose senses overlap with your own and through whose "
"eyes you can see.  Although they are spirits, they are fragile and dissipate "
"easily in the face of any assault."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "animist_mass_hiding_aoe"
msgid "A Shadow in the Crowd"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "animist_mass_hiding_aoe ( A Shadow in the Crowd )"
msgid ""
"Sever the connections between your spirit and the spirits of everyone around "
"you, rendering them incapable of perceiving you; the light might hit their "
"eyes and the sounds their ears, but they cannot recognize what those "
"impressions mean.  Anything outside the spell's area of effect will have no "
"trouble spotting you.\n"
"\n"
"This spell does not affect any target without a spirit, such as a robot."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "animist_luck_bone"
msgid "Osseous Luck"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "animist_luck_bone ( Osseous Luck )"
msgid ""
"Attract spirits of good fortune to a bone, granting minor bonuses as long as "
"it is carried.  Though benevolent, the spirits are capricious, and exactly "
"what benefits they will provide cannot be determined ahead of time.  The bone "
"crumbles to dust when the spell duration expires and the spirits leave."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "animist_spirit_walking"
msgid "Spirit-Walking"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "animist_spirit_walking ( Spirit-Walking )"
msgid ""
"Transform your body to pure spirit, making you invisible and intangible.  You "
"can move incredibly quickly while the spell is in effect and can pass by "
"enemies unseen, but you will be unable to affect the physical world or cast "
"spells."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects_monster.json
#. ~ Name of spell "animist_add_evasion_spell"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_animist_add_evasion"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_feral_animist_guardian_spirit"
msgid "Guardian Spirit"
msgstr "Espíritu Guardián"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "animist_add_evasion_spell ( Guardian Spirit )"
msgid ""
"Summon a benevolent spirit to keep watch over you and warn you of imminent "
"attacks, allowing you to dodge some of them."
msgstr ""
"Convoca un espíritu benevolente para que te cuide y te advierta de ataques "
"inminentes, permitiéndote esquivar algunos de ellos."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "animist_slow_food_rotting_spell"
msgid "Abjure Spirits of Rot"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "animist_slow_food_rotting_spell ( Abjure Spirits of
#. Rot )"
msgid ""
"Placing a warding on food or drink, preventing the spirits of decay from "
"nesting within it.  The mage may affect as much food or drink as they can "
"carry.  The principles by which this spell functions were not discovered "
"until the 20th century, but some animists maintain that radiation is "
"frightening to decay spirits."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "animist_magic_fissile"
msgid "Magic Fissile"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "animist_magic_fissile ( Magic Fissile )"
msgid "I cast Magic… Fissile?  At the darkness?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "animist_cast_spells_when_silent"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_animist_vocalize"
msgid "The Inner Voice"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "animist_cast_spells_when_silent ( The Inner Voice
#. )"
msgid ""
"Channel magic through your soul instead of your voice, allowing you to cast "
"spells that require speech even when mute."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "animist_do_psionic_damage_to_head"
msgid "Mind Crush"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "animist_do_psionic_damage_to_head ( Mind Crush )"
msgid ""
"Directly assault the target's spirit, bypassing any physical protections they "
"have."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "animist_detect_wizards"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_animist_detect_wizards"
msgid "Witchsight"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "animist_detect_wizards ( Witchsight )"
msgid ""
"Open your senses up to look for the bright corporeal ley lines of those who "
"spent their lives frequently expending their mana.  This also applies to "
"creatures or alien beings that frequently use spells."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "light_healing"
msgid "Knit the Rent Flesh"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "light_healing ( Knit the Rent Flesh )"
msgid ""
"Cause the target's wounds to writhe, the flesh to crawl back together, and "
"their injuries to heal.  Disturbing, and painful, but effective."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "pain_split"
msgid "Pain Split"
msgstr "Dolor Dividido"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "pain_split ( Pain Split )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Pain Split"
msgid "Evens out damage among your limbs."
msgstr "Empareja el daño entre tus extremidades."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "vicious_tentacle"
msgid "Vicious Tentacle"
msgstr "Tentaculo Atroz"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "vicious_tentacle ( Vicious Tentacle )"
msgid ""
"This spell extrudes a long and nasty whiplike tentacle of sharp bones and "
"oozing acid from your body, which has a long reach attack and vicious damage."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "vicious_tentacle_plus"
msgid "Evolved Vicious Tentacle"
msgstr "Tentáculo Feroz Evolucionado"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "vicious_tentacle_plus ( Evolved Vicious Tentacle )"
msgid ""
"This spell extrudes a long and nasty whiplike tentacle of sharp bones and "
"oozing acid from your body, which has a long reach attack and vicious damage. "
" Now you know this spell like the back of your hand, and start to design your "
"own version."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "bio_grotesque"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "bio_boost"
msgid "Grotesque Enhancement"
msgstr "Mejora Grotesco"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "bio_grotesque ( Grotesque Enhancement )"
msgid ""
"A spell that warps your body in foreign, unnatural ways to increase your "
"physical abilities and strength."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "bio_acidicspray"
msgid "Acidic Spray"
msgstr "Rocio Ácido"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "bio_acidicspray ( Acidic Spray )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Acidic Spray"
msgid ""
"When cast, the mage opens his mouth and sprays acid in a wide cone to "
"dissolve his foes into goo.  Just imagine what he'll do with the goo."
msgstr ""
"Cuando es lanzado, el mago abre su boca y rocía ácido en un cono ancho para "
"disolver a sus enemigos a una sustancia viscosa. Imagina lo que hará con la "
"sustancia viscosa."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "bio_fleshpouch"
msgid "Flesh Pouch"
msgstr "Bolsa De Carne"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "bio_fleshpouch ( Flesh Pouch )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Flesh Pouch"
msgid ""
"This spell grows a large pouch out of your skin on your back, allowing you to "
"store your gear in it."
msgstr ""
"Este hechizo hace crecer una gran bolsa detu piel en la espalda, "
"permitiéndote almacenar tu equipo en ella."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "bio_bonespear"
msgid "Conjure Bonespear"
msgstr "Conjurar Lanza de Huesos"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "bio_bonespear ( Conjure Bonespear )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Conjure Bonespear"
msgid ""
"This spell creates a long shaft of bone with a wicked point and blades along "
"its length."
msgstr ""
"Este hechizo crea un largo eje de hueso con una punta malvada y cuchillas a "
"lo largo de su longitud."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "bio_bonespear_plus"
msgid "Evolved Conjure Bonespear"
msgstr "Conjurar Lanza de Hueso Evolucionada"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "bio_bonespear_plus ( Evolved Conjure Bonespear )"
msgid ""
"This spell creates a long shaft of bone with a wicked point and blades along "
"its length.  Now you know this spell like the back of your hand, and have "
"started to design your own version."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "create_rune_biomancer"
msgid "Biomancer Rune"
msgstr "Runa Biomante"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "create_rune_biomancer ( Biomancer Rune )"
msgid ""
"This ritual grows a small nub of flesh on you, which quickly falls off and "
"turns into a rune attuned to Biomancers.  You can use the rune as a catalyst "
"for recipes."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "biomancer_paralytic_dart"
msgid "Paralytic Dart"
msgstr "Dardo Paralizante"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "biomancer_paralytic_dart ( Paralytic Dart )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Paralytic Dart"
msgid ""
"Spits a warped needle of sinew and bone, carrying with it a sting that slows "
"your victim."
msgstr ""
"Escupe una aguja deformada de tendón y hueso, llevando consigo un aguijón que "
"ralentiza a su víctima."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "biomancer_visceral_projection"
msgid "Visceral Projection"
msgstr "Proyección Visceral"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "biomancer_visceral_projection ( Visceral Projection
#. )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Visceral Projection"
msgid ""
"Projects a spray of acrid blood and gore all around you, growing to ensnare "
"your prey in a field of twitching poisonous tendrils."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/obsoletion_and_migration/spells.json
#. ~ Name of spell "biomancer_coagulant_weave"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "bio_weave"
#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Name of spell "spell_coagulant_weave"
msgid "Coagulant Weave"
msgstr "Tejido coagulante"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "biomancer_coagulant_weave ( Coagulant Weave )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Coagulant Weave"
msgid ""
"Turns your biological mastery inwards, medically enhancing your flesh.  "
"Rather than strength of healing, it staves off blood loss and purges wounds "
"before they can turn septic, at the cost of increased hunger and thirst."
msgstr ""
"Vuelve tu dominio biológico hacia adentro, mejorando médicamente tu carne. En "
"lugar de la fuerza de curación, evita la pérdida de sangre y purga las "
"heridas antes de que se vuelvan sépticas, a costa del aumento del hambre y la "
"sed."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#. ~ Sound description of spell "corrosive_aura_spell ( Caustic Feedback )"
msgid "acidic sizzle!"
msgstr "¡chispas acidas!"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "biomancer_caustic_aura"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_biomancer_aura_caustic"
msgid "Caustic Aura"
msgstr "Aura Cáustica"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "biomancer_caustic_aura ( Caustic Aura )"
msgid ""
"This spell suspends acid in a layer around you, corroding melee attackers "
"when struck and enhancing your melee damage."
msgstr ""
"Este hechizo suspende el ácido en una capa a tu alrededor, corroyendo a los "
"atacantes c. a c. cuando te golpean y aumentando tu daño c. a c."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "biomancer_caustic_aura_plus"
msgid "Improved Caustic Aura"
msgstr "Aura Cáustica Mejorada"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "biomancer_caustic_aura_plus ( Improved Caustic Aura
#. )"
msgid ""
"This spell suspends acid in a layer around you, corroding melee attackers "
"when struck and enhancing your melee damage.  Now you know this spell like "
"the back of your hand, and have started to design your own version."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "biomancer_swim_frog"
msgid "Limbs of the Frog"
msgstr "Miembros de Rana"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "biomancer_swim_frog ( Limbs of the Frog )"
msgid "Grow webbing on your hands and feet, making quick swimming a breeze."
msgstr ""
"Crecen membranas en tus manos y pies, haciendo que nadar rápido sea pan "
"comido."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "biomancer_giant_growth"
msgid "Giant Growth"
msgstr "Crecimiento Gigante"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "biomancer_giant_growth ( Giant Growth )"
msgid "Grow to enormous size.  Your clothing and equipment will not grow with you."
msgstr "Creces hasta un tamaño enorme. Tu ropa y equipo no crecerán contigo."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Blood_Mage.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_GIANT_GROWTH_MUTATION"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_DEMON_POSSESSION"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_GOBLIN_FRUIT_GIANT_GROWTH"
msgid "Your body swells and warps as your size increases!"
msgstr "¡Tu cuerpo se hincha y se deforma a medida que aumenta tu tamaño!"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_GIANT_GROWTH_MUTATION"
msgid "You are already enormous--the spell cannot make you any larger!"
msgstr "¡Ya eres enorme, el hechizo no puede hacerte más grande!"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Blood_Mage.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/goblin_fruits.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_GIANT_GROWTH_MUTATION_REMOVE"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_DEMON_POSSESSION_REMOVE"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_GOBLIN_FRUIT_GIANT_GROWTH_REMOVE"
msgid "Your body shrinks and warps as your size decreases!"
msgstr "¡Tu cuerpo se encoge y se deforma a medida que disminuye tu tamaño!"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "biomancer_remove_instability"
msgid "Preserve Genetic Stability"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "biomancer_remove_instability ( Preserve Genetic
#. Stability )"
msgid ""
"The scroll said that this spell is for \"Reducing negative consequences from "
"XE037 exposure\", whatever that means.  According the scroll, the spell "
"should be allowed to run its course before reapplication."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "biomancer_carrion_feast"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_biomancer_carrion_feast"
msgid "Carrion Feast"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "biomancer_carrion_feast ( Carrion Feast )"
msgid ""
"Alter your digestive system to consume rotten food with no ill effects.  This "
"is either a truly ancient spell or otherwise must have been the product of "
"some university thaumaturgical research department."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/spell_invoked_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "biomancer_lashing_tentacles"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_biomancer_lashing_tentacles"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Lashing Tentacles"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "biomancer_lashing_tentacles ( Lashing Tentacles )"
msgid ""
"Grow a pair of lashing tentacles from your shoulders.  While not as long as "
"the Vicious Tentacle, they will strike anyone in melee with you.  You cannot "
"wear rigid armor that covers the shoulders with them."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "biomancer_cure_disease_minor"
msgid "Purgation of Maladies"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "biomancer_cure_disease_minor ( Purgation of
#. Maladies )"
msgid ""
"Vomit up any minor illnesses you might be suffering from, such as colds or "
"the flu.  This is one of the few biomantic cure spells that is castable on "
"other people."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "biomancer_hyper_regeneration"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_biomancer_hyper_regeneration"
msgid "Corporeal Reconstitution"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "biomancer_hyper_regeneration ( Corporeal
#. Reconstitution )"
msgid ""
"Possibly the most powerful of the biomantic healing spells, this causes your "
"flesh to literally knit itself together before your eyes."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "biomancer_slow_bleeding"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_biomancer_slow_bleeding_01"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_biomancer_slow_bleeding_02"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_biomancer_slow_bleeding_03"
msgid "Halt Bleeding"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "biomancer_slow_bleeding ( Halt Bleeding )"
msgid "As you can control your body, you can control your blood."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "biomancer_scalpel_fingers"
msgid "Flensing Fingers"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "biomancer_scalpel_fingers ( Flensing Fingers )"
msgid ""
"Change each of your fingers into a myriad of tiny bone knives, allowing you "
"to cut with surgical precision… or slice your enemies to ribbons."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "biomancer_caustic_blood"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_biomancer_caustic_blood"
msgid "Caustic Blood"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "biomancer_caustic_blood ( Caustic Blood )"
msgid ""
"Transmute your blood to magically-enhanced acid, making you immune to acid "
"and also splashing anyone who spills your blood."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "biomancer_eat_tons_of_food"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_biomancer_eat_tons_of_food"
msgid "Gluttonous Consumption"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "biomancer_eat_tons_of_food ( Gluttonous Consumption
#. )"
msgid ""
"Magically expand your stomach size, allowing it to consume more food without "
"taking up any more room in your body.  Once a rarely-learned spell, it's much "
"more useful now that you're not always sure where your next meal is coming "
"from."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "biomancer_get_more_blood"
msgid "Carmine Infusion"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "biomancer_get_more_blood ( Carmine Infusion )"
msgid ""
"Using water as a catalyst, restore some of your lost blood.  This spell has "
"no effect if you're healthy and uninjured."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "biomancer_control_mutations"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_biomancer_control_mutations"
msgid "Morphogenic Mastery"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "biomancer_control_mutations ( Morphogenic Mastery
#. )"
msgid ""
"The scroll said that this spell is for \"Exerting deliberate control over "
"morphogenic alterations\", which sounds ominous."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/bionic_spells.json
#. ~ Message of spell "bio_ley_energy_blaster_spell ( Levinbolt Projector
#. Targeting )"
msgid "You unleash a levinbolt."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Name of spell "acid_claw"
msgid "Acid Claw"
msgstr "Garra Ácida"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Description of spell "acid_claw ( Acid Claw )"
msgid ""
"Your claws glow with yellow acid energy, and as you swipe your claw a wave of "
"acid sweeps forth from it."
msgstr ""
"Tus garras brillan con energía ácida amarilla, y al deslizar tu garra una ola "
"de ácido sale de ella."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Name of spell "acid_bite"
msgid "Acid Bite"
msgstr "Mordisco Ácido"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Description of spell "acid_bite ( Acid Bite )"
msgid "Your maw drips with acid as you make a bite attack."
msgstr "Tus fauces gotean ácido mientras haces un ataque de mordisco."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Name of spell "dragon_bite"
msgid "Dragon's Bite"
msgstr "Mordisco de Dragón"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Description of spell "dragon_bite ( Dragon's Bite )"
msgid "The bite damage in Acid Bite."
msgstr "El daño por mordedura de Mordisco Ácida."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/black_dragon.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/ethereal_items.json
#. ~ Name of spell "dragon_shell_black"
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Black Dragon Shell"
msgid_plural "Black Dragon Shells"
msgstr[0] "Caparazón de Dragón Negro"
msgstr[1] "Caparazones de Dragón Negro"
msgstr[2] "Caparazones de Dragón Negro"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Description of spell "dragon_shell_black ( Black Dragon Shell )"
msgid ""
"You channel your inner draconic magic to protect yourself from damage and "
"reflect some back as acid damage."
msgstr ""
"Canalizas tu magia dracónica interior para protegerte del daño y reflejar una "
"parte como daño de ácido."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/black_dragon.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/mutation_effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "dragon_terror"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "dragon_terror_debuff"
msgid "Dragon Terror"
msgstr "Terror de Dragón"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Description of spell "dragon_terror ( Dragon Terror )"
msgid ""
"With an ear piercing roar, you channel the inner power of dragons and strike "
"fear into those who stand before you, slowing their escape from your terror."
msgstr ""
"Con un rugido desgarrador, canalizas el poder interior de los dragones e "
"infundes miedo a los que se encuentran ante ti, frenando su huida de tu "
"terror."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/black_dragon.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/mutation_effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "dragon_boost"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "dragon_boost"
msgid "Dragon Boost"
msgstr "Impulso de Dragón"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Description of spell "dragon_boost ( Dragon Boost )"
msgid "You let out a mighty roar as you infuse yourself with the power of Dragons."
msgstr ""
"Dejas escapar un poderoso rugido mientras te infundes con el poder de los "
"Dragones."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Name of spell "dragon_spit_acid"
msgid "Dragon Acid Spit"
msgstr "Saliva Ácida de Dragón"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Description of spell "dragon_spit_acid ( Dragon Acid Spit )"
msgid ""
"You conjure up acidic spittle that you can shoot long distances as you close "
"in on your terrified prey."
msgstr ""
"Conjuras saliva ácida que puedes disparar a larga distancia mientras te "
"acercas a tu aterrorizada presa."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/black_dragon.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Name of spell "dragon_breath_acid"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Black Dragon Breath"
msgstr "Aliento de Dragón Negro"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/black_dragon.json
#. ~ Description of spell "dragon_breath_acid ( Black Dragon Breath )"
msgid "Spews a line of acid from your mouth."
msgstr "Echa una línea de ácido por la boca."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/manatouched.json
#. ~ Name of spell "crystallize_mana"
#. ~ Name of spell "manatouched_crystal"
msgid "Crystallize Mana"
msgstr "Cristalizar Maná"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#. ~ Description of spell "crystallize_mana ( Crystallize Mana )"
msgid "Crystallizes mana into solid form."
msgstr "Cristaliza maná en forma sólida."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "dark_sight"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "dark_sight"
msgid "Dark Sight"
msgstr "Visión Oscura"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/obsoletion_and_migration/spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/classless_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "dark_sight ( Dark Sight )"
#. ~ Description of spell "spell_eyegleam ( Eye gleam )"
#. ~ Description of spell "night_sight ( Night Sight )"
msgid "Gives you the power to see in the dark."
msgstr "Te da el poder de ver en la oscuridad."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#. ~ Message of spell "dark_sight ( Dark Sight )"
msgid ""
"Your eyes glow green for a moment.  Now your sight can pierce the darkest "
"shadows."
msgstr ""
"Tus ojos brillan en verde por un momento. Ahora tu vista puede atravesar las "
"sombras más oscuras."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#. ~ Name of spell "megablast"
msgid "Megablast"
msgstr "MegaImpacto"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "megablast ( Megablast )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Megablast"
msgid ""
"You always wanted to fire energy beams like in the animes you watched as a "
"kid.  Now you can!"
msgstr ""
"Siempre quisiste disparar rayos de energía como en los animes que veías de "
"niño. ¡Ahora puedes!"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#. ~ Name of spell "create_atomic_light"
msgid "Magical Light"
msgstr "Luz Mágica"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Description of spell "create_atomic_light ( Magical Light )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Magical Light"
#. ~ Description of spell "create_light_sylph ( Light )"
#. ~ Description of spell "create_light_salamander ( Light )"
msgid "Creates a magical light."
msgstr "Crea una luz mágica."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#. ~ Name of spell "blinding_flash"
msgid "Blinding Flash"
msgstr "Flash Cegador"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "blinding_flash ( Blinding Flash )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Blinding Flash"
msgid ""
"Blind enemies for a short time with a sudden, dazzling light.  Higher levels "
"deal slightly higher damage."
msgstr ""
"Ciega a los enemigos por un corto tiempo con una repentina y deslumbrante "
"luz. Los niveles más altos causan un daño ligeramente mayor."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#. ~ Name of spell "ethereal_grasp"
msgid "Ethereal Grasp"
msgstr "Agarre Etéreo"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#. ~ Description of spell "ethereal_grasp ( Ethereal Grasp )"
msgid ""
"A mass of spectral hands emerge from the ground, grabbing and slowing "
"everything in range.  Higher levels allow a bigger AoE, and longer effect\n"
"\n"
"Larger targets will be <color_yellow>less affected</color> by the spell."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#. ~ Name of spell "obfuscated_body"
msgid "Obfuscated Body"
msgstr "Cuerpo Ofuscado"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#. ~ Description of spell "obfuscated_body ( Obfuscated Body )"
#. ~ Description of spell "obfuscated_body_plus ( Improved Obfuscated Body )"
msgid ""
"A magical aura distorts light around your body, increasing the amount of "
"attacks you might dodge in a given turn."
msgstr ""
"Un aura mágica distorsiona la luz alrededor de tu cuerpo, aumentando la "
"cantidad de ataques que puedes esquivar en un turno determinado."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#. ~ Name of spell "obfuscated_body_plus"
msgid "Improved Obfuscated Body"
msgstr "Cuerpo Confundido Mejorado"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#. ~ Name of spell "protection_aura"
msgid "Aura of Protection"
msgstr "Aura de Protección"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "protection_aura ( Aura of Protection )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Aura of Protection"
msgid ""
"Encases your whole body in a magical aura that protects you from the "
"environment."
msgstr "Envuelve todo tu cuerpo en un aura mágica que te protege del entorno."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#. ~ Name of spell "protection_aura_plus"
msgid "Improved Aura of Protection"
msgstr "Aura de Protección Mejorada"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#. ~ Description of spell "protection_aura_plus ( Improved Aura of Protection
#. )"
msgid ""
"Encases your whole body in a magical aura that protects you from the "
"environment.  Now you know this spell like the back of your hand, and have "
"started to design your own version."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#. ~ Name of spell "translocate_self"
msgid "Translocate Self"
msgstr "Teletransportarse"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#. ~ Description of spell "translocate_self ( Translocate Self )"
msgid "Translocates the user to an attuned gate."
msgstr "Traslada al usuario a una puerta sintonizada."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#. ~ Name of spell "acid_resistance"
msgid "Acid Resistance"
msgstr "Resistencia al Ácido"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#. ~ Description of spell "acid_resistance ( Acid Resistance )"
msgid "Protects the user from acid."
msgstr "Protege al usuario del ácido."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#. ~ Name of spell "acid_resistance_greater"
msgid "Greater Acid Resistance"
msgstr "Resistencia al Ácido Mayor"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#. ~ Description of spell "acid_resistance_greater ( Greater Acid Resistance
#. )"
msgid ""
"Protects the user from acid.  Now you know this spell like the back of your "
"hand, and start to design your own version, no longer requiring you to hold "
"concentration."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#. ~ Name of spell "thought_shield"
msgid "Thought Shield"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#. ~ Description of spell "thought_shield ( Thought Shield )"
msgid ""
"Two small shimmering spots appear on your temples, protecting your mind from "
"outside influences."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#. ~ Name of spell "thought_shield_plus"
msgid "Thought Suit"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#. ~ Description of spell "thought_shield_plus ( Thought Suit )"
msgid ""
"Why protect just your mind from outside influences?  More shields all over "
"your body should also prevent you from being teleported forcefully"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#. ~ Name of spell "sound_bomb"
msgid "Sound Bomb"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "sound_bomb ( Sound Bomb )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Sound Bomb"
msgid ""
"Behind the cool name hides a common joke spell to spook your friends and "
"restrain dogs.  It can be useful in some special cases."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#. ~ Sound description of spell "sound_bomb ( Sound Bomb )"
msgid "a loud, high pitched sound"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#. ~ Name of spell "classless_watch_spell"
msgid "Knowing the Day and the Hour"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#. ~ Description of spell "classless_watch_spell ( Knowing the Day and the
#. Hour )"
msgid ""
"Probably the single greatest example of technology rendering magic obsolete, "
"this spell allows you know exactly what time it is."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#. ~ Name of spell "classless_clean_clothing_and_self"
msgid "Freshen Up"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#. ~ Description of spell "classless_clean_clothing_and_self ( Freshen Up )"
msgid ""
"Undoubtedly the single most common spell in the world before the Cataclysm, "
"Freshen Up cleans your teeth, sweetens your breath, removes stains and sweat "
"from your clothes, exfoliates you, and gives volume back to your hair."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "classless_easy_sleep_spell"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_classless_easy_sleep"
msgid "Peaceful Rest"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#. ~ Description of spell "classless_easy_sleep_spell ( Peaceful Rest )"
msgid ""
"A favorite of overworked mages and dilettantes who, this spell makes it much "
"easier to fall asleep regardless of how tired you are."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "classless_dispel_magic"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_dispel_magic"
msgid "Dispel Magic"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#. ~ Description of spell "classless_dispel_magic ( Dispel Magic )"
msgid ""
"Remove magical effects from your target.  It fails when faced with powerful "
"enchantments or the unique bonuses provided by attunements."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "classless_disjunction"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_disjunction"
msgid "Disjunction"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#. ~ Description of spell "classless_disjunction ( Disjunction )"
msgid ""
"The ultimate anti-magic spell, Disjunction will strip even attunement-related "
"or powerful enchantments from the target."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#. ~ Name of spell "classless_restore_crystal_mana"
msgid "Mana Extraction"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#. ~ Description of spell "classless_restore_crystal_mana ( Mana Extraction )"
msgid ""
"Return crystallized mana into raw mana and absorb it, restoring some of your "
"mana.  The process is slow and not very efficient, but it's easier to "
"transport than mana potions."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#. ~ Message of spell "classless_restore_crystal_mana ( Mana Extraction )"
msgid ""
"You slowly crush the crystallized mana and as it flares into a burst of "
"light, absorb the now-free mana."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/consumables.json
#. ~ Message of spell "flower_fern_spell ( Flower fern effect )"
msgid "You feel better!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/consumables.json
#. ~ Message of spell "glowing_mushroom_spell ( Glowing mushroom effect )"
msgid "You feel lighter!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/consumables.json
#. ~ Message of spell "whiskflower_spell ( Whiskflower effect )"
msgid "You wobble as you feel inebriated"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/consumables.json
#. ~ Message of spell "sojourners_palm_spell ( Sojourners palm effect )"
msgid "Your vision shifts in a flash of colors and you reappear elsewhere."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/consumables.json
#. ~ Message of spell "funnelcap_spell ( Funnelcap effect )"
msgid "You recover mana!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "druid_veggrasp"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "entangled"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "entangled_monster"
msgid "Vegetative Grasp"
msgstr "Agarre Vegetal"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Description of spell "druid_veggrasp ( Vegetative Grasp )"
msgid ""
"This spell causes roots and vines to burst forth from the ground and grab "
"your foes, slowing them and doing a small amount of damage as they dig in.\n"
"\n"
"Larger targets will be <color_yellow>less affected</color> by the spell, and "
"it has <color_red>no effect</color> on targets not on natural ground."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Name of spell "druid_rootstrike"
msgid "Root Strike"
msgstr "Golpe de raíz"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Description of spell "druid_rootstrike ( Root Strike )"
msgid ""
"This spell causes roots to spear out of the ground in a cone and stab into "
"your foes, impaling them."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Name of spell "druid_woodshaft"
msgid "Wooden Shaft"
msgstr "Asta de Madera"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "druid_woodshaft ( Wooden Shaft )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Wooden Shaft"
msgid ""
"This spell creates a projectile of hardwood that shoots forth from the "
"caster's hand at high speed to stab into an enemy."
msgstr ""
"Este hechizo crea un proyectil de madera dura que sale disparado de la mano "
"del lanzador a gran velocidad para apuñalar a un enemigo."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Name of spell "druid_naturebow1"
msgid "Nature's Bow"
msgstr "Arco de la Naturaleza"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Description of spell "druid_naturebow1 ( Nature's Bow )"
msgid ""
"This spell conjures a magical wooden recurve bow, as well as a quiver and a "
"set of arrows to go with it."
msgstr ""
"Este hechizo conjura un arco curvo mágico de madera, así como un carcaj y un "
"juego de flechas para acompañarlo."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Name of spell "druid_naturebow1_plus"
msgid "Improved Nature's Bow"
msgstr "Arco Natural Mejorado"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Description of spell "druid_naturebow1_plus ( Improved Nature's Bow )"
msgid ""
"This spell conjures a magical wooden recurve bow, as well as a quiver and a "
"set of arrows to go with it.  Now you know this spell like the back of your "
"hand, and have started to design your own version."
msgstr ""
"Este hechizo conjura un arco curvo mágico de madera, así como un carcaj y un "
"juego de flechas para acompañarlo. Ya conoces este hechizo como la palma de "
"tu mano y has empezado a diseñar tu propia versión."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Name of spell "recover_sleepiness"
msgid "Nature's Trance"
msgstr "Trance de la Naturaleza"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "recover_sleepiness ( Nature's Trance )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Nature's Trance"
msgid ""
"Your connection to living things allows you to go into a magical trance.  "
"This allows you to recover from fatigue quickly in exchange for mana."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Name of spell "summon_cats"
msgid "Bag of Cats"
msgstr "Bolsa de Gatos"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "summon_cats ( Bag of Cats )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Bag of Cats"
msgid "Are you the crazy cat lady?"
msgstr "¿Eres la señora loca de los gatos?"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Name of spell "summon_bear"
msgid "Cause Bear"
msgstr "Causa Perror"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Description of spell "summon_bear ( Cause Bear )"
msgid ""
"This spell appears to be very smudged.  You're fairly sure the name should be "
"Cause Fear, but you're also fairly sure it won't have the desired effect "
"because the instructions are hardly legible.  No time like the Cataclysm to "
"find out, though!"
msgstr ""
"Este hechizo parece estar muy manchado. Estás bastante seguro de que el "
"nombre debería ser Causa Terror, pero también estás bastante seguro de que no "
"tendrá el efecto deseado porque las instrucciones son apenas legibles. Sin "
"embargo, no hay mejor momento que el Cataclismo para averiguarlo."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Name of spell "fungicide"
msgid "Kill Fungus"
msgstr "Matar Hongos"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Description of spell "fungicide ( Kill Fungus )"
msgid "Kills fungus affected areas."
msgstr "Mata las áreas afectadas por hongos."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Name of spell "create_rune_druid"
msgid "Druid Rune"
msgstr "Runa Druida"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Description of spell "create_rune_druid ( Druid Rune )"
msgid ""
"A ritual in which you conjure forth roots and vines in order to make a "
"druidic rune.  You can use the rune as a catalyst for recipes."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Name of spell "purify_seed"
msgid "Purification Seed"
msgstr "Semillas de Potabilización"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Description of spell "purify_seed ( Purification Seed )"
msgid ""
"You summon a gift of the earth which will purify water.  Rapidly degrades if "
"not utilized."
msgstr ""
"Invoca un regalo de la tierra que potabilizará el agua. Se degrada "
"rápidamente si no se utiliza."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Name of spell "druidic_regrowth"
msgid "Sacrificial Regrowth"
msgstr "Crecimiento Sacrificado"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "druidic_regrowth ( Sacrificial Regrowth )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Sacrificial Regrowth"
msgid ""
"Through giving of one's own life force, you restore withered and barren plant "
"life nearby.  What remains will need time to regrow its full strength."
msgstr ""
"A través de la entrega de la propia fuerza de vida, se restaura la vida "
"vegetal seca y estéril cercana. Lo que queda necesitará tiempo para recuperar "
"toda su fuerza."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Name of spell "druidic_healing"
msgid "Sacrificial Healing"
msgstr "Curación por Sacrificio"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "druidic_healing ( Sacrificial Healing )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Sacrificial Healing"
msgid ""
"Channels some of the user's own life force into healing energy, for the sake "
"of one's allies."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Name of spell "druid_tornskin"
msgid "Tornskin"
msgstr "Piel de Espino"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Description of spell "druid_tornskin ( Tornskin )"
msgid ""
"This spell, which resembles Thornskin through the sap & needles covering the "
"page, seemed to involve thorns and bleeding wounds.  The marred words may "
"have altered the function."
msgstr ""
"Este hechizo, que se parece a Piel de Espino por la savia y las agujas que "
"cubren la hoja, parecía implicar espinas y heridas sangrantes. Las palabras "
"estropeadas pueden haber alterado la función."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Name of spell "druid_feralform"
msgid "Feral Form"
msgstr "Forma Salvaje"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Description of spell "druid_feralform ( Feral Form )"
msgid ""
"This spell unleashes your inner beast, growing claws & fangs to rend your "
"foes limb from limb."
msgstr ""
"Este hechizo desata tu bestia interna, creciéndote garras y colmillos para "
"desgarrar a tus enemigos miembro a miembro."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Name of spell "druid_feralform_plus"
msgid "Enhanced Feral Form"
msgstr "Formal Salvaje Mejorada"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Description of spell "druid_feralform_plus ( Enhanced Feral Form )"
msgid ""
"This spell unleashes your inner beast, growing claws & fangs to rend your "
"foes limb from limb.  Now you know this spell like the back of your hand, and "
"start to design your own version."
msgstr ""
"Este hechizo desata a la bestia que llevas dentro, desarrollando garras y "
"colmillos para desgarrar a tus enemigos miembro a miembro. Ahora que conoces "
"este hechizo como la palma de tu mano, puedes empezar a diseñar tu propia "
"versión."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Name of spell "summon_wolf_druid"
msgid "Summon Wolf"
msgstr "Invocar Lobo"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Description of spell "summon_wolf_druid ( Summon Wolf )"
msgid "Call to the wilds for aid from some wolves."
msgstr "Llama a los salvajes para pedir ayuda a algunos lobos."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Name of spell "druid_natures_commune"
msgid "Communion with Nature"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Description of spell "druid_natures_commune ( Communion with Nature )"
msgid ""
"You focus on the bounty of nature around you and commune with it, improving "
"your health and mood and calming nearby wildlife.  This spell may only be "
"cast outdoors away from civilization."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_NATURE_COMMUNE"
msgid "You must be surrounded by nature to commune with nature"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Name of spell "druid_growth"
msgid "Seed of Growth"
msgstr "Semilla de Crecimiento"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "druid_growth ( Seed of Growth )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Seed of Growth"
msgid "Offer some of your life in a ritual to get tokens of growth in return."
msgstr ""
"Ofreces parte de tu vida en un ritual para obtener a cambio símbolos de "
"crecimiento."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Name of spell "cause_rot"
msgid "Cause Rot"
msgstr "Causar Putrefacción"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Description of spell "cause_rot ( Cause Rot )"
msgid ""
"A spell from a darker sect of druidry, created to forcibly begin the circle "
"of life anew.  For without rot, you cannot have growth.  Affects a huge area, "
"but is indiscriminate; even rusting machines into nothing but dust and slow "
"both in casting and effect.  Once lost entirely to the passage of time, this "
"spell was thought to be no more than a myth, the stuff of fairy tales, albeit "
"grim ones."
msgstr ""
"Un hechizo de una secta más oscura de druidas, creada para iniciar por la "
"fuerza el círculo de la vida de nuevo. Porque sin putrefacción, no puede "
"haber crecimiento. Afecta a un área enorme y es indiscriminado; incluso oxida "
"las máquinas hasta convertirlas en polvo y es lento tanto su lanzamiento como "
"su efecto. Una vez perdido por completo por el paso del tiempo, se pensaba "
"que este hechizo no era más que un mito, material de cuentos de hadas, aunque "
"sombríos."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Name of spell "druid_healing"
msgid "Restoration"
msgstr "Restauración"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Description of spell "druid_healing ( Restoration )"
msgid ""
"Slowly heal your wounds by drawing on the power of nature.\n"
"\n"
"You must be <color_yellow>outdoors and in a natural area</color> away from "
"civilization to cast Restoration."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_DRUID_RESTORATION"
msgid "You must be surrounded by nature to use its power to heal."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Name of spell "druid_healing_herb"
msgid "Floral Healing"
msgstr "Curación Floral"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Description of spell "druid_healing_herb ( Floral Healing )"
msgid "Use some magic herbs to heal yourself."
msgstr "Usa hierbas mágicas para curarte."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/ethereal_items.json
#. ~ Name of spell "druid_bandage_heal"
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Vegetative Poultice"
msgid_plural "Vegetative Poultices"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Description of spell "druid_bandage_heal ( Vegetative Poultice )"
msgid ""
"This spell turns a mixture of bark and leaves into a powerful salve capable "
"of stopping even grievous wounds from bleeding."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Name of spell "druid_whisper_leaves"
msgid "Whisper of the Leaves"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Description of spell "druid_whisper_leaves ( Whisper of the Leaves )"
msgid ""
"This spell allows you to hear the trees' wisdom in the rustle of the leaves "
"and the creaking of their roots, discerning the layout of the forest."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/obsoletion_and_migration/spells.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_GAIN_WHISPER_LEAVES"
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_GAIN_COMMUNE_OAKS"
msgid ""
"You are already in tune with the rhythms of the forest.  Further magic cannot "
"deepen your bond."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Name of spell "druid_harvest_hunter"
msgid "Harvest of the Hunter"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Description of spell "druid_harvest_hunter ( Harvest of the Hunter )"
msgid ""
"This spell creates a grouping of odd-looking but functional arrows out of "
"forest detritus."
msgstr ""
"Este hechizo crea una agrupación de flechas de aspecto extraño pero "
"funcionales a partir de detritos del bosque."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Name of spell "druid_summon_tanglevine"
msgid "Summon Tanglevine"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Description of spell "druid_summon_tanglevine ( Summon Tanglevine )"
msgid ""
"This spell causes an animated vine to burst from the ground and attempt to "
"seize a nearby target and hold it fast."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Name of spell "druid_beguile_savage_beast"
msgid "Beguiling the Savage Beast"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Description of spell "druid_beguile_savage_beast ( Beguiling the Savage
#. Beast )"
msgid ""
"Using your connection to nature, you can sway an animal to your service.  "
"This spell even works on mutated animals."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Name of spell "druid_bramble_spear"
msgid "Spear of Brambles"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Description of spell "druid_bramble_spear ( Spear of Brambles )"
msgid "This spell turns a stick into a vicious spear that drips with sticky sap."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Name of spell "druid_bramble_spear_enhanced"
msgid "Enhanced Spear of Brambles"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Description of spell "druid_bramble_spear_enhanced ( Enhanced Spear of
#. Brambles )"
msgid ""
"This spell turns a bit of bark or a twig into a vicious spear that drips with "
"sticky sap.  You now know this spell like the back of your hand, and no "
"longer need such massive spell components as you did previously."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Name of spell "druid_summon_brambles"
msgid "Stranglethorns"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Description of spell "druid_summon_brambles ( Stranglethorns )"
#. ~ Description of spell "druid_summon_brambles_arc ( Summon Brambles Arc )"
#. ~ Description of spell "druid_summon_brambles_line ( Summon Brambles Line
#. )"
msgid ""
"Call up thick, swiftly growing brambles, either in a line to form a wall or "
"an arc to trap an enemy."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_eocs.json
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_DRUID_BRAMBLES_SELECTOR"
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_ARVORE_BRIARS_SELECTOR"
msgid "Thorny Arc"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_eocs.json
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_DRUID_BRAMBLES_SELECTOR"
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_ARVORE_BRIARS_SELECTOR"
msgid "Wall of Brambles"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_eocs.json
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_DRUID_BRAMBLES_SELECTOR"
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_ARVORE_BRIARS_SELECTOR"
msgid "Summon a spray of brambles to entrap an enemy."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_eocs.json
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_DRUID_BRAMBLES_SELECTOR"
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_ARVORE_BRIARS_SELECTOR"
msgid "Summon a wall of thorns to fortify a location."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Name of spell "druid_summon_brambles_arc"
msgid "Summon Brambles Arc"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Name of spell "druid_summon_brambles_line"
msgid "Summon Brambles Line"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/ethereal_items.json
#. ~ Name of spell "druid_thorn_skin"
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Thornskin"
msgid_plural "Thornskins"
msgstr[0] "Piel Espinosa"
msgstr[1] "Pieles Espinosas"
msgstr[2] "Pieles Espinosas"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Description of spell "druid_thorn_skin ( Thornskin )"
msgid ""
"This spell transforms the druid's skin into a bark-like material covered in "
"large thorns.  It provides excellent protection but slightly slows you and "
"makes you vulnerable to fire."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Name of spell "druid_renew_forest_spell"
msgid "Renewing the Forest"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Description of spell "druid_renew_forest_spell ( Renewing the Forest )"
msgid ""
"While outdoors and not underground, the druid can create a profusion of life "
"around themselves, causing grass to grow through pavement, bushes and flowers "
"to sprout, and trees to grow to full height in moments.\n"
"\n"
"In <color_yellow>addition to</color> mana, this spell also requires "
"<color_red>hit points</color> to cast and <color_yellow>will fail</color> if "
"you are too injured."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in else statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_DRUID_RENEW_FOREST_SPELL_2" in nested EOCs in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_DRUID_RENEW_FOREST_SPELL"
msgid "You do not have enough life force to donate it to renew the forest!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_DRUID_RENEW_FOREST_SPELL_2" in
#. nested EOCs in effect in EoC "EOC_DRUID_RENEW_FOREST_SPELL"
msgid ""
"You must be on the surface and not on a building's upper stories to cast "
"Renewing the Forest!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_DRUID_RENEW_FOREST_SPELL"
msgid "You must be outside to cast Renewing the Forest!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Name of spell "druid_wood_living_tree_spell"
msgid "Shape Wood"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Description of spell "druid_wood_living_tree_spell ( Shape Wood )"
msgid ""
"Using druidic magic, shape living wood into a log that you can use for other "
"projects without harming the tree.  You must cast this spell on a living tree."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_eocs.json
#. ~ Message in effect in EoC "EOC_EOC_DRUID_SHAPE_WOOD"
#. ~ Message in effect in EoC "EOC_ARVORE_TREE_SINGING"
msgid "Select nearby tree"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_EOC_DRUID_SHAPE_WOOD"
msgid ""
"The wood of the tree grows and forms as you cast the spell and when it ends, "
"there is a log lying on the ground, entirely covered in bark but otherwise "
"straight and ready to be used in other projects."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "druid_anti_heat"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_druid_anti_heat"
msgid "Water's Cooling Touch"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Description of spell "druid_anti_heat ( Water's Cooling Touch )"
msgid ""
"Draw on some of the essence of water, providing protection against the "
"summer's heat."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/ethereal_items.json
#. ~ Name of spell "druid_breathing_underwater"
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Aquatic Mantle"
msgid_plural "Aquatic Mantles"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Description of spell "druid_breathing_underwater ( Aquatic Mantle )"
msgid ""
"Cover yourself in a thin layer of magical seaweed, preventing you from "
"getting wet and allowing you to breathe underwater."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Name of spell "druid_disinfectant"
msgid "Wash the Wounds Clean"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Description of spell "druid_disinfectant ( Wash the Wounds Clean )"
msgid ""
"Transform a bit of water into a magical disinfectant as you pour it over your "
"wounds."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "druid_water_walking"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_druid_water_walking"
msgid "Water Strider's Walk"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Description of spell "druid_water_walking ( Water Strider's Walk )"
msgid ""
"Enchant yourself so that the water will buoy you up and prevent you from "
"sinking, allowing you to walk on its surface."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "druid_traverse_the_wilds"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_druid_traverse_the_wilds"
#. ~ Name of spell "arvore_traverse_the_wilds"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Traverse the Wilds"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Description of spell "druid_traverse_the_wilds ( Traverse the Wilds )"
msgid ""
"Blend in the wilds and urge them to speed your passage.  Trees bend out of "
"the way, bushes do not hinder you, and even grass subtly moves your feet "
"along.  The spell cannot be cast near civilization and similarly will fade if "
"your travels take you out of the wilds."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_DRUID_TRAVERSE_THE_WILDS"
msgid "You must be surrounded by the wilds to traverse them."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_DRUID_TRAVERSE_THE_WILDS_REMOVER"
msgid "As you approach civilization, your spell fades."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Name of spell "druid_bearmantle"
msgid "Bearmantle"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Description of spell "druid_bearmantle ( Bearmantle )"
msgid ""
"Adopt some of the aspect of the bear, protecting you from cold and preparing "
"you for winter."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Name of spell "druid_goodberry"
msgid "Goodberry"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Description of spell "druid_goodberry ( Goodberry )"
msgid ""
"Enchant a set of berries, transforming them into magical fruit that will "
"provide a hearty meal's worth of nutrition and a small amount of healing when "
"eaten.  The goodberries will rot away within 24 hours if not eaten."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Name of spell "druid_create_temporary_spring"
msgid "Fountain of the Depths"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Description of spell "druid_create_temporary_spring ( Fountain of the
#. Depths )"
msgid ""
"Call to the waters beneath the earth and bring them to the surface, creating "
"a natural spring.  The waters will subside when the spell's duration ends."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Message in effect in EoC "EOC_DRUID_TEMPORARY_SPRING"
msgid "Select natural earth"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Name of spell "druid_turn_tree_into_treant"
msgid "Awakening of the Forest Guardian"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Description of spell "druid_turn_tree_into_treant ( Awakening of the
#. Forest Guardian )"
msgid ""
"Grant a nearby tree awareness and mobility, letting it shake free from the "
"soil and rise up to crush your enemies.  It will root itself again when the "
"spell expires.\n"
"\n"
"You must be <color_yellow>standing next to a tree</color> for the spell to "
"take effect."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "stonefist"
msgid "Stonefist"
msgstr "Puño de Piedra"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "stonefist ( Stonefist )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Stonefist"
msgid ""
"Encases your arms and hands in a sheath of magical stone, you can punch and "
"defend yourself with it in melee combat."
msgstr ""
"Encierra tus brazos y manos en una cubierta de piedra mágica, puedes golpear "
"y defenderte con ella en el combate c. a c."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "stonefist_plus"
msgid "Improved Stonefist"
msgstr "Puño piedra mejorado"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Description of spell "stonefist_plus ( Improved Stonefist )"
msgid ""
"Encases your arms and hands in a sheath of magical stone, you can punch and "
"defend yourself with it in melee combat.  Now you know this spell like the "
"back of your hand, and have started to design your own version."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "seismic_stomp"
msgid "Seismic Stomp"
msgstr "Pisotón Sísmico"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "seismic_stomp ( Seismic Stomp )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Seismic Stomp"
msgid ""
"Focusing mana into your leg, you stomp your foot and send out a shockwave, "
"knocking enemies around you onto the ground."
msgstr ""
"Al concentrar el maná en tu pierna, con una pisada  envías una onda expansiva "
"que hace caer al suelo a los enemigos que te rodean."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "recover_stamina"
msgid "Stone's Endurance"
msgstr "Resistencia de Piedra"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "recover_stamina ( Stone's Endurance )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Stone's Endurance"
msgid ""
"You focus on the stones beneath you and draw from their agelessness.  Your "
"mana is converted to stamina."
msgstr ""
"Te concentras en las piedras que están debajo de ti y extraes de su "
"intemporalidad. Tu maná se convierte en vigor."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "eshaper_shardspray"
msgid "Shardspray"
msgstr "Rocio de Esquirlas"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "eshaper_shardspray ( Shardspray )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Shardspray"
msgid ""
"This spell projects a wide spray of sharp metal shards, cutting into your "
"foes and friends alike."
msgstr ""
"Este hechizo proyecta un amplio rocío de afilados fragmentos de metal, "
"cortando a tus enemigos y amigos por igual."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "eshaper_piercing_bolt"
msgid "Piercing Bolt"
msgstr "Rayo Penetrante"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "eshaper_piercing_bolt ( Piercing Bolt )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Piercing Bolt"
msgid ""
"This spell projects a piercing rod of conjured iron at those that dare oppose "
"you."
msgstr ""
"Este hechizo proyecta una varilla de hierro conjurado a aquellos que se "
"atrevan a oponerse a ti."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "eshaper_shardstorm"
msgid "Shardstorm"
msgstr "Tormenta de Esquirlas"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "eshaper_shardstorm ( Shardstorm )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Shardstorm"
msgid "Creates an omnidirectional spray of razor sharp metal shards all around you."
msgstr "Crea un rocío omnidireccional de fragmentos metálicos afilados a tu alrededor."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "eshaper_rockbolt"
msgid "Rockbolt"
msgstr "Saeta Pétrea"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "eshaper_rockbolt ( Rockbolt )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Rockbolt"
msgid "Fires a conjured stone projectile at high velocity."
msgstr "Dispara un proyectil de piedra conjurado a alta velocidad."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "move_earth"
msgid "Move Earth"
msgstr "Mover la Tierra"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Description of spell "move_earth ( Move Earth )"
msgid "Your essence flows around you, and the earth follows."
msgstr "Tu esencia fluye a tu alrededor, y la tierra te sigue."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "create_rune_earthshaper"
msgid "Earthshaper Rune"
msgstr "Runa Terraformante"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Description of spell "create_rune_earthshaper ( Earthshaper Rune )"
msgid ""
"This ritual creates a small pebble attuned to Earthshapers.  You can use the "
"rune as a catalyst for recipes."
msgstr ""
"Este ritual crea un pequeño guijarro en sintonía con los Terraformantes. "
"Puedes usar la runa como catalizador para recetas."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "clairvoyance"
msgid "Clairvoyance"
msgstr "Clarividencia"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "clairvoyance ( Clairvoyance )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Clairvoyance"
msgid "You close your eyes and the earth surrenders its secrets to you."
msgstr "Cierras los ojos y la tierra te entrega sus secretos."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "earthshaper_stoneskin"
msgid "Stoneskin"
msgstr "Piel de Piedra"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "earthshaper_stoneskin ( Stoneskin )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Stoneskin"
msgid ""
"Envelops your entire body in armor formed from living rock, encumbering yet "
"protective."
msgstr ""
"Envuelve todo el cuerpo en una armadura formada por roca viva, incómoda pero "
"protectora."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "earthshaper_stoneskin_plus"
msgid "Improved Stoneskin"
msgstr "Piel pétrea mejorada"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Description of spell "earthshaper_stoneskin_plus ( Improved Stoneskin )"
msgid ""
"Envelops your entire body in armor formed from living rock, encumbering yet "
"protective.  Now you know this spell like the back of your hand, and have "
"started to design your own version."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "earthshaper_pillar"
msgid "Pillar of Stone"
msgstr "Pilar de Piedra"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "earthshaper_pillar ( Pillar of Stone )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Pillar of Stone"
msgid ""
"Drawing upon the surrounding earth, you form a pillar of solid rock.  "
"Experience will make the task easier, and less disruptive to the surrounding "
"area."
msgstr ""
"Aprovechando la tierra que te rodea, formas un pilar de roca sólida. La "
"experiencia hará la tarea  más fácil y menos disruptiva para los el área "
"cercana."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "pertifying_touch"
msgid "Petrifying Touch"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Description of spell "pertifying_touch ( Petrifying Touch )"
msgid ""
"With a simple touch, you transform the body of your enemy into pure stone.  "
"The effect is temporary, but the target will be totally immobile while the "
"spell lasts."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "reactive_armor"
msgid "Reactive Armor"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "reactive_armor ( Reactive Armor )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Reactive Armor"
msgid "Explode your stone skin, to deal massive damage to all enemies around."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "eshaper_impalement"
msgid "Impalement"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "eshaper_impalement ( Impalement )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Impalement"
msgid ""
"Summon a stone spikes underground, that penetrate your enemies, and nail them "
"for a while."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "eshaper_spawn_tools"
msgid "Utility Molding"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "eshaper_spawn_tools ( Utility Molding )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Utility Molding"
msgid ""
"Shape the basic working tools, using your own magic abilities and earth "
"nearby.  Activate to change the shape of a tool."
msgstr ""
"Forma las herramientas básicas de trabajo, utilizando tus propias habilidades "
"mágicas y la tierra cercana. Activar para cambiar la forma de una herramienta."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_EARTHSHAPER_UTILITY_MOLDING"
msgid "Summon Hammer"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_EARTHSHAPER_UTILITY_MOLDING"
msgid "Summon Pickaxe"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_EARTHSHAPER_UTILITY_MOLDING"
msgid "Summon Axe"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_EARTHSHAPER_UTILITY_MOLDING"
msgid "Summon Knife"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_EARTHSHAPER_UTILITY_MOLDING"
msgid "Summon Shovel"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_EARTHSHAPER_UTILITY_MOLDING"
msgid "Transform the living earth into a hammer."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_EARTHSHAPER_UTILITY_MOLDING"
msgid "Transform the living earth into a pickaxe."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_EARTHSHAPER_UTILITY_MOLDING"
msgid "Transform the living earth into an axe."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_EARTHSHAPER_UTILITY_MOLDING"
msgid "Transform the living earth into a knife."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_EARTHSHAPER_UTILITY_MOLDING"
msgid "Transform the living earth into a shovel."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "eshaper_melee_damage"
msgid "Weighting"
msgstr "Contrapeso"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "eshaper_melee_damage ( Weighting )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Weighting"
msgid ""
"Fill yourself with the power of Earth, and make each your attacks as "
"devastating as an earthquake."
msgstr ""
"Llénate del poder de la Tierra y haz que cada uno de tus ataques sea tan "
"devastador como un terremoto."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "eshaper_crystal_wrap"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "eshaper_crystal_wrap"
msgid "Crystal Wrapping"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Description of spell "eshaper_crystal_wrap ( Crystal Wrapping )"
msgid ""
"You cover your body with a layer of small, razor-sharp crystals.  It makes "
"monsters that attack you take some damage in return, and gives you some "
"additional cut damage in melee."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "shape_of_dust"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_shape_of_dust"
msgid "Shape of Dust"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Description of spell "shape_of_dust ( Shape of Dust )"
msgid ""
"Hide yourself within sand-filled winds.  It's harder to hit you, and monsters "
"can't spot you.  Attacking a target will break the spell."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "summon_eshaper_golem"
msgid "Summon Earthshaper's Golem"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Description of spell "summon_eshaper_golem ( Summon Earthshaper's Golem
#. )"
msgid ""
"Shape a strong golem out of stone.  It may help for a while, but you haven't "
"enough energy to support it forever."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "earthshaper_boulder"
msgid "Summon Boulder"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Description of spell "earthshaper_boulder ( Summon Boulder )"
msgid ""
"Pull forth a table of smooth rock from the underground bedrock, using your "
"forces of earthshaping.  You can use it as a table or as a primitive anvil."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "earthshaper_reveal_world_map"
msgid "Reading the Earthbones"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Description of spell "earthshaper_reveal_world_map ( Reading the
#. Earthbones )"
msgid ""
"You extend your senses into the ground, becoming aware of every hill and "
"valley within a large area.  It will only work when in contact with the earth."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_EARTHSHAPER_MAP"
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_EARTHSHAPER_DANGERSENSE"
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_IERDE_REVEAL_MAP"
msgid "Without a direct connection to the living earth, the spell fails."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "earthshaper_danger_sense"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_tremorsense"
msgid "Tremorsense"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Description of spell "earthshaper_danger_sense ( Tremorsense )"
msgid ""
"By sensing their movements upon the earth, you can detect nearby sources of "
"danger.  You must maintain a connection to the earth for the spell to "
"function."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_EARTHSHAPER_DANGERSENSE_CHECKER"
msgid ""
"As you break your connection to the living earth, your magical senses fade "
"away."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "earthshaper_fortitude_of_stone"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "earthshaper_fortitude_of_stone"
msgid "Stones' Fortitude"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Description of spell "earthshaper_fortitude_of_stone ( Stones' Fortitude
#. )"
msgid ""
"Draw on the eternal endurance of the stones, slowing your metabolism and "
"staving off hunger and thirst.  However, while the enchantment is in effect, "
"you will not heal."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "earthshaper_turning_of_earth"
msgid "The Turning of the Earth"
msgstr "El Movimiento de la Tierra"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Description of spell "earthshaper_turning_of_earth ( The Turning of the
#. Earth )"
msgid "Ask the earth spirits to prepare the earth for growth and planting."
msgstr ""
"Pide a los espíritus de la tierra que preparen la tierra para el crecimiento "
"y la siembra."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "earthshaper_granite_aegis"
msgid "Granite Aegis"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Description of spell "earthshaper_granite_aegis ( Granite Aegis )"
msgid ""
"In an extremity of danger, summon a hollow shell of rock around yourself.  It "
"lasts only a few moments, but sometimes that's all you need.  You must be "
"standing on the living earth to invoke it."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_EARTHSHAPER_GRANITE_AEGIS"
msgid ""
"Without a connection to the living earth or a flat surface of solid rock, the "
"spell fails."
msgstr ""
"Sin una conexión con la tierra viva o una superficie plana de roca sólida, el "
"hechizo falla."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "earthshaper_harden_earth"
msgid "Harden Earth"
msgstr "Endurecer Tierra"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Description of spell "earthshaper_harden_earth ( Harden Earth )"
msgid ""
"Compress dirt together so it becomes as hard as rock.  A great way to turn "
"makeshift barricades into a fortress."
msgstr ""
"Comprime la tierra para que se vuelva dura como una roca. Una gran manera de "
"convertir barricadas improvisadas en una fortaleza."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "earthshaper_sleep_in_earth"
msgid "Stone Slumber"
msgstr "Sueño de Piedra"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Description of spell "earthshaper_sleep_in_earth ( Stone Slumber )"
msgid ""
"When standing on earth or stone, sink into the ground.  While submerged, you "
"will heal faster, sleep will be more restorative, and you will not need to "
"eat or drink.  Cast this spell again to return to the surface."
msgstr ""
"Cuando estés sobre tierra o piedra, húndete en el suelo. Mientras estés "
"hundido, te curarás más rápido, el sueño será más reparador y no necesitarás "
"comer ni beber. Lanza este hechizo de nuevo para volver a la superficie."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_EARTHSHAPER_SLEEP_IN_EARTH_2" in nested EOCs in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_EARTHSHAPER_SLEEP_IN_EARTH"
msgid ""
"As you complete the spell, the earth parts beneath you and you sink down into "
"the stone."
msgstr "Cuando completas el hechizo, la tierra se rompe y te hundes en la piedra."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in else statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_EARTHSHAPER_SLEEP_IN_EARTH_2" in nested EOCs in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_EARTHSHAPER_SLEEP_IN_EARTH"
msgid ""
"As you nearly complete the spell, you stop in your tracks.  There's something "
"odd about the ground below you, and sinking into it would be too dangerous."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/ierde_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_EARTHSHAPER_SLEEP_IN_EARTH_2"
#. in nested EOCs in effect in EoC "EOC_EARTHSHAPER_SLEEP_IN_EARTH"
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_IERDE_SLEEP_IN_EARTH_2" in
#. nested EOCs in effect in EoC "EOC_IERDE_SLEEP_IN_EARTH"
msgid "You must be standing on the living earth to sink into the stone!"
msgstr "¡Hay que estar sobre tierra viva para hundirse en la piedra!"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_EARTHSHAPER_SLEEP_IN_EARTH"
msgid ""
"As you recite the words of release, you feel yourself rising until you stand "
"in the clear air once again."
msgstr ""
"Mientras recitas las palabras de liberación, sientes que te elevas hasta que "
"vuelves a estar de pie en el aire puro."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "earthshaper_repair_metal_stone"
msgid "Fault-Mending Chant"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Description of spell "earthshaper_repair_metal_stone ( Fault-Mending
#. Chant )"
msgid ""
"While holding an item made of natural metal or stone, mold it with your "
"hands, work to repairing any flaws and restoring its condition.  Note that "
"some items may still not be repaired."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_EARTHSHAPER_REPAIR_METAL_STONE_ITEM" in nested EOCs on true condition
#. in effect in EoC "EOC_EARTHSHAPER_REPAIR_METAL_STONE"
msgid ""
"The magic simply does not take hold.  The item cannot be repaired, even with "
"sorcery."
msgstr ""
"La magia simplemente no arraiga. El objeto no puede repararse, ni siquiera "
"con hechicería."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
