#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/caster_level_boosters.json
#. ~ Description of "technomancer's clay tablet"
msgid ""
"A fire-hardened clay tablet depicting a technomancer rune.  Breaking the "
"tablet will release the stored magical energy, boosting your technomancer "
"caster level by 1 for a while."
