#. ~ Description of gun "Woodbow"
#. ~ Description of "Woodbow"
msgid ""
"A magically conjured ornate recurve bow of solid flexible wood.  A matching "
"conjured wooden arrow appears when you draw the string back for firing."
msgstr ""
"Un arco recurvo ornamentado mágicamente conjurado de madera maciza y "
"flexible. Una flecha de madera conjurada a juego aparece cuando se retira la "
"cuerda para disparar."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/ethereal_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Woodquiver"
msgid_plural "Woodquivers"
msgstr[0] "Carcajdera"
msgstr[1] "Carcajderas"
msgstr[2] "Carcajderas"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/ethereal_items.json
#. ~ Description of "Woodquiver"
msgid ""
"A magically conjured quiver, marvelously light and easy to wear despite the "
"arrows it holds."
msgstr ""
"Un carcaj mágicamente conjurado, maravillosamente ligero y fácil de llevar a "
"pesar de las flechas que contiene."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/ethereal_items.json
#. ~ Description of "Woodquiver"
msgid ""
"A magically conjured quiver, marvelously light and easy to wear despite the "
"arrows it holds.  This is an enhanced version, created by your increased "
"mastery of the spell."
msgstr ""
"Un carcaj mágicamente conjurado, maravillosamente ligero y fácil de llevar a "
"pesar de las flechas que contiene. Esta es una versión mejorada, creada por "
"tu mayor dominio del hechizo."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/ethereal_items.json
