#. ~ Description of "jar of force"
msgid ""
"A three-liter container made out of transparent force.  Can be used to store "
"liquids."
msgstr ""
"Un recipiente de tres litros hecho de fuerza transparente. Puede utilizarse "
"para almacenar líquidos."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/ethereal_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "mage blade"
msgid_plural "mage blades"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/ethereal_items.json
#. ~ Description of "mage blade"
msgid ""
"This is a summoned mana sword, between the lighter arming sword and later "
"two-handed swords in size.  It glows shiny, and its edge is sharper the more "
"spell level and intelligence you have."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una espada de maná invocada, entre la espada de armas ligeras y las "
"posteriores espadas de dos manos en tamaño. Brilla con intensidad y su filo "
"es más afilado cuanto más nivel de hechizo e inteligencia tengas."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/ethereal_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "auroral shell"
msgid_plural "auroral shell"
msgstr[0] "caparazón aurora"
msgstr[1] "caparazones aurora"
msgstr[2] "caparazones aurora"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/ethereal_items.json
