msgid_plural "Scrolls of Fire Spark"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Fire Spark"
msgid ""
"Summons a small electric spark, that do not harm anything.  You can use it to "
"ignite something flammable."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Repelling Arc"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Repelling Arc"
msgstr[0] "Pergamino de Arco Repelente"
msgstr[1] "Pergaminos de Arco Repelente"
msgstr[2] "Pergaminos de Arco Repelente"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Repelling Arc"
msgid ""
"You manifest an aura of crackling electricity around you to strike attackers "
"with baleful lightning."
msgstr ""
"Manifiestas un aura de electricidad crepitante a tu alrededor para golpear a "
"los atacantes con un relámpago maligno."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Sappy Scroll"
msgid_plural "Sappy Scrolls"
msgstr[0] "Pergamino con Savia"
msgstr[1] "Pergaminos con Savia"
msgstr[2] "Pergaminos con Savia"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Sappy Scroll"
msgid ""
"This scroll is covered in sap and rose thorns.  You can still make out some "
"of the writings, but it probably won't work the same."
msgstr ""
"Este pergamino está cubierto de savia y espinas de rosa. Todavía puedes ver "
"algunos de los escritos, pero probablemente no vaya a funcionar de igual "
"forma."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Feral Form"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Feral Form"
msgstr[0] "Pergamino de Forma Salvaje"
msgstr[1] "Pergaminos de Forma Salvaje"
msgstr[2] "Pergaminos de Forma Salvaje"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Feral Form"
msgid "Unleash your inner beast by snapping a fur-covered bone, becoming beastly."
msgstr ""
"Libera tu bestia interior al romper un hueso cubierto de piel, convirtiéndote "
"en bestia."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Flamesword"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Flamesword"
msgstr[0] "Pergamino de Espada Flamígera"
msgstr[1] "Pergaminos de Espada Flamígera"
msgstr[2] "Pergaminos de Espada Flamígera"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Flamesword"
msgid "Ignite a wooden sword to create a flaming saber."
msgstr "Enciende una espada de madera para crear un sable llameante."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Flamebreath"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Flamebreath"
msgstr[0] "Pergamino de Aliento de Llama"
msgstr[1] "Pergaminos de Aliento de Llama"
msgstr[2] "Pergaminos de Aliento de Llama"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Flamebreath"
msgid ""
"A pocketful of combustible powder is ignited, creating a cone of flame with "
"ashes that stick to those in its path."
msgstr ""
"Un paquete lleno de polvo combustible se enciende, creando un cono de fuego "
"con cenizas que se pegan a lo que se encuentra a su paso."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Caustic Aura"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Caustic Aura"
msgstr[0] "Pergamino de Aura Cáustica"
msgstr[1] "Pergaminos de Aura Cáustica"
msgstr[2] "Pergaminos de Aura Cáustica"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Caustic Aura"
msgid ""
"Animate a layer of acid around you, burning attackers and increasing your "
"melee damage."
msgstr ""
"Anima una capa de ácido a tu alrededor, quemando a los atacantes e "
"incrementando tu daño en el combate c. a c."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Decaying Boneclub"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Decaying Boneclub"
msgstr[0] "Pergamino de Garrote de Hueso Pútrido"
msgstr[1] "Pergaminos de Garrote de Hueso Pútrido"
msgstr[2] "Pergaminos de Garrote de Hueso Pútrido"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Decaying Boneclub"
msgid ""
"Link your live blood to dead blood and bones, creating a club eager to "
"harvest the living."
msgstr ""
"Vincula tu sangre viva con la sangre y los huesos muertos, creando un garrote "
"ansioso por cosechar a los vivos."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Disruption Bolt"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Disruption Bolt"
msgstr[0] "Pergamino de Rayo Disruptivo"
msgstr[1] "Pergaminos de Rayo Disruptivo"
msgstr[2] "Pergaminos de Rayo Disruptivo"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Disruption Bolt"
msgid ""
"Release a resonant bolt of spiritual energy at a nearby target.  It will "
"disrupt the natural link between matter and animus, causing heavy but never "
"lethal damage."
msgstr ""
"Libera un resonante rayo de energía espiritual hacia un objetivo cercano. "
"Interrumpirá el enlace natural entre la materia y el alma, causando gran daño "
"pero nunca letal."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Impact Sling"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Impact Sling"
msgstr[0] "Pergamino de Honda de Impacto"
msgstr[1] "Pergaminos de Honda de Impacto"
msgstr[2] "Pergaminos de Honda de Impacto"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Impact Sling"
msgid ""
"Infuse a sling with excess energy, delivering devastating throws before it "
"tears itself apart."
msgstr ""
"Infunde una honda con un exceso de energía, entregando lanzamientos "
"devastadores antes de romperse en partes."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Knifeshot"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Knifeshot"
msgstr[0] "Pergamino de Tiro Cuchillo"
msgstr[1] "Pergaminos de Tiro Cuchillo"
msgstr[2] "Pergaminos de Tiro Cuchillo"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Knifeshot"
msgid "Emulate a railgun, launching a knife at high speed."
msgstr "Emula una cañón de riel, lanzando un cuchillo a alta velocidad."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "MICE(R) blueprint"
msgid_plural "MICE(R) blueprints"
msgstr[0] "esquema MICE(R)"
msgstr[1] "esquemas MICE(R)"
msgstr[2] "esquemas MICE(R)"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "MICE(R) blueprint"
msgid ""
"Manafied Infernal Combustion Engine (Rideable)\n"
"Detailed schematics for a motorcycle, that are somehow simultaneously "
"obviously impossible and yet intriguingly intuitive.\n"
"In one margin, the word 'Mojocycle' has been scrawled in a flowing hand."
msgstr ""
"Motor de Combustión Infernal Manificado (Manejable)\n"
"Esquemas detallados para una motocicleta, que de alguna manera obviamente es "
"simultáneamente imposible y sin embargo intrigantemente intuitiva.\n"
"En un margen, la palabra \"Mojocicleta\" ha sido garabateada a mano alzada."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Nova Flare"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Nova Flare"
msgstr[0] "Pergamino de Nova de Llamas"
msgstr[1] "Pergaminos de Nova de Llamas"
msgstr[2] "Pergaminos de Nova de Llamas"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Nova Flare"
msgid "Causes an intense heat at the location, greatly damaging the target."
msgstr "Provoca un intenso calor en el lugar, dañando enormemente al objetivo."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Scroll of Jar of Force"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Jar of Force"
msgstr[0] "Pergamino de Tarro de Fuerza"
msgstr[1] "Pergaminos de Tarro de Fuerza"
msgstr[2] "Pergaminos de Tarro de Fuerza"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Jar of Force"
msgid "Summon a jar of force you can use to store liquids in."
msgstr "Invoca un tarro de fuerza que puedas utilizar para almacenar líquidos."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Item name
