#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/goblin.json
#. ~ Description of monster "bugbear stalker"
msgid ""
"An enormous gray-green humanoid, over two meters tall with thick fur at their "
"joints and long, tufted ears, this creature no longer has much resemblance to "
"a goblin other than the color.  Despite their size, they move in almost "
"complete silence and hold a long spear in their hand.  Strangely, you can "
"only see them when you're looking directly at them; when in the corner of "
"your vision they simply fade from sight."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/golems.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "clay golem"
msgid_plural "clay golems"
msgstr[0] "golem de arcilla"
msgstr[1] "golems de arcilla"
msgstr[2] "golems de arcilla"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/golems.json
#. ~ Description of monster "clay golem"
msgid ""
"A large, humanoid golem made from clay.  Its proportions are off and it seems "
"fragile."
msgstr ""
"Un gran golem humanoide hecho de arcilla. Sus proporciones no son las "
"adecuadas y parece frágil."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/golems.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "plastic golem"
msgid_plural "plastic golems"
msgstr[0] "golem de plástico"
msgstr[1] "golems de plástico"
msgstr[2] "golems de plástico"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/golems.json
#. ~ Description of monster "plastic golem"
msgid ""
"Traditionally, making a golem is a months-long process involving hand tools "
"and precision craftsmanship.  A stone golem is as much a work of art as it is "
"a magical device.  The advent of 3D printing made it easy to get into the "
"golem-making hobby, and plastic golems have soared in popularity."
msgstr ""
"Tradicionalmente, hacer un gólem es un proceso de meses que involucra "
"herramientas de mano y artesanía de precisión. Un golem de piedra es tanto "
"una obra de arte como un dispositivo mágico. El advenimiento de la impresión "
"3D facilitó la afición de hacer golem, y los golem de plástico se han "
"disparado en popularidad."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/golems.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "stone golem"
msgid_plural "stone golems"
msgstr[0] "golem de piedra"
msgstr[1] "golems de piedra"
msgstr[2] "golems de piedra"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/golems.json
#. ~ Description of monster "stone golem"
msgid "A large, humanoid golem made from stone.  Its fists look similar to rockets."
msgstr ""
"Un gran golem humanoide hecho de piedra. Sus puños se parecen a los de los "
"cohetes."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/golems.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "iron golem"
msgid_plural "iron golems"
msgstr[0] "golem de hierro"
msgstr[1] "golems de hierro"
msgstr[2] "golems de hierro"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/golems.json
#. ~ Description of monster "iron golem"
msgid ""
"A large, humanoid golem made from iron.  Some sort of noxious gas seems to be "
"seeping from its mouth."
msgstr ""
"Un gran golem humanoide hecho de hierro. Parece que algún tipo de gas nocivo "
"se está filtrando de su boca."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/golems.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "earthshaper's golem"
msgid_plural "earthshaper's golems"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/golems.json
#. ~ Description of monster "earthshaper's golem"
msgid ""
"This golem is easy to separate from other golems - the metallic earthshaper's "
"emblem shines on its smooth body, and it's eyes and hands are made out of "
"amethyst."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/holiday_magiclysm.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Yule cat"
msgid_plural "Yule cats"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/holiday_magiclysm.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Yule cat"
msgid ""
"Magical beast from Icelandic folklore, known for their catlike appearance and "
"their hobby of eating Workshop Elves."
msgstr ""
"Bestia mágica del folclore islandés, conocida por su aspecto felino y su "
"afición a comer a los elfos del taller."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/holiday_magiclysm.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Yule cat cub"
msgid_plural "Yule cat cubs"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/holiday_magiclysm.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Yule cat cub"
msgid ""
"The child of a Yule cat, this catlike creature looks as if it poses no threat "
"to you, but looks can be deceiving."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/holiday_magiclysm.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "workshop elf"
msgid_plural "workshop elves"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/holiday_magiclysm.json
#. ~ Description of monster "workshop elf"
msgid ""
"Magical humanoids who are known for working in workshops, wearing green, and "
"being proficient at making toys."
msgstr ""
"Humanoides mágicos conocidos por trabajar en talleres, vestir de verde y ser "
"expertos en la fabricación de juguetes."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/holiday_magiclysm.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "leprechaun"
msgid_plural "leprechauns"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/holiday_magiclysm.json
#. ~ Description of monster "leprechaun"
msgid "Mischievous shoemakers who wear green and love pulling pranks on mortals."
msgstr ""
"Zapateros traviesos que visten de verde y les encanta gastar bromas a los "
"mortales."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/lizardfolk.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "lizardfolk warrior"
msgid_plural "lizardfolk warriors"
msgstr[0] "guerrero lagarto"
msgstr[1] "guerreros lagarto"
msgstr[2] "guerreros lagarto"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/lizardfolk.json
#. ~ Description of monster "lizardfolk warrior"
msgid ""
"A tall, powerful, reptilian humanoid with a muscular tail whose skin is "
"covered in dark gray-green scales.  They are tribal and tend to be found in "
"caves and near water, especially in areas inhabited by dragons and wyrms.  "
"They aren't particularly hostile, though they don't care for outsiders and "
"are highly dangerous when provoked.  While they usually prefer to fight with "
"their greatclubs, they are equally ferocious with their sharp teeth and claws."
msgstr ""
"Un humanoide reptil alto y poderoso con una cola musculosa cuya piel está "
"cubierta de escamas de color gris verdoso oscuro. Son tribales y tienden a "
"encontrarse en cuevas y cerca del agua, especialmente en áreas habitadas por "
"dragones y gusanos. No son particularmente hostiles, aunque no se preocupan "
"por los forasteros y son muy peligrosos cuando son provocados. Aunque "
"normalmente prefieren pelear con sus grandes palos, son igualmente feroces "
"con sus afilados dientes y garras."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/lizardfolk.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "lizardfolk hunter"
msgid_plural "lizardfolk hunters"
msgstr[0] "cazador lagarto"
msgstr[1] "cazadores lagarto"
msgstr[2] "cazadores lagarto"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/lizardfolk.json
#. ~ Description of monster "lizardfolk hunter"
msgid ""
"The hunter is a smaller lizardfolk than a warrior, but equally as deadly, "
"with their lithe figures and accurate javelin throws."
msgstr ""
"El cazador es un lagarto más pequeño que un guerrero, pero igual de "
"mortífero, con sus figuras ágiles y sus precisos lanzamientos de jabalina."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/lizardfolk.json
#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "lizardfolk hunter"
msgid "The hunter hurls a barbed javelin at you!"
msgstr "¡El cazador te lanza una jabalina de púas!"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/lizardfolk.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "lizardfolk shaman"
msgid_plural "lizardfolk shamans"
msgstr[0] "chamán lagarto"
msgstr[1] "chamanes lagarto"
msgstr[2] "chamanes lagarto"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/lizardfolk.json
#. ~ Description of monster "lizardfolk shaman"
msgid ""
"Lizardfolk are very intelligent and cunning, but magical ability is a rare "
"quality.  Shamans are chosen from the tribe during childhood, when magical "
"abilities mark the fate of the young tribesman.  Not much is known about the "
"initiation ritual they must undergo, but few survive the experience.  Shamans "
"are druidic spellcasters that can use the forces of nature to battle enemies, "
"as well as summoning assistance when needed."
msgstr ""
"Los lagartos son muy inteligentes y astutos, pero la habilidad mágica es una "
"cualidad rara. Los chamanes son elegidos de la tribu durante la infancia, "
"cuando las habilidades mágicas marcan el destino del joven de la tribu. No se "
"sabe mucho sobre el ritual de iniciación al que deben someterse, pero pocos "
"sobreviven a la experiencia. Los chamanes son hechiceros druídicos que pueden "
"usar las fuerzas de la naturaleza para luchar contra los enemigos, así como "
"para invocar ayuda cuando sea necesario."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/lizardfolk.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "lizardfolk chieftain"
msgid_plural "lizardfolk chieftains"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/lizardfolk.json
#. ~ Description of monster "lizardfolk chieftain"
msgid ""
"Among the lizardfolk, ambition is a rare quality.  Chieftains earn their "
"place by exhibiting unusually high levels of ambition, often mistaken by "
"outsiders as excessive, brutal violence.  This chief is the largest and "
"strongest member of its tribe and carries a fierce trident to compliment its "
"teeth and claws."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/lizardfolk.json
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_reptile_amphibian.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "crocodile"
msgid_plural "crocodiles"
msgstr[0] "cocodrilo"
msgstr[1] "cocodrilos"
msgstr[2] "cocodrilos"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/lizardfolk.json
#. ~ Description of monster "crocodile"
msgid ""
"A once-and-future lizardfolk shaman, this large crocodile no longer has any "
"hint of any humanoid characteristics and looks very, very dangerous."
msgstr ""
"Este gran cocodrilo ya no tiene ningún indicio de características humanoides "
"y parece muy, muy peligroso."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/mi-go.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "mi-go fleshwarper"
msgid_plural "mi-go fleshwarpers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/mi-go.json
#. ~ Description of monster "mi-go fleshwarper"
msgid ""
"An alien creature of uncertain origin.  Its shapeless pink body bears "
"numerous sets of paired appendages of unknown function, and a pair of ribbed, "
"membranous wings which seem to be quite useless.  Its odd, vaguely "
"pyramid-shaped head bristles with numerous wavering antennae, and it moves "
"with an uncanny fluidity on its many legs.  Its flesh occasionally ripples, "
"as though something inside was squirming and trying to get free."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/mi-go.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "mi-go fleshwarper"
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s's numerous antennae move rhythmically for a moment."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/mi-go.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "mi-go fleshwarper"
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s's numerous antennae twitch in all directions for a moment."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/mi-go.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "mi-go fleshwarper"
#, c-format
msgid "As %1$s touches %3$s, the flesh warps and twists!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/mi-go.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "mi-go nethermancer"
msgid_plural "mi-go nethermancers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/mi-go.json
#. ~ Description of monster "mi-go nethermancer"
msgid ""
"An alien creature of uncertain origin.  Its shapeless pink body bears "
"numerous sets of paired appendages of unknown function, and a pair of ribbed, "
"membranous wings which seem to be quite useless.  Its odd, vaguely "
"pyramid-shaped head bristles with numerous wavering antennae, and it moves "
"with an uncanny fluidity on its many legs.  Its carapace is covered in "
"regular patterns which occasionally shift as you look at them before settling "
"into a new configuration."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/mi-go.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "mi-go nethermancer"
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%1$s twitches its antennae at %3$s and %3$s is lifted up and pulled towards "
"them!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/mi-go.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/mi_go.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "mi-go nethermancer"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "mi-go lightbringer"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "mi-go mindrender"
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s's numerous antennae sync their movements for a brief moment."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/mi-go.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "mi-go nethermancer"
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s's numerous antennae weave in a complicated pattern."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/mi-go.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "mi-go nethermancer"
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s numerous antennae point directly at %3$s."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/mics.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "animated blade"
msgid_plural "animated blades"
msgstr[0] "hoja animada"
msgstr[1] "hojas animadas"
msgstr[2] "hojas animadas"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/mics.json
#. ~ Description of monster "animated blade"
msgid ""
"A conjured glowing longsword that darts and dodges around, slicing and "
"cutting your foes into small pieces."
msgstr ""
"Una espada larga y brillante que se lanza y esquiva, rebanando y cortando a "
"tus enemigos en pequeños trozos."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/mics.json
#. ~ Description of monster "animated blade"
msgid ""
"A conjured glowing longsword that darts and dodges around, slicing and "
"cutting enemies into small pieces."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/mics.json
#. ~ Description of monster "hologram"
msgid "Hologram copy of you."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/mics.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "watcher spirit"
msgid_plural "watcher spirits"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/mics.json
#. ~ Description of monster "watcher spirit"
msgid ""
"A summoned watcher spirit, translucent and barely visible.  It gazes all "
"around itself."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/mics.json
#. ~ Death message of monster "watcher spirit"
#, c-format
msgid "The %s dissipates in a gust of wind!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "owlbear"
msgid_plural "owlbears"
msgstr[0] "buhoso"
msgstr[1] "buhosos"
msgstr[2] "buhosos"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "owlbear"
msgid ""
"The horrible owlbear is probably the result of genetic experimentation by "
"some insane wizard.  These creatures inhabit the tangled forest regions of "
"every temperate clime, as well as subterranean labyrinths.  They are ravenous "
"eaters, aggressive hunters, and evil tempered at all times.  They attack prey "
"on sight and will fight to the death."
msgstr ""
"El horrible buhoso es probablemente el resultado de la experimentación "
"genética de algún mago loco. Estas criaturas habitan en las enredadas "
"regiones forestales de todos los climas templados, así como en los laberintos "
"subterráneos. Son comedores hambrientos, cazadores agresivos y malvados "
"temperamentales en todo momento. Atacan a las presas en cuanto las ven y "
"luchan hasta la muerte."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "black pudding"
msgid_plural "black puddings"
msgstr[0] "pudding negro"
msgstr[1] "pudding negro"
msgstr[2] "pudding negro"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "black pudding"
msgid ""
"Writhing, sticky, black sludge undulates across the ground.  A faint sizzling "
"sound comes from the ground beneath it as it lurches toward you."
msgstr ""
"El cieno negro, pegajoso y retorcido se ondula en el suelo. Un débil "
"chisporroteo viene del suelo debajo de él mientras se tambalea hacia ti."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "black pudding"
#, c-format
msgid "The black pudding burns %3$s with acid!"
msgstr "¡El lodo negro quema %3$s con el ácido!"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "krabgek"
msgid_plural "krabgeks"
msgstr[0] "Krabgek"
msgstr[1] "Krabgeks"
msgstr[2] "Krabgeks"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "krabgek"
msgid ""
"A large baleful eye peers out from the darkness, its gleam hinting at a weird "
"intelligence and unnerving malevolence.  The eye oozes some pinkish liquid, "
"and the weirdly humanoid figure is covered in sharp blue-black triangular "
"plates."
msgstr ""
"Un gran ojo malvado se asoma desde la oscuridad, su brillo insinúa una "
"inteligencia extraña y una malevolencia desconcertante. El ojo rezuma un "
"líquido rosado, y la extraña figura humanoide está cubierta de afiladas "
"placas triangulares azul-negras."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "krabgek"
#, c-format
msgid "The krabgek gazes at %3$s!"
msgstr "¡El krabgek mira a%3$s !"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "hunllef lamb"
msgid_plural "hunllef lambs"
msgstr[0] "cordero hunllef"
msgstr[1] "corderos hunllef"
msgstr[2] "corderos hunllef"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "hunllef lamb"
msgid ""
"The offspring of the Hunllef rams are much more docile but still have wicked "
"looking horns like their parents."
msgstr ""
"Las crías de los carneros de Hunllef son mucho más dóciles, pero siguen "
"teniendo cuernos de aspecto perverso como sus padres."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "hunllef ram"
msgid_plural "hunllef rams"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "hunllef ram"
msgid ""
"Hunllef rams, also known as Nightmare Sheep, are a particularly vicious breed "
"of sheep suspected to be from another plane of existence.  Both males and "
"females display deadly horns and a willingness to use them on most other "
"creatures that come near them.  They are the most biddable source of "
"parabolan wool and often take a protective stance towards other sheep, so "
"some farmers will risk life and limb to keep them."
msgstr ""
"Los carneros Hunllef, también conocidos como Ovejas de Pesadilla, son una "
"raza de ovejas especialmente feroces que se sospecha provienen de otro plano "
"de existencia. Tanto los machos como las hembras exhiben unos cuernos "
"mortíferos y están dispuestos a utilizarlos con la mayoría de las criaturas "
"que se les acercan. Son la fuente de lana parabolan más licita y suelen "
"adoptar una postura protectora hacia otras ovejas, por lo que algunos "
"ganaderos arriesgan su vida para mantenerlas."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "owlbear cub"
msgid_plural "owlbear cubs"
msgstr[0] "cachorro de búhoso"
msgstr[1] "cachorros de búhoso"
msgstr[2] "cachorros de búhoso"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "bulette"
msgid_plural "bulettes"
msgstr[0] "bulette"
msgstr[1] "bulettes"
msgstr[2] "bulettes"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "bulette"
msgid ""
"The bulette (or landshark) was the result of a mad wizard's experimental "
"cross breeding of a snapping turtle and armadillo with infusions of demons' "
"ichor.  They range temperate climates feeding on horses, men, and most other "
"flesh.  The stupid bulette is irascible and always hungry, and they fear "
"nothing."
msgstr ""
"La bulette (o tiburón) fue el resultado del cruce experimental de un mago "
"loco con una tortuga y un armadillo con infusiones de ichor de demonios. Se "
"extienden por climas templados alimentándose de caballos, hombres y la "
"mayoría de la carne. La estúpida bulette es irascible y siempre está "
"hambrienta, y no le temen a nada."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "will-o-wisp"
msgid_plural "will-o-wisps"
msgstr[0] "fuego fatuo"
msgstr[1] "fuegos fatuos"
msgstr[2] "fuegos fatuos"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "will-o-wisp"
msgid ""
"Will-o'-wisps can be yellow, white, green, or blue.  They are easily mistaken "
"for lanterns, especially in the foggy marshes and swamps where they reside."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "will-o-wisp"
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s glitters in an eerie pattern."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "troll"
msgid_plural "trolls"
msgstr[0] "trol"
msgstr[1] "troles"
msgstr[2] "troles"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "troll"
msgid ""
"A monstrous, green-skinned humanoid, almost three meters tall but as thin as "
"the average human.  Trolls are renowned for their thick hides and natural "
"regenerative ability."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "rock troll"
msgid_plural "rock trolls"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "rock troll"
msgid ""
"A monstrous, gray-skinned humanoid, almost three meters tall but as thin as "
"the average human.  Rock trolls have rocky skin that's almost impervious to "
"hand weapons, but they turn to stone in the sunlight."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
#. ~ Death message of monster "rock troll"
#, c-format
msgid "The %s turns to stone."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "sea troll"
msgid_plural "sea trolls"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "sea troll"
msgid ""
"A monstrous, green-skinned humanoid, almost three meters tall but as thin as "
"the average human.  Sea trolls are just as mean and dangerous as trolls on "
"land, but they can also swim and breathe in water."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "stirge"
msgid_plural "stirges"
msgstr[0] "murciequito"
msgstr[1] "murciequitos"
msgstr[2] "murciequitos"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "stirge"
msgid ""
"This horrid flying creature looks like a cross between a large bat and "
"oversized mosquito."
msgstr ""
"Esta horrible criatura voladora parece un cruce entre un gran murciélago y un "
"mosquito de gran tamaño."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "shrieker"
msgid_plural "shriekers"
msgstr[0] "aullador"
msgstr[1] "aulladores"
msgstr[2] "aulladores"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "shrieker"
msgid ""
"A shrieker is a human-sized mushroom that emits a piercing screech to drive "
"off creatures that disturb it."
msgstr ""
"Un aullador es un hongo de tamaño humano que emite un chillido penetrante "
"para ahuyentar a las criaturas que lo molestan."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "frog"
msgid_plural "frogs"
msgstr[0] "rana"
msgstr[1] "ranas"
msgstr[2] "ranas"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "frog"
msgid ""
"A conspicuously average American bullfrog.  You better keep prince charming "
"away from it."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "lemure"
msgid_plural "lemures"
msgstr[0] "lemur"
msgstr[1] "lemures"
msgstr[2] "lemures"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "lemure"
msgid ""
"A lemure resembles a molten mass of flesh with a vaguely humanoid head and "
"torso."
msgstr ""
"Un lemur se asemeja a una masa fundida de carne con una cabeza y un torso "
"vagamente humanoide."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "winter wolf"
msgid_plural "winter wolves"
msgstr[0] "lobo de invierno"
msgstr[1] "lobos de invierno"
msgstr[2] "lobos de invierno"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "winter wolf"
msgid ""
"A pure white dire wolf.  If you squint, you can see a faint mist surrounding "
"its coat, and ice shards slowly descend from its breath."
msgstr ""
"Un lobo huargo de color blanco puro. Si entrecierras los ojos, puedes ver una "
"tenue niebla que rodea su pelaje, y fragmentos de hielo que descienden "
"lentamente de su aliento."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "loup garou"
msgid_plural "loup garous"
msgstr[0] "loup garou"
msgstr[1] "loup garous"
msgstr[2] "loup garous"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "loup garou"
msgid ""
"Previously thought extinct outside of rural Quebec and Louisiana this cursed "
"creature has been known to breed with true wolves when it isn't madly "
"destroying any signs of humanity in its territory.  These once normal men, "
"women, elves and dwarves are now forever cursed to roam the wilderness as "
"four legged avatars of destruction; giant, rabid, maddened wolves that never "
"know peace when they can smell or see the creations of the mortal races.  "
"Immortal until killed it would be difficult to remember they were once mortal "
"until cutting beneath the fur shows meat that somehow remembers a different "
"life."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "fiery nightmare"
msgid_plural "fiery nightmares"
msgstr[0] "pesadilla ardiente"
msgstr[1] "pesadillas ardientes"
msgstr[2] "pesadillas ardientes"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "fiery nightmare"
msgid ""
"A colossal figure which seems to consist entirely of shadows engulfed in "
"flames.  Their immense dark wings extend from wall to wall.  Two eyes that "
"resemble burning coals are gazing down on you with hatred.  In one hand they "
"hold a huge sword, in the other a many thonged whip, both glowing with "
"red-hot flames."
msgstr ""
"Un colosal muñeco que parece estar formado íntegramente por sombras envueltas "
"en llamas. Sus inmensas alas oscuras se extienden de pared a pared. Dos ojos "
"que parecen carbones encendidos te miran con odio. En una mano sostiene una "
"enorme espada, en la otra un látigo con muchas puntas, ambas brillando con "
"llamas al rojo vivo."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "teravolt"
msgid_plural "teravolts"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "teravolt"
msgid "A small energy sphere that slowly floats towards the target."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
#. ~ Death message of monster "teravolt"
#, c-format
msgid "The %s explode, creating a giant cloud of sparks."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "razor butterfly"
msgid_plural "razor butterflies"
msgstr[0] "mariposa navaja"
msgstr[1] "mariposas navaja"
msgstr[2] "mariposas navaja"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
#. ~ Description of monster "razor butterfly"
#. ~ Description of monster "skyglass butterfly"
msgid ""
"A large, brightly colored butterfly with crystalline wings, fluttering "
"incongruously through the air.  This one seems to be patterned with orange "
"runes, and its wings look razor-sharp."
msgstr ""
"Es una mariposa grande de colores brillantes con alas cristalinas, aleteando "
"incongruentemente por el aire. Esta parece tener runas naranjas y sus alas "
"son filosas como navajas."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "electric demon"
msgid_plural "electric demons"
msgstr[0] "demonio eléctrico"
msgstr[1] "demonios eléctricos"
msgstr[2] "demonios eléctricos"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "electric demon"
msgid ""
"Small, pure electric elemental that jumps from target to target, attacking "
"anything and everything in their sight bar the caster."
msgstr ""
"Pequeño elemental eléctrico puro que salta de objetivo en objetivo, atacando "
"a todo lo que tiene a la vista excepto al lanzador."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
#. ~ Death message of monster "electric demon"
#, c-format
msgid "A %s explode!"
msgstr "¡%s explota!"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "thunder pillar"
msgid_plural "thunder pillars"
msgstr[0] "pilar trueno"
msgstr[1] "pilares trueno"
msgstr[2] "pilares trueno"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "thunder pillar"
msgid ""
"They look like a giant floating stone shard, but are actually an intelligent "
"creature that can use electric branches as their own bodies."
msgstr ""
"Su aspecto es el de un gigantesco fragmento de piedra flotante, pero en "
"realidad se trata de una criatura inteligente que puede utilizar "
"ramificaciones eléctricas como si fueran su propio cuerpo."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "thunder pillar"
msgid "The pillar weaves electricity around themself!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "ankheg"
msgid_plural "ankhegs"
msgstr[0] "ankheg"
msgstr[1] "ankhegs"
msgstr[2] "ankhegs"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "ankheg"
msgid ""
"A huge, segmented, burrowing insect, two meters long and pale greenish-yellow "
"in color."
msgstr ""
"Un enorme insecto excavador segmentado, de dos metros de largo y de color "
"amarillo verdoso pálido."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "ankheg"
#, c-format
msgid "The ankheg spits a stream of acid at %3$s!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "otyugh"
msgid_plural "otyughs"
msgstr[0] "otyugh"
msgstr[1] "otyughs"
msgstr[2] "otyughs"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "otyugh"
msgid ""
"An enormous, bulbous body dominated by a toothy maw, with three tentacles "
"extending from the top.  Two tentacles are tipped with grasping filaments and "
"the last has several dark spots that might be eyes.  It smells indescribably "
"foul."
msgstr ""
"Un cuerpo enorme y bulboso dominado por unas fauces dentadas, con tres "
"tentáculos que se extienden desde la parte superior. Dos tentáculos tienen "
"filamentos en la punta y el último tiene varias manchas oscuras que podrían "
"ser ojos. Huele indescriptiblemente mal."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "catoblepas"
msgid_plural "catoblepases"
msgstr[0] "catoblepas"
msgstr[1] "catoblepas"
msgstr[2] "catoblepas"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "catoblepas"
msgid ""
"A terrible stench is the first sign of this monster's presence.  It has an "
"ox-like body and warthog-like head, with a neck almost as long as a "
"giraffe's.  It keeps its head low to the ground, but there's something odd "
"about its eyes."
msgstr ""
"Un terrible hedor es la primera señal de la presencia de este monstruo. Tiene "
"cuerpo de buey y cabeza de facóquero, con un cuello casi tan largo como el de "
"una jirafa. Mantiene la cabeza pegada al suelo, pero hay algo extraño en sus "
"ojos."

