#. ~ Description of monster "zombie queller"
msgid ""
"This zombie's ley lines are glowing beneath its skin, but very dimly.  They "
"seem to absorb nearby light."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/zombies.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie disruptor"
msgid_plural "zombie disruptors"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/zombies.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie disruptor"
msgid ""
"The light seems to grow dim around this zombie's hands, in contrast to the "
"blue glow of its eyes.  Barely-visible blue paths on its visible skin, like "
"traceries of veins, mark the site of its ley lines."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/zombies.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "magebreaker"
msgid_plural "magebreakers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/zombies.json
#. ~ Description of monster "magebreaker"
msgid ""
"The air continuously wavers around this zombie's hands and its eyes are a "
"luminous shining blue.  It occasionally gestures at some of the nearby "
"scenery and light warps, like you're looking at it through a kaleidoscope.  "
"You can't tell a difference after it turns to normal, but you still don't "
"want to end up inside it."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/zombies.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "magebreaker"
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s raises both of its hands toward %3$s."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/zombified_fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie dwarf"
msgid_plural "zombie dwarves"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/zombified_fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie dwarf"
msgid ""
"Once a dwarf, this zombie now has rent flesh and a beard in tatters.  Its "
"face is twisted in an expression of rage."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/zombified_fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie dwarven miner"
msgid_plural "zombie dwarven miners"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/zombified_fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie dwarven miner"
msgid ""
"Once a dwarven miner, this zombie now has rent flesh and a beard in tatters.  "
"Its face is twisted in an expression of rage."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/zombified_fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie elf"
msgid_plural "zombie elves"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/zombified_fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie elf"
msgid ""
"Its face twisted in an expression of pure rage and with glassy eyes, this elf "
"looks nothing like the ethereal elves from before the Cataclysm.  Though it "
"also lacks the elves' characteristic grace, its movements are quieter than "
"the other dead."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/zombified_fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie goblin"
msgid_plural "zombie goblins"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/zombified_fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie goblin"
msgid ""
"With bared teeth and black eyes filled with rage, this formerly-living goblin "
"is now a walking nightmare.  While small, unlike the human zombies it was "
"born with teeth and claws."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/zombified_fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie ravenfolk"
msgid_plural "zombie ravenfolk"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/zombified_fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie ravenfolk"
msgid ""
"With bedraggled wings, dull eyes, and beak hanging open, this ravenfolk body "
"still walks, a slight sway as it moves."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/zombified_fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie lizardfolk"
msgid_plural "zombie lizardfolk"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/zombified_fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie lizardfolk"
msgid ""
"A proud servant of dragons reduced to a walking corpse, this lizardfolk's "
"scales are streaked with grime and its black eyes burn with rage.  It has not "
"lost its teeth and claws in the transition to undeath."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/zombified_monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "rotting wolf man"
msgid_plural "rotting wolf men"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/zombified_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "rotting wolf man"
msgid ""
"The classic half man half wolf of the movies, but with a new twist: UNDEATH!  "
"This monster lopes along alternating between two and four legged gaits.  It's "
"jet black eyes seething with insatiable hunger.  Now you will know why you "
"fear the night."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/zombified_monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zorc"
msgid_plural "zorcs"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/zombified_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zorc"
msgid ""
"This unholy beast looks at you with a piercing stare so strong it might scare "
"your soul away."
msgstr ""
"Esta bestia impía te mira con una mirada penetrante tan fuerte que podría "
"asustar tu alma."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/zombified_monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zowlbear"
msgid_plural "zowlbears"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/zombified_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zowlbear"
msgid ""
"This horrible mutant monster has been zombified.  Though it looks weaker than "
"its living counterpart, you feel much more hostility from its black oily eyes."
msgstr ""
"Este horrible monstruo mutante ha sido zombificado. Aunque parece más débil "
"que su homólogo vivo, sientes mucha más hostilidad por sus ojos negros y "
"aceitosos."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/zombified_monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zowlbear predator"
msgid_plural "zowlbear predators"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/zombified_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zowlbear predator"
msgid ""
"A once zombified owlbear, now faster and much bigger in size.  Its thick skin "
"protects the monster from harm, a sharp beak capable of rending through metal "
"and a fury in its eyes warns you to stay away."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/zombified_monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "undying"
msgid_plural "undying"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/zombified_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "undying"
msgid ""
"An enormous humanoid monster with a yellowish-green skin.  Trolls are "
"renowned for their thick hides and natural regenerative ability.  After "
"death, its pus filled body seems to have much grown stronger, it looks at you "
"ferociously with hunger in its eyes."
msgstr ""
"Un enorme monstruo humanoide de piel verde amarillenta. Los trolls son "
"famosos por su gruesa piel y su capacidad de regeneración natural. Tras la "
"muerte, su cuerpo lleno de pus parece haberse fortalecido mucho más, te mira "
"ferozmente con hambre en los ojos."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/zombified_monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombified Yule cat"
msgid_plural "zombified Yule cats"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/zombified_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombified Yule cat"
msgid ""
"A magical beast from Icelandic folklore, known for their catlike appearance "
"and their hobby of eating Workshop Elves.  It creepily stumbles on its 4 legs "
"with its squirming uneven body after meeting demise and being reborn just to "
"eat you."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/zombified_monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Tod cat"
msgid_plural "Tod cats"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/zombified_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Tod cat"
msgid ""
"Once used to its decomposed body, this nightmarish cat with thick teeth and "
"razor-sharp claws seems to be looking around for things to \"play\" with.  "
"Though its head is of a feline, it grins at you sadistically with a glint in "
"its cold demonic eyes."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/zombified_monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombified catoblepas"
msgid_plural "zombified catoblepases"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/zombified_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombified catoblepas"
msgid ""
"Already foul in life, this catoblepas now has oozing sores on its body and an "
"even more rank odor.  At least whatever was odd about its eyes is gone, now "
"that they're black and filled with rage."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/zombified_monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
#. ~ Word is invented: meaning is given as 'white-striders'
msgid "zombified aenor"
msgid_plural "zombified aenóren"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/zombified_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombified aenor"
msgid ""
"With bedraggled feathers and rent skin, stumbling as it walks, this "
"formerly-living aenor is in a sad state."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/dreams.json
#. ~ Dream of mutation category "DRAGON_BLACK"
msgid "You have a strange dream about dragons."
msgstr "Tienes un extraño sueño con dragones."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/dreams.json
#. ~ Dream of mutation category "DRAGON_BLACK"
msgid "You have a disturbing dream of rampaging in a village."
msgstr "Tienes un sueño perturbador sobre arrasar un pueblo."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/dreams.json
#. ~ Dream of mutation category "DRAGON_BLACK"
msgid "While dreaming, you see a distinctively dragon-like reflection of yourself."
msgstr "Mientras soñás ves un distintivo reflejo similar a un dragón de vos mismo."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/dreams.json
#. ~ Dream of mutation category "DRAGON_BLACK"
msgid ""
"You blissfully dream of soaring over a human village.  The thought of "
"destroying it and abducting the chiefs daughter is somewhat disturbing."
msgstr ""
"Soñás felizmente pasando por arriba de un poblado humano. El pensamiento de "
"destruirlo  y de atrapar a la hija del jefe te molesta de alguna manera."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/dreams.json
#. ~ Dream of mutation category "DRAGON_BLACK"
msgid "You have a disturbingly lifelike dream of living as a dragon."
msgstr "Tienes un perturbador sueño vívido acerca de vivir como un dragón."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/dreams.json
#. ~ Dream of mutation category "DRAGON_BLACK"
msgid "In your dream you are the nightmare of a human."
msgstr "En tu sueño, sos la pesadilla de un humano."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/dreams.json
#. ~ Dream of mutation category "DRAGON_BLACK"
msgid "You have a disturbingly satisfying dream of ravaging a human village."
msgstr ""
"Tienes un sueño perturbadoramente satisfactorio en el que devastas una aldea "
"humana."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/dreams.json
#. ~ Dream of mutation category "DRAGON_BLACK"
msgid "You dream of raiding a castle and abducting the princess."
msgstr "Soñás con atacar un castillo y capturar a la princesa."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Human Magic"
msgstr "Magia Humana"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Human Magic"
msgid "Your body is depressingly mundane."
msgstr "Tu cuerpo es depresivamente mundano."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Lesser Mana Efficiency"
msgstr "Eficiencia de Maná Menor"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Lesser Mana Efficiency"
msgid "You are able to store a little more mana in your body than usual."
msgstr "Eres capaz de almacenar un poco más de maná en tu cuerpo de lo habitual."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Mana Efficiency"
msgstr "Eficiencia de Maná"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Mana Efficiency"
#. ~ Description of mutation "Change with the Seasons"
msgid "You are able to store more mana in your body than usual."
msgstr "Eres capaz de almacenar más maná en tu cuerpo de lo habitual."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Greater Mana Efficiency"
msgstr "Eficiencia de Maná Mayor"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/manatouched.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/paraclesian_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Greater Mana Efficiency"
#. ~ Description of mutation "Manatouched Mana Efficiency"
#. ~ Description of mutation "Walking Ley Line"
msgid "You are able to store a lot more mana in your body than usual."
msgstr "Eres capaz de almacenar mucho más maná en tu cuerpo de lo habitual."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Lesser Mana Inefficiency"
msgstr "Ineficiencia de Maná Menor"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Lesser Mana Inefficiency"
msgid "You are able to store a little less mana in your body than usual."
msgstr "Eres capaz de almacenar un poco menos de maná en tu cuerpo de lo habitual."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Mana Inefficiency"
msgstr "Ineficiencia de Maná"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Mana Inefficiency"
msgid "You are able to store less mana in your body than usual."
msgstr "Eres capaz de almacenar menos maná en tu cuerpo de lo habitual."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Greater Mana Inefficiency"
msgstr "Ineficiencia de Maná Mayor"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Greater Mana Inefficiency"
msgid "You are able to store a lot less mana in your body than usual."
msgstr "Eres capaz de almacenar mucho menos maná en tu cuerpo de lo habitual."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Lesser Mana Regeneration"
msgstr "Regeneración menor de maná"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Lesser Mana Regeneration"
msgid "Your natural mana regeneration is slightly faster than normal."
msgstr "La regeneración natural del maná es ligeramente más rápida de lo normal."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Mana Regeneration"
msgstr "Regeneración de Maná"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Mana Regeneration"
msgid "Your natural mana regeneration is faster than normal."
msgstr "Tu regeneración de maná natural es más rápida de lo normal."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Greater Mana Regeneration"
msgstr "Gran Regeneración de Maná"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/manatouched.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Greater Mana Regeneration"
#. ~ Description of mutation "Manatouched Mana Regeneration"
msgid "Your natural mana regeneration is much faster than normal."
msgstr "La regeneración natural de maná es mucho más rápida de lo normal."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Poor Mana Regeneration"
msgstr "Regeneración Pobre de Maná"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Poor Mana Regeneration"
msgid "Your natural mana regeneration is slightly slower than normal."
msgstr "La regeneración natural del maná es ligeramente más lenta de lo normal."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Very Poor Mana Regeneration"
msgstr "Regeneración Mínima de Maná "

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Very Poor Mana Regeneration"
msgid "Your natural mana regeneration is slower than normal."
msgstr "Se frena la regeneración de Maná."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Abysmal Mana Regeneration"
msgstr "Frenado Abismal de Maná"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Abysmal Mana Regeneration"
msgid "Your natural mana regeneration is much slower than normal."
msgstr "Tu regeneración natural de maná es mucho más lenta de lo normal."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Lesser Mana Sensitivity"
msgstr "Sensibilidad Menor al Maná"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Lesser Mana Sensitivity"
msgid ""
"You can sense the mana in your body slightly better than normal, allowing you "
"to tap into more of your reserves."
msgstr ""
"Puedes sentir el maná en tu cuerpo un poco mejor de lo normal, lo que te "
"permite aprovechar más tus reservas."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Mana Sensitivity"
msgstr "Sensibilidad al Maná"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Mana Sensitivity"
msgid ""
"You can sense the mana in your body better than normal, allowing you to tap "
"into more of your reserves."
msgstr ""
"Puedes sentir el maná en tu cuerpo mejor de lo normal, lo que te permite "
"aprovechar más tus reservas."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Greater Mana Sensitivity"
msgstr "Gran Sensibilidad al Maná"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/manatouched.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Greater Mana Sensitivity"
#. ~ Description of mutation "Manatouched Mana Sensitivity"
msgid ""
"You can sense the mana in your body much better than normal, allowing you to "
"tap into more of your reserves."
msgstr ""
"Puedes sentir el maná en tu cuerpo mucho mejor de lo normal, permitiéndote "
"aprovechar más de tus reservas."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Poor Mana Sensitivity"
msgstr "Sensibilidad Pobre de Maná"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Poor Mana Sensitivity"
#. ~ Description of mutation "Very Poor Mana Sensitivity"
#. ~ Description of mutation "Abysmal Mana Sensitivity"
msgid ""
"You have a hard time sensing the mana in your body, making less of your "
"reserves available for use."
msgstr ""
"Te cuesta sentir el maná en tu cuerpo, lo que hace que menos de tus reservas "
"estén disponibles para su uso."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Very Poor Mana Sensitivity"
msgstr "Sensibilidad Muy Pobre de Maná"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Abysmal Mana Sensitivity"
msgstr "Insensibilidad Abismal de Maná"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Slime Breath"
msgstr "Aliento de Légamo"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Slime Breath"
msgid ""
"Your breath is sticky and slimy somehow.  This won't damage your interactions "
"with people but it's definitely noticeable."
msgstr ""
"Tu aliento es pegajoso y viscoso de alguna manera. Esto no perjudicará tus "
"interacciones con la gente, pero definitivamente se nota."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Chimeric Breath"
msgstr "Aliento Quimérico"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Chimeric Breath"
msgid ""
"Your breath could metaphorically melt lead.  It's horrible.  It's so bad that "
"it can actually distract from your attempts to intimidate someone."
msgstr ""
"Tu aliento podría fundir metafóricamente el plomo. Es horrible. Es tan malo "
"que puede distraer tus intentos de intimidar a alguien."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Debug Spell Mutation"
msgstr "Depurar Hechizo Mutación "

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Debug Spell Mutation"
msgid "Gives all of the debug spells at max level."
msgstr "Otorga todos los hechizos de depuración al máximo nivel."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Wildshape: Fish"
msgstr "Forma Salvaje: Pescado"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Wildshape: Fish"
msgid "You are fish-like.  Just keep swimming!"
msgstr "Eres como un pez. ¡Seguí nadando!"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Wildshape: Bear"
msgstr "Forma Salvaje: Oso"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Wildshape: Bear"
msgid ""
"You are bear-like, granting you raw bestial power in exchange for "
"intelligence."
msgstr ""
"Eres como un oso, lo que te da una potencia bestial a cambio de tu "
"inteligencia."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Wildshape: Deer"
msgstr "Forma Salvaje: Ciervo"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Wildshape: Deer"
msgid ""
"You are deer-like, giving you the ability to move quickly and escape danger.  "
"It is hard to use your arms in combat, however."
msgstr ""
"Eres como un ciervo, con la habilidad de moverte rápidamente y escapar del "
"peligro. Por contrapartida, es difícil usar armas en combate."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Mirror Displacement"
msgstr "Desplazamiento Espejo"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Mirror Displacement"
#. ~ Description of mutation "Future Sight"
msgid "You aren't where you seem to be."
msgstr "No estás donde pareces estar."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Empty"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Empty"
msgid ""
"You are one of the Empty, the rare few unable to cast even the simplest "
"spells.  Your complete lack of mana prevents you from ever casting any magic, "
"no matter how well you know it.  At least it doesn't prevent the use of "
"magical items and potions."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Mana-Shackled"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Mana-Shackled"
msgid ""
"For a reason or another you are wearing a mana-leech shackle, leaving you "
"constantly empty of mana.  Should you get rid of it you will regain the "
"ability to use your mana, but this is much easier said than done.  You know "
"that these shackles are often used in prisons, so maybe you could find a way "
"to remove it in there?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Mana-Shackled effect"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Iron Intolerance"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Iron Intolerance"
msgid ""
"You were born with an allergy to iron and, to a lesser extent, steel.  "
"Wearing or touching anything made of iron or steel will cause you pain and "
"discomfort."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/school_deficiencies.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "School Deficiency: Channeling"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/school_deficiencies.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "School Deficiency: Channeling"
msgid ""
