msgid_plural "mammoth shelter kits"
msgstr[0] "equipo de refugio mamut"
msgstr[1] "equipos de refugio mamut"
msgstr[2] "equipos de refugio mamut"

#: data/mods/Megafauna/items/tool/shelters.json
#. ~ Description of "mammoth shelter kit"
msgid ""
"This is a small shelter, made of large bones, mammoth tusks, and skins.  Use "
"it to place."
msgstr ""
"Este es un pequeño refugio, hecho con grandes huesos, colmillos de mamut, y "
"pieles. Usar para colocar."

#: data/mods/Megafauna/items/tool/shelters.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "large mammoth shelter kit"
msgid_plural "large mammoth shelter kits"
msgstr[0] "equipo de refugio grande de mamut"
msgstr[1] "equipos de refugio grandes de mamut"
msgstr[2] "equipos de refugio grandes de mamut"

#: data/mods/Megafauna/items/tool/shelters.json
#. ~ Description of "large mammoth shelter kit"
msgid ""
"This is a big shelter, made of large bones, mammoth tusks, and skins.  Use it "
"to place."
msgstr ""
"Esto es un refugio grande, hecho con largos huesos, colmillos de mamut, y "
"pieles. Usar para colocar."

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "shrub-ox"
msgid_plural "shrub-ox"
msgstr[0] "buey de los arbustos"
msgstr[1] "bueyes de los arbustos"
msgstr[2] "bueyes de los arbustos"

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
#. ~ Description of monster "shrub-ox"
msgid ""
"A massively built bovine sometimes found browsing in the woods.  It has dark, "
"long wool and two big, curved horns."
msgstr ""
"Es un descomunal bovino que a veces se lo puede ver buscando comida en el "
"bosque. Tiene pelaje largo y oscuro y dos cuernos curvos grandes."

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
#. ~ Feed message of monster "shrub-ox"
#. ~ Feed message of monster "wood-ox"
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The %s seems to like you!  It lets you pat its shaggy-haired head and seems "
"friendly."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
#. ~ Pet message of monster "shrub-ox"
#. ~ Pet message of monster "wood-ox"
#, c-format
msgid "The %s lets you pet its shaggy-haired head, mooing loudly in satisfaction."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "shrub-ox calf"
msgid_plural "shrub-ox calves"
msgstr[0] "cría de buey de los arbustos"
msgstr[1] "crías de buey de los arbustos"
msgstr[2] "crías de buey de los arbustos"

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
#. ~ Description of monster "shrub-ox calf"
msgid "A juvenile shrub-ox.  It's horns and wool have not grown far yet."
msgstr ""
"Es un buey de los arbustos joven. Sus cuernos y pelaje todavía no le han "
"crecido mucho."

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "wood-ox"
msgid_plural "wood-ox"
msgstr[0] "buey del bosque"
msgstr[1] "bueyes del bosque"
msgstr[2] "bueyes del bosque"

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
#. ~ Description of monster "wood-ox"
msgid ""
"A large-built bovine sometimes found browsing in high altitude woods.  It has "
"a thick, long coat of wool and two short, curved horns."
msgstr ""
"Es un bovino grande que a veces se lo puede ver buscando comida en el bosque "
"de montañas. Tiene pelaje largo y grueso y dos cuernos curvos cortos."

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "wood-ox calf"
msgid_plural "wood-ox calves"
msgstr[0] "cría de buey del bosque"
msgstr[1] "crías de buey del bosque"
msgstr[2] "crías de buey del bosque"

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
#. ~ Description of monster "wood-ox calf"
msgid "A juvenile wood-ox.  It's horns and wool have not grown far yet."
msgstr ""
"Es un buey del bosque joven. Sus cuernos y pelaje todavía no le han crecido "
"mucho."

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Mayfield's goat"
msgid_plural "Mayfield's goat"
msgstr[0] "cabra de Mayfield"
msgstr[1] "cabras de Mayfield"
msgstr[2] "cabras de Mayfield"

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Mayfield's goat"
msgid ""
"Soergelia mayfieldi - a sturdily built ruminant, not unlike a goat but more "
"massively built.  It has light-brown wool and two vicious looking horns that "
"are curved forward."
msgstr ""
"Soergelia mayfieldi - es un rumiante robusto, no muy diferente a la cabra "
"pero de complexión más grande. Tiene lana de color marrón claro y dos cuernos "
"de aspecto agresivo que están curvados hacia adelante."

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
#. ~ Feed message of monster "Mayfield's goat"
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The %s seems to tolerate you!  It cocks its head and stares at you with its "
"strange goat-eyes as you approach."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
#. ~ Pet message of monster "Mayfield's goat"
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The %s lets you scratch its big belly, letting of a sonorous bleat in "
"satisfaction."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Mayfield's goat kid"
msgid_plural "Mayfield's goat kids"
msgstr[0] "cabrito de Mayfield"
msgstr[1] "cabritos de Mayfield"
msgstr[2] "cabritos de Mayfield"

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Mayfield's goat kid"
msgid ""
"A juvenile Mayfield's goat.  It's horns have not grown far yet, and its wool "
"is still short, white, and quite fluffy."
msgstr ""
"Es una cabra de Mayfield joven. No le han crecido mucho los cuernos y su lana "
"es corta, blanca y bastante esponjosa."

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "ancient bison"
msgid_plural "ancient bison"
msgstr[0] "bisonte antiguo"
msgstr[1] "bisontes antiguos"
msgstr[2] "bisontes antiguos"

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
#. ~ Description of monster "ancient bison"
msgid ""
"A massive, meaty bovid that roams the steppes in large herds.  It is "
"insulated against the cold with a thick layer of wool.  Two short horns "
"appear from its bushy head wool."
msgstr ""
"Es un descomunal bovino carnoso que deambula por la estepa en grandes "
"manadas. Está aislado contra el frío por su gruesa capa de lana. Tiene dos "
"cuernos cortos que le salen de la cabeza lanuda."

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "ancient bison calf"
msgid_plural "ancient bison calves"
msgstr[0] "cría de bisonte antiguo"
msgstr[1] "crías de bisonte antiguo"
msgstr[2] "crías de bisonte antiguo"

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
#. ~ Description of monster "ancient bison calf"
msgid "A juvenile ancient bison.  It's horns and wool have not grown far yet."
msgstr ""
"Es un bisonte antiguo joven. Sus cuernos y pelaje todavía no le han crecido "
"mucho."

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Scott's horse"
msgid_plural "Scott's horses"
msgstr[0] "caballo de Scott"
msgstr[1] "caballos de Scott"
msgstr[2] "caballos de Scott"

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Scott's horse foal"
msgid_plural "Scott's horse foals"
msgstr[0] "potrillo de caballo de Scott"
msgstr[1] "potrillos de caballo de Scott"
msgstr[2] "potrillos de caballo de Scott"

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Scott's horse foal"
msgid ""
"A juvenile horse.  It gallops around its parent excitedly, throwing around "
"its head joyously."
msgstr ""
"Un caballo joven. Galopa con excitación alrededor de sus padres, moviendo la "
"cabeza con alegría."

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant horse"
msgid_plural "giant horses"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant horse"
msgid ""
"A massive species of Equus that looks like a draft horse, just bigger.  If "
"you dare come close to it, you might be able to get this one to trust you "
"enough to ride it."
msgstr ""
"Es una descomunal especie de Equus que se parece a un caballo de tiro pero "
"más grande. Si te animás a acercarte, tal vez logres que este confíe en vos "
"lo suficiente como para dejar que lo montés."

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant horse foal"
msgid_plural "giant horse foals"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant horse foal"
msgid ""
"A juvenile giant horse.  It gallops around its parent excitedly, throwing "
"around its head joyously."
msgstr ""
"Es un caballo gigante joven. Galopa con excitación alrededor de sus padres, "
"revoleando la cabeza con alegría."

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Camelops"
msgid_plural "Camelops"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Camelops"
msgid ""
"A huge, woolly two-humped camel that roams far and wide across the American "
"continent.  It looks at you irritated, chewing on some long grass."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Camelops foal"
msgid_plural "Camelops foals"
msgstr[0] "cría de camelops"
msgstr[1] "crías de camelops"
msgstr[2] "crías de camelops"

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Camelops foal"
msgid ""
"A juvenile camelops.  Its humps haven't grown to full size yet, but it is "
"already covered in a thin layer of wool."
msgstr ""
"Es un camelops joven. Sus jorobas todavía no han crecido a su tamaño "
"completo, pero ya está cubierto de una fina capa de lana."

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "flat-headed peccary"
msgid_plural "flat-headed peccaries"
msgstr[0] "pecarí de cabeza plana"
msgstr[1] "pecaríes de cabeza plana"
msgstr[2] "pecaríes de cabeza plana"

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
#. ~ Description of monster "flat-headed peccary"
msgid ""
"A stocky, short-legged, pig-like animal with coarse brown fur.  It is smaller "
"than a wild boar, its distant European cousin, and also a bit smaller than "
"its close relative, the long-nosed peccary.  Different to these, it is a "
"quite social and friendly creature - unless its young are threatened."
msgstr ""
"Es un animal similar a un chancho con patas cortas y fornidas con el pelaje "
"marrón grueso. Es más chico que un jabalí, su pariente lejano europeo, y un "
"poco más chico que su pariente más cercano, el pecarí de hocico largo. A "
"diferencia de estos, es bastante sociable y amigable, salvo que sus crías "
"estén amenazadas."

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
#. ~ Feed message of monster "flat-headed peccary"
#. ~ Feed message of monster "flat-headed peccary piglet"
#, c-format
msgid "The %s seems to like you!  It squeals happily as you pet it."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "flat-headed peccary piglet"
msgid_plural "flat-headed peccary piglets"
msgstr[0] "pecarí cachorro de cabeza plana"
msgstr[1] "pecaríes cachorros de cabeza plana"
msgstr[2] "pecaríes cachorros de cabeza plana"

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
#. ~ Description of monster "flat-headed peccary piglet"
msgid ""
"A juvenile flat-headed peccary - a stocky, short-legged, pig-like animal.  "
"Its playful squeaks delight your heart."
msgstr ""
"Es un pecarí de cabeza plana joven, un animal similar a un chancho de patas "
"cortas y fornidas. Sus chillidos juguetones te llenan el corazón."

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "long-nosed peccary"
msgid_plural "long-nosed peccaries"
msgstr[0] "pecarí de hocico largo"
msgstr[1] "pecaríes de hocico largo"
msgstr[2] "pecaríes de hocico largo"

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
#. ~ Description of monster "long-nosed peccary"
msgid ""
"A stocky, short-legged, pig-like animal with coarse brown fur.  It just a bit "
"smaller than a wild boar, its distant European cousin, but considerably "
"bigger than its close relative, the flat-headed peccary.  Different to the "
"latter, they are solitary and more aggressive, but still appreciate good food."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "long-nosed peccary piglet"
msgid_plural "long-nosed peccary piglets"
msgstr[0] "pecarí cachorro de hocico largo"
msgstr[1] "pecaríes cachorros de hocico largo"
msgstr[2] "pecaríes cachorros de hocico largo"

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
#. ~ Description of monster "long-nosed peccary piglet"
msgid ""
"A juvenile long-nosed peccary - a stocky, short-legged, pig-like animal.  Its "
"playful squeals delight your heart."
msgstr ""
"Es un pecarí de hocico largo joven, un animal similar a un chancho de patas "
"cortas y fornidas. Sus grititos juguetones te llenan el corazón."

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "dire wolf"
msgid_plural "dire wolves"
msgstr[0] "lobo feroz"
msgstr[1] "lobos feroces"
msgstr[2] "lobos feroces"

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
#. ~ Description of monster "dire wolf"
msgid ""
"A large, muscular species of wolf, with incredibly strong and sharp teeth "
"capable of penetrating the thick hides of mammoths and giant sloths."
msgstr ""
"Es un especie de lobo musculoso y grande, con dientes increíblemente fuertes "
"y filosos capaces de penetrar los cueros gruesos de mamuts y perezosos "
"gigantes."

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
#. ~ Feed message of monster "dire wolf"
#. ~ Feed message of monster "stag moose"
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The %s seems to tolerate you.  It cautiously lets you pat its head and seems "
"friendly for now."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
#. ~ Pet message of monster "dire wolf"
#, c-format
msgid "The %s reluctantly wags its tail while you pat their massive head."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "dire wolf cub"
msgid_plural "dire wolf cubs"
msgstr[0] "lobo gigante cachorro"
msgstr[1] "lobos gigantes cachorros"
msgstr[2] "lobos gigantes cachorros"

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
#. ~ Description of monster "dire wolf cub"
msgid ""
"A juvenile dire wolf.  It runs around as excited as aimless, occasionally "
"barking joyously."
msgstr ""
"Es un lobo gigante joven. Anda corriendo tan excitado como al azar, "
"ocasionalmente ladrando de manera juguetona."

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "sabre-toothed cat"
msgid_plural "sabre-toothed cats"
msgstr[0] "felino dientes de sable"
msgstr[1] "felinos dientes de sable"
msgstr[2] "felinos dientes de sable"

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
#. ~ Description of monster "sabre-toothed cat"
msgid ""
"This tiger-sized, but more robustly built creature has a sand-colored, "
"spotted coat and a short tail.  Its eponymous sabre-like upper canine teeth "
"look menacing."
msgstr ""
"Esta criatura tiene el tamaño de un tigre pero es más robusto, tiene color "
"arena, pelaje con lunares y cola corta. Sus epónimos caninos superiores "
"similares a sables tienen un aspecto amenazante."

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
#. ~ Feed message of monster "sabre-toothed cat"
#, c-format
msgid "The %s seems to like you!  It emits a growling purr as you pet it."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "sabre-toothed cat cub"
msgid_plural "sabre-toothed cat cubs"
msgstr[0] "cría de felino dientes de sable"
msgstr[1] "crías de felino dientes de sable"
msgstr[2] "crías de felino dientes de sable"

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
#. ~ Description of monster "sabre-toothed cat cub"
msgid ""
"A juvenile sabre-toothed cat.  Still sizable, but much less dangerous than "
"its parent, which will fight fiercely to protect its offspring."
msgstr ""
"Es un felino dientes de sable joven. De todas maneras, tiene un tamaño "
"considerable pero es mucho menos peligroso que sus padres, que lucharán "
"ferozmente para proteger a su cría."

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "cave lion"
msgid_plural "cave lions"
msgstr[0] "león de las cavernas"
msgstr[1] "leones de las cavernas"
msgstr[2] "leones de las cavernas"

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
#. ~ Description of monster "cave lion"
msgid ""
"This fierce looking sister of the European cave lion is a fast hunter, but "
"usually likes to spend its days laying in the sun."
msgstr ""
"Este hermano feroz del león de las cavernas europeo es un cazador veloz pero "
"usualmente le gusta pasar los días tirado al sol."

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "cave lion cub"
msgid_plural "cave lion cubs"
msgstr[0] "cría de león de las cavernas"
msgstr[1] "crías de león de las cavernas"
msgstr[2] "crías de león de las cavernas"

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
#. ~ Description of monster "cave lion cub"
msgid ""
"A juvenile cave lion.  Still sizable, but much less dangerous than its "
"parent, which will fight fiercely to protect its offspring."
msgstr ""
"Es un león de las cavernas joven. De todas maneras, tiene un tamaño "
"considerable pero es mucho menos peligroso que sus padres, que lucharán "
"ferozmente para proteger a su cría."

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
#. ~ Feed message of monster "bobcat"
#, c-format
msgid "The %s seems to like you!  It emits a satisfied purr as you pet it."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "bobcat cub"
msgid_plural "bobcat cubs"
msgstr[0] "cachorro de lince"
msgstr[1] "cachorros de lince"
msgstr[2] "cachorros de lince"

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
#. ~ Description of monster "bobcat cub"
msgid ""
"A juvenile bobcat.  It already moves with enthusiasm, but with much less "
"grace and dexterity than its parent."
msgstr ""
"Es un lince joven. Ya se mueve con entusiasmo pero con mucho menos gracia y "
"destreza que sus padres."

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "titanis walleri"
msgid_plural "titani walleri"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
#. ~ Description of monster "titanis walleri"
msgid ""
"A large predatory flightless bird with monstrous beak and strong legs.  "
"Truly, the dinosaurs never went extinct, they just grew more feathers."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
#. ~ Feed message of monster "titanis walleri"
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The %s seems to like you!  It clicks its beak a few times and lowers its "
"head, allowing you to pet it."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "titanis walleri chick"
msgid_plural "titanis walleri chicks"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
#. ~ Description of monster "titanis walleri chick"
msgid ""
"A juvenile titanis walleri.  It is already large for a bird, but it is still "
"far from its parent."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant beaver"
msgid_plural "giant beavers"
msgstr[0] "castor gigante"
msgstr[1] "castores gigantes"
msgstr[2] "castores gigantes"

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant beaver"
msgid ""
"A big rodent feeding off of wood, known for building dams that set entire "
"regions under water.  About the size of a calf."
msgstr ""
"Es un roedor grande que se alimenta de madera, conocido por construir "
"represas que pueden inundar regiones enteras. Es casi del tamaño de un "
"ternero."

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant beaver cub"
msgid_plural "giant beaver cubs"
msgstr[0] "cría de castor gigante"
msgstr[1] "crías de castor gigante"
msgstr[2] "crías de castor gigante"

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant beaver cub"
msgid "A juvenile giant beaver.  Pretty big already."
msgstr "Es un castor gigante joven. Ya es bastante grande."

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "large claw sloth"
msgid_plural "large claw sloths"
msgstr[0] "perezoso de garras largas"
msgstr[1] "perezosos de garras largas"
msgstr[2] "perezosos de garras largas"

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
#. ~ Description of monster "large claw sloth"
msgid ""
"A huge lumbering sloth standing at over 3 meters, gracefully wandering "
"through the woods at a glacial tempo.  It is constantly in search for food to "
"support its massive body weight."
msgstr ""
"Un enorme perezoso pesado de más de 3 metros, andando elegantemente por el "
"bosque con un ritmo glacial. Está buscando constantemente comida para "
"alimentar su descomunal peso corporal."

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
#. ~ Feed message of monster "large claw sloth"
#, c-format
msgid "The %s seems to like you!  It lets you pat its head, giving off a bassy hum."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
#. ~ Pet message of monster "large claw sloth"
#, c-format
msgid "The %s turns on its back and lets you scratch its huge, moss-overgrown belly."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "large claw sloth cub"
msgid_plural "large claw sloth cubs"
msgstr[0] "cría de perezoso de garras largas"
msgstr[1] "crías de perezoso de garras largas"
msgstr[2] "crías de perezoso de garras largas"

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
#. ~ Description of monster "large claw sloth cub"
msgid "A juvenile large claw sloth.  Pretty big already."
