#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "woolly mammoth"
msgid_plural "woolly mammoths"
msgstr[0] "mamut lanudo"
msgstr[1] "mamuts lanudos"
msgstr[2] "mamuts lanudos"

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
#. ~ Description of monster "woolly mammoth"
msgid ""
"A huge elephant-like animal covered in thick, long hair, shielding it against "
"the cold.  Its trunk lazily swings around its two massive, upward-curving "
"tusks."
msgstr ""
"Un enorme animal similar a un elefante cubierto de pelo largo y grueso que lo "
"protege del frío. Su trompa se mueve perezosamente alrededor de sus dos "
"gigantescos colmillos curvados hacia arriba."

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "woolly mammoth cub"
msgid_plural "woolly mammoth cubs"
msgstr[0] "cría de mamut lanudo"
msgstr[1] "crías de mamuts lanudos"
msgstr[2] "crías de mamuts lanudos"

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
#. ~ Description of monster "woolly mammoth cub"
msgid ""
"This big baby mammoth is already covered in thick brown wool, but the "
"menacing tusks of their parents have not grown yet."
msgstr ""
"Este mamut bebé ya está cubierto de lana marrón gruesa, pero todavía no le "
"crecieron los amenazantes colmillos que tienen sus padres."

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "mastodon"
msgid_plural "mastodons"
msgstr[0] "mastodonte"
msgstr[1] "mastodontes"
msgstr[2] "mastodontes"

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
#. ~ Description of monster "mastodon"
msgid ""
"Shorter, but more massive than a woolly mammoth, and - crucially - much less "
"hairy.  Its trunk lazily swings around its two massive, upward-curving tusks."
msgstr ""
"Es más petiso pero más enorme que un mamut lanudo y, significativamente, "
"mucho menos peludo. Su trompa se mueve perezosamente alrededor de sus dos "
"gigantescos colmillos curvados hacia arriba."

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "mastodon cub"
msgid_plural "mastodon cubs"
msgstr[0] "cría de mastodonte"
msgstr[1] "crías de mastodontes"
msgstr[2] "crías de mastodontes"

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
#. ~ Description of monster "mastodon cub"
msgid ""
"This big baby mastodon is already quite muscular, but the menacing tusks of "
"their parents have not grown yet."
msgstr ""
"Este mastodonte bebé ya es bastante musculoso, pero todavía no le crecieron "
"los amenazantes colmillos que tienen sus padres."

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant short-faced bear"
msgid_plural "giant short-faced bears"
msgstr[0] "oso gigante de hocico corto"
msgstr[1] "osos gigantes de hocico corto"
msgstr[2] "osos gigantes de hocico corto"

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant short-faced bear"
msgid ""
"A bear weighing about a ton, standing at literal eyelevel with man, as long "
"as it isn't towering above you on it's long, muscular hind legs.  Has a wide, "
"short snout, giving it's face an almost feline expression.  Its not "
"particularly aggressive, but doesn't tolerate threats to itself or its cubs."
msgstr ""
"Es un oso que pesa casi una tonelada, alto como un humano siempre y cuando no "
"esté parado sobre sus largas y musculosas patas traseras. Tiene el hocico "
"corto y ancho lo que le da una expresión casi felina. No es particularmente "
"agresivo pero no tolera las amenazas hacia él o sus crías."

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "giant short-faced bear cub"
msgid_plural "giant short-faced bear cubs"
msgstr[0] "osezno gigante de hocico corto"
msgstr[1] "oseznos gigantes de hocico corto"
msgstr[2] "oseznos gigantes de hocico corto"

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
#. ~ Description of monster "giant short-faced bear cub"
msgid ""
"A juvenile giant short-faced bear.  Still a massive bear and a considerable "
"threat on its own, but the real danger will come from its highly protective "
"parent."
msgstr ""
"Es un oso gigante de hocico corto joven. De todas maneras, es un oso enorme y "
"una amenaza considerable, pero el verdadero peligro son sus protectores "
"padres."

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "great auk"
msgid_plural "great auks"
msgstr[0] "alca gigante"
msgstr[1] "alcas gigantes"
msgstr[2] "alcas gigantes"

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
#. ~ Description of monster "great auk"
msgid ""
"A large flightless sea bird that bears some resemblance to penguins, although "
"it has a much larger beak.  It has a black and white coat with a "
"characteristic white spot around its eyes."
msgstr ""
"Es una ave marina grande no voladora que se asemeja a los pingüinos, aunque "
"tiene un pico mucho más grande. Tiene plumaje negro y blanco con una "
"característica mancha blanca alrededor de sus ojos."

#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
#. ~ Monster name
