msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Teōchicāhualiztli Booster CBM"
msgid ""
"A series of implants along the skeleton and in major muscle groups allow a "
"dramatic increase in the user's strength and agility."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Tapayaxitilmàtli CBM"
msgid_plural "Tapayaxitilmàtli CBMs"
