#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Tapayaxitilmàtli CBM"
msgid ""
"Implants under the skin throughout the body that bend light when activated, "
"making it much harder to spot the user from a distance."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
