#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
#. ~ Description of "Meditation and You"
msgid ""
"A description of simple meditation and breathing techniques, intended for a "
"beginner."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
