#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
#. ~ Description of variant "Zen Mind, Beginner's Mind" of item "Meditation
#. and You"
msgid ""
"This is a transcription of lectures given by Suzuki Shunryū, a Buddhist monk "
"who founded the first Zen Buddhist monastery in the United States, containing "
"discussion about Zen meditation and practice."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Meditation and You"
msgid "How to Meditate: A Practical Guide to Making Friends with Your Mind"
msgid_plural "copies of How to Meditate: A Practical Guide to Making Friends with Your Mind"
