msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
#. ~ Description of "Secrets of the Zen Masters"
msgid ""
"This book purports to contain hidden tips that will make you serene and calm "
"in the face of the most grievous calamities.  Cataclysms, one might say."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Secrets of the Zen Masters"
msgid ""
"The Mind Illuminated: A Complete Meditation Guide Integrating Buddhist Wisdom "
"and Brain Science for Greater Mindfulness"
msgid_plural ""
"copies of The Mind Illuminated: A Complete Meditation Guide Integrating "
"Buddhist Wisdom and Brain Science for Greater Mindfulness"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
#. ~ Description of variant "The Mind Illuminated: A Complete Meditation Guide
#. Integrating Buddhist Wisdom and Brain Science for Greater Mindfulness" of
#. item "Secrets of the Zen Masters"
msgid ""
"Written by a neuroscientist and meditator practitioner, this book offers a "
"ten-step meditation program that combines science with traditional meditation "
"techniques."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
#. ~ Variant name of item "Secrets of the Zen Masters"
msgid "Mastering the Core Teachings of the Buddha: An Unusually Hardcore Dharma Book"
