"puncturing ship hulls during engagements.  The G-Tz77 has been a mainstay of "
"the Imperial Navy for decades at this point and seen service on the surface "
"of and in orbit around dozens of worlds.  This is just one more in its long "
"history of protecting the Ēxcān Tlahtōlōyān."
