"Use of your powers has led to an insight.  You can refine specific elements "
"of your metabolism with an incredible amount of focus, allowing you to "
"directly convert your stored calories into vitamins."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/learning_eocs/biokinesis.json
