#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/snippets/snippets_fifth_sun.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_QUEST_STARTER_NOTE_FIFTH_SUN_CUACHIC"
msgid ""
"You take a closer look at the note and, with mounting excitement, realize its "
"written in the Imperial Speech!  The blocky Imperial-military-standard "
"characters read, \"I do not know if there are any who will read this, but I "
"am still alive.  I survived the disaster of the Texopapalotl and awakened in "
"a scientific facility filled with demons.  I fought my way out and found a "
"place of some safety.  If you can read this, find me.\n"
"Xiuhcozcatl, Squad Leader, Eighth Band\"  Below it is a map of a small "
"building by a lake, though you don't recognize the nearby terrain."
msgstr ""
"Miras de cerca la nota y, con creciente emoción, te das cuenta de que está "
"escrita en el Habla Imperial. Los caracteres en bloque del lenguaje militar "
"imperial dicen: \"No sé si habrá alguien que lea esto, pero sigo vivo. "
"Sobreviví al desastre del Texopapalotl y desperté en una instalación "
"científica llena de demonios. Luché por salir y encontré un lugar seguro. Si "
"puedes leer esto, encuéntrame.\n"
"Xiuhcozcatl, Líder de Escuadrón, Octava Banda\" Debajo hay un mapa de un "
"pequeño edificio junto a un lago, aunque no reconoces el terreno cercano."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/snippets/snippets_fifth_sun.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_QUEST_STARTER_NOTE_FIFTH_SUN_CUACHIC"
msgid ""
"The note is written in another language with some kind of pictographic "
"characters.  They look vaguely…Mayan?  Regardless, you can't read them.  "
"There is a crude map drawn below the characters, however, showing a house or "
"similar structure by a lake."
msgstr ""
"La nota está escrita en otro idioma con una especie de caracteres "
"pictográficos. Parecen vagamente... ¿Mayas? En cualquier caso, no se pueden "
"leer. Sin embargo, hay un tosco mapa dibujado debajo de los caracteres, que "
"muestra una casa o una estructura similar junto a un lago."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/snippets/snippets_new.json
