#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/modinfo.json
#. ~ MOD name
msgid "My Sweet Cataclysm"
msgstr "Mi Dulce Cataclismo"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/modinfo.json
#. ~ Description of MOD "My Sweet Cataclysm"
msgid ""
"In the wake of the Cataclysm, sweets and snacks are coming to life.  You "
"could be one of them and walk through the Cataclysm as a human shaped piece "
"of sugar with your pet necco wafer, or you could just hunt them for some "
"sweet treats."
msgstr ""
"Tras el cataclismo, los dulces y los bocadillos están cobrando vida. Podrías "
"ser uno de ellos y caminar a través del Cataclismo como un cacho de azúcar "
"con forma humana con tu mascota necco wafer, o podrías simplemente cazarlos "
"por algunos dulces."

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_comestibles.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "necco corpse"
msgid_plural "necco corpses"
msgstr[0] "cadáver necco"
msgstr[1] "cadáveres necco"
msgstr[2] "cadáveres necco"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_comestibles.json
#. ~ Description of "necco corpse"
msgid ""
"The corpse of a necco.  Now it really looks like a giant necco wafer.  Surely "
"a bite wouldn't hurt, right?"
msgstr ""
"El cadáver de un necco, ahora realmente parece una galleta gigante de necco. "
"Seguramente un mordisco no haría daño, ¿verdad?"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_comestibles.json
#. ~ Description of "marshmallows"
msgid ""
"A handful of squishy, fluffy, puffy, delicious marshmallows.  They feel oddly "
"warm…"
msgstr ""
"Un puñado de malvaviscos blandos, suaves, inflados y deliciosos. Están "
"extrañamente tibios..."

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_comestibles.json
#. ~ Description of "s'mores"
msgid ""
"A pair of graham crackers with some chocolate and a marshmallow between them. "
" Warmth radiates from it as if it is… alive?"
msgstr ""
"Un par de galletas graham con un poco de chocolate y un malvavisco entre "
"ellas. El calor irradia de ellas como si estuvieran... ¿vivas?"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_comestibles.json
#. ~ Description of "chewy candy"
msgid ""
"A handful of colorful fruit-flavored chewy candy.  They feel warm to the "
"touch and you can almost feel a slow beat coming from them.  How odd…"
msgstr ""
"Un puñado de coloridos caramelos masticables con sabor a fruta. Se sienten "
"cálidos al tacto y casi se puede sentir un ritmo lento que viene de ellos. "
"Qué extraño..."

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_comestibles.json
#. ~ Description of "chewy reptilian candy"
msgid ""
"A handful of colorful fruit-flavored chewy candy shaped in a reptilian "
"fashion.  They're warm to the touch and you can feel a slow beat coming from "
"them.  How odd…"
msgstr ""
"Un puñado de coloridos caramelos masticables con sabor a frutas con forma de "
"reptil. Cálidos al tacto y se puede sentir un ritmo lento que viene de ellos. "
"Qué extraño..."

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_comestibles.json
#. ~ Description of "graham cracker"
msgid ""
"Dry and sugary, these crackers will leave you thirsty, but go good with some "
"chocolate and marshmallows.  They shiver under your touch.  Weird!"
msgstr ""
"Secas y azucaradas, estas galletas te darán sed, pero van bien con un poco de "
"chocolate y malvaviscos. Tiemblan al tacto. ¡Qué raro!"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_comestibles.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "graham cracker roe"
msgid_plural "graham cracker roe"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_comestibles.json
#. ~ Description of "graham cracker roe"
msgid ""
"Dry and sugary, these cracker pellets will leave you thirsty, but go good "
"with some chocolate and marshmallows.  They shiver under your touch.  Weird!"
msgstr ""
"Secas y azucaradas, estas bolitas de galletas te darán sed, pero van bien con "
"un poco de chocolate y malvaviscos. Se estremecen bajo tu toque. ¡Raro!"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_comestibles.json
#. ~ Description of "cookie"
msgid ""
"Sweet and delicious cookies, just like grandma used to bake.  They shiver "
"under your touch.  Weird!"
msgstr ""
"Dulces y deliciosas galletas, como las que solía hornear la abuela. Se "
"estremecen bajo tu toque. ¡Raro!"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_comestibles.json
#. ~ Description of "cookie egg"
msgid ""
"Sweet and delicious cookies, shaped like eggs.  They shiver under your touch "
"as if something is inside.  Weird!"
msgstr ""
"Dulces y deliciosas galletas, con forma de huevo. Se estremecen bajo tu toque "
"como si hubiera algo dentro. ¡Raro!"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_comestibles.json
#. ~ Description of "chewing gum"
msgid ""
"Bright pink chewing gum.  Sugary, sweet, and bad for your teeth.  It's oddly "
"warm to the touch…"
msgstr ""
"Un chicle rosa brillante. Azucarado, dulce y malo para tus dientes. "
"Extrañamente cálido al tacto..."

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_comestibles.json
#. ~ Description of "caffeinated chewing gum"
msgid ""
"Chewing gum with added caffeine.  Sugary and bad for your teeth, but it's a "
"nice pick-me-up.  It's oddly warm to the touch…"
msgstr ""
"Chicle con cafeína añadida. Azucarado y malo para los dientes, pero es un "
"buen estimulante. Es extrañamente cálido al tacto."

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_comestibles.json
#. ~ Description of "candy cattle"
msgid ""
"A handful of chocolate candies shaped like cows.  They're really warm, enough "
"to make you wonder how they haven't melted."
msgstr ""
"Un puñado de caramelos de chocolate con forma de vaca. Están muy calientes, "
"lo suficiente para que te preguntes cómo es que no se han derretido."

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_comestibles.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "raw chocolate milk"
msgid_plural "raw chocolate milk"
msgstr[0] "leche chocolateada cruda"
msgstr[1] "leche chocolateada cruda"
msgstr[2] "leche chocolateada cruda"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_comestibles.json
#. ~ Description of "raw chocolate milk"
msgid ""
"This is raw, unhomogenized and unpasteurized chocolate milk from a chocolate "
"cow.  It couldn't be any fresher unless you drank it straight from the cow, "
"which might upset it.  Depending on your dietary sensibilities, you might "
"want to pasteurize or even boil this before drinking."
msgstr ""
"Esto es leche chocolateada cruda de vaca de chocolate, sin homogeneizar ni "
"pasteurizar. Lo más fresco que vas a verla, salvo que la tomes directamente "
"de la vaca, lo que podría molestarle. Dependiendo de tu sensibilidad "
"dietaria, podrías preferir pasteurizarla o hervirla antes de tomarla."

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_comestibles.json
#. ~ Description of "chocolate milk"
msgid "Baby chocolate cow food, appropriated for adult humans.  Spoils rapidly."
msgstr ""
"Comida para terneros de chocolate, apropiada para humanos adultos. Se pudre "
"rápidamente."

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_comestibles.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "liquid cacao"
msgid_plural "liquid cacao"
msgstr[0] "cacao líquido"
msgstr[1] "cacao líquido"
msgstr[2] "cacao líquido"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_comestibles.json
#. ~ Description of "liquid cacao"
msgid "Liquid unsweetened cacao.  Quite bitter to taste."
msgstr "Cacao líquido sin endulzar. Bastante amargo."

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_comestibles.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "reconstituted chocolate milk"
msgid_plural "reconstituted chocolate milk"
msgstr[0] "leche chocolateada reconstituida"
msgstr[1] "leche chocolateada reconstituida"
msgstr[2] "leche chocolateada reconstituida"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_comestibles.json
#. ~ Description of "reconstituted chocolate milk"
msgid ""
"Baby chocolate cow food, appropriated for adult humans.  This milk has been "
"reconstituted from a processed milk.  Spoils rapidly."
msgstr ""
"Comida para terneros de chocolate, apropiada para humanos adultos. Esta leche "
"ha sido reconstituida a partir de leche procesada. Se pudre rápidamente."

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_comestibles.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "powdered chocolate milk"
msgid_plural "powdered chocolate milk"
msgstr[0] "leche chocolateada en polvo"
msgstr[1] "leche chocolateada en polvo"
msgstr[2] "leche chocolateada en polvo"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_comestibles.json
#. ~ Description of "powdered chocolate milk"
msgid "Dehydrated chocolate milk powder.  Mix with water to make drinkable milk."
msgstr ""
"Polvo de leche chocolateada deshidratada. Mezclar con agua para hacer leche "
"bebible."

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_comestibles.json
#. ~ Description of "licorice"
msgid ""
"A swirly confectionary treat in strings of sweet tasting candy.  You think "
"you've seen them wriggle a bit.  How strange…"
msgstr ""
"Una golosina arremolinada en cuerdas de caramelos de sabor dulce. Crees que "
"los has visto retorcerse un poco. Qué extraño..."

