#: data/mods/Personal_Portal_Storms/modinfo.json
#. ~ MOD name
msgid "Portal Storms Ignore NPCs"
msgstr "Las Tormentas de Portal ignoran a los PNJs"

#: data/mods/Personal_Portal_Storms/modinfo.json
#. ~ Description of MOD "Portal Storms Ignore NPCs"
msgid ""
"Makes Portal Storm enemies only attack the player.  Without this critical "
"NPCs can die to Portal Storm enemies in very unfair ways.  More work needs to "
"be done on AI and faction base security before it will be safe to disable "
"this."
msgstr ""
"Hace que los enemigos de la Tormenta de Portales sólo ataquen al jugador. Sin "
"esta opción, los PNJ críticos pueden morir a manos de los enemigos de las "
"Tormentas de Portales de forma muy injusta. Hay que trabajar más en la IA y "
"en la seguridad de la facción de la base antes de que sea seguro desactivar "
"esta opción."

#: data/mods/Rummaging/modinfo.json
#. ~ MOD name
msgid "Rummaging"
msgstr "Rebuscando"

#: data/mods/Rummaging/modinfo.json
#. ~ Description of MOD "Rummaging"
msgid ""
"Some furniture containers need to open the door to scavenge, to enhance the "
"thrill of scavenging."
msgstr ""
"Algunos muebles hay que abrirlos para rebuscar adentro, esto aumenta la "
"emoción de encontrar cosas."

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_difficultysafeguard"
msgid ""
"You haven't selected a difficulty.  This could be because you're playing an "
"old save.\n"
"\n"
"Your current difficulty has been set to Normal.  In this setting, you will "
"have 4 hours in every expedition to reach the exit and leave safely.  After "
"this, warp sickness sets in and applies heavy debuffs until you exit.  After "
"6 hours, warp disintegration begins, and you will rapidly lose health until "
"you exit or die."
msgstr ""

