#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "infinity ore"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "infinity ore"
msgid ""
"A roiling, rattling mass of ever-churning metal.  Flares of purple energy arc "
"around the formless pile like electricity, and in their wake, thin metal rods "
"and struts jut out, before disappearing into the half-molten heap which never "
"seems to grow or diminish.  Its strange nature allows you to shift it around "
"like furniture.\n"
"\n"
"The power of this ore allows you to produce raw and basic metal items from "
"material tokens via the crafting menu.\n"
"Just one of these could last forever."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "warped rock"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "warped rock"
msgid ""
"A sparkly-black stone that's glassy smooth to the touch.  Seems "
"indestructible by normal means."
msgstr ""

