"helping you rest and recuperate between expeditions.\n"
"A new recipe has been learned.  Craft this artifact to permanently upgrade "
"the island.\n"
"\n"
"New Structure: Bunker Entrance.  A simple concrete entrance leading down into "
"the lower levels of the island, including a small subterranean chamber."
msgstr ""

