msgstr "¡Envenenaste tu propia sangre!"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Death message of effect type "poisoned_blood2"
msgid "Your blood turns to acid and melts through your body."
msgstr "Tu sangre se convierte en ácido y te derrite mientras pasa por tu cuerpo."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "vampire_virus"
msgid "Wan"
msgstr "Apagado"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "vampire_virus"
msgid "Reddened Eyes"
msgstr "Ojos rojos"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "vampire_virus"
msgid "Bloodthirst"
msgstr "Sed de sangre"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Wan"
msgid "Your complexion is wan and spent."
msgstr "Tu tez está apagada y gastada."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Reddened Eyes"
msgid "Your skin is pale and your eyes are thoroughly bloodshot."
msgstr "Tu piel es pálida y sus ojos están completamente inyectados en sangre."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Bloodthirst"
msgid ""
"Your skin is pale and your eyes have turned dark red.  You feel a constant "
"hunger, like the food you eat is no longer nourishing you."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Wan, Reddened Eyes, Bloodthirst"
msgid ""
"You feel the blood rushing from the wound and then a pressure that reminds "
"you of backwash."
msgstr ""
"Siente la sangre salir a toda prisa de la herida y luego una presión que "
"recuerda a la contracorriente."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Wan, Reddened Eyes, Bloodthirst"
msgid "Your iris slowly turns red from the outside in."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Wan, Reddened Eyes, Bloodthirst"
msgid ""
"There is an emptiness in your stomach and soul that can no longer be filled "
"with mortal joys."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#: data/mods/deadly_bites/effects.json
#. ~ Death message of effect type "Wan, Reddened Eyes, Bloodthirst"
#. ~ Death message of effect type "Terminal Porphyria"
#. ~ Death message of effect type "Homo sapiens homovorus"
#. ~ Death message of effect type "Pallor, Itchy pale skin, Necrotic skin"
msgid "You succumb to your deadly necrotic condition."
msgstr "Sucumbes a tu mortal condición necrótica."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Blood analysis description of effect type "Wan, Reddened Eyes,
#. Bloodthirst"
msgid "Unknown RNA virus is rewriting sampled blood cells."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "vampire_virus_ascendant"
msgid "Terminal Porphyria"
msgstr "Porfiria Terminal"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Terminal Porphyria"
msgid "Your skin is deathly white and will redden and burn when exposed to the sun."
msgstr ""
"Tu piel es mortalmente blanca y se enrojece y se quema cuando se expone al "
"sol."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Terminal Porphyria"
msgid "You've chosen to embrace this illness and enhance your curse."
msgstr ""
"Tu piel es mortalmente blanca y se enrojece y se quema cuando se expone al "
"sol."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Blood analysis description of effect type "Terminal Porphyria"
#. ~ Blood analysis description of effect type "Homo sapiens homovorus"
msgid ""
"Blood sample contains numerous unidentified mutations and numerous blood "
"sources.  Original host blood unidentifiable in the mix."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "vampire_virus_post_mortal"
msgid "Homo sapiens homovorus"
msgstr "Homo sapiens homovorus"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Homo sapiens homovorus"
msgid ""
"Your skin is deathly white, your eyes are solid red except for a huge pupil, "
"the only food you can consume is human blood, and if sunlight hits you that "
"part of your body instantly burns."
msgstr ""
"Tu piel está mortalmente blanca, tus ojos son de color rojo excepto por la "
"enorme pupila, el único alimento que puedes consumir es la sangre humana, y "
"si la luz del sol te da, esa parte de tu cuerpo se quema instantáneamente."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Homo sapiens homovorus"
msgid ""
"Becoming a monster is a matter of degrees until one day it isn't and you can "
"no longer remember why morality seemed important."
msgstr ""
"Ser un monstruo es una cuestión de matices hasta que un día deja de serlo y "
"ya no recuerdas por qué la moral parecía importante."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Sallow"
msgid ""
"The absence of raw blood from your diet has left you wan, pale and "
"uncomfortable."
msgstr "La ausencia de sangre cruda en tu dieta te ha dejado débil, pálido e incómodo."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Hypomia"
msgid "Your body is weakened and your need to feed is a constant pain in your chest."
msgstr ""
"Tu cuerpo está débil y la necesidad de alimentarte es un dolor constante en "
"el pecho."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Corpse-like"
msgid ""
"Severe blood deficiency has left you looking emaciated no matter what your "
"weight is."
msgstr ""
"La deficiencia sanguínea severa te ha dejado con un aspecto demacrado sin "
"importar tu peso."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Eternal Slumber"
msgid ""
"One day blood may spill on your lips and wake you from your slumber, but "
"until then you are a corpse."
msgstr ""
"Un día, sangre puede derramarse en tus labios y despertarte de tu sueño, pero "
"hasta entonces eres un cadáver."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Sallow, Hypomia, Corpse-like, Eternal
#. Slumber"
msgid ""
"Most of your thoughts now revolve around blood, how good it tastes and where "
"you might find it."
msgstr ""
"La mayoría de tus pensamientos giran ahora en torno a la sangre, a su buen "
"sabor y en donde podrías conseguirla."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Sallow, Hypomia, Corpse-like, Eternal
#. Slumber"
msgid "Your blood lust is slaked."
msgstr "Tu sed de sangre fue saciada."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Sallow, Hypomia, Corpse-like, Eternal
#. Slumber"
msgid "You've almost consumed enough blood to feel normal again."
msgstr "Casi has consumido suficiente sangre para sentirte normal de nuevo."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Sallow, Hypomia, Corpse-like, Eternal
#. Slumber"
msgid "More blood and you'll start to feel even better."
msgstr "Más sangre y empezarás a sentirte aún mejor."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Blood analysis description of effect type "Sallow, Hypomia, Corpse-like,
#. Eternal Slumber"
msgid "Severe Progressive Anemic Autophagy"
msgstr ""

