#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/alchemy.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Imbuement of the Trees"
msgid_plural "Imbuement of the Trees"
msgstr[0] "Imbuimiento de los Árboles"
msgstr[1] "Imbuimientos de los Árboles"
msgstr[2] "Imbuimiento de los Árboles"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/alchemy.json
#. ~ Description of "Imbuement of the Trees"
msgid ""
"In a wooden bowl, Faewild and Dreamdross are mixed together along with "
"ground-up leaves.  The mixture has fae and human blood added to it and parts "
"from the plant fae and then all mixed again until it's a uniform blend.  The "
"resulting mixture will eventually dissolve into a deep green liquid."
msgstr ""
"En un cuenco de madera, se mezclan Faewild y Dreamdross junto con hojas "
"trituradas. A la mezcla se le añade sangre de hadas y humana, así como partes "
"de la planta de hadas, y se vuelve a mezclar todo hasta obtener una mezcla "
"homogénea. La mezcla resultante acabará disolviéndose en un líquido de color "
"verde intenso."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/alchemy.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Imbuement of the Earth"
msgid_plural "Imbuement of the Earth"
msgstr[0] "Imbuimiento de la Tierra"
msgstr[1] "Imbuimientos de la Tierra"
msgstr[2] "Imbuimiento de la Tierra"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/alchemy.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Imbuement of the Waters"
msgid_plural "Imbuement of the Waters"
msgstr[0] "Imbuimiento de las Aguas"
msgstr[1] "Imbuimientos de las Aguas"
msgstr[2] "Imbuimiento de las Aguas"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/alchemy.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Imbuement of the Winds"
msgid_plural "Imbuement of the Winds"
msgstr[0] "Imbuimiento de los vientos"
msgstr[1] "Imbuimientos de los vientos"
msgstr[2] "Imbuimiento de los vientos"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/alchemy.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Imbuement of the Flames"
msgid_plural "Imbuement of the Flames"
msgstr[0] "Imbuimiento de las llamas"
msgstr[1] "Imbuimientos de las llamas"
msgstr[2] "Imbuimiento de las llamas"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/alchemy.json
#. ~ Description of "Imbuement of the Flames"
msgid ""
"Heat Faewild and Dreamdross over a roaring fire and the mix in the ashes "
"until you have a thick paste.  That paste is mixed with parts taken from the "
"Fair Folk and united with a dollop of fae, and human blood.  The resulting "
"mixture will eventually dissolve into a scarlet liquid that shines with its "
"own light."
msgstr ""
"Calienta Faewild y Dreamdross sobre un fuego ardiente y mézclalos con las "
"cenizas hasta obtener una pasta espesa. Esa pasta se mezcla con partes "
"extraídas del Fair Folk y se une con una cucharada de sangre de hada y sangre "
"humana. La mezcla resultante acabará disolviéndose en un líquido escarlata "
"que brilla con luz propia."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/alchemy.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Imbuement of Parchment"
msgid_plural "Imbuement of Parchment"
msgstr[0] "Incorporación de pergamino"
msgstr[1] "Incorporación de pergaminos"
msgstr[2] "Incorporación de pergamino"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/alchemy.json
#. ~ Description of "Imbuement of Parchment"
msgid ""
"While looking in a mirror, Faewild and Dreamdross are ground to dust.  That "
"dust is mixed with parts taken from the Fair Folk and united with a dollop of "
"fae, and human blood.  The resulting mixture will eventually dissolve into "
"what almost looks like liquid porcelain."
msgstr ""
"Mientras se miran en un espejo, Faewild y Dreamdross se convierten en polvo. "
"Ese polvo se mezcla con partes extraídas de los Fair Folk y se une con una "
"cucharada de sangre de hada y sangre humana. La mezcla resultante acabará "
"disolviéndose hasta convertirse en algo que casi parece porcelana líquida."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/alchemy_recipes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "scribbled notes (eXtra strength aspirin)"
msgid_plural "scribbled notes (eXtra strength aspirin)"
msgstr[0] "notas garabateadas (aspirina extra fuerte)"
msgstr[1] "notas garabateadas (aspirina extra fuerte)"
msgstr[2] "notas garabateadas (aspirina extra fuerte)"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/alchemy_recipes.json
#. ~ Description of "scribbled notes (eXtra strength aspirin)"
msgid ""
"An handwritten set of notes detailing an alchemical recipe for extra strength "
"aspirin.  The active ingredient is apparently hallucinogenic, which is "
"certainly one way to stop from feeling pain."
msgstr ""
"Un conjunto de notas manuscritas que detallan una receta alquímica para "
"fabricar aspirina extra fuerte. Al parecer, el ingrediente activo es "
"alucinógeno, lo que sin duda es una forma de dejar de sentir dolor."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/alchemy_recipes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "scribbled notes (small blessing of Brigit)"
msgid_plural "scribbled notes (small blessing of Brigit)"
msgstr[0] "notas garabateadas (pequeña bendición de Brigit)"
msgstr[1] "notas garabateadas (pequeña bendición de Brigit)"
msgstr[2] "notas garabateadas (pequeña bendición de Brigit)"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/alchemy_recipes.json
#. ~ Description of "scribbled notes (small blessing of Brigit)"
msgid ""
"An handwritten set of notes detailing an alchemical recipe for a pill to cure "
"minor illnesses.  You're not looking forward to getting that royal jelly now "
"that you've seen what the bees are like lately."
msgstr ""
"Un conjunto de notas manuscritas que detallan una receta alquímica para "
"elaborar una píldora que cura enfermedades leves. Ahora que has visto cómo "
"están las abejas últimamente, no te apetece tanto tomar esa jalea real."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/alchemy_recipes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "scribbled notes (rage drink)"
msgid_plural "scribbled notes (rage drink)"
msgstr[0] "notas garabateadas (bebida de la ira)"
msgstr[1] "notas garabateadas (bebida de la ira)"
msgstr[2] "notas garabateadas (bebida de la ira)"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/alchemy_recipes.json
#. ~ Description of "scribbled notes (rage drink)"
msgid ""
"An handwritten set of notes detailing an alchemical recipe for some kind of "
"energy drink.  You do a double-take when you see just how much caffeine and "
"alcohol you're supposed to add to the recipe."
msgstr ""
"Un conjunto de notas escritas a mano que detallan una receta alquímica para "
"algún tipo de bebida energética. Te sorprendes al ver la cantidad de cafeína "
"y alcohol que se supone que debes añadir a la receta."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/alchemy_recipes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "scribbled notes (sixdust)"
msgid_plural "scribbled notes (sixdust)"
msgstr[0] "notas garabateadas (sixdust)"
msgstr[1] "notas garabateadas (sixdust)"
msgstr[2] "notas garabateadas (sixdust)"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/alchemy_recipes.json
#. ~ Description of "scribbled notes (sixdust)"
msgid ""
"An handwritten set of notes detailing an alchemical recipe for an "
"insecticide.  \"WEAR MASK DURING BREWING!!!!!\" is written at the bottom of "
"the recipe"
msgstr ""
"Un conjunto de notas manuscritas que detallan una receta alquímica para un "
"insecticida. «¡¡¡¡USAR MÁSCARA DURANTE LA PREPARACIÓN!!!!!» está escrito en "
"la parte inferior de la receta."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/alchemy_recipes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "scribbled notes (prophet's LSD)"
msgid_plural "scribbled notes (prophet's LSD)"
msgstr[0] "notas garabateadas (LSD del profeta)"
msgstr[1] "notas garabateadas (LSD del profeta)"
msgstr[2] "notas garabateadas (LSD del profeta)"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/alchemy_recipes.json
#. ~ Description of "scribbled notes (prophet's LSD)"
msgid ""
"An handwritten set of notes detailing an alchemical recipe for an extremely "
"powerful hallucinogen.  The end product will supposedly allow you to \"see "
"through time\"."
msgstr ""
"Un conjunto de notas manuscritas que detallan una receta alquímica para un "
"alucinógeno extremadamente potente. El producto final supuestamente te "
"permitirá «ver a través del tiempo»."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/alchemy_recipes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "scribbled notes (alchemically altered trucker pill)"
msgid_plural "scribbled notes (alchemically altered trucker pill)"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/alchemy_recipes.json
#. ~ Description of "scribbled notes (alchemically altered trucker pill)"
msgid ""
"An handwritten set of notes detailing an alchemical recipe for a \"stamina "
"enhancement\".  The ingredients make you raise your eyebrows, but the notes "
"in the margins indicate that you won't need to sleep for quite some time "
"after taking them."
msgstr ""
"Un conjunto de notas manuscritas que detallan una receta alquímica para "
"«aumentar el vigor». Los ingredientes te sorprenderán, pero las notas al "
"margen indican que no necesitarás dormir durante bastante tiempo después de "
"tomarlos."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/alchemy_recipes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "scribbled notes (charm of Marzanna)"
msgid_plural "scribbled notes (charm of Marzanna)"
msgstr[0] "notas garabateadas (amuleto de Marzanna)"
msgstr[1] "notas garabateadas (amuleto de Marzanna)"
msgstr[2] "notas garabateadas (amuleto de Marzanna)"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/alchemy_recipes.json
#. ~ Description of "scribbled notes (charm of Marzanna)"
msgid ""
"An handwritten set of notes detailing an alchemical recipe for an enchanted "
"amulet.  The notes indicate wearing it should protect you from cold "
"temperatures."
msgstr ""
"Un conjunto de notas manuscritas que detallan una receta alquímica para crear "
"un amuleto encantado. Las notas indican que llevarlo puesto debería "
"protegerte de las bajas temperaturas."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/alchemy_recipes.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "scribbled notes (spirit show dust)"
msgid_plural "scribbled notes (spirit show dust)"
