#. ~ Description of "heavy CQC system"
msgid ""
"This robust system begins at your hands, where it features a squarish steel "
"frame enhanced with strategic protrusions to amplify impact damage by "
"focusing the point of contact.  It extends along your forearms with thick, "
"hardened steel shields protecting both your limbs and the underlying "
