msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/consumables.json
#. ~ Description of "cosmic dagwood"
msgid ""
"The greatest sandwich that will ever be made, in this universe and the next.  "
"A quadruple stacker with beer-batter fried poultry, caramel chocolate chili, "
"and topped with a specially made sauce of egg, blue cheese, honey mustard, "
"BBQ and extremely concentrated vinegar that oozes down the other layers, "
"before the entire thing is pressed and grilled in a waffle iron and finished "
"with a garnish of gold and silver flakes and a fresh fruit skewered on top.  "
"All the gourmet chefs in existence could not even conceive such a combination "
"which, by all means, should not taste this good - But you did it.  And you "
"don't plan on sharing."
msgstr ""

