"In this device the Mad Genius creates an extremely strong magnetic field.  "
"Then in the next step of its creation they split that field in two in such a "
"way it is perpetually trying to reconnect.  When activated the timer counts "
"down til the moment the two fields reconnect.  Upon reconnection, energy is "
"released in the form of EMP."
msgstr ""

