msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "IA software"
msgid ""
"A simple intelligent agent to provide support in parsing big layers of "
"information."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Netherium-Reality Smoothing Device"
msgid_plural "Netherium-Reality Smoothing Devices"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "Netherium-Reality Smoothing Device"
msgid ""
"An enormous industrial press shaped device, covered in sensors, circuits, and "
"other doodads.  Two inverted teleporters are located on each side of the "
"hammers, poised to perfectly align at the end of a strike.  Doing so will "
"smoothen the overall local barrier between Earth and other realities, filling "
"in any holes at the expense of weakening it in a much wider area.  This is an "
"overall positive effect, allowing you to heal tears that would never "
"naturally close, but expect large temporary side-effects."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/misc.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Time Piercing Device"
msgid_plural "Time Piercing Devices"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/misc.json
#. ~ Description of "Time Piercing Device"
msgid ""
"A small remote with a sharp spike at the end.  You can activate this device "
"while poking it into a zone of frozen time in order to unfreeze the area "
"you're touching."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "intricate and opulent clock"
msgid_plural "intricate and opulent clocks"
msgstr[0] "reloj complejo y opulento"
msgstr[1] "relojes complejos y opulentos"
msgstr[2] "relojes complejos y opulentos"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
#. ~ Description of "intricate and opulent clock"
msgid ""
"An incredibly intricate clock where every visible surface appears to be "
"gilded or chrome.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"Es un reloj increíblemente complicado en el que cada superficie visible "
"parece estar enchapada en oro o cromo.\n"
"Puede tener poderes desconocidos, intentá activarlos."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "crystalline rod"
msgid_plural "crystalline rods"
msgstr[0] "vara cristalina"
msgstr[1] "varas cristalinas"
msgstr[2] "varas cristalinas"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
#. ~ Description of "crystalline rod"
msgid ""
"This crystal rod changes hue at random.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"Esta vara de cristal cambia de color aleatoriamente.\n"
"Puede tener poderes desconocidos; intentá activarlos."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "baroque monitor"
msgid_plural "baroque monitors"
msgstr[0] "monitor barroco"
msgstr[1] "monitores barrocos"
msgstr[2] "monitores barrocos"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
#. ~ Description of "baroque monitor"
msgid ""
"A strange monitor with a variety of knobs and dials.  When you turn it on, it "
"crackles and then begins tracking things that either aren't there or aren't "
"visible to the naked eye.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"Es un extraño monitor con una variedad de perillas y diales. Cuando lo "
"encendés, chisporrotea y luego comienza a rastrear cosas que o no están ahí o "
"no son visibles a simple vista.\n"
"Puede tener poderes desconocidos, intentá activarlos."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "a mess of tubes and wires"
msgid_plural "several messes of tubes and wires"
msgstr[0] "un revoltijo de caños y alambres"
msgstr[1] "varios revoltijos de caños y alambres"
msgstr[2] "varios revoltijos de caños y alambres"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
#. ~ Description of "a mess of tubes and wires"
msgid ""
"What is it for?  What could it do?\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"¿Para qué sirve? ¿Qué se podrá hacer?\n"
"Puede que tenga poderes desconocidos; intenta activarlos."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "abstract sculpture"
msgid_plural "abstract sculptures"
msgstr[0] "escultura abstracta"
msgstr[1] "esculturas abstractas"
msgstr[2] "esculturas abstractas"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
#. ~ Description of "abstract sculpture"
msgid ""
"It's a sculpture, but you can't identify what it depicts.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "humming disc"
msgid_plural "humming discs"
msgstr[0] "disco zumbante"
msgstr[1] "discos zumbantes"
msgstr[2] "discos zumbantes"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
#. ~ Description of "humming disc"
msgid ""
"It hums louder when you touch it.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"Zumba más fuerte cuando lo tocas.\n"
"Puede que tenga poderes desconocidos; intenta activarlos."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "an instrument"
msgid_plural "instruments"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
#. ~ Description of "an instrument"
msgid ""
"This looks like a musical instrument.  But how would you play it?\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
#. ~ Description of "very thin sheet"
msgid ""
"A sheet so light and thin that viewing it horizontally makes it almost "
"invisible.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"Una lámina tan ligera y fina que, vista horizontalmente, resulta casi "
"invisible.\n"
"Puede que tenga poderes desconocidos; intenta activarlos."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
#. ~ Description of "spiked sphere"
msgid ""
"A prickly ball that, no matter the force you apply, somehow never feels as if "
"it could cut.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"Una bola espinosa, la cual, no importa la fuerza que apliques, de algún modo "
"nunca parece que pueda herir.\n"
"Puede que tenga poderes desconocidos; intenta activarlos."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
#. ~ Description of "malleable blob"
msgid ""
"Despite its looseness, this mass of goo keeps its shape as you fold it in "
"your hands.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"A pesar de su fluidez, esta masa de viscosidad mantiene su forma mientras la "
"doblas en tus manos.\n"
"Puede que tenga poderes desconocidos; intenta activarlos."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
#. ~ Description of "spiraling rod"
msgid ""
"A rod with a bulbous, spiralling knob on the end that seems to spin as you "
"look.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"Una barra con un pomo bulboso en espiral en el extremo que parece moverse al "
"mirar.\n"
"Puede que tenga poderes desconocidos; intenta activarlos."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
#. ~ Description of "small pin"
msgid ""
"One of those pins you wear on your shirt, but this one has indecipherable "
"symbols in place of a witty slogan.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"Uno de esos pins que te pones en la camiseta, pero este tiene símbolos "
"indescifrables en vez de un ingenioso eslogan.\n"
"Podría tener poderes desconocidos. Intenta activarlo."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
#. ~ Description of "hollow tube"
msgid ""
"A tube of unknown material.  A strange noise from nowhere can be heard when "
"you place it next to your ear, as if something's inside.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"Un tubo de material desconocido. Un extraño ruido de la nada se puede oír "
"cuando lo pones cerca de tu oreja, como si algo estuviese dentro.\n"
"Podría tener poderes desconocidos. Intenta activarlos."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
#. ~ Description of "regular tetrahedron"
msgid ""
"A triangular pyramid, inconspicuous in every way.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"Una pirámide triangular, discreta en todos los sentidos.\n"
"Puede que tenga poderes desconocidos; intenta activarlos."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
#. ~ Description of "translucent crystal"
msgid ""
"A beautiful crystal, which seems to suck in detail rather than merely "
"obscuring it as light passes through.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"Un cristal precioso, que parece absorber los detalles en lugar de limitarse a "
"oscurecerlos al pasar la luz.\n"
"Puede que tenga poderes desconocidos; intenta activarlos."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/spark_artifact_items.json
#. ~ Description of "twisted, knotted cord"
msgid ""
"A bit of spiralling rope, disorienting you as your eyes vainly try to "
"complete following the loop.\n"
"It may have unknown powers; try activating them."
msgstr ""
"Es un poco de soga en forma de espiral, desorientándote mientras tus ojos "
"intentan seguir el bucle.\n"
