"lying prone on his deathbed as black ichor seeps from a sword wound in his "
"side.  His own sword rests near his hand and his ever dying breath asks you "
"to take up his blade."
msgstr ""
"Es una pintura anteriormente desconocida con el estilo de Caravaggio del "
"mismo artista tirado en su lecho de muerte mientras un icor negro chorrea de "
"una herida de espada en su costado. Su propia espada está cerca de su mano y "
"su último suspiro te pide que agarres su cuchilla."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spell_learning_items_dreamer.json
