#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks/perks.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Basic Alchemical Knowledge"
msgstr "Conocimiento Básico de Alquimia"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks/perks.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Basic Alchemical Knowledge"
msgid ""
"You spent years before the Cataclysm researching esoteric sciences and occult "
"mysteries but only now in the heat of survival, have you experienced the "
"epiphany that will allow you to create alchemical substances."
msgstr ""
"Pasaste años antes del Cataclismo investigando ciencias esotéricas y "
"misterios ocultos, pero sólo ahora, en plena supervivencia, has experimentado "
"la epifanía que te permitirá crear sustancias alquímicas."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks/perks.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Initiate Alchemy"
msgstr "Iniciado en la Alquimia"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks/perks.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Initiate Alchemy"
msgid ""
"The days and weeks since the Cataclysm have been a blur of ideas and thoughts "
"that you can only wish you had been able to think of before everything ended."
msgstr ""
"Los días y semanas transcurridos desde el Cataclismo han sido un borrón de "
"ideas y pensamientos que sólo puedes desear haber sido capaz de pensar antes "
"de que todo acabara."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks/perks.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Adept Alchemical Knowledge"
msgstr "Conocimiento Alquímico Experto"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks/perks.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Adept Alchemical Knowledge"
msgid ""
"The things you've learned would have changed your life in the old days, you "
"could have dropped out of the rat race and become a hidden master of the "
"occult."
msgstr ""
"Las cosas que has aprendido habrían cambiado tu vida en otros tiempos, "
"podrías haber abandonado la competitiva carrera profesional y convertirte en "
"un maestro oculto del ocultismo."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks/perks.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Cold Iron Knowledge"
msgstr "Conocimiento del Hierro Frío"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks/perks.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Cold Iron Knowledge"
msgid ""
"You've mastered the technique of cold forging iron from ingots into various "
"items and weapons that are particularly effective against creatures from "
"faerie myths."
msgstr ""
"Has dominado la técnica de forjar en frío hierro a partir de lingotes para "
"crear diversos objetos y armas que son especialmente eficaces contra las "
"criaturas de los mitos fantásticos."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks/perks.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Magister Alchemical Knowledge"
msgstr "Magister en Conocimiento Alquímico"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks/perks.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Magister Alchemical Knowledge"
msgid ""
"At this stage in your occult education, normally you would start a small "
"cabal of your own with apprentices that would engage in research and material "
"gathering.  You would likely have several rich patrons financing you in "
"return for alchemical medicines and goods to give them health and longevity."
msgstr ""
"En esta etapa de tu formación en ocultismo, lo normal sería que crearas tu "
"propia pequeña secta con aprendices que se dedicaran a la investigación y la "
"recopilación de material. Probablemente contarías con varios mecenas "
"adinerados que te financiarían a cambio de medicinas y productos alquímicos "
"que les proporcionaran salud y longevidad."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks/perks.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Illuminated Alchemy"
msgstr "Alquimia iluminada"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks/perks.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Illuminated Alchemy"
msgid ""
"Truly you have become one of the hidden occult masters of the world.  It's a "
"pity that so few people are around for you to enjoy the benefits of your "
"knowledge.  At least it's helping you to survive and maybe even thrive in "
"this post-Cataclysm world."
msgstr ""
"Verdaderamente te has convertido en uno de los maestros ocultos del mundo. Es "
"una pena que haya tan poca gente a tu alrededor para que puedas disfrutar de "
"los beneficios de tu conocimiento. Al menos te está ayudando a sobrevivir y "
"tal vez incluso a prosperar en este mundo post-cataclismo."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks/perks.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Mana for Morons"
msgstr "Mana para Idiotas"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks/perks.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Mana for Morons"
msgid ""
"Maybe you aren't a genius, but something inside of you grants previously "
"hidden reserves of mana."
msgstr ""
"Quizás no seas un genio, pero algo dentro de ti te concede reservas de maná "
"que antes estaban ocultas."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks/perks.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Vampire Killer"
msgstr "Asesino de vampiros"

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks/perks.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Vampire Killer"
msgid ""
"One of your ancestors spent their life fighting the monsters that stalk the "
"night, and you have finally taken up their legacy, though you've also adopted "
"their unusual weapon choice.  When wielding a whip, you do greatly-increased "
"damage to vampires and renfields, and have a much easier time hitting their "
"weakpoints."
msgstr ""
"Uno de tus antepasados dedicó su vida a luchar contra los monstruos que "
"acechan en la noche, y tú finalmente has tomado el relevo, aunque también has "
"adoptado su inusual elección de arma. Cuando empuñas un látigo, infliges un "
"daño mucho mayor a los vampiros y renfields, y te resulta mucho más fácil "
"golpear sus puntos débiles."

