"The blood hits your tongue with a wash of warmth and for a moment the world "
"goes white.  The taste is indescribable.  It's better than nectar, better "
"than ambrosia, better than anything you've ever tasted in your life.  You "
"know at this moment that you have crossed a river and there will never be any "
"going back."
msgstr ""

