#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_UNDINE_LEARN_FOUL_WATER"
msgid ""
"Drawn from some atavistic well, knowledge of how to turn foul water into "
"clean, pure water, and vice versa, fills your mind."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_UNDINE_LEARN_LIQUID_TO_WATER"
msgid ""
"Drawn from some atavistic well, knowledge of how to turn various other "
"liquids directly into water fills your mind."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_UNDINE_GOBLIN_FRUIT"
msgid ""
"You must be standing in water or near a large body of water to call forth a "
"goblin fruit."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_UNDINE_WATER_FORM_ON"
msgid "Your body falls apart in a rush of water."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_eocs.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_UNDINE_WATER_FORM_OFF"
