"Upon gaining this ability the Undine gains the ability to grow a goblin fruit "
"from a natural water source."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/undine_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "One Foot in the River and One in the Sea"
