#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/snippet.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "fae_organs_desc"
msgid ""
"These organs came from a glittering nether beast, and you really aren't sure "
"what to make of them.  There are things you've possibly seen in an anatomy "
"book, but in colors and shapes that leave you doubtful."
msgstr ""
"Estos órganos provienen de una bestia reluciente del inframundo y no estás "
"muy seguro de qué puedes hacer con esto. Hay cosas que posiblemente hayas "
"visto en un libro de anatomía, pero con colores y formas que te dejan con "
"dudas."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/snippet.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "fae_organs_desc"
msgid "These might be a kidney equivalent but they smell of rosemary at your touch."
msgstr "Estos pueden ser un equivalente de riñón pero huelen a romero al tocarlos."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/snippet.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "fae_organs_desc"
msgid "The lung looking organs are oozing a shimmering green substance."
msgstr "Los órganos de aspecto pulmonar rezuman una sustancia verde brillante."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/snippet.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "spy_note"
msgid ""
"I've tracked down rumors an intradimensional contact unit based out a local "
"government building.  I'm going to go recon it, see you in a few days."
msgstr ""
"He localizado rumores de una unidad de contacto intradimensional con base en "
"un edificio del gobierno local. Voy a ir a explorar el área, nos vemos en "
"unos días."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/snippet.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
msgid ""
"The weird creatures that seem to come out of peoples nightmares don't seem to "
"be able to track by smell like so many of the other monsters.  I wonder if "
"that's because smell isn't a strong sense in dreams?"
msgstr ""
"Las extrañas criaturas que parecen salir de las pesadillas de la gente no "
"parecen ser capaces de rastrear por el olfato como muchos de los otros "
"monstruos. Me pregunto si es porque el olfato no es un sentido fuerte en los "
"sueños."

