msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Awakening Psion" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You survived a portal storm and hid inside while reality broke around you, "
"and when you left to examine the damage you found a strange crystal the storm "
"had left behind.  It was captivating, and you took it with you.  Sometimes, "
"at night, you look into it before you sleep, and you almost feel like "
"something in you is responding to the glow within the crystal."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Star Athlete" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were always good at athletics.  People praised your effort and hard work, "
"but the truth was you barely needed to practice.  It all just came naturally "
"to you, as naturally as breathing.  That kept you safe during the "
"Cataclysm--you outran the dead and worse things that chased you and made it "
"out of the cities, and they're certainly the thing that will keep you going, "
"especially since now, you're stronger and faster than you've ever been."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Doomseer" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You knew the world was going to end, but they never listened.  They never "
"listened!  They couldn't see the things that walked among them!  They didn't "
"know what you had seen, what you knew was coming, and where are they now?  In "
"a zombie's stomach or walking with those corpses themselves, but you're still "
"alive."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Electrical Engineer" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You followed your parents' wishes and became an engineer, and to your "
"surprise you were extremely good at it.  It was like the electronics you "
"built just spoke to you, like you could see inside the wires and circuits, "
"and then when the sky broke that literally came true."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Magician" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Ever since you were a young kid, you just loved magic.  Growing up you "
"managed to become a professional magician and even performed at a few big "
"shows.  You were practicing a new trick when the Cataclysm hit, when you "
"realized you don't need to practice anymore.  You can just do it, for real."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Firestarter" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Fire always fascinated you.  The fires you set almost got you arrested a few "
"times, but the urge was just too powerful.  It was like they were calling to "
"you, urging you to create them.  And ever since the sky broke, you can create "
"fire with merely a thought."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Test Subject, Project ONYX LIGHTNING" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Before the Cataclysm, you were 'volunteered' for a top-secret military "
"project.  They never told you what all the injections and EEGs and hours of "
"staring at a quarter on the table were supposed to accomplish, but now that "
"you can move things with your mind you have a pretty good idea what they were "
"aiming at."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Government Interrogator (DECEASED)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You did not die in the Cataclysm because on paper, you are already dead.  You "
"assumed a new identity as part of an experimental program designed to produce "
"psychic interrogators.  They told you that you were serving your country, "
"that your gifts would be the key to winning the new Cold War that was surely "
"developing, but they didn't consider the ramifications of having a telepath "
"on the base.  You knew right away that things were much worse than the brass "
"was telling you, and your gifts let you \"persuade\" the guards to let you "
"out even in the face of the lockdown.  You had thought to go somewhere else, "
"to get away from New England, but the end came much faster than even you "
"thought it would."
msgstr ""
"No moriste en el Cataclismo porque en teoría, ya estabas muerto. Adoptaste "
"una nueva identidad como parte de un programa experimental diseñado para "
"producir interrogadores psíquicos. Te dijeron que estabas sirviendo a tu "
"país, que tus habilidades serían la clave para ganar la nueva Guerra Fría que "
"seguramente se estaba desarrollando, pero no consideraron las ramificaciones "
"de tener un telepático en la base. Te diste cuenta de inmediato que las cosas "
"eran mucho peores de lo que tus superiores te decían, y tus habilidades te "
"permitieron \"persuadir\" a los guardias para que te dejaran salir incluso en "
"medio del confinamiento. Habías pensado en ir a otro lugar, alejarte de Nueva "
"Inglaterra, pero el fin llegó mucho más rápido de lo que incluso tú pensabas "
"que lo haría."

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Itzcuāuhtli Corps Liaison, Yohualli Ehēcatl
#. Division" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"The last thing you remember was inputting the jump coordinates into the "
"tliltilhuicaātl drive and reaching out to initiate the transfer when there "
"was a power surge and it felt like the entire ship was turning inside out.  "
"Now, you have no idea where you are."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Faith Healer" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"People came to you for diseases that modern medicine told them were "
"incurable, and you made them well.  At least, they felt well, and that was "
"what mattered.  Now the dead walk and do not respond to your exhortations, "
"but your healing works better on yourself than it ever has on anyone else."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Cuāuhpilli Special Forces" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were on guard duty when the ship was preparing to enter Tliltilhuicaātl "
"and had just braced for the jump when something went wrong.  The ship seemed "
"like it was turning inside out, then you seemed like you were turning inside "
"out, and suddenly you were planetside in the ruins of a dying world.  You've "
"served the Excān Tlahtōlōyān on a dozen worlds, taken five captives, and even "
"have clearance for contact with huecachane civilizations, but none of that "
"has prepared you for the Cataclysm"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mod_interactions/xedra_evolved/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Mobile Task Force: Psi 7 "Sleepwalkers"" for
#. male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"As a member of Psi 7, your job was to take out the dangerous rogue psychics "
"that popped up with increasing frequency as the strangeness in the world "
"increased.  Even before the end of the world you had seen enough bizarre "
"things to write a dozen books, but nothing compares to what you've seen "
"during the Cataclysm."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Sugar Boy" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You're a human shaped candy brought to life under unknown circumstances.  You "
"have your whole life ahead of you and it's gonna be sweet!"
msgstr ""
"Eres un caramelo con forma humana que cobra vida en circunstancias "
"desconocidas. ¡Tienes toda la vida por delante y va a ser dulce!"

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/mod_interactions/xedra_evolved/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Werewolf, Natural-born (Species)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You had no idea what was going on the first time it happened, when you woke "
"up with mud on your bare feet and a sour taste in your mouth, but you were "
"soon found.  The People of the Moon, they called themselves, and they said "
"you were one of them.  A werewolf.  You lived out in the wilderness for a "
"while but didn't entirely abandon human civilization, and when the Cataclysm "
"hit you ignored the evacuation warnings and struck it out on your own.  Maybe "
"some of the People are still out there."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/mod_interactions/xedra_evolved/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Lilit (Species)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"For most or all of your life, you've had a secret; you are a predator.  While "
"you don't need to drink blood or eat flesh or anything so crude, you must "
"absorb the spiritual essence, the \"ruach\", of living beings in order to "
"maintain your health and vitality.  You had to hide your condition before the "
"Cataclysm, especially as things became stranger in the years leading up to "
"it, but now you don't have to hide anymore.  On the other hand, your "
"potential ruach supply has taken a drastic decline."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/mod_interactions/xedra_evolved/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Vampire" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"As if the world ending and you being stranded on some flying island away from "
"everything wasn't bad enough, you now feel a growing hunger for the blood of "
"others.  Whether you decide to try and cure it or see what abilities can be "
"gained from this condition is up to you."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Standard_Combat_Tests/modinfo.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Day 1" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid "Starter evacuee gear, no skills - probably not going to have a good time."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Standard_Combat_Tests/modinfo.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Midgame" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Scavenged armor and mid-range skills, meant to represent an established "
"survivor before making the jump to (self)-fabricated custom gear."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Standard_Combat_Tests/modinfo.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Lategame" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid "Heavy (survivor pneumatic) post-Cataclysm gear, excluding rare lootables."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mod_interactions/innawood/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Ierde" for male
#. ~ Description of profession "Arvi" for male
#. ~ Description of profession "Onduine" for male
#. ~ Description of profession "Kéményseprő" for male
#. ~ Description of profession "Dúln" for male
#. ~ Description of profession "Silvestris" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You are the spirit of a place that slowly gained sentience, a genius loci, "
"born alone in the wilderness.  With no parents, no kin, and no guidance, it's "
"up to you to make your own way in the world."
msgstr ""
"Eres el espíritu de un lugar que poco a poco ha ido adquiriendo conciencia, "
"un genius loci, nacido solo en medio de la naturaleza salvaje. Sin padres, "
"sin familiares y sin guía, depende de ti abrirte camino en el mundo."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Unknowing Changeling, Noble (Species)" for
#. male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You grew up thinking you were human, just another person among billions, but "
"you were born Under the Hill and swapped for a human baby shortly after "
"birth.  Your parents were the nobility of the Fair Folk, the great lords and "
"ladies who traveled in spider-silk carriages on roads built of moonbeams and "
"danced the unending nights away before leading fantastic armies in battle the "
"next morning.  When the Cataclysm hit, your parents' slumbering power "
"asserted itself, giving you access to a portion of their fae magick.  "
"Hopefully it will help you survive."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Unknowing Changeling, Commoner (Species)" for
#. male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You grew up thinking you were human, just another person among billions, but "
"you were born Under the Hill and swapped for a human baby shortly after "
"birth.  Your parents come from the common masses of the Fair Folk, the pooka, "
"redcaps, hobgoblins, trow, pixies, knockers, selkies, or any of the myriad of "
"others.  When the Cataclysm hit, your parents' slumbering power asserted "
"itself, revealing your heritage and giving you access to a portion of their "
"fae magick.  Hopefully it will help you survive."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_playable_gracken.json
#. ~ Description of profession "XE843 'Gracken' (Species)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Species XE843 is how the Xedra scientists identified your people before they "
"learned your people could speak to them after enough time around them to "
"develop a way to communicate.  They had little idea that communication is "
"your people's survival trait, coming from a much harsher environment than the "
"humans are…were blessed with, you can make allies with almost any thinking "
"being.  You informed the Xedra people of your race's name 'Gracken' but you "
"didn't tell them that most of your people they found were larval forms and "
"lacking access to the shadow materials needed would never grow up into an "
"adult form.  Now the humans' world is as deadly or moreso than your home and "
"the way back is mostly closed.  Time to try and find a route home that "
"wouldn't be a death sentence, or see what this world has to offer."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Awakened Eater" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Ever since the Cataclysm you've been able to clearly see elements of other "
"realities that have intruded your own.  You also are able to consume a "
"resource they seem to have brought with them to give you power far beyond a "
"normal human."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Awakened Dreamer" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Ever since the Cataclysm you've become far more aware of the weakened gap "
"between realities.  Specifically, of what is on the other side.  "
"Surprisingly, it doesn't seem universally hostile, and you think you'd be "
"able to bring some of these entities over if you desired."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Awakened Inventor" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Ever since the Cataclysm you've begun having crazy ideas on how to create "
"technological devices.  While conventional logic would label these designs as "
"silly or even insane, something tells you that they'd work regardless."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Awakened Dreamsmith" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Ever since the Cataclysm you've gained an instinctive sense of how to work "
"dreamdross into tools and armor.  It will still take some effort to put these "
"vague ideas to proper use."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Dhampir (Species)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"One of your parents was always a little odd.  They stayed out of the sun as "
"much as they could, their eyes were a bit of an odd color, and they vanished "
"without a trace before you grew old enough to ask them why they left the room "
"every time you got a scrape that drew blood.  But now that you're older, you "
"understand.  You are the child of a vampire, and have inherited a small "
"portion of their power."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Paraclesian Birth" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"By dint of your birth you already have some knowledge of how the universe "
"really works."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Born with the gift of gab." for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've never met another person but already you are ready for the "
"conversations that will ensue."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Knack of formless movement." for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Water takes on the shape of whatever opening is given to it.  You were born "
"with this knowledge and way of moving."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Everywhere and nowhere." for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Air expands to fill every space it encounters and by filling the space it "
"becomes diffuse and impossible to grasp.  Would you slip through the fingers "
"of those who grasp at you?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Born a seedbearer." for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"A gift from your birth world?  A quirk of nature?  For reasons unknown to "
"you, you can sprout seeds from this planet.  You can't control what seeds you "
"get, however."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Fire dances with itself." for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"At your birth you already danced a flaming path, enthralled with your own "
"capacity for destruction and change."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "What does the stone dream of?" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Before you were born, your thoughts and dreams were those of stone.  When "
"this world sucks you into it's highs and lows, you can remember the eternity "
"that is stone."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "FBI Paranormal Investigator" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Before the Cataclysm, you used to work for the Paranormal Investigation "
"Department of the FBI.  You got used to jokes at your expense, as well as "
"being constantly underfunded and disregarded by your superiors.  You were "
"returning from yet another case with nothing but a bag of suspicious candies "
"to show, when all hell broke loose.  Oh well, at least now you can be certain "
"that everyone still alive will believe you that the truth is out there."
msgstr ""
"Antes del Cataclismo, trabajabas para el Departamento de Investigación "
"Paranormal del FBI. Te habías acostumbrado a las bromas por tu cuenta, así "
"como a la constante falta de fondos y a que tus superiores no te tuvieran en "
"cuenta. Volvías de otro caso sin nada más que una bolsa de caramelos "
"sospechosos, cuando se desató el infierno. Oh, bueno, al menos ahora puedes "
"estar seguro de que todos los que siguen vivos creerán que la verdad está ahí "
"fuera."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Xedra Response Team Member" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Before Xedra recruited you, you probably worked for the ATF or a PMC like "
"Kroll.  It was your job to investigate any cross-pollination incidents where "
"alternate physics regions crossed over the Nether and reached our world.  "
"Part exterminator part investigator, you made sure that any new resources and "
"contaminants were accounted for, including any intelligent life trying to "
"sneak into our world.  Local law enforcement and civilians called you "
"'Zebras' since your identification and badges only had a barcode instead of "
"any name/rank/number.  This job has shown you things you don't want to "
"remember but luckily the Zebra docs seem to have an endless supply of pills."
msgstr ""
"Antes de que Xedra te reclutara, probablemente trabajabas para la ATF o una "
"PMC como Kroll. Tu trabajo consistía en investigar cualquier incidente de "
"polinización cruzada en el que regiones de física alternativa cruzaban al "
"Inframundo y alcanzaban nuestro mundo. En parte exterminador y en parte "
"investigador, te asegurabas de que se tuvieran en cuenta los nuevos recursos "
"y contaminantes, incluida cualquier vida inteligente que intentara colarse en "
"nuestro mundo. Las fuerzas de seguridad locales y los civiles os llamaban "
"'Cebras', ya que vuestras identificaciones y placas sólo tenían un código de "
"barras en lugar de un nombre, rango o número. Este trabajo os ha enseñado "
"cosas que no queréis recordar, pero por suerte los médicos cebra parecen "
"tener un suministro inagotable de pastillas."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Foreign Agent" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You came here from another country trying to gain access to secrets the "
"United States had ripped from other worlds.  They probably had sent people to "
"your homeland to do the same.  You were out performing recon when the "
"Cataclysm struck and caught a ride with a stranger trying to find safety.  "
"Sadly you lost your companion and vehicle, getting lost in the process and "
"with now only a vague idea on how to get back to the safehouse, where you "
"hope your hidden gear remains untouched."
msgstr ""
"Llegaste aquí desde otro país intentando acceder a secretos que Estados "
"Unidos había arrancado de otros mundos. Probablemente habían enviado gente a "
"tu tierra natal para hacer lo mismo. Estabas realizando labores de "
"reconocimiento cuando se produjo el Cataclismo y te encontraste con un "
"desconocido que intentaba ponerte a salvo. Desgraciadamente, perdiste a tu "
"compañero y tu vehículo, y ahora sólo tienes una vaga idea de cómo volver al "
"refugio, donde esperas que tu equipo oculto permanezca intacto."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Xedra Offworld Team: Jotunn Hunter" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Part of Xedra's Offworld Acquisitions group, you specialized in tracking, "
"killing and retrieving useful components from the cyborg tribes that seem to "
"exist on some of the worlds Xedra had access to.  Do you feel guilt about "
"bringing back the cybernetic components that are now inside you or your "
"teammates?  Or do you worry that now they might be on this world hunting you? "
" You've lost your sidearm and spent half of your heavy ordnance.  Worst of "
"all, you're out of smokes."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Xedra Offworld Team: Big Game Hunter" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You are what Xedra refers to as a non-local guide.  A mature Gracken hired on "
"to join the Offworld Acquisitions Team, you trained in human long distance "
"weaponry in order to take down big game and create new improvements to bring "
"back to your people.  They gave you a big gun and a little training in how to "
"use it and in return you help them know what things in other dimensions to "
"hunt and what to run from."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Xedra Offworld Team: Troll Slayer" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Part of Xedra's Offworld Acquisitions team, you were sent to gather "
"biological specimens, they often objected strenuously to being gathered.  "
"You've got some CBMs in you but understand they probably came out of someone "
"that might have friends."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Xedra Offworld Team: Specter" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Part of Xedra's Offworld Acquisitions team, you were trained to infiltrate "
"any human compatible cultures that were discovered.  You never found any with "
"technology worth stealing and you aren't sure what that says about humanity."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Mobile Task Force: Upsilon 4 "Devourers"" for
#. male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Being part of Upsilon 4, you were always at the front of your unit, "
"protecting other operatives from danger ahead using your eater's abilities.  "
"This one was no different, but something went really wrong."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Mobile Task Force: Theta 1 "Middle-
#. Management"" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Theta 1, also known as \"kindergarten\" between other task forces, is used "
"when missions are expected to be too dangerous to send people or when "
"reconnaissance can't obtain any important information about the target, which "
"is why otherworldly creatures, summoned by dreamers, are sent.  It's not the "
"best course of action, but the unit's nearly zero fatality rate makes it "
"worth using."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Mobile Task Force: Nu 3 "Techno Savvy"" for
#. male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Despite the \"Task Force\" in their name, Nu 3 is rarely called into the "
"actual mission; their main task is reconnaissance and developing tools to "
"support another task force, even if these tools last only a few weeks.  But "
"when they do accept a task, it's almost guaranteed to be successful.  It "
"should've been your first day here, but something went really wrong."
msgstr ""
"A pesar de \"Grupo Operativo\" en su nombre, Nu 3 rara vez es convocado a una "
"misión real; su tarea principal es el reconocimiento y el desarrollo de "
"herramientas para apoyar a otro grupo operativo, incluso si estas "
"herramientas duran sólo unas pocas semanas. Pero cuando aceptan una tarea, el "
"éxito está casi garantizado. Debería haber sido su primer día aquí, pero algo "
"salió muy mal."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Mobile Task Force: Tau 8 "Anvil"" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Sharing the same problem with Nu 3, dreamsmiths from Tau 8 are not called on "
"the operation very often, and their main work looks really medieval.  Despite "
"this, they are really popular among other branches, as their tools and armor "
"have everything a modern soldier can dream of."
msgstr ""
"Compartiendo el mismo problema con Nu 3, los herreros de sueños de Tau 8 no "
"son llamados a la operación muy a menudo, y su trabajo principal parece "
"realmente medieval. A pesar de ello, son realmente populares entre otras "
"ramas, ya que sus herramientas y armaduras tienen todo lo que un soldado "
"moderno puede soñar."

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "XEDRA Operative, Department of Extra-Normal
#. Capabilities, SATOR Division" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You joined XEDRA during the years leading up to the Cataclysm, and they told "
"you that you fit the profile of a SATOR agent.  At the time you had no idea "
"what they meant, and they gave you a couple days to process when you learned "
"that magic was real, the enemies of the United States possessed it, and they "
"wanted you to learn it too.  When they sat you down and had you practice "
"writing letters into patterns for days on end you wondered if you had made a "
"mistake, but when one of those squares let you summon a loaf of bread out of "
"thin air for lunch, you changed your tune pretty quickly."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Ierde" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"With the dimensional spillage that preceded the Cataclysm you are the spirit "
"of a place that slowly gained sentience, a genius loci.  As the world "
"reshapes itself you have decided to wander from your birthplace and determine "
"where you will end up.\n"
"\n"
"As a spirit of the earth, your powers are strengthened by contact with the "
"soil and the rock and weakened by separation from the living earth."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Arvi" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"With the dimensional spillage that preceded the Cataclysm you are the spirit "
"of a place that slowly gained sentience, a genius loci.  As the world "
"reshapes itself you have decided to wander from your birthplace and determine "
"where you will end up.\n"
"\n"
"As a spirit of the forest, your powers are strengthened by the wild places "
"and weakened within the constructs of humanity."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Onduine" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"With the dimensional spillage that preceded the Cataclysm you are the spirit "
"of a place that slowly gained sentience, a genius loci.  As the world "
"reshapes itself you have decided to wander from your birthplace and determine "
"where you will end up.\n"
"\n"
"As a spirit of the lakes and rivers, your powers are strengthened when you "
"are surrounded by water and weakened when you spend too long away from the "
"water."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Kéményseprő" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"With the dimensional spillage that preceded the Cataclysm you are the spirit "
"of a place that slowly gained sentience, a genius loci.  As the world "
"reshapes itself you have decided to wander from your birthplace and determine "
"where you will end up.\n"
"\n"
"As a spirit of the flames, your powers are strengthened when among heat and "
"fire and weakened by the cold."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Dúln" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"With the dimensional spillage that preceded the Cataclysm you are the spirit "
"of a place that slowly gained sentience, a genius loci.  As the world "
"reshapes itself you have decided to wander from your birthplace and determine "
"where you will end up.\n"
"\n"
"As a spirit of humanity, your powers are strengthened when among humankind or "
"in the remnants of civilization and weakened when in the wilderness."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Silvestris" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"With the dimensional spillage that preceded the Cataclysm you are the spirit "
"of a place that slowly gained sentience, a genius loci.  As the world "
"reshapes itself you have decided to wander from your birthplace and determine "
"where you will end up.\n"
"\n"
"As a spirit of the winds, your powers are strengthened when under the open "
"sky and weakened when indoors or underground."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Hedge Wizard" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"In the years and decades leading up to the Cataclysm, things got weirder and "
"weirder.  The government tried their best to cover it up but they couldn't "
"entirely stop all knowledge from leaking out.  You were one of the people who "
"responded to the weirdness by becoming weird yourself; you spent time combing "
"through old books and found some of the charms and spells written in them "
"actually worked.  When you had the right ingredients and were in the right "
"place, you could make the impossible possible.  Maybe lighting a fire without "
"a match won't help you kill a zombie, but it's kept you warm and safe when "
"you're sure other survivors had to shiver as the night closed in."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Skinchanger (Bear)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Perhaps you were the member of a cult, or a strange family legacy, or maybe "
"you just stumbled on a book that probably shouldn't have been left where you "
"could find it.  Regardless, you have the ability to turn into an animal when "
"you kill it and make a talisman out of its bones and skin.  Every change "
"requires a death, but with so much death already since the Cataclysm, what's "
"a little bit more?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Cryptid Hunter" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You spent months trying to find one of these elusive creatures, searching all "
"over the country in the hopes of proving beyond doubt that they exist.  You "
"recently found enough trustworthy information to write down a map that will "
"certainly lead you to a cryptid.  Now that the supernatural is undeniable you "
"feel that you should find a cryptid anyway, if only to say that you didn't do "
"all this work for nothing."
msgstr ""
"Has pasado meses intentando encontrar a una de estas escurridizas criaturas, "
"buscando por todo el país con la esperanza de demostrar sin lugar a dudas que "
"existen. Hace poco encontraste suficiente información fidedigna para anotar "
"un mapa que sin duda te llevará hasta un críptido. Ahora que lo sobrenatural "
"es innegable, crees que deberías encontrar un críptido de todos modos, aunque "
"sólo sea para decir que no has hecho todo este trabajo en balde."

#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/profession_groups.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Standard Bionic Interface" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Like most people on Salus IV you have previously received cybernetic "
"enhancement to make life easier.  Your enhancements include a universal data "
"link, some basic power storage, and a charging cable to top up."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/innawood/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Goat Man" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Nobody around?  Oh well, it doesn't matter.  Your beloved goats are all you "
"need!"
msgstr ""
"¿No hay nadie cerca? Uh, bueno, no importa. ¡Tus queridas cabras es lo único "
"que necesitás!"

#: data/mods/innawood/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Lost Tribal" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were out gathering for the tribe when the sky broke and the gods called "
"to you, then you collapsed.  When you woke up, you were in an unfamiliar "
"place with new memories crowding your thoughts."
msgstr ""
"Estabas fuera en favor de la tribu cuando el cielo se rompió y los dioses te "
"llamaron, entonces te desmayaste. Cuando despertaste, estabas en un lugar "
"desconocido con nuevos recuerdos que se agolpaban en tus pensamientos."

#: data/mods/innawood/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Shaman" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've trained in the medical arts, refining natural remedies into real cures "
"for disease.  Your tribe would have lived long and healthy lives, were they "
"still here."
msgstr ""
"Te entrenastes en las artes médicas, refinando remedios naturales en curas "
"reales para las enfermedades. Tu tribu habría vivido una vida larga y "
"saludable, si aún estuvieran aquí."

#: data/mods/innawood/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Backpacker" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"For the past few years you've been traveling the world, sightseeing and "
"living off tribal donations.  You came home to find your home abandoned, and "
"the only thing between you and death is the open fields and your pack."
msgstr ""
"Durante los últimos años estuviste viajando por el mundo, haciendo turismo y "
"viviendo de las donaciones de la tribu. Volviste a tu casa y la encontraste "
"abandonada, y la única cosa entre vos y la muerte eran los campos abiertos y "
"tu mochila."

#: data/mods/innawood/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Miner" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You're a miner, not a minor!  Your waterskin is dry, you lost your haul, and "
"you're on your last torch…"
msgstr ""
"¡Eres minero, no menor! Tu odre está seco, perdiste tu botín y ahora solo te "
"queda esta antorcha…"

#: data/mods/innawood/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Spear Hunter" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Ever since you were a child you loved hunting, and quickly developed a talent "
"for chasing down your prey with a spear.  Why, if the world ended, there's "
"nothing you'd want at your side more than your trusty spear.  So, when it "
"did, you made sure to bring it along."
msgstr ""
"Desde que eras un niño te encantaba cazar, y rápidamente desarrollaste un "
"talento para perseguir a tu presa con una lanza. Si el mundo se acabara, nada "
"te gustaría más a tu lado que tu fiel lanza. Así que, cuando ocurrió, te "
"aseguraste de llevarla contigo."

#: data/mods/innawood/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Javelin Hunter" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Ever since you were a child you loved hunting, and quickly developed a talent "
"for javelin throwing.  Why, if the world ended, there's nothing you'd want at "
"your side more than your trusty javelins.  So, when it did, you made sure to "
"bring them along."
msgstr ""
"Desde que eras niño te encantaba cazar, y rápidamente desarrollaste un "
"talento para lanzar jabalinas. Si el mundo se acabara, nada te gustaría más a "
"tu lado que tus fieles jabalinas. Así que, cuando ocurrió, te aseguraste de "
"llevarlas contigo."

#: data/mods/innawood/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Canoe Fisherman" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You spent most of your days fishing in lakes and swamps, getting by quietly "
"on your catch.  While you've wandered from your canoe, you can't resist "
"coming back for another catch."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/innawood/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Redsmith" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You ran into trouble coming out from your forge, but despite the havoc you've "
"managed to keep some of your equipment along with your latest project."
msgstr ""
"Te encontraste con problemas cuando salías de tu forja, pero a pesar del caos "
"pudiste quedarte con parte de tu equipo junto con tu último proyecto."

#: data/mods/innawood/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Lumberjack" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You're a lumberjack, and you're okay.  You felled trees before the world "
"ended, and you suspect the undead aren't nearly as tough."
msgstr ""
"Eres leñador y estás bien. Talabas árboles antes de que el mundo se "
"terminara, pero sospechas que los muertos vivientes no serán tan resistentes."

#: data/mods/innawood/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Musician" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You nailed your solo, but the audience erupted into screams instead of "
"applause.  You weren't able to grab much during the panic, but at least you "
"have your flute in your basket."
msgstr ""
"Has tocado bien el solo, pero el público ha gritado en vez de aplaudir. No "
"pudiste agarrar mucho durante el pánico, pero al menos tienes la flauta en tu "
"cesta."

#: data/mods/innawood/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Tribal Warrior Recruit" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Joining the tribal guard has been your dream for years.  You finally got in, "
"just in time for your training to get interrupted by some sort of emergency.  "
"As far as you can tell, the elders abandoned you in this hellhole when you "
"missed the emergency evac."
msgstr ""
"Entrar en la guardia tribal ha sido tu sueño durante años. Por fin entraste, "
"justo a tiempo para que tu entrenamiento se viera interrumpido por algún tipo "
"de emergencia. Por lo que sabes, los ancianos te abandonaron en este infierno "
"cuando te perdiste la evacuación de emergencia."

#: data/mods/innawood/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Tribal Swordsman" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"As a member of your tribe's elite guard, you sharpened your swordsmanship to "
"the best that you could.  Now, you're a rōnin of the woods."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/innawood/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Tribal Arbalist" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"From your first hunt, you showed talent with a crossbow.  While the tribe was "
"well guarded by your aim, you're all alone now."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/innawood/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Native Settler" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were on the road with friends from your tribe to search for a new "
"settlement spot when you seemed to be yanked somewhere completely different.  "
"You see no sign of your friends, but at least you got your equipment and some "
"seeds with you."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/innawood/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Carpenter" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Living under your craftsmanship, the tribe was no longer bound to caves lest "
"they freeze in the night.  You won't have to work nearly as hard for just "
"yourself."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/innawood/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Bricklayer" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Using the earth and organic material to create durable, insulated adobe kept "
"your trade in high demand in your tribe.  Now alone, you only need to look "
"out for yourself."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/package_bionic_professions/bionic_professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Bionic Athlete" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You'll never get your shot at the Cyberolympics.  All that's left of your "
"dream is a single leftover protein shake.  Well, that and your bulging, "
"cybernetically-enhanced muscles."
msgstr ""
"Nunca tendrás tu oportunidad en las Ciberolimpiadas. Todo lo que queda de tu "
"sueño es un único batido de proteínas sobrante. Bueno, eso y tus abultados "
"músculos mejorados cibernéticamente."

#: data/mods/package_bionic_professions/bionic_professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Bionic Police Officer" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Mortally injured in the line of duty, you were resurrected by the surgeons "
"from the department's revolutionary Cybercop program.  Now, in these lawless "
"times, you are truly the future of law enforcement."
msgstr ""
"Mortalmente herido en el cumplimiento del deber, fuiste resucitado por los "
"cirujanos del programa del departamento revolucionario de Ciberpolicías. "
"Ahora, en estos tiempos sin leyes, eres verdaderamente el futuro de las "
"fuerzas de la ley."

#: data/mods/package_bionic_professions/bionic_professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Commercial Cyborg" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You always had to have the latest and best gadgets and gizmos, so is it any "
"wonder that you upgraded your flesh along with your smart phone?"
msgstr ""
"Siempre has tenido que tener los últimos y mejores gadgets y artilugios, así "
"que ¿es de extrañar que hayas actualizado tu carne junto con tu teléfono "
"inteligente?"

#: data/mods/package_bionic_professions/bionic_professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Bionic Firefighter" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"As a second-generation augmented firefighter, you have been cybernetically "
"enhanced to operate in the most dire of emergency situations.  You're pretty "
"sure this counts."
msgstr ""
"Como bombero aumentado de segunda generación, has sido mejorado "
"cibernéticamente para actuar en las situaciones de emergencia más graves. "
"Estás seguro de que esto cuenta."

#: data/mods/package_bionic_professions/bionic_professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Bionic Game Master" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You came into a large fortune, through luck or will, and hosted games for "
"world-famous celebrities.  You could afford to spoil your players, and so you "
"did.  You invested in bionics to make you smarter and memorized the entire "
"handbook.  Let's hope that knowledge helps you now."
msgstr ""
"Te hiciste con una gran fortuna, por suerte o por voluntad, y organizaste "
"juegos para celebridades de fama mundial. Podías permitirte mimar a tus "
"jugadores, y así lo hiciste. Invertiste en biónica para hacerte más "
"inteligente y memorizaste el manual entero. Esperemos que ese conocimiento te "
"ayude ahora."

#: data/mods/package_bionic_professions/bionic_professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Bionic Gangster" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were the boss's favorite, their protege; they always counted on you to "
"get the toughest jobs done.  They invested in \"basic\" augments and the best "
"gear on the market in preparation for your biggest hit yet.  Sadly, you came "
"out of surgery to find your whole gang had been eaten."
msgstr ""
"Eras el favorito del jefe, su protegido; siempre contaban contigo para "
"realizar los trabajos más duros. Invirtieron en aumentos \"básicos\" y en el "
"mejor equipo del mercado para preparar tu mayor golpe. Tristemente, al salir "
"del quirófano descubriste que toda tu banda había sido devorada."

#: data/mods/package_bionic_professions/bionic_professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Bionic Assassin" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"The product of millions of dollars of clandestine research, you are a bionic "
"sleeper agent capable of silently engaging your target while maintaining an "
"innocuous appearance.  Your handler cut all contact a week ago."
msgstr ""
"Producto de millones de dólares de investigación clandestina, eres un agente "
"durmiente biónico capaz de atacar silenciosamente a tu objetivo manteniendo "
"una apariencia inocua. Tu controlador cortó todo contacto hace una semana."

#: data/mods/package_bionic_professions/bionic_professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Augmentation Associate" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"When bionics first emerged, you were quick to make them into your career, and "
"spent your days overseeing their installation.  That makes you one of the few "
"non-zombies in the world that can calibrate an Autodoc, which might come in "
"handy."
msgstr ""
"Cuando aparecieron los biónicos por primera vez, te apresuraste a "
"convertirlos en tu carrera, y pasaste tus días supervisando su instalación. "
"Eso te convierte en uno de los pocos no zombis del mundo que puede calibrar "
"un Autodoc, lo que podría resultar útil."

#: data/mods/package_bionic_professions/bionic_professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Bionic Surgeon" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"As one of the top surgeons in the country, you were chosen for an "
"augmentation program to expand the medical field.  With your expertise and "
"augmentations, you can perform precise surgery with little assistance."
msgstr ""
"Como uno de los mejores cirujanos del país, fuiste elegido para un programa "
"de aumentos para expandir el campo de la medicina. Con tu experiencia y los "
"aumentos, puedes realizar cirugías de precisión con poca ayuda."

#: data/mods/package_bionic_professions/bionic_professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Bionic Boffin" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were employed by a major international corporation as a representative "
"and technical advisor, utilizing the incredible power of your cybernetically "
"augmented mind."
msgstr ""
"Una importante corporación internacional te contrató como representante y "
"asesor técnico, utilizando el increíble poder de tu mente aumentada "
"cibernéticamente."

#: data/mods/package_bionic_professions/bionic_professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Bionic Patient" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"When the diagnosis came back positive, you signed up for a series of "
"experimental bionic surgeries that saved your life.  Now you're healthier "
"than you ever were before, thanks to a suite of bionic systems powered by "
"your own metabolic functions.  Make the most of your second chance at life."
msgstr ""
"Cuando el diagnóstico fue positivo, te apuntaste a una serie de cirugías "
"biónicas experimentales que te salvaron la vida. Ahora estás más sano que "
"nunca, gracias a un conjunto de sistemas biónicos alimentados por tus propias "
"funciones metabólicas. Aprovecha al máximo tu segunda oportunidad en la vida."

#: data/mods/package_bionic_professions/bionic_professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Bionic Prepper" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You knew the end was coming.  You augmented yourself with some basic bionic "
"tools and underwent extensive survival training.  Now the end has come, and "
"it is time to see if your efforts have paid off."
msgstr ""
"Sabías que se acercaba el final. Te has dotado de algunas herramientas "
"biónicas básicas y te has sometido a un exhaustivo entrenamiento de "
"supervivencia. Ahora ha llegado el final, y es hora de ver si tus esfuerzos "
"han merecido la pena."

#: data/mods/package_bionic_professions/bionic_professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Bionic Runner" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were the kind of sportsman who couldn't get off the track.  You love "
"running, and you enhanced your body with cybernetics to go even faster.  Now "
"there's plenty to run from - this is your kind of game."
msgstr ""
"Eras el tipo de deportista que no podía salir de la pista. Te encanta correr "
"y mejoraste tu cuerpo con cibernética para ir aún más rápido. Ahora hay mucho "
"que correr: este es tu tipo de juego."

#: data/mods/package_bionic_professions/bionic_professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Bionic Sniper" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"A top-secret military program sought to convert you into the perfect sniper.  "
"Your bionics, equipment, and extensive field training enable you to drop "
"targets from implausible distances, even after weeks of total isolation in "
"enemy territory."
msgstr ""
"Un programa militar ultrasecreto pretendía convertirte en el francotirador "
"perfecto. Tu biónica, tu equipo y tu extenso entrenamiento de campo te "
"permiten abatir objetivos desde distancias inverosímiles, incluso tras "
"semanas de total aislamiento en territorio enemigo."

#: data/mods/package_bionic_professions/bionic_professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Bionic Soldier" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You are the result of one of the military's last research programs: a "
"prototype cyborg soldier.  The wars they expected you to fight have become "
"obsolete, but war never changes."
msgstr ""
"Eres el resultado de uno de los últimos programas de investigación del "
"ejército: un prototipo de soldado cíborg. Las guerras que esperaban que "
"combatieras se han quedado obsoletas, pero la guerra nunca cambia."

#: data/mods/package_bionic_professions/bionic_professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Bionic Agent" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Your body conceals several bionic components, worth millions of dollars in "
"public taxes.  The government turned you into an infiltration and recon "
"specialist: you have night vision, an alarm, lock picking capabilities and a "
"hacking module."
msgstr ""
"Tu cuerpo esconde varios componentes biónicos, valorados en millones de "
"dólares en impuestos públicos. El gobierno te convirtió en un especialista en "
"infiltración y reconocimiento: tienes visión nocturna, una alarma, capacidad "
"de abrir cerraduras y un módulo de hackeo."

#: data/mods/package_bionic_professions/bionic_professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Bionic Student" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Your parents were so obsessed with making sure you aced every test that they "
"had you outfitted with bionics to enhance your intellect and memory.  Now "
"you're facing the hardest test yet, and you're not sure if those are the "
"right kind of tools for the job."
msgstr ""
"Tus padres estaban tan obsesionados con que aprobaras todos los exámenes que "
"te equiparon con biónica para mejorar tu intelecto y tu memoria. Ahora te "
"enfrentas a la prueba más difícil, y no estás seguro de que esas sean las "
"herramientas adecuadas para el trabajo."

#: data/mods/package_bionic_professions/bionic_professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Bionic Thief" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Impeccable style and a few bionic tricks up your sleeve have seen you pull "
"off a string of daring, high-profile heists.  The cops would love to get "
"their hands on you, but seem otherwise occupied."
msgstr ""
"Un estilo impecable y unos cuantos trucos biónicos en la manga te han "
"permitido llevar a cabo una serie de atrevidos atracos de alto nivel. A la "
"policía le encantaría echarte el guante, pero parece estar ocupada."

#: data/mods/package_bionic_professions/bionic_professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Industrial Cyborg" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"For better or for worse, bionic augmentation has turned you into a walking "
"power tool.  Upgraded with a standard industrial-grade manual labor surgery "
"and training package, you are augmented with bionic muscles and an integrated "
"toolset, both powered by standard batteries."
msgstr ""
"Para mejor o para peor, las alteraciones biónicas te han convertido en una "
"herramienta eléctrica con patas. Mejorado con cirugía de grado industrial y "
"un paquete de entrenamiento, se te ha instalado musculatura biónica y una "
"caja de herramientas, alimentadas con baterías normales."

#: data/mods/package_bionic_professions/bionic_professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Prototype Cyborg" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were normal once.  Before the tests, before the procedures, before they "
"stripped away every outward sign of your humanity.  You're more machine than "
"human now, but that might prove to be an advantage against the horrors that "
"await."
msgstr ""
"Una vez fuiste normal. Antes de las pruebas, antes de los procedimientos, "
"antes de que te quitaran todo signo externo de tu humanidad. Ahora eres más "
"máquina que humano, pero eso puede ser una ventaja contra los horrores que te "
"esperan."

#: data/mods/package_bionic_professions/bionic_professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Cyberjunkie" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Long ago your lifelong infatuation with bionic enhancement lead you into a "
"shady world of back-alley bionic clinics and self-installed secondhand CBMs.  "
"Your posthuman hunger still cries out to be fed; where will you get your "
"bionic fix now?"
msgstr ""
"Hace mucho, tu capricho con las mejoras biónicas te llevó a un mundo oscuro "
"de clínicas biónicas en callejones perdidos y instalaciones manuales de MBCs "
"usados. El mundo cambió pero tu hambre posthumana todavía grita por ser "
"satisfecha. ¿Dónde conseguirás ahora ese repuesto biónico?"

#: data/mods/package_bionic_professions/bionic_professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Bionic Monster" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Completely overtaken by bionic-induced psychosis, you are a deformed "
"posthuman monster, forced to hide in the shadows.  Amidst the desolation, "
"however, even a creature such as yourself might find its niche."
msgstr ""
"Completamente superado por la psicosis inducida por los biónicos, eres un "
"monstruo posthumano deformado, obligado a esconderse en las sombras. Sin "
"embargo, en medio de la desolación, incluso una criatura como tú puede "
"encontrar su lugar."

#: data/mods/package_bionic_professions/bionic_professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Failed Cyborg" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"After a series of surgical mistakes, your body is a wreck of bionic parts.  "
"You have a large capacity for power, but are filled with broken and useless "
"bionics.  Your ethanol power supply still works, at least."
msgstr ""
"Después de una serie de errores quirúrgicos, tu cuerpo es una ruina de partes "
"biónicas. Tienes una gran capacidad de energía, pero estás lleno de biónicos "
"rotos e inútiles. Tu fuente de alimentación de etanol aún funciona, al menos."

#: data/mods/package_bionic_professions/bionic_professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Drone Operator" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You had a job programming machines such as automatic street cleaners, "
"newsbots, and pizza delivery drones.  Bionic implants helped you control them "
"remotely.  Now all the drones carry guns instead of pizza.  At least you "
"still have a… RC car?"
msgstr ""
"Tenías un trabajo programando máquinas como limpiadores de calles "
"automáticos, robots de noticias y drones repartidores de pizza. Los implantes "
"biónicos te ayudaban a controlarlos a distancia. Ahora todos los drones "
"llevan armas en lugar de pizza. Al menos aún tienes un... ¿Coche RC?"

#: data/mods/package_bionic_professions/bionic_professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Razor Boy" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Through a series of painful and expensive surgeries, you became a walking "
"bionic weapon, your services as a mercenary available to the highest bidder."
msgstr ""
"A través de una serie de dolorosas y costosas cirugías, te convertiste en un "
"arma biónica andante, tus servicios como mercenario disponibles al mejor "
"postor."

