"a fully awakened psion, you have a single trick you can use.  Hopefully it "
"helps you survive."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Psychic Knack (Immunostimulus)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
