#: data/mods/innawood/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "In a Cave" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid "Somehow, you found yourself in a cave.  Someone else is with you."
msgstr "De algún modo, te has encontrado en una cueva. Alguien más está contigo."

#: data/mods/innawood/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "A Lonely Cave" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid "Somehow, you found yourself in a cave.  Seems like you're on your own."
msgstr "De alguna manera, te encuentras en una cueva. Parece que estás sola."

#: data/mods/innawood/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Infected" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"In the chaos and panic of evacuation, you got bitten by something!  You "
"didn't get proper medical care, and now the wound has started turning green."
msgstr ""
"Durante el caos y el pánico de la evacuación, ¡fuiste mordido por algo!. No "
"recibiste el cuidado médico adecuado y ahora la herida se ha empezado a poner "
"verde."

#: data/mods/innawood/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Challenge - Bordered" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You have survived the initial wave of panic, and have achieved (relative) "
"safety in a wilderness.  The only thing that really bothers you is a "
"mysterious sky-high wall seen in the distance."
msgstr ""
"Has sobrevivido a la oleada inicial de pánico y has logrado una (relativa) "
"seguridad en la intemperie. Lo único que realmente te preocupa es un "
"misterioso muro lejano que se ve a lo lejos en el cielo."

#: data/mods/innawood/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Ambush" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"It is the winter after zero hour.  As you were scavenging for food and a warm "
"place to stay at, you heard the sound of lots of movement nearby."
msgstr ""
"Es el invierno después de la hora cero. Mientras buscabas comida y un lugar "
"cálido donde alojarte, escuchaste el sonido de movimientos cercanos."

#: data/mods/innawood/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Last Flight" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Once it became clear that the world was ending you took to the skies, hoping "
"that your flying skills could lead you to safety.  During your flight you got "
"lost and had to land on an empty field."
msgstr ""
"Una vez que quedó claro que el mundo se estaba acabando, te lanzaste a los "
"cielos con la esperanza de que tus habilidades de vuelo te llevaran a un "
"lugar seguro. Durante tu vuelo te perdiste y tuviste que aterrizar en un "
"campo vacío."

#: data/mods/innawood/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Wilderness" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You find yourself amongst trees.  The screaming and the moaning is fainter "
"this far from civilization, but you'd better know what you're doing out here."
msgstr ""
"Estás entre árboles. Los gritos y gemidos se escuchan cada vez menos lejos de "
"la civilización, pero vas a necesitar saber cómo cuidarte aquí en lo salvaje."

#: data/mods/innawood/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "Car Crash" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You decided the open road would be a better prospect than the zombie-filled "
"cities.  While en route to your destination, you were involved in a wreck.  "
"When you look around, you can no longer spot the road you were driving on.  "
"Just how hard did you hit your head?"
msgstr ""
"Decidiste que la carretera abierta sería una perspectiva mejor que las "
"ciudades llenas de zombis. Mientras te diriges a tu destino, te ves envuelto "
"en un accidente. Cuando miras a tu alrededor, ya no puedes ver la carretera "
"por la que conducías. ¿Con qué fuerza te has golpeado la cabeza?"

#: data/mods/package_bionic_professions/scenarios.json
#. ~ Description of scenario "High Tech, Low Life" for female
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Before the world ended, bionics were reserved for the rich and the famous.  "
"You might not have been either, but you wanted in.  Hidden offices "
"sequestered away in basements, anesthetic smuggled out of hospitals, and "
"desperate people with little to lose could get you what you wanted.  If you "
"went too deep, however, your augmentation may have come at a price…"
msgstr ""
"Antes de que el mundo terminara, la biónica estaba reservada para los ricos y "
"los famosos. Puede que no fueras ni lo uno ni lo otro pero la querias. "
"Oficinas ocultas aisladas en sótanos, anestesia sacada de contrabando de "
"hospitales, y personas desesperadas con poco que perder podrían conseguirte "
"lo que quieres. Sin embargo, si cruzas la linea, tu aumento puede tener un "
"coste..."

