#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CITY_COP.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"STOP, Put your hands in the air!  Ha, startled you didn't I… there is no law "
"anymore…"
msgstr "¡ALTO, manos arriba! Ja, te he asustado, no... ya no hay ley..."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CITY_COP.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I was watching the station when things went sideways.  None of the other "
"officers returned from the last call, well not as humans anyway…"
msgstr ""
"Estaba vigilando la comisaría cuando las cosas se torcieron. Ninguno de los "
"otros oficiales regresó de la última llamada, bueno, no como humanos..."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CITY_COP.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"This is a nice, secure building.  I'd be a fool to leave.  Been living off "
"the vending machines, but I found the code for the evidence lockup so I've "
"been doing some trading with other survivors."
msgstr ""
"Este es un edificio tranquilo y seguro. Sería un tonto si me fuera. He estado "
"viviendo de las máquinas expendedoras, pero encontré el código para el "
"almacén de pruebas y he estado comerciando con otros supervivientes con ellas."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I… I'm free.  *Zzzt* I'm actually free!  *bzzz* Look, you're the first person "
"I've seen in a long time."
msgstr ""
"Yo... estoy libre. *Zzzt* ¡Realmente estoy libre! *bzzz* Mira, eres la "
"primera persona que veo en mucho tiempo."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_MARLOSS_VOICE.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I'm a priest or guide of a sort.  I sing the hymns along my companions so "
"that we may learn to live in unity, both with each other and with our ailing "
"world."
msgstr ""
"Soy una especie de sacerdote o guía. Canto los himnos junto a mis compañeros "
"para que aprendamos a vivir unidos, tanto entre nosotros como con nuestro "
"mundo enfermo."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_NC_FARMER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I heard it's bad in the cities, back when the radio was still working.  Some "
"of those things came through here.  I want to stay out in the country if I "
"can stay safe."
msgstr ""
"Oí que se estaba muy mal en las ciudades, cuando la radio aún funcionaba. "
"Algunas de esas cosas pasaron por aquí. Quisiera quedarme en el campo si "
"pudiera estar a salvo."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_NC_FARMER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I'm a lot better now, I've been hunkering down here.  Something came by in "
"the night screaming and crying, sounded just like that woman.  Maybe a ghost, "
"I don't know.  It's good to have company again.  You're not a ghost, right?  "
"On second thought, don't tell me if you are, I probably don't want to know."
msgstr ""
"Ahora estoy mucho mejor, me he estado refugiando aquí. Algo pasó por la noche "
"gritando y llorando, sonaba igual que esa mujer. Tal vez un fantasma, no lo "
"sé. Es bueno tener compañía de nuevo. No eres un fantasma, ¿verdad? Aunque "
"pensándolo bien, no me digas si lo eres, probablemente no quiera saberlo."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_NC_FARMER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I grew up on the farm, I don't know much about ghosts and goblins, but I've "
"spent a lot of time growing food and I work hard.  It's better in the "
"country, cleaner.  Not as dangerous.  I hope."
msgstr ""
"Crecí en la granja, no sé mucho de fantasmas y duendes, pero he pasado mucho "
"tiempo cultivando alimentos y trabajo muy duramente. Se está mejor en el "
"campo, más limpio. No es tan peligroso. Al menos eso espero."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "Hey, I didn't expect to live long enough to see another living human!"
msgstr "¡Eh, no esperaba vivir lo suficiente para ver a otro ser humano con vida!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "I've been here since shit went down.  Just my luck I had to work."
msgstr ""
"He estado aquí desde todo se fue a la mierda. Mi suerte es que tenía que "
"trabajar."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Well, the dishwasher made a break for it three days after things got weird.  "
"He was ripped to shreds before he made it to the street.  I figure this place "
"has gotta be safer than my apartment, and at least I've got all this food "
"here."
msgstr ""
"Bueno, el lavavajillas se rompió tres días después de que las cosas se "
"pusieran raras. Fue despedazado antes de llegar a la calle. Me imagino que "
"este lugar debe ser más seguro que mi apartamento, y al menos tengo toda esta "
"comida aquí."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I… um… hid.  I was in the kitchen, preparing another masterpiece when I heard "
"glass shattering followed by screaming.  I ran over to the serving window to "
"see what happened, assuming a guest had fallen and broke something.  What I "
"witnessed was the most awful thing I've ever seen.  I'm not even sure I could "
"go over it again."
msgstr ""
"Yo... um... me escondí. Estaba en la cocina, preparando otra obra maestra "
"cuando oí un cristal romperse seguido de gritos. Corrí hacia la ventana de "
"servicio para ver qué había pasado, suponiendo que un invitado se había caído "
"y roto algo. Lo que presencié fue lo más horrible que he visto nunca. Ni "
"siquiera estoy seguro de poder recordarlo."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Some lunatic covered in a film of goo, black as oil, had fallen through one "
"of the large glass windows.  There were glass shards stuck in its head and "
"neck.  I thought the poor guy, girl-thing-whatever was dead.  People began to "
"crowd around it, some were taking pictures."
msgstr ""
"Algún lunático cubierto con una película de sustancia viscosa, negra como el "
"aceite, había atravesado de una de las grandes ventanas de vidrio. Había "
"trozos de cristal incrustados en su cabeza y cuello. Creí que el pobre tipo, "
"la chica, lo que fuera, estaba muerto. La gente empezó a agolparse a su "
"alrededor, algunos estaban tomando fotos."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"No!  I figured the thing dead until it started writhing and spazzing out for "
"a moment.  Everyone jumped back, a few screamed, and one curious stranger "
"stepped in closer, kneeling a little… it attacked him!"
msgstr ""
"¡No!, lo creía muerto hasta que empezó a retorcerse y a vomitar por un "
"momento. Todo el mundo retrocedió de un salto, algunos gritaron y un extraño "
"curioso se acercó, se arrodilló un poco... ¡y eso lo atacó!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I ran to the back of the kitchen and hid as best I could.  People outside "
"were screaming and I could hear them running.  Suddenly I heard more glass "
"shatter and something skitter out of the restaurant.  I waited a moment and "
"then went and checked the dining area.  Both the stranger and the thing were "
"gone.  People were running in the streets, some even had guns so I locked all "
"the doors and blocked the windows with what I could and barricaded myself in "
"here."
msgstr ""
"Corrí al fondo de la cocina y me escondí lo mejor que pude. La gente gritaba "
"fuera y les oía correr. De repente, oí cómo se rompían más cristales y algo "
"salía a toda velocidad del restaurante. Esperé un momento y fui a comprobar "
"la zona del comedor. Tanto el desconocido como la cosa habían desaparecido. "
"La gente corría por las calles, algunos incluso tenían armas, así que cerré "
"todas las puertas y bloqueé las ventanas con lo que pude y me atrincheré aquí."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Yeah, it was awhile before it was quiet again.  I heard all kinds of sounds: "
"explosions, jets flying by, helicopters, screaming, and rapid gunfire.  I "
"swear I even heard what sounded like a freaking tank drive by at one time!  "
"I've been hiding here since."
msgstr ""
"Sí, pasó un tiempo antes de que todo volviera a estar tranquilo. Oí todo tipo "
"de ruidos: explosiones, aviones a reacción, helicópteros, gritos y ráfagas de "
"disparos. ¡Te juro que incluso oí pasar lo que parecía un maldito tanque! "
"Desde ese momento me he escondido aquí."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I've been a cook since forever, this wasn't the best joint, but management "
"was cool."
msgstr ""
"He sido cocinero toda mi vida, este no era el mejor garito, pero la dirección "
"era enrollada."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "Indeed it is I!  The one and only FOODPERSON!"
msgstr "¡De hecho soy yo! ¡El único COMIDAPERSONA!"

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/bg_pizzaiolo.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I was just a regular pizzaiolo.  My father was a pizzaiolo, my grandfather "
"was a pizzaiolo and I also became a pizzaiolo.  I was making pizza my whole "
"life, until some American <name_b>s ruined my business!  I couldn't do "
"anything about this, but now, with <the_cataclysm> and <zombies> around, I "
"have a chance to get my revenge!  And I got my revenge, thanks to a special "
"someone."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/bg_pizzaiolo.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Are you kidding?  That was the best!  When I imagine the face of that "
"arrogant cook… mmm, sweet, sweet picture.  Oh, and how we beat up that "
"<freaking> food-<name_b>, I dreamed about it for so long… and my restaurant, "
"we beat the shit out of those <name_b>s.  Too bad it was trashed as hell… "
"anyway, let's hit the dirt."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/burger_flipper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Before this started, I had a crappy job flipping burgers at Sambal's Grille.  "
"Losing that isn't a big deal.  Losing my mom and dad hurts a lot more.  Last "
"time I saw them alive, I just came home from school, grabbed a snack and went "
"to work.  I don't think I even told my mom I loved her, and I was pissed at "
"my dad for some dumb shit that really doesn't matter.  Didn't matter then, "
"really doesn't now.  Things started going crazy while I was at work… the "
"military rolled into town, and the evacuation alert sounded."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/burger_flipper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I didn't evacuate.  I went home… saw some freaky shit on the way, but at the "
"time I just thought it was riots or drugs.  By the time I got there, my "
"parents were gone.  No sign of them.  There was a big mess, stuff scattered "
"everywhere like there'd been a struggle, and a little blood on the floor."
msgstr ""
"No evacué. Me fui a casa... vi algunas cosas muy raras por el camino, pero en "
"ese momento pensé que eran disturbios o drogas. Cuando llegué, mis padres ya "
"se habían ido. No había rastro de ellos. Había un desastre, cosas esparcidas "
"por todas partes como si hubiera habido una pelea y un poco de sangre en el "
"suelo."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/burger_flipper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I haven't found them yet.  Whenever I see a <zombie>, a little part of me is "
"afraid it's going to be one of them.  But then, maybe not.  Maybe they were "
"evacuated, maybe they fought and tried to wait for me but the military took "
"them anyway?  I've heard that sort of thing happened.  I don't know if I'll "
"ever know."
msgstr ""
"Todavía no los he encontrado. Cada vez que veo un <zombie>, una pequeña parte "
"de mí teme que vaya a ser uno de ellos. Pero a lo mejor no. ¿ Quizás fueron "
"evacuados, quizás lucharon e intentaron esperarme pero los militares se los "
"llevaron de todos modos? He oído que ese tipo de cosas sucedieron. No sé si "
"alguna vez lo sabré."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/codger.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Well now, that's a hell of a story, so settle in.  It all goes back to about "
"five years ago, after I retired from my job at the mill.  Times was tough, "
"but we got by."
msgstr ""
"Menuda historia, así que prepárate. Todo se remonta a hace unos cinco años, "
"después de jubilarme de mi trabajo en la fábrica. Tiempos difíciles, pero nos "
"las arreglamos."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/codger.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Anyway, long story short, I were headin' back up to Mount Greenwood to check "
"on th' old ranger station again when I heard them bombs fallin' and choppers "
"flyin'.  Decided to camp out there to see it all through, but it didn't ever "
"end, now, did it?  So here I am."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/confused_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I don't even fucking know anymore.  I have no freaking idea what is going on. "
" I'm just doing what I can to stay alive.  The world ended and I bungled "
"along not dying, until I met you."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/cop_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I was a cop.  Small town sheriff.  We got orders without even really knowing "
"what they meant.  At some point one of the g-men on the phone told me it was "
"a Chinese attack, something in the water supply… I don't know if I believe it "
"now, but at the time it was the best explanation.  At first it was weird, a "
"few people - <zombies> - fighting like rabid animals.  Then it got worse.  I "
"tried to control things, but it was just me and my deputies against a town in "
"riot.  Then things really got fucked up."
msgstr ""
"Yo era policía. Sheriff de un pueblo pequeño. Recibíamos órdenes sin saber "
"realmente lo que significaban. En algún momento, uno de los hombres del "
"gobierno me dijo por teléfono que era un ataque de China, algo en el "
"suministro de agua... No sé si creerlo ahora, pero en aquel momento era la "
"mejor explicación. Al principio fue extraño, unas pocas personas -<zombies> - "
"luchando como animales rabiosos. Luego empeoró. Traté de controlar las cosas, "
"pero éramos sólo yo y mis ayudantes contra un pueblo con disturbios. Después "
"las cosas se jodieron de verdad."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/cop_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"A big-ass hole opened up right in the middle of town, and a nightmarish demon "
"crawled out, right in front of the church.  We unloaded into it, but bullets "
"just bounced off.  Got some civilians in the crossfire.  It started just "
"devouring people like potato chips into a gullet that looked like a rotting "
"asshole with teeth, and… well, I lost my nerve.  I ran.  I think I might have "
"been the only person to escape.  I haven't been able to even look at my badge "
"since then."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/cop_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I was SWAT.  By all rights I should be dead.  We were called to control "
"\"riots\", which we all know were the first <zombie> hordes.  Fat lot of good "
"we were.  Pretty sure we killed more civilians.  Even among my crew, morale "
"was piss poor and we were shooting wild.  Then something hit us, something "
"big.  Might have been a bomb, I really don't remember.  I woke up pinned "
"underneath the SWAT van.  I couldn't see anything… but I could hear it.  "
"<swear!>  I could hear everything.  I spent hours, maybe days under that van, "
"not even trying to get out."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/cop_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Eventually yes.  It had been quiet for hours.  I was parched, injured, and "
"terrified.  My training was maybe the only thing that kept me from freaking "
"out.  I decided to try to pull myself out and see how bad my injuries were.  "
"It was quite easy.  The side of the van was torn open, and it turned out I "
"was basically just lying under a little debris, with the ruins of the van "
"tented around me.  I wasn't even too badly hurt.  I grabbed as much gear as I "
"could, and I slipped out.  It was night.  I could hear fighting farther away "
"in the city, so I went the other way.  I made it a few blocks before I ran "
"into any <zombies>… I ran from them.  I ran, and I ran, and I ran some more.  "
"And here I am."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/cop_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Before <the_cataclysm>, I was a cop.  I got shot just a couple days before "
"everything went down… I made a bad call in a drug bust and a scumbag got me "
"right in the gut, it was barely stopped by my vest.  I took some pretty bad "
"internal bruising.  I never thought getting shot would save my life, but I "
"was off duty recuperating when the worst of it hit."
msgstr ""
"Antes <the_cataclysm>, era policía. Me dispararon un par de días antes de que "
"todo se desmoronara... Tomé una mala decisión en una redada antidrogas y un "
"cabronazo me alcanzó justo en las tripas, a duras penas lo detuvo mi chaleco. "
"Me llevé un buen moratón interno. Nunca pensé que recibir un disparo me "
"salvaría la vida, pero estaba recuperándome fuera de servicio cuando llegó lo "
"peor."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/cop_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"At first I wanted to help.  The riots, fighting in the streets, it was too "
"much for me to just sit in my house and hear about it on the news.  Then a "
"buddy of mine called me from just off the front lines.  He'd been hurt and he "
"wasn't making much sense, but what he told me… well, you can imagine the kind "
"of stuff he told me.  Everything the worst of the internet was making up, and "
"more.  Instead of packing up to try to volunteer back onto active duty, I "
"took his advice and packed up to leave.  My house was on the edge of town and "
"the riots hadn't reached it yet, but from what I'd heard it was smarter to "
"get out than to hold tight.  I slipped out that night, took my quad out, and "
"camped a few days in the woods, waiting for it to blow over.  It never did."
msgstr ""
"Al principio quería ayudar. Los disturbios, la lucha en las calles, era "
"imposible para mí quedarme sentado en casa y oírlo en las noticias. Entonces "
"me llamó un amigo que estaba en primera línea. Le habían herido y no hablaba "
"muy claro, pero lo que me contó... bueno, ya te puedes imaginar el tipo de "
"cosas que me contó. Todo lo que se inventaba lo peor de internet, y más. En "
"lugar de hacer las maletas para intentar volver como voluntario al servicio "
"activo, seguí su consejo e hice las maletas para marcharme. Mi casa estaba en "
"las afueras de la ciudad y los disturbios aún no habían llegado a ella, pero "
"por lo que había oído era más inteligente salir que aguantar. Aquella noche "
"me escapé, me llevé el quad y acampé unos días en el bosque, esperando a que "
"pasara todo. Nunca pasó."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/cop_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Honestly, probably better than it sounds.  I had a good bug-out bag, a nice "
"tent, a lot of good stuff.  I hadn't suffered any internal organ damage, my "
"stomach muscles were just really badly bruised, and I'd already had some good "
"time to recover.  I think it kept me from doing anything too stupid, and "
"believe me there was a high chance of that.  For a long time I had these "
"Rambo visions of rushing into town and saving everyone, but I was still too "
"immobile.  By the time I had my strength back, it wasn't an option… we were "
"well into the rushing into town for supplies phase.  The closest I got to "
"saving any old friends was putting down the monsters wearing their faces."
msgstr ""
"Honestamente, probablemente mejor de lo que suena. Tenía una buena bolsa de "
"supervivencia, una buena tienda de campaña, un montón de cosas buenas. No "
"había sufrido daños en ningún órgano interno, sólo tenía los músculos del "
"estómago muy magullados, y ya había tenido bastante tiempo para recuperarme. "
"Creo que eso evitó que hiciera alguna estupidez, y créeme que había muchas "
"posibilidades de que ocurriera. Durante mucho tiempo tuve visiones a lo Rambo "
"de ir corriendo a la ciudad y salvar a todo el mundo, pero seguía muy "
"inmóvil. Cuando recuperé las fuerzas, ya no era una opción... estábamos "
"bastante metidos en la fase de ir corriendo a la ciudad a por provisiones. Lo "
"más cerca que estuve de salvar a algún viejo amigo fue acabar con los "
"monstruos que llevaban sus caras."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/criminal_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I was just sittin' in lockup.  They took me in the night before, for a "
"bullshit parole violation.  Assholes.  I was stuck in my cell when the cops "
"all started yelling about an emergency, geared up, and left me in there "
"havin' a <freaking> staring contest with a security cam that probably wasn't "
"even on.  I was stuck in there for two god-damn days, with no food and only a "
"little water.  Then this big-ass zombie busted in.  I didn't know what the "
"fuck to think, but if my cam wasn't working, the one in the hall sure was.  "
"Tripped a motion sensor or some shit, alarm started going, and the big dumb "
"fuck turned around to get at it while its arms were still stuck in the cell "
"bars.  Ripped the whole door out."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/criminal_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"'cuz I know how cops think.  If you can call it that.  Early days, they were "
"still going after alarms in case it meant, I dunno, survivors.  You smack "
"some fucker's sports car, it starts wailing, the cops come to take a look and "
"you can walk right behind 'em.  That's the thing about cops; they follow "
"orders, right?  Even when the world's comin' apart.  I kept my head down "
"until I got past the worst of it, but then, lucky me, I got sergeant "
"brainiac.  Figured out why someone would trip an alarm on purpose, had them "
"case all up and down the streets for me.  I wound up on the edge of town "
"layin' low under an abandoned RV for a few hours.  By then… well, they had "
"some other big problems to deal with.  For a little bit.  Might've survived "
"if they hadn't blown their wads chasing me around the block."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/criminal_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Bullshit, that's what.  The assholes busted me on possession, wasn't even my "
"fuckin' stash.  I don't do crack, man, that shit's nasty, I was just carryin' "
"it for my buddy Johnny.  Y'know, this might be a <freaking> hellhole now, but "
"if I've seen the last power-trippin' asshole cop, it might all be worth it."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/criminal_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I was fricking lucky for <the_cataclysm>.  I was squatting in a warehouse out "
"on the edge of town.  I was in a real shitty place, and my crew had mostly "
"just been arrested in a big drug bust, but I had skipped out.  I was scared "
"they were gonna think I ratted 'em out and come get me, but hey, no worries "
"about that now."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/criminal_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I was just in a warehouse, not in Zambonia.  I had the internet.  Watched "
"those crazy videos on YouTube in real time, scared the shit out of me.  I had "
"it pretty good though, I'd lifted a bunch of canned food and shit, and I had "
"a pretty sweet little squat in that warehouse.  I'd been planning on spending "
"a long time there after all, while I figured out how to get in good with my "
"crew."
msgstr ""
"Estaba en un almacén, no en Zambonia. Tenía internet. Veía esos videos locos "
"en YouTube en tiempo real, me cagué de miedo. Lo tenía bastante bien, había "
"cargado un montón de comida enlatada y mierdas, y tenía una pequeña y bonita "
"casa ocupada en ese almacén. Había estado planeando pasar mucho tiempo allí "
"después de todo, mientras averiguaba cómo llevarme bien con mi equipo."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/criminal_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Yeah.  <zombies>.  A bunch of them, led by this big creepy-ass jet-black "
"bastard with glowing red eyes, I shit you not.  I dunno what brought them way "
"out my way but they saw me takin' a piss outside and that was that.  I took a "
"few shots at them but that creepy-ass motherfucker waves his hands and brings "
"'em back up, so I ran.  Once I got my shit together again I realized it "
"wasn't so bad, I was running out of stuff anyway.  Been livin' on what I can "
"loot ever since, until I fell in with you."
msgstr ""
"Sí. <zombies>. Un grupo de ellos, liderados por este bastardo horripilante "
"negro con ojos rojos brillantes. No te engaño. No se que los trajo hasta mi "
"camino pero me vieron meando afuera y eso fue todo. Les disparé un par de "
"veces, pero ese hijo de puta espeluznante agitó las manos y los hizo "
"levantarse, así que salí corriendo. Una vez que me recompuse me di cuenta de "
"que no fue tan malo, me estaba quedando sin nada de todos modos. He estado "
"viviendo de lo que he podido saquear hasta que me topé contigo."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/criminal_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Well, I mean, if he's surrounded by buddies like that and he can just bring "
"'em back, I think he's a scary bastard.  If I got him on his own I think "
"maybe I could have taken him.  Also when I was running I managed to get a "
"zombie on its own, and I smashed it to shit with a stick before the rest "
"showed up.  He tried to raise that one and it didn't get back up."
msgstr ""
"Si esta rodeado de compinches como esos y puede traerlos de vuelta, creo que "
"es un bastardo temible. Si lo hubiera cogido por mi cuenta creo que tal vez "
"hubiera podido con él. Además, cuando estaba corriendo logré coger a un zombi "
"solo, y lo hice papilla con un palo antes de que aparecieran los demás. A ese "
"lo intentaba levantar pero no se volvía a levantar."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/dreamer.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"OK, this is gonna sound crazy but I, like, I knew this was going to happen.  "
"Like, before it did.  You can even ask my psychic except, like, I think she's "
"dead now.  I told her about my dreams a week before the world ended.  Serious!"
msgstr ""
"Mira, esto va a sonar a locura pero yo, como que ya sabía que esto iba a "
"pasar. Antes de que pasara. Puedes preguntarle a mi vidente aunque creo que "
"ahora está muerta. Le conté sobre mis sueños una semana antes de que el mundo "
"se acabara. ¡De verdad!"

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/dreamer.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"OK, so, sometimes I dream that I am a zombie.  I just don't realize it.  And "
"I just act normal to myself and I see zombies as normal people and normal "
"people as zombies.  When I wake up I know it's fake though because if it were "
"real, there would be way more normal people.  Because they'd actually be "
"zombies.  And everyone is a zombie now."
msgstr ""
"Mira, a veces sueño que soy un zombi. Pero no me doy cuenta. Y actúo con "
"normalidad y veo a los zombis como gente normal y a la gente normal como "
"zombis. Pero cuando me despierto sé que es falso, porque si fuera real, "
"habría mucha más gente normal. Porque en realidad serían zombis. Y ahora todo "
"el mundo es zombi."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/dreamer.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"So, like, there were some really bad riots, okay?  Everyone got really "
"violent and nasty, and to be honest, I was on a bit of a spirit journey for a "
"lot of it and I don't really remember too well.  But the weirdest part is, "
"nobody even *cared* about each other.  It's like all our caring got sucked "
"away.  I think it was some kind of negative energy thing.  And also that made "
"the dead, like, come back to life and stuff.  Plus, like, there were some "
"monsters?  I'm not really sure how they fit in."
msgstr ""
"Se produjeron disturbios muy graves. Todo el mundo se puso muy violento y "
"desagradable, y para ser honesto, yo estaba en un pequeño viaje espiritual "
"durante gran parte de ella y realmente no recuerdo demasiado bien. Pero lo "
"más extraño es que nadie se preocupaba por los demás. Es como si todo nuestro "
"cariño hubiera desaparecido. Creo que era una especie de energía negativa. Y "
"eso hizo que los muertos volvieran a la vida y otras cosas. Además, ¿había "
"algunos monstruos? No estoy muy seguro de cómo encajan."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I made it to one of those <freaking> evac shelters, but it was almost worse "
"than what I left behind.  Escaped from there, been on the run since."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I spent a lot of time rummaging for rhubarb and bits of vegetables in the "
"forest before I found the courage to start picking off some of those dead "
"monsters.  I guess I was getting desperate."
msgstr ""
"Pasé mucho tiempo buscando ruibarbo y trozos de verdura en el bosque antes de "
"armarme de valor y empezar a eliminar a algunos de esos monstruos muertos. "
"Supongo que me estaba desesperando."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Not exactly.  After a while, I got brave.  I started venturing towards the "
"outskirts of town, picking off zombies here and there.  I learned about "
"traveling in at night to avoid all but those <freaking> shadow-zombies, and "
"that got me pretty far.  Eventually I cleared out a cozy little nook for "
"myself and started really feeling comfortable.  I guess I got a bit "
"complacent."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I thought I had those damned <zombies> figured out.  I got braver, started "
"heading out by day more and more.  One of those screamer zombies spotted me "
"and called in a horde, with a giant <freaking> beastie at the head of it, the "
"size of a Volkswagen and all covered in bone plates.  I know when I'm "
"outclassed.  The big guy was held back by his own horde of buddies, and I "
"managed to book it back to my place.  I closed the windows, locked it down, "
"but it was too late.  The giant followed me and just started hammering right "
"through the walls.  I grabbed what I could and made for the horizon.  Last I "
"saw of my squat, it was collapsing on the bastard.  For all I know, it died "
"in the crash, but I am not going back to find out."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"What happened?  I'm not really sure.  You must know about the riots and all "
"that, that the government and the police totally failed to contain.  I don't "
"have a good guess what caused that.  I thought it was the usual stuff at "
"first, and I gotta admit, I was sort of excited and scared it was the start "
"of a revolution.  Not excited enough to join in though, and I guess anyone "
"who was is probably dead now.  I tried to wait it out at home, packed a "
"little bug-out bag, but then the internet started showing videos of rioters "
"getting back up and fighting with crazy injuries.  I don't know how many "
"people really believed it at first, but I took that as my sign and ditched "
"town for the evac shelter.  I don't know exactly what happened after that.  "
"The center I was in was heavily vandalized and empty, and I never saw anyone "
"else.  The cell phone grid was locked up, except for one emergency message "
"that came through around a day later saying the government had fallen.  Power "
"went out a few days later."
msgstr ""
"¿Qué ha pasado? No estoy muy seguro. Seguro que sabes lo de los disturbios y "
"todo eso, que el gobierno y la policía no consiguieron contener. No tengo una "
"buena idea de lo que causó eso. Al principio pensé que era lo normal, y tengo "
"que admitir que estaba un poco emocionado y asustado de que fuera el comienzo "
"de una revolución. Pero no lo suficiente como para participar, y supongo que "
"los que lo estaban probablemente ya estén muertos. Intenté esperar en casa, "
"preparé una pequeña bolsa de supervivencia, pero entonces Internet empezó a "
"mostrar vídeos de alborotadores que se levantaban y luchaban con heridas "
"mortales. No sé cuánta gente se lo creyó al principio, pero yo lo tomé como "
"una señal y abandoné la ciudad para ir al refugio de evacuados. No sé "
"exactamente qué pasó después. El centro en el que estuve estaba muy "
"vandalizado y vacío, y nunca vi a nadie más. La red de telefonía móvil estaba "
"bloqueada, salvo por un mensaje de emergencia que llegó aproximadamente un "
"día después diciendo que el gobierno había caído. La electricidad se cortó "
"unos días después."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Same as most people who didn't get killed straight up during the riots.  I "
"went to one of those stupid <freaking> evacuation death traps.  I actually "
"lived there for a while with three others.  One guy who I guess had watched a "
"lot of movies kinda ran the show, because he seemed to really know what was "
"going on.  Spoiler alert: he fucking didn't."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Things went south when our fearless leader decided we had to put down one of "
"the other survivors that had been bitten.  Her husband felt a bit strongly "
"against that, and I wasn't too keen on it either; by this point, he'd already "
"been wrong about a lot.  Well, he took matters into his own hands and killed "
"her.  Then her husband decided one good turn deserves another, and killed the "
"idiot.  And then she got back up and I killed her again, and pulped our "
"former leader.  Unfortunately she'd given her husband a hell of a nip during "
"the struggle, when he couldn't get his shit together enough to fight back.  "
"Not that I fucking blame him.  We made it out of there together, but it was "
"too much for him, he clearly wasn't in it anymore… the bite got infected, but "
"it was another <zombie> that finally killed him.  And then I was alone."
msgstr ""
"Las cosas empezaron a salir mal cuando nuestro intrépido líder decidió que "
"teníamos que matar a uno de los otros supervivientes que habian sido "
"mordidos. El marido de la superviviente se opuso frontalmente a eso y yo no "
"estaba de acuerdo tampoco; el lider ya había tomado bastantes decisiones "
"erróneas en el pasado. Decidió hacerlo el y la mató. Su marido decidió que "
"era su turno y mató al idiota. Después ella se volvió a levantar y su marido "
"la mató de nuevo, y a continuación destrozó el cuerpo de nuestro exlíder.  "
"Lamentablemente, ella le dió un gran mordisco a su marido durante la lucha, "
"mientras él estaba en shock sin poder defenderse. No puedo culparle. Salimos "
"de allí juntos, pero fue demasiado para él, ya no era el mismo… El mordisco "
"se infectó, pero fue otro <zombie> lo que lo terminó matando. Me quedé solo."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Well, I assume you know about the riots and the military and police and the "
"freakin' nightmare monsters walking the earth beside zombies, right?  If "
"you're asking what I think caused it all, well, I dunno.  My best guess it "
"was some huge government overreach, maybe some kind of experimental bioweapon "
"that got away.  They tried to lie so much at the start about everything that "
"was going on, I don't think the whole 'Chinese attack' shit measures up.  "
"They were trying to cover something up.  As for the real end times, maybe the "
"rest of the world tried to contain it.  I heard there were honest-to-god "
"nukes going off here on American soil.  To me that seems like somewhere else, "
"maybe Europe, trying to get whatever is going on here contained.  Maybe it "
"even worked.  It's bad now but it's not like it was."
msgstr ""
"Bueno, supongo que sabes lo de los disturbios y los militares y la policía y "
"los monstruos de pesadilla que andan por la tierra junto a los zombis, "
"¿verdad? Si me preguntas qué creo que lo causó todo, bueno, no lo sé. Mi "
"mejor suposición es que fue una gran actuación del gobierno, tal vez algún "
"tipo de arma biológica experimental que se escapó. Intentaron mentir tanto al "
"principio sobre todo lo que estaba pasando, que no creo que toda la mierda "
"del 'ataque chino' tenga sentido. Estaban tratando de encubrir algo. En "
"cuanto al verdadero fin de los tiempos, quizás el resto del mundo trato de "
"contenerlo. Escuche que habia bombas nucleares explotando en suelo americano. "
"A mi me parece que en otro lugar, quizas Europa, trataron de contener lo que "
"sea que este sucediendo aqui. Tal vez incluso funcionó. Ahora se está mal, "
"pero no es como era antes."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"There's nothing too special about me, I'm not sure why I survived.  I got "
"evacuated with a handful of others, but we were too late to make the second "
"trip to a FEMA center.  We got attacked by the dead… I was the only one to "
"make it out.  I never looked back."
msgstr ""
"No hay nada especial en mí, no estoy seguro de por qué sobreviví. Me "
"evacuaron con un puñado de personas, pero llegamos demasiado tarde para hacer "
"el segundo viaje a un centro de la FEMA. Nos atacaron los muertos... Yo fui "
"el único que logró salir. Jamás miré atrás."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Sheer luck I guess.  I went the absolute wrong way, into town, and wound up "
"stuck in the subway system.  I spent a few days living off vending machine "
"food.  Not the best eating, but I pulled through.  At least there weren't so "
"many zombies down there."
msgstr ""
"Supongo que fue pura suerte. Fui en la dirección equivocada, a la ciudad, y "
"acabé atrapado en el metro. Pasé unos días viviendo de la comida de las "
"máquinas expendedoras. No era la mejor comida, pero sobreviví. Al menos no "
"había tantos zombis ahí abajo."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Straight up hunger.  I didn't have any great light source down there, and I "
"didn't have much food.  I was slipping up and down to the station to buy from "
"the vending machines, but once I ran out of cash I had to make a break for "
"it.  I waited until dark and then skipped out."
msgstr ""
"Simplemente hambre. No tenía ninguna gran fuente de luz allí abajo, y no "
"tenía mucha comida. Subía y bajaba a la estación para comprar en las máquinas "
"expendedoras, pero en cuanto se me acabó el dinero tuve que huir. Esperé a "
"que oscureciera y me largué."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Straight up hunger.  I didn't have any great light source down there, and I "
"didn't have much food.  I was slipping up and down to the station to buy from "
"the vending machines, but once I ran out of cash I had to think of something "
"else.  I started raiding the surrounding area by night, and built a decent "
"little base under there."
msgstr ""
"Simplemente hambre. No tenía ninguna gran fuente de luz allí abajo, y tampoco "
"mucha comida. Subía y bajaba a la estación para comprar en las máquinas "
"expendedoras, pero en cuanto se me acabó el dinero tuve que pensar en otra "
"cosa. Empecé a hacer incursiones nocturnas en los alrededores y construí una "
"pequeña base aceptable allí abajo."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Yeah.  I had it pretty good there, but eventually I just started going a bit "
"nuts.  Always dark, a bit cold, living off scavenged junk food… a soul can "
"only live like that for so long.  When the weather above ground got warmer "
"and the daylight hours got longer I decided to get a bit braver.  I'd learned "
"enough about the <zombies> that I was able to live pretty well after that.  "
"I've camped a few places, scavenged berries and whatnot, lived a pretty good "
"life compared to those first few months."
msgstr ""
"Sí. Lo pasé bastante bien allí, pero al final empecé a volverme un poco loco. "
"Siempre a oscuras, con un poco de frío, viviendo de comida basura... un alma "
"sóla puede vivir así durante un tiempo. Cuando hizo más calor en la "
"superficie y las horas de luz se hicieron más largas, decidí ser más "
"valiente. Había aprendido lo suficiente sobre <zombies> y era capaz de vivir "
"bastante bien después de eso. He acampado en algunos sitios, he rebuscado "
"bayas y demás, he vivido bastante bien en comparación con aquellos primeros "
"meses."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Woah, <name_g>, I don't even know where to start.  The riots?  I think it was "
"going on sooner than that.  There were bad murmurs going on a few weeks "
"before that happened.  Lots of really scary crimes, not your usual stuff but "
"like cannibalism and some real unspeakable shit, you know?  When the riots "
"started, I think I was already primed to think of it as something different "
"from a normal equality riot or anything like that.  I think that's part of "
"how I got out safer, I had had some time to get some stuff and get going, and "
"didn't try to make shopping trips.  People were abso-fuckin-lutely crazy in "
"those days.  It was a lot like the pandemic a few years back, except the "
"police were out in the streets in force, gunning people down like it was "
"going out of style."
msgstr ""
"Woah, <name_g> , ni siquiera sé por dónde empezar. ¿Los disturbios? Creo que "
"fue antes de eso. Hubo rumores negativos unas semanas antes de que "
"ocurrieran. Un montón de crímenes realmente aterradores, no los habituales, "
"sino canibalismo y cosas realmente indescriptibles, ¿sabes? Cuando empezaron "
"los disturbios, creo que ya estaba preparado para pensar que era algo "
"diferente a un disturbio normal por la igualdad o algo así. Creo que en parte "
"por eso salí más seguro, había tenido algo de tiempo para conseguir algunas "
"cosas y ponerme en marcha, y no intenté hacer compras. La gente estaba "
"absoluta y jodidamente loca en aquellos días. Se parecía mucho a la pandemia "
"de hace unos años, con la diferencia de que la policía salía a la calle en "
"masa, matando a la gente como si no pasara nada."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_4.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"They were shipping me with a bunch of evacuees over to a refugee center, when "
"the bus got smashed in by the biggest zombie you ever saw.  It was busy with "
"the other passengers, so I did what anyone would do and fucked right out of "
"there."
msgstr ""
"Me estaban enviando con un grupo de evacuados a un centro de refugiados, "
"cuando el autobús fue aplastado por el zombi más grande que jamás hayas "
"visto. Estaba ocupado con los demás pasajeros, así que hice lo que haría "
"cualquiera y salí pitando de allí."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_4.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I ran until I felt like my lungs were going to jump right out of my mouth.  I "
"holed up in the forest for the night, under a fir tree.  In the morning I "
"heard someone talking, so I went to see.  I was playing it pretty careful "
"though, there were still a lot of psychos and rioters around.  I snuck up on "
"some kind of thing, some monster worse than any zombie.  Some huge bug thing, "
"saying random phrases like some kind of broken tape recorder.  It was "
"dragging a few human bodies behind it, I couldn't tell if they were dead or "
"unconscious.  Honestly I didn't wait to find out, I ducked into the bushes "
"and tried not to breath until I couldn't hear it anymore."
msgstr ""
"Corrí hasta que sentí que los pulmones se me iban a salir por la boca. Pasé "
"la noche en el bosque, bajo un abeto. Por la mañana oí hablar a alguien, así "
"que fui a ver. Pero fui con mucho cuidado, todavía había muchos psicópatas y "
"alborotadores. Me acerqué sigilosamente a una especie de cosa, un monstruo "
"peor que cualquier zombi. Un bicho enorme que decía frases al azar como si "
"fuera una grabadora rota. Estaba arrastrando unos cuantos cuerpos humanos "
"detrás de él, no sabría decirte si estaban muertos o inconscientes. "
"Sinceramente, no me quedé a averiguarlo, me agaché entre los arbustos e "
"intenté no respirar hasta que dejé de oírlo."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_4.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Once I was okay leaving the bushes, I made my way to an old shed I could see "
"a ways off.  It was falling in but it kept the rain and wind off and gave me "
"a place out of sight.  I stayed there until I ran out of those ass-tasting "
"ration bars I'd filled my backpack with.  Then I took on the wanderin' life "
"until we met."
msgstr ""
"Una vez que me sentí bien saliendo de los arbustos, me dirigí a un viejo "
"cobertizo que podía ver a cierta distancia. Se estaba derrumbando, pero me "
"protegía de la lluvia y el viento y me daba un lugar fuera de la vista. Me "
"quedé allí hasta que se me acabaron las barritas de racionamiento con sabor a "
"culo con las que había llenado mi mochila. Luego me dediqué a vagabundear "
"hasta que nos conocimos."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_5.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"My evac shelter got swarmed by some of those bees, the ones the size of dogs. "
" I took out a few with a plank, but pretty quick I realized it was either "
"head for the hills or get stuck like a pig.  The rest is history."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_5.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Yeah, I'm sure you've seen them, they're everywhere.  Like something out of "
"an old sci-fi movie.  Some of the others in the evac shelter got stung, it "
"was no joke.  I didn't stick around to see what the lasting effect was "
"though.  I'm not ashamed to admit I ran like a <freaking> chicken."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_5.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Well, excuse me if I didn't stop to fucking ask what kind of killer bugs they "
"were."
msgstr ""
"Bueno, perdóname si no me detuve a preguntar qué tipo de insectos asesinos "
"eran."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_6.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Well, I was at home when the cell phone alert went off and told me to get to "
"an evac shelter.  So I went to an evac shelter.  And then the shelter got too "
"crowded, and people were waiting to get taken to the refugee center, but the "
"buses never came.  You must already know about all that.  It turned into "
"panic, and then fighting.  I didn't stick around to see what happened next; I "
"headed into the woods with what tools I could snatch from the lockers.  I "
"went back a few days later, but the place was totally abandoned.  No idea "
"what happened to all those people."
msgstr ""
"Bueno, estaba en casa cuando sonó la alerta del móvil y me dijeron que fuera "
"a un refugio de evacuados. Así que fui al refugio. Y entonces el refugio se "
"llenó demasiado, y la gente estaba esperando a que la llevaran al centro de "
"refugiados, pero los autobuses nunca llegaron. Ya debes saber todo eso. El "
"pánico se apoderó de la gente y empezaron los enfrentamientos. No me quedé a "
"ver qué pasaba después; me fui al bosque con las herramientas que pude coger "
"de las taquillas. Volví unos días después, pero el lugar estaba totalmente "
"abandonado. Ni idea de lo que les pasó a todas aquellas personas."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_6.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I gotta be honest with you, I heard a lot of stories back at the shelter, and "
"only one of them really stuck.  This is some kind of science experiment gone "
"wrong.  I don't know what caused the riots and the undead in the first place, "
"but there's no way it's this out of control everywhere.  Yeah, I got the same "
"'the government has fallen' text as everyone, but it doesn't make *sense* "
"that it could be so widespread so fast.  I think we're in some sort of "
"exclusion zone, where they're letting whatever is going on run its course to "
"see how it works so they can fight it better next time.  Somewhere out there, "
"outside the zone, it's more or less business as usual."
msgstr ""
"Debo ser honesto contigo, escuché muchas historias en el refugio, y sólo una "
"de ellas se me quedó grabada. Esto es una especie de experimento científico "
"que salió mal. No sé qué causó los disturbios y los muertos vivientes en "
"primer lugar, pero no hay manera de que esto esté tan fuera de control en "
"todas partes. Sí, me llegó el mismo texto de 'el gobierno ha caído' que a "
"todo el mundo, pero no tiene *sentido* que se haya extendido tan rápido. Creo "
"que estamos en una especie de zona de exclusión, donde están dejando que lo "
"que está pasando siga su curso para ver cómo funciona y así poder combatirlo "
"mejor la próxima vez. En algún lugar, fuera de esta zona, todo debe continuar "
"como si nada hubiera pasado."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/ex_pilot_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Where was I?  I don't even know, what day do you think it all ended?  When I "
"thought shit was hitting the fan I took some vacation time at the airline.  "
"Next day, somebody bombed them.  No shit, just like Oklahoma city in '95.  "
"Thought that was a good sign to get out so I emailed some family out in the "
"country that I was coming over and got on the road.  Didn't even make it to "
"the interstate before I ran into the cops setting up a roadblock.  I drove "
"off the road and it all gets fuzzy from there.  Next town I got to was "
"already lynching people from the streetlights… I didn't stop for gas.  Lost "
"the car at some point, lost track of the days too.  Not sure I ever got a "
"reply to my email."
msgstr ""
"¿Dónde estaba? Ni siquiera lo sé, ¿qué día crees que terminó todo? Cuando "
"pensé que la mierda estaba salpicando, me tomé unas vacaciones en la "
"aerolínea. Al día siguiente, alguien les puso una bomba. No es broma, igual "
"que en Oklahoma City en 1995. Pensé que era una buena señal para salir de "
"allí, así que envié un correo electrónico a algunos familiares que vivían en "
"el campo para decirles que iba para allá y me puse en camino. Ni siquiera "
"llegué a la interestatal antes de encontrarme con la policía montando un "
"control de carretera. Me salí de la carretera y a partir de ahí todo se "
"vuelve confuso. En la siguiente ciudad a la que llegué ya estaban linchando a "
"gente en las farolas... No paré a repostar. En algún momento perdí el coche y "
"también la noción del tiempo. No estoy seguro de haber recibido respuesta a "
"mi correo electrónico."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/fema_evacuee_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"That place was chaos.  I only stayed a few hours.  They had a big backhoe "
"running, digging a huge pit in a cordoned section they wouldn't let us near.  "
"Well, I managed to sneak over that way, and saw them dumping load after load "
"of the dead in the pit, pouring dirt back over them even as they revived and "
"tried to climb out.  Even with all the shit I've seen since, it haunts me.  I "
"knew then I had to get out.  Luckily for me, we were attacked the next "
"morning by some giant horror, a kind I haven't really seen since then.  While "
"the guards were busy with that, I grabbed some supplies I'd stocked up over "
"the night and I fucked right out of there.  A few others tried to get the "
"fuck out with me, but as far as I know I was the only lucky one."
msgstr ""
"Aquello era un caos. Solo estuve allí unas horas. Tenían una gran "
"retroexcavadora excavando un enorme hoyo en una zona acordonada a la que no "
"nos dejaban acercarnos. Bueno, conseguí colarme por allí y vi cómo echaban un "
"montón de cadáveres en el hoyo y los cubrían con tierra, incluso cuando "
"revivían e intentaban salir. A pesar de todas las cosas horribles que he "
"visto desde entonces, aquello me persigue. Entonces supe que tenía que salir "
"de allí. Por suerte para mí, a la mañana siguiente nos atacó un horror "
"gigante, uno que no he vuelto a ver desde entonces. Mientras los guardias "
"estaban ocupados con eso, cogí algunos suministros que había acumulado "
"durante la noche y me largué de allí. Otros intentaron escapar conmigo, pero, "
"por lo que sé, fui el único afortunado."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/grad_student_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I'm not from around here… You can probably tell from the accent, I'm from the "
"UK.  I was here doing my PhD at Dartmouth.  I was halfway to MIT for a "
"conference when <the_cataclysm> stopped me.  I was staying at a flea-ridden "
"little motel on the side of the road.  When I got up for whatever was going "
"to pass for breakfast, the fat bloody proprietor was sitting at his desk, "
"wearing the same grubby clothes from the night before.  I thought he had just "
"slept there, but when he looked at me… well, you know what those Zed-eyes "
"look like.  He lunged, and I reacted without thinking.  Smacked him on the "
"head with my tablet, again and again, until he stopped coming for me.  I "
"never thought I had anything like that in me."
msgstr ""
"No nací aquí... Probablemente puedas deducirlo por el acento, soy del Reino "
"Unido. Estaba aquí haciendo mi doctorado en Dartmouth. Estaba a medio camino "
"del MIT para una conferencia cuando me detuvo <the_cataclysm>. Me estaba "
"quedando en un pequeño motel lleno de pulgas al lado de la carretera. Cuando "
"me levanté para desayunar, el maldito propietario estaba sentado en su "
"escritorio con la misma ropa vieja de la noche anterior. Pensé que se había "
"quedado dormido allí, pero cuando me miró... bueno, ya sabes cómo son esos "
"ojos de zeta. Se abalanzó, y reaccioné sin pensar. Le golpeé en la cabeza con "
"mi tableta, una y otra vez, hasta que paró de abalanzarse sobre mí. Nunca "
"pensé que tuviese algo así dentro de mí."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/grad_student_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I wandered for a little while around the grounds, letting the adrenaline "
"fade, hoping for some kind of idea what to do.  I was out in the middle of "
"nowhere, and I didn't know the area at all.  I wasn't certain if I should "
"head back to Hanover, and try to get my belongings, or stay out where I was.  "
"Finally, I decided to rest a while until I knew what was going on.  The "
"internet told me most of what I needed; I'm sure you saw Twitter in those "
"days.  Even if I'd thought it wise to go back all the way to New Hampshire, I "
"was far too scared."
msgstr ""
"Deambulé un rato por el recinto, dejando que la adrenalina desapareciera, "
"esperando tener alguna idea de qué hacer. Estaba en medio de la nada y no "
"conocía la zona en absoluto. No sabía si debía volver a Hanover e intentar "
"recuperar mis cosas o quedarme donde estaba. Finalmente, decidí descansar un "
"rato hasta saber qué pasaba. Internet me informó de la mayor parte de lo que "
"necesitaba; seguro que que vistes Twitter en aquellos días. Aunque me hubiera "
"parecido prudente volver hasta New Hampshire, estaba demasiado asustado."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/grad_student_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Yes.  Simple hunger.  The vending machines sold only peanuts and biscuits.  I "
"wasn't about to rely on that for survival.  I stayed long enough to realize "
"no one was going to come for me, then packed up what I could and drove off.  "
"Eventually my car was caught in a downpour of acid rain that stripped the "
"tires and left me to carry on on foot, living the life of a hunter gatherer.  "
"Honestly, I think I eat better this way than I did as a grad student."
msgstr ""
"Sí. Por pura hambre. Las máquinas expendedoras sólo vendían cacahuetes y "
"galletas. No iba a poder subsistir con eso. Me quedé el tiempo suficiente "
"para darme cuenta de que nadie iba a venir a por mí, recogí lo que pude y me "
"fui. Al final, mi coche se vio atrapado en un aguacero de lluvia ácida que "
"destrozó los neumáticos y me obligó a seguir a pie, viviendo la vida de un "
"cazador recolector. Sinceramente, creo que como mejor así que como estudiante "
"de posgrado."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/grad_student_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I was in biochemistry.  Specifically, if you're interested, I was studying "
"the folding of non-standard nucleic acids into enzyme-like structures.  It "
"sounds more interesting than it was; most of my time was spent cursing at "
"computer screens and wishing we had more information on threose chains at "
"unusual temperatures and pressures for modeling."
msgstr ""
"Yo estudiaba bioquímica. En concreto, si te interesa, estudiaba el "
"plegamiento de ácidos nucleicos no estándar en estructuras de tipo "
"enzimático. Suena más interesante de lo que era; la mayor parte de mi tiempo "
"lo pasaba maldiciendo a las pantallas de los ordenadores y deseando que "
"tuviéramos más información sobre las cadenas de treosa a temperaturas y "
"presiones inusuales para modelarlas."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/gung_ho_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Nothin' special before <the_cataclysm>.  When the dead started walking, I "
"geared up and started puttin' them back down."
msgstr ""
"Nada especial antes d<the_cataclysm>. Cuando los muertos empezaron a caminar, "
"me equipé y empecé a aplastarlos."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/gung_ho_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Almost got killed.  One <zombie> is easy pickins, but ten is a lot, and a "
"hundred is a death trap.  I got myself in too deep, an' barely slipped out "
"with my guts still inside me.  Holed up in an old motel for a while lickin' "
"my wounds and thinkin' about what I wanted to do next.  That's when I figured "
"it out."
msgstr ""
"Casi me matan. Un <zombie> es fácil, pero diez son demasiados, y cien es una "
"trampa mortal. Me metí muy adentro, y apenas pude salir con las tripas aún "
"dentro de mí. Me quedé en un viejo motel lamiéndome las heridas y pensando en "
"lo que haría después. Fue entonces cuando me di cuenta."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/gung_ho_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"This is it.  This is what I was made for.  There in the street, smashin' "
"monster heads and prayin' I'd make it out?  I've never felt like that.  "
"Alive.  Important.  So after I got myself all stuck back together, I nutted "
"up and went back to it.  Probly killed a thousand Z since then, and I'm still "
"not tired of it."
msgstr ""
"Es esto. Esto es para lo que fui hecho. ¿Ahí en la calle, reventando cabezas "
"de monstruos y rogando por sobrevivir? Nunca me había sentido así. Vivo. "
"Importante. Así que después de recomponerme, me puse las pilas y retomé el "
"oficio. Probablemente he matado mil Z desde entonces, y aún no me he cansado."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/gung_ho_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Oh, you know.  Blah blah blah, had a job and a life, everyone died.  Boo hoo. "
" I gotta be straight with you though: I honestly think I like this better.  "
"Fighting for survival every day?  I've never felt so alive.  I've killed "
"hundreds of those bastards.  Sooner or later one of them will take me out, "
"but I'll go down knowing I did something actually important."
msgstr ""
"Oh, ya sabes. Bla, bla, bla, tenía un trabajo y una vida, todos murieron. Buu "
"buu. Tengo que ser sincero contigo: francamente creo que esto me gusta más. "
"¿Luchar por sobrevivir cada día? Nunca me he sentido tan vivo. He matado a "
"cientos de esos bastardos. Tarde o temprano uno de ellos me matará, pero "
"caeré sabiendo que hice algo realmente importante."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/gung_ho_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Well y'see, I'm not from these parts at all.  I was driving up from the South "
"to visit my son when it all happened.  I was staying at a motel when a "
"military convoy passed through and told us to evacuate to a FEMA shelter."
msgstr ""
"Bueno, verás, no soy de por aquí en absoluto. Estaba conduciendo desde el Sur "
"para visitar a mi hijo cuando sucedió. Me estaba quedando en un hotel cuando "
"una caravana militar pasó y nos dijo que evacuáramos a un refugio de la FEMA."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/gung_ho_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"He lives up in Northern Canada, way in the middle of nowhere, with his crazy "
"wife and my three grandkids.  He's an environmental engineer for some oil and "
"gas company out there.  She's a bit of a hippy-dippy headcase.  I love em "
"both though, and as far as I'm concerned they all made it out of this fucked "
"up mess safe, out there in the boondocks.  I guess they think I'm dead, so "
"they'll steer clear of this hellhole, and that's the best as could be."
msgstr ""
"Vive en el norte de Canadá, en medio de la nada, con su mujer loca y mis tres "
"nietos. Es ingeniero medioambiental para una de esas empresas de petróleo y "
"gas. Ella es un poco hippie. Sin embargo, los quiero a los dos y, por lo que "
"a mí respecta, todos han conseguido salir sanos y salvos de este desastre. "
"Supongo que piensan que estoy muerto, por lo que se mantendrán alejados de "
"este infierno, y eso es lo mejor que puede pasar."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/gung_ho_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Lord no.  I'll be fucked if I let a kid in a too-big uniform tell me what the "
"hell to do.  I had my Hummer loaded out and ready to go offroading, I had a "
"ton of gas, and I even had as many rifles as the border was gonna let me "
"bring over.  I didn't know what I was supposed to be running from, but I sure "
"as shit didn't run."
msgstr ""
"Señor, no. Estaré jodido si dejo que un chaval con un uniforme demasiado "
"grande me diga lo que tengo que hacer. Tenía mi Hummer cargado y listo para "
"ir por el campo, tenía una tonelada de gasolina, e incluso tenía todos los "
"rifles que la frontera me iba a permitir pasar. No sabía de qué se suponía "
"que tenía que huir, pero te aseguro que no huí."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/gung_ho_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"At first, I just kept going North, but I ran into a huge military blockade.  "
"They even had those giant walking robots like on TV.  I started going up to "
"check it out, and before I knew it they were opening fire!  I coulda died, "
"but I still have pretty good reactions.  I turned tail and rolled out of "
"there.  My Hummer had taken some bad hits though, and I found out the hard "
"way I was leaking gas all down the freeway.  Made it a few miles before I "
"wound up stuck in the ass-end of nowhere.  I settled in to wander.  I guess "
"I'm still kinda heading North, just by a pretty round-about way, you know?"
msgstr ""
"Al principio, fui hacia el Norte, pero me topé con un enorme bloqueo militar. "
"Incluso tenían esos robots gigantes ambulantes como en la tele. Empecé a "
"subir para echarle un vistazo y, antes de darme cuenta, ¡estaban abriendo "
"fuego! Podría haber muerto, pero todavía tengo buenos reflejos. Di media "
"vuelta y salí rodando de allí. Sin embargo, mi Hummer había recibido algunos "
"impactos, y descubrí por las malas que estaba perdiendo gasolina por toda la "
"autopista. Recorrí unos kilómetros antes de quedarme atascado en el culo del "
"mundo. Me dediqué a vagar. Supongo que sigo yendo hacia el Norte, pero de una "
"manera bastante indirecta, ¿sabes?"

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/gung_ho_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"We're all thinking the same thing, aren't we?  Not much this could be but "
"some kind of secret military bullshit.  At first, I thought it was our own "
"government, but after all that went down, it's just too much.  It must've "
"been the Chinese.  I wonder if those sons of bitches are sitting back home, "
"right as rain, watching us struggling down here and waiting for things to die "
"down."
msgstr ""
"Todos estamos pensando lo mismo, ¿no? Esto no puede ser más que algún tipo de "
"mierda militar secreta. Al principio, pensé que era nuestro propio gobierno, "
"pero después de todo lo que pasó, es demasiado. Deben haber sido los chinos. "
"Me pregunto si esos hijos de puta están sentados en casa, mirando cómo "
"luchamos aquí y esperando a que las cosas se calmen."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/gung_ho_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I dunno, I'm no expert.  You might not remember, but there was that big news "
"a couple years back that supposedly China had some kind of super fusion "
"reactor.  I read a news article, apparently that was all a front for some "
"other kind of secret weapon they were working on.  Made so much energy, there "
"was no way to hide it, so they made it a story about fusion power instead.  "
"That'd explain why we never saw fusion power Stateside, don't you think?  And "
"if they were that much more advanced that they could make fusion power, who "
"knows what else they could make."
msgstr ""
"No sé, no soy un experto. Puede que no lo recuerdes, pero hubo una gran "
"noticia hace un par de años de que supuestamente China tenía algún tipo de "
"súper reactor de fusión. Leí un reportaje, aparentemente todo era una fachada "
"para algún otro tipo de arma secreta en la que estaban trabajando. Producía "
"tanta energía que no había forma de ocultarlo, así que lo convirtieron en una "
"historia sobre la energía de fusión. Eso explicaría por qué nunca vimos la "
"energía de fusión en Estados Unidos, ¿no crees? Y si estaban tan avanzados "
"que podían hacer energía de fusión, quién sabe qué más podrían hacer."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/high_school_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I was at school.  I'm a senior.  We'd heard about riots… it started with a "
"kid showing videos of one of the big riots in Providence.  You've probably "
"seen it, the one where the woman turns to the camera and you can see her "
"whole lower lip has been ripped off, and is just flapping there?  It got so "
"bad, they went over the PA system to tell us about Chinese drugs in the water "
"supply.  Right… does anyone buy that explanation?"
msgstr ""
"Estaba en la escuela. En el último curso. Habíamos oído hablar de "
"disturbios... todo empezó con un chico que mostraba vídeos de uno de los "
"grandes disturbios de Providence. Probablemente lo has visto, ese en el que "
"la mujer se vuelve hacia la cámara y puedes ver que le han arrancado todo el "
"labio inferior, y está ahí aleteando... La cosa se puso tan fea, que por "
"megafonía nos hablaron de drogas chinas en el suministro de agua. Bien... "
"¿alguien se cree esa explicación?"

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/high_school_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I guess it got worse, because the faculty decided to put us in lockdown.  For "
"hours.  And then the school buses showed up to evacuate us.  Eventually, they "
"ran out of buses.  I was one of the lucky few who didn't have a bus to get "
"on.  The soldiers weren't much older than me… they didn't look like they knew "
"what was going on.  I lived just a few blocks away.  I snuck off."
msgstr ""
"Supongo que empeoró, porque la facultad decidió encerrarnos. Durante horas. Y "
"después llegaron los autobuses escolares para evacuarnos. Al final, se "
"quedaron sin autobuses. Yo fui uno de los pocos afortunados que no tuvo un "
"autobús al que subirse. Los soldados no parecían mucho mayores que yo... ni "
"sabían lo que estaba pasando. Yo vivía a pocas manzanas así que me escape."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/high_school_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Yeah.  On the way there, I met some <zombies> for real.  They chased me, but "
"I did pretty well in track.  I lost them… but I couldn't get home, there were "
"just too many.  I wound up running more.  Stole a bike and ran more again.  "
"I'm a bit better at killing those things now, but I haven't made it home yet. "
" I guess I'm afraid of what I'll find."
msgstr ""
"Sí. En el camino, me encontré con algunos <zombies> de verdad. Me "
"persiguieron, pero siempre he sido bastante bueno en la pista. Los perdí... "
"pero no pude llegar a casa, eran demasiados. Terminé corriendo más. Robé una "
"bici y volví a huir más. Ahora soy un poco mejor matando esas cosas, pero aún "
"no he llegado a casa. Supongo que tengo miedo de lo que voy a encontrar."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hospital_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I saw it all pretty early, before it all really started.  I worked at the "
"hospital.  It started with a jump in the number of code whites - that's an "
"aggressive patient.  Wasn't my training so I didn't hear about it until "
"later… but rumors started flying about hyperaggressive delirious patients "
"that coded and seemed to die, then started attacking staff, and wouldn't "
"respond to anything we hit them with.  Then a friend of mine was killed by "
"one of them, and I realized it wasn't just a few weird reports.  I called in "
"sick the next day."
msgstr ""
"Lo vi todo muy pronto, antes de que todo empezara de verdad. Trabajaba en el "
"hospital. Empezó con un incremento en el número de códigos blancos, que son "
"pacientes agresivos. No era mi especialidad, así que no me enteré hasta "
"después... pero empezaron a correr rumores sobre pacientes delirantes "
"hiperagresivos que colapsaban y parecían morir, luego empezaban a atacar al "
"personal y no respondían a nada de lo que les aplicábamos. Cuando uno de "
"ellos mató a un amigo mío, me di cuenta de que no se trataba sólo de unos "
"rumores raros. Al día siguiente avisé de que estaba enfermo."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hospital_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Well, <the_cataclysm>.  I lived a fair distance out of town, and I already "
"knew something was seriously wrong, but I hadn't admitted to myself what I "
"was really seeing quite yet.  When I saw the military convoys pouring into "
"the city, I put the pieces together.  At first I thought it was just my "
"hospital.  Still, I packed up my bags, locked the doors and windows, and "
"waited for the evacuation call."
msgstr ""
"Bueno, <the_cataclysm>. Yo vivía bastante lejos de la ciudad y ya sabía que "
"algo iba muy mal, pero aún no me había reconocido a mí mismo lo que realmente "
"estaba viendo. Cuando vi las caravanas militares entrando en la ciudad, "
"empecé a atar cabos. Al principio pensé que se trataba de mi hospital. Aun "
"así, hice las maletas, cerré puertas y ventanas y esperé la llamada de "
"evacuación."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hospital_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"No.  The call came too late.  I'd already seen the clouds on the horizon.  "
"Mushroom clouds, and also those insane hell-clouds.  I've heard that horrible "
"things came out of them.  I decided it was safer in my locked up house."
msgstr ""
"No. La llamada llegó demasiado tarde. Ya había visto las nubes en el "
"horizonte. Nubes en forma de hongo, y también esas descabelladas nubes "
"infernales. Había oído que cosas horribles salían de ellas. Decidí que era "
"más seguro quedarme en mi casa encerrado."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hospital_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"The military happened.  They showed up and commandeered my land for some kind "
"of forward base, demanding I evacuate to a FEMA camp.  I didn't even try to "
"argue… I had my dad's old hunting rifle, they had high tech weapons.  I heard "
"one of them joking about the FEMA camp being Auschwitz, though.  I gave their "
"evac driver the slip and decided to make for my sister's place up north.  In "
"theory I guess I'm still going that way, although honestly I'm just busy not "
"dying."
msgstr ""
"El ejército apareció. Se presentaron y requisaron mi tierra para una especie "
"de base avanzada, exigiendo que evacuara a un campamento de la FEMA. Ni "
"siquiera intenté discutir... Yo tenía el viejo rifle de caza de mi padre, "
"ellos tenían armas de alta tecnología. Oí a uno de ellos bromear sobre el "
"campo de la FEMA como Auschwitz. Le di esquinazo al conductor de evacuación "
"que me seguía y decidí ir a casa de mi hermana en el norte. En teoría, "
"supongo que todavía voy en esa dirección, aunque sinceramente estoy ocupado "
"en no morir."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hospital_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I was at work at the hospital, when it all went down.  It's a bit of a blur.  "
"For a while there were weird reports, stuff that sounded unbelievable about "
"patients getting back up after dying, but mostly things were business as "
"usual.  Then, towards the end, stuff just skyrocketed.  We thought it was a "
"Chinese attack, and that's what we were being told.  People coming in crazed, "
"covered in wounds from bullets and bites.  About halfway through my shift I… "
"well, I broke."
msgstr ""
"Me encontraba trabajando en el hospital cuando ocurrió todo. Lo recuerdo un "
"poco borroso. Durante un tiempo hubo noticias extrañas, cosas que parecían "
"increíbles sobre pacientes que se levantaban después de morir, pero la "
"mayoría de las situaciones eran normales. Luego, hacia el final, las cosas se "
"desbordaron. Pensábamos que era un ataque chino, y eso es lo que nos decían. "
"La gente llegaba enloquecida, cubierta de heridas de balas y mordeduras. "
"Hacia la mitad de mi turno yo... bueno, me quebré."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hospital_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I was at work at the hospital, when it all went down.  It's a bit of a blur.  "
"For a while there were weird reports, stuff that sounded unbelievable about "
"patients getting back up after dying, but mostly things were business as "
"usual.  Then, towards the end, stuff just skyrocketed.  We thought it was a "
"Chinese attack, and that's what we were being told.  People coming in crazed, "
"covered in wounds from bullets and bites.  About halfway through my shift I… "
"well, I broke.  I'd seen such horrible injuries, and then I…  <swear!>  I "
"can't even talk about it."
msgstr ""
"Estaba trabajando en el hospital cuando todo sucedió. Lo recuerdo un poco "
"borroso. Durante un tiempo hubo informes extraños, cosas que parecían "
"increíbles, como pacientes que resucitaban tras morir, pero en general todo "
"seguía como de costumbre. Luego, hacia el final, todo se disparó. Pensamos "
"que era un ataque chino, y eso era lo que nos decían. La gente llegaba "
"enloquecida, cubierta de heridas de bala y mordiscos. A mitad de mi turno, "
"yo... bueno, me derrumbé. Había visto heridas tan horribles, y entonces... "
"¡Maldita sea! Ni siquiera puedo hablar de ello."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hospital_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"A young mother.  I know she was a mother, because I delivered her baby.  "
"Sweet girl, she… she had a good sense of humor.  She came in, spitting that "
"black goo, fighting the orderlies, dead from a bullet wound through the "
"chest.  That's when I… I don't know if I woke up, finally, or if I finally "
"went crazy.  Either way, I broke.  I broke a lot earlier than my colleagues, "
"and that's the only reason I lived.  I skipped out, went to a dead corner of "
"the hospital I used to hide in when I was a resident.  An old stairwell "
"leading to a closed-off unit the maintenance staff were using to store old "
"equipment.  I hid there for hours, while I listened to the world crumbling "
"outside and inside."
msgstr ""
"Una madre joven. Sé que era madre, porque atendí su parto. Una chica dulce, "
"ella... tenía un buen sentido del humor. Entró, escupiendo esa sustancia "
"negra, luchando contra los camilleros, muerta de una herida de bala en el "
"pecho. Ahí fue cuando yo... no sé si finalmente desperté, o si finalmente "
"enloquecí. De cualquier manera, me quebré. Me rompí mucho antes que mis "
"colegas, y esa es la única razón por la que viví. Me escapé, fui a un rincón "
"muerto del hospital en el que solía esconderme cuando era residente. Una "
"vieja escalera que conducía a una unidad cerrada que el personal de "
"mantenimiento utilizaba para almacenar equipos viejos. Me escondí allí "
"durante horas, mientras escuchaba cómo el mundo se desmoronaba fuera y dentro."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hospital_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Somehow, I don't know how, I managed to fall asleep in there.  I think it "
"might have started with me hyperventilating and passing out.  When I woke up "
"it was night, I was starving and parched, and… and the screaming had died "
"down.  At first I tried to go out the way I came in, but I peaked out the "
"window and saw one of the nurses stumbling around, spitting that black shit "
"up.  Her name was Becky.  She wasn't Becky anymore.  So, I went back up and "
"somehow made it into the storage area.  From there, the roof.  I drank water "
"from some nasty old puddle and I camped out there for a while, watching the "
"city around me burn."
msgstr ""
"Ignoro cómo me quedé dormido allí. Creo que todo pudo ocurrir cuando "
"hiperventilé y me desmayé. Cuando me desperté era de noche, estaba muerto de "
"hambre y sediento, y... y los gritos se habían apagado. Al principio intenté "
"salir por donde había entrado, por la ventana vi a una de las enfermeras "
"dando tumbos y escupiendo esa mierda negra. Su nombre era Becky. Pero ya no "
"era Becky. Volví a la planta de arriba y de alguna manera llegué al almacén. "
"De ahí, al techo/tejado. Bebí agua de un charco repugnante y me quedé "
"acampado allí un rato, viendo arder la ciudad a mi alrededor."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hospital_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Well, I still didn't have any food.  Eventually I had to climb down the side "
"of the building… so I did, as quietly as I could.  It was night, and I have "
"pretty good nightvision.  Apparently the zombies don't, because I was able to "
"slip right past them and steal a bicycle that was just laying on the side of "
"the road.  I'd kind of scouted out my route from above… I'm not from a big "
"city, the hospital was the tallest building around.  I avoided the major "
"military blockades, and headed out of town towards a friend's old cabin.  I "
"had to fight off a couple of the <zombies>, but I managed to avoid any big "
"fuss, by some miracle."
msgstr ""
"Bueno, aún no tenía comida. Al final tuve que bajar por el lateral del "
"edificio... así que lo hice, tan silenciosamente como pude. Ya era de noche, "
"y tengo muy buena visión nocturna. Al parecer, los zombis no, porque fui "
"capaz de colarme entre ellos y robar una bicicleta que estaba tirada a un "
"lado de la carretera. Había estudiado mi ruta desde arriba... No vengo de una "
"gran ciudad, el hospital era el edificio más alto de los alrededores. Evité "
"los principales bloqueos militares, y me dirigí fuera de la ciudad hacia la "
"vieja cabaña de un amigo. Tuve que luchar contra un par de <zombies> , pero "
"me las arreglé para evitar cualquier gran alboroto, por algún milagro."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hospital_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Well, I still didn't have any food.  Eventually I had to climb down the side "
"of the building… so I did, as quietly as I could.  It was night, and I have "
"pretty good nightvision.  Apparently the zombies don't, because I was able to "
"slip right past them and steal a bicycle that was just laying on the side of "
"the road.  I'd kind of scouted out my route from above… I'm not from a big "
"city, the hospital was the tallest building around.  I avoided the major "
"military blockades, and headed out of town towards a friend's old cabin.  I "
"had to fight off a couple of the <zombies>, but I managed to avoid any big "
"fuss, by some miracle.  I never made it to the cabin, but that's not "
"important now."
msgstr ""
"Bueno, aún no tenía comida. Al final tuve que bajar por el lateral del "
"edificio... así que lo hice, tan silenciosamente como pude. Ya era de noche, "
"y tengo muy buena visión nocturna. Al parecer, los zombis no, porque fui "
"capaz de colarme entre ellos y robar una bicicleta que estaba tirada a un "
"lado de la carretera. Había estudiado mi ruta desde arriba... No vengo de una "
"gran ciudad, el hospital era el edificio más alto de los alrededores. Evité "
"los principales bloqueos militares, y me dirigí fuera de la ciudad hacia la "
"vieja cabaña de un amigo. Tuve que luchar contra un par de <zombies> , pero "
"me las arreglé para evitar cualquier gran alboroto, por algún milagro. Nunca "
"llegué a la cabaña, pero eso no importa ahora."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hospital_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"My hospital was the tallest building in town, so I saw quite a bit.  The "
"military set up blockades on the roads coming in and out of the town, and "
"there was quite a lightshow going on out there when I started up.  I think it "
"was mostly automated turrets and robots, I didn't hear much shouting.  I saw "
"a few cars and trucks try to run the barricade and get blown to high hell.  "
"There were swarms of <zombies> in the streets, traveling in packs towards "
"sounds and noises.  I watched them rip a few running cars to shreds, "
"including the people inside who were trying to get away.  You know.  The "
"usual stuff.  I was pretty numb by that point."
msgstr ""
"Mi hospital era el edificio más alto de la ciudad, así que vi bastante. Los "
"militares bloquearon las carreteras que entraban y salían de la ciudad, y "
"cuando me puse en marcha había un gran despliegue de luces. Creo que la "
"mayoría eran torretas automatizadas y robots, no oí muchos gritos. Vi algunos "
"coches y camiones que intentaban atravesar la barricada y salieron volando "
"por los aires. Había hordas en las calles, viajando en manadas de <zombies> "
"hacia los sonidos y ruidos. Vi como destrozaban algunos coches en marcha, "
"incluso a la gente que iba dentro intentando huir. Ya sabéis. Lo normal. A "
"esas alturas estaba bastante insensibilizado."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hospital_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I was called in to work at the hospital.  I don't usually work there, I'm a "
"community doctor.  I don't really love emergency medicine at the best of "
"times, and when your patient keeps trying to rip your face off, well, it "
"takes the last bit of fun out of it.  You might think I'm a coward, but I "
"slipped out early on, and I've got no regrets.  There was nothing I could "
"have done except die like everyone else.  I couldn't get out of the building, "
"the military had blockaded us in… so I went to the most secure, quiet damned "
"place in the building."
msgstr ""
"Me llamaron para que trabajara en el hospital. No suelo trabajar allí, soy "
"médico comunitario. No me gusta mucho la medicina de urgencias, y cuando un "
"paciente intenta arrancarte la cara, le quita toda la gracia. Pensarás que "
"soy un cobarde, pero me escapé muy pronto y no me arrepiento de nada. No "
"había nada que pudiera haber hecho excepto morir como todos los demás. No "
"podía salir del edificio, los militares habían bloqueado la zona... así que "
"me fui al lugar más seguro y tranquilo del edificio."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hospital_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"The morgue.  Seems like a dumb place to go at the start of a zombie "
"apocalypse, right?  Thing is, nobody had made it to the morgue in quite a "
"while, the bodies were reanimating too quickly and the staff were just too "
"busy.  I was shaking and puking and I could see the world was ending… I "
"bundled myself up, grabbed a few snacks from the pathologist's desk, and "
"crawled into one of those drawers to contemplate the end of the world.  After "
"breaking the handle to make sure it couldn't lock behind me, of course.  It "
"was safe and quiet in there.  Not just my cubby, the whole morgue.  At first "
"it was because nobody was dumb enough to come down there except me.  Later, "
"it was because nobody was left."
msgstr ""
"La morgue. Parece un lugar tonto al que ir al comienzo de un apocalipsis "
"zombi, ¿verdad? La cuestión es que nadie había llegado a la morgue en "
"bastante tiempo, los cadáveres se reanimaban demasiado rápido y el personal "
"estaba demasiado ocupado. Temblaba y vomitaba, y veía que el mundo se "
"acababa... Me acurruqué, cogí unos bocadillos de la mesa del patólogo y me "
"metí en uno de esos cajones para contemplar el fin del mundo. Después de "
"romper la manija para asegurarme de que no se pudiera cerrar detrás de mí, "
"claro. Allí dentro estaba a salvo y en silencio. No solo mi cubículo, toda la "
"morgue. Al principio era porque nadie era tan tonto como para bajar allí "
"excepto yo. Más tarde, era porque no quedaba nadie."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hospital_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"The door was good heavy steel with no window, and there was a staff room with "
"a fully stocked fridge, so when it became clear that nothing was going to get "
"any better on its own, I set up shop.  I stayed down there for a couple days. "
" I could hear explosions and screaming for the first while, then just guns "
"and explosions, and then it got really quiet.  Eventually, I ran out of "
"snacks, so I worked up the nerve to climb out a window and check out the city "
"by night.  I used that place as a base for a little while, but the area "
"around the hospital was too hot to keep it up, so I made my way out to "
"greener pastures.  And here I am."
msgstr ""
"La puerta era de acero macizo, sin ventanas, y había una sala para el "
"personal con una nevera bien surtida, así que cuando quedó claro que la "
"situación no iba a mejorar por sí sola, me instalé allí. Me quedé allí abajo "
"un par de días. Al principio se oían explosiones y gritos, luego solo "
"disparos y explosiones, y después todo quedó en silencio. Al final, me quedé "
"sin comida, así que me armé de valor, salí por la ventana y fui a ver cómo "
"estaba la ciudad por la noche. Utilicé ese lugar como base durante un tiempo, "
"pero la zona alrededor del hospital era demasiado peligrosa para quedarme, "
"así que me fui a pastos más verdes. Y aquí estoy."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hunter_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I live way out of town.  I hear the small towns lasted a bit longer than the "
"big cities.  Doesn't matter to me, I was out on my end-of-winter hunting "
"trip, I'd been out of town for a week already.  First clue I had things were "
"going wrong was when I saw a mushroom cloud out near an old abandoned "
"military base, way out in the middle of nowhere.  I didn't think much about "
"that.  Then I was attacked by a demon."
msgstr ""
"Vivo muy lejos de la ciudad. He oído que los pueblos pequeños duraron un poco "
"más que las grandes ciudades. No me importa, estaba en mi viaje de caza de "
"fin de invierno, llevaba ya una semana fuera de la ciudad. La primera pista "
"que tuve de que las cosas iban mal fue cuando vi una nube con forma de hongo "
"cerca de una antigua base militar abandonada, en medio de la nada. No pensé "
"mucho en eso. Entonces me atacó un demonio."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hunter_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Yeah, it was like a… like a soft shelled crab, with tentacle mouths, and it "
"kept talking in different voices.  I saw it before it saw me, and I capped it "
"with my Remington.  That just pissed it off, but I got another couple shots "
"off while it charged me.  Third or fourth shot took it down.  I figured out "
"shit had hit the fan, somehow.  Headed to my cabin and camped out there for a "
"while, but I had to skip out when a bunch of <zombies> showed up and trashed "
"the place.  I ran into you not much later."
msgstr ""
"Sí, era como un... como un cangrejo de caparazón blando, con bocas "
"tentaculares, y no paraba de hablar en diferentes voces. Lo vi antes de que "
"me viera, y le disparé con mi Remington. Eso lo enfureció, pero le disparé un "
"par de veces más mientras me atacaba. El tercer o cuarto disparo lo derribó. "
"Me di cuenta de que la cosa se había puesto fea. Me dirigí a mi cabaña y "
"acampé allí un rato, pero tuve que irme cuando aparecieron unos cuantos "
"<zombies> y destrozaron el lugar. Me encontré contigo poco después."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hunter_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Yeah… the… the accident got him, but when I came to he was already coming "
"back.  Thank god for seatbelts, right?  He was screeching and flapping "
"around, hanging upside down.  I thought he was just hurt at first, but he "
"just kept coming at me while I tried to talk to him.  His arm was badly hurt "
"already and instead of unbuckling himself he started… he was ripping it right "
"off pulling against the seatbelt.  That, and the crazy shit with the chopper, "
"was when I realized just how fucked up things had got.  I grabbed my hunting "
"knife and ran, but my brother got out and started crawling after me."
msgstr ""
"Sí... el... el accidente lo atrapó, pero cuando volví en sí ya estaba "
"retornando. Gracias a Dios por los cinturones de seguridad, ¿verdad? Estaba "
"chillando y sacudiéndose, colgando bocaabajo. Al principio pensé que sólo "
"estaba herido, pero siguió viniendo hacia mí mientras intentaba hablar con "
"él. Su brazo ya estaba malherido y en vez de desabrocharse el cinturón "
"empezó... ...a arrancárselo tirando del cinturón de seguridad. Eso, y la "
"mierda del helicóptero, fue cuando me di cuenta de lo jodidas que estaban las "
"cosas. Agarré mi cuchillo de caza y corrí, pero mi hermano salió y empezó a "
"reptar tras de mí."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hunter_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I ran for a little bit, but then I saw soldier zombies crawling out of that "
"chopper.  They had the same look about them as my brother did, and it was "
"them on one side and him on the other.  I'm no genius but I've seen a few "
"movies: I figured out what was happening.  I didn't want to take on Kevlar "
"armor with my knife, so I turned back and faced the other zombie.  I couldn't "
"let my brother stay… like that.  So I did what I had to, and I guess I'll "
"live with that forever."
msgstr ""
"Corrí un poco, pero entonces vi a los zombis soldados reptando de ese "
"helicóptero. Tenían el mismo aspecto que mi hermano, y eran ellos por un lado "
"y él por el otro. No soy un genio, pero he visto algunas películas y me "
"imaginé lo que estaba pasando. No quería enfrentarme a una armadura de kevlar "
"con mi cuchillo, así que me di la vuelta y me enfrenté al otro zombi. No "
"podía dejar que mi hermano se quedara... así. Así que hice lo que tenía que "
"hacer, y supongo que es algo con lo que tendré que vivir."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/lab_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"For me, this started a couple days before <the_cataclysm>.  I'm a biochemist. "
" I did my postdoc work with a brilliant colleague, Pat Dionne.  I hadn't "
"talked to Pat in ages… word has it, the government got wind of our thesis, "
"found out Pat did most of the heavy lifting, and that was the last we talked "
"for years.  So, I was a bit surprised to see an e-mail from "
"Pat.Dionne@FreeMailNow.co.ru… even more surprised when it was a series of "
"nostalgic references to a D&D game we played years earlier."
msgstr ""
"Para mí, esto comenzó un par de días antes d<the_cataclysm> . Soy bioquímico. "
"Hice mi trabajo postdoctoral con un brillante colega, Pat Dionne. No había "
"hablado con Pat en años... se dice que el gobierno se enteró de nuestra "
"tesis, descubrió que Pat hizo la mayor parte del trabajo pesado, y esa fue la "
"última vez que hablamos durante años. Así que me sorprendió un poco ver un "
"correo electrónico de Pat.Dionne@FreeMailNow.co.ru... más aún cuando era una "
"serie de referencias nostálgicas a un juego de D&D al que jugamos años atrás."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/lab_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Well, the references weren't quite right.  Pat referred to things that we'd "
"never played.  The situations were close, but not right, and when I put it "
"all together, it told a story.  A story about a scholar whose kids were being "
"held captive by a corrupt government, forced to research dark magic for them. "
" And there was a clincher: A warning that the magic had escaped, a warning "
"that all heroes had to leave the kingdom before it fell."
msgstr ""
"Bueno, las referencias no eran del todo correctas. Pat se refería a cosas a "
"las que nunca habíamos jugado. Las situaciones eran parecidas, pero no "
"exactas, y cuando lo combiné todo, contaba una historia. Una historia sobre "
"un erudito cuyos hijos estaban cautivos de un gobierno corrupto, obligados a "
"investigar magia oscura para ellos. Y había un final: Una advertencia de que "
"la magia se había escapado, una alerta de que todos los héroes debían "
"abandonar el reino antes de que cayera."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/lab_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Listen, I know it's incredibly cheesy.  That's D&D for you.  Anyway, "
"something about the tone really got to me.  I knew it was important.  I "
"wasted a little time waffling, then decided to use my outstanding vacation "
"time and skip town for a while.  I packed for the end of the world.  Turns "
"out, I packed the right stuff."
msgstr ""
"Escucha, sé que es increíblemente cutre. Así es D&D para ti. De todos modos, "
"algo sobre el tono me afectó mucho. Sabía que era importante. Perdí un poco "
"de tiempo dudando, luego decidí usar mi excedente de vacaciones y salir de la "
"ciudad por un tiempo. Hice las maletas para el fin del mundo. Resulta que "
"preparé el equipaje adecuado."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/lab_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"There was, yeah, but it was cryptic.  If I had a copy of Pat's notes, I could "
"probably decipher it, but I'm sure those burned up in <the_cataclysm>.  They "
"bombed those labs, you know."
msgstr ""
"Lo había, sí, pero era críptico. Si tuviera una copia de las notas de Pat, "
"probablemente podría descifrarlo, pero estoy seguro de que se quemaron en "
"<the_cataclysm>. Bombardearon esos laboratorios, ya sabes."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/left_for_dead_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I was late to evacuate when the shit hit the fan.  Got stuck in town for a "
"few days, survived by hiding in basements eating girl scout cookies and "
"drinking warm root beer.  Eventually I managed to weasel my way out without "
"getting caught by the <zombies>.  I spent a few days holed up in an abandoned "
"mall, but I needed food so I headed out to fend for myself in the woods.  I "
"wasn't doing a great job of it, so I'm kinda glad you showed up."
msgstr ""
"Me retrasé en la evacuación cuando se desató la catástrofe. Me quedé atrapado "
"en el pueblo unos días y sobreviví escondiéndome en los sótanos, comiendo "
"galletas de las girl scouts y bebiendo cerveza de raíz caliente. Al final "
"conseguí salir sin que me pillaran los <zombies>. Pasé unos días escondido en "
"un centro comercial abandonado, pero necesitaba comida, así que salí a "
"buscarme la vida en el bosque. No lo estaba haciendo muy bien, así que me "
"alegro de que aparecieras."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/left_for_dead_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I was home with the flu when the world went to shit, and when I recovered "
"enough to make a run to the store for groceries… well, I've been running ever "
"since."
msgstr ""
"Estaba en casa con gripe cuando el mundo se fue a la mierda, y cuando me "
"recuperé lo suficiente para hacer una escapada a la tienda de comestibles... "
"bueno, he estado corriendo desde entonces."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/left_for_dead_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Okay, well, I was kinda out of it those first few days.  I knew there were "
"storms, but I was having crazy fever dreams and stuff.  Honestly I probably "
"should have gone to the hospital, except then I guess I'd be dead now.  I "
"don't know what was a dream and what was the world ending.  I remember "
"heading to the fridge for a drink and noticing the light was out and the "
"water was warm, I think that was a bit before my fever broke.  I was still "
"pretty groggy when I ran out of chicken soup, so it took me a while to really "
"process how dark and dead my building was when I headed out."
msgstr ""
"Bueno, los primeros días estaba un poco fuera de sí. Sabía que había "
"tormentas, pero estaba teniendo unos sueños febriles locos y cosas así. "
"Honestamente, probablemente debería haber ido al hospital, pero supongo que "
"ahora estaría muerto. No sabía qué era un sueño y qué era el fin del mundo. "
"Recuerdo que fui a la nevera a por algo de beber y me di cuenta de que la luz "
"estaba apagada y el agua estaba caliente, creo que fue un poco antes de que "
"me subiera la fiebre. Todavía estaba bastante atontado cuando me quedé sin "
"sopa de pollo, así que me llevó un rato procesar realmente lo oscuro y muerto "
"que estaba mi edificio al salir."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/left_for_dead_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"You probably remember what the cities were like.  I think it was about day "
"four.  Once I stepped outside I realized what was going on, or realized I "
"didn't know what was going on at least.  I saw a bunch of rioters smashing a "
"car, and then I noticed one of them was bashing a woman's head in.  I "
"canceled my grocery trip, ran back to my apartment before they saw me, and "
"holed up there for as long as I could.  Things got comparatively quiet as the "
"dead started to outnumber the living, so I started looting what I could from "
"my neighbors, re-killing them when I had to.  Eventually the <zombies> "
"overran my building and I had to climb out and head for the hills on an old "
"bike."
msgstr ""
"Probablemente recuerdes cómo fue en las ciudades. Creo que fue más o menos el "
"cuarto día. En cuanto salí me di cuenta de lo que estaba pasando, o al menos "
"me di cuenta de que no sabía lo que estaba pasando. Vi a un grupo de "
"manifestantes destrozando un coche, y luego me di cuenta de que uno de ellos "
"estaba machacando la cabeza de una mujer dentro. Cancelé mi viaje al "
"supermercado, volví corriendo a mi apartamento antes de que me vieran y me "
"quedé allí escondido todo el tiempo que pude. Las cosas se calmaron "
"comparativamente cuando los muertos empezaron a superar en número a los "
"vivos, así que empecé a saquear lo que podía de mis vecinos, volviendo a "
"matarlos cuando era preciso. Al final, los <zombies> invadieron mi edificio y "
"tuve que escapar y dirigirme a las colinas en una vieja bicicleta."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/left_for_dead_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"You mean what caused the riots and all that?  Well, they told us it was a "
"Chinese bioweapon but I have troubles believing anyone could engineer a "
"bioweapon that could do all this.  The only answer I can come up with, silly "
"though it sounds, is aliens."
msgstr ""
"¿Te refieres a lo que causó los disturbios y todo eso? Bueno, nos dijeron que "
"fue un arma biológica china, pero me cuesta creer que alguien pudiera diseñar "
"un arma biológica capaz de hacer todo eso. La única respuesta que se me "
"ocurre, por tonta que parezca, son aliens."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/left_for_dead_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Well, maybe, but I'd guess it's too disorganized to be a proper invasion.  If "
"I had to guess, I'd say there was something locked in the polar ice.  Like, "
"remember a few years back there was that big thing online about an alien body "
"found in the ice?  I don't know if you remember but it was all over the news "
"for a while until it turned out to be a hoax.  Only, since then, I've seen "
"some aliens walking around that look a *lot* like that ice body.  Maybe it "
"wasn't a hoax, maybe that was a cover-up.  So, maybe those aliens had some "
"kind of virus.  It went around the world and infected everything silently "
"until, somehow, it activated and caused the violence and monsters and "
"mutations."
msgstr ""
"Bueno, quizá, pero supongo que es muy desorganizado para ser una invasión "
"apropiada. Si tuviera que adivinar, diría que hay algo encerrado en el hielo "
"polar. ¿Te acuerdas que hace unos años hubo una gran noticia en internet "
"sobre un cadáver alienígena encontrado en el hielo? No sé si te acuerdas, "
"pero estuvo en todas las noticias durante un tiempo hasta que resultó ser un "
"bulo. Sólo que, desde entonces, he visto algunos alienígenas caminando por "
"ahí que se parecen *mucho* a ese cuerpo de hielo. Tal vez no fue un engaño, "
"tal vez fue una tapadera. Quizás esos alienígenas tenían algún tipo de virus. "
"Recorrió el mundo e infectó todo de forma silenciosa hasta que, de alguna "
"manera, se activó y causó la violencia, los monstruos y las mutaciones."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/left_for_dead_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Let's not dance around it: I joined the riots, at first.  I don't really "
"remember what I was thinking.  I'd protested stuff like police brutality "
"before, but this was different.  I didn't make a sign and go down there "
"expecting to chant and march, I grabbed a bat and went outside planning to "
"fuck shit up.  I've never felt so angry before.  The riots had already been "
"going on a while at that point, and to me, it just looked like the government "
"trying to squash the people again."
msgstr ""
"No le demos más vueltas: Me uní a los manifestantes, al principio. No me "
"acuerdo de en qué pensaba. Ya había protestado antes por asuntos como la "
"brutalidad policial, pero esto era diferente. No hice una pancarta y fui allí "
"esperando cantar y marchar, cogí un bate y fui fuera planeando mandar todo a "
"la mierda. Nunca me había enfadado tanto. Los disturbios ya llevaban un "
"tiempo produciéndose, y a mí me pareció que el gobierno intentaba aplastar a "
"la gente de nuevo."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/left_for_dead_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Yeah, you're telling me.  The rioters… they weren't even like humans, let "
"alone protesters.  Nothing like any protest I'd ever been in before.  That "
"didn't stop me.  I joined them, and I was as bad as a bunch of them.  Smashed "
"windows, beat up bystanders, burnt cars.  I remember ripping riot gear off a "
"cop and… nevermind.  I don't want to remember that."
msgstr ""
"Sí, ya me lo dices. Los alborotadores... ni siquiera parecían humanos, y "
"mucho menos manifestantes. No se parecía en nada a ninguna protesta en la que "
"hubiera participado antes. Pero eso no me detuvo. Me uní a ellos y fui tan "
"malo como muchos de ellos. Rompí ventanas, golpeé a transeúntes, quemé "
"coches. Recuerdo haberle arrancado el equipo antidisturbios a un policía y... "
"Da igual. No quiero recordar eso."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/left_for_dead_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"At some point, I felt like I was waking up.  It was around the time they were "
"busting out those Humvees with riot control turrets on top.  Says something "
"about my frame of mind that I don't even remember if I'd seen them before "
"that point.  Anyway I heard the gunfire going off and just kinda realized I "
"was on the edges of a mob charging a heavily armed military emplacement.  "
"That's when I started seeing the mob for what it was, seeing the wild-eyed "
"animals, even the zombies.  I turned and ran."
msgstr ""
"En algún momento, sentí que me despertaba. Fue más o menos cuando estaban "
"sacando esos Humvees con torretas antidisturbios en el techo. Dice algo sobre "
"mi estado mental que ni siquiera recuerdo si los había visto antes de ese "
"punto. De todas formas, escuché los disparos y me di cuenta de que estaba en "
"los límites de una turba que atacaba un emplazamiento militar fuertemente "
"armado. Fue entonces cuando empecé a ver a la turba como lo que era, a ver a "
"los animales de ojos salvajes, incluso a los zombis. Me giré y corrí."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/left_for_dead_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I honestly don't know.  I wonder if some of the others would have come back "
"to their senses, given time.  I don't think I'm anything special.  Maybe a "
"lot of them did, and just weren't on the edge of the crowd at the time.  I'll "
"tell you, almost as soon as I came back to myself, I could see some of the "
"rioters looking at me like I was prey.  I didn't stick around to see what "
"would happen."
msgstr ""
"Sinceramente, no lo sé. Me pregunto si algunos de los otros volverían en sí, "
"con el tiempo. No creo que yo sea nada especial. Tal vez muchos de ellos lo "
"hicieron, y simplemente no estaban en el borde de la multitud en ese momento. "
"Te diré, casi tan pronto como regresé a mí mismo, pude ver a algunos de los "
"manifestantes mirándome como si fuera una presa. No me quedé a ver qué pasaba."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/left_for_dead_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I knew the city pretty well.  I went for an abandoned building I knew about, "
"headed through a broken window, and holed up in there for a few days.  I had "
"a fair bit of stolen food and I just kept to myself.  When things started to "
"quiet down, I headed out, and here I am."
msgstr ""
"Conocía la ciudad bastante bien. Fui a un edificio abandonado que conocía, "
"entré por una ventana rota y me refugié allí unos días. Tenía un poco de "
"comida que había robado y me mantuve al margen. Cuando las cosas empezaron a "
"calmarse, me fui, y aquí estoy ahora."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/left_for_dead_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"So, I remember the time leading up to the riots, same as anyone.  Things were "
"bad, there were some really awful crimes being reported in the news, and "
"there was a lot of racial tension as usual from the way the cops were "
"handling it.  Then people started rioting, which isn't unusual, but it was "
"weird the kind of places that the riots were starting in.  Like, upper middle "
"class neighborhoods, Midwestern small towns, things like that.  Anyway, I "
"joined the riots and I don't remember a lot of clear stuff after that."
msgstr ""
"Recuerdo el periodo previo a los disturbios, como todo el mundo. La situación "
"era mala, se informaba de crímenes realmente horribles en las noticias y, "
"como de costumbre, había mucha tensión racial por la forma en que la policía "
"estaba gestionando la situación. Entonces la gente empezó a amotinarse, lo "
"cual no es inusual, pero era extraño el tipo de lugares en los que se "
"iniciaban los disturbios. Por ejemplo, en barrios de clase media alta, en "
"pequeñas ciudades del Medio Oeste, cosas así. En fin, me uní a los disturbios "
"y no recuerdo muchas cosas con claridad después de eso."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/left_for_dead_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Kinda, I guess.  I heard people blaming the riots on some kind of mind "
"control drug, and frankly I'm not sure that's far off base.  That's kinda "
"what it felt like, although the whole time I really felt like myself.  It "
"wasn't until I snapped out of it that I realized how weird it was.  That "
"doesn't explain anything else though: the zombies, the monsters, all this "
"stuff is way off base.  Anything I've tried to guess just sounds like bad "
"science fiction, like demonic curses or alien weapons kinda stuff."
msgstr ""
"Más o menos, supongo. Oí a gente culpar de los disturbios a algún tipo de "
"droga de control mental, y francamente no estoy seguro de que eso esté muy "
"lejos de la realidad. Eso es más o menos lo que sentí, aunque todo el tiempo "
"me sentí como yo mismo. No fue hasta que me desperté que me di cuenta de lo "
"raro que era. Pero eso no explica nada más: los zombis, los monstruos, todo "
"eso se sale de lo normal. Todo lo que he intentado averiguar suena a mala "
"ciencia ficción, como maldiciones demoníacas o armas alienígenas."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/lost_partner_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"That's how it goes, you know?  These are the end times.  I don't really want "
"to talk about it more than that.  And honestly, I never really felt like I "
"belonged, in the old world.  In a weird way, I actually feel like I have a "
"purpose now.  Do you ever get that?"
msgstr ""
"Así es como va, ¿sabes? Estos son los últimos tiempos. Realmente no quiero "
"hablar de ello más que eso. Y honestamente, nunca me sentí como que "
"pertenecía al viejo mundo. De una manera extraña, ahora siento que tengo un "
"propósito. ¿Alguna vez lo has sentido?"

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/lost_partner_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Yeah, have you seen them yet?  They're these shitty walking flowers with a "
"big <freaking> stinger in the middle.  They travel in packs.  They hate the "
"zombies, and we were using them for cover to clear a horde of the dead.  "
"Unfortunately, turns out the plants are better trackers than the <zombies>.  "
"They almost seemed intelligent… I barely made it out, only because they were, "
"uh, distracted."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/lost_partner_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "I said, I don't wanna talk about it.  How are you not understanding this?"
msgstr "He dicho que no quiero hablar de eso. ¿Como es que no lo entiendes?"

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/lost_partner_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Like I said, it's a lame story, but I guess it won't kill me to tell it one "
"more time."
msgstr ""
"Como dije, es una historia aburrida, pero supongo que no me matará contarla "
"una vez más."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/lost_partner_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Yeah.  I really did.  It took me two days to make it across the city on foot, "
"camping out in dumpsters and places like that.  I started moving more by "
"night, and I learned right away to avoid the military.  They were a magnet "
"for the <zombies>, and they were usually stationed where the monsters were "
"coming.  Some parts of the city were pretty tame at first.  There were a few "
"chunks where people had been evacuated or cleared out, and the <zombies> "
"didn't really go there.  Later on, others like me started moving into those "
"neighborhoods, so I switched and started running through the blasted out "
"downtown.  I had to anyway, to get home.  By the time I made the switch "
"though, the fighting was starting to die off, and I was mostly just avoiding "
"attention from zombies and other things."
msgstr ""
"Sí, lo hice de verdad. Me llevó dos días cruzar la ciudad a pie, acampando en "
"contenedores y sitios de ese tipo. Me empecé a mover más por la noche, y "
"aprendí enseguida a evitar a los militares. Eran un imán para los <zombies> , "
"y normalmente estaban situados en los lugares donde venían los monstruos. "
"Algunas partes de la ciudad eran bastante tranquilas al principio. Había "
"algunas partes donde la gente había sido evacuada o desalojada, y los "
"<zombies> no iban por allí. Más tarde, otros como yo empezamos a movernos por "
"esos barrios, así que decidí cambiar y empecé a correr por el centro de la "
"ciudad. Tenía que volver a casa. Para cuando hice el cambio, los combates "
"empezaban a desaparecer y yo me limitaba a evitar la atención de los zombis y "
"otras cosas."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/lost_partner_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"The first warning was that I had to move from the preserved parts of the city "
"to the burnt out ones to get home.  It only got worse.  There was a police "
"barricade right outside my house, with a totally useless pair of automated "
"turrets sitting in front just idly watching the zombies lurch by.  That was "
"before someone switched them to kill everybody, back when it only killed "
"trespassing humans.  Good times, you can always trust bureaucracy to fuck "
"things up in the most spectacular way possible.  Anyway, the house itself was "
"half collapsed, a SWAT van had plowed into it.  I think I knew what I was "
"going to see in there, but I had made it that far and I wasn't going to turn "
"back."
msgstr ""
"El primer aviso fue que tenía que pasar de las partes preservadas de la "
"ciudad a las incendiadas para llegar a casa. La cosa no hizo más que "
"empeorar. Había una barricada policial justo delante de mi casa, con un par "
"de torretas automatizadas delante totalmente inútiles que se limitaban a "
"observar ociosamente a los zombis que pasaban. Eso fue antes de que alguien "
"las modificara para matar a todo el mundo, cuando solo mataban a los humanos "
"intrusos. Buenos tiempos, siempre puedes confiar en que la burocracia joderá "
"las cosas de la forma más espectacular posible. De todos modos, la casa "
"estaba medio derrumbada, una furgoneta SWAT se había empotrado contra ella. "
"Sabía lo que iba a ver allí dentro, pero había llegado hasta ahí y no iba a "
"darme la vuelta."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/meteorologist.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Before <the_cataclysm>, I was just a regular meteorologist.  I worked for the "
"local weather station doing data analysis and stuff.  In general, ordinary "
"boredom.  In my free time I was studying electronics and radio engineering, a "
"bit for work but mostly just as a hobby.  When the riots got serious, my "
"neighborhood was looking pretty sketchy.  I gathered all my things that I "
"managed to carry with me and settled in a radio station that seemed "
"abandoned.  I lived there for a while, doing all sorts of nonsense, until I "
"met you.  I guess you know the rest."
msgstr ""
"Antes d<the_cataclysm> era un meteorólogo normal. Trabajaba para la emisora "
"meteorológica local haciendo análisis de datos y esas cosas. En general, un "
"aburrimiento ordinario. En mi tiempo libre estudiaba electrónica y "
"radioingeniería, un poco por trabajo pero sobre todo por afición. Cuando los "
"disturbios se pusieron serios, mi barrio se puso bastante chungo. Recogí "
"todas las cosas que conseguí llevar conmigo y me instalé en una emisora de "
"radio que parecía abandonada. Viví allí un tiempo, haciendo todo tipo de "
"tonterías, hasta que te conocí. Supongo que ya conoces el resto."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/nerd_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I was at school for <the_cataclysm>.  Funny thing, actually: I was gearing up "
"to run a zombie survival RPG with my friends on the weekend.  Ha, I didn't "
"think it'd turn into a LARP!  Okay….  No, that wasn't funny."
msgstr ""
"Estaba en la escuela cuando pasó<the_cataclysm>. Lo gracioso fue que me "
"estaba equipando para un juego RPG de supervivencia zombi con unos amigos, "
"para el fin de semana. ¡Ja, ni me imagine que se iba a transformar en un "
"juego de rol en vivo!... No fue muy divertido."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/nerd_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Well, I may be a huge <freaking> nerd, but I'm not an idiot.  Plus I'm genre "
"savvy.  We'd already heard about people coming back from the dead, actually "
"that's why I was doing the RPG.  When the cops came to put the school on "
"lockdown I managed to slip out the back.  I live a long way out of town, but "
"there was no way I was going to take a bus home, so I walked.  Two hours.  "
"Heard a lot of sirens, and I even saw jets overhead.  It was getting late "
"when I got back, but my mom and dad weren't back from work yet.  I stayed "
"there, hoping they'd come.  I sent texts but got no reply.  After a few days, "
"well… the news got worse and worse, then it stopped completely."
msgstr ""
"Bueno, puede que sea un gran <freaking> empollón, pero no soy idiota. Además, "
"sé mucho de géneros. Ya habíamos oído hablar de gente que volvía de entre los "
"muertos, de hecho, por eso estaba jugando al juego de rol. Cuando la policía "
"vino a cerrar la escuela, me las arreglé para escapar por la parte de atrás. "
"Vivo muy lejos de la ciudad, pero ni se me ocurría coger el autobús para "
"volver a casa, así que fui andando. Dos horas. Oí muchas sirenas e incluso vi "
"aviones sobrevolando la ciudad. Era tarde cuando llegué, pero mis padres aún "
"no habían vuelto del trabajo. Me quedé allí, esperando a que llegaran. Les "
"envié mensajes, pero no me respondieron. Después de unos días, bueno... las "
"noticias fueron empeorando cada vez más, hasta que dejaron de llegar por "
"completo."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/nerd_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I'm not stupid.  I know they're gone.  Who knows where… maybe in an evac "
"shelter, maybe in a FEMA camp.  Most of everyone is dead."
msgstr ""
"No soy estúpido. Sé que se han ido. Quién sabe dónde ... tal vez a un refugio "
"de evacuación, quizás a un campamento de la FEMA. Casi todo el mundo está "
"muerto."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/nerd_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Eventually the zombies came.  I figured they would.  Before the net cut out, "
"there were plenty of videos online making it clear enough what was going on.  "
"I'd picked out some good gear and loaded my bag up with supplies….  When they "
"started knocking at the door, I slipped out the back and took to the street.  "
"And here I am."
msgstr ""
"Al final llegaron los zombis. Me lo imaginaba. Antes de que se cortara la "
"red, había un montón de vídeos en línea que dejaban bastante claro lo que "
"estaba pasando. Había elegido un buen equipo y cargado mi bolsa con "
"suministros .... Cuando empezaron a golpear la puerta, me escabullí por "
"detrás y salí a la calle. Y aquí estoy."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/no_past_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"This is gonna sound crazy, but I woke up in the forest in the middle of "
"nowhere, freezing cold, about a week before I met you.  I had my clothes, a "
"splitting headache, and absolutely no memory of anything.  Like, I know "
"stuff.  I can talk, I have skills and understanding… but I don't remember "
"where any of it comes from.  I had a driver's license in my pocket and that's "
"the only way I even know my name."
msgstr ""
"Esto va a parecer una locura, pero me desperté en el bosque, en medio de la "
"nada, con un frío glacial, una semana antes de conocerte. Tenía mi ropa, un "
"fuerte dolor de cabeza, y absolutamente ningún recuerdo de nada. Sé cosas. "
"Puedo hablar, tengo habilidades y conocimientos... pero no recuerdo de dónde "
"viene nada de eso. Tenía una licencia de conducir en el bolsillo y es lo "
"único que sé de mi nombre."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/no_past_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Well, not having a memory is weird as heck, but I'll be honest: I think it "
"might be better?  With what's going on, I bet you my memories weren't happy "
"ones.  Besides my driver's license, there were pictures of kids in my wallet… "
"not that that sparked any reaction from me.  I didn't see any kids around.  "
"Maybe losing my mind is a mercy.  Hell, maybe it's some kind of psychotic "
"break and my brain did this to itself.  To be honest with you I think I'd "
"rather focus on surviving, and not worry about it."
msgstr ""
"No tener recuerdos es rarísimo, pero seré sincero: quizás sea mejor... Con lo "
"que está pasando, apuesto a que mis recuerdos no fueron felices. Además de mi "
"carné de conducir, en mi cartera había imágenes de niños... no es que eso me "
"produjera alguna reacción. No había ningún niño cerca. Tal vez la pérdida de "
"mi memoria sea una bendición. Joder, a lo mejor tengo algún tipo de brote "
"psicótico y mi cerebro se ha hecho esto a sí mismo. Para serte sincero creo "
"que prefiero centrarme en sobrevivir, y no preocuparme por ello."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/no_past_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I know it's nuts.  It sounds like fake amnesia from a Bugs Bunny cartoon.  "
"See?  How can I know that, but not remember how I know it?  Like, I remember "
"Bugs Bunny but I don't remember any time I sat down and watched a Bugs Bunny "
"show."
msgstr ""
"Sé que es una locura. Suena como la falsa amnesia de los dibujos animados de "
"Bugs Bunny. ¿Lo veis? ¿Cómo puedo saber eso, pero no recordar por qué lo sé? "
"Recuerdo a Bugs Bunny pero no recuerdo ninguna vez que me senté a ver un "
"episodio de Bugs Bunny."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/no_past_4.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Who I was is gone.  All that stuff burned away in <the_cataclysm>.  Got it?  "
"Who I am now started two days into it.  I was on the run from a big-ass hell "
"zombie, running like I'd always been doing, when I found a steel baseball bat "
"just laying on the ground.  I took it as a sign and beat that gooey bastard "
"to a pulp… and that's when I became me.  I still run, because who doesn't, "
"but I stand my ground now."
msgstr ""
"Quién fui ya no existe. Todo eso se quemó en <the_cataclysm>. ¿comprendes? "
"Quien soy ahora surgió a los dos días. Estaba huyendo de un enorme zombi del "
"infierno, corriendo como lo había hecho hasta ahora, cuando encontré un bate "
"de béisbol de acero tirado en el suelo. Lo tomé como una señal y machaqué a "
"ese cabrón pegajoso... y entonces me convertí en yo mismo. Sigo corriendo, "
"porque quien no, pero ahora me defiendo."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/no_past_4.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I went on, running when I had to and fighting when I could, like the rest of "
"us.  Started learning who I am now.  Lost the bat in a fight against some "
"crazy electric lightning shooting zombie.  It was arcing electricity through "
"my bat so I dropped it and used a nearby plank, but I wound up having to run "
"and leave the ol' slugger behind.  I nearly died that day."
msgstr ""
"Seguí adelante, corriendo cuando tenía que hacerlo y luchando cuando podía, "
"como el resto de nosotros. Comencé a aprender quién soy ahora. Perdí el bate "
"en una pelea contra un zombi eléctrico que lanzaba rayos. Se formó un arco "
"eléctrico a través del bate, por lo que lo dejé caer y utilicé un tablón "
"cercano, pero al final tuve que huir y dejar atrás el viejo bate. Ese día "
"estuve a punto de morir."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/no_past_4.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Listen.  I said it clearly, and if you keep picking at it I'm gonna get mad.  "
"Who I was is gone.  Dead.  I don't give a shit about your 'healthy', don't "
"fucking ask again."
msgstr ""
"Escucha. Lo he dicho claramente, y si sigues insistiendo, me voy a enfadar. "
"Quien era ya no existe. Está muerto. Me importa una mierda tu «saludable», no "
"me lo vuelvas a preguntar, joder."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/no_past_5.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Let's not talk about it, ok?  It just hurts to think about.  I've lost so "
"many people… and I'm sure you have too.  Let's focus on the here and now."
msgstr ""
"No hablemos de eso, ¿vale? Me duele mucho recordarlo. He perdido a demasiada "
"gente... y estoy seguro de que tú también. Concentrémonos en el presente."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/out_of_town_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I didn't even know about <the_cataclysm> right away.  I was way out, away "
"from the worst of it.  My car broke down out on the highway, and I was "
"waiting for a tow for hours.  I finally wound up camping in the bushes off "
"the side of the road; good thing, too, because a semi truck whipped by - dead "
"driver, you know - and turned my car into a skid mark.  I feel bad for the "
"bastards that were in the cities when it hit."
msgstr ""
"Ni siquiera me enteré d<the_cataclysm> de  inmediato. Estaba lejos, lejos de "
"lo peor. Se me averió el coche en la autopista y estuve horas esperando a que "
"me remolcaran. Al final acabé acampando en unos arbustos al borde de la "
"carretera; menos mal, porque pasó un camión semirremolque -con conductor "
"muerto, ya sabes- y convirtió mi coche en una mancha de neumáticos. Me siento "
"mal por los cabrones que estaban en las ciudades cuando ocurrió."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/out_of_town_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Ha, I don't fully understand it myself.  Those first few days were a tough "
"time to be outside, that's for sure.  I got caught in one of those hellish "
"rainstorms, it started to burn my skin right off.  I managed to take shelter "
"under a car, lying on top of my tent.  Wrecked the damn thing, but better it "
"than me.  From what I hear, though, I got lucky.  That was pretty much the "
"worst I saw.  I didn't run into any of those demon-monsters that I hear "
"attacked the cities, so I guess I got off lucky."
msgstr ""
"Ja, yo tampoco lo entiendo del todo. Esos primeros días fueron difíciles de "
"pasar al aire libre, eso seguro. Me pilló uno de esos aguaceros infernales "
"que empezaron a quemarme la piel. Conseguí refugiarme debajo de un coche, "
"acostado encima de mi tienda. Destrocé el maldito cacharro, pero mejor él que "
"yo. Por lo que he oído, tuve suerte. Eso fue prácticamente lo peor que vi. No "
"me topé con ninguno de esos monstruos demoníacos que he oído que atacaban las "
"ciudades, así que supongo que tuve suerte."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/out_of_town_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Besides the acid rain, I mostly saw people fleeing the cities.  I tried to "
"stay away from the roads, but I didn't want to get lost in the woods either, "
"so I stuck to the deep margins.  I saw cars, buses, trucks loaded down with "
"evacuees.  Plenty went right on, but a lot stalled out of gas and other "
"stuff.  Some were so full of gear and people there were folks hanging off "
"them.  Stalling out was a death sentence, because the dead were coming along "
"the roads picking off the survivors."
msgstr ""
"Aparte de la lluvia ácida, vi sobre todo gente huyendo de las ciudades. "
"Intenté alejarme de las carreteras, pero tampoco quería perderme en el "
"bosque, así que me quedé en los márgenes profundos. Vi coches, autobuses y "
"camiones cargados de evacuados. Muchos seguían de largo, pero muchos se "
"quedaban sin gasolina y otras cosas. Algunos estaban tan llenos de equipos y "
"personas que había gente enganchada a ellos. Pararse era una sentencia de "
"muerte, porque los muertos venían por las carreteras matando a los "
"supervivientes."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/out_of_town_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I was out on a fishing trip with my friend when it happened.  I don't know "
"exactly how the days line up… our first clue that Armageddon had come was "
"when we got blasted by some kind of poison wind, with a sort of acid mist in "
"it that burnt our eyes and skin.  We weren't sure what to make of it so we "
"went inside to rest up, and while we were in there a weird dust settled over "
"everything."
msgstr ""
"Yo estaba en un viaje de pesca con mi amiga cuando sucedió. No sé exactamente "
"cómo se sucedieron los días... nuestra primera pista de que el Armagedón "
"había llegado fue cuando nos alcanzó una especie de viento envenenado, con "
"una especie de niebla ácida que nos quemó los ojos y la piel. No sabíamos qué "
"hacer, así que nos metimos dentro a descansar y, mientras estábamos allí, una "
"extraña nube de polvo lo cubrió todo."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/out_of_town_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"She took sick a few hours after we left the lake.  Puking, complaining about "
"her joints hurting.  I took us to a little shop I knew about on the "
"riverside, hoping they might have something to help or at least know what was "
"going on."
msgstr ""
"Ella enfermó unas horas después de dejar el lago. Vomitaba y se quejaba del "
"dolor en las articulaciones. La llevé a una pequeña tienda que conocía en la "
"orilla del río, con la esperanza de que tuviera algo para ayudarla o al menos "
"saber qué le pasaba."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/out_of_town_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"The shop was empty, actually.  She was desperate though, so I broke in.  I "
"found out more about the chaos in towns from the store radio.  Got my friend "
"some painkillers and Gravol, but when I came out to the boat, well… it was "
"too late for her."
msgstr ""
"La tienda estaba vacía, en realidad. Pero ella estaba desesperada, así que "
"entré por la fuerza. Me enteré de más cosas sobre el caos en las ciudades "
"gracias a la radio de la tienda. Le conseguí a mi amiga unos analgésicos y "
"Gravol, pero cuando salí al barco, bueno... ya era demasiado tarde para ella."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/out_of_town_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I wish.  That would have been a mercy.  She was letting out an awful, choking "
"scream, and her body was shredding itself apart.  Mushrooms were busting out "
"of every part of her.  I… I ran.  Now I wish that I'd put her out of her "
"misery, but going back there now would be suicide."
msgstr ""
"Ojalá. Habría sido una bendición. Estaba gritando de forma horrible y "
"ahogada, y su cuerpo se estaba deshaciendo en pedazos. Los hongos salían de "
"todas partes de ella. Yo... corrí. Ahora desearía haber acabado con su "
"sufrimiento, pero volver ahora sería un acto suicida."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Ooooh, boy.  I was ready for this.  The winds were blowing this way for "
"years.  I had a full last man on earth shelter set up just out of town.  So, "
"of course, just my luck: I was miles out of town for a work conference when "
"China attacked and the world ended."
msgstr ""
"Ooooh, caray. Estaba preparado para esto. Hace años que se veia lo que iba a "
"pasar. Tenía un refugio preparado a las afueras de la ciudad. Y claro, suerte "
"la mía: estaba a muchos kilómetros de la ciudad por una conferencia de "
"trabajo cuando China atacó y el mundo se acabó."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Our conference was at a retreat by a lake.  We all got the emergency "
"broadcast on our cells, but I was the only one to read between the lines and "
"see it for what it was: large scale bio-terrorism.  I wasn't about to stay "
"and find out who of my coworkers was a sleeper agent.  Although I'd bet fifty "
"bucks it was Lee.  Anyway, I stole the coordinator's pickup and headed "
"straight for my shelter."
msgstr ""
"Nuestra conferencia era en un retiro junto a un lago. Todos recibimos la "
"emisión de emergencia en nuestros móviles, pero yo fui el único que leyó "
"entre líneas y lo vio como lo que era: bioterrorismo a gran escala. No iba a "
"quedarme a averiguar quién de mis compañeros era un agente infiltrado. Aunque "
"apostaría cincuenta pavos a que era Lee. En fin, robé la camioneta del "
"coordinador y me dirigí directamente a mi refugio."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"No, I barely got two miles.  I crashed into some kind of hell-spawn "
"bio-weapon, a crazy screeching nightmarish thing made of arms and legs and "
"heads from all sorts of creatures, humans too.  I think I killed it, but I "
"know for sure I killed the truck.  Grabbed my duffel bag and ran, after "
"putting a couple bullets into it for good measure.  I hope I never see "
"something like that again."
msgstr ""
"No, apenas recorrí dos millas. Chocé contra una especie de arma biológica "
"infernal, una cosa aterradora y chirriante hecha de brazos, piernas y cabezas "
"de todo tipo de criaturas, incluidos humanos. Creo que la maté, pero sé con "
"certeza que destrocé la camioneta. Cogí mi bolsa de viaje y eché a correr, "
"después de meterle un par de balas por si acaso. Espero no volver a ver nunca "
"algo así."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I never made it there and can't imagine I ever will.  Every time I've tried "
"I've been headed off by the <zombies>."
msgstr ""
"Nunca llegué allí y no creo que lo haga nunca. Cada vez que lo he intentado, "
"me han impedido el paso los <zombies>."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"The shelter?  Bought the land pretty cheap.  I hired a contractor to build "
"the thing but did the door myself.  Metal pin in the door frame.  Can't open "
"unless you remove it.  There's a little pulley inside you have to pull up to "
"reset.  They made dozens of these in the area, and I couldn't sleep knowing "
"just any <name_b> at that company could waltz in as soon as shit hit the fan. "
" They'd know exactly where to go and what to do!  Nah… how do you think I've "
"made it this long?  Always keep a trick up your sleeve."
msgstr ""
"¿El refugio? Compré el terreno muy barato. Empleé a un contratista para "
"construirlo, pero la puerta la hice yo mismo. Pasador de metal en el marco de "
"la puerta. No se puede abrir a menos que lo quites. Hay una pequeña polea en "
"el interior que tienes que tirar hacia arriba para reiniciarla. Hicieron "
"docenas de estos en la zona, y no podía dormir sabiendo que cualquier "
"<name_b> en esa empresa podría entrar tan pronto como la mierda se desatara. "
"¡Sabrían exactamente dónde ir y qué hacer! No... ¿cómo crees que he "
"conseguido llegar hasta aquí? Siempre guarda un truco bajo la manga."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Nope, that's it.  Got the idea for the door from a book on medieval castles, "
"in case you were wondering.  But instead of a counterweight holding a "
"drawbridge up, I just ram a hex key in a hole."
msgstr ""
"No, eso es todo. Saqué la idea de la puerta de un libro sobre castillos "
"medievales, por si te lo estabas preguntando. Pero en vez de un contrapeso "
"sosteniendo un puente levadizo, simplemente encajo una llave hexagonal en un "
"agujero."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Almost as much as my house, in the end.  I think they realized they could "
"make a lot of money as things got worse and worse.  But it's nicer than my "
"house, too.  They said the ventilation system was built to withstand a month "
"of anything: nuclear fallout, biological attack, you name it.  Concrete and "
"soil above me to absorb radiation, appliances and supplies…  I even brought "
"some old books I've never read.  I always knew it would come to this."
msgstr ""
"Casi como mi casa, al final. Creo que se dieron cuenta de que podían ganar "
"mucho dinero a medida que las cosas empeoraban. Pero también es más bonita "
"que mi casa. Dijeron que el sistema de ventilación fue construido para "
"soportar un mes de cualquier cosa: lluvia nuclear, ataque biológico, lo que "
"sea. Hormigón y tierra sobre mí para absorber la radiación, electrodomésticos "
"y suministros... Incluso traje algunos libros viejos que nunca he leído. "
"Siempre he sabido que llegaría a esto."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"What, like some secret Batcave?  Pull back the curtain and it turns out I'm "
"the communist <name_b> who brewed up a demon bio-weapon in their basement?  I "
"just gave you food, all the tools in my workshop, and the safest hole in the "
"ground in the county.  If I've got any secrets left, they're mine to keep."
msgstr ""
"¿Qué, como una Baticueva secreta? ¿Retiras la cortina y resulta que soy "
"<name_b> el comunista que fabricó un arma biológica demoníaca en su sótano? "
"Acabo de darte comida, todas las herramientas de mi taller y el agujero más "
"seguro del condado. Si tengo algunos secretos, los guardaré para mí."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I knew it…  This whole time.  It was all part of the plan.  The riots, the "
"storms…  You always had control…"
msgstr ""
"Lo sabía... todo este tiempo. Todo era parte del plan. Los disturbios, las "
"tormentas... Siempre tuviste el control..."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I'd have to be absolutely imbecilic to give up the location of my stash to "
"someone I barely know.  For all I know you'd just kill me and take it all for "
"yourself!  Better luck next time, pal."
msgstr ""
"Tendría que ser completamente imbécil para revelarle la ubicación de mi alijo "
"a alguien a quien apenas conozco. Por lo que sé, ¡podrías matarme y quedarte "
"con todo! Mejor suerte la próxima vez, amigo."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Well, that's one way to say 'fuck you'!  I know it's been a while since shit "
"went down, but I didn't lock that door and put up that sign for no reason!  "
"How would you feel if I came and stole all the stuff that YOU locked away for "
"safe keeping?!"
msgstr ""
"¡Bueno, esa es una forma de decir jódete! ¡Sé que ha pasado un tiempo desde "
"que ocurrió, pero no cerré esa puerta y puse ese cartel por ningún motivo! "
"¡¿Cómo te sentirías si yo viniera y robara todas las cosas que TU has "
"guardado a buen recaudo?!"

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Well, that's one way to say 'fuck you'!  How…  Why…  I was still trying to "
"get back there, surviving and struggling just like you!  How would you feel "
"if I came and stole all YOUR stuff right when you needed it most?!"
msgstr ""
"Bueno, esa es una forma de decir ¡que te jodan! ¡Sé que ha pasado un tiempo "
"desde que ocurrió, pero no cerré esa puerta y puse ese cartel sin motivo! "
"¡¿Cómo te sentirías si yo viniera y robara todas las cosas que TU has "
"guardado a buen recaudo?!"

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I guess I can't judge.  I've made some fucked up decisions, too.  Taken some "
"things that aren't mine."
msgstr ""
"Creo que no te puedo criticar. Yo también he tomado algunas decisiones "
"jodidas. He cogido algunas cosas que no son mías."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"You're not really a good liar.  I built that thing like a fortress.  No one "
"would just break into it."
msgstr ""
"La verdad es que no sabes mentir. Construí esa cosa como una fortaleza. Nadie "
"podría entrar en ella."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Just don't lie about it.  I understand your life was probably in danger.  I "
"can see past that.  Trust me, I've been in sticky situations before.  Tell "
"the truth next time."
msgstr ""
"Simplemente no mientas sobre ello. Entiendo que tu vida probablemente estaba "
"en peligro. Puedo ver a través de eso. Confía en mí, he estado en situaciones "
"difíciles antes. Di la verdad la próxima vez."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"&<npc_name> sighs and pauses for a moment.\n"
"\n"
"\"It's been so long now.  I barely even remember what I was doing.  There was "
"so much confusion and violence in those last days.  My family didn't "
"understand the threat, even though I tried to tell them.  I know what you "
"think I am, but look what's happened!  The dead are walking, the sky is "
"cracking open, and…  well, I can't even talk about it.  Isn't it obvious "
"something bigger is going on?\""
msgstr ""
"&<npc_name> suspira y se detiene por un momento.\n"
"\n"
"\"Ha pasado tanto tiempo. Apenas recuerdo qué estaba haciendo. Hubo tanta "
"confusión y violencia en esos últimos días. Mi familia no entendía la "
"amenaza, aunque intenté explicárselo. Sé lo que piensas que soy, ¡pero mira "
"lo que ha ocurrido! Los muertos caminan, el cielo se resquebraja y... bueno, "
"ni siquiera puedo hablar de ello. ¿No es obvio que algo más grande está "
"pasando?\""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I thought I knew at one point.  There were so many signs of manipulation and "
"control.  I thought maybe they were trying to discredit the protests, but "
"when the violence broke out it seemed to be everywhere.  There was footage on "
"the news of people fighting, destroying property, eating animals and… each "
"other in the street.  I thought at some point they were going to sweep in and "
"seize control, but it just never happened."
msgstr ""
"En un momento creí saberlo. Había tantos signos de manipulación y control. "
"Pensé que quizá intentaban desacreditar las protestas, pero cuando estalló la "
"violencia parecía estar por todas partes. Había imágenes en las noticias de "
"gente peleándose, destruyendo propiedades, comiéndose animales y... unos a "
"otros en la calle. Pensé que en algún momento intervendrían y tomarían el "
"control, pero nunca ocurrió."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"You know, the elites.  The ones who have always had control will continue "
"having control, no matter what it costs.  If it means destroying everything "
"to be king of the ashes, they'll do it.  I used to think it was China, for "
"sure, but I'm not so sure anymore.  I figured they would probably be here by "
"now, putting on their crown.  Maybe they're still waiting to make their move…"
msgstr ""
"Ya sabes, las élites. Los que siempre han tenido el control seguirán "
"teniéndolo, cueste lo que cueste. Si eso significa destruirlo todo para ser "
"el rey de las cenizas, lo harán. Solía pensar que era China, con seguridad, "
"pero ya no estoy tan seguro. Me imaginaba que ya estarían aquí, coronándose. "
"Tal vez todavía están esperando para hacer su movimiento ..."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"That's what I'm saying!  Everything that's going on wouldn't be possible "
"without massive fuck-ups by people in power.  China has fusion reactors?  "
"Well, I've never seen it!  America sinks trillions and trillions of dollars "
"into secret military budgets with no explanation.  If you gave me a trillion "
"dollars and the brain of a bureaucrat, I bet I could completely fuck up "
"reality, too."
msgstr ""
"¡Eso es lo que estoy diciendo! Todo lo que está pasando no sería posible sin "
"enormes cagadas por parte de la gente en el poder. ¿China tiene reactores de "
"fusión? Bueno, ¡nunca lo he visto! América invierte billones y billones de "
"dólares en presupuestos militares secretos sin ninguna explicación. Si me "
"dieran un billón de dólares y el cerebro de un burócrata, apuesto a que "
"también podría joder completamente la realidad."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I've been trying not to think about it, but you could be right.  The more "
"that I see, the less I can explain.  I grew up around a lot of people who "
"always talked about the Rapture.  Hell itself opening up and everything.  It "
"was like they KNEW it would happen.  Before the internet stopped working, I "
"saw people saying that sinners were becoming zombies.  'As above, so below' "
"someone said, or something like that…"
msgstr ""
"He intentado no pensar en ello, pero podrías tener razón. Cuanto más veo, "
"menos puedo explicar. Crecí rodeado de mucha gente que siempre hablaba del "
"Rapto. El mismo infierno abriéndose y todo eso. Era como si SUPIERAN que "
"sucedería. Antes de que internet dejara de funcionar, vi a gente diciendo que "
"los pecadores se estaban convirtiendo en zombis. \"Como arriba, así abajo\" "
"dijo alguien, o algo así..."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"She said it was… energy in bones?  Listen, I've heard a lot of crazy bullshit "
"in my time and that's up there, for sure.  And I don't see how something like "
"that explains all the crazy shit I've seen either.  But collecting bones to… "
"save the world?  Fuck it, give it a shot.  Maybe that's something just YOU "
"do, though.  I'm happy believing a lie if that's the truth, I'll be honest."
msgstr ""
"Ella dijo que había... ¿energía en los huesos? Escucha, he oido muchas "
"tonterías locas en mi vida y eso está en el top, sin duda. Y tampoco veo cómo "
"algo así explica todas las locuras que he visto. Pero reunir huesos para... "
"salvar el mundo? Joder, inténtalo. Aunque quizá eso es algo que TÚ sólo "
"haces. Soy feliz creyendo una mentira, siendo honesta esa es la verdad."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "I'm sorry, 'officer'.  I didn't write the book of cop jokes, you know."
msgstr "Lo siento, 'oficial'. Yo no escribí el libro de chistes de policías, sabes."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Scared?  Yeah, that's fair.  I wouldn't say it's a friendly world out here.  "
"Still, it's best to be friends.  Anyone that prepared for the apocalypse is "
"probably armed to the teeth anyway."
msgstr ""
"¿Asustado? Si, es justo. No diría que es un mundo amigable ahí fuera. Aun "
"así, es mejor ser amigos. Cualquiera así de preparado para el apocalipsis "
"esta probablemente armado hasta los dientes."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Oh, man.  I thought I was ready.  I had it all planned out.  Bug out bags.  "
"Loaded guns.  Maps of escape routes.  Bunker in the back yard."
msgstr ""
"Oh, tío. Pensé que estaba listo. Lo tenía todo planeado. Bolsas de "
"emergencia. Armas cargadas. Mapas de rutas de escape. Búnker en el patio "
"trasero."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Depends on your definition.  I'm alive, aren't I?  When Hell itself came down "
"from the skies and monsters started attacking the cities, I grabbed my stuff "
"and crammed into the bunker.  My surface cameras stayed online for days; I "
"could see everything happening up there.  I watched those things stride past. "
" I still have nightmares about the way their bodies moved, like they broke "
"the world just to be here.  I had nothing better to do.  I watched them rip "
"up the cops and the military, watched the dead rise back up and start "
"fighting the living.  I watched the nice old lady down the street rip the "
"head off my neighbor's dog.  I saw a soldier's body twitch and grow into some "
"kind of electrified hulk beast.  I watched it all happen."
msgstr ""
"Depende de tu definición. Estoy vivo, ¿no? Cuando el mismísimo Infierno cayó "
"del cielo y los monstruos empezaron a atacar las ciudades, cogí mis cosas y "
"me metí en el búnker. Mis cámaras de superficie permanecieron conectadas "
"durante días; pude ver todo lo que ocurría allí arriba. Vi pasar a esas cosas "
"a zancadas. Todavía tengo pesadillas sobre la forma en que se movían sus "
"cuerpos, como si hubieran destrozado el mundo solo para estar aquí. No tenía "
"nada mejor que hacer. Vi cómo destrozaban a la policía y al ejército, cómo "
"los muertos volvían a levantarse y empezaban a luchar contra los vivos. Vi a "
"la simpática anciana de la calle de abajo arrancarle la cabeza al perro de mi "
"vecino. Vi cómo el cuerpo de un soldado se retorcía y se convertía en una "
"especie de bestia mole electrificada. Vi cómo sucedía todo."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Honestly?  I was planning to die.  After what I'd seen, I went a little "
"crazy.  I thought it was over for sure, I figured there was no point in "
"fighting it.  I thought I wouldn't last a minute out here, but I couldn't "
"bring myself to end it down there.  I headed out, planning to let the "
"<zombies> finish me off, but what can I say?  Survival instinct is a funny "
"thing, and I killed the ones outside the bunker.  I guess the adrenaline was "
"what I needed.  It's kept me going since then."
msgstr ""
"¿Sinceramente? Estaba planeando matarme. Después de lo que había visto, me "
"volví un poco loco. Pensé que todo había terminado, pensé que no tenía "
"sentido luchar. Pensé que no duraría ni un minuto aquí fuera, pero no me "
"atrevía a acabar allí abajo. Me dirigí hacia afuera, planeando permitir que "
"los <zombies> acabaran conmigo, pero ¿qué puedo decir? El instinto de "
"supervivencia es algo curioso, y maté a los que estaban fuera del búnker. "
"Supongo que adrenalina era lo que necesitaba. Me ha mantenido en marcha desde "
"entonces."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prisoner_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "I was in jail for <the_cataclysm>, but I escaped.  Hell of a story."
msgstr ""
"Me encontraba preso durante  <the_cataclysm>, pero me escapé. Una buena "
"historia."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prisoner_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"It's a bit of a… it's a thing.  It started out as a dare.  I wound up making "
"a bioweapon.  It didn't get used or anything, but, well, it got out of hand."
msgstr ""
"Es un poco ... es una cosa. Comenzó como un reto. Terminé haciendo un arma "
"biológica. No fue usada ni nada, pero, bueno, se me fue de las manos."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prisoner_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Tax evasion.  I was an accountant, and I helped my boss move a hell of a lot "
"of money in some very clever ways.  Not clever enough, it turns out…"
msgstr ""
"Evasión de impuestos. Yo era contable, y ayudé a mi jefe a mover un montón de "
"dinero de forma muy inteligente. No lo suficientemente inteligente, resulta "
"que..."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prisoner_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "Multiple counts of possession.  I used to be really hung up on meth."
msgstr ""
"Múltiples cargos por posesión. Solía estar muy obsesionado con la "
"metanfetamina."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prisoner_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Okay, well, I was in the wrong place at the wrong time.  There was a big "
"fight, I didn't stay clear of it, and me and a bunch of others got tossed in "
"solitary while a few more landed in the infirmary.  Some looked pretty bad, "
"now I kinda wonder if any of them were our first <zombies>."
msgstr ""
"Bien, estaba en el lugar equivocado en el momento equivocado. Hubo una gran "
"pelea, no me mantuve alejado de ella, y a mí y a un montón de otros nos "
"metieron en aislamiento mientras unos cuantos más aterrizaban en la "
"enfermería. Algunos tenían muy mal aspecto, ahora me pregunto si alguno de "
"ellos fue nuestro primer <zombies>."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prisoner_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I heard gunshots, even from down in lockup.  Didn't hear much screaming or "
"anything.  That was my first clue something was up.  Food stopped showing up, "
"next.  Then, the lights went out.  I was down there for maybe hours, maybe "
"days, when finally a flashlight in the bars blinded me.  It was a guard.  He "
"let me out, filled me in on what was going on.  I wanted to think he was "
"crazy, but something in his eyes… I believed him."
msgstr ""
"Oí disparos, incluso desde la celda. No oí muchos gritos ni nada. Esa fue mi "
"primera pista de que algo pasaba. La comida dejó de aparecer. Luego, las "
"luces se apagaron. Estuve allí abajo durante horas, tal vez días, cuando "
"finalmente una linterna en los barrotes me cegó. Era un guardia. Me dejó "
"salir, me informó de lo que estaba pasando. Quise pensar que estaba loco, "
"pero había algo en sus ojos... le creí."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prisoner_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"The guard took off on his own.  Didn't trust us, and I don't blame him.  The "
"other two wanted to set up a bandit gig.  Didn't sit right with me, so I "
"split on pretty good terms.  I ran into the guard a couple more times.  "
"Thought of seeing if he'd travel with me, but I dunno.  I don't think he'd "
"take the offer, I'll always be a con to him.  If you want to try, I can tell "
"you where I saw him last.  Wasn't long before I met you, and he had a good "
"thing going, might still be there."
msgstr ""
"El guardia se marchó por su cuenta. No confiaba en nosotros, y no le culpo. "
"Los otros dos querían montar una banda de bandidos. No me pareció bien, así "
"que me fui sin problemas. Me encontré con el guardia un par de veces más. "
"Pensé en preguntarle si viajaría conmigo, pero no sé. No creo que aceptara la "
"oferta, siempre seré una estafador para él. Si quieres intentarlo, puedo "
"decirte dónde lo vi por última vez. No fue mucho antes de conocerte, y tenía "
"algo bueno entre manos, puede que aún esté allí."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/professor_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I'm actually a chemistry professor at Harvard.  I'd been on sabbatical for "
"the last six months.  I can't imagine the university was a good place to be, "
"given what I've heard about Boston… I'm not sure anyone made it out.  I was "
"out at my cabin near Chatham, ostensibly working on the finishing touches for "
"a paper, but mostly just sipping whisky and thanking my lucky stars for "
"tenure.  Those were good days.  Then came <the_cataclysm>, the military "
"convoys, the <zombies>.  My cabin was crushed by a fearsome beast, just "
"collateral damage after it got blasted off Orleans by a tank.  I was already "
"busy running frantically by then."
msgstr ""
"En realidad soy profesor de química en Harvard. He estado de año sabático "
"durante los últimos seis meses. No puedo imaginar que la universidad fuera un "
"buen lugar para estar, teniendo en cuenta lo que he oído sobre Boston... No "
"estoy seguro de que nadie haya salido con vida. Estaba en mi cabaña cerca de "
"Chatham, aparentemente trabajando en los últimos detalles de un artículo, "
"pero sobre todo bebiendo whisky y dando gracias a mi buena estrella por tener "
"un puesto fijo. Aquellos eran buenos tiempos. Luego llego <the_cataclysm>, "
"los convoyes militares, los <zombies>. Mi cabaña fue aplastada por una "
"temible bestia, solo un daño colateral después de que un tanque la hiciera "
"volar por los aires en Orleans. Para entonces, yo ya estaba ocupado corriendo "
"frenéticamente."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/religious_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Same as anyone.  I turned away from God, and now I'm paying the price.  The "
"Rapture has come, and I was left behind.  So now, I guess I wander through "
"Hell on Earth.  I wish I'd paid more attention in Sunday School."
msgstr ""
"Igual que cualquiera. Me alejé de Dios, y ahora estoy pagando el precio. El "
"Rapto ha llegado, y me han dejado atrás. Así que ahora, supongo que deambulo "
"por el Infierno en la Tierra. Ojalá hubiera prestado más atención en la "
"Escuela Dominical."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/religious_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Well, I guess that was the Rapture.  It didn't play out how I thought it "
"would.  They made me think it was gonna be a flash of light and then *poof*, "
"everyone's gone.  Instead it was messy and dirty.  Riots in the streets, the "
"military and police serving the Antichrist to gun down the people like - what "
"was it my dad used to say - like wheat before the chaff?  Then when we'd "
"really showed our Sin, God came in with the real plagues.  The dead started "
"walking, getting up with machine gun holes in them to fight the military, and "
"the military started turning on each other too.  After that, the legions of "
"Hell itself came out.  Huge monsters, worse than anything I'd ever imagined, "
"just tore through the cities ripping everything to shreds.  Then they started "
"dying off as quick as they'd arrived, and we were left trying to run and hide "
"from the undead.  A day or two later the power started going out."
msgstr ""
"Supongo que eso fue el Rapto. No fue como yo pensaba. Me hicieron pensar que "
"iba a ser un destello de luz y luego *puf*, todo el mundo se ha ido. En lugar "
"de eso fue caótico y sucio. Disturbios en las calles, el ejército y la "
"policía al servicio del Anticristo para acribillar a la gente -¿qué solía "
"decir mi padre, separar el trigo de la paja? Entonces, cuando realmente "
"habíamos mostrado nuestro Pecado, Dios entró con las verdaderas plagas. Los "
"muertos empezaron a caminar, a levantarse con agujeros de ametralladora para "
"luchar contra los militares, y los militares empezaron a volverse unos contra "
"otros también. Después de eso, las legiones del mismo Infierno salieron. "
"Enormes monstruos, peores que cualquier cosa que hubiera imaginado, arrasaron "
"las ciudades haciéndolo todo pedazos. Luego empezaron a morir tan rápido como "
"habían llegado, y nos quedamos intentando huir y escondernos de los muertos "
"vivientes. Uno o dos días después, empezó a fallar la electricidad."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/rural_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Well, it built up a bit.  There was that acid rain, it burnt up one of my "
"tractors.  Not that I'd been working the fields since… well, it'd been a "
"terrible year and I hadn't done much worth doing.  There were explosions and "
"things, and choppers overhead.  I was scared, kept the curtains drawn, kept "
"changing the channels.  Then, one day, there were no channels to change to.  "
"Just the emergency broadcast, over and over."
msgstr ""
"Bueno, se fue acumulando poco a poco. Hubo una lluvia ácida que quemó uno de "
"mis tractores. No es que hubiera estado trabajando en los campos desde "
"entonces... Bueno, había sido un año terrible y no había hecho nada que "
"valiera la pena. Hubo explosiones y cosas así, y helicópteros sobrevolando. "
"Tenía miedo, mantenía las cortinas cerradas y cambiaba constantemente de "
"canal. Entonces, un día, ya no había canales a los que cambiar. Solo la "
"emisión de emergencia, una y otra vez."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/rural_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"That was the first thing to really shake me out of it.  I didn't really have "
"any very close friends, but there were people back in town I cared about a "
"bit.  I had sent some texts, but I hadn't really twigged that they hadn't "
"replied for days.  I got in my truck and tried to get back to town.  Didn't "
"get far before I hit a <zombie> infested pileup blocking the highway, and "
"that's when I started to put it all together.  Never did get to town.  "
"Unfortunately I led the <zombies> back to my farm, and had to bug out of "
"there.  And now I'm here with you."
msgstr ""
"Eso fue lo primero que me despertó. No tenía amigos íntimos, pero había gente "
"en la ciudad que me importaba un poco. Les había enviado algunos mensajes, "
"pero no me había dado cuenta de que llevaban días sin responderme. Subí a mi "
"camioneta e intenté volver a la ciudad. No llegué lejos antes de toparme con "
"coches con una infestación <zombie> bloqueando la autopista , y fue entonces "
"cuando empecé a atar cabos. Nunca llegué a la ciudad. Desafortunadamente, me "
"traje de vuelta los <zombies> a mi granja, y tuve que salir de allí. Y ahora "
"estoy aquí contigo."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/rural_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"That was the first thing to really shake me out of it.  I didn't really have "
"any very close friends, but there were people back in town I cared about a "
"bit.  I had sent some texts, but I hadn't really twigged that they hadn't "
"replied for days.  I got in my truck and tried to get back to town.  Didn't "
"get far before I hit a <zombie> infested pileup blocking the highway, and "
"that's when I started to put it all together.  Never did get to town.  "
"Unfortunately I led the <zombies> back to my farm, and had to bug out of "
"there.  Might go back and clear it out, someday."
msgstr ""
"Eso fue lo primero que me despertó. No tenía amigos íntimos, pero había gente "
"en la ciudad que me importaba un poco. Les había enviado algunos mensajes, "
"pero no me había dado cuenta de que llevaban días sin responderme. Subí a mi "
"camioneta e intenté volver a la ciudad. No llegué lejos antes de golpear un "
"<zombie> infestado con coches bloqueando la autopista, y fue entonces cuando "
"empecé a atar cabos. Nunca llegué a la ciudad. Desafortunadamente, me traje "
"de vuelta los <zombies> a mi granja, y tuve que salir de allí. Puede que "
"algún día vuelva y lo despeje."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/rural_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Well, I lived on the edge of a small town.  Corner store and a gas station "
"and not much else.  We heard about the shit goin' down in the city, but we "
"didn't see much of it until the military came blazing through and tried to "
"set up a camp there.  They wanted to bottle us all up in town, and I wasn't "
"having with that, so my dog Buck and I, we headed out while they were all "
"sniffin' their own farts."
msgstr ""
"Bueno, yo vivía en las afueras de una pequeña ciudad. Una tienda y una "
"gasolinera y no mucho más. Nos enteramos de la mierda que pasaba en la "
"ciudad, pero no vimos mucho hasta que los militares llegaron y trataron de "
"establecer un campamento ahí. Querían encerrarnos a todos en la ciudad, y yo "
"no estaba de acuerdo con eso, así que mi perro Buck y yo nos fuimos mientras "
"se rascaban el culo."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/rural_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Buck and I slipped out and went East, headin' for my friend's ranch.  Cute "
"little dope thought we were just goin' for a real long walk.  I couldn't take "
"the truck without the army boys catchin' wind of it.  We made it out to the "
"forest, camped out in a lean to.  Packed up and kept heading out.  At first "
"we walked along the highway a little, but saw too many army trucks and buses "
"full of evacuees, and that's when we found out about the <zombies>."
msgstr ""
"Buck y yo nos escabullimos y fuimos al este, hacia el rancho de mi amigo. El "
"tontito pensó que íbamos a dar un paseo muy largo. No podía coger el camión "
"sin que los chicos del ejército se enteraran. Llegamos al bosque y acampamos "
"en un cobertizo. Recogimos y seguimos caminando. Al principio caminamos un "
"poco por la carretera, pero vimos demasiados camiones y autobuses del "
"ejército llenos de evacuados, y fue entonces cuando nos enteramos de los "
"<zombies>."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/rural_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"We got to my buddy's ranch, but the <freaking> g-men had been there first.  "
"It was all boarded up and there was a police barricade out front.  One of "
"those <freaking> turrets… shot Buck.  Almost got me too.  I managed to get my "
"pup… get him outta there, that… it wasn't easy, had to use a police car door "
"as a shield, had to kill a cop-zombie first.  And then, well, while I was "
"still cryin', Buck came back.  I had to…  <swear!>  I… I can't say it.  You "
"know."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/scavenger_merc_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Like I said, you want me to tell you a story, you gotta pony up the whisky.  "
"A full bottle, mind you."
msgstr ""
"Como dije, si quieres que te cuente una historia, tienes que pagar por el "
"whisky. Una botella llena, por supuesto."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/scavenger_merc_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Mostly I just wanted to get some scotch out of you.  There really ain't much "
"of a story.  I was in the marines, years ago.  After that, did security "
"contract work.  I was out guarding some dump of a warehouse when the "
"apocalypse rolled through town.  I was out on the edge of town, armed, and "
"know when to not pick a fight, so I didn't get killed.  Wound up recruited by "
"the Free Merchants early on, and then the Old Guard for a bit, but I was "
"getting itchy feet when you came by with an offer.  Here I am."
msgstr ""
"Más que nada quería conseguir un poco de whisky de ti. Realmente no hay mucha "
"historia. Estuve en los marines, hace años. Después de eso, hice trabajos "
"para seguridad. Estaba vigilando un almacén cuando el Apocalipsis llegó a la "
"ciudad. Estaba en las afueras de la ciudad, armado, y sabía cuando no pelear, "
"así que no me mataron. Al principio me reclutaron los Mercaderes Libres y "
"luego la Vieja Guardia por un tiempo, pero me estaba empezando a inquietar "
"cuando apareciste tú con una oferta. Aquí me tienes."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/scavenger_merc_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Huh.  Hadn't thought about it in ages, but now that you mention it, that was "
"a weird job.  It was just a boarded up warehouse in the middle of nowhere, "
"and I was not a cheap contractor in those days.  Coulda got any fat "
"rent-a-cop to watch it.  I had only just started working there when the shit "
"hit the fan, and I kinda forgot about that to be honest."
msgstr ""
"Huh. No había pensado en eso en años, pero ahora que lo mencionas, fue un "
"trabajo extraño. Era sólo un almacén abandonado en medio de la nada, y yo no "
"era un contratista barato en aquellos días. Cualquier policía gordo de "
"alquiler podría vigilarlo. Yo acababa de empezar a trabajar allí cuando la "
"mierda explotó, y me olvidé un poco de eso para serte sincero."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/scavenger_merc_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Good work, and some fun stuff, but risky.  Without a few hands at my side "
"that I trust, I wouldn't take more of their work.  If I had a solid team, "
"though, I'd happily work for Uncle Sam again."
msgstr ""
"Buen trabajo con cosas divertidas, pero arriesgado. Sin unas cuantas manos a "
"mi lado en las que confiar, no aceptaría más trabajo suyo. Sin embargo, si "
"tuviera un equipo sólido, volvería a trabajar con gusto para el Tío Sam."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/scientist_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Before <the_cataclysm> I worked in a lab.  Don't look at me like that, it had "
"nothing to do with this stuff… I was studying protein-protein interactions in "
"smooth muscle in mice, using NMR.  Nothing even vaguely related to zombies.  "
"Anyway, I was at last year's Experimental Biology conference in San "
"Francisco, and an old friend of mine was talking about some really weird shit "
"she'd heard of coming out of government labs.  Really hush hush stuff.  "
"Normally I wouldn't put much cred into that sort of thing, but from her, it "
"actually had me worried.  I packed a bug-out bag just in case."
msgstr ""
"Antes d<the_cataclysm> trabajaba en un laboratorio. No me mires así, no tenía "
"nada que ver con estas cosas... Estudiaba interacciones proteína-proteína en "
"el músculo liso de ratones, usando RMN. Nada vagamente relacionado con "
"zombis. De todos modos, estaba en la conferencia de Biología Experimental del "
"año pasado en San Francisco, y una vieja amiga mía estaba hablando de algunas "
"cosas realmente raras que había oído salir de los laboratorios del gobierno. "
"Cosas realmente secretas. Normalmente no le daría mucha credibilidad a ese "
"tipo de cosas, pero debido a ella, realmente me preocupé. Preparé una bolsa "
"de emergencia por si acaso."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/scientist_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"The evacuation order sounded, so I evacuated, comparatively quickly.  That "
"got me out before the worst part.  Our evacuation center was useless… me, a "
"couple other evacuees, a few tins of food, and a few emergency blankets.  Not "
"even close to enough to go around.  The evacuees split down the middle into a "
"few camps, and infighting started.  I ran into the woods nearby with a few "
"others.  We got away, had a little camp going.  They tried to make me their "
"leader, thought I knew more about things than I did because I'd come so "
"prepared.  Like I said, I'm not that kind of scientist, but they didn't seem "
"to understand.  I… I did my best."
msgstr ""
"La orden de evacuación sonó, así que evacué, con celeridad. Eso me hizo salir "
"antes de la peor parte. Nuestro centro de evacuación fue inútil... yo, un par "
"de evacuados más, unas cuantas latas de comida y unas cuantas mantas de "
"emergencia. Ni siquiera lo suficiente para todos. Los evacuados se dividieron "
"en varios bandos y empezaron las luchas internas. Corrí a los bosques "
"cercanos con algunos otros. Nos escapamos y montamos un pequeño campamento. "
"Intentaron convertirme en su líder, pensaban que sabía más de las cosas "
"porque había venido muy preparado. Como dije, no soy esa clase de científico, "
"pero no parecían entenderlo. Yo... hice lo que pude."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/scientist_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I thought that us leaving, letting the others have the evac center to "
"themselves, would be enough, but it wasn't.  They tracked us down in the "
"night, a few days later.  They… well… I made it out, along with one other "
"survivor.  The attackers, they were like animals.  We tried to travel "
"together for a while.  I blamed myself, for what had happened, and couldn't "
"really get past it.  We parted ways on good terms not long before I met you.  "
"I just couldn't face the reminder of what had happened."
msgstr ""
"Creí que con que nos fuéramos, dejando que los demás tuvieran el centro de "
"evacuación para ellos, sería suficiente, pero no fue así. Nos localizaron en "
"la noche, unos días después. Ellos... bueno... yo salí, junto con otro "
"superviviente. Los atacantes, eran como animales. Intentamos viajar juntos "
"durante un tiempo. Me culpé a mí mismo por lo que había pasado y no pude "
"superarlo. Nos separamos en buenos términos no mucho antes de conocerte. No "
"podía enfrentar el recuerdo de lo que había pasado."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/scientist_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I've got a memory blank for about three days before and after <the_cataclysm> "
"actually.  I worked at a lab - nothing to do with any of this; physics stuff. "
" I think I was working there when things happened.  My first clear memory is "
"running through the underbrush a few miles from town.  I was bandaged up, I "
"had a messenger bag loaded with gear, and I'd taken a hard hit to the side of "
"my head.  I have no idea what happened to me, but clearly I had already been "
"on the run for a bit."
msgstr ""
"Tengo la memoria en blanco durante unos tres días antes y después "
"d<the_cataclysm>. Trabajaba en un laboratorio, nada que ver con esto; cosas "
"de física. Creo que estaba trabajando allí cuando ocurrieron los hechos. Mi "
"primer recuerdo nítido es el de correr entre la maleza a unos kilómetros de "
"la ciudad. Estaba vendado, llevaba una bolsa cargada de equipo y había "
"recibido un fuerte golpe en un lado de la cabeza. No tengo ni idea de lo que "
"me pasó, pero está claro que ya llevaba un tiempo corriendo."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/soldier_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Listen, I don't want to get too into it.  I was in the reserves, OK?  I "
"didn't sign on for some glory loaded shit about protecting my nation, I "
"wanted to get some exercise, make some friends, and it looks good on my "
"resume.  I never thought I'd get called to active duty to fight <freaking> "
"zombies.  Maybe I'm a deserter, or a chickenshit, but I can tell you one "
"other thing I am that the other grunts ain't: alive.  You can figure the rest "
"out."
msgstr ""
"Escucha, no quiero entrar en detalles. Estaba en la reserva, ¿vale? No me "
"alisté por ninguna mierda gloriosa de proteger a mi país, quería hacer "
"ejercicio, hacer amigos y que quedara bien en mi currículum. Nunca pensé que "
"me llamarían al servicio activo para luchar contra <freaking> zombis. Quizá "
"sea un desertor o un cobarde, pero te puedo decir otra cosa que soy y que los "
"demás soldados no son: estoy vivo. El resto ya te lo puedes imaginar."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/soldier_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I was in the army.  Just a new recruit.  I wasn't even done basic training, "
"they actually called me out of boot camp to serve once the shit hit the fan.  "
"I barely knew which end of the gun the bullets came out of, and they jammed "
"me into a truck and drove me to Newport to 'assist in the evacuation "
"efforts'.  Our orders barely made sense, our officers were as confused as we "
"were."
msgstr ""
"Estaba en el ejército. Era un nuevo recluta. Ni siquiera había terminado el "
"entrenamiento básico y, cuando empezó todo, me llamaron del campo de "
"entrenamiento para que sirviera. Apenas sabía de qué lado del arma salían las "
"balas, me encerraron en un camión y me llevaron a Newport para 'ayudar en los "
"esfuerzos de evacuación'. Nuestras órdenes apenas tenían sentido, nuestros "
"oficiales estaban tan confundidos como nosotros."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/soldier_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"We never even made it to Newport.  The truck got stomped by something "
"gigantic.  I didn't even see it, just saw this huge black-and-green spiny leg "
"jam through the ceiling, through the el-tee.  Heard the tires grinding, felt "
"the truck lift up.  We were kicked off the leg like dog shit off a sneaker.  "
"I don't know how I survived.  The thing rolled over, killed most of us right "
"there.  I musta blacked out for a bit.  Came to, and while I was getting "
"myself out, the others started getting back up.  Long story short, I lived, "
"they didn't, and I ran."
msgstr ""
"Ni siquiera llegamos a Newport. El camión fue aplastado por algo gigantesco. "
"Ni siquiera lo vi, sólo vi una enorme pata espinosa negra y verde atravesar "
"el techo, a través del techo. Oí los neumáticos rechinar y sentí que el "
"camión se levantaba. Fuimos sacudidos de la pata como mierda de perro de una "
"zapatilla. No sé cómo sobreviví. La cosa rodó, mató a la mayoría de nosotros "
"ahí mismo. Debí desmayarme un rato. Me desperté, y mientras yo salía, los "
"demás empezaron a levantarse. En resumen, sobreviví, ellos no, y corrí."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/wedding_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Yeah, in hindsight it maybe wasn't the best choice of dates, huh?  I admit I "
"had cold feet though.  Anyway we were getting hitched at the church.  Lucky "
"for me I was late to the ceremony… I guess some of the fresher corpses in the "
"graveyard had gotten up and started harassing the party."
msgstr ""
"Sí, en retrospectiva tal vez no fue la mejor elección de fechas, ¿eh? Admito "
"que me dio miedo. De todos modos nos casamos en la iglesia. Por suerte para "
"mí llegué tarde a la ceremonia... Supongo que algunos de los cadáveres más "
"frescos del cementerio se habían levantado y habían empezado a acosar a la "
"fiesta."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/wedding_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"After I saw what was going on, I turned around and headed out in the opposite "
"direction.  I've seen zombie movies before.  I picked up some stuff from home "
"and I managed to get out of town before things went really bad.  At the time "
"I thought I was being a coward, but now I know if I'd stayed to help, I'd "
"just be another dripping corpse."
msgstr ""
"Después de ver lo que pasaba, me di la vuelta y salí en dirección contraria. "
"Ya había visto películas de zombis. Recogí algunas cosas de casa y conseguí "
"salir de la ciudad antes de que las cosas se pusieran realmente feas. En ese "
"momento pensé que estaba siendo un cobarde, pero ahora sé que si me hubiera "
"quedado a ayudar, sólo sería otro cadáver chorreante."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/wedding_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I'll be honest with you, I was paying more attention to wedding planning than "
"current events leading up to things.  I knew there were riots going on, but "
"they were out of town.  Even when they got closer to home, I tried to ignore "
"them so we could have our big day.  After the zombies started coming, though, "
"well that's when stuff got really weird.  When I was running from the wedding "
"I swear I saw the sky rip open and monsters fly out of the hole, like "
"something out of Independence Day.  I don't know what it all was, it looked "
"like black magic or something."
msgstr ""
"Seré sincero contigo, estaba prestando más atención a los preparativos de la "
"boda que a los acontecimientos que se avecinaban. Sabía que había disturbios, "
"pero estaban fuera de la ciudad. Incluso cuando se acercaron a casa, intenté "
"ignorarlos para poder celebrar nuestro gran día. Pero cuando empezaron a "
"llegar los zombis, las cosas se pusieron extrañas. Cuando huía de la boda, "
"juro que vi el cielo abrirse y monstruos salir volando por un agujero, como "
"algo sacado de Independence Day. No sé qué era todo aquello, parecía magia "
"negra o algo así."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/OtherSurvivorStories/NC_Farmer_background.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Actually, I ran into another survivor once - survivalist, total nutcase.  He "
"was headed for a military bunker to try and loot it, guessing that didn't go "
"well.  Anyway, he mentioned a pack of survivors who camped out at a farm "
"around here, some of them actually knew about farming.  There's a chance "
"they're still out there, could be worth looking for."
msgstr ""
"De hecho, una vez me encontré con otro superviviente, un superviviente "
"totalmente loco. Se dirigía a un búnker militar para intentar saquearlo, "
"supongo que no le fue bien. De todas formas, mencionó a un grupo de "
"supervivientes que acampaban en una granja de por aquí, algunos de ellos "
"sabían de agricultura. Hay una posibilidad de que todavía estén por ahí, "
"podría valer la pena buscarlos."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/OtherSurvivorStories/NC_SURVIVOR_CHEF_background.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I found a cell phone a while ago and it started ringing.  I picked it up and "
"just listened.  It was this cook, and they just kept talking on and on about "
"some restaurant and all the good food there and asking to be rescued.  Maybe "
"they were just dialing random numbers?  I don't know.  But they might still "
"be out there, and I wouldn't mind a good meal."
msgstr ""
"Hace un rato encontré un móvil y empezó a sonar. Lo cogí y me puse a "
"escuchar. Era un cocinero que no paraba de hablar de un restaurante y de lo "
"bien que se comía allí, y pedía que le rescataran. ¿Quizás simplemente estaba "
"marcando números al azar? No lo sé. Pero todavía puede estar por ahí, y no me "
"importaría una buena comida."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/OtherSurvivorStories/No_Others_01.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "Sorry, but until I met you, I thought I might be the only one left."
msgstr "Lo siento, pero hasta que te conocí, pensé que era el único que quedaba."

#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/TALK_fix_lighthouse.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Boss, here's the thing… just don't be mad, please.  I lied that I'm good at "
"this… I thought I could figure it out, but it's far beyond my comprehension.  "
"I'm sorry."
msgstr ""
"Jefe, este es el problema... no se enfade, por favor. Te mentí diciéndote que "
"soy bueno en esto... Pensé que podría resolverlo, pero está mucho más allá de "
"mi comprensión. Lo lamento."

#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/TALK_fix_lighthouse.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Boss, here's the thing… just don't be mad, please.  I lied that I know "
"something about this… I thought I could figure it out, but it's far beyond my "
"comprehension.  I'm sorry."
msgstr ""
"Jefe, este es el problema... no se enfade, por favor. Te mentí diciéndote que "
"soy bueno en esto... Pensé que podría resolverlo, pero está mucho más allá de "
"mi comprensión. Lo lamento."

#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/npc_survivor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"During one of my night searches of food and supplies, I noticed a bright glow "
"that came from somewhere far away.  I thought that one of the survivors had "
"lit it to indicate their location.  As you can see, I was right.  I managed "
"to find a boat near the nearest shore, on which I set sail."
msgstr ""
"Durante una de mis búsquedas nocturnas de comida y provisiones, noté un "
"resplandor brillante que venía de un lugar lejano. Pensé que uno de los "
"supervivientes lo había encendido para indicar su ubicación. Como puedes ver, "
"estaba en lo cierto. Conseguí encontrar un bote cerca de la orilla más "
"cercana, en el que me hice a la mar."

#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/npc_survivor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I have been sailing on my little boat from coast to coast for a long time.  "
"In truth, the boat was not entirely mine, but it doesn't matter.  That way of "
"life provided me with sufficient safety from the <zombies>, and I managed to "
"get around the sea creatures deftly.  When I saw a distant light, at first, I "
"could not believe my eyes.  Then, I decided to find out what it is."
msgstr ""
"Llevo mucho tiempo navegando en mi barquito de costa a costa. En realidad, el "
"barco no era completamente mío, pero no importa. Ese modo de vida me "
"proporcionaba suficiente seguridad frente a los <zombies>, y me las arreglaba "
"con destreza para sortear a las criaturas marinas. Cuando vi una luz lejana, "
"al principio, no podía creer lo que veían mis ojos. Decidí averiguar qué era."

#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/npc_survivor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"  Unfortunately, during my 'voyage' to this lighthouse, luck turned away from "
"me.  I was attacked by some dreadful creature from the underwater depths.  I "
"couldn't fight off him and he dragged my ship to the bottom.  The waves "
"brought me straight to the shore of this little island.  I still don't "
"understand by what miracle I managed to survive, <name_g>."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/npc_survivor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"  Unfortunately, when I arrived here, I forgot to tie my boat, and during "
"yesterday's storm it was carried off somewhere.  Well, you don't always have "
"to be lucky, right?"
msgstr ""
" Por desgracia, cuando llegué aquí, olvidé atar mi barca, y durante la "
"tormenta de ayer fue arrastrada a alguna parte. Bueno, no siempre se necesita "
"tener suerte, ¿verdad?"

#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/npc_survivor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"  I sailed here a few days ago.  Mikhail and his family are very hospitable.  "
"Unfortunately, during our joint fishing, we were attacked by a swarm of "
"underwater abominations, and my boat was smashed to pieces.  It was so scary, "
"we could barely sail away on Mikhail's ship."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/bunker_shop/TALK_BUNKER_MERCHANT.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"No, no… well, maybe a little.  It was just as wrecked down here as it is up "
"top when I found it, wasn't too hard to fix up.  You're welcome to stay in "
"the spare room awhile, just don't hog it.  You're not the only scav out there."
msgstr ""
"No, no... bueno, tal vez un poco. Estaba tan destrozado aquí abajo como "
"arriba cuando lo encontré, no era muy difícil de arreglar. Eres bienvenido a "
"quedarte en la habitación de invitados un tiempo, pero no la acapares. No "
"eres el único carroñero ahí fuera."

#: data/json/npcs/bunker_shop/TALK_BUNKER_MERCHANT.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Just a scav who got lucky.  Now I'm content to sit around here on my pile of "
"treasure.  I'm more than willing to trade if you've got the cash."
msgstr ""
"Sólo un carroñero que tuvo suerte. Ahora me conformo con sentarme aquí sobre "
"mi pila de tesoros. Estoy más que dispuesto a negociar si tienes dinero."

#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_npc.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"It's nice to see a new face around here.  I'm <npc_name>, it's a pleasure "
"meeting you."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_npc.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Like I said before, I'm a chemist.  I've been living out here for a while, "
"decided to set up shop in this old cabin.  I even found some good equipment "
"out here, and a couple useful things here in the cupboards.  I decided to "
"stay right here."
msgstr ""
"Como dije antes, soy químico. Llevo un tiempo viviendo aquí y decidí "
"instalarme en esta vieja cabaña. Incluso encontré un buen equipo y un par de "
"cosas útiles aquí, en los armarios. Así que decidí quedarme aquí."

#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_npc.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I used to be a chemist.  Well, I am a chemist.  I've been living out here in "
"the wilderness for a little while now since <the_cataclysm>.  Lucky enough, I "
"even found some good equipment out here, though unfortunately missing some of "
"the more sensitive and expensive stuff.  I found a couple useful things here "
"in the cupboards, but other than that, entirely empty.  So, I moved in."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_npc.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Not my place, just somewhere I ended up.  Some old shack, maybe a hunting "
"cabin or something more… criminal, at least judging by some of what I found "
"on the shelves.  You certainly wouldn't attract much attention synthesizing "
"illegal substances all the way out here, that's all I'm saying.  I found it "
"while I was trying to escape all the <zombies> in the city, and I decided to "
"stay."
msgstr ""
"No es mi casa, sólo un lugar al que fui a parar. Una vieja choza, quizá una "
"cabaña de caza o algo más... criminal, al menos a juzgar por lo que encontré "
"en las estanterías. Ciertamente no llamarías mucho la atención sintetizando "
"sustancias ilegales por aquí, es todo lo que digo. Lo encontré mientras "
"intentaba escapar de todos los <zombies>de la ciudad, y decidí quedarme."

#: data/json/npcs/campus/NPC_campus_guard_generic.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I'm not even supposed to be here today, I just lost a bet and had to take "
"this shift."
msgstr ""
"Ni siquiera debería estar aquí hoy, acabo de perder una apuesta y he tenido "
"que hacer este turno."

#: data/json/npcs/campus/NPC_campus_guard_generic.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I should be resting right now, this is my third straight shift.  Too many "
"people sick or hurt right now."
msgstr ""
"Debería estar descansando ahora mismo, este es mi tercer turno consecutivo. "
"Hay demasiada gente enferma o herida ahora mismo."

#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_GREET.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "Now get out of here, before I kill you."
msgstr "Ahora sal de aquí, antes de que te mate."

#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "I'm too tired, let me rest first."
msgstr "Estoy agotado, déjame descansar primero."

#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_GUARD_PREDATORY.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "Really, I haven't heard anything about it.  What's it you need?"
msgstr "De verdad, no he oído nada al respecto. ¿Qué necesitas?"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_GUARD_PREDATORY.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "I told you already, I'm not finished with them, come back later."
msgstr "Ya te lo he dicho antes. No he acabado, vuelve mas tarde."

#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_MERCHANT_PREDATORY.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I'm a businessman, and business is my game.  I came out here to help these "
"poor, poor people who are doing without in such a bad time."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_MERCHANT_PREDATORY.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I'm just a man looking to help some poor folks out, caught word of this place "
"from one of those old FEMA bunkers, a group's holed up there.  I figured I'd "
"come out here and help these people out."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_MERCHANT_PREDATORY.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Like I said, I'm a businessman and business is my job.  Those other yahoos "
"you've been talkin' to don't know what they're doing."
msgstr ""
"Como dije, soy un hombre de negocios y los negocios son mi trabajo. Esos "
"otros patanes con los que has estado hablando no saben lo que hacen."

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"They say I turned a man into a cedar tree once.  That's a terrible thing to "
"say."
msgstr ""
"Dicen que una vez convertí un hombre en un cedro. Es una cosa horrible para "
"andar diciendo por ahí."

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"You like maple syrup?  That was me.  Not the syrup, that was the trees, but I "
"figured out how to make it much harder to concentrate it, used to be way too "
"easy.  Pretty nice right?"
msgstr ""
"¿Te gusta el sirope de arce? Ese fui yo. No el sirope, eran los árboles, pero "
"descubrí cómo hacer mucho más difícil concentrarlo, solía ser demasiado "
"fácil. Muy agradable, ¿verdad?"

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Did I tell you the one about the beavers?  Used to be way too big.  Like "
"giant beavers, it was a mess.  I fixed that.  Of course there seem to be a "
"bunch of new giant things out here now.  I'll have to think about that."
msgstr ""
"¿Te conté la historia de los castores? Solían ser demasiado grandes. Como "
"castores gigantes, era un desastre. Arreglé eso. Por supuesto, parece que hay "
"un montón de nuevas cosas gigantes por aquí. Tendré que pensar en eso."

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I'm used to it.  No, Glooscap has been a name here for a very long time.  Is "
"your name foreign?"
msgstr ""
"Estoy acostumbrado. No, Glooscap es un nombre de aquí desde hace mucho "
"tiempo. ¿Es tu nombre extranjero?"

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"And stuff sure.  How can I help you stranger?  They say I'm the nice one.  "
"See this smile?  Nice smile right?"
msgstr ""
"Y esas cosas, seguro. ¿Cómo te puedo ayudar, extraño? Dicen que yo soy el "
"bueno. ¿Ves esta sonrisa? ¿Linda sonrisa, eh?"

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I do have a twin.  Malsumis is probably around here somewhere, very tricky.  "
"You know I turned Malsumis to stone once?  I'm supposed to be the nice one, "
"but you know how much it hurts turning yourself back from stone?  It takes "
"days."
msgstr ""
"Tengo un gemelo. Malsumis está probablemente por aquí en alguna parte, muy "
"astuto. ¿Sabes que una vez convertí a Malsumis en piedra? Se supone que soy "
"el bueno, pero ¿sabes cuánto duele volver de la piedra? Lleva días."

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"If I were Malsumis you would be in terrible danger my friend.  But Glooscap "
"would stop me."
msgstr ""
"Si yo fuera Malsumis estarías en un peligro terrible, amigo mío. Pero "
"Glooscap me detendría."

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I worked on a ranch not too fah from here 'fore it all went down.  I'd love "
"ta get back ta what I did - taking care of horses, cows, all sorts of "
"animals, makin' sure the fields stay safe an' all that.  But now?  I dunno, "
"man.  Just tryin' ta survive, I suppose.  Hopefully, tha world will get back "
"togetha' one day and I can put mah skills ta use doin' what I like."
msgstr ""
"Trabajé en un rancho no muy lejos de aquí antes de que todo se viniera abajo. "
"Me encantaría volver a hacer lo que hacía: cuidar caballos, vacas, todo tipo "
"de animales, asegurarme de que los campos estén a salvo y todo eso. ¿Pero "
"ahora? No lo sé. Sólo trato de sobrevivir, supongo. Con suerte, el mundo "
"volverá a estar unido algún día y podré usar mis habilidades para hacer lo "
"que me gusta."

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I was just sort of wanderin' around, hoping ta maybe find some bettah gear.  "
"Decided ta rest up, 'eard someone walkin', and, well, here we are."
msgstr ""
"Estaba dando un paseo, esperando encontrar algo mejor. Decidí descansar, "
"escuché a alguien caminando, y, bueno, aquí estamos."

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "I already told you.  Don't want to go through it again."
msgstr "Ya te lo dije. No quiero pasar por eso otra vez."

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Lived in a nearby town.  Normal life.  9 to 5 job.  When it all happened, we "
"ran away to find some safety.  But there's no safety anymore, is there?"
msgstr ""
"Vivía en un pueblo cercano. Vida normal. Trabajo de 9 a 5. Cuando todo "
"sucedió, huimos para encontrar algo de seguridad. Pero ya no hay seguridad, "
"¿verdad?"

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "I didn't leave the town alone.  I arrived here alone."
msgstr "No dejé la ciudad solo. Llegué aquí solo."

#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "I told you to just leave me alone."
msgstr "Te dije que me dejaras en paz."

#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I don't know if you know, but there are sewers underneath the prison.  I was "
"planning an escape long before <the_cataclysm>, and while I was working on "
"cleaning the sewers, I noticed a damaged wall section.  There was a flow of "
"fresh air coming out of it, so I think it's leading to the surface.  It could "
"be your way to freedom.  Feel free to use it."
msgstr ""
"No sé si lo sabes, pero hay alcantarillas debajo de la prisión. Estaba "
"planeando una fuga mucho antes d<the_cataclysm>. Mientras trabajaba en la "
"limpieza de las alcantarillas, me di cuenta de una sección de pared dañada. "
"Había un flujo de aire fresco que salía de ello, así que pense que llevaba a "
"la superficie. Podría ser tu camino a la libertad. Siéntete libre de usarlo."

#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/TALK_lumbermill_logger.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ", then frowns.  \"I think I'd remember something like that, no.  Sorry.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/TALK_lumbermill_logger.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
", looking thoughtful.  \"You know, around the time things really went bad, I "
"remember a really awful portal storm.  A while later, I saw something like "
"that in the distance.  Could be what you're talking about.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/TALK_lumbermill_logger.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I'll be honest, I don't remember a whole lot about what I was doing here.  I "
"know that I cut trees, but not much else.  Good thing I have friends here, "
"they've helped me out a lot."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/TALK_lumbermill_logger.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Not much to it.  I worked here as a logger before <the_cataclysm> began.  "
"When all went to hell, I was on the job and had to hole up here with my "
"coworkers.  Good news is we all came out fine, and the boss decided to keep "
"the mill running.  I don't know how much longer we can last, though; not "
"unless we make some contact with other people.  Customers, I guess you might "
"call 'em."
msgstr ""
"No es gran cosa. Trabajé aquí como leñador antes de empezar <the_cataclysm>. "
"Cuando todo se fue al infierno, yo estaba trabajando y tuve que esconderme "
"aquí con mis compañeros. La buena noticia es que todos nos salvamos y el jefe "
"decidió mantener el aserradero en funcionamiento. Pero no sé cuánto tiempo "
"más podremos aguantar, a menos que establezcamos contacto con otras personas. "
"Clientes, supongo que podría llamarlos."

#: data/json/npcs/lumbermill_employees/TALK_lumbermill_logger.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"New to the job… or, well, whatever's happening now.  I still cut trees and "
"run logs through the saw from time to time, so I guess you'd call me a "
"logger.  Things have only gotten weirder after those fucking <zombies> nearly "
"killed us.  I'm not sure how much longer we'll last…"
msgstr ""
"Soy nuevo en este trabajo… o, bueno, cómo se llame esto ahora. Todavía corto "
"árboles y paso los troncos por la sierra de vez en cuando, así que puedes "
"decir que soy leñador. Las cosas se fueron poniendo cada vez más raras "
"después de que esos <zombies> de mierda casi nos matan. No sé cuánto más "
"podremos aguantar…"

#: data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Ah, home sweet home.  It feels like I haven't been here for ages.  Fuck, it "
"looks so horrible now.  I guess it's because of <the_cataclysm>.  Thank you "
"for bringing me here, <name_g>.  Let's eat the cake."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I'm just a regular pizzaiolo.  My father was a pizzaiolo, my grandfather was "
"a pizzaiolo and I also became a pizzaiolo.  I was making pizza my whole life, "
"until some American <name_b>s ruined my business!  I couldn't do anything "
"about this, but now, with <the_cataclysm> and <zombies> around, I have a "
"chance to get my revenge!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_ANIMAL_SHELTER_SURVIVOR.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I worked here before <the_cataclysm> dumped everything in the <freaking> bin. "
" I took care of all the animals here, and when the <zombies> started roaming "
"the streets, I gathered every pet or stray I could.  I still take care of "
"them, just gotta worry about the <zombies> now on top of disease, "
"cleanliness, etc."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_GUN_STORE_SURVIVOR.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I'm just an average person, really.  When a horde of those <freaking> "
"<zombies> came knockin' on my door, I ran for it.  Good for me that someone "
"left this store open in the chaos, I ran inside and locked the place down.  "
"There isn't a thing in all of <city> that can bust through these walls and "
"barred windows, I'd reckon I'm the luckiest <name_b> in town."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_APARTMENT_SURVIVOR.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I used to live here before <the_cataclysm>.  I was asleep when a horde of "
"<zombies> busted through the front, and in the chaos I wound up here.  When "
"the screaming stopped, I peaked out the door to find my neighbor stumbling "
"about with his face half-eaten, and I haven't left since."
msgstr ""
"Antes d<the_cataclysm> vivía aquí. Estaba durmiendo cuando una horda de "
"<zombies> apareció en frente de la casa, y en el caos acabé aquí. Cuando "
"cesaron los gritos, me asomé a la puerta y encontré a mi vecino dando tumbos "
"con la cara medio devorada, y desde entonces no me he ido."

#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_CAMPER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I was out here camping when <the_cataclysm> disturbed me.  I didn't know "
"anything was wrong until two <zombies> stumbled up here, and tried to kill "
"me.  I figured staying here would be my best bet, away from the cities."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_MOONSHINER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "Haven't seen someone new in a while.  What brings you around here?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_MOONSHINER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I run this distillery you're standing in, before <the_cataclysm> it wasn't so "
"legal with the law.  I was in <city> making a deal on my product when a horde "
"of rioters busted in, so I ran for it.  I thought my business would be a nice "
"place to stay, so I came out here."
msgstr ""
"Dirijo esta destilería en la que te encuentras, antes d<the_cataclysm> no era "
"legal. Me encontraba en <city> haciendo un negocio con el producto cuando "
"irrumpió una horda de asaltantes, así que huí. Pensé que mi negocio sería un "
"buen lugar para quedarme, así que me vine."

#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_PREPPER_SURVIVOR.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"They all said I was crazy for preparing for <the_cataclysm>.  Now, they're "
"all dead, and I'm still kickin'.  When the riots turned to hordes, I was "
"ready; all I had to do was dodge a few <zombies> to get back to my bastion.  "
"I've been living safely here ever since."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_shelter_survivors.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I found this emergency shelter when I was running from the chaos back in the "
"cities.  Fortunately, the place hadn't been looted yet and there weren't any "
"<zombies> lurking around; just the spot to stay 'till who knows when."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/other/camp_start.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "Hey, I did some surveying and I believe this is a good spot to set up at."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Air temperature, precipitation, but what about… oh, I'm sorry, I didn't "
"notice you.  Hello."
msgstr ""
"Temperatura del aire, precipitaciones, pero qué... oh, lo siento, no me fijé "
"en ti. Hola."

#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I have not seen living people for a long time.  Glad to see another survivor. "
" Greetings, <name_g>."
msgstr ""
"Hacía tiempo que no veía gente viva. Me alegra ver a otro superviviente. "
"Saludos, <name_g>."

#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Help?  Help with what?  Oh, yes, yes.  If you know a place with many "
"survivors, can you take me there?  I doubt I can survive alone…"
msgstr ""
"¿Ayuda? ¿Ayuda con qué? Ah, sí, sí. Si conoces un lugar con muchos "
"supervivientes, ¿me podrias llevar hasta ahí? Dudo que pueda sobrevivir solo…"

#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "I'm glad you still alive."
msgstr "Contento de verte con vida."

#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I'm just a regular meteorologist.  In recent years I have worked at a weather "
"station, monitored the weather, state of air, read and wrote reports, drew up "
"schedules… in general, complete boredom.  In my free time I was studying "
"electronics and radio engineering, making various devices, some for work, "
"some just for fun.  When the first riots began, I gathered all my things that "
"I managed to take with me and settled here.  Since then I've been sitting "
"here, wasting my time doing all sorts of nonsense."
msgstr ""
"Soy un meteorólogo normal y corriente. En los últimos años trabajé en una "
"estación meteorológica, controlaba el tiempo, el estado del aire, leía y "
"escribía informes, elaboraba horarios... en general, un completo "
"aburrimiento. En mi tiempo libre estudiaba electrónica y radioingeniería, "
"fabricaba diversos aparatos, algunos para el trabajo, otros sólo por "
"diversión. Cuando empezaron los primeros disturbios, recogí todas las cosas "
"que conseguí llevarme y me instalé aquí. Desde entonces estoy aquí sentado, "
"perdiendo el tiempo haciendo todo tipo de tonterías."

#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/TALK_homeless_survivor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I was homeless before everything went down, just camping out here for a "
"while.  Stuck up <name_b>s shunned me for my condition, but they're all dead "
"now.  I guess I'm better off than they are."
msgstr ""
"Yo era un sin techo antes de que todo se fuera a pique, simplemente acampando "
"aquí por un tiempo. En <name_b> me rechazaban por mi condición, pero ahora "
"están todos muertos. Supongo que estoy mejor que ellos."

#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/TALK_homeless_survivor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"It's hard to say exactly what I'm doing out here, but I guess one thing just "
"leads to another and… well, you're just being nice when you ask, aren't you?  "
"It doesn't matter now anyway.  I'm here and I'm still alive."
msgstr ""
"Es difícil decir exactamente qué estoy haciendo aquí, pero supongo que una "
"cosa lleva a la otra y... bueno, sólo estás siendo amable cuando preguntas, "
"¿no? De todos modos, ya no importa. Estoy aquí y sigo vivo."

#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_broker.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I was homeless for a while before <the_cataclysm>.  I met some buddies out on "
"the road and we were camping out here.  Now we're just scraping by on what we "
"can find, mostly.  We're willing to trade, though.  Who knows, you might find "
"yourself a good deal."
msgstr ""
"Antes d<the_cataclysm> estuve un tiempo sin hogar. Conocí a unos amigos en la "
"carretera y acampamos aquí. Ahora sobrevivimos con lo que encontramos. Pero "
"estamos dispuestos a negociar. Quién sabe, puede que encuentres una buena "
"oferta."

#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/camper_van_traveler.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "I didn't think anyone was around here.  Pleased to meet you, I'm <npc_name>."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/camper_van_traveler.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
", then frowns.  \"I don't believe I've heard about anything like that, no.  "
"Sorry.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/camper_van_traveler.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I'm going north, up towards the border and the big wide wilderness.  I heard "
"that there's some sort of safe spot up there, where people didn't go crazy "
"and try to kill each other.  I don't know whether or not that's true, but at "
"the very least, the colder climate might help keep the <zombies> down."
msgstr ""
"Voy hacia el norte, hacia la frontera y las vastas tierras salvajes. He oído "
"que hay una especie de lugar seguro allí arriba, donde la gente no se vuelve "
"loca e intenta matarse entre sí. No sé si es cierto o no, pero al menos, el "
"clima más frío podría ayudar a reducir la violencia de los <zombies>."

#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/camper_van_traveler.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I'm going east, towards the coastline.  I heard some rumors that Rhode Island "
"was still holding itself together, so I'm going to go and check that out.  "
"Heck, I might just go out to sea myself, live on an old oil rig or something "
"like that."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/camper_van_traveler.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I haven't found anything out of the ordinary, just a bunch of <zombies> and "
"the ruins of our old lives."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/camper_van_traveler.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Actually, I came across a group of farmers on my way here.  They were a "
"little suspicious, but turned out to be pretty nice.  Good place to buy some "
"food, if they're still around."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/camper_van_traveler.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I found a small cabin out in the woods, someone was living there and had some "
"serious chemistry equipment.  I managed to get good medical supplies from "
"there.  They even had some oddball things too, like fucking napalm and black "
"powder."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/camper_van_traveler.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I ran in to someone living in an old barn, didn't want anything to do with "
"the world.  The odd thing is, they looked like one of those old, Wild West "
"cowboys."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/camper_van_traveler.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I used to travel a lot before <the_cataclysm>, and I've had this camper with "
"me for a while now.  I was at home when the riots started, so I grabbed "
"everything I could from my house and hopped in the camper.  I nearly wrecked "
"on my way out of town when some crazy people tried to smash my van, but I "
"made it out.  I've been on the move ever since."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/refugee_caravans.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "You again.  Any good news?  Haven't heard any in a long time."
msgstr "Tú otra vez. ¿Alguna buena noticia? No he oído ninguna en mucho tiempo."

#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/refugee_caravans.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
", looking thoughtful.  \"Maybe, yeah.  I saw a weird building sort of like "
"that a while back, but we were on the move and couldn't stop to check it out.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/refugee_caravans.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I'm a refugee, but don't get the wrong idea.  I've got big dreams of settling "
"down after this and starting a big family.  I just need to find the right "
"place and the right person.  Last couple of places didn't work out so well."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Uyen_Tran.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"*studies you with interest, her eyes lined with fatigue but still alert.  She "
"brushes a lock of hair off her forehead.  \"Hi there.  You look new, nice to "
"meet you.  My name's Uyen.\""
msgstr ""
"*te estudia con interés, con los ojos marcados por el cansancio pero aún "
"alerta. Se aparta un mechón de pelo de la frente. \"Hola. Pareces nuevo, "
"encantada de conocerte. Me llamo Uyen\"."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/shared_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"No way, sorry.  I was in there when things went bad.  It'll be hard enough to "
"go back after it's cleaned up, I can't bear to look at it right now."
msgstr ""
"De ninguna manera, lo siento. Yo estaba allí cuando las cosas se pusieron "
"feas. Será bastante difícil volver después de que se limpie, no puedo "
"soportar mirarlo ahora mismo."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/shared_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Sorry, no.  That's too much to ask from me.  I was back there when it went "
"wrong."
msgstr "Lo siento, no. Eso es mucho pedir de mí. Yo estaba allí cuando todo se torció."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I oversee the food stocks for the center.  There was significant looting "
"during the panic when we first arrived so most of our food was carried away.  "
"I manage what we have left and do everything I can to increase our supplies.  "
"We've got a few growing sources of fresh meats and vegetables, so I "
"prioritize non-perishable food, such as cornmeal, jerky, and fruit wine."
msgstr ""
"Superviso las reservas de alimentos del centro. Durante el pánico que cundió "
"cuando llegamos, hubo muchos saqueos, así que nos robaron casi toda la "
"comida. Gestiono lo que nos queda y hago todo lo que puedo para aumentar "
"nuestros suministros. Tenemos algunas fuentes crecientes de carnes y verduras "
"frescas, así que doy prioridad a los alimentos no perecederos, como harina de "
"maíz, cecina y vino de frutas."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Well, there's the downstairs section, we can't fit more people down there so "
"it's out of bounds.  Then there's the second bay that we were using as a "
"staging area at first.  Things went… wrong.  I hear the shopkeeper is "
"offering a reward to clear it out, if you're feeling suicidal."
msgstr ""
"Bueno, está la sección de la planta baja, no podemos meter más gente ahí "
"abajo así que está fuera de los límites. Luego está la segunda bahía que "
"estábamos utilizando como zona de operaciones en un primer momento. Las cosas "
"fueron... mal. He oído que el mercader ofrece una recompensa por limpiarlo, "
"si te sientes suicida."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I'm so glad we've got that up and running.  One of the people evacuated here "
"had a connection to a functioning ranch, and we got him and a crew out there "
"as quickly as we were able.  We're hoping they'll be able to supply us in "
"enough foodstuffs to make this place self-sufficient and even to trade with "
"other communities as they arise."
msgstr ""
"Me alegro mucho de que lo hayamos puesto en marcha. Una de las personas "
"evacuadas aquí tenía una conexión con un rancho en funcionamiento, y le "
"llevamos a él y a un equipo allí tan rápido como pudimos. Esperamos que "
"puedan suministrarnos alimentos suficientes para que este lugar sea "
"autosuficiente e incluso para comerciar con otras comunidades a medida que "
"surjan."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I haven't been here for long but I do my best to watch who comes and goes.  "
"You can't always predict who will bring trouble."
msgstr ""
"No llevo mucho tiempo aquí, pero hago lo que puedo para ver quién entra y "
"quién sale. No siempre se puede predecir quién traerá problemas."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I've seen my share of zombies, I'm one of the ones that's ready to take em "
"on.  Nothing more."
msgstr ""
"He visto mi dosis de zombis, soy de los que están preparados para enfrentarse "
"a ellos. Nada más."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"There's been rumors.  Folks talkin' about some kind of secret lab, out in the "
"wilds, with survivors in it.  I haven't seen it myself, mind you."
msgstr ""
"Ha habido rumores. La gente habla de una especie de laboratorio secreto, en "
"la naturaleza, con supervivientes. Yo no lo he visto."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
", looking thoughtful.  \"Hmm.  I'm not sure, but I've heard of an odd "
"building that's a bit like you're describing.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Yeah, I'll help out.  I've pretty much been waiting for someone to ask, the "
"mess is in my way but I've been too busy to organize it myself.  Boris is the "
"one to talk to, you say?  I'll let him know."
msgstr ""
"Sí, te ayudaré. He estado esperando a que alguien me lo pidiera, el desorden "
"me estorba pero he estado demasiado ocupado para organizarlo yo mismo. ¿Dices "
"que Boris es con quien hay que hablar? Se lo haré saber."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Oh yeah, they're my rookie representative.  I figured that those people "
"wouldn't cause too much trouble for them, so I sent them over there.  What "
"about them?"
msgstr ""
"Oh sí, son mis representantes novatos. Pensé que esas personas no les "
"causarían demasiados problemas, así que los envié allí. ¿Qué pasa con ellos?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I'm a doctor, one of the several at the outpost.  We were the lucky ones.  "
"Came here right went things started to go wrong, never left."
msgstr ""
"Soy médico, uno de los varios del puesto de avanzada. Fuimos los afortunados. "
"Vinimos aquí justo cuando las cosas empezaron a ir mal y ya unca nos "
"marchamos."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_hunter.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "I thought I smelled a pig.  I jest… please don't arrest me."
msgstr "Creí haber olido un cerdo. Bromeo... por favor no me arrestes."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_hunter.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "Huh, thought I smelled someone new.  Can I help you?"
msgstr "Ah, me pareció oler a alguien nuevo. ¿Te puedo ayudar en algo?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_hunter.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Oh, I didn't mean that in a bad way.  Been out in the wilderness so long, I "
"find myself noticing things by scent before sight."
msgstr ""
"No lo dije con mala intención. Llevo tanto tiempo en la naturaleza que me doy "
"cuenta de las cosas por el olor antes que por la vista."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_hunter.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "I've heard that cougars sometimes leap.  Maybe it's just a myth."
msgstr "He escuchado que los leopardos a veces saltan. Tal vez sea solo un mito."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Well… I was like any other civilian till they conscripted me so I'll tell it "
"to you straight.  They're the best hope we got right now.  They are stretched "
"impossibly thin but are willing to do what is needed to maintain order.  They "
"don't care much about looters since they understand most everyone is dead, "
"but if you have something they need… you WILL give it to them.  Since most "
"survivors here have nothing they want, they are welcomed as champions."
msgstr ""
"Bueno... yo era como cualquier otro civil hasta que me reclutaron, así que te "
"lo diré sin rodeos. Son la mejor esperanza que tenemos ahora mismo. No dan "
"abasto, pero están dispuestos a hacer lo necesario para mantener el orden. No "
"les importan mucho los saqueadores, ya que entienden que casi todo el mundo "
"está muerto, pero si tienes algo que necesitan... SE LO DARÁS. Como la "
"mayoría de los supervivientes no tienen nada que deseen, son bienvenidos como "
"campeones."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"If you want to know what our next steps are, I'm not at liberty to tell you.  "
"Truth be told, I don't even know myself.  They don't share that sort of "
"information with me."
msgstr ""
"Si quieres saber cuáles son nuestros próximos pasos, no estoy en condiciones "
"de decírtelo. A decir verdad, ni yo mismo lo sé. No comparten ese tipo de "
"información conmigo."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_scavenger_mercenary.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "I haven't done anything wrong…"
msgstr "No he hecho nada malo..."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_visiting_scavenger.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I found a map to this place in an evac center and thought I'd see if it was "
"just full of <zombies> or if there was something up.  Didn't expect to find "
"so many survivors still alive though."
msgstr ""
"Encontré un mapa de este lugar en un centro de evacuación y pensé en ver si "
"sólo estaba lleno de <zombies> o si había algo. Aunque no esperaba encontrar "
"tantos supervivientes aún con vida."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_visiting_scavenger.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Sure.  Seen more'n I'd like to think about honestly.  Like, I think these "
"zombies are evolving?  I've seen new things come out that I swear aren't "
"natural.  One of them looked like it was sparking with electricity."
msgstr ""
"Claro. He visto más de lo que me gustaría pensar sinceramente. Creo que esos "
"zombis están evolucionando. He visto salir cosas nuevas que juraría que no "
"son naturales. Uno de ellos parecía que estaba produciendo chispas de "
"electricidad."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_visiting_scavenger.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"There's so much weird stuff out there in the wilderness now.  A while back, I "
"found this weird cartoon sign with a map on it, pointing to some kind of "
"trade center.  Haven't been there yet but I can show you my copy of the map "
"if you want."
msgstr ""
"Ahora hay muchas cosas raras en la naturaleza. Hace un tiempo, encontré un "
"extraño cartel con un mapa que señalaba una especie de centro comercial. No "
"he estado allí todavía, pero puedo enseñarte mi copia del mapa si quieres."

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_DOCTOR.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Augustmoon_Salvors/augustmoon_doctor.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Augustmoon_Salvors/augustmoon_doctor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "I'm free at the moment if you need something."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_HQ_GUARD.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "&The mercenary looks noticeably tense as you approach."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_anchor_seller.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "Sorry I'd rather be left alone right now."
msgstr "Lo siento, prefiero que me dejen solo ahora mismo."

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_anchor_seller.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"&A grim expression and deep sunken eyes imply some malady that can't be "
"simply drowned with alcohol alone.  They interrupt you just as you were about "
"to introduce yourself.  \"This anchor I'm wearing, I don't think I'll be "
"needing it any more.  I-I'm just looking for someone to rid me of it"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_anchor_seller.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"It takes only a moment to retrieve a suitable coin from your pockets, and yet "
"your interlocutor found enough time to disappear, having left a sharp "
"emptiness both in memory and the chair before you.  The anchor has been "
"neatly folded on the table."
msgstr ""
"Te lleva solo un instante sacar una moneda de tus bolsillos pero igualmente "
"tu interlocutor tuvo el tiempo suficiente para desaparecer. Dejando un vacío "
"tanto en tu memoria como en la silla. El ancla ha sido plegada cuidadosamente "
"en la mesa."

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_anchor_seller.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"The mercenary stares in silence, a flickering of the overhead lighting "
"thankfully cuts the moment short."
msgstr ""
"El mercenario se queda en silencio, por suerte un parpadeo de luz de la "
"iluminación hace que el momento dure poco."

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_drugs.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"&This visitor seems way more watchful than normal.  You notice zip bags "
"peeking out from <mypossesivepronoun> overcoat, they are clearly pushing "
"something.  It doesn't take much longer for them to notice you in kind.\n"
"\"You want something?  Or just gawking?\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_hireable.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"The mercenary's demeanor changes completely when they realize you aren't here "
"to waste time.  \"Alright, tell you what.  Get me twelve coins and that's "
"giving my skills away, just anything to be done with that voice on a box.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_human_sample.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"&The mercenary stares at the window, and speaks in a quiet and terse manner.  "
"\"I have a client looking for a medical-grade human biopsy sample, no "
"questions asked.  Are you the right one for the job?"
msgstr ""
"&El mercenario mira fijamente a la ventana y habla en voz baja y concisa. "
"\"Tengo un cliente que busca una muestra de biopsia humana de calidad médica, "
"sin preguntas. ¿Eres el adecuado para el trabajo?"

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_human_sample.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"&The mercenary gives you a quick appraisal.  \"Five coins for three, special "
"price just for you.  Pay in advance, and I'll arrange a drop in the subway "
"rails here for you to pick within two days.  Deal or not?"
msgstr ""
"&El mercenario te da una valoración rápida. \"Cinco monedas por tres, precio "
"especial sólo para ti. Paga por adelantado, y me encargaré de dejarlo en los "
"raíles del metro de aquí para que lo recojas en dos días. ¿Trato hecho o no?"

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_jabberwock.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"&The mercenary stares intently at a stain in the ceiling, firmly clutching a "
"now cold cup of soup.  No one else seems to be very concerned about this."
msgstr ""
"&El mercenario mira fijamente una mancha en el techo, agarrando con firmeza "
"una taza de sopa ahora fría. Nadie más parece estar muy preocupado por esto."

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_jabberwock.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"&Continued prodding manages to extract a baffling response from your "
"interlocutor \"I- I've seen it, the god of our new world, a god of flesh and "
"bone.\" <mypronoun> says with a maddened glare, as though this were some sort "
"of shocking revelation."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_keycard_seller.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"&You spot the mercenary at the tail end of a deal.  \"Want in on the "
"business?  Still have a pair of ID cards looking for buyers.  Two army and "
"two science cards left, they sell together for 4 coins or not at all."
msgstr ""
"&Ves al mercenario finalizando una negociación. \"¿Quieres negociar? Todavía "
"tengo un par de tarjetas de identidad buscando dueño. Me quedan dos del "
"ejército y dos de científicos, las vendo como lote por 4 monedas todas juntas."

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_template_seller.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"&The mercenary seems uncharacteristically upbeat, or perhaps just drunk.  "
"\"Found this neat gizmo in a lab run a few days ago.\"  <mypronoun> blurts "
"while procuring a small cube of etched glass from <mypossesivepronoun> "
"pocket.  \"Now, I have no use for such a thing, but perhaps you do.  What do "
"you say?  It's yours for 3 coins.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_bartender.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Oh, that?  There were too many people stealing our glasses, so I started "
"stamping a logo on some bottle caps as a token and raised the drink prices a "
"bit to encourage their return.  I'll give you a merch back when you bring me "
"the token with your glass."
msgstr ""
"¿Ah, sí? Había demasiada gente que nos robaba los vasos, así que empecé a "
"estampar un logotipo en las tapas de algunas botellas a modo de ficha y subí "
"un poco el precio de las bebidas para animar a devolverlos. Te devolveré el "
"merca de vuelta cuando me traigas la ficha con tu vaso."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_carpenter2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I was among one of the first groups of immigrants sent here to fortify the "
"outpost.  I might have exaggerated my construction skills to get the hell out "
"of the refugee center.  Unless you are a trader, there isn't much work there "
"and food was really becoming scarce when I left."
msgstr ""
"Yo estaba en uno de los primeros grupos de inmigrantes enviados aquí para "
"fortificar el puesto. Puede que haya exagerado mis habilidades para la "
"construcción para poder salir del centro de refugiados. Salvo que seas un "
"comerciante, no hay mucho trabajo allí y la comida se estaba volviendo escasa "
"cuando me fui."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I was starting to wonder if they were really interested in the project or "
"were just trying to get rid of me."
msgstr ""
"Empezaba a preguntarme si realmente les interesaba el proyecto o sólo querían "
"deshacerse de mí."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Could easily be hundreds as far as I know.  They chose this ranch because of "
"its rather remote location, decent fence, and huge cleared field.  With as "
"much land as we have fenced off we could build a village if we had the "
"materials.  We would have tried to secure a small town or something, but the "
"lack of good farmland and number of undead makes it more practical for us to "
"build from scratch.  The refugee center I came from is constantly facing "
"starvation and undead assaults."
msgstr ""
"Por lo que sé, podrían ser cientos. Eligieron este rancho por su ubicación "
"bastante remota, su vallado decente y su enorme campo despejado. Con tanta "
"tierra como tenemos cercada podríamos construir un pueblo si tuviéramos los "
"materiales. Habríamos intentado asegurar una pequeña ciudad o algo así, pero "
"la falta de buenas tierras de cultivo y el número de no muertos hace que nos "
"resulte más práctico construir desde cero. El centro de refugiados del que "
"vengo se enfrenta constantemente al hambre y a los asaltos de los no muertos."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I organize scavenging runs to bring in supplies that we can't produce "
"ourselves.  I try and provide incentives to get migrants to join one of the "
"teams… it's dangerous work, but keeps our outpost alive.  Selling anything we "
"can't use helps keep us afloat with the traders.  If you wanted to drop off a "
"companion or two to assist in one of the runs, I'd appreciate it."
msgstr ""
"Organizo partidas de carroñeros para traer los suministros que no podemos "
"producir nosotros mismos. Intento ofrecer incentivos para que los emigrantes "
"se unan a uno de los equipos... es un trabajo peligroso, pero mantiene vivo "
"nuestro puesto. Vender todo lo que no podemos usar nos ayuda a mantenernos a "
"flote con los comerciantes. Si quieres dejar un compañero o dos para ayudar "
"en una de las expediciones, te lo agradecería."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scrapper.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Hmm, let me think.  There might be a few things I could scrounge up to help, "
"but it's going to take some time to sort through the scrap to find exactly "
"what you need.  How about this… some of my tools are getting a bit worn and "
"are in need of replacement.  If you could bring me a new angle grinder and a "
"hacksaw, I should be able to find all the parts you need by the time you get "
"back."
msgstr ""
"Hmm, déjame pensar. Puede que haya algunas cosas que pueda gorronear para "
"ayudarte, pero me va a llevar algún tiempo buscar entre la chatarra hasta "
"encontrar exactamente lo que necesitas. ¿Qué te parece esto? Algunas de mis "
"herramientas están un poco desgastadas y necesitan un recambio. Si pudieras "
"traerme una amoladora angular nueva y una sierra para metales, debería ser "
"capaz de encontrar todas las piezas que necesitas para cuando vuelvas."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_sickly_laborer.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I was just a laborer till they could find me something a bit more permanent, "
"but being constantly sick has prevented me from doing much of anything."
msgstr ""
"Fui sólo un trabajador hasta que me encontraron algo un poco más permanente, "
"pero estar constantemente enfermo me ha impedido hacer casi cualquier cosa."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_sickly_laborer.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "I don't know what you could do.  I've tried everything.  Just give me time…"
msgstr "No sé qué podrías hacer. Lo he intentado todo. Sólo dame tiempo..."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_sickly_laborer.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I keep getting sick!  At first I thought it was something I ate, but now it "
"seems like I can't keep anything down…"
msgstr ""
"¡Sigo enfermando! Al principio pensé que era algo que comí, pero ahora parece "
"que no consigo retener nada en el estómago..."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_woodcutter1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I'm one of the migrants that got diverted to this outpost when I arrived at "
"the refugee center.  They said I was big enough to swing an axe, so my "
"profession became lumberjack… didn't have any say in it.  If I want to eat, "
"then I'll be cutting wood from now till kingdom come."
msgstr ""
"Soy uno de los emigrantes que fueron desviados a este puesto cuando llegué al "
"centro de refugiados. Dijeron que era lo bastante grande como para blandir un "
"hacha, así que mi profesión se convirtió en leñador... no tuve voz ni voto. "
"Si quiero comer, estaré cortando leña desde ahora hasta el día del juicio "
"final."

#: data/mods/innawood/npcs/Backgrounds/no_past_4.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Listen.  I said it clearly, and if you keep picking at it I'm gonna get mad.  "
"Who I was is gone.  Dead.  I don't give a shit about your 'healthy', don't "
"<freaking> ask again."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CITY_COP.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"STOP, Put your hands in the air!  Ha, startled you didn't I… there is no law "
"anymore…"
msgstr "¡ALTO, manos arriba! Ja, te he asustado, no... ya no hay ley..."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CITY_COP.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I was watching the station when things went sideways.  None of the other "
"officers returned from the last call, well not as humans anyway…"
msgstr ""
"Estaba vigilando la comisaría cuando las cosas se torcieron. Ninguno de los "
"otros oficiales regresó de la última llamada, bueno, no como humanos..."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CITY_COP.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"This is a nice, secure building.  I'd be a fool to leave.  Been living off "
"the vending machines, but I found the code for the evidence lockup so I've "
"been doing some trading with other survivors."
msgstr ""
"Este es un edificio tranquilo y seguro. Sería una tonta si me fuera. He "
"estado viviendo de las máquinas expendedoras, pero encontré el código para el "
"almacén de pruebas y he estado comerciando con otros supervivientes con ellas."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I… I'm free.  *Zzzt* I'm actually free!  *bzzz* Look, you're the first person "
"I've seen in a long time."
msgstr ""
"Yo... estoy libre. *Zzzt* ¡Realmente estoy libre! *bzzz* Mira, eres la "
"primera persona que veo en mucho tiempo."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_MARLOSS_VOICE.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I'm a priest or guide of a sort.  I sing the hymns along my companions so "
"that we may learn to live in unity, both with each other and with our ailing "
"world."
msgstr ""
"Soy una especie de sacerdotisa o guía. Canto los himnos junto a mis "
"compañeros para que aprendamos a vivir unidos, tanto entre nosotros como con "
"nuestro mundo enfermo."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_NC_FARMER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I heard it's bad in the cities, back when the radio was still working.  Some "
"of those things came through here.  I want to stay out in the country if I "
"can stay safe."
msgstr ""
"Oí que se estaba muy mal en las ciudades, cuando la radio aún funcionaba. "
"Algunas de esas cosas pasaron por aquí. Quisiera quedarme en el campo si "
"pudiera estar a salvo."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_NC_FARMER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I'm a lot better now, I've been hunkering down here.  Something came by in "
"the night screaming and crying, sounded just like that woman.  Maybe a ghost, "
"I don't know.  It's good to have company again.  You're not a ghost, right?  "
"On second thought, don't tell me if you are, I probably don't want to know."
msgstr ""
"Ahora estoy mucho mejor, me he estado refugiando aquí. Algo pasó por la noche "
"gritando y llorando, sonaba igual que esa mujer. Tal vez un fantasma, no lo "
"sé. Es bueno tener compañía de nuevo. No eres un fantasma, ¿verdad? Aunque "
"pensándolo bien, no me digas si lo eres, probablemente no quiera saberlo."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_NC_FARMER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I grew up on the farm, I don't know much about ghosts and goblins, but I've "
"spent a lot of time growing food and I work hard.  It's better in the "
"country, cleaner.  Not as dangerous.  I hope."
msgstr ""
"Me crié en la granja, no sé mucho de fantasmas y duendes, pero he pasado "
"mucho tiempo cultivando alimentos y trabajando duramente. Se está mejor en el "
"campo, es más limpio. No tan peligroso. Al menos eso espero."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid "Hey, I didn't expect to live long enough to see another living human!"
msgstr "¡Eh, no esperaba vivir lo suficiente para ver a otro ser humano con vida!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid "I've been here since shit went down.  Just my luck I had to work."
msgstr ""
"He estado aquí desde todo se fue a la mierda. Mi suerte es que tenía que "
"trabajar."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Well, the dishwasher made a break for it three days after things got weird.  "
"He was ripped to shreds before he made it to the street.  I figure this place "
"has gotta be safer than my apartment, and at least I've got all this food "
"here."
msgstr ""
"Bueno, el tipo que fregaba los platos se tomó un descando fuera tres días "
"después de que las cosas se pusieran raras. Lo despedazaron antes de llegar a "
"la calle. Me imagine que este lugar debía ser más seguro que mi apartamento, "
"y al menos tengo toda esta comida aquí."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I… um… hid.  I was in the kitchen, preparing another masterpiece when I heard "
"glass shattering followed by screaming.  I ran over to the serving window to "
"see what happened, assuming a guest had fallen and broke something.  What I "
"witnessed was the most awful thing I've ever seen.  I'm not even sure I could "
"go over it again."
msgstr ""
"Yo... um... me escondí. Estaba en la cocina, preparando otra obra maestra "
"cuando oí un cristal romperse seguido de gritos. Corrí hacia la ventana de "
"servicio para ver qué había pasado, suponiendo que un invitado se había caído "
"y roto algo. Lo que presencié fue lo más horrible que he visto nunca. Ni "
"siquiera estoy segura de poder recordarlo."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Some lunatic covered in a film of goo, black as oil, had fallen through one "
"of the large glass windows.  There were glass shards stuck in its head and "
"neck.  I thought the poor guy, girl-thing-whatever was dead.  People began to "
"crowd around it, some were taking pictures."
msgstr ""
"Algún lunático cubierto con una película de sustancia viscosa, negra como el "
"aceite, había caído atravesado una de las grandes ventanas de vidrio. Había "
"trozos de cristal incrustados en su cabeza y cuello. Creí que el pobre tipo, "
"la chica, lo que fuera, estaba muerto. La gente empezó a agolparse a su "
"alrededor, algunos estaban tomando fotos."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"No!  I figured the thing dead until it started writhing and spazzing out for "
"a moment.  Everyone jumped back, a few screamed, and one curious stranger "
"stepped in closer, kneeling a little… it attacked him!"
msgstr ""
"¡No!, lo creía muerto hasta que empezó a retorcerse y a vomitar por un "
"momento. Todo el mundo retrocedió de un salto, algunos gritaron y un extraño "
"curioso se acercó, se arrodilló un poco... ¡y eso lo atacó!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I ran to the back of the kitchen and hid as best I could.  People outside "
"were screaming and I could hear them running.  Suddenly I heard more glass "
"shatter and something skitter out of the restaurant.  I waited a moment and "
"then went and checked the dining area.  Both the stranger and the thing were "
"gone.  People were running in the streets, some even had guns so I locked all "
"the doors and blocked the windows with what I could and barricaded myself in "
"here."
msgstr ""
"Corrí al fondo de la cocina y me escondí lo mejor que pude. La gente gritaba "
"fuera y les oía correr. De repente, oí cómo se rompían más cristales y algo "
"salía a toda velocidad del restaurante. Esperé un momento y fui a comprobar "
"la zona del comedor. Tanto el desconocido como la cosa habían desaparecido. "
"La gente corría por las calles, algunos incluso tenían armas, así que cerré "
"todas las puertas y bloqueé las ventanas con lo que pude y me atrincheré aquí."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Yeah, it was awhile before it was quiet again.  I heard all kinds of sounds: "
"explosions, jets flying by, helicopters, screaming, and rapid gunfire.  I "
"swear I even heard what sounded like a freaking tank drive by at one time!  "
"I've been hiding here since."
msgstr ""
"Sí, pasó un tiempo antes de que todo volviera a estar tranquilo. Oí todo tipo "
"de ruidos: explosiones, aviones a reacción, helicópteros, gritos y ráfagas de "
"disparos. ¡Te juro que incluso oí pasar lo que parecía un maldito tanque! "
"Desde ese momento me he escondido aquí."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I've been a cook since forever, this wasn't the best joint, but management "
"was cool."
msgstr ""
"He sido cocinera toda mi vida, este no era el mejor garito, pero la dirección "
"era enrollada."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid "Indeed it is I!  The one and only FOODPERSON!"
msgstr "¡De hecho soy yo! ¡La única COMIDAPERSONA!"

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/bg_pizzaiolo.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I was just a regular pizzaiolo.  My father was a pizzaiolo, my grandfather "
"was a pizzaiolo and I also became a pizzaiolo.  I was making pizza my whole "
"life, until some American <name_b>s ruined my business!  I couldn't do "
"anything about this, but now, with <the_cataclysm> and <zombies> around, I "
"have a chance to get my revenge!  And I got my revenge, thanks to a special "
"someone."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/bg_pizzaiolo.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Are you kidding?  That was the best!  When I imagine the face of that "
"arrogant cook… mmm, sweet, sweet picture.  Oh, and how we beat up that "
"<freaking> food-<name_b>, I dreamed about it for so long… and my restaurant, "
"we beat the shit out of those <name_b>s.  Too bad it was trashed as hell… "
"anyway, let's hit the dirt."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/burger_flipper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Before this started, I had a crappy job flipping burgers at Sambal's Grille.  "
"Losing that isn't a big deal.  Losing my mom and dad hurts a lot more.  Last "
"time I saw them alive, I just came home from school, grabbed a snack and went "
"to work.  I don't think I even told my mom I loved her, and I was pissed at "
"my dad for some dumb shit that really doesn't matter.  Didn't matter then, "
"really doesn't now.  Things started going crazy while I was at work… the "
"military rolled into town, and the evacuation alert sounded."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/burger_flipper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I didn't evacuate.  I went home… saw some freaky shit on the way, but at the "
"time I just thought it was riots or drugs.  By the time I got there, my "
"parents were gone.  No sign of them.  There was a big mess, stuff scattered "
"everywhere like there'd been a struggle, and a little blood on the floor."
msgstr ""
"No evacué. Me fui a casa... vi algunas cosas muy raras por el camino, pero en "
"ese momento pensé que eran disturbios o drogas. Cuando llegué, mis padres ya "
"se habían ido. No había rastro de ellos. Había un desastre, cosas esparcidas "
"por todas partes como si hubiera habido una pelea y un poco de sangre en el "
"suelo."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/burger_flipper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I haven't found them yet.  Whenever I see a <zombie>, a little part of me is "
"afraid it's going to be one of them.  But then, maybe not.  Maybe they were "
"evacuated, maybe they fought and tried to wait for me but the military took "
"them anyway?  I've heard that sort of thing happened.  I don't know if I'll "
"ever know."
msgstr ""
"Todavía no los he encontrado. Cada vez que veo un <zombie>, una pequeña parte "
"de mí teme que vaya a ser uno de ellos. Pero a lo mejor no. ¿ Quizás fueron "
"evacuados, quizás lucharon e intentaron esperarme pero los militares se los "
"llevaron de todos modos? He oído que ese tipo de cosas sucedieron. No sé si "
"alguna vez lo sabré."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/codger.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Well now, that's a hell of a story, so settle in.  It all goes back to about "
"five years ago, after I retired from my job at the mill.  Times was tough, "
"but we got by."
msgstr ""
"Menuda historia, así que prepárate. Todo se remonta a hace unos cinco años, "
"después de jubilarme de mi trabajo en la fábrica. Tiempos difíciles, pero nos "
"las arreglamos."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/codger.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Anyway, long story short, I were headin' back up to Mount Greenwood to check "
"on th' old ranger station again when I heard them bombs fallin' and choppers "
"flyin'.  Decided to camp out there to see it all through, but it didn't ever "
"end, now, did it?  So here I am."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/confused_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I don't even fucking know anymore.  I have no freaking idea what is going on. "
" I'm just doing what I can to stay alive.  The world ended and I bungled "
"along not dying, until I met you."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/cop_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I was a cop.  Small town sheriff.  We got orders without even really knowing "
"what they meant.  At some point one of the g-men on the phone told me it was "
"a Chinese attack, something in the water supply… I don't know if I believe it "
"now, but at the time it was the best explanation.  At first it was weird, a "
"few people - <zombies> - fighting like rabid animals.  Then it got worse.  I "
"tried to control things, but it was just me and my deputies against a town in "
"riot.  Then things really got fucked up."
msgstr ""
"Yo era policía. Sheriff de un pueblo pequeño. Recibíamos órdenes sin saber "
"realmente lo que significaban. En algún momento, uno de los hombres del "
"gobierno me dijo por teléfono que era un ataque de China, algo en el "
"suministro de agua... No sé si creerlo ahora, pero en aquel momento era la "
"mejor explicación. Al principio fue extraño, unas pocas personas - <zombies>  "
"- luchando como animales rabiosos. Luego empeoró. Traté de controlar las "
"cosas, pero éramos sólo yo y mis ayudantes contra un pueblo con disturbios. "
"Después las cosas se jodieron de verdad."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/cop_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"A big-ass hole opened up right in the middle of town, and a nightmarish demon "
"crawled out, right in front of the church.  We unloaded into it, but bullets "
"just bounced off.  Got some civilians in the crossfire.  It started just "
"devouring people like potato chips into a gullet that looked like a rotting "
"asshole with teeth, and… well, I lost my nerve.  I ran.  I think I might have "
"been the only person to escape.  I haven't been able to even look at my badge "
"since then."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/cop_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I was SWAT.  By all rights I should be dead.  We were called to control "
"\"riots\", which we all know were the first <zombie> hordes.  Fat lot of good "
"we were.  Pretty sure we killed more civilians.  Even among my crew, morale "
"was piss poor and we were shooting wild.  Then something hit us, something "
"big.  Might have been a bomb, I really don't remember.  I woke up pinned "
"underneath the SWAT van.  I couldn't see anything… but I could hear it.  "
"<swear!>  I could hear everything.  I spent hours, maybe days under that van, "
"not even trying to get out."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/cop_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Eventually yes.  It had been quiet for hours.  I was parched, injured, and "
"terrified.  My training was maybe the only thing that kept me from freaking "
"out.  I decided to try to pull myself out and see how bad my injuries were.  "
"It was quite easy.  The side of the van was torn open, and it turned out I "
"was basically just lying under a little debris, with the ruins of the van "
"tented around me.  I wasn't even too badly hurt.  I grabbed as much gear as I "
"could, and I slipped out.  It was night.  I could hear fighting farther away "
"in the city, so I went the other way.  I made it a few blocks before I ran "
"into any <zombies>… I ran from them.  I ran, and I ran, and I ran some more.  "
"And here I am."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/cop_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Before <the_cataclysm>, I was a cop.  I got shot just a couple days before "
"everything went down… I made a bad call in a drug bust and a scumbag got me "
"right in the gut, it was barely stopped by my vest.  I took some pretty bad "
"internal bruising.  I never thought getting shot would save my life, but I "
"was off duty recuperating when the worst of it hit."
msgstr ""
"Antes <the_cataclysm>, era policía. Me dispararon un par de días antes de que "
"todo se desmoronara... Tomé una mala decisión en una redada antidrogas y un "
"cabronazo me alcanzó justo en las tripas, a duras penas lo detuvo mi chaleco. "
"Me llevé un buen moratón interno. Nunca pensé que recibir un disparo me "
"salvaría la vida, pero estaba recuperándome fuera de servicio cuando llegó lo "
"peor."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/cop_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"At first I wanted to help.  The riots, fighting in the streets, it was too "
"much for me to just sit in my house and hear about it on the news.  Then a "
"buddy of mine called me from just off the front lines.  He'd been hurt and he "
"wasn't making much sense, but what he told me… well, you can imagine the kind "
"of stuff he told me.  Everything the worst of the internet was making up, and "
"more.  Instead of packing up to try to volunteer back onto active duty, I "
"took his advice and packed up to leave.  My house was on the edge of town and "
"the riots hadn't reached it yet, but from what I'd heard it was smarter to "
"get out than to hold tight.  I slipped out that night, took my quad out, and "
"camped a few days in the woods, waiting for it to blow over.  It never did."
msgstr ""
"Al principio quería ayudar. Los disturbios, la lucha en las calles, era "
"imposible para mí quedarme sentado en casa y oírlo en las noticias. Entonces "
"me llamó un amigo que estaba en primera línea. Le habían herido y no hablaba "
"muy claro, pero lo que me contó... bueno, ya te puedes imaginar el tipo de "
"cosas que me contó. Todo lo que se inventaba lo peor de internet, y más. En "
"lugar de hacer las maletas para intentar volver como voluntaria al servicio "
"activo, seguí su consejo e hice las maletas para marcharme. Mi casa estaba en "
"las afueras de la ciudad y los disturbios aún no habían llegado a ella, pero "
"por lo que había oído era más inteligente salir que aguantar. Aquella noche "
"me escapé, me llevé el quad y acampé unos días en el bosque, esperando a que "
"pasara todo. Nunca pasó."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/cop_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Honestly, probably better than it sounds.  I had a good bug-out bag, a nice "
"tent, a lot of good stuff.  I hadn't suffered any internal organ damage, my "
"stomach muscles were just really badly bruised, and I'd already had some good "
"time to recover.  I think it kept me from doing anything too stupid, and "
"believe me there was a high chance of that.  For a long time I had these "
"Rambo visions of rushing into town and saving everyone, but I was still too "
"immobile.  By the time I had my strength back, it wasn't an option… we were "
"well into the rushing into town for supplies phase.  The closest I got to "
"saving any old friends was putting down the monsters wearing their faces."
msgstr ""
"Honestamente, probablemente mejor de lo que suena. Tenía una buena bolsa de "
"supervivencia, una buena tienda de campaña, un montón de cosas buenas. No "
"había sufrido daños en ningún órgano interno, sólo tenía los músculos del "
"estómago muy magullados, y ya había tenido bastante tiempo para recuperarme. "
"Creo que eso evitó que hiciera alguna estupidez, y créeme que había muchas "
"posibilidades de que ocurriera. Durante mucho tiempo tuve visiones a lo Rambo "
"de ir corriendo a la ciudad y salvar a todo el mundo, pero seguía muy "
"inmóvil. Cuando recuperé las fuerzas, ya no era una opción... estábamos "
"bastante metidos en la fase de ir corriendo a la ciudad a por provisiones. Lo "
"más cerca que estuve de salvar a algún viejo amigo fue acabar con los "
"monstruos que llevaban sus caras."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/criminal_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I was just sittin' in lockup.  They took me in the night before, for a "
"bullshit parole violation.  Assholes.  I was stuck in my cell when the cops "
"all started yelling about an emergency, geared up, and left me in there "
"havin' a <freaking> staring contest with a security cam that probably wasn't "
"even on.  I was stuck in there for two god-damn days, with no food and only a "
"little water.  Then this big-ass zombie busted in.  I didn't know what the "
"fuck to think, but if my cam wasn't working, the one in the hall sure was.  "
"Tripped a motion sensor or some shit, alarm started going, and the big dumb "
"fuck turned around to get at it while its arms were still stuck in the cell "
"bars.  Ripped the whole door out."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/criminal_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"'cuz I know how cops think.  If you can call it that.  Early days, they were "
"still going after alarms in case it meant, I dunno, survivors.  You smack "
"some fucker's sports car, it starts wailing, the cops come to take a look and "
"you can walk right behind 'em.  That's the thing about cops; they follow "
"orders, right?  Even when the world's comin' apart.  I kept my head down "
"until I got past the worst of it, but then, lucky me, I got sergeant "
"brainiac.  Figured out why someone would trip an alarm on purpose, had them "
"case all up and down the streets for me.  I wound up on the edge of town "
"layin' low under an abandoned RV for a few hours.  By then… well, they had "
"some other big problems to deal with.  For a little bit.  Might've survived "
"if they hadn't blown their wads chasing me around the block."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/criminal_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Bullshit, that's what.  The assholes busted me on possession, wasn't even my "
"fuckin' stash.  I don't do crack, man, that shit's nasty, I was just carryin' "
"it for my buddy Johnny.  Y'know, this might be a <freaking> hellhole now, but "
"if I've seen the last power-trippin' asshole cop, it might all be worth it."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/criminal_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I was fricking lucky for <the_cataclysm>.  I was squatting in a warehouse out "
"on the edge of town.  I was in a real shitty place, and my crew had mostly "
"just been arrested in a big drug bust, but I had skipped out.  I was scared "
"they were gonna think I ratted 'em out and come get me, but hey, no worries "
"about that now."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/criminal_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I was just in a warehouse, not in Zambonia.  I had the internet.  Watched "
"those crazy videos on YouTube in real time, scared the shit out of me.  I had "
"it pretty good though, I'd lifted a bunch of canned food and shit, and I had "
"a pretty sweet little squat in that warehouse.  I'd been planning on spending "
"a long time there after all, while I figured out how to get in good with my "
"crew."
msgstr ""
"Estaba en un almacén, no en Zambonia. Tenía internet. Veía esos videos locos "
"en YouTube en tiempo real, me cagué de miedo. Lo tenía bastante bien, había "
"cargado un montón de comida enlatada y mierdas, y tenía una pequeña y bonita "
"casa ocupada en ese almacén. Había estado planeando pasar mucho tiempo allí "
"después de todo, mientras averiguaba cómo llevarme bien con mi equipo."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/criminal_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Yeah.  <zombies>.  A bunch of them, led by this big creepy-ass jet-black "
"bastard with glowing red eyes, I shit you not.  I dunno what brought them way "
"out my way but they saw me takin' a piss outside and that was that.  I took a "
"few shots at them but that creepy-ass motherfucker waves his hands and brings "
"'em back up, so I ran.  Once I got my shit together again I realized it "
"wasn't so bad, I was running out of stuff anyway.  Been livin' on what I can "
"loot ever since, until I fell in with you."
msgstr ""
"Sí. <zombies>. Un grupo de ellos, liderados por este bastardo horripilante "
"negro con ojos rojos brillantes. No te engaño. No se que los trajo hasta mi "
"camino pero me vieron meando afuera y eso fue todo. Les disparé un par de "
"veces, pero ese hijo de puta espeluznante agitó las manos y los hizo "
"levantarse, así que salí corriendo. Una vez que me recompuse me di cuenta de "
"que no fue tan malo, me estaba quedando sin nada de todos modos. He estado "
"viviendo de lo que he podido saquear hasta que me topé contigo."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/criminal_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Well, I mean, if he's surrounded by buddies like that and he can just bring "
"'em back, I think he's a scary bastard.  If I got him on his own I think "
"maybe I could have taken him.  Also when I was running I managed to get a "
"zombie on its own, and I smashed it to shit with a stick before the rest "
"showed up.  He tried to raise that one and it didn't get back up."
msgstr ""
"Si esta rodeado de compinches como esos y puede traerlos de vuelta, creo que "
"es un bastardo temible. Si lo hubiera cogido por mi cuenta creo que tal vez "
"hubiera podido con él. Además, cuando estaba corriendo logré coger a un zombi "
"solo, y lo hice papilla con un palo antes de que aparecieran los demás. A ese "
"lo intentaba levantar pero no se volvía a levantar."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/dreamer.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"OK, this is gonna sound crazy but I, like, I knew this was going to happen.  "
"Like, before it did.  You can even ask my psychic except, like, I think she's "
"dead now.  I told her about my dreams a week before the world ended.  Serious!"
msgstr ""
"Mira, esto va a sonar a locura pero yo, como que ya sabía que esto iba a "
"pasar. Antes de que pasara. Puedes preguntarle a mi vidente aunque creo que "
"ahora está muerta. Le conté sobre mis sueños una semana antes de que el mundo "
"se acabara. ¡De verdad!"

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/dreamer.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"OK, so, sometimes I dream that I am a zombie.  I just don't realize it.  And "
"I just act normal to myself and I see zombies as normal people and normal "
"people as zombies.  When I wake up I know it's fake though because if it were "
"real, there would be way more normal people.  Because they'd actually be "
"zombies.  And everyone is a zombie now."
msgstr ""
"Mira, a veces sueño que soy una zombi. Pero no me doy cuenta. Y actúo con "
"normalidad y veo a los zombis como gente normal y a la gente normal como "
"zombis. Pero cuando me despierto sé que es falso, porque si fuera real, "
"habría mucha más gente normal. Porque en realidad serían zombis. Y ahora todo "
"el mundo es zombi."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/dreamer.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"So, like, there were some really bad riots, okay?  Everyone got really "
"violent and nasty, and to be honest, I was on a bit of a spirit journey for a "
"lot of it and I don't really remember too well.  But the weirdest part is, "
"nobody even *cared* about each other.  It's like all our caring got sucked "
"away.  I think it was some kind of negative energy thing.  And also that made "
"the dead, like, come back to life and stuff.  Plus, like, there were some "
"monsters?  I'm not really sure how they fit in."
msgstr ""
"Se produjeron disturbios muy graves. Todo el mundo se puso muy violento y "
"desagradable, y para ser honesto, yo estaba en un pequeño viaje espiritual "
"durante gran parte de ellos y realmente no lo recuerdo demasiado bien. Pero "
"lo más extraño es que nadie se preocupaba por los demás. Es como si todo "
"nuestro cariño hubiera desaparecido. Creo que era una especie de energía "
"negativa. Y eso hizo que los muertos volvieran a la vida y otras cosas. "
"Además, ¿había algunos monstruos? No estoy muy seguro de cómo encajan."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I made it to one of those <freaking> evac shelters, but it was almost worse "
"than what I left behind.  Escaped from there, been on the run since."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I spent a lot of time rummaging for rhubarb and bits of vegetables in the "
"forest before I found the courage to start picking off some of those dead "
"monsters.  I guess I was getting desperate."
msgstr ""
"Pasé mucho tiempo buscando ruibarbo y trozos de verdura en el bosque antes de "
"armarme de valor y empezar a eliminar a algunos de esos monstruos muertos. "
"Supongo que me estaba desesperando."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Not exactly.  After a while, I got brave.  I started venturing towards the "
"outskirts of town, picking off zombies here and there.  I learned about "
"traveling in at night to avoid all but those <freaking> shadow-zombies, and "
"that got me pretty far.  Eventually I cleared out a cozy little nook for "
"myself and started really feeling comfortable.  I guess I got a bit "
"complacent."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I thought I had those damned <zombies> figured out.  I got braver, started "
"heading out by day more and more.  One of those screamer zombies spotted me "
"and called in a horde, with a giant <freaking> beastie at the head of it, the "
"size of a Volkswagen and all covered in bone plates.  I know when I'm "
"outclassed.  The big guy was held back by his own horde of buddies, and I "
"managed to book it back to my place.  I closed the windows, locked it down, "
"but it was too late.  The giant followed me and just started hammering right "
"through the walls.  I grabbed what I could and made for the horizon.  Last I "
"saw of my squat, it was collapsing on the bastard.  For all I know, it died "
"in the crash, but I am not going back to find out."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"What happened?  I'm not really sure.  You must know about the riots and all "
"that, that the government and the police totally failed to contain.  I don't "
"have a good guess what caused that.  I thought it was the usual stuff at "
"first, and I gotta admit, I was sort of excited and scared it was the start "
"of a revolution.  Not excited enough to join in though, and I guess anyone "
"who was is probably dead now.  I tried to wait it out at home, packed a "
"little bug-out bag, but then the internet started showing videos of rioters "
"getting back up and fighting with crazy injuries.  I don't know how many "
"people really believed it at first, but I took that as my sign and ditched "
"town for the evac shelter.  I don't know exactly what happened after that.  "
"The center I was in was heavily vandalized and empty, and I never saw anyone "
"else.  The cell phone grid was locked up, except for one emergency message "
"that came through around a day later saying the government had fallen.  Power "
"went out a few days later."
msgstr ""
"¿Qué ha pasado? No estoy muy seguro. Seguro que sabes lo de los disturbios y "
"todo eso, que el gobierno y la policía no consiguieron contener. No tengo una "
"buena idea de lo que causó eso. Al principio pensé que era lo normal, y tengo "
"que admitir que estaba un poco emocionado y asustado de que fuera el comienzo "
"de una revolución. Pero no lo suficiente como para participar, y supongo que "
"los que lo estaban probablemente ya estén muertos. Intenté esperar en casa, "
"preparé una pequeña bolsa de supervivencia, pero entonces Internet empezó a "
"mostrar vídeos de alborotadores que se levantaban y luchaban con heridas "
"mortales. No sé cuánta gente se lo creyó al principio, pero yo lo tomé como "
"una señal y abandoné la ciudad para ir al refugio de evacuados. No sé "
"exactamente qué pasó después. El centro en el que estuve estaba muy "
"vandalizado y vacío, y nunca vi a nadie más. La red de telefonía móvil estaba "
"bloqueada, salvo por un mensaje de emergencia que llegó aproximadamente un "
"día después diciendo que el gobierno había caído. La electricidad se cortó "
"unos días después."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Same as most people who didn't get killed straight up during the riots.  I "
"went to one of those stupid <freaking> evacuation death traps.  I actually "
"lived there for a while with three others.  One guy who I guess had watched a "
"lot of movies kinda ran the show, because he seemed to really know what was "
"going on.  Spoiler alert: he fucking didn't."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Things went south when our fearless leader decided we had to put down one of "
"the other survivors that had been bitten.  Her husband felt a bit strongly "
"against that, and I wasn't too keen on it either; by this point, he'd already "
"been wrong about a lot.  Well, he took matters into his own hands and killed "
"her.  Then her husband decided one good turn deserves another, and killed the "
"idiot.  And then she got back up and I killed her again, and pulped our "
"former leader.  Unfortunately she'd given her husband a hell of a nip during "
"the struggle, when he couldn't get his shit together enough to fight back.  "
"Not that I fucking blame him.  We made it out of there together, but it was "
"too much for him, he clearly wasn't in it anymore… the bite got infected, but "
"it was another <zombie> that finally killed him.  And then I was alone."
msgstr ""
"Las cosas empezaron a salir mal cuando nuestro intrépido líder decidió que "
"teníamos que matar a uno de los otros supervivientes que habian sido "
"mordidos. El marido de la superviviente se opuso frontalmente a eso y yo no "
"estaba de acuerdo tampoco; el lider ya había tomado bastantes decisiones "
"erróneas en el pasado. Decidió hacerlo el y la mató. Su marido decidió que "
"era su turno y mató al idiota. Después ella se volvió a levantar y su marido "
"la mató de nuevo, y a continuación destrozó el cuerpo de nuestro exlíder. "
"Lamentablemente, ella le dió un gran mordisco a su marido durante la lucha, "
"mientras él estaba en shock sin poder defenderse. No puedo culparle. Salimos "
"de allí juntos, pero fue demasiado para él, ya no era el mismo… El mordisco "
"se infectó, pero fue otro <zombie> lo que lo terminó matando. Me quedé sola."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Well, I assume you know about the riots and the military and police and the "
"freakin' nightmare monsters walking the earth beside zombies, right?  If "
"you're asking what I think caused it all, well, I dunno.  My best guess it "
"was some huge government overreach, maybe some kind of experimental bioweapon "
"that got away.  They tried to lie so much at the start about everything that "
"was going on, I don't think the whole 'Chinese attack' shit measures up.  "
"They were trying to cover something up.  As for the real end times, maybe the "
"rest of the world tried to contain it.  I heard there were honest-to-god "
"nukes going off here on American soil.  To me that seems like somewhere else, "
"maybe Europe, trying to get whatever is going on here contained.  Maybe it "
"even worked.  It's bad now but it's not like it was."
msgstr ""
"Bueno, supongo que sabes lo de los disturbios y los militares y la policía y "
"los monstruos de pesadilla que andan por la tierra junto a los zombis, "
"¿verdad? Si me preguntas qué creo que lo causó todo, bueno, no lo sé. Mi "
"mejor suposición es que fue una gran actuación del gobierno, tal vez algún "
"tipo de arma biológica experimental que se escapó. Intentaron mentir tanto al "
"principio sobre todo lo que estaba pasando, que no creo que toda la mierda "
"del 'ataque chino' tenga sentido. Estaban tratando de encubrir algo. En "
"cuanto al verdadero fin de los tiempos, quizás el resto del mundo trato de "
"contenerlo. Escuche que habia bombas nucleares explotando en suelo americano. "
"A mi me parece que en otro lugar, quizas Europa, trataron de contener lo que "
"sea que este sucediendo aqui. Tal vez incluso funcionó. Ahora se está mal, "
"pero no es como era antes."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"There's nothing too special about me, I'm not sure why I survived.  I got "
"evacuated with a handful of others, but we were too late to make the second "
"trip to a FEMA center.  We got attacked by the dead… I was the only one to "
"make it out.  I never looked back."
msgstr ""
"No hay nada especial en mí, no estoy seguro de por qué sobreviví. Me "
"evacuaron con un puñado de personas, pero llegamos demasiado tarde para hacer "
"el segundo viaje a un centro de la FEMA. Nos atacaron los muertos... Yo fui "
"el único que logró salir. Jamás miré atrás."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Sheer luck I guess.  I went the absolute wrong way, into town, and wound up "
"stuck in the subway system.  I spent a few days living off vending machine "
"food.  Not the best eating, but I pulled through.  At least there weren't so "
"many zombies down there."
msgstr ""
"Supongo que fue pura suerte. Fui en la dirección equivocada, a la ciudad, y "
"acabé atrapado en el metro. Pasé unos días viviendo de la comida de las "
"máquinas expendedoras. No era la mejor comida, pero sobreviví. Al menos no "
"había tantos zombis ahí abajo."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Straight up hunger.  I didn't have any great light source down there, and I "
"didn't have much food.  I was slipping up and down to the station to buy from "
"the vending machines, but once I ran out of cash I had to make a break for "
"it.  I waited until dark and then skipped out."
msgstr ""
"Simplemente hambre. No tenía ninguna gran fuente de luz allí abajo, y no "
"tenía mucha comida. Subía y bajaba a la estación para comprar en las máquinas "
"expendedoras, pero en cuanto se me acabó el dinero tuve que huir. Esperé a "
"que oscureciera y me largué."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Straight up hunger.  I didn't have any great light source down there, and I "
"didn't have much food.  I was slipping up and down to the station to buy from "
"the vending machines, but once I ran out of cash I had to think of something "
"else.  I started raiding the surrounding area by night, and built a decent "
"little base under there."
msgstr ""
"Simplemente hambre. No tenía ninguna gran fuente de luz allí abajo, y tampoco "
"mucha comida. Subía y bajaba a la estación para comprar en las máquinas "
"expendedoras, pero en cuanto se me acabó el dinero tuve que pensar en otra "
"cosa. Empecé a hacer incursiones nocturnas en los alrededores y construí una "
"pequeña base aceptable allí abajo."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Yeah.  I had it pretty good there, but eventually I just started going a bit "
"nuts.  Always dark, a bit cold, living off scavenged junk food… a soul can "
"only live like that for so long.  When the weather above ground got warmer "
"and the daylight hours got longer I decided to get a bit braver.  I'd learned "
"enough about the <zombies> that I was able to live pretty well after that.  "
"I've camped a few places, scavenged berries and whatnot, lived a pretty good "
"life compared to those first few months."
msgstr ""
"Sí. Lo tenía bastante bien allí, pero al final empecé a volverme un poco "
"loco. Siempre oscuro, un poco frío, viviendo de comida basura rebuscada... un "
"alma sólo puede vivir así por un tiempo. Cuando el clima en la superficie se "
"calentó y las horas de luz se alargaron, decidí ser un poco más valiente. Ya "
"había aprendido lo suficiente sobre los <zombies> y era capaz de vivir "
"bastante bien después de aquella. Acampé en algunos lugares, rebusque bayas y "
"lo que no era bayas, viví una vida bastante buena comparada con esos primeros "
"meses."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Woah, <name_g>, I don't even know where to start.  The riots?  I think it was "
"going on sooner than that.  There were bad murmurs going on a few weeks "
"before that happened.  Lots of really scary crimes, not your usual stuff but "
"like cannibalism and some real unspeakable shit, you know?  When the riots "
"started, I think I was already primed to think of it as something different "
"from a normal equality riot or anything like that.  I think that's part of "
"how I got out safer, I had had some time to get some stuff and get going, and "
"didn't try to make shopping trips.  People were abso-fuckin-lutely crazy in "
"those days.  It was a lot like the pandemic a few years back, except the "
"police were out in the streets in force, gunning people down like it was "
"going out of style."
msgstr ""
"Woah, <name_g> , ni siquiera sé por dónde empezar. ¿Los disturbios? Creo que "
"fue antes de eso. Hubo rumores negativos unas semanas antes de que "
"ocurrieran. Un montón de crímenes realmente aterradores, no los habituales, "
"sino canibalismo y cosas realmente indescriptibles, ¿sabes? Cuando empezaron "
"los disturbios, creo que ya estaba preparado para pensar que era algo "
"diferente a un disturbio normal por la igualdad o algo así. Creo que en parte "
"por eso salí más seguro, había tenido algo de tiempo para conseguir algunas "
"cosas y ponerme en marcha, y no intenté hacer compras. La gente estaba "
"absoluta y jodidamente loca en aquellos días. Se parecía mucho a la pandemia "
"de hace unos años, con la diferencia de que la policía salía a la calle en "
"masa, matando a la gente como si no pasara nada."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_4.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"They were shipping me with a bunch of evacuees over to a refugee center, when "
"the bus got smashed in by the biggest zombie you ever saw.  It was busy with "
"the other passengers, so I did what anyone would do and fucked right out of "
"there."
msgstr ""
"Me estaban enviando con un grupo de evacuados a un centro de refugiados, "
"cuando el autobús fue aplastado por el zombi más grande que jamás hayas "
"visto. Estaba ocupado con los demás pasajeros, así que hice lo que haría "
"cualquiera y salí pitando de allí."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_4.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I ran until I felt like my lungs were going to jump right out of my mouth.  I "
"holed up in the forest for the night, under a fir tree.  In the morning I "
"heard someone talking, so I went to see.  I was playing it pretty careful "
"though, there were still a lot of psychos and rioters around.  I snuck up on "
"some kind of thing, some monster worse than any zombie.  Some huge bug thing, "
"saying random phrases like some kind of broken tape recorder.  It was "
"dragging a few human bodies behind it, I couldn't tell if they were dead or "
"unconscious.  Honestly I didn't wait to find out, I ducked into the bushes "
"and tried not to breath until I couldn't hear it anymore."
msgstr ""
"Corrí hasta que sentí que los pulmones se me iban a salir por la boca. Pasé "
"la noche en el bosque, bajo un abeto. Por la mañana oí hablar a alguien, así "
"que fui a ver. Pero fui con mucho cuidado, todavía había muchos psicópatas y "
"alborotadores. Me acerqué sigilosamente a una especie de cosa, un monstruo "
"peor que cualquier zombi. Un bicho enorme que decía frases al azar como si "
"fuera una grabadora rota. Estaba arrastrando unos cuantos cuerpos humanos "
"detrás de él, no sabría decirte si estaban muertos o inconscientes. "
"Sinceramente, no me quedé a averiguarlo, me agaché entre los arbustos e "
"intenté no respirar hasta que dejé de oírlo."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_4.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Once I was okay leaving the bushes, I made my way to an old shed I could see "
"a ways off.  It was falling in but it kept the rain and wind off and gave me "
"a place out of sight.  I stayed there until I ran out of those ass-tasting "
"ration bars I'd filled my backpack with.  Then I took on the wanderin' life "
"until we met."
msgstr ""
"Una vez que me sentí bien saliendo de los arbustos, me dirigí a un viejo "
"cobertizo que podía ver a cierta distancia. Se estaba derrumbando, pero me "
"protegía de la lluvia y el viento y me daba un lugar fuera de la vista. Me "
"quedé allí hasta que se me acabaron las barritas de racionamiento con sabor a "
"culo con las que había llenado mi mochila. Luego me dediqué a vagabundear "
"hasta que nos conocimos."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_5.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"My evac shelter got swarmed by some of those bees, the ones the size of dogs. "
" I took out a few with a plank, but pretty quick I realized it was either "
"head for the hills or get stuck like a pig.  The rest is history."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_5.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Yeah, I'm sure you've seen them, they're everywhere.  Like something out of "
"an old sci-fi movie.  Some of the others in the evac shelter got stung, it "
"was no joke.  I didn't stick around to see what the lasting effect was "
"though.  I'm not ashamed to admit I ran like a <freaking> chicken."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_5.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Well, excuse me if I didn't stop to fucking ask what kind of killer bugs they "
"were."
msgstr ""
"Bueno, perdóname si no me detuve a preguntar qué tipo de insectos asesinos "
"eran."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_6.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Well, I was at home when the cell phone alert went off and told me to get to "
"an evac shelter.  So I went to an evac shelter.  And then the shelter got too "
"crowded, and people were waiting to get taken to the refugee center, but the "
"buses never came.  You must already know about all that.  It turned into "
"panic, and then fighting.  I didn't stick around to see what happened next; I "
"headed into the woods with what tools I could snatch from the lockers.  I "
"went back a few days later, but the place was totally abandoned.  No idea "
"what happened to all those people."
msgstr ""
"Bueno, estaba en casa cuando sonó la alerta del móvil y me dijeron que fuera "
"a un refugio de evacuados. Así que fui al refugio. Y entonces el refugio se "
"llenó demasiado, y la gente estaba esperando a que la llevaran al centro de "
"refugiados, pero los autobuses nunca llegaron. Ya debes saber todo eso. El "
"pánico se apoderó de la gente y empezaron los enfrentamientos. No me quedé a "
"ver qué pasaba después; me fui al bosque con las herramientas que pude coger "
"de las taquillas. Volví unos días después, pero el lugar estaba totalmente "
"abandonado. Ni idea de lo que les pasó a todas aquellas personas."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_6.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I gotta be honest with you, I heard a lot of stories back at the shelter, and "
"only one of them really stuck.  This is some kind of science experiment gone "
"wrong.  I don't know what caused the riots and the undead in the first place, "
"but there's no way it's this out of control everywhere.  Yeah, I got the same "
"'the government has fallen' text as everyone, but it doesn't make *sense* "
"that it could be so widespread so fast.  I think we're in some sort of "
"exclusion zone, where they're letting whatever is going on run its course to "
"see how it works so they can fight it better next time.  Somewhere out there, "
"outside the zone, it's more or less business as usual."
msgstr ""
"Debo ser honesta contigo, escuché muchas historias en el refugio, y sólo una "
"de ellas se me quedó grabada. Esto es una especie de experimento científico "
"que salió mal. No sé qué causó los disturbios y los muertos vivientes en "
"primer lugar, pero no hay manera de que esto esté tan fuera de control en "
"todas partes. Sí, me llegó el mismo texto de 'el gobierno ha caído' que a "
"todo el mundo, pero no tiene *sentido* que se haya extendido tan rápido. Creo "
"que estamos en una especie de zona de exclusión, donde están dejando que lo "
"que está pasando siga su curso para ver cómo funciona y así poder combatirlo "
"mejor la próxima vez. En algún lugar, fuera de esta zona, todo debe continuar "
"como si nada hubiera pasado."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/ex_pilot_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Where was I?  I don't even know, what day do you think it all ended?  When I "
"thought shit was hitting the fan I took some vacation time at the airline.  "
"Next day, somebody bombed them.  No shit, just like Oklahoma city in '95.  "
"Thought that was a good sign to get out so I emailed some family out in the "
"country that I was coming over and got on the road.  Didn't even make it to "
"the interstate before I ran into the cops setting up a roadblock.  I drove "
"off the road and it all gets fuzzy from there.  Next town I got to was "
"already lynching people from the streetlights… I didn't stop for gas.  Lost "
"the car at some point, lost track of the days too.  Not sure I ever got a "
"reply to my email."
msgstr ""
"¿Dónde estaba? Ni siquiera lo sé, ¿qué día crees que terminó todo? Cuando "
"pensé que la mierda estaba salpicando, me tomé unas vacaciones en la "
"aerolínea. Al día siguiente, alguien les puso una bomba. No es broma, igual "
"que en Oklahoma City en 1995. Pensé que era una buena señal para salir de "
"allí, así que envié un correo electrónico a algunos familiares que vivían en "
"el campo para decirles que iba para allá y me puse en camino. Ni siquiera "
"llegué a la interestatal antes de encontrarme con la policía montando un "
"control de carretera. Me salí de la carretera y a partir de ahí todo se "
"vuelve confuso. En la siguiente ciudad a la que llegué ya estaban linchando a "
"gente en las farolas... No paré a repostar. En algún momento perdí el coche y "
"también la noción del tiempo. No estoy seguro de haber recibido respuesta a "
"mi correo electrónico."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/fema_evacuee_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"That place was chaos.  I only stayed a few hours.  They had a big backhoe "
"running, digging a huge pit in a cordoned section they wouldn't let us near.  "
"Well, I managed to sneak over that way, and saw them dumping load after load "
"of the dead in the pit, pouring dirt back over them even as they revived and "
"tried to climb out.  Even with all the shit I've seen since, it haunts me.  I "
"knew then I had to get out.  Luckily for me, we were attacked the next "
"morning by some giant horror, a kind I haven't really seen since then.  While "
"the guards were busy with that, I grabbed some supplies I'd stocked up over "
"the night and I fucked right out of there.  A few others tried to get the "
"fuck out with me, but as far as I know I was the only lucky one."
msgstr ""
"Aquello era un caos. Solo estuve allí unas horas. Tenían una gran "
"retroexcavadora excavando un enorme hoyo en una zona acordonada a la que no "
"nos dejaban acercarnos. Bueno, conseguí colarme por allí y vi cómo echaban un "
"montón de cadáveres en el hoyo y los cubrían con tierra, incluso cuando "
"revivían e intentaban salir. A pesar de todas las cosas horribles que he "
"visto desde entonces, aquello me persigue. Entonces supe que tenía que salir "
"de allí. Por suerte para mí, a la mañana siguiente nos atacó un horror "
"gigante, uno que no he vuelto a ver desde entonces. Mientras los guardias "
"estaban ocupados con eso, cogí algunos suministros que había acumulado "
"durante la noche y me largué de allí. Otros intentaron escapar conmigo, pero, "
"por lo que sé, fui el único afortunado."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/grad_student_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I'm not from around here… You can probably tell from the accent, I'm from the "
"UK.  I was here doing my PhD at Dartmouth.  I was halfway to MIT for a "
"conference when <the_cataclysm> stopped me.  I was staying at a flea-ridden "
"little motel on the side of the road.  When I got up for whatever was going "
"to pass for breakfast, the fat bloody proprietor was sitting at his desk, "
"wearing the same grubby clothes from the night before.  I thought he had just "
"slept there, but when he looked at me… well, you know what those Zed-eyes "
"look like.  He lunged, and I reacted without thinking.  Smacked him on the "
"head with my tablet, again and again, until he stopped coming for me.  I "
"never thought I had anything like that in me."
msgstr ""
"No nací aquí... Probablemente puedas deducirlo por el acento, soy del Reino "
"Unido. Estaba aquí haciendo mi doctorado en Dartmouth. Estaba a medio camino "
"del MIT para una conferencia cuando me detuvo <the_cataclysm> . Me estaba "
"quedando en un pequeño motel lleno de pulgas al lado de la carretera. Cuando "
"me levanté para desayunar, el maldito propietario estaba sentado en su "
"escritorio con la misma ropa vieja de la noche anterior. Pensé que se había "
"quedado dormido allí, pero cuando me miró... bueno, ya sabes cómo son esos "
"ojos de zeta. Se abalanzó, y reaccioné sin pensar. Le golpeé en la cabeza con "
"mi tableta, una y otra vez, hasta que paró de abalanzarse sobre mí. Nunca "
"pensé que tuviese algo así dentro de mí."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/grad_student_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I wandered for a little while around the grounds, letting the adrenaline "
"fade, hoping for some kind of idea what to do.  I was out in the middle of "
"nowhere, and I didn't know the area at all.  I wasn't certain if I should "
"head back to Hanover, and try to get my belongings, or stay out where I was.  "
"Finally, I decided to rest a while until I knew what was going on.  The "
"internet told me most of what I needed; I'm sure you saw Twitter in those "
"days.  Even if I'd thought it wise to go back all the way to New Hampshire, I "
"was far too scared."
msgstr ""
"Deambulé un rato por el recinto, dejando que la adrenalina desapareciera, "
"esperando tener alguna idea de qué hacer. Estaba en medio de la nada y no "
"conocía la zona en absoluto. No sabía si debía volver a Hanover e intentar "
"recuperar mis cosas o quedarme donde estaba. Finalmente, decidí descansar un "
"rato hasta saber qué pasaba. Internet me informó de la mayor parte de lo que "
"necesitaba; seguro que que vistes Twitter en aquellos días. Aunque me hubiera "
"parecido prudente volver hasta New Hampshire, estaba demasiado asustada."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/grad_student_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Yes.  Simple hunger.  The vending machines sold only peanuts and biscuits.  I "
"wasn't about to rely on that for survival.  I stayed long enough to realize "
"no one was going to come for me, then packed up what I could and drove off.  "
"Eventually my car was caught in a downpour of acid rain that stripped the "
"tires and left me to carry on on foot, living the life of a hunter gatherer.  "
"Honestly, I think I eat better this way than I did as a grad student."
msgstr ""
"Sí. Por pura hambre. Las máquinas expendedoras sólo vendían cacahuetes y "
"galletas. No iba a poder subsistir con eso. Me quedé el tiempo suficiente "
"para darme cuenta de que nadie iba a venir a por mí, recogí lo que pude y me "
"fui. Al final, mi coche se vio atrapado en un aguacero de lluvia ácida que "
"destrozó los neumáticos y me obligó a seguir a pie, viviendo la vida de una "
"cazadora recolectora. Sinceramente, creo que como mejor así que como "
"estudiante de posgrado."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/grad_student_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I was in biochemistry.  Specifically, if you're interested, I was studying "
"the folding of non-standard nucleic acids into enzyme-like structures.  It "
"sounds more interesting than it was; most of my time was spent cursing at "
"computer screens and wishing we had more information on threose chains at "
"unusual temperatures and pressures for modeling."
msgstr ""
"Yo estudiaba bioquímica. En concreto, si te interesa, estudiaba el "
"plegamiento de ácidos nucleicos no estándar en estructuras de tipo "
"enzimático. Suena más interesante de lo que era; la mayor parte de mi tiempo "
"lo pasaba maldiciendo a las pantallas de los ordenadores y deseando que "
"tuviéramos más información sobre las cadenas de treosa a temperaturas y "
"presiones inusuales para modelarlas."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/gung_ho_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Nothin' special before <the_cataclysm>.  When the dead started walking, I "
"geared up and started puttin' them back down."
msgstr ""
"Nada especial antes d<the_cataclysm>. Cuando los muertos empezaron a caminar, "
"me equipé y empecé a aplastarlos."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/gung_ho_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Almost got killed.  One <zombie> is easy pickins, but ten is a lot, and a "
"hundred is a death trap.  I got myself in too deep, an' barely slipped out "
"with my guts still inside me.  Holed up in an old motel for a while lickin' "
"my wounds and thinkin' about what I wanted to do next.  That's when I figured "
"it out."
msgstr ""
"Casi me matan. Un <zombie> es fácil, pero diez son demasiados, y cien es una "
"trampa mortal. Me metí muy adentro, y apenas pude salir con las tripas aún "
"dentro de mí. Me quedé en un viejo motel lamiéndome las heridas y pensando en "
"lo que haría después. Fue entonces cuando me di cuenta."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/gung_ho_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"This is it.  This is what I was made for.  There in the street, smashin' "
"monster heads and prayin' I'd make it out?  I've never felt like that.  "
"Alive.  Important.  So after I got myself all stuck back together, I nutted "
"up and went back to it.  Probly killed a thousand Z since then, and I'm still "
"not tired of it."
msgstr ""
"Es esto. Esto es para lo que fui hecho. ¿Ahí en la calle, reventando cabezas "
"de monstruos y rogando por sobrevivir? Nunca me había sentido así. Viva. "
"Importante. Así que después de recomponerme, me puse las pilas y retomé el "
"oficio. Probablemente he matado mil Z desde entonces, y aún no me he cansado."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/gung_ho_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Oh, you know.  Blah blah blah, had a job and a life, everyone died.  Boo hoo. "
" I gotta be straight with you though: I honestly think I like this better.  "
"Fighting for survival every day?  I've never felt so alive.  I've killed "
"hundreds of those bastards.  Sooner or later one of them will take me out, "
"but I'll go down knowing I did something actually important."
msgstr ""
"Oh, ya sabes. Bla, bla, bla, tenía un trabajo y una vida, todos murieron. Buu "
"buu. Tengo que ser sincera contigo: francamente creo que esto me gusta más. "
"¿Luchar por sobrevivir cada día? Nunca me he sentido tan viva. He matado a "
"cientos de esos bastardos. Tarde o temprano uno de ellos me matará, pero "
"caeré sabiendo que hice algo realmente importante."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/gung_ho_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Well y'see, I'm not from these parts at all.  I was driving up from the South "
"to visit my son when it all happened.  I was staying at a motel when a "
"military convoy passed through and told us to evacuate to a FEMA shelter."
msgstr ""
"Bueno, verás, no soy de por aquí en absoluto. Estaba conduciendo desde el Sur "
"para visitar a mi hijo cuando sucedió. Me estaba quedando en un hotel cuando "
"una caravana militar pasó y nos dijo que evacuáramos a un refugio de la FEMA."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/gung_ho_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"He lives up in Northern Canada, way in the middle of nowhere, with his crazy "
"wife and my three grandkids.  He's an environmental engineer for some oil and "
"gas company out there.  She's a bit of a hippy-dippy headcase.  I love em "
"both though, and as far as I'm concerned they all made it out of this fucked "
"up mess safe, out there in the boondocks.  I guess they think I'm dead, so "
"they'll steer clear of this hellhole, and that's the best as could be."
msgstr ""
"Vive en el norte de Canadá, en medio de la nada, con su mujer loca y mis tres "
"nietos. Es ingeniero medioambiental para una de esas empresas de petróleo y "
"gas. Ella es un poco hippie. Sin embargo, los quiero a los dos y, por lo que "
"a mí respecta, todos han conseguido salir sanos y salvos de este desastre. "
"Supongo que piensan que estoy muerta, por lo que se mantendrán alejados de "
"este infierno, y eso es lo mejor que puede pasar."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/gung_ho_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Lord no.  I'll be fucked if I let a kid in a too-big uniform tell me what the "
"hell to do.  I had my Hummer loaded out and ready to go offroading, I had a "
"ton of gas, and I even had as many rifles as the border was gonna let me "
"bring over.  I didn't know what I was supposed to be running from, but I sure "
"as shit didn't run."
msgstr ""
"Señor, no. Estaré jodida si dejo que un chaval con un uniforme demasiado "
"grande me diga lo que tengo que hacer. Tenía mi Hummer cargado y listo para "
"ir por el campo, tenía una tonelada de gasolina, e incluso tenía todos los "
"rifles que la frontera me iba a permitir pasar. No sabía de qué se suponía "
"que tenía que huir, pero te aseguro que no huí."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/gung_ho_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"At first, I just kept going North, but I ran into a huge military blockade.  "
"They even had those giant walking robots like on TV.  I started going up to "
"check it out, and before I knew it they were opening fire!  I coulda died, "
"but I still have pretty good reactions.  I turned tail and rolled out of "
"there.  My Hummer had taken some bad hits though, and I found out the hard "
"way I was leaking gas all down the freeway.  Made it a few miles before I "
"wound up stuck in the ass-end of nowhere.  I settled in to wander.  I guess "
"I'm still kinda heading North, just by a pretty round-about way, you know?"
msgstr ""
"Al principio, fui hacia el Norte, pero me topé con un enorme bloqueo militar. "
"Incluso tenían esos robots gigantes ambulantes como en la tele. Empecé a "
"subir para echarle un vistazo y, antes de darme cuenta, ¡estaban abriendo "
"fuego! Podría haber muerto, pero todavía tengo buenos reflejos. Di media "
"vuelta y salí rodando de allí. Sin embargo, mi Hummer había recibido algunos "
"impactos, y descubrí por las malas que estaba perdiendo gasolina por toda la "
"autopista. Recorrí unos kilómetros antes de quedarme atascado en el culo del "
"mundo. Me dediqué a vagar. Supongo que sigo yendo hacia el Norte, pero de una "
"manera bastante indirecta, ¿sabes?"

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/gung_ho_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"We're all thinking the same thing, aren't we?  Not much this could be but "
"some kind of secret military bullshit.  At first, I thought it was our own "
"government, but after all that went down, it's just too much.  It must've "
"been the Chinese.  I wonder if those sons of bitches are sitting back home, "
"right as rain, watching us struggling down here and waiting for things to die "
"down."
msgstr ""
"Todos estamos pensando lo mismo, ¿no? Esto no puede ser más que algún tipo de "
"mierda militar secreta. Al principio, pensé que era nuestro propio gobierno, "
"pero después de todo lo que pasó, es demasiado. Deben haber sido los chinos. "
"Me pregunto si esos hijos de puta están sentados en casa, mirando cómo "
"luchamos aquí y esperando a que las cosas se calmen."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/gung_ho_3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I dunno, I'm no expert.  You might not remember, but there was that big news "
"a couple years back that supposedly China had some kind of super fusion "
"reactor.  I read a news article, apparently that was all a front for some "
"other kind of secret weapon they were working on.  Made so much energy, there "
"was no way to hide it, so they made it a story about fusion power instead.  "
"That'd explain why we never saw fusion power Stateside, don't you think?  And "
"if they were that much more advanced that they could make fusion power, who "
"knows what else they could make."
msgstr ""
"No sé, no soy un experta. Puede que no lo recuerdes, pero hubo una gran "
"noticia hace un par de años de que supuestamente China tenía algún tipo de "
"súper reactor de fusión. Leí un reportaje, aparentemente todo era una fachada "
"para algún otro tipo de arma secreta en la que estaban trabajando. Producía "
"tanta energía que no había forma de ocultarlo, así que lo convirtieron en una "
"historia sobre la energía de fusión. Eso explicaría por qué nunca vimos la "
"energía de fusión en Estados Unidos, ¿no crees? Y si estaban tan avanzados "
"que podían hacer energía de fusión, quién sabe qué más podrían hacer."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/high_school_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I was at school.  I'm a senior.  We'd heard about riots… it started with a "
"kid showing videos of one of the big riots in Providence.  You've probably "
"seen it, the one where the woman turns to the camera and you can see her "
"whole lower lip has been ripped off, and is just flapping there?  It got so "
"bad, they went over the PA system to tell us about Chinese drugs in the water "
"supply.  Right… does anyone buy that explanation?"
msgstr ""
"Estaba en la escuela. En el último curso. Habíamos oído hablar de "
"disturbios... todo empezó con un chico que mostraba vídeos de uno de los "
"grandes disturbios de Providence. Probablemente lo has visto, ese en el que "
"la mujer se vuelve hacia la cámara y puedes ver que le han arrancado todo el "
"labio inferior, y está ahí aleteando... La cosa se puso tan fea, que por "
"megafonía nos hablaron de drogas chinas en el suministro de agua. Bien... "
"¿alguien se cree esa explicación?"

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/high_school_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I guess it got worse, because the faculty decided to put us in lockdown.  For "
"hours.  And then the school buses showed up to evacuate us.  Eventually, they "
"ran out of buses.  I was one of the lucky few who didn't have a bus to get "
"on.  The soldiers weren't much older than me… they didn't look like they knew "
"what was going on.  I lived just a few blocks away.  I snuck off."
msgstr ""
"Supongo que empeoró, porque la facultad decidió encerrarnos. Durante horas. Y "
"después llegaron los autobuses escolares para evacuarnos. Al final, se "
"quedaron sin autobuses. Yo fui uno de los pocos afortunados que no tuvo un "
"autobús al que subirse. Los soldados no parecían mucho mayores que yo... ni "
"sabían lo que estaba pasando. Yo vivía a pocas manzanas así que me escape."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/high_school_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Yeah.  On the way there, I met some <zombies> for real.  They chased me, but "
"I did pretty well in track.  I lost them… but I couldn't get home, there were "
"just too many.  I wound up running more.  Stole a bike and ran more again.  "
"I'm a bit better at killing those things now, but I haven't made it home yet. "
" I guess I'm afraid of what I'll find."
msgstr ""
"Sí. En el camino, me encontré con algunos <zombies> de verdad. Me "
"persiguieron, pero siempre he sido bastante bueno en la pista. Los perdí... "
"pero no pude llegar a casa, eran demasiados. Terminé corriendo más. Robé una "
"bici y volví a huir más. Ahora soy un poco mejor matando esas cosas, pero aún "
"no he llegado a casa. Supongo que tengo miedo de lo que voy a encontrar."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hospital_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I saw it all pretty early, before it all really started.  I worked at the "
"hospital.  It started with a jump in the number of code whites - that's an "
"aggressive patient.  Wasn't my training so I didn't hear about it until "
"later… but rumors started flying about hyperaggressive delirious patients "
"that coded and seemed to die, then started attacking staff, and wouldn't "
"respond to anything we hit them with.  Then a friend of mine was killed by "
"one of them, and I realized it wasn't just a few weird reports.  I called in "
"sick the next day."
msgstr ""
"Lo vi todo muy pronto, antes de que todo empezara de verdad. Trabajaba en el "
"hospital. Empezó con un incremento en el número de códigos blancos, que son "
"pacientes agresivos. No era mi especialidad, así que no me enteré hasta "
"después... pero empezaron a correr rumores sobre pacientes delirantes "
"hiperagresivos que colapsaban y parecían morir, luego empezaban a atacar al "
"personal y no respondían a nada de lo que les aplicábamos. Cuando uno de "
"ellos mató a un amigo mío, me di cuenta de que no se trataba sólo de unos "
"rumores raros. Al día siguiente avisé de que estaba enfermo."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hospital_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Well, <the_cataclysm>.  I lived a fair distance out of town, and I already "
"knew something was seriously wrong, but I hadn't admitted to myself what I "
"was really seeing quite yet.  When I saw the military convoys pouring into "
"the city, I put the pieces together.  At first I thought it was just my "
"hospital.  Still, I packed up my bags, locked the doors and windows, and "
"waited for the evacuation call."
msgstr ""
"Vale, <the_cataclysm>. Yo vivía bastante lejos de la ciudad y ya sabía que "
"algo iba muy mal, pero aún no me había reconocido a mí misma lo que realmente "
"estaba viendo. Cuando vi las caravanas militares entrando en la ciudad, "
"empecé a atar cabos. Al principio pensé que se trataba de mi hospital. Aun "
"así, hice las maletas, cerré puertas y ventanas y esperé la llamada de "
"evacuación."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hospital_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"No.  The call came too late.  I'd already seen the clouds on the horizon.  "
"Mushroom clouds, and also those insane hell-clouds.  I've heard that horrible "
"things came out of them.  I decided it was safer in my locked up house."
msgstr ""
"No. La llamada llegó demasiado tarde. Ya había visto las nubes en el "
"horizonte. Nubes en forma de hongo, y también esas descabelladas nubes "
"infernales. Había oído que cosas horribles salían de ellas. Decidí que era "
"más seguro quedarme en mi casa encerrada."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hospital_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"The military happened.  They showed up and commandeered my land for some kind "
"of forward base, demanding I evacuate to a FEMA camp.  I didn't even try to "
"argue… I had my dad's old hunting rifle, they had high tech weapons.  I heard "
"one of them joking about the FEMA camp being Auschwitz, though.  I gave their "
"evac driver the slip and decided to make for my sister's place up north.  In "
"theory I guess I'm still going that way, although honestly I'm just busy not "
"dying."
msgstr ""
"El ejército apareció. Se presentaron y requisaron mi tierra para una especie "
"de base avanzada, exigiendo que evacuara a un campamento de la FEMA. Ni "
"siquiera intenté discutir... Yo tenía el viejo rifle de caza de mi padre, "
"ellos tenían armas de alta tecnología. Oí a uno de ellos bromear sobre el "
"campo de la FEMA como Auschwitz. Le di esquinazo al conductor de evacuación "
"que me seguía y decidí ir a casa de mi hermana en el norte. En teoría, "
"supongo que todavía voy en esa dirección, aunque sinceramente estoy ocupado "
"en no morir."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hospital_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I was at work at the hospital, when it all went down.  It's a bit of a blur.  "
"For a while there were weird reports, stuff that sounded unbelievable about "
"patients getting back up after dying, but mostly things were business as "
"usual.  Then, towards the end, stuff just skyrocketed.  We thought it was a "
"Chinese attack, and that's what we were being told.  People coming in crazed, "
"covered in wounds from bullets and bites.  About halfway through my shift I… "
"well, I broke."
msgstr ""
"Me encontraba trabajando en el hospital cuando ocurrió todo. Lo recuerdo un "
"poco borroso. Durante un tiempo hubo noticias extrañas, cosas que parecían "
"increíbles sobre pacientes que se levantaban después de morir, pero la "
"mayoría de las situaciones eran normales. Luego, hacia el final, las cosas se "
"desbordaron. Pensábamos que era un ataque chino, y eso es lo que nos decían. "
"La gente llegaba enloquecida, cubierta de heridas de balas y mordeduras. "
"Hacia la mitad de mi turno yo... bueno, me quebré."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hospital_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I was at work at the hospital, when it all went down.  It's a bit of a blur.  "
"For a while there were weird reports, stuff that sounded unbelievable about "
"patients getting back up after dying, but mostly things were business as "
"usual.  Then, towards the end, stuff just skyrocketed.  We thought it was a "
"Chinese attack, and that's what we were being told.  People coming in crazed, "
"covered in wounds from bullets and bites.  About halfway through my shift I… "
"well, I broke.  I'd seen such horrible injuries, and then I…  <swear!>  I "
"can't even talk about it."
msgstr ""
"Estaba trabajando en el hospital cuando todo sucedió. Lo recuerdo un poco "
"borroso. Durante un tiempo hubo informes extraños, cosas que parecían "
"increíbles, como pacientes que resucitaban tras morir, pero en general todo "
"seguía como de costumbre. Luego, hacia el final, todo se disparó. Pensamos "
"que era un ataque chino, y eso era lo que nos decían. La gente llegaba "
"enloquecida, cubierta de heridas de bala y mordiscos. A mitad de mi turno, "
"yo... bueno, me derrumbé. Había visto heridas tan horribles, y entonces... "
"¡Maldita sea! Ni siquiera puedo hablar de ello."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hospital_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"A young mother.  I know she was a mother, because I delivered her baby.  "
"Sweet girl, she… she had a good sense of humor.  She came in, spitting that "
"black goo, fighting the orderlies, dead from a bullet wound through the "
"chest.  That's when I… I don't know if I woke up, finally, or if I finally "
"went crazy.  Either way, I broke.  I broke a lot earlier than my colleagues, "
"and that's the only reason I lived.  I skipped out, went to a dead corner of "
"the hospital I used to hide in when I was a resident.  An old stairwell "
"leading to a closed-off unit the maintenance staff were using to store old "
"equipment.  I hid there for hours, while I listened to the world crumbling "
"outside and inside."
msgstr ""
"Una madre joven. Sé que era madre, porque atendí su parto. Una chica dulce, "
"ella... tenía un buen sentido del humor. Entró, escupiendo esa sustancia "
"negra, luchando contra los camilleros, muerta de una herida de bala en el "
"pecho. Ahí fue cuando yo... no sé si finalmente desperté, o si finalmente "
"enloquecí. De cualquier manera, me quebré. Me rompí mucho antes que mis "
"colegas, y esa es la única razón por la que viví. Me escapé, fui a un rincón "
"muerto del hospital en el que solía esconderme cuando era residente. Una "
"vieja escalera que conducía a una unidad cerrada que el personal de "
"mantenimiento utilizaba para almacenar equipos viejos. Me escondí allí "
"durante horas, mientras escuchaba cómo el mundo se desmoronaba fuera y dentro."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hospital_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Somehow, I don't know how, I managed to fall asleep in there.  I think it "
"might have started with me hyperventilating and passing out.  When I woke up "
"it was night, I was starving and parched, and… and the screaming had died "
"down.  At first I tried to go out the way I came in, but I peaked out the "
"window and saw one of the nurses stumbling around, spitting that black shit "
"up.  Her name was Becky.  She wasn't Becky anymore.  So, I went back up and "
"somehow made it into the storage area.  From there, the roof.  I drank water "
"from some nasty old puddle and I camped out there for a while, watching the "
"city around me burn."
msgstr ""
"Ignoro cómo me quedé dormido allí. Creo que todo pudo ocurrir cuando "
"hiperventilé y me desmayé. Cuando me desperté era de noche, estaba muerto de "
"hambre y sediento, y... y los gritos se habían apagado. Al principio intenté "
"salir por donde había entrado, por la ventana vi a una de las enfermeras "
"dando tumbos y escupiendo esa mierda negra. Su nombre era Becky. Pero ya no "
"era Becky. Volví a la planta de arriba y de alguna manera llegué al almacén. "
"De ahí, al techo/tejado. Bebí agua de un charco repugnante y me quedé "
"acampado allí un rato, viendo arder la ciudad a mi alrededor."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hospital_2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Well, I still didn't have any food.  Eventually I had to climb down the side "
"of the building… so I did, as quietly as I could.  It was night, and I have "
"pretty good nightvision.  Apparently the zombies don't, because I was able to "
"slip right past them and steal a bicycle that was just laying on the side of "
"the road.  I'd kind of scouted out my route from above… I'm not from a big "
"city, the hospital was the tallest building around.  I avoided the major "
"military blockades, and headed out of town towards a friend's old cabin.  I "
"had to fight off a couple of the <zombies>, but I managed to avoid any big "
"fuss, by some miracle."
msgstr ""
"Bueno, aún no tenía comida. Al final tuve que bajar por el lateral del "
"edificio... así que lo hice, tan silenciosamente como pude. Ya era de noche, "
"y tengo muy buena visión nocturna. Al parecer, los zombis no, porque fui "
"capaz de colarme entre ellos y robar una bicicleta que estaba tirada a un "
"lado de la carretera. Había estudiado mi ruta desde arriba... No vengo de una "
"gran ciudad, el hospital era el edificio más alto de los alrededores. Evité "
"los principales bloqueos militares, y me dirigí fuera de la ciudad hacia la "
"vieja cabaña de un amigo. Tuve que luchar contra un par de <zombies> , pero "
"me las arreglé para evitar cualquier gran alboroto, por algún milagro."

