#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"Surprise!\"  They do jazz hands.  \"Sorry.  Well, I'm told that I'm part of a "
"small group right now.  Maybe you were the first."
msgstr ""
"¡Sorpresa!\" Hace el gesto de manos de jazz. \"Lo siento. vale, me formo "
"parte de un reducido grupo en este momento. Tal vez tu fuiste el primero."

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"Yeah.  Have you noticed how they pay us in these tiny little gold coins?\"  "
"Cranberry holds one up for emphasis.  \"It's bizarre.  You'd think they have "
"a gold mine in there, but no, they don't, so they make me cross the damn "
"world grabbing gold bars.  As far as scrip goes, it seems inconvenient as "
"hell to make."
msgstr ""
"Sí. ¿Te has dado cuenta de que nos pagan con estas diminutas monedas de "
"oro?\". Cranberry levanta una para enfatizar. \"Es extraño. Uno pensaría que "
"tienen una mina de oro ahí dentro, pero no, no la tienen, así que me hacen "
"cruzar el maldito mundo consiguiendo lingotes de oro. Como pagaré, parece muy "
"inconveniente de fabricar."

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Have you ever noticed how… wait no, never mind."
msgstr "Alguna vez has notado cómo... espera no, no importa."

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"Hey, did you notice that there's working wi-fi here?  Not that anything else "
"is online anymore, but still."
msgstr ""
"Eh, ¿te has dado cuenta de que hay wi-fi funcionando aquí? No es que haya "
"nada más conectado, pero aún así."

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_DOCTOR.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Augustmoon_Salvors/augustmoon_doctor.json
